    title "10 Minute Abs Workout - No Equipment - TABATA FOLLOW ALONG"
    description "Funk Roberts take you through a 10 minute abs workout using no equipment but your bodyweight.  This 10 minute abs workout using the tabata protocol and targets your abs and core region.&#10;&#10;Join the July Summer Shred Abs Challenge FREE:  https://over40shred.com/funk-roberts-fitness-shred-workout-app&#10;&#10;My BEST Workout Programs&#10;&#61664; Best Program for Men Over 40: https://www.over40alpha.com&#10;&#61664; Best Program for Women: https://over40shred.com/WomenOfStrength&#10;&#61664; My Supplements: https://funksupplementshop.com/  (USE CODE: Funk10 FOR 10% OFF)&#10;&#61664; My Music: https://www.epidemicsound.com/&#10;&#10;My Social Channels&#10;&#61664; Subscribe to My YouTube Channel for FREE: https://www.youtube.com/funkroberts&#10;&#61664; Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/funkrobertsfitness/&#10;&#61664; Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/funkrobertsfitness&#10;&#10;Watch more of my videos! &#10;Subscribe and Click Notifications: http://www.youtube.com/subscription_center?add_user=Marcroops&#10;&#10;10 Minute Tabata Abs Extreme Workout&#10;Perform each exercise for 20 seconds of work followed by 10 seconds rest for 4 rounds and then move onto the next exercises.&#10;1.     Abs Buzzsaw x4. &#8211; dynamic plank&#10;2.     Knee Slide Crunches x4 &#8211; upper abs strength&#10;3.    Dead Bug Variations x4 &#8211; core &#8211; anti-rotation&#10;4.     Alternating Abs V-ups x4 &#8211; Lower abs&#10;5.     Extreme Russian Twists x4 &#8211; rotation&#10;&#10;Join the July Summer Shred Abs Challenge FREE:  https://over40shred.com/funk-roberts-fitness-shred-workout-app&#10;&#10;Warm Up Routine&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GQXpRWdtzRg&#38;t=1s&#10;&#10;Post Workout Stretch Routine&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ymSxLm0wEG4&#38;t=2s&#10;&#10;WARNING: THE INFORMATION OFFERED IN THIS VIDEO IS OFFERED AS OPINION ONLY. ALWAYS CONSULT YOUR PHYSICIAN BEFORE TRYING ANY NEW DIET OR EXERCISE PROGRAM. THIS WORKOUT ROUTINE MAY NOT BE SUITABLE FOR YOU.  ALWAYS WARM UP PRIOR AND STRETCH AFTER YOUR WORKOUT SESSIONS"
