    title "10 Minute ARMS and ABS Workout (No Repeat + Modifications)"
    description "Tap in with us for a quick 10 Minute Arms and Abs Workout &#128293;. This workout is all about targeting the entire upper body while keeping your abs engaged in the process. All you need is a soft surface and light pair of dumbbells (3-10lbs) to do this workout. Some of the exercises may be a bit too difficult, so feel free to follow Toya for modifications. To build upper and core strength over time, this is great flow to do daily or as a finisher to one of your own workoutGive this workout a try and let us know how you did in the comments!&#10;&#10;Check out our other follow along dumbbell workouts:&#10;&#10;20 Minute Full Body Dumbbell Wokrout: https://youtu.be/mf1xQS_Zlkc&#10;15 Minute Lower Body Dumbbell Workout: https://youtu.be/Huq6i9gscrk&#8203;&#10;20 Minute Light Dumbbell Workout: https://youtu.be/PFGeohvbNq8&#8203;&#10;15 Minute Full Body Dumbbell Workout: https://youtu.be/xqVBoyKXbsA&#8203;&#10;20 Minute Upper Body Dumbbell Workout: https://youtu.be/RPbscYct3I4&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;The Home Equipment We Use:&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/juicetoya...&#8203;&#10;&#10;Follow Us On Instagram For More Fitness Related Content:&#10;&#10;Juice: @JuicetonTx&#10;&#10;Toya: @ToyaCherrelle&#10;&#10;Personal Training Business Page: @OneBodyLA"
