  node [
    id 184
    label "9kV7PNH3Gio"
    step 0
    date "2018-08-31T18:57:52Z"
    title "15 Minute AB Workout - Fitness Series With Romee Strijd"
    description "15 min AB workout - For this workout you need a Matt and/or a Bosu ball&#10;&#10;1 ROUND IS 7:30 MINUTES:&#10;&#10;- Plank 60 seconds&#10;- Jack Knives 30 seconds x 2&#10;- Jack Knives 30 seconds x 2 (other side)&#10;- Flutter Kicks 45 seconds&#10;- Hold -&#10;- Spidermans 30 seconds (on Bosu ball)&#10;- Mountainclimbers 30 seconds&#10;- Side Plank 30 seconds + pulse 30 seconds&#10;- Side Plank 30 seconds + pulse 30 seconds(other side)&#10;&#10;Do 2 rounds to get in an effective 15 Minute Ab Workout!&#10;&#10;Sportlegging + Top: @victoriasport&#10;Shoes: @adidas&#10;&#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Here's where I get my music from:&#10;http://share.epidemicsound.com/njDwH&#10;&#10;Personal:&#10;http://instagram.com/romeestrijd&#10;https://twitter.com/romeestrijd&#10;https://facebook.com/romeestrijd&#10;&#10;edit by @dabbevandenbrand"
