    date "2020-06-15T16:30:03Z"
    title "Weighted Ab Workout | I lost so much belly fat from this!"
    description "Hello! I am so happy to finally share with you guys my favorite ab workout of all times! I&#8217;ve always had trouble losing lower belly fat and adding weights to my ab workout has changed the game for me. I burned off a handful of lower belly fat in just a week and lost 3lbs (I really never thought I could burn it off). Just imagine how effective it can be if this is done every single day. Remember, this workout is to strengthen your core and build muscle. And as you gain more muscle mass, your body will burn fat a lot more quickly. &#10;&#10;ALSO, what works for others may not work for you and what works for you may not work for others! Our bodies are ALL SO DIFFERENT so find what works best for you. I plan to come out with more weighted ab workouts so stay tuned~ &#10;&#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE.&#10;See you soon loves &#9829;&#65038;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789;S O C I A L M E D I A&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/elizvchu/&#10;(where I keep you posted about new vids, updates, and more)&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789;F A Q&#10;name? Elizabeth Chu &#10;age? 21 &#10;height? 5&#8217;7&#10;fav book atm? The Glass Cage&#10;fav song atm? Everything by Kota&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789;M U S I C&#10;Letmeknow-DJ Grumble&#10;https://soundcloud.com/gbeats/letemknow&#10;&#10;&#10;See the Stars-Daniel Rosty &#38; Sash_S&#10;Daniel Rosty:&#10;https://soundcloud.com/danielrosty&#10;https://www.facebook.com/danielrosty&#10;https://twitter.com/rostydaniel&#10;&#10;&#10;Home ft Ria Choony-Spectrum&#10;Spectrum:&#10;https://open.spotify.com/artist/0TsUr...&#10;https://www.instagram.com/spectrum_uk&#10;https://soundcloud.com/spectrumuk&#10;https://www.facebook.com/SpectrumUK&#10;Ria Choony:&#10;https://www.facebook.com/riachoony/&#10;https://www.instagram.com/riachoonymusic&#10;Music from Soundcloud&#10;Music provided by RFM: https://youtu.be/boZNPbEtB_o&#10;&#10;&#10;Be Around-Bloom [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/XnouxUYJRRo&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/BeAround&#10;&#10;&#10;High-JPB [NCS Release]&#10;Music Provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tv6WImqSuxA&#10;Free Download/Stream: http://ncs.io/jpbhigh"
