    title "5 MIN INTENSE AB WORKOUT II Lose Belly Fat (No Equipment)"
    description "Hey guys it&#8217;s G, I know it&#8217;s been a while but I&#8217;m back. I just got on break from UNI and I thought it would be the perfect time to bring you a banging summer workout series to get you looking fit and snatched this summer.&#10;  &#10;I&#8217;ll be posting two intense 5-minute workouts a week for four weeks straight. This week we are starting with a 5 Minute Intense AB Workout. This is my go-to intense ab routine. It&#8217;s difficult but the results are insane. I have combined my favorite and most intense exercises to lose belly fat. &#10;&#10;I suggest doing this workout once or twice a day.  The burn is real but you got this! Stick with me and let&#8217;s get our summer bodies banging. &#10;&#10;(Workout 1) : 5 Minute Intense ABS: &#10;(Workout 2) : 5 MIN Bubble Butt: &#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME: &#10;https://www.instagram.com/gabriellawhited/&#10;&#10;FOLLOW THE COMMUNITY: &#10;https://www.instagram.com/lolliesandgloss/&#10;&#10;MERCH: &#10;https://www.lolliesandgloss.com/shop&#10;&#10;Music by:&#10;@ gabriellawhited &#10;@ donyeden &#10;@ maximilliandeshotel &#10;@ sorrymyphoneoff &#10;@ shivaward"
