    title "How to Lose BELLY POOCH | Lower Abs Barre Bootcamp"
    description "Uh the dreaded lower belly pooch! Seriously such an annoying little area to try to get rid of, but today I&#8217;m sharing a few of the BEST exercises to lose the lower belly fat for good! Plus there is one MAJOR announcement you don&#8217;t want to miss!&#10;&#10;Join #teamlsf &#38; get your LSF 8 Week Hot Body Workout Guide &#38; 4 Week Meal Plan! https://my.lovesweatfitness.com&#10;&#10;&#34;Day Drinking&#34; LSF Water Bottle https://my.lovesweatfitness.com/products/day-drinking-water-bottle&#10;&#10;Repeat this workout 3X w/ 16 reps per exercise!&#10;&#10;&#9829; Follow me on Instagram https://instagram.com/lovesweatfitness&#10;&#9829; My 45lb Weight Loss Story https://youtu.be/Vzv82k9iIT8&#10;&#10;&#9829; Join the LSF Girls Community &#38; be part of #teamLSF ! Get FREE workouts, recipes &#38; motivation right in your email...plus exclusive challenges &#38; giveaways!&#10;Sign up today! http://bit.ly/1zkQmwq&#10;&#10;&#9829; Get in on all the fun, lets get sweaty together&#9829; &#10;Instagram: http://www.instagram.com/lovesweatfitness&#10;Snapchat: https://www.snapchat.com/add/lovesweatandfit&#10;Twitter: http://www.twitter.com/lovesweatandfit&#10;Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/lovesweatandfitness&#10;Pinterest: http://www.pinterest.com/lovesweatfit&#10;&#10;&#9835;Music By&#9835;&#10;&#9679;Del - Smells Like Summer - https://youtu.be/2BfSGb2E_Pk&#10;&#9679;Twitter - https://twitter.com/Del_Sound&#10;&#9679;YouTube - https://www.youtube.com/user/TheDelsound&#10;&#9679;Soundcloud - https://soundcloud.com/del-sound"
