    description "This toned arms workout with dumbbells for women is an awesome biceps and triceps workout. There are just 6 exercises in this toned arms workout with dumbbells, focusing on biceps and triceps. It can be done at home or a gym. &#10;&#10;For your reference, I'm using a pair a 15 pound dumbbells, but if you're a beginner, I would recommend starting with a lighter weight like a pair of 8 or 10 pound dumbbells.&#10;&#10;Biceps and Triceps exercises:&#10;1) Bicep Curls 3x10&#10;2) Triceps Kickbacks 3x10&#10;3) Wide Curls 3x10&#10;4) Skull Crushers 3x10&#10;5) Hammer Curls 3x10&#10;6) Triceps Pushups 3x10 (Modified on knees)&#10;&#10;&#10148;Thank you for watching! SUBSCRIBE to my channel for more workouts, DIYs, and everything in between: https://bit.ly/youtube-TerraBarton&#10;&#10;&#10148;FOLLOW me on social media:&#10;Instagram -  https://www.instagram.com/terralynn.barton"
