    title "I did Pamela Reif workouts for 3 months and here's what happened"
    description "Hey again friends. I tried to find different ways on how to communicate my journey using Pamela Reif workouts and I decided narrating it this way would be best. You can call this video another version of a &#34;Before and After Pamela Reif Workouts&#34;, but its much more than that! At least to me anyway. Along the way, I've learned about my past mistakes and created goals with more intention. I'm truly proud to see how far I've gone and how I've been able to do it. The 3 months flew by, but I'm grateful I'm back in the game and reaching farther with my fitness and health goals. Hope you guys enjoy this Pamela Reif transformation / results video!&#10;&#10;&#127861; Use my favorite Teami Greens Superfood Powder if you want to help control bloating and feel energized naturally! Use my code for BLANCHE20 for 20% off&#10;link to powder: ttps://www.teamiblends.com/discount/BLANCHE20&#10;&#10;                                                     &#10032; &#10032; &#10032;&#10;&#10;LET'S BE FRIENDS &#10;&#128242;  insta: @beelonkay &#10154; https://www.instagram.com/beelonkay/&#10;&#128242;  pinterest: @beelonkay &#10154; https://www.pinterest.ca/beelonkay/ &#10;&#128242;  tik tok: @beelonkay http://www.tiktok.com/@beelonkay&#10;&#10;                                                    &#10032; &#10032; &#10032;&#10;CONTACT ME&#10;&#128233;  *Email for business inquiries only* blanchetecson@yahoo.com&#10;&#128150;  sub count: 3.58k&#10;&#10;                                                    &#10032; &#10032; &#10032;&#10;&#10;VIDEOS TO WATCH NEXT:&#10;&#128253;&#65039;  come join me on my hot girl summer diaries - https://youtu.be/yQCUvK4yHnA&#10;&#128253;&#65039;  trying to be &#34;that girl&#34; on pintrest and tiktok - https://youtu.be/pgXks3gkf7U&#10;&#128253;&#65039;  leaving my town after 6 months in quarantine - https://youtu.be/gXcuTLDsrUk&#10;&#10;                                                    &#10032; &#10032; &#10032;&#10;&#10;&#128722; shop