  node [
    id 579
    label "JAuNs5FnAOU"
    step 1
    date "2020-05-14T20:21:07Z"
    title "10 MIN BACK WORKOUT - upper back, lower back, lats &#38; neck / Equipment: Bottles I Pamela Reif"
    description "I used 1 liter bottles &#9829;&#65038; it&#8217;s a TOTAL BACK Workout - using water bottles, wine bottles, packs of rice .. or whatever you have at home! / Werbung &#10;&#10;This was the most requested workout eveeeer! I know it&#8217;s super hard to train your back muscles at home, if you don&#8217;t have any equipment. But if we get a little creative .. we CAN make it work!  &#10;&#10;Training your back is super duper important, because everything in our body should be balanced :) people often suffer from back pain when sitting all day long, rounding the back when looking at our phone, etc. - so it&#8217;s definitely time to strengthen this part of our body &#38; show it some love (and a beautiful burn haha). &#10;&#10;_&#10;&#10;The video is in full length which means you can just follow whatever I&#8217;m doing 30s for each exercise. If you need a break - TAKE IT! Don't worry too much about that. &#10;&#10;I recommend switching up your workouts to give your muscles enough time to recover and to hit them from different angles.&#10;&#10;&#9656; you can find WORKOUT PLANS with those videos on my Instagram Channel. 30min, 45min and Beginner Friendly combinations. Check out the Highlight Bubble &#34;Workout Plans&#34; for that.  &#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#9656; You can always find ALL SONGS in my workout playlist. I update it weekly &#38; it's available on Spotify, Apple Music, etc. &#9829;&#65038;&#10;http://wmg.click/GetActive&#10;&#10;1. Lennon Stella (Scoob OST) - Summer Feelings (feat. Charlie Puth) 0:00 - 2:44&#10;2. Kelly Clarkson - I Dare You (Eden Prince Remix) 2:45 - 5:44&#10;3. Cash Cash - Gasoline (feat. Laura White) 5:45 - 9:19&#10;4. Shawn Wasabi - Lemons ft. kennedi 9:20 - 11:05 &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10142; Food Account http://www.instagram.com/pamgoesnuts/&#10;&#10;__&#10;unterst&#252;tzt durch Warner Music Germany&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;When joining me for this workout video, you need to take some precautions as your health and safety is the most important.&#160;To avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health with your doctor before exercising.&#160;By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. Pamela Reif will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video."
