    description "&#11088;&#11088;Join The Fit Camp Membership &#11088;&#11088;&#10;    www.chairworkouts.com&#10;HELP ME TO KEEP CREATING GREAT CONTENT &#128071;&#128071;&#128071; &#10;&#128591;&#9989;BY DONATING&#10145;&#65039;https://tinyurl.com/rsehwcc&#10;&#10;&#128591;Please SUBSCRIBE and press the Bell&#128276; Icon&#10145;&#65039;http://bit.ly/2HiGQRT&#10;&#10;&#9989;Queries&#10145;&#65039;donovan@chairworkouts.com&#10;&#9989;Check out our popular videos:&#128071;&#128071;&#128071;&#10;&#10;&#128170;&#127996;&#9654;&#65039;Chair Up (Motivation)&#10145;&#65039;http://bit.ly/2ONrJnQ&#10;&#128170;&#127996;&#9654;&#65039;ChairTrition&#10145;&#65039;http://bit.ly/39lqCUi&#10;&#128170;&#127996;&#9654;&#65039;QUICK TIPS&#10145;&#65039;http://bit.ly/2UH4qjr&#10;&#128170;&#127996;&#9654;&#65039;Full Chair Workouts&#10145;&#65039;http://bit.ly/37jCGnI&#10;&#128170;&#127996;&#9654;&#65039;Office Chair Exercises&#10145;&#65039;http://bit.ly/38naCkD&#10;&#128170;&#127996;&#9654;&#65039;Media Appearances&#10145;&#65039;http://bit.ly/2SkyPT3&#10;&#10;&#129309;Stay connected with us:&#128071;&#10;&#128077;https://www.facebook.com/Chair-Workouts-112680820296693/&#10;&#128247;httpd://www.instagram.com/chairworkouts/?hl=en&#10;&#10;&#10;#chairworkouts #DonovanGreenChairworkouts This is a great Chair exercise that can be done at home or at the office. Dr.Oz's trainer Donovan Green proves that a chair can do more than just provide a resting place for your butt. You can sit and get fit any time, any place, anywhere.&#10;&#10;www.chairworkouts"
