    date "2020-05-29T16:24:36Z"
    title "&#127825; Small Waist &#38; Round Booty Workout &#127825;"
    description "Do this at home Small Waist and Round Booty Workout: GET VERY FAST RESULTS with our Meal Plans &#38; Home Workout Calendars &#8211; https://cutt.ly/gyIWnhr&#10;&#10;This is a quick and effective 15 min tiny waist and round butt workout routine that will help you sculpt and shape an hourglass figure. The exercises are very focused so remember to really squeeze your glutes and keep your core engaged by pulling your rib-cage down and tuck your pelvis. Try this small waist workout 1-2x a week and comment your progress below!&#10;&#10;* For FAST RESULTS use the at home workout calendars as your personal training guide &#38; meal plans. *&#10;If you are advanced combine our free home workout videos (2-4 home workouts a day).&#10;&#10;MY WORKOUT OUTFITS  - https://gym.sh/muscle-home &#10;BEST Supplements &#8211; https://womens.best/mrandmrsmuscle &#10;Show LOVE &#38; Subscribe (It&#8217;s FREE) - https://cutt.ly/OyIWJrJ&#10;1.3m+ Instagram: https://instagram.com/mrandmrsmuscle &#10;YT Channel: https://youtube.com/channel/UCi_J6WNj99ro-9cPZOUrf8Q &#10;---&#10;How to get smaller waist and lose belly fat? &#10;Reducing your waist size and losing belly fat relies on a well-structured intuitive diet and movement.&#10;- Heavily reduce refined/processed carbs (SIMPLE SUGARS!!)&#10;- Drink plenty of water or herbal teas (green tea)&#10;- Eat intuitively (DO NOT EAT UNTIL YOU ARE FULL!)&#10;- Sleep earlier and longer&#10;- Move more and sweat more! &#8211; Try our cardio workouts - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PVvAPWvEI3s&#38;list=PLfj4lZyPiNakYgymIbJTGcoNXnrnk8yls &#10;&#10;For small waist workouts go to:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLfj4lZyPiNakgM2qY5V2vsMNC8ebPszl_ &#10;&#10;How to Lose belly fat? Fat around the waist?&#10;You cannot spot reduce fat and in this case waist fat but you can lose weight, build muscle, tone and shape targeted areas of the body. Lose belly fat and get a smaller waist by burning more calories than you eat. The best way to do this effectively is always by MOVING MORE!! (DO NOT IMMEDIATELY RESTRICT CALORIES WITHOUT GUIDANCE &#8211; SEE OUR MEAL PLANS).&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;MrandMrsMuscle strongly recommends that you consult your physician before starting any exercise or workout program.&#10;You should be in good physical and mental condition and be able to participate in the exercises.&#10;You should be aware and understand that when participating in any exercise or exercise program, there is the possibility of physical injury. If you engage in this workout, exercise or exercise program, you agree that you do so at your own risk, are voluntarily participating in these activities, assume all risk of injury to yourself, and agree to release and discharge MrandMrsMuscle from any and all claims or causes of action, known or unknown, arising out of MrandMrsMuscle's negligence.&#10;&#10;#smallwaist #roundbutt #smallerwaist"
