    title "NO JUMPING!! Standing Abs &#38; Obliques HIIT workout (Low Impact)"
    description "Get stronger and more defined abs as well as a smaller waist by combining the Standing Abs Workout with our cardio workouts and a well-managed diet. To lose belly fat fast and develop your figure pay close attention to the type of food you consume, your protein levels, water intake, your rest/sleep and do more cardio focused workouts.&#10;-&#10;My Plans: https://mrandmrsmuscle.com&#10;My Outfit: https://gym.sh/muscle-womens&#10;My Supplements: https://womens.best/mrandmrsmuscle&#10;-&#10;This workout targets the muscles in your abs and obliques but also works the stabilizing muscles throughout your body.&#10;&#10;Exercises in this HIIT Workout:&#10;1) Knee to Elbow variation - L&#10;2) Knee to Elbow variation - R&#10;3) Metronome&#10;4) Squat Oblique Crunch&#10;5) Diagonal Chop&#10;6) High Knee Pull&#10;---&#10;For KNEE FRIENDLY WORKOUTS click here:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xyNxjx60Y7o&#38;list=PLfj4lZyPiNakHnwM70szo85SIbhACqdWB&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;VIDEO KEY:&#10;MUSCLES WORKED&#10;&#128308; RED = Primary Muscles&#10;&#128309; BLUE = Secondary Muscles&#10;---&#10;SEND OUR WORKOUTS TO SOMEONE WHO NEEDS MOTIVATION AND HELP &#10;---&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;MrandMrsMuscle strongly recommends that you consult your physician before starting any exercise or workout program.&#10;You should be in good physical and mental condition and be able to participate in the exercises.&#10;You should be aware and understand that when participating in any exercise or exercise program, there is the possibility of physical injury. If you engage in this workout, exercise or exercise program, you agree that you do so at your own risk, are voluntarily participating in these activities, assume all risk of injury to yourself, and agree to release and discharge MrandMrsMuscle from any and all claims or causes of action, known or unknown, arising out of MrandMrsMuscle's negligence."
