    date "2020-04-16T15:40:14Z"
    title "SADDLE BAG WORKOUT // 15 MIN FAT BURN // BEST OUTER THIGH WORKOUT | MR AND MRS MUSCLE"
    description "#saddlebag #outerthighworkout #mrandmrsmuscle #tonedthighs #glutes&#10;-&#10;LOSE WEIGHT AND BURN FAT WITH:&#10;SADDLEBAG WORKOUT // 15 MIN FAT BURN // BEST OUTER THIGH WORKOUT | MR AND MRS MUSCLE&#10;-&#10;Saddlebags are the pockets of fat stored on your outer thighs. Fat stored here can be caused and made worse by inactivity, hormonal imbalances (in particular an increase in estrogen) and a poorly managed diet.&#10;The best way to get rid of fat is to work on your diet and combine this with exercise. &#10;All of the Mr and Mrs Muscle Workouts are high intensity and designed for optimal fat burn.&#10;This workout predominantly targets the muscles in your outer thigh and glutes but also works your core and other stabilizing muscles throughout your body.&#10;&#10;FOR BEST RESULTS: Do this workout a minimum of twice a week!&#10;-&#10;&#10084;&#65039; For daily workouts subcribe and sweat with us:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi_J6WNj99ro-9cPZOUrf8Q?sub_confirmation=1&#10;-&#10;NEED TO LOSE WEIGHT QUICKLY &#38; EFFECTIVELY?&#10;Download our FREE &#38; PREMIUM Workout Calendars and Weight Loss Meal Plans&#10;Go to - https://MrandMrsMuscle.com&#10;-&#10;FOR OUR FITNESS APPAREL&#10;Check out: https://gym.sh/muscle-home&#10;-&#10;FOR NO EQUIPMENT HOME WORKOUTS&#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLfj4lZyPiNalBzIOOmtB59SjwxNWXpN9_&#10;-&#10;FOR WARM UP EXERCISES CLICK HERE:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLfj4lZyPiNakOeBmzvK06kBJSrKbihzii&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Main Workout: 30s Active / 10s Rest / 4 Rounds&#10;1) Sumo Squat to Leg Abduction&#10;2) Curtsy Lunge to Standing Kickback - Left&#10;3) Curtsy Lunge to Standing Kickback - Right&#10;4) Hydrant to Leg Extension - Left&#10;5) Hydrant to Leg Extension - Right&#10;6) Glute Bridge Hold&#10;&#10;VIDEO KEY:&#10;MUSCLES WORKED&#10;&#128308; RED = Primary Muscles&#10;&#128309; BLUE = Secondary Muscles&#10;&#10;---&#10;Use our Website - https://www.mrandmrsmuscle.com&#10;750+ Workouts on Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/mrandmrsmuscle&#10;Like our Facebook Page - https://www.facebook.com/mrandmrsmuscle&#10;Subscribe - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi_J6WNj99ro-9cPZOUrf8Q?sub_confirmation=1&#10;Get My Fitness Supplements - https://womens.best/mrandmrsmuscle&#10;Our Gymshark Outfits - https://gym.sh/muscle-home&#10;---&#10;PLEASE SHARE OUR HIIT WORKOUTS WITH SOMEONE WHO NEEDS MOTIVATION AND HELP &#10;---&#10;STAY AT HOME DURING THIS COVID 19 CRISIS // QUARANTINE WORKOUT // HOME WORKOUT // INDOOR WORKOUT // GLUTE WORKOUT AT HOME // BEST SADDLEBAG WORKOUT // BEST BOOTY WORKOUT // TONED LEGS&#10;----&#10;#bestweightloss #gluteworkout #hiitworkout #weightloss #quarantine #tonedlegs #weightwatchers #withme"
