    title "8 Core Exercises for True Beginners - Bodyweight Only"
    description "5 Best Core Killer Exercises - FREE report&#10;http://www.criticalbench.com/corekillers/&#10;&#10;Here are 8 of the best core exercises for those TRUE beginners out there! You know who you are.... NPC Bikini Competitor Sarah DeMarco shows you how to do 8 core exercises for TRUE BEGINNERS using no equipment and no weights.  Just you and the floor. &#10;&#10;Exercises in order:&#10;&#10;Kneeling Plank&#10;Full Plank&#10;Cat / Cow&#10;Quadruped Bird Dog&#10;Bent Knee Leg Drop&#10;V-Sit Hold&#10;Seated Torso Twist / Russian Twist&#10;Seated Cherry Picker&#10;&#10;If you're just getting started, are brand new to fitness/workouts and consider yourself a beginner, please listen to Coach Brian. You will absolutely start to see and feel a change in your midsection. Give yourself 30-60-90 days of movements like this to begin to see and feel results.&#10;&#10;Of course eating better foods, sleeping well and improving your lifestyle habits in other ways are crucial to seeing maximum benefits.&#10;&#10;If you're a beginner, perfect, start slowly and make steady progress. Over time you can begin adding on reps, time, sets or even some extra resistance to make this workout harder. Be sure to check out this channel for more core exercises and ab workouts once you are no longer a beginner :-)&#10;&#10;Why Crunches &#38; Sit Ups DAMAGE Your Spine&#10;http://www.criticalbench.com/growth/core&#10;&#10;Subscribe to Our Channel:&#10;http://www.youtube.com/subscription_center?add_user=criticalbench"
