    description "My workout + nutrition plans: https://theteamplans.com/&#10;&#10;(GIVEAWAY DETAILS BELOW)&#10;&#10;What's up What's up! I'm SO EXCITED to be finally sharing this video. You asked for it, so today I'm breaking down exactly what I did to shrink my thighs while keeping my glutes round. I'm explaining the strategies I used, the science behind them, as well as taking you through a day in the life to show you how I put it all together. You'll see the meals I eat, my new workout routine, and more.&#10;&#10;-------------------------------&#10;&#10;GIVEAWAY RULES:&#10;&#10;International Giveaway | 2 winners | 48 HOURS&#10;&#10;1. Like this video &#10;2. Subscribe to my channel &#10;3. Follow me on Instagram @ampollo &#10;4. Comment how I can reach you and which plan you'd like - beginner or advanced&#10;&#10;Not sure which plan to get? Take my body type quiz here: https://trans.fo/tool-yt/&#10;&#10;Use code: YOUTUBEFRIEND for 15% all my plans&#10;&#10;Need support? Email support@transformnation.tv&#10;&#10;-------------------------------&#10;&#10;TIMESTAMPS:&#10;0:44 why I wanted to shrink my thighs / personal chit chat&#10;4:25 the strategy I used / science behind it&#10;6:22 day in the life starts&#10;6:38 meal 1 - egg white omelette&#10;6:46 workout start&#10;11:09 workout end&#10;11:52 meal 2 - all the volume salad&#10;13:12 what I think about step counts / how I stay active when busy&#10;14:40 meal 3 - choco smoothie bowl&#10;15:37 giveaway details + SAVINGS&#10;&#10;-------------------------------&#10;&#10;Bret Contreras article: https://bretcontreras.com/whats-the-difference-between-a-romanian-deadlift-american-deadlift-stiff-legged-deadlift-and-straight-leg-deadlift/&#10;&#10;Videos to get you MOTIVATED:&#10;Story Time: My Binge Eating Story https://youtu.be/23nsnqOgFUM&#10;How to Get Motivated to Lose Weight https://youtu.be/Pr2Ke2DUHTo&#10;My 3 Biggest Weight Loss Mistakes https://youtu.be/rJRFmKSxeNY"
