sh - Reps 20&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BVLWdW5Bzaw&#10;&#10;13 - 4 Times Abs - Reps 20&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w_dNwVxW0v0&#10;&#10;14 - Double twist - Reps 20&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-vVOfsdwqaY&#10;&#10;15 - Crunch elbow towards knee - alternated - Reps 20&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hlcQQdYSJgY&#10;&#10;16 - Recovery Time 30 sec.&#10;&#10;17 - Alternating Curls - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qp2UfbAVwLg&#10;&#10;18 - Alternating Beat Abs - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wq45EYyH02w&#10;&#10;19 - Cycling Abs - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LRVfoxPAv-k&#10;&#10;20 - Floor wiper - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SIzEgpoNwsc&#10;&#10;21 - Full vertical crunch - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lj0UedPrueU&#10;&#10;22 - V-ups - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AJD6aPu5kw4&#10;&#10;23 - Double Crunch - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k1WwGzce9-4&#10;&#10;24 - Leg Push - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BVLWdW5Bzaw&#10;&#10;25 - 4 Times Abs - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w_dNwVxW0v0&#10;&#10;26 - Double twist - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-vVOfsdwqaY&#10;&#10;27 - Crunch elbow towards knee - alternated - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hlcQQdYSJgY&#10;&#10;-~-~~-~~~-~~-~-&#10;Please watch: &#34;Chest workout - best home routine to kill pec muscle calisthenics and bodyweight&#34; &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ImNFOaCcWZs&#10;-~-~~-~~~-~~-~-&#10;#absworkout #abdominal #abs