  node [
    id 985
    label "f9OF3lsjSJo"
    step 1
    date "2020-05-23T13:33:14Z"
    title "29 Bodyweight Exercises that will increase your Body Strength"
    description "When you train with Bodyweight movements you are building muscle strength and endurance because by nature Bodyweight training is the ability to exert maximal force in minimal time. This means putting YOUR ALL into every one of your sets. No lazy reps. No long rests. And yes it&#8217;s extremely difficult to stay with it especially when you feel you have nothing left to give. But that&#8217;s when the mind takes control to push you to your last set and reps. So let&#8217;s really continue to work hard. I&#8217;ll give you the workouts and you put in the work!&#10;Workout Program&#10;1. Chest Tap Push-up 3 sets | 12 reps | 30 sec break&#10;2. Crucifix Press 3 sets | 12 reps | 30 second break&#10;3. Inverted Head Press 3 sets | 5-10 reps | 30 second break&#10;4. Spider Pushup 3 sets | 12 reps | 30 second break&#10;5. Plyo Knee Tap Push-up 3 sets | 10 reps | 30 second break&#10;6. Floor Press Push-up 2 sets | 1 minute on | 30 second rest&#10;7. Speed Shoulder Taps to Push-up 2 sets | 45 seconds on | 15 second break&#10;&#10;Track: Gideon Walker - Still Flying alive (Official Instrumental)&#10;Music &#38; Composition: Gideon Walker&#10;Link: https://youtu.be/88OrXP3gil4&#10;&#10;Marvel Asia &#38; Gideon Walker ft. Felicia - Still Flying Alive&#10;Link: https://youtu.be/aXFd0JhrnhE&#10;Release: Marvel Asia &#38; Gideon Walker&#10;&#10;#workout #training #fitness"
