ructions - http://youtu.be/EhnwoUrDh_g&#10;14 - Recovery Time 01 min. 00 sec.&#10;15 - Lateral Lunge - Reps 10&#10;16 - Concentrated hip extension - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jPowXx1axKo&#10;17 - Squat - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://youtu.be/EhnwoUrDh_g&#10;18 - Side kick with bent knee - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://youtu.be/9hKsATwrmzY&#10;19 - Forward Lunges - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HacUpgo8h80&#10;20 - Recovery Time 01 min. 00 sec.&#10;21 - Lateral Lunge - Reps 10&#10;22 - Concentrated hip extension - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jPowXx1axKo&#10;23 - Squat - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://youtu.be/EhnwoUrDh_g&#10;24 - Side kick with bent knee - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://youtu.be/9hKsATwrmzY&#10;25 - Forward Lunges - Reps 10&#10;See video and instructions - http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HacUpgo8h80&#10;26 - - Reps 10&#10;&#10;-~-~~-~~~-~~-~-&#10;Please watch: &#34;Chest workout - best home routine to kill pec muscle calisthenics and bodyweight&#34; &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ImNFOaCcWZs&#10;-~-~~-~~~-~~-~-"
