    title "I Ate &#38; Exercised Like The MOST POPULAR Fitness YouTubers For A WEEK (CHLOE, MADFIT, PAMELA, etc.)"
    description "SHOP GYMSHARK: http://gym.sh/Shop-Linda-Sun &#10;PART 2: https://youtu.be/qZdVtB_sE4M&#10;&#10;This video was so fun to make! ********EMI WONG, SYDNEY CUMMINGS, HEATHER ROBERTSON, ETC. WILL BE IN THE PART 2 DON'T WORRY******** I know I didn't include ton of other popular fitness influencers but there is only 7 days in a week and it would have been like a 6 hour video! These are just some of the girls that i have personally had a lot of experience working out to so i could give you my most honest and best opinion! &#10;&#10;These are the specific times for each girl: &#10;CASSEY HO: 1:17 - 4:20&#10;CHLOE TING: 4:20 - 7:06&#10;LILLY SABRI: 7:06 - 11:09&#10;MADDIE LYMBURNER: 11:09 - 15:54&#10;NATACHA OCEANE: 15:54 - 18:54&#10;PAMELA REIF: 18:54 - 21:42&#10;WHITNEY SIMMONS: 21:42 - 24:05&#10;FINAL COMPARISONS: 24:05 - end &#10;&#10;peanut tofu: https://www.feastingathome.com/bali-bowls-with-peanut-tofu/&#10;kale salad dressing:  https://cookieandkate.com/how-to-make-vinaigrette-plus-variations/&#10;&#10;favourite products &#10;pb2: https://amzn.to/3qQRTXB&#10;My fav crunchy Kraft Peanut butter: https://amzn.to/39OEqZf&#10;yoga mat: https://amzn.to/3o01CJ3 &#10;my camera: https://amzn.to/3p2Ljwl&#10;popcorners: https://amzn.to/392cMJ1&#10;resistance bands: https://amzn.to/3iyxV0Q&#10;bark thins: https://amzn.to/3bXB4WH&#10;&#10;These are the workouts i did for each girl: &#10;CASSEY HO:&#10;Cardio booty: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c7ZYCXu2hco&#38;list=PLazKiEKQ9yAKXMoKIL8ojMiJipogAx9EP&#38;index=2&#38;t=30s&#10;20 min booty:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zq9uQyt3BG0&#38;list=PLazKiEKQ9yAKXMoKIL8ojMiJipogAx9EP&#38;index=2&#10;10 min butt: &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YD0MJ0eDg7M&#38;list=PLazKiEKQ9yAKXMoKIL8ojMiJipogAx9EP&#38;index=3&#10;&#10;CHLOE TING:&#10;Everyday to lose weight: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2MoGxae-zyo&#38;list=PLazKiEKQ9yAIiUvqeOSFthlWQs2BIn7oi&#38;index=2&#10;Abs in 2 weeks: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2pLT-olgUJs&#38;list=PLazKiEKQ9yAIiUvqeOSFthlWQs2BIn7oi&#38;index=2&#10;Lower body workout: &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I9nG-G4B5Bs&#38;list=PLazKiEKQ9yAIiUvqeOSFthlWQs2BIn7oi&#38;index=3&#10;&#10;LILLY SABRI:&#10;Butt workout: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=emrq-qkuSrU&#38;list=PLazKiEKQ9yAKIcTKlk988jOaRFfRMucXa&#38;index=2&#38;t=1354s&#10;Abs finisher: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9ZwVXgUlJ2Q&#38;list=PLazKiEKQ9yAKIcTKlk988jOaRFfRMucXa&#38;index=3 &#10;&#10;MADDIE LYMBURNER: &#10;Resistance band butt workout:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BB0QpDx93lk&#38;list=PLazKiEKQ9yALflSHJnxYXJJnNwCb6tNbv&#38;index=5&#10;Tik tok dance workout:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SoRmqE7A_IE&#38;list=PLazKiEKQ9yALflSHJnxYXJJnNwCb6tNbv&#38;index=6 &#10;&#10;PAMELA REIF:&#10;Booty activation: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6ecOt63tW7Q&#38;list=PLazKiEKQ9yAJLO0k7vr76doH_Vhmh3PIn&#38;index=2&#38;t=1s&#10;Butt workout: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p-uUnrCdhR8&#38;list=PLazKiEKQ9yAJLO0k7vr76doH_Vhmh3PIn&#38;index=2 &#10;Cardio workout: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y2eOW7XYWxc&#38;list=PLazKiEKQ9yAJLO0k7vr76doH_Vhmh3PIn&#38;index=3 &#10;&#10;Business Inquiries: lindasun@select.co&#10;&#10;Music:&#10;Morning stroll by Josh Kirsch/Media Right Productions from youtube audio library &#10;Music by HOAX - Moon Moon Baby - https://thmatc.co/?l=007A5DBD &#10;Music by HOAX - Grow - https://thmatc.co/?l=8FD72C05&#10;Music by Peter Fenn - Like Crzy - https://thmatc.co/?l=93BBF209 &#10;Music by Eric Reprid - Going - https://thmatc.co/?l=38B7CD3B&#10;Music by HOAX - Beach House - https://thmatc.co/?l=9F666C89&#10;Music by Dylan Rockoff - Awesome - https://thmatc.co/?l=397F712A&#10;Music by eric Reprid - Lime - https://thmatc.co/?l=47CAE26F&#10;Music by mark generous - orange and pomegranate - https://thmatc.co/?l=16FD1F70&#10;Music by Eric Reprid - Come Back to Earth - https://thmatc.co/?l=656796FC&#10;Music by MYSM - Honeymoon At The Holiday Inn - https://thmatc.co/?l=F0A462C5&#10;Music by Eric Reprid - Basement - https://thmatc.co/?l=CA984851&#10;Music by Grant Schaffer - Pineapple - https://thmatc.co/?l=6A2836FB &#10;Music by Jaylon Ashaun - On Sight - https://thmatc.co/?l=7522DF74&#10;Music by Dylan Rockoff - Anymore (NDAF Chill Remix) - https://thmatc.co/?l=87F29144&#10;Music by Dylan Rockoff - Anymore - https://thmatc.co/?l=931F8244&#10;Music by Reggie San Miguel - Ruby Grapefruit - https://thmatc.co/?l=F1C79AC8&#10;Music by Sam Stan - Look Like Art  - https://thmatc.co/?l=23119E45&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: I am not a doctor, nutritionist, or dietician. The information I share should not be interpreted as nutritional advise. Everything I say is my own OPINION and it&#8217;s based off of MY OWN EXPERIENCES. I am not here to promote any type of diet or advise anyone to follow my diet. I am not a professional I am a student. If you have questions or concerns regarding diet, nutrition or fitness, speak to a professional. This channel is about me sharing my THOUGHTS and STORY and LIFE in a POSITIVE SPACE, and if you have anything NEGATIVE to say keep it to yourself or feel free to leave."
