    description "LOVE THE JIGGLE EVERYONE! ;)&#10;&#10;BTW:  THE SECOND WEEK OF EATING CAN BE FOUND ON MY OTHER VIDEO THAT IS WHY SOME OF THE CLIPS LOOK THE SAME! BECAUSE THEY ARE.... &#10;for what I ate the second week of this challenge: https://youtu.be/XlC19Xigscw&#10;&#10;GO TO 16:06 FOR A MESSAGE FOR ALL OF YOU! &#10;&#10;thank you  @Lilly Sabri for truly making me feel strong and proud of my body :)&#10;&#10;&#10;Intro: 0:00 - 1:59 &#10;Working out and food: 2:00 - 12:49 &#10;Results: 12:57 - 14:10 &#10;Difficulty: 14:25 - 15:02&#10;Final thoughts: 15:02 - 16:06&#10;A MESSAGE FOR EVERYONE: 16:06 - the end &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Link to lilly sabri&#8217;s website:&#10; https://www.leanwithlilly.com/?utm_campaign=10344780386&#38;utm_source=google&#38;utm_medium=cpc&#38;utm_content=443617767792&#38;utm_term=%22lilly%20sabri%20%22&#38;adgroupid=104085188078&#38;gclid=Cj0KCQjw0rr4BRCtARIsAB0_48NhdCC4dudrEm064e0hXa-LKSYDLazXf9y3uxtvV80uRkS3LnQpuVYaAmsxEALw_wcB &#10;&#10;Link to Lilly&#8217;s 14 day summer shred: https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0267/1381/7193/files/LEAN_Guide_-_14_Day_Summer_Shred_Challenge_V2.pdf?v=1593364696 &#10;&#10;Link to Lilly&#8217;s YouTube: &#10; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTsM1dSAiXqiV5oZjuNw_Bg &#10;&#10;favourite products &#10;pb2: https://amzn.to/3qQRTXB&#10;My fav crunchy Kraft Peanut butter: https://amzn.to/39OEqZf&#10;yoga mat: https://amzn.to/3o01CJ3 &#10;my camera: https://amzn.to/3p2Ljwl&#10;popcorners: https://amzn.to/392cMJ1&#10;resistance bands: https://amzn.to/3iyxV0Q&#10;&#10;Banana bread recipe &#10;https://cookieandkate.com/healthy-banana-bread-recipe/&#10;&#10;Honey garlic salmon recipe &#10;https://www.thechunkychef.com/honey-garlic-glazed-salmon/ &#10;&#10;Broccoli recipe: https://tasty.co/recipe/garlic-parmesan-roasted-broccoli&#10;&#10;Pancake recipe &#10;1/2 - 1 banana&#10;1/4 cup oats &#10;1 tsp baking powder&#10;1 scoop protein powder&#10;2 tbsp of almond milk (more if needed)&#10;1 egg &#10;1 - 2 tbsp of PB2 &#10;1 tsp cinnamon&#10;Chocolate chips :) &#10;&#10;Pancake Instructions &#10;Heat pan on medium (Make sure the pan is hot before pouring batter)&#10;Spray with cooking oil or just put some oil on the pan&#10;Pour pancake batter on the pan &#10;Wait for it to bubble and the bottom to brown&#10;Flip !&#10;Put on plate, top with A LOT of fruit, A LOT of peanut butter, and A LOT of maple syrup! &#10;Enjoy :) &#10;&#10;&#10;MUSIC: &#10;Music by Reggie San Miguel - Ruby Grapefruit - https://thmatc.co/?l=F1C79AC8&#10;Music by cults - ever - https://thmatc.co/?l=C35FB31D&#10;Music by cassette tapes - sugar rush - https://thmatc.co/?l=52663067 &#10;Music by Fiji Blue - Space Makes Me Sad - https://thmatc.co/?l=46716D33\&#10;Music by mark generous - orange and pomegranate - https://thmatc.co/?l=16FD1F70&#10;Music by Fiji Blue - Numb - https://thmatc.co/?l=05B6B8C8&#10;Music by Jonny Glenn - Don't Wanna Let You Down  - https://thmatc.co/?l=7C8CD3B5&#10;&#10;Song: Joakim Karud - Mondays (Vlog No Copyright Music)&#10;Music provided by Vlog No Copyright Music.&#10;Video Link: https://youtu.be/cF-iAyO8yGw&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: I am not a doctor, nutritionist, or dietician. The information I share should not be interpreted as nutritional advise. Everything I say is my own OPINION and it&#8217;s based off of MY OWN EXPERIENCES. I am not here to promote any type of diet or advise anyone to follow my diet. I am not a professional I am a student. If you have questions or concerns regarding diet, nutrition or fitness, speak to a professional. I am learning and growing and on my own journey of self-love and acceptance just like any other human being is. I am not perfect. These videos are meant only to showcase my own experiences. This channel is about me sharing my THOUGHTS and STORY and LIFE in a POSITIVE SPACE, and if you have anything NEGATIVE to say keep it to yourself or feel free to leave.  &#10;&#10;Please remember the only message I want to spread is a positive one. I want to encourage us all, myself included, that we should continually practice self-love and appreciate our bodies. We are on this journey together. I hope you can try to remember that. &#10;&#10;Love you guys. I'm so proud of you. We got this.  &#10;Linda"
