    description "hi! today&#8217;s video is CRAZY! i did a 5 min ab workout every day for a WEEK! i completed the Lily Sabri 7 day ab fat burning challenge and in the video we also see a little of what i eat during the challenge. Watch to see if a 5 minute fat burning ab workout can really change how you look in only one week! Find the results from my before and after (: Thank you Lily Sabri for this challenge! &#10;&#10;Lily&#8217;s Video I followed:&#10;https://youtu.be/ohgLmY19jNg&#10;&#10;Follow my blog / podcast instagram!: @aliveaura &#10;&#10;My Podcast: https://anchor.fm/brooke-potvin5/episodes/How-to-LIVE-your-life---Finding-Joy-in-Small-Things-emgmpe&#10;&#10;Wanna chat/collab/partner? Send me an email or DM:&#10;&#10084;&#65039;brookemarie24@gmail.com &#10;&#10084;&#65039;instagram: @brookepotvin&#10;&#10;Thank you so much for watching, I hope you guys enjoyed this video. I&#8217;m wishing you all health and happiness. &#10;I hope I could put a smile on your face. &#10;Have any amazing day!&#10;-Brooke&#10;&#10;!!LETS BE FRIENDS!!&#10;Instagram: @brookepotvin&#10;Instagram Blog: @aliveaura&#10;VSCO: @brookepotvin&#10;Pinterest: @brookepotvinn&#10;Poshmark: @brookemarie240 &#10;&#10;BUSINESS INQUIRES EMAIL&#10;brookemarie24@gmail.com&#10;Want to work together? Email me!&#10;&#10;WHO AM I? &#10;I am 17 year old high school senior from Massachusetts. &#10;&#10;WHY DID I START MY YOUTUBE?&#10;I have genuinely enjoyed Youtube since I could operate a computer. I consistently wanted to start a channel, but I was too scared of others opinions. I want to make young girls and girls/boys my age feel that they have an outlet and that they can watch my videos to have some freedom from their own life&#8217;s. If anyone needs to talk, i&#8217;m always just a instagram dm away! I&#8217;m so happy I created this channel! &#10;&#10;SUB COUNT: 2,265&#10;GOAL: 2,300&#10;#7dayfatburnchallenge #lillysabri #leanwithlilly&#10;&#10;*this video is sponsored not sponsored*&#10;*i do not own the rights to the music in this video* &#10;Background Music: Views by Ikson"
