    description "Follow along with this awesome home ab workout! Let's go! &#10;You won't need any equipment, just your bodyweight and you can follow this routine anywhere.&#10;&#10;I've included beeps so you know when to take a break, also look out for the preview clips of the next exercise in sequence.&#10;&#10;You can mix between this routine and one of many others available on my channel 2-3x per week, be sure to head to my website if you want to download a complete six pack program.&#10;&#10;Training Programs: https://www.simeonpanda.com&#10;Supplements: https://www.innosupps.com&#10;Shop Just Lift: https://www.justlift.com&#10;&#10;Follow me here for more tips/exercises:&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/simeonpanda&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/simeonpanda&#10;Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/simeonpanda&#10;&#10;&#8216;Aim to do something everyday that pushes you forward.&#8217;"
