    description "Only 3 min abs home workout no rest with no equipment and you can do anywhere without GYM. A quick and intense workout to target your abs. You don't need any equipment or weights! 3 minute and six pack guaranteed&#10;&#10;This video is full length which means you can just follow along with whatever I'm doing. If you need rest, just pause the video. If you don't need a rest - watch it the whole way through&#10;&#10;PREVIOUS VIDEO:&#10;&#10;( 3 min AB Workout ): http://lnnk.in/s0I&#10;( 4 min ABS Workout  ): http://lnnk.in/AWD&#10;( 4 min SIX PACK Workout ): http://lnnk.in/Lxr&#10;( 3 min Full Body Workout ): http://lnnk.in/FVt&#10;( SIMPLE CHEST Workout AT HOME ): http://lnnk.in/Uoq&#10;( QUICK AB Workout): http://lnnk.in/0uk&#10;( 6 PACK HOME Workout | For beginners): http://lnnk.in/ahd2&#10;( 5 min MORNING Full Body Workout ): http://lnnk.in/f7ar&#10;( TABATA ABS AT HOME | 4 min ): http://lnnk.in/hMap&#10;&#10;EXERCISES (30 seconds on, no rest):&#10;&#10;1. PUSH THROUGH&#10;2. SCISSOR KICKS&#10;3. ANKLE TAPS&#10;4. FEET OFF&#10;5. SINGLE LEG LIFTS&#10;6. PLANK&#10;&#10;&#10;Track: Audioscribe - Shimmer [NCS Release] [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch:  https://youtu.be/AFmXC8I13yY&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/Shimmer&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/sam.stas/&#10;&#10;&#10;#absworkoutathome #3minabsworkout #homeworkoutnorest&#10;#3minworkout #workoutathome #bodyweightworkout &#10; #homeworkoutforbeginners  #workoutsam #samworkout"
