    title "10 Best Workout for Upper Abs by Arif Shaikh | Modern Fitness Gym"
    description "Namaskar and adaab to all of you friends, My self Arif Shaikh - Owner of Modern Fitness Gym, Fitness Enthusiast, Fitness Trainer &#38; Fitness Adviser.&#10;&#10;Jab baat aati hai Abs ki, To har koi Abs banana chahta hai. Lekin Abs ke liye bhi Special Workout hote hai jo Aapke Abs ko jaldi build hone me kaafi madad karte hai. Waise aap agar Abs ka workout karte ho to wo aapke Upper Abs and Lower Abs dono pe sath me effect karega. Lekin mai aapko 10 aise workout batane wala hu jo aapke Upper Abs ko build karne me kaafi madad karega. aur next video Lower Abs Workout ke liye hogi. To agli video ka wait kijiye aur is video ko akhiri tak zarur dekhe.&#10;&#10;#AbsWorkout #UpperAbsWorkout #ModernFitnessGym #MFG&#10;&#10;Video Shoot and Edit by Sonu Prajapati&#10;https://www.instagram.com/imsonu248/&#10;&#10;Follow on Social Media:&#10;&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/modernfitnessgyms&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/arifshaikh2015/?hl=en&#10;TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@modernfitnessgym?source=h5_m"
