    title "Upper Ab Burner! (Intense 8 Minutes Workout)"
    description "&#9825;  DO THE QUIZ TO KNOW WHAT DIET AND TRAINING IS BEST FOR YOU:  &#10;https://bit.ly/2QKYXoh&#10;&#10;Upper Abs | Flat Stomach | Intense Home Workout | 8 Minute Workout &#10;&#10;Hi loves, welcome back to my channel!&#10;&#10;This week, I decided to do a workout all on the upper abs. We are doing 2 different circuits that are repeated twice and each circuit contains 3 exercises. The workout lasts for 8 minutes in total, so you can do it on its own or add it to the end of a workout!&#10;&#10;The upper ab exercises are: &#10;- Sit Ups&#10;- Frog Crunches&#10;- Leg Tap Crunch &#10;- Crossed Arm Crunches &#10;- Single Plank Pike &#10;- Superman Crunch &#10;- BONUS &#10;&#10;There is one final exercise at the end for a bonus round ;)&#10;&#10;These do burn so I hope you enjoy. &#10;&#10;I hope you enjoy this. &#10;&#10;Love, Holly xx&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM: @hollydolke&#10;MUSIC: Epidemic Sounds &#10;&#10;Disclaimer: I am not a PT."
