    title "4 min TABATA PLANK AT HOME | SIX PACK ABS WORKOUT"
    description "&#10071;&#65039;&#128293;50 DAYS JUICE FAST. Amazing Results.&#128293;: https://youtu.be/g09XNg-9eQA&#10;&#128293;My transformation abs in 30 days&#128293;: https://youtu.be/IeYo0E0nQgc&#10;&#10;Only 4 min Tabata plank at home six pack abs workout  with no equipment and you can do anywhere without GYM. A quick and intense workout to target your abs. You don't need any equipment or weights! 4 minute and six pack guaranteed&#10;&#10;This video is full length which means you can just follow along with whatever I'm doing. If you need rest, just pause the video. If you don't need a rest - watch it the whole way through&#10;&#10;PREVIOUS VIDEO:&#10;&#10;( 3 min AB Workout ): http://lnnk.in/s0I&#10;( 4 min ABS Workout  ): http://lnnk.in/AWD&#10;( 4 min SIX PACK Workout ): http://lnnk.in/Lxr&#10;( 3 min Full Body Workout ): http://lnnk.in/FVt&#10;( SIMPLE CHEST Workout AT HOME ): http://lnnk.in/Uoq&#10;( QUICK AB Workout): http://lnnk.in/0uk&#10;( 6 PACK HOME Workout | For beginners): http://lnnk.in/ahd2&#10;( 5 min MORNING Full Body Workout ): http://lnnk.in/f7ar&#10;( TABATA ABS AT HOME | 4 min ): http://lnnk.in/nTZ&#10;&#10;TABATA EXERCISES (20 seconds on, 10 second rest):&#10;&#10;1. PLANK KNEE TO ELBOW&#10;2. PLANK&#10;3. PLANK TWIST&#10;4. ROLL HAND UP&#10;5. LEG RAISE&#10;6. PLANK WALK&#10;7. SHOULDER TAP&#10;8. UP AND DOWN&#10;&#10;&#10;Track: Showdown - Freedom (feat. IMAN) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/eqtnSO1y-oo&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/FreedomYO&#10;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/sam.stas/&#10;&#10;&#10;#tabataathome #4mintabata #tabataplank&#10;#4mintabataplank #6packathome #4mintabataworkout #tabatasongs #homeworkoutforbeginners #tabata #workoutsam #samworkouttabata #tabatasam"
