    date "2021-02-02T13:40:51Z"
    title "CHLOE TING 2021 FLAT STOMACH CHALLENGE *Realistic Results* | Binging I 80 lb Weight Loss Journey"
    description "#ChloeTing #FlatTummyChallenge #ChloeTingResults #ChloeTingChallenge&#10;&#10;I finished Chloe Ting 2021 Flat Stomach Challenge! This is such a huge accomplishment for me. The last Chloe Ting Challenge I did was the 2 Week Shred and I struggled to finished it. Not that I didn't struggle, but my struggles were mostly outside of the workouts which was nice. I've been working out consistently since November and I am super excited about my results. I have come a long way from 215 pounds. I am almost at the 40 pound mark! &#10;&#10;I binged for 4 days. I talked about it briefly in my Blogilates video but wanted to speak more on it since I did learn a lot. I've grown so much in how I think and approach food in the last year. A few months ago, that binge would have ruined everything. I would have just settled with ending the working out and continuing to eat whatever I wanted until I got tired. It's so important to understand how we treat ourselves. It wasn't until after the binge that I realized I had been so mean to myself whoever I slipped up. I either told myself to give up cause I'm not good enough, or that failure is all that I'll ever be good for. I am so happy that I only had these thoughts for a moment. We all mess up and messing up is part of life.&#10;&#10;This channel is sort of a time capsule. I got to my highest weight in 2017 and planned to lose the weight and get healthy. 2020 was the year that I was finally able to find what works for me and I am so proud of myself.&#160;&#10;&#10;If you are on a weight loss journey drop your goals in the comments. You aren't alone, let&#8217;s work together! Also, if you documenting your journey on Youtube too, drop your channel in the comments. Let's build a network of support.&#10;&#10;Don't forget to like, comment, and subscribe!&#10;&#10;IG - https://www.instagram.com/creative_caprice/&#10;&#10;Music by Singto Conley - Lunar Tear - https://thmatc.co/?l=6B2B8E0A&#10;Music by Metacell Music - Breathe - https://thmatc.co/?l=23A955D1&#10;Music by Clueless Kit - close your fridge it's cold - https://thmatc.co/?l=9304A6A0&#10;Music by Ryan Little - fall so high. - https://thmatc.co/?l=951C3176&#10;Music by Animus Volt - Victory - https://thmatc.co/?l=FF1DE170"
    channel_title "Caprice Simone"
    channel_id "UCPQqxG3bZhYxltrdgJt_R9g"
