    title "10 Minute Ab Workout // Core Strength Training"
    description "It's a quick burn in today's 10 minute Ab Workout. The focus is on core strength and training the abdominal muscles with a series of body-weight exercises. This is a low impact no equipment, no repeats workout that is great on its own or as a workout finisher. Roll out that mat and follow along! #Abs #AbWorkout #Workout #Fitness&#10;&#10;&#127822;Nutrition Guide: https://heatherrobertson.com/shop/ &#10;&#11088;&#65039;Free Workout Programs: https://heatherrobertson.com/programs/&#10;&#128467; Free Monthly Workout Calendar: https://bit.ly/3bMZGjU&#10;&#128587;&#127996; My Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;&#128722;Outfit Details:&#10;      Shorts: https://bit.ly/3uBvz7p&#10;      Bra: https://lululemon.prf.hn/l/6PEAdmx&#10;     &#10;Workout Breakdown:&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;&#10;10 Minute Abs Workout (30s each)&#10;0:36 Bent knee Crunch&#10;1:06 Crunch + Hold&#10;1:36 Extend + Tuck&#10;2:06 Hold Extension&#10;2:36 Side Bridge (L)&#10;3:06 Bridge + Kick (L)&#10;3:36 Bent Knee V-Sit&#10;4:06 Side Bridge (R)&#10;4:36 Bridge + Kick (R)&#10;5:06 Superwoman&#10;5:36 Swimmer Kicks&#10;6:06 Plank Tuck + Drive (R)&#10;6:36 Plank Tuck + Drive (L)&#10;7:06 Hold Plank&#10;7:36 1-Leg Bicycle (L)&#10;8:06 Hold Bicycle (L)&#10;8:36 1-Leg Bicycle (R)&#10;9:06 Hold Bicycle (R)&#10;9:36 Bicycle Crunch&#10;10:06 Rocking Chair&#10;&#10;10:36 Stretch&#10;&#10;Equipment Needed: exercise mat or other soft surface. The Mat I use: https://lululemon.prf.hn/l/Kj00Lb1&#10;&#10;Where I download my Music *Try it FREE for 30 days*&#10;http://share.epidemicsound.com/zj9WV&#10;&#10;My Amazon Picks: https://www.amazon.com/shop/heatherrobertson&#10;&#10;L I N K S&#10;&#10;Website: http://www.heatherrobertson.com&#10;Instagram: http://www.instagram.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;______________________________ &#10;&#10;D I S C L A I M E R&#10;&#10;T