    title "Total Body STRENGTH Workout // Dumbbells Only"
    description "I'm feeling the burn from head to toe after this Total Body Strength Workout! Using dumbbells only today we are going to target your body's major muscle groups with a series of strength exercises that will build lean muscle and power woohooo! Choose a weight that challenges you but allows you to complete each exercise with controlled, proper form. #strengthworkout #workout #fitness&#10;&#10;&#127822;Nutrition Guide: https://heatherrobertson.com/shop/ &#10;&#11088;&#65039;Free Workout Programs: https://heatherrobertson.com/programs/&#10;&#128467; Free Monthly Workout Calendar: https://bit.ly/3bMZGjU&#10;&#128587;&#127996; My Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;&#128722;Outfit Details:&#10;      Leggings: https://lululemon.prf.hn/l/64yk5Mp&#10;      Tank: https://bit.ly/3lemEpg&#10;      Shoes: https://bit.ly/34x9nz5&#10;&#10;Workout Breakdown:&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:28 Warm Up&#10;&#10;Circuit One (40s work + 20s rest x2 rounds)&#10;4:04 Goblet Squat&#10;5:04 Deadlift&#10;6:04 Push Press&#10;7:04 Bent Over Row&#10; &#10;Circuit Two (40s work + 20s rest x2 rounds)&#10;12:04 Reverse Lunges&#10;13:04 Glute Bridge&#10;14:04 Skull Crusher&#10;15:04 Push Ups&#10; &#10;20:04 Rest&#10; &#10;Circuit Three (40s work + 20s rest x2 rounds)&#10;20:16 Cossack Squat&#10;21:16 Rear Flys&#10;22:16 Tricep Press&#10;23:16 1-arm Swing&#10; &#10;Circuit Four (40s work + 20s rest x2 rounds)&#10;28:16 Sumo Curls&#10;29:16 Crunch Twist + Press&#10;30:16 Renegade Row&#10;31:16 1-Arm Jack&#10; &#10;36:16 Cool Down &#38; Stretch&#10;&#10;Equipment Needed: &#10;Dumbbells: I used sets of 10, 15 and 25lbs &#10;Exercise mat: https://lululemon.prf.hn/l/Kj00Lb1&#10;&#10;Where I download my Music *Try it FREE for 30 days*&#10;http://share.epidemicsound.com/zj9WV&#10;&#10;My Amazon Picks: https://www.amazon.com/shop/heatherrobertson&#10;&#10;L I N K S&#10;&#10;Website: http://www.heatherrobertson.com&#10;Instagram: http://www.instagram.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#1