    title "Get Abs in 10 DAYS And Lose Belly Fat With This 10 Min Ab Workout | Abs Workout Challenge"
    description "We challenge you to do this 10 Min Abs workout for 10 days straight. You will be surprised by the results. &#10;&#10;Lose belly fat and get those abs to show by staying consistent with this workout for 10 days. Just do this workout 10 min a day, either before or after one of our other workouts. This workout is a great option to use as a warm up or as a workout finisher or as a stand alone workout if you are feeling a little bit low on energy. No equipment needed. &#10;&#10;Remember that it's important to combine any exercise with good and healthy foods to maximise the results. Are you ready to get a flat stomach and get rid of fat at home?&#10;&#10;Share your progress, comment workout ideas, or simply share some love in the comments below! &#128172; &#10;&#10;Let's get after it babes!&#10;xoxo&#10;No Bad Addiction&#10;&#10;FREE 14 DAY SUMMER SHRED SCHEDULE&#128071;&#128293;&#10;https://nobadaddiction.com/14-day-summer-shred-program&#10;&#10;&#128717;SHOP OUR SWIMWEAR &#38; ACTIVEWEAR:&#10;https://nobadaddiction.com/&#10;&#10;DON'T FORGET TO FOLLOW US:&#10;&#10;Instagram&#10;@nobadaddiction&#10;https://www.instagram.com/nobadaddiction/ &#10;&#10;Today's Trainer | Layla&#10;https://www.instagram.com/layfitcoach/&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: &#10;All information provided by Nobadaddiction is for educational/entertainment purposes only. No information is to be taken as medical or other health advice pertaining to any individual-specific health or medical condition. You agree that the use of this information is at your own risk and Nobaddadiction is not liable for any injuries or damages or other claims."
