    title "5 Things Women Should Quit Doing After 60... How Many Are YOU Guilty of? :)"
    description "5 Things Women Should Quit Doing After 60&#10;&#10;No, I&#8217;m not talking about wearing jeans or leggings. I&#8217;m not talking about any of the usual stereotypes or clich&#233;s. I&#8217;m talking, instead, about things that can really change your life in a positive way!&#10;&#10;In this morning&#8217;s show, I would love to share 5 things that every woman over 60 should quit doing. I&#8217;m sure that, like me, you will find more than a few of which you are guilty.  &#10;&#10;What do you think that every woman over 60 should quit getting more from life? Are there any destructive behaviors that you have abandoned in recent years?&#10;&#10;Read our article and join the conversation here: https://sixtyandme.com/5-things-every-woman-over-60-should-quit-doing/ &#10;&#10;*****WANT TO RETIRE IN LUXURY OVERSEAS?*****&#10;&#10;Thanks to International Living for sponsoring this video! Check out their free guides to learn about the best (and affordable!) places to retire, travel, buy real estate and enjoy life overseas: https://internationalliving.com/sixtyandme&#10;&#10;*****MAKE MORE FRIENDS THIS YEAR!*****&#10;&#10;If you believe in our mission to improve the lives of women over 60, please consider supporting us on Patreon. Learn how here: https://www.patreon.com/sixtyandme&#10;&#10;*****GET MORE FROM SIXTY AND ME*****&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE to my YouTube channel and click the bell for notifications: http://www.youtube.com/subscription_center?add_user=sixtyandme&#10;&#10;Be inspired to live your life to the fullest with our &#34;Aging Beautifully&#34; inspirational cards: https://sixtyandme.com/aging-beautifully-affirmation-cards/&#10;&#10;Watch all of our yoga for seniors videos for FREE: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0rn7wEvImNM&#38;list=PLnZnSS8X96ZVvR7myoLhLT4s4SkJGQg8n &#10;&#10;Also, remember to check out everything Sixty and Me has to offer here: http://sixtyandme.com/start&#10;&#10;#5_Things_Women_Should_Quit_Doing_After_60  #SixtyAndMe"
