    title "ADVANCED AB WORKOUT | Level 3 ABS | Six-Pack Challenge! (Follow Along)"
    description "Do this 6 MINUTE ADVANCED AB WORKOUT daily! Follow along with me in Level 3 ABS of my six-pack challenge!&#10;Do this ab workout DAILY until it (Level 3) becomes easy and then you progress to Level 4.&#10;.&#10;00:00 Intro&#10;00:14 ADVANCED AB WORKOUT &#10;06:40 Outro&#10;.&#10;&#9989;Like and &#8599;Share to anyone who needs this. &#10;.&#10;Level 1: BEGINNER AB WORKOUT&#10;https://youtu.be/QDUklXQJ_6E&#10;.&#10;Level 2: INTERMEDIATE AB WORKOUT&#10;https://youtu.be/c6VQvQJfD8Q&#10;.&#10;Level 4: ELITE AB WORKOUT &#10;https://youtu.be/spqeeakvmtM&#10;.&#10;Main Instagram - @tmm.midas&#10;Instagram (Digital Content) - @digitalbymidas&#10;Instagram (Gear/Merch) - @gearbymidas&#10;.&#10;ALL MY GYM GEAR/SUPPLEMENTS&#10;-----------------------------------------------------------&#10;www.amazon.ca/shop/midas-themvmt&#10;.&#10;GEAR/MERCH STORE&#10;------------------------------------&#10;www.themidasmvmt.com/shopgear&#10;.&#10;Video Production Gear&#10;--------------------------------------&#10;Canon EOS M50 - https://geni.us/L7UNiBZ&#10;Sigma 16mm F1.4 - https://geni.us/Gempe&#10;Manfrotto Tripod Stand - https://geni.us/jLfyB&#10;Sandisk 64GB Memory Card - https://geni.us/eb8IEyQ&#10;Rode VideoMicro Pro - https://geni.us/Bk2l0xQ&#10;Aputure LS C120D II - https://geni.us/eJ5bFkq&#10;LAOFAS Softbox Dome - https://geni.us/BrVK&#10;.&#10;DIGITAL STORE&#10;--------------------------&#10;www.themidasmvmt.com/shopdigital&#10;.&#10;DISCLAIMER: Links included in this description might be affiliate links. If you purchase a product or service with the links that I provide I may receive a small commission. There is no additional charge to you! Thanks for the support so I can continue to bring you good content."
