    date "2022-06-25T18:37:02Z"
    title "HOW TO DEADLIFT"
    description "A traditional bodybuilding exercise for adding muscle and enhancing all-around body strength is the barbell deadlift.&#10;&#10;&#10;Steps:&#10;&#10;&#10;1.) To begin, place a barbell in front of you and stand with your feet shoulder-width apart.&#10;&#10;&#10;2. Hold the barbell in your hands with your arms extended straight down.&#10;&#10;&#10;3. Holding the barbell in your hands, stand tall and keep your arms still.&#10;&#10;&#10;4. With the barbell, squat back down.&#10;&#10;&#10;5. Continue for the desired number of reps."
