  node [
    id 1327
    label "a33fF6lfbco"
    step 1
    date "2020-08-26T01:02:44Z"
    title "15 Min UPPPER ABS WORKOUT at Home | No Equipment | Caroline Girvan"
    description "This 15 minute upper abs workout will target the abdominal muscles and help strengthen the overall core with focus on the upper abdominal muscles. &#10;&#10;The rectus abdominis muscle runs down the centre of your torso from your sternum down to your pubic bone. When you work these muscles, they contract and all gear towards having visible abs when combined with a body fat percentage that allows visibility.&#10;&#10;However they have many important roles in our body such as flexion of our lumbar spine, postural support and tilting of the pelvis.&#10;&#10;Most of these exercises involves movements involving bring the chest towards the pelvis.&#10;&#10;If these movements cause any strain to the neck, you cause claps hands behind head to provide support. Also try slowing it down a lot, lifting with solely the abdominal muscles to allow the head, neck and upper back to rise as one. &#10;&#10;This follow along workout consists of the following exercises which are performed once and for 50 seconds each followed with 10 seconds rest in between each set to get ready for next exercise. &#10;&#10;BUTTERFLY CRUNCH&#10;TOE REACH&#10;ARMS LOCKED CRUNCH&#10;KNEES TO ELBOW CRUNCH&#10;TABLE TOP SWEEPS&#10;HEEL REACHES&#10;CROSS ARM SIT UP&#10;SINGLE LEG TOE REACH&#10;SINGLE LEG TOE REACH&#10;TABLE TOP CRUNCH TO TOE REACH&#10;SIDE TO SIDE ELBOW CRUNCH&#10;CRUNCH 3 POINT REACH&#10;HANDS BEHIND HEAD PULSES&#10;&#10;PLANK 2 minutes!! &#10;&#10;Please ensure you warm for prior to this workout and stop immediately if feeling strain in neck or any dizziness. &#10;&#10;Ensure your ensure mid section is level on same surface ie. mat.&#10;&#10;Take each movement slowly and exhale on the lifting part of the movement.&#10;&#10;I hope you enjoy!&#10;&#10;Cx&#10;&#10;&#9733; Subscribe to my YouTube Fitness Channel: https://youtube.com/c/carolinegirvan/?sub_confirmation=1 (Thank you for your support)&#10;&#9829; Follow me on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/carolinegirvan&#10;&#9654; Equipment I use from Amazon in my other workouts: https://www.amazon.co.uk/shop/carolinegirvan&#10;&#10149; Business Email for Caroline Girvan: info@carolinegirvan.com&#10;&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: If you are new to exercise or planning on embarking on a new fitness programme, you should consult your physician. This video may offer health, fitness or nutritional information and is meant for educational purposes only. This information is not meant as an alternative to seeking professional medical advice or suggested treatment. Please know that performing any exercise or programme is solely at your own risk."
    channel_title "Caroline Girvan"
    channel_id "UCpis3RcTw6t47XO0R_KY4WQ"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
