    title "How to Do a Leg Raise | Female Bodybuilding"
    description "Full Playlist - https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLB22C9B80DE9FCC61&#10;-&#10;-&#10;like these Workout Lessons !!! Download our official fitness app http://apple.co/1J7guQ7&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Check out these Top Rated Women&#8217;s Workout Essentials:  &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Shake Weight Dumbell: http://amzn.to/1igS0YU&#13;&#10;Gaiam Total Body Balance Ball Kit: http://amzn.to/1igUpmx&#13;&#10;Jillian Michaels: No More Trouble Zones: http://amzn.to/1Q6P5gS&#13;&#10;Fitbit Flex Sleep + Activity Tracker: http://amzn.to/1Jfm7Lq &#13;&#10;Aylio 3 Flat Stretch Bands Exercise Set: http://amzn.to/1hvOrNT&#13;&#10;Trigger Point Performance Foam Roller: http://amzn.to/1LIZvS6&#10;&#10;Watch more How to Strength Train for Women videos: http://www.howcast.com/videos/498039-How-to-Do-a-Leg-Raise-Female-Bodybuilding&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Hey, my name is Erin and I'm a former US Junior Olympic certified swim&#10;coach and personal trainer and fitness is my passion so I cannot wait to&#10;share it with you guys.&#10;&#10;There's a ton of stuff you can do for abs, I'm trying to show you guys some&#10;more creative moves that you don't know about but there are some staples&#10;that we cannot live without.  I want you to lie on your back and tuck your&#10;arms underneath your butt to protect your lower back.  Especially women, we&#10; tend to have more of a curved back, there, so you want to flatten that out and&#10;protect the lower back area.   Now bring your legs up. Now if that's too hard&#10;for you, you can keep the legs slightly bent, that's a good modification.&#10;If you keep the legs bent, you're just going to bring one leg down, tap it&#10;to the floor, back to meet the other, and the other leg.  You have your&#10;legs straight it looks like that, very simple."
