    description "*Win a Fitbit: Do you want to track all your physical activities to get your mind and body right? Take a survey and get a Fitbit. Find fitness inspiration and wellness with Fitbit. Learn how: (US Only)Click Here: https://bit.ly/3M6hiXZ &#10;&#10;*Get a $100 Starbucks Gift Card: Caffeine can&#8217;t make you gain weight but can boost your weight loss goals. Caffeine is good for your brain health and memory. And according to John Hopkins University, caffeine can enhance long-term memory. Get it Here: (US Only) Click Here: https://bit.ly/37Edoa4&#10;&#10;*Free Trial: Medical Strength Male Enhancement:(US Only) Claim Your Sample Here: https://bit.ly/3LgAFg5 &#10;&#10;This video is about how to plank properly for beginners, step by step tutorial. If you are looking for plank exercises for abs, or plank exercises routine that is good for core muscle development, this video will help. Watch now to learn how to plank properly right from the comfort of your home. #plankexercise #planking #waysandhow&#10;&#10;Check out our Health And Wellness Solutions at Amazon. https://www.amazon.com/shop/waysandhow&#10;&#10;http://www.waysandhow.com &#10;Subscribe to Waysandhow: https://goo.gl/RK2SbN &#10;Our Social Media: &#10;Google+: https://plus.google.com/+waysandhow&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/waysandhow/ &#10;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/waysandhow/ &#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/waysandhow &#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/ways.and.how/&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Waysandhow is a DIY channel with health-focused videos in areas of health and fitness, dieting, weight loss, healthy foods, exercise, and many other types of health-related how-to videos."
