    title "PREVENT LOWER BACK PAIN WITH LEG RAISES | activate lower abs"
    description "Hey, ever get lower back pain in leg raises? Or you can do millions of them and not feel them in your abs!? This is the video for you as I&#8217;ll teach you how to prevent lower back pain with leg raises and activate your lower abs for a stronger defined abs. &#10;&#10;I&#8217;d love to see your progress so tag me on Instagram using #AAGurrrls or if you have any questions comment below or email me at andreaantoniou94@gmail.com &#10;&#10;Exercises in the video: &#10;Leg raises, &#10;Single leg raises, &#10;Bent single leg raises, &#10;Two versions of bent leg raises. &#10;&#10;Try to go for 10 repetitions, 3 times. &#10;&#10;I hope this helps you in reducing your back pain and feeling it more in the lower abs. &#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/andreaantoniou_/&#10;&#10;How to do a push up: https://youtu.be/CQOX1wf8Ul0&#10;&#10;How to engage your abs in a sit up: https://youtu.be/Cnyl4zEHYns"
