    label "GvRgijoJ2xY"
    step 1
    date "2016-11-10T21:18:45Z"
    title "What Other Trainers Will Not Tell You: Building Huge Quads. Leg Press Done Right."
    description "The leg press is one of the most misunderstood machines and common mistakes are the norm when I see people doing the mistakes. &#10;In this clip taken from the Miami Muscle Members site, I show you how to do the exercise correctly! &#10;Miami Muscle has the State Of The Art Animation which shows you the angles and ranges along with an Introduction, Common Mistakes, and correct form. &#10;This is followed by a Summary, while I explain the whole process throughout. I make it simple. You see it and get it in one go! I am a certified personal trainer and ex-Olympic weightlifter so I understand the difference between lifting weight and building muscle. &#10;Let's not forget that every exercise in Miami Muscle is doctor approved so you know it's safe. &#10;Enjoy this video from the members' site and remember that all the exercises on the members' website follow the same high standard and are all professionally produced like this one. &#10;Let me know what you think! &#10;&#10;Moji Out!&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Learn Muscle Building from a Muscle Building Expert. Moji Oluwa reveals his 20+ years of experience and tips and tricks &#10;&#10;Go to http://miamimuscleusa.com and try the program for free.&#10;&#10;Click 'thumbs up' if you find this information useful or you are going to try it yourself and get updates every week by hitting the Subscribe button.&#10;&#10;Moji Oluwa is a a 35 times Natural Bodybuilding Champion. (Natural = No Drugs!) and IFPA Pro.&#10;&#10;Moji is an elite trainer and is developer of the Miami Muscle System, the easiest, clearest, most advanced muscle building program available.&#10;&#10;If you want to train smart and see results fast&#10;&#10;Subscribe to our channel: https://www.youtube.com/user/MiamiMuscleUSA&#10;&#10;Click 'thumbs up' if you find this information useful or you are going to try it yourself and get updates every week by hitting the Subscribe button.&#10;&#10;Get your daily free workout tip / motivation from a 35 time muscle building champion on Facebook.&#10;&#10;Follow us on Twitter: https://twitter.com/MiamiMuscleUSA&#10;Follow us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/MiamiMuscle&#10;Follow Moji on Instagram: http://instagram.com/bigmanbosa&#10;&#10;Terms of Service: https://miamimuscleusa.com/miami-muscle-terms-of-service/&#10;&#10;Have a great day!&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Moji &#38; The Miami Muscle Team"
