    description "Six ways to fix your Chest Workout, based on tips and research from Fit Media's expert trainers.&#10;&#10;GET FREE WRITTEN WORKOUTS FROM OUR WEBSITE:&#10;https://www.fitmediaplus.com/free-workout-guides&#10;&#10;Main demos by Beny @FitBeny&#10;Thanks to King's Gym, London&#10;&#10;Also featured - Charles Paquette, Yasir Khan, Elton Pinto Mota, Alessandro Cavagnola, Nick Topel, Auday Al-Ahmad, Moziah Pinder, Peter J.ht, Radostin Tsventaov, Csaba Szigetti, Justin Gonzales. &#10;PowerLifting demo by British Champion Rich Gozdecki&#10;&#10;#gym #workout #chestworkout &#10;&#10;RECOMMENDED WORKOUTS FOR YOU&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XwSJy-S6oXI&#38;list=PLDLX5DjCkvO_SdYO47q82uo4VPOmWEIvM&#10;&#10;Follow us on Instagram &#10;https://www.instagram.com/fitmediachannelofficial/"
