    label "3vuSl6ZBAtw"
    step 1
    date "2016-09-05T23:19:25Z"
    title "300 PUSHUPS A DAY FOR 30 DAYS [MY BODY RESULTS]"
    description "300 Pushups every single day for 30 days straight. Did all pushups at once generally in sets of 20-25. Definitely worth pursuing as a challenge. This will push you. &#10;&#10;Some of you have mentioned how I do not achieve a full range of motion. I agree, I did not achieve a full range of motion, but it would be crazy crazy difficult to get 300 pushups with a full range of motion. I still achieved the results that I was after, and am super proud of this video. Thank you for watching. Thank you to all that have told me that you are going to start the same challenge. That is amazing to hear.&#10;&#10;Love you all!&#10;&#10;Broke up 300 pushups into 15 sets of 20. Mentally broke 300 into sets of 100.&#10;&#10;Set to 100&#10;20 . 20 . 20 . 20 . 20 &#10;&#10;Set to 200&#10;20 . 20 . 20 . 20 . 20 &#10;&#10;Set to 300&#10;20 . 20 . 20 . 20 . 20 &#10;&#10;Beginning&#10;Weight 177lb&#10;Time to complete -- 1 hour&#10;Bench Press -- Struggled getting 135 lbs for 7 reps&#10;&#10;End&#10;Weight 176.2lb&#10;Time to complete -- 20-25 minutes at day 30.&#10;Bench Press -- easy 135lbs for 15-20 / 225lb for 1-2 reps&#10;&#10;Benefits I noticed&#10;Got cut and improved strength&#10;Better sleep&#10;Noticeably happier&#10;Become more disciplined&#10;&#10;PLEASE LIKE, FAVORITE, SHARE and SUBSCRIBE&#10;&#10;&#10;Video Equipment&#10;Canon G7x Mark ii - http://amzn.to/2aB1Qku&#10;Canon Vixia HF G40 - http://amzn.to/2adQm67 &#10;Rode VideoMic Pro - http://amzn.to/2adQOBh&#10;&#10;Outro &#10;Just Do It - Shia LaBeouf&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZXsQAXx_ao0 &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;LIKE MY FACE IN THESE PLACES &#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/taaronjones&#10;Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/acedoozy1&#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/taaronjones&#10;Snapchat - AJizznut"
