    description "&#9825; MY QUIZ: FIND OUT WHAT DIET &#38; TRAINING IS BEST FOR YOU: https://bit.ly/3bcj48i&#10;----&#10;Time to target the lower abs! An area so many of us want to work one, even me after having a baby! This routine will target all the lower ab areas, and if you do it for 14 days, you will see and feel a big difference! &#10;&#10;And if you guys also want to join my challenge on my Pink Dragon app, then sign up below for a FREE 30 Day Trial! &#10;&#10;https://pinkdragon.studio/pd-challenge/ &#10;&#10;------------&#10;You can connect with me below for more workouts, food, and motivation!&#10;&#10;&#9825; MY INSTAGRAM:  https://www.instagram.com/hollydolke &#10;&#10;&#9825; MY TIKTOK: https://vm.tiktok.com/uWJLyQ/&#10;&#10;&#9825; FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/Holly-Dolke-455973181401357/"
