    title "10 MIN KILLER AB &#38; CORE WORKOUT/ Intense Abs With No Equipment/- Fit By Angela"
    description "Ladies and gents, &#10;get ready for a killer ab and core workout! &#10;&#10;This intense Ab routine is suitable for boys, and my strong girls,&#10;and It targets your entire Core, your Lower Abs, Upper Abs &#38; Obliques- Sixpack Abs. The result is stronger core and visible six-pack abs&#10;&#10;Some of the exercises might feel challenging at first, but don't give up and give your 110 % because you will love the results. And you'll notice how it gets easier each time.&#10;&#10;The video is Full Length which means that you can just Follow Along with me. We gonna go through a series of Ab Exercises with 5 sec rest in between. There will be a 30 sec break in the middle of the video so you can catch your breath and get your power back for the second round!&#10;&#10;If You love this workout- please give it a thumbs up! Im also happy to read all your comments and will try to answer you all as soon as possible. &#10;&#10;for Free Workout Plans check out my Instagram Stories and Youtube Posts.&#10;My intention with those is help you reach your Fitness And Health Goals and to have fun!&#10;&#10;Let's go!!&#10;&#10;&#129293; A&#10;&#10;_____________________________&#10;&#10;Music by Epidemic Sound&#10;https://www.epidemicsound&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#10;Follow me on Instagram:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/angelakajo/&#8203;&#10;&#10;Business enquiries:&#10;Email: kajoandco@gmail.com"
