    description "Sending good vibes your way through this quick easy and effective abs exercise at home for ladies beginner standing abs video. If you want to challenge yourself, do high knees in running pace. &#10;&#10;In this workout we have 3 cycles/sets to complete. A total of 6 exercises each. 30 minutes work. 15 seconds rest and 15 seconds recovery.&#10;&#10;&#128221; A little note that this is specially designed for beginners. It is easy to follow so make sure to engage your core the whole time you&#8217;re performing to make it even more effective.&#10;&#10;Enjoy and don&#8217;t forget to leave a comment below if you like this video. Also if you haven&#8217;t subscribe yet, make sure to click that subscribe button and notification bell coz ill be posting more short but effective workouts in the coming days. &#128071;&#127996;&#128071;&#127996;&#128071;&#127996;&#10;&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;When it comes to sculpting those abs of your dreams, it&#8217;s not as simple as doing endless crunches. Core muscles must be strengthened first to create a strong and solid base. It takes time so be patient. If you currently have health issues, please consult your doctor first before doing my workouts.&#10;&#10;Have fun! &#128536;&#10;&#10;WORKOUT FOR ABS&#10;BEST EXERCISE FOR ABS"
