    title "Plantita Jinkee Pacquiao Part 2"
    description "Join me as we explore the beautiful, lush garden of Jinkee's Mansion II in GenSan. I was toured by Roy, Jinkee's favorite landscape artist. He explained to me the why's and how's of this garden. We checked the tropical themed wall garden outside Manny's basketball court. Afterwards, we saw the Japanese styled garden at their Bulwagan. It was breathtaking! They also have some indoor plants inside the Bulwagan. The plants and pots in that area made it look relaxing.&#10;&#10;Being surrounded by greenery is really relaxing. Nakaka-dagdag talaga sa good vibes and sa magandang aura ng isang bahay ang mga halaman."
