  node [
    id 1763
    label "VkyQ4VVj8b8"
    step 1
    date "2022-06-17T15:00:20Z"
    title "20 MIN QUICK NO JUMPING SWEATY HIIT - No Equipment - No Repeat - Full Body Home Workout"
    description "Get your body moving with this 20 min QUICK and SWEATY Low Impact, No Equipment Workout! Team - you'll sweat and burn fat fast with this quick &#38; effective home workout. It's Bodyweight only - you can do it anywhere! No excuses, let's do it &#128170;&#10;&#10;&#9656; Muscles Worked: Full Body &#10;&#9656; Time: 20 Min&#10;&#9656; Equipment: No Equipment&#10;&#9656; Workout: 30 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;&#9656; Cool down with my 15 min Stretch: https://youtu.be/0ZVLG0E72Kw&#10;&#10;Exercises in this Video:&#10;1. Toe Taps&#10;2. Rainbow Thrusters&#10;3. Quiet Burpees&#10;4. Standing Crunches&#10;5. Quiet Burpee and Squat&#10;6. Overhead Squat and Pull Down&#10;7. Clap Under Kick&#10;8. Squat and Punch&#10;9. Punches&#10;10. Prisoner Squats&#10;11. Prisoner Squat Pulses&#10;12. Walk Outs&#10;13. Curtsy Lunges&#10;14. Quiet Burpee and Crunches&#10;15. Knee and Toe Taps&#10;16. Knee Downs&#10;17. Overhead Squat Hold&#10;18. Front Back Lunges Left Leg&#10;19. Front Back Lunges Right Leg&#10;20. Standing Jacks&#10;21. Toes In Out Squats&#10;22. Standing Stars&#10;23. Side Squats&#10;24. Froggy Squats&#10;25. Walk Out and Push Up&#10;26. Reach Up and Down&#10;27. Toes In Out Squats with Pulse&#10;28. Surfer Steps&#10;29. Lunge Kick Right Leg&#10;30. Lunge Kick Left Leg&#10;&#10;&#9656; Instructions: Follow along and complete as many reps as possible in 30 Seconds, then continue to the next move.&#10;&#10;Please remember that we are all different and that you can make this your own workout &#9825; Take a longer break when you need to.&#10;&#10;&#9825; Sign up to my Grow with Anna APP: https://growwithanna.page.link/GetGrowNow&#10;&#10;&#9825; Sign up to the Team Grow Newsletter: https://manage.kmail-lists.com/subscriptions/subscribe?a=VLsDDa&#38;g=WikyFT&#10;&#10;&#9825; Join the OFFICIAL TEAM GROW Community Group: https://www.facebook.com/groups/teamgrowsupport/&#10;&#10;&#9825; My  @foodspring  Supplements: https://bit.ly/33gIZZD&#10;DISCOUNT CODE - ANNAFSG&#10;&#10;&#9825; My  @Gymshark  Outfits: https://gym.sh/Shop-Anna-E&#10;&#10;&#9825;  The Gear I Use: &#10;Camera: https://amzn.to/3aticKD&#10;Lens: https://amzn.to/3cCiujR&#10;Tripod: https://amzn.to/2zontX9&#10;Microphone: https://amzn.to/34VaKXH&#10;&#10;&#9825; SUBSCRIBE: http://bit.ly/2QLvpXn&#10;&#9825; Instagram: http://bit.ly/2ZSdHFR&#10;&#9825; Facebook: http://bit.ly/2SVkgpE&#10;&#10;&#9825; My Music: Get Problem (In the Style of Ariana Grande &#38; Iggy Azalea) [Instrumental Version] by BeatRunnaz here https://t.lickd.co/91f77d9f4ced44f9ae0952fd9f27cea2&#10;License ID: JYlZwAx7LbW&#10;&#10;Get Closer by Sonny Fodera, Just Kiddin, Lilly Ahlberg here https://lickd.lnk.to/42Yb03ID!growingannanas&#10;License ID: DQvPxMawNX1&#10;&#10;Get 7/11 (In the Style of Beyonce) [Instrumental Version] by BeatRunnaz here https://t.lickd.co/636076c3d25745fcaf4434d2b36aaa40&#10;License ID: ZGonyQBXnxE&#10;Get this and other songs for your next YouTube video at https://lickd.co&#10;&#10;https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/gw5avz&#10;&#10;#growingannanas #growwithanna #homeworkouts #lowimpactexercise #hiitworkout #noequipmentworkout &#10;&#10;D I S C L A I M E R&#10;&#10;If you are a newbie start with a simple and easy exercise before attempting all advanced exercises. Performing exercises out of your capability might strain your muscles and you may get injured.&#10;&#10;This channel offers health, fitness and nutritional information. You should not rely on this information as a substitute for, nor does it replace, professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. Growingannanas will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video."
