    description "SWEAT &#38; SHRED 2022 #TABATA &#128170;&#127996; 24 minutes of high-intensity cardio &#38; strength exercises you can do from anywhere! Get your heart rate pumping and muscles burning &#128293; Team, as your coach I really want you to push yourself to YOUR LIMIT for the 24 mins and I promise you'll finish it feeling AMAZING + SWEATY &#128166;  Let's do it!&#10;&#10;&#9656; Muscles Worked: Full Body&#10;&#9656; Time: 24 Min + Cool Down&#10;&#9656; Equipment: Bodyweight Only, No Equipment&#10;&#10;MY BRAND NEW FITNESS NUTRITION GUIDE:&#10;https://www.growwithanna-shop.com/products/grow-nutrition-guide&#10;&#10;&#9829;&#65038; TABATA WORKOUT &#9829;&#65038;&#10;&#9656; 00:00 - 24:05 Workout 20 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;Mini Squat + Heel Tap&#10;Bear + Down Dog Knee Taps&#10;Slams&#10;Jumping Jacks&#10;Squat + Punch&#10;Surfer Jump + Clap&#10;Thrusters&#10;Jumping Jack + Power Jump&#10;Mountain Climbers&#10;Low Plank Dips&#10;High Leg Raise + Climber Right&#10;High Leg Raise + Climber Left&#10;Rope Jumps&#10;Pop Squats&#10;Side Plank Hold&#10;Side Plank Hold&#10;High Knees&#10;Plank Jacks&#10;Reverse Lunges Right&#10;Butt Kicks&#10;Reverse Lunges Left&#10;Plank Butt Kicks&#10;Low Plank Leg Raises&#10;Squat Jumps&#10;High Plank&#10;Plank Walks&#10;Push Ups&#10;Superman Hold&#10;Hand Release Push Ups&#10;Fast Feet&#10;Squat Jacks&#10;Step Backs&#10;1 Squat 1 Squat Jump&#10;Skater Jumps&#10;Squat Hold + Punches&#10;Burpees&#10;Reverse Lunge + Knee Drive Right Leg&#10;Reverse Lunge + Knee Drive Left Leg&#10;Curtsy Lunge + Squat Right Leg&#10;Curtsy Lunge + Squat Left Leg&#10;Seal Jacks&#10;Prisoner Duck Walk&#10;Prisoner Squats&#10;Army Crawl&#10;Low Plank Climbers&#10;Squat Burpees&#10;Lunge Jumps&#10;Jumping Slams&#10;&#10;&#9656; 24:05 - 27:53 Cool Down 30 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;Deep Lunge Left Leg&#10;Deep Lunge Right Leg&#10;Child&#8217;s Pose&#10;Pigeon Left Leg&#10;Pigeon Right Leg&#10;&#10;Please remember that we are all different and that you can mak