    description "Move your body and get super sweaty with this 30 MIN CARDIO HIIT Workout &#128166; Burn calories, sweat and have fun with all standing, no repeat exercises that you can do anywhere! What are you waiting for? Let's do it!&#10;&#10;&#9656; Muscles Worked: Full Body Cardio &#38; Toning&#10;&#9656; Time: 30 Min + cool down stretches&#10;&#9656; Equipment: No Equipment&#10;&#10;Workout:&#10;&#9656; Round 1: 40 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;Reach Up + Down&#10;Rainbow Thrusters&#10;Butt Kicks&#10;2 Jumping Jacks + Pop Squat&#10;Reverse Lunge + Knee Drive Right Leg&#10;Lunge Pulse + Heel Tap Same Leg Position&#10;Reverse Lunge + Knee Drive Right Leg&#10;Lunge Pulse + Heel Tap Same Leg Position&#10;Curtsy Lunge + Squat Jump&#10;Jumping Jacks&#10;Lateral Lunge Step + Toe Tap Right Leg&#10;Lateral Lunge Step + Toe Tap Left Leg&#10;Prisoner Squat Side Step Right Leg&#10;Prisoner Squat + Side Step Left Leg&#10;High Knee Run&#10;Jump Out + Pulse&#10;Balancing Skaters + Pause&#10;Fast Skaters&#10;&#10;&#9656; Round 2: 30 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;Squat + Overhead Reach&#10;Jumping Jack Variation&#10;Pop Squats&#10;Kneeling Up + Knee Drive&#10;Standing Stars&#10;Star Jump + Squat Side Step&#10;Star Jumps&#10;Rope Jumps&#10;Toes In Out Squats&#10;Fast Feet&#10;Sumo Squats&#10;Sumo Pulses&#10;Squat Jacks&#10;Slams&#10;Lunge Squat Combo &#10;Surfer Jumps + Pulse&#10;&#10;&#9656; Round 3: 20 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;Squat Side Jump + Heel Tap&#10;Squat Jumps&#10;Knee Downs&#10;Reverse Lunge + Kick Right&#10;Reverse Lunge + Kick Left&#10;Power Slam + Jump&#10;Squat Scissor Jump&#10;Lunge Star Jump&#10;&#10;&#9656; Cool Down: 30 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;Inhale Exhale&#10;Lunge + Overhead Reach&#10;Lunge + Overhead Reach&#10;Forward Fold&#10;&#10;Please remember that we are all different and that you can make this your own workout &#9825; Take a longer break when you need to.&#10;&#10;&#9825; My Grow with Anna App is launching soon! Don't miss out to sign up for a LIFETIME 30% DISCOUN