    date "2020-11-30T21:23:21Z"
    title "30 MIN TOTAL BODY BLAST HIIT - No Equipment, No Repeat, Full Body Home Workout"
    description "LET'S HIIT IT TEAM!! 30 minutes of total body blasting HIIT exercises with some pretty cool tunes to keep your motivation high - simple, and straight to the point! I had so much fun making this workout for you guys, let me know how you like it in the comments &#128170;&#127996;&#10;&#10;WORKOUT DETAILS&#10;&#10;&#128073;&#127996; Duration: 30 mins plus 5 mins of cool-down stretches&#10;&#128073;&#127996; No Equipment&#10;&#128073;&#127996; 50 Sec Work, 10 Sec Rest&#10;&#128073;&#127996; Level: Medium to Advanced&#10;&#128073;&#127996; No Repeat&#10;&#10;Please remember that we all are different and that you can make this your OWN workout... take a longer break when you need to.&#10;&#10;&#128247; GEAR I USE: &#10;Camera: https://amzn.to/3aticKD&#10;Lens: https://amzn.to/3cCiujR&#10;Tripod: https://amzn.to/2zontX9&#10;Microphone: https://amzn.to/34VaKXH&#10;&#10;&#128170;&#127996; MY HOME TRAINING GUIDE: http://growingannanas.com&#10;&#10;&#187; Subscribe to my Channel for weekly workouts: http://bit.ly/2QLvpXn&#10;&#187; Instagram: http://bit.ly/2ZSdHFR&#10;&#187; Facebook: http://bit.ly/2SVkgpE&#10;&#9993; Contact (business inquiries):  anna@fyndafit.com&#10;&#10;Music: https://lickd.co/&#10;Get Alarm by Anne-Marie here https://t.lickd.co/15Krenggydq&#10;License ID: 582l8EGxKy7&#10;Get Paradise by Bazzi here https://t.lickd.co/GjD5dA5gmrV&#10;License ID: bVYy3JWaN8n&#10;Get Better Off Without You (Extended) by Becky Hill, Shift K3Y here https://beckyhill.lnk.to/BetterOffWithoutYouLi&#10;License ID: agVnwAYjqwd&#10;Get No One by Jess Glynne here https://t.lickd.co/j2BLelOlGea&#10;License ID: zyd9rN3O9nB&#10;Get Mad Love by Mabel here https://t.lickd.co/yoXKMv94N95&#10;License ID: KdmqNyW7j9J&#10;Get Don't Call Me Up by Mabel here https://t.lickd.co/YvZ536bL9WP&#10;License ID: 5LdDLx3lDYN&#10;Get The Giver by Duke Dumont here https://t.lickd.co/ZY0616WEpOx&#10;License ID: zEWbBz7DbL7&#10;Get Mine by Bazzi here https://t.lickd.co/ZlLQMjGdLJY&#10;License ID: B1A3VxVyPLE&#10;Get Love Me Again by John Newman here https://JohnNewman.lnk.to/LoveMeAgain&#10;License ID: O9DoV6NGopj&#10;Get this and other songs for your next YouTube video at https://lickd.co&#10;&#10;&#10;D I S C L A I M E R&#10;&#10;Tabata is an advanced level of the workout and is not suitable for beginners. If you are a newbie start with simple and easy exercise before attempting Tabata. Performing Tabata, in the beginning, might strain your muscles and you may get injured.&#10;&#10;This channel offers health, fitness and nutritional information. You should not rely on this information as a substitute for, nor does it replace professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. The use of any information provided on this channel is solely at your own risk."
