    step 1
    date "2022-03-10T13:40:34Z"
    title "30 MIN TONED UPPER BODY Workout - No Equipment, Tone your Arms &#38; Upper body, No Repeat Home Workout"
    description "Today's Toned Upper Body Workout is all about DEFINING and TONING! You can do this workout anywhere! Get ready to feel the &#128293; in your upper body with these bodyweight only, no-repeat exercises. Let's do it!&#10;&#10;&#9656; Muscles Worked: Upper Body&#10;&#9656; Time: 30 Min&#10;&#9656; Equipment: No Equipment&#10;&#10;Workout:&#10;&#9656; 00:00 - 25:25 Workout 40 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;Push Up + ROTATION Right Side&#10;Side Plank Dip + Climber Right Side&#10;Push Up + ROTATION Left Side&#10;Side Plank Dip + Climber Left Side&#10;Superman Pull Down&#10;Superman Hold&#10;Diamond Push Ups&#10;Cobra Push Ups&#10;Plank Reach + Toe Tap Right Arm&#10;Plank Reach + Toe Tap Left Arm&#10;Back Press&#10;Drive elbows into the floor&#10;Back Press Hold&#10;Side Tricep Press Up Right Side&#10;Side Tricep Press Up Left Side&#10;Kneeling Pull Dows&#10;Reverse Fly Pulses&#10;Side Plank Pull Down Right Side&#10;Side Plank Pull Down Left Side&#10;Crab Tricep Dip + Toe Touch&#10;Frog stand&#10;Tricep Dips&#10;Low Plank + Reach&#10;Superman Lifts&#10;Superman Flutters&#10;Push Up + Row&#10;Plank Walk Back &#38; Forth&#10;Crab Toe Touches&#10;Bear Hold Knee Taps&#10;Pike Push Ups&#10;Low Push Up Hold&#10;&#10;&#9656; 25:25 - 29:40 Finisher 40 sec on, no rest&#10;High Plank&#10;Low Plank&#10;One Arm Plank Left Arm&#10;One Arm Plank Right Arm&#10;Up Down Plank&#10;Low Plank to Dolphin&#10;&#10;&#9656; 29:40 - 33:26 Cool Down 30 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;Child&#8217;s Pose&#10;Shoulder Stretch Left Arm&#10;Tricep Stretch Left Arm&#10;Shoulder Stretch Right Arm&#10;Tricep Stretch Right Arm&#10;&#10;Please remember that we are all different and that you can make this your own workout &#9825; Take a longer break when you need to.&#10;&#10;&#9825; Sign up to the Team Grow Newsletter: https://manage.kmail-lists.com/subscriptions/subscribe?a=VLsDDa&#38;g=WikyFT&#10;&#10;&#9825; Join the OFFICIAL TEAM GROW Community Group: https://www.facebook.com/groups/teamgrowsupport/&#10;