    title "How To Lose Belly Fat In 1 Week | 5 Simple Steps"
    description "In this video you&#8217;ll learn the 4 best evidence-backed tips to answer the question &#8220;How to Lose Stubborn Fat&#8221;, commonly known as &#8220;Lower Abdominal Fat&#8221;. &#10;&#128276;Book a FREE COACHING Call: http://tinyurl.com/DrMikeCoaching/ &#10;&#10;Calorie &#38; Macro Calculator: https://www.calculator.net/macro-calculator.html&#10;&#10;&#10146;SUPPLEMENTS :  https://ehplabs.com&#10;DISCOUNT Code: DIAMONDS10 (directly supports me)&#10;&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME ON INSTAGRAM &#10;&#9654;Instagram: http://instagram.com/doctormike.eth&#10;&#10;** The information in this video is not intended nor implied to be a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis or treatment. All content, including text, graphics, images, and information, contained in this video is for general information purposes only and does not replace a consultation with your own doctor/health professional **"
