    step 1
    date "2018-05-16T00:16:23Z"
    title "Lower Abs Tightening Follow Along 10 Minute Workout [NO EQUIPMENT] | LiveLeanTV"
    description "Flatten your Lower Abs with this 10 minute home workout&#10;&#10004;Join our Team to get LEAN and TONED: https://goo.gl/NwF8rd&#10;&#10;Because you have loved these two lower belly videos:&#10;&#10004;Best Lower Ab Exercises for Women: https://youtu.be/-pJ9rnhQB9g&#10;&#10004;Goodbye Belly Pooch: https://youtu.be/_SHRvEKrJeU&#10;I put together this awesome 10 minute follow-along workout including my 10 favorite lower ab exercises.&#10;&#10;Together we'll do 40 seconds of work for each exercise with 20 second rest periods between exercises. &#10;&#10;I'll be doing each move with you! Just click play and follow along.&#10;&#10;All you need for this is an exercise mat or a carpet to pad your spine.&#10;&#10;Follow with me for the best lower abs workout ever! &#10;&#10;Concentrate on the contractions of your lower abs with each movement for best results.&#10;&#10;To see the complete list of exercises check out the blog post here: &#10004;https://www.liveleantv.com/belly-pooch-flattening-workout/&#10;&#10;Outfit I'm wearing is from Skins, Shoes are Nike's&#10;&#10;OTHER AWESOME ABS TRAINING VIDEOS:&#10;&#10004; How to Get a Slim Waist: &#10;https://youtu.be/qVtAVFlA6ek&#10;&#10004; 4 Minute Abs:&#10;https://youtu.be/zO9OpYulkt4&#10;&#10004; Number One Reason You're Not Getting Flat Abs:&#10;https://youtu.be/PC3r_b8OTp0&#10;&#10;READ OR LISTEN TO EPISODES:&#10;&#10004; Blog Post: https://www.liveleantv.com/&#10;&#10004; Podcast: https://www.liveleantv.com/podcast&#10;&#10;Subscribe Here! http://bit.ly/SubLiveLeanTV&#10;Check Out Our Top Videos! http://bit.ly/LiveLeanTVTopVideos&#10;&#10;WANT MORE DAILY TIPS ON HOW TO LIVE LEAN?:&#10;&#10004; INSTAGRAM: http://www.instagram.com/bradgouthro&#10;&#10004; INSTAGRAM: http://www.instagram.com/JessicaGouthroFitness&#10;&#10004; INSTAGRAM: http://www.instagram.com/LiveLeanTV&#10;&#10004; SNAPCHAT: http://www.snapchat.com/add/bradgouthro &#10;&#10004; FACEBOOK: http://www.facebook.com/LiveLeanTV&#10;&#10004; TWITTER: http://www.twitter.com/bradgouthro&#10;&#10004; TWITTER: http://www.twitter.com/LiveLeanTV&#10;&#10004;TIK-TOK: &#160;https://www.tiktok.com/@bradgouthro&#160;&#10;https://www.tiktok.com/@jessgouthro&#10;&#10; #LiveLeanTV&#10;&#10;About Live Lean TV:&#10;Welcome to Live Lean TV. The online fitness and nutrition show, hosted by Brad and Jessica Gouthro, teaching you how to LIVE THE LEAN LIFESTYLE 365 days a year. Watch hundreds of fat blasting &#38; muscle building workouts, easy and delicious recipes, as well as fitness and nutrition tips to get you your dream body (and maintain it 365 days a year). Make sure you click the SUBSCRIBE button for new fitness and nutrition episodes every week! &#10;&#10;Business Enquiries: info@LiveLeanTV.com&#10;&#10;Lower Abs Tightening Follow Along 10 Minute Workout [NO EQUIPMENT] | LiveLeanTV&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PQlaLAZj0hE&#10;&#10;Live Lean TV&#10;http://www.youtube.com/LiveLeanTV"
