    description "#LowerBellyWorkout #BeginnerWorkout #HomeWorkout &#10;Workout starts at 1:32&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE TO MY CHANNEL (It&#8217;s free!): https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCce7Uuc8LILSkgzavNyDL9g &#10;FOLLOW ME ON INSTAGRAM @Piecesofapril37  https://www.instagram.com/piecesofapril37/ &#10;Email: piecesofapril37@gmail.com&#10;&#10;Contribute to subtitles of this video, thanks.&#10;http://www.youtube.com/timedtext_video?v=kcQKWYc4xo4&#38;ref=share&#10;&#10;My Other Fitness Videos:&#10;Best 12 min Beginner HIIT workout &#10;https://youtu.be/q4gq9mn8iXc&#10;Slim Arms in 30 Days&#10;https://youtu.be/8qDDtm6BOfw&#10;Slim Thighs in 7 Days&#10;https://youtu.be/90a-Tf2jrVQ&#10;10 min Firm Abs Workout You can do Everyday &#10;https://youtu.be/XFtGxoqBmf8&#10;&#10;Large Yoga Mat (Amazon) &#10;https://rstyle.me/+5imBJRLNsqeaMPHGFaA99Q&#10;Sport Bra (Lululemon, size 6, size runs small)&#10;https://rstyle.me/+5pSCxLr1nlFNNXXaPR6vQQ&#10;Legging (Lululemon, size 2)&#10;https://rstyle.me/+SLzIKtnq6HCF1BOZQhi3Iw&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: &#10;I recommend you consult with medical professionals before beginning any exercise program, and always do exercises in safe environments. This video was not sponsored. I use affiliate links. Thanks for your support to my channel!"
