    title "Day 1 #levelup - 30 MIN HIIT Workout, KILLER No Repeat - Exercises to BURN FAT, SWEAT &#38; HAVE FUN!"
    description "&#9829;&#65038; DAY 1 LEVEL UP CHALLENGE: NEW 30 min Killer HIIT workout to burn calories and fat + strengthen and tone your muscles (bodyweight only). NO EQUIPMENT needed for this KILLER HIIT ROUTINE, so all you need is your beautiful and strong body! Grab your mat, a bottle of water and enjoy this crazy sweaty #HIIT party! &#10;&#10;&#9656; Muscles Worked: Full Body &#10;&#9656; Time: 30 Min&#10;&#9656; Equipment: No Equipment&#10;&#10;&#9829;&#65038;  My Music: https://playde.link/fitnessathome&#10;Enjoy sweating and working out with me and the TEAM to popular and uplifting music! HAVE FUN!&#10;00:12 Lucky Luke - Cooler Than Me&#10;03:06 Dynoro &#38; Gigi D&#8217;Agostino - In my Mind&#10;05:56 Rat City, Isak Heim, OKEY - Rather Be (OKEY Remix)&#10;08:45 Gaullin &#38; Julian Perretta - SevenNationArmy&#10;11:37 Max + Johann - What is Love&#10;13:47 James Arthur - September (CORSAK Remix)&#10;17:31 KC Lights - Share a Little Love AMPM&#10;21:00 VIZE feat. Tokio Hotel - Behind Blue Eyes&#10;23:46 Tiscore, VIZE &#38; NO&#216;N &#8211; Where The Roses Grow&#10;26:24 Sofia Martin, le Shuuk &#38; Vize - Toxica (VIZE Remix)&#10;29:52 Lotus Blue - Put your Head on My Shoulder&#10;&#10;&#9829;&#65038; Workout&#10;00:00 - 04:30&#9656; Warm Up: 30 sec on, 0 sec off&#10;Warm Up Hops&#10;Reach Up Reach Down&#10;Warm Up Run&#10;Squat Pulses&#10;Knee Downs&#10;Good Morning + Squat&#10;Slow Climbers&#10;Walk Outs&#10;&#10;04:30 - 14:33&#9656; HIIT INTERVAL 1: 30 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;Squat Burpee&#10;Jumping Jacks&#10;T Rotation Push Up&#10;Fast Climbers&#10;Front Side to Side Lunge&#10;Front Side to Side Lunge&#10;Pulsing Squat Jump&#10;Jumping Jack Variation&#10;Plank Jacks&#10;Lunge Knee Drive&#10;Lunge Knee Drive&#10;Stand Ups&#10;Walking Push Ups&#10;Prisoner Squat Heel Tap&#10;Squat Jacks&#10;&#10;14:33 - 24:43 &#9656; HIIT INTERVAL 2: 40 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;Lunge + Heel Tap&#10;Lunge + Heel Tap&#10;Squat + Heel Tap Jump&#10;Rope Jumps&#10;Squat + Punch&#10;Prisoner Squat + Lunge&#10;Push Back Push Up&#10;Plank Jack Squat Burpee&#10;Thrusters&#10;Burpees&#10;X Jumps&#10;Slams&#10;&#10;24:43 - 29:53&#9656; HIIT FINISHER &#128293; 50 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;Hand Release Push Ups&#10;High Knees&#10;Burpee + 2 Squat Jumps&#10;Stars&#10;Burpee + Tuck Jump&#10;&#10;29:53 - 34:23&#9656; Cool Down 30 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;Standing Inhale Exhale&#10;Forward Fold Swings&#10;Hamstring Stretch&#10;Hamstring Stretch&#10;Butterfly Stretch&#10;Standing Chest Opener&#10;&#10;Please remember that we are all different and that you can make this your own workout &#9825; Take a longer break when you need to.&#10;&#10;&#9825; Join the OFFICIAL #TEAMGROW Community Group: https://www.facebook.com/groups/teamgrowsupport/&#10;&#10;&#9825; Workout Challenges &#38; Guides: http://growwithanna-shop.com&#10;&#10;&#9825; My  @foodspring  Supplements: https://bit.ly/33gIZZD&#10;DISCOUNT CODE - ANNAFSG&#10;&#10;&#9825; My  @Gymshark  Outfits: https://gym.sh/Shop-Anna-E&#10;&#10;&#9825;  The Gear I Use: &#10;Camera: https://amzn.to/3aticKD&#10;Lens: https://amzn.to/3cCiujR&#10;Tripod: https://amzn.to/2zontX9&#10;Microphone: https://amzn.to/34VaKXH&#10;&#10;&#9825; SUBSCRIBE: http://bit.ly/2QLvpXn&#10;&#9825; Instagram: http://bit.ly/2ZSdHFR&#10;&#9825; Facebook: http://bit.ly/2SVkgpE&#10;#growingannanas #growwithanna #homeworkouts #hiitworkout #workoutchallenge #7daylevelupchallenge #sonymusic #homeworkout&#10;&#10;D I S C L A I M E R&#10;&#10;If you are a newbie start with a simple and easy exercise before attempting all advanced exercises. Performing exercises out of your capability might strain your muscles and you may get injured.&#10;&#10;This channel offers health, fitness and nutritional information. You should not rely on this information as a substitute for, nor does it replace, professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at y