  node [
    id 2033
    label "Cw-Wt4xKD2s"
    step 1
    date "2020-05-19T20:10:16Z"
    title "15 MIN HAPPY DANCE WORKOUT - burn calories and smile / No Equipment I Pamela Reif"
    description ".. ready to DANCE (and get really, really sweaty)? This happy dance workout is such a calorie killer! &#9829;&#65038; / Werbung&#10;&#10;This version is full of hits that were popular in the 2010s. From &#34;Shape Of You&#34; by Ed Sheeran, to &#34;Try Me&#34; by Jason Derulo and J-Lo .. all songs put a big smile on my face! Judging from the dance moves, I feel like we have a mixture between the 80s Dance Video &#38; the Sexy Dance Workout! &#10;Aaaand: don't underestimate the last song! I let my Instagram Community chose which song + mood they want to have. And the majority wanted to have &#34;INTENSE&#34; :D .. so this is the part you'll get super sweaty. But the moves are not complicated - don't be scared. &#10;&#10;Apart form the guaranteed GOOD MOOD &#38; I can also guarantee a serious number of burned CALORIES here. My heart rate went up to 170 bpm, which I normally reach with tons of Burpees or Jump Squats :D &#10;&#10;&#9656; I again burned 120kcal in those 15min (which is a lot for me, I'm a tiny human and I normally burn about 250kcal in a 1h session). &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#9656; you can find FREE WORKOUT PLANS on my Instagram Channel. 30min, 45min and Beginner Friendly combinations. Check out the Highlight Bubble &#34;Workout Plans&#34; for that.  &#10;&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10;__&#10; &#10;I update my workout playlist weekly &#38; it's available on Spotify, Apple Music, etc. &#9829;&#65038;&#10;http://wmg.click/GetActive&#10;&#10;1. Jason Derulo ft. Jennifer Lopez, Matoma - Try Me 0:00 - 3:21&#10;2. Ed Sheeran - Shape Of You 3:22 - 7:11&#10;3. Clean Bandit ft. Jess Glynne - Rather Be 7:12 - 10:55&#10;4. David Guetta ft. Nicki Minaj, Bebe Rexha, Afrojack - Hey Mama 10:56 - 14:08&#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10142; Food Account http://www.instagram.com/pamgoesnuts/&#10;__&#10;&#10;Business Contact:&#10;pamela_reif@icloud.com&#10;&#10;__&#10;unterst&#252;tzt durch Warner Music Germany&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;When joining me for this workout video, you need to take some precautions as your health and safety is the most important.&#160;To avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health with your doctor before exercising.&#160;By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. Pamela Reif will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video."
    channel_title "Pamela Reif"
