    description "yayyyy we hit 4M on YouTube! This deserves a special video &#9829;&#65038;&#9829;&#65038;&#9829;&#65038; / Werbung &#10;&#10;another DANCE WORKOUT to oldies music (PS: my parents were again secretly grooving when I chose &#34;their kind of&#34; music). I wanted to call this the &#34;90s Workout&#34; until I noticed that &#34;We Are Family&#34; by Sister Sledge is not from the 90s lol. &#10;Fun to see how I'm not even shy anymore doing (silly) dances in front of the camera. I improved in comparison to my first dance workout haha! &#10; &#10;I do think this one has a litttleeee more advanced dance moves, in comparison to my older Dance Cardio Workout. But you'll get the hang out of it after doing it once - I'm sure!! :) &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#9656; you can find FREE WORKOUT PLANS on my Instagram Channel. 30min, 45min, Beginner Friendly combinations &#38; a DANCE plan. Check out the Highlight Bubble &#34;Workout Plans&#34; for that.  &#10;&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10;__&#10; &#10;&#9656; I update my workout playlist weekly &#38; it's available on Spotify, Apple Music, etc. &#9829;&#65038;&#10;http://wmg.click/GetActive&#10;&#10;1. Cher - Strong Enough 0:00 - 3:30 &#10;2. Snow - Informer 3:31 - 6:34&#10;3. Sister Sledge - We are Family  6:35 - 10:14&#10;4. Cher - Believe 10:15 - 13:56&#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10142; Food Account http://www.instagram.com/pamgoesnuts/&#10;__&#10;&#10;Business Contact:&#10;pamela_reif@icloud.com&#10;&#10;__&#10;unterst&#252;tzt durch Warner Music Germany&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;When joining me for this workout video, you need to take some precautions as your health and safety is the most important. To avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health with your doctor before exercising. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness pr