    description "Get ready for a quick 10 minute Ab Burn!&#10;This Ab routine targets your entire Core, your Lower Abs, Upper Abs &#38; Obliques- Sixpack Abs.&#10;The result is stronger, more defined abs and core. &#10;&#10;It's a perfect workout to add on to your daily workout routine, or when you are short in time and just wanna bust a quick one in.&#10;&#10;Some of the exercises might feel challenging at first, but don't give up! You will see that the exercises will get easier each time you do this routine.&#10;&#10;The video is Full Length which means that you can just Follow Along with me. We gonna go through a series of Ab Exercises with 5 sec rest in between.&#10;&#10;If You love this workout- please give it a thumbs up! Im also happy to read all your comments and will try to answer you all as soon as possible. &#10;&#10;for Free Workout Plans check out my Instagram Stories and Youtube Posts.&#10;My intention with those is help you reach your Fitness And Health Goals and to have fun!&#10;&#10;&#129293; A&#10;&#10;_____________________________&#10;&#10;Music by Epidemic Sound&#10;https://www.epidemicsound&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#10;Follow me on Instagram:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/angelakajo/&#8203;&#10;&#10;Business enquiries:&#10;Email: kajoandco@gmail.com"
