    date "2020-02-17T08:34:01Z"
    title "4 MIN FULL BODY TABATA for FAT-BURNING  |  4&#48516; &#51204;&#49888; &#53440;&#48148;&#53440; &#50868;&#46041; (8K VIDEO)"
    description "Today's workout is 4 minute fullbody tabata routine.&#10;We collaborated with Korean fitness YouTuber GoRush (https://bit.ly/2WlxcUO) for the video and you might be able to see our sweat pore since we used 8K camera for the shooting.&#10;&#10;The temperature was -10&#186;C, however, we didn't give up until the end while thinking of you guys.&#10;Then let's go for the workout with our video !&#10;&#10;&#10;&#50724;&#45720;&#51032; &#50868;&#46041;&#51008; 4&#48516; &#51204;&#49888;&#50868;&#46041; &#47336;&#54004;&#51077;&#45768;&#45796;.&#10;&#51060;&#48264; &#50689;&#49345;&#51008; &#51648;&#45212; '&#47577;&#49548;&#49324; &#53440;&#48148;&#53440;' &#50689;&#49345;&#50640; &#54632;&#44760; &#52636;&#50672;&#54620; &#50868;&#46041; &#50976;&#53916;&#48260; &#34;&#44256;&#47084;&#49772;&#34;(https://bit.ly/2WlxcUO) &#50752; &#54632;&#44760; &#54664;&#45716;&#45936;&#50836;, 8K &#52852;&#47700;&#46972;&#47196; &#52524;&#50689;&#54644;&#49436; &#46400;&#44396;&#47693;&#44620;&#51648; &#48372;&#51068;&#51648;&#46020; &#47792;&#46972;&#50836;:)&#10;&#10;&#52524;&#50689;&#45216; &#52404;&#44048; &#50728;&#46020; &#50689;&#49345; 10&#46020;&#51032; &#52628;&#50868; &#45216;&#50472;&#50688;&#51648;&#47564; &#51200;&#55148;&#50752; &#54632;&#44760; &#50868;&#46041;&#54624; &#50668;&#47084;&#48516;&#46308;&#51012; &#49373;&#44033;&#54616;&#47732;&#49436; &#45149;&#44620;&#51648; &#54868;&#51060;&#54021; &#54664;&#49845;&#45768;&#45796;!&#10;&#44536;&#47100; &#50724;&#45720;&#46020; &#51200;&#55148; &#50689;&#49345;&#44284; &#54632;&#44760; &#50868;&#46041;&#54644;&#50836;:)&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#47560;&#51060;&#54532;&#47196;&#54004;(MYPROTEIN) &#54624;&#51064; &#44396;&#47588;&#47553;&#53356;!&#10;&#128073;&#127995; http://tidd.ly/54ad296a&#10;&#54624;&#51064;&#53076;&#46300;(D/C Code) &#34;allblanc&#34; &#51077;&#47141;&#49884;, &#52628;&#44032; 33% &#54624;&#51064;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#47588;&#51452; &#50732;&#46972;&#50724;&#45716; &#50689;&#49345; &#44396;&#4