ke - One Dance (Leahy &#38; Mack Remix) [No Copyright Music]&#10;Music provided by YouTubers Music &#10;Link to song: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_gdXc4yJ-Y0 &#10;Credits: ~ Leahy &#38; Mack: http://soundcloud.com/leahyandmack &#10;&#10;Song: Adam Lambert - Ghost Town (Veorra &#38; The Tech Thieves Remix) [No Copyright Music] &#10;Music provided by YouTubers Music &#10;Link to song: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z3ixYILmrSM     &#10;Credits: https: //soundcloud.com/veorra    https: / /soundcloud.com/thetechthieves &#10;&#10;Song: Mac Beez - Never Gonna Give You Up [No Copyright Music] &#10;Music provided by YouTubers Music &#10;Link to song: https://www.youtube.com/ watch? v = yL7OeIoX4xs  &#10;Credits: https://open.spotify.com/album/1fWMQOAKIqdgzQgE311HK8  &#10;&#10;Song: The Chainsmokers - Honest (KOFI GANG Remix) [No Copyright Music] &#10;Music provided by YouTubers Music &#10;Link to song: https: // www .youtube.com / watch? v = MuKogFgJzSw &#10;Credits: ~ KOFI GANG www.facebook.com/KoFiGang/ &#10;&#10;Song: Alan Walker - Tired (We Rabbitz ft. Chris Commisso Remix Cover) [No Copyright Music] &#10;Music provided by YouTubers Music &#10;Link to song: https://www.youtube .com / watch? v = SZ8Xuw7OXrI  &#10;&#10;Song: Gwen Stefani - Baby Don't Lie (Brady Greenman Remix) [No Copyright Music] &#10;Music provided by YouTubers Music &#10;Link to song: https: // www. youtube.com/watch?v=zRVehAaRjQw  &#10;&#10;Song: Eurythmics - Sweet Dreams (Notorious TRP Remix) [No Copyright Music] &#10;Music provided by YouTubers Music &#10;Link to song: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FVW05Wba61Q   &#10;&#10;Song : Mattafix - Big City Life (LEEX Remix) [No Copyright Music] &#10;Music provided by YouTubers Music &#10;Link to song: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hkc0kxO_zjE  &#10;Credit: https://soundcloud.com/leex-music &#10;&#10;song: Macklemore feat. Ed Sheeran - Same Love (Sander W. &#38; Natio Remix ft. SDY) [No Copyright Music] &#10;Music provided by YouTubers Music &#10;Link to song: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KXtfmfTn1HY  &#10;Credit: https: / /soundcloud.com/sanderwofficial &#10;&#10;Song: Martin Garrix ft. Troye Sivan - There For You (AND3R5 Remix) [No Copyright Remix] &#10;Music provided by YouTubers Music &#10;Link to song: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v= IxUEm0kdVco &#10;Credit: https://soundcloud.com/and3r5"
