    title "30 MIN KILLER BOOTY BURN Workout - With Weights, No Repeat, Home Workout"
    description "Let's grow this Booty Team &#127825; 30 Minutes of burning exercises, to build and shape your glutes / bum / butt - Grab your weights and your workout mat and then let's get straight into the workout! Let's do it, let's gooooo!&#10;&#10;&#9656; Muscles Worked: Glutes / Butt / Booty&#10;&#9656; Time: 30 Min + cool down &#10;&#9656; Equipment: Dumbbells (I'm using 2x5kg dumbbells for your reference)&#10;&#10;&#9656; Instructions: Follow along and complete as many reps as possible in 50 Seconds. After 10 Seconds of Rest continue to the next move.&#10;&#10;Workout:&#10;&#9656; 00:00 - 04:15 Warm Up 30 sec on, no rest&#10;Sumo Squats&#10;3 x Pulse Sumo Squat&#10;Standing Toe Taps&#10;Good Morning + Squat&#10;Reverse Lunge + Stretch&#10;Side Squats&#10;Squat + Hamstring Stretch&#10;Alternating Heel Raises&#10;&#10;&#9656; 04:15 - 34:20 Workout&#10;Sumo Squat + Pulse&#10;Curtsy Lunge + Pulse Left&#10;Curtsy Pulses Left&#10;Curtsy Lunge + Pulse Right&#10;Curtsy Pulses Right&#10;3 Sec Down Romanian Deadlift&#10;Double Dumbbell Sumo Squat&#10;Double Dumbbell Sumo Pulses&#10;Feet Elevated Glute Bridge&#10;Feet Elevated Bridge Pulses&#10;One Leg Glute Bridge Right&#10;One Leg Glute Bridge Left&#10;Froggy Pulses&#10;Froggy Hold&#10;Side Squats Right&#10;Side Squats Left&#10;Side Steps&#10;Donkey Kick Pulses Right&#10;Donkey Kick + Fire Hydrant Right&#10;Donkey Hold Right&#10;Donkey Kick Pulses Left&#10;Donkey Kick + Fire Hydrant Left&#10;Donkey Hold Left&#10;Romanian Deadlift&#10;Split Squats Right&#10;Split Squats Left&#10;Side Clams Left&#10;Side Clams Right&#10;3 sec hold Sumo Squat&#10;Sumo Squat Horror Hold&#10;&#10;&#9656; 34:20 - 38:03 Cool Down&#10;Wide Leg Forward Fold&#10;Forward Fold To the Left&#10;Forward Fold To the Right&#10;Seated Glute Stretch Left&#10;Seated Glute Stretch Right&#10;&#10;Please remember that we are all different and that you can make this your own workout &#9825; Take a longer break when you need to.&#10;&#10;&#9825; Join the OF