    title "20 MINUTE HIIT FOR ABS | HOME WORKOUT TO REDUCE BELLY FAT | LEVEL 1 (NO EQUIPMENT)"
    description "Try this 20 Minute HIIT for ABS to torch calories and reduce overall body fat. This is a home workout to reduce belly fat by training in High Intensity and Targetting the ABs for core strength at the same time. &#10;.&#10;- 30 Seconds of Active time (1 Exercise every 30 Seconds) and 30 Seconds of Rest time.&#10;- This workout requires no equipment&#10;- Train at a faster tempo to burn more calories (250+). Train with a slower tempo to burn fewer calories or for a beginner-style workout.&#10;- Do this workout once or twice daily for the best results.&#10;.&#10;00:00 Intro&#10;00:38 Mountain Climber&#10;01:38 Alternating Toe Tap&#10;02:38 Plank x Knee Tap&#10;03:38 Standing Side Crunch&#10;04:38 Pike Up&#10;05:38 Outward Foot Tap&#10;06:38 X-Up&#10;07:38 Inward Foot Tap&#10;08:38 Bicycle&#10;09:38 Woodchopper&#10;10:38 AB Walkout&#10;11:38 Knee to Opposite Elbow&#10;12:38 Half Burpee&#10;13:38 High Knee&#10;14:38 Plank Kick Out&#10;15:38 Suqatting Side Crunch - Alternating&#10;16:38 Plank Knee Tucks&#10;17:38 Knee Jump&#10;18:38 Straight Arm Crunch&#10;19:38 Heel Tap&#10;.&#10;Like the Beat in this video, Support my BEATS channel - https://bit.ly/2RnwzMG&#10;Say hello on Instagram - @tmm.midas&#10;.&#10;Download My FREE Workout Programs &#38; Meal Guides: https://sellfy.com/digitalbymidas/freeworkoutprograms/&#10;.&#10;Try Amazon Prime for 30 days FREE&#10;US - https://geni.us/rWyNSyz&#10;CA - https://geni.us/IxeN&#10;UK - https://geni.us/PIP5p&#10;.&#10;WORKOUT EQUIPMENT (DUMBBELLS, KETTLEBELL ETC.)&#10;KIT - https://kit.co/Midas/home-workout-gear&#10;.&#10;US - https://geni.us/Im9yM&#10;CA - https://geni.us/9ErW&#10;UK - https://geni.us/HAHeB&#10;.&#10;WORKOUT SUPPLEMENT RECOMMENDATIONS&#10;KIT - https://kit.co/Midas/workout-supplements&#10;.&#10;Whey Protein Isolate (Less Sugar/Fats/Carbs - Pure Protein Source)&#10;US - https://geni.us/nyGun&#10;CA - https://geni.us/vvdI&#10;UK - https://geni.us/V2JEg&#10;.&#10;Whey Protein Concentrate (More Sugar/Fats/Carbs)&#10;US - https://geni.us/BExt&#10;CA - https://geni.us/BrEgB&#10;UK - https://geni.us/hdak5nb&#10;.&#10;Creatine&#10;US - https://geni.us/fLUdOgs&#10;CA - https://geni.us/5iddAM&#10;UK - https://geni.us/XST8Yk&#10;.&#10;Pre-Workout&#10;US - https://geni.us/JgPPwB&#10;CA - https://geni.us/FXW6UWh&#10;UK - https://geni.us/wBaQNPa&#10;.&#10;Feeling generous? &#128591;&#127998;&#128588;&#127998; Donate here  - https://www.paypal.com/donate?hosted_button_id=2R2JVV47AT38Y&#10;.&#10;MASSAGE GUN (Use CODE 'Midas10' for 10% off) - http://bit.ly/38ed8M3&#10;MY VIDEO GRAPHICS - www.sellfy.com/digitalbymidas&#10;.&#10;FREE YouTube Growth and Management Tool (TubeBuddy) - https://www.tubebuddy.com/themidasmvmt&#10;Build your E-Commerce Store (Sellfy) - https://get.sellfy.com/themidasmvmt&#10;.&#10;MY FILMING EQUIPMENT - https://kit.co/Midas/youtube-video-kit&#10;GEAR/MERCH - www.themidasmvmt.com/shopgear&#10;3D ILLUSION LAMP (Use CODE 'Lamptee-DiGiTAL' for 10% off) - https://bit.ly/3uZWl9i&#10;.&#10;Tech Channel - https://www.youtube.com/c/MIDASDIGITAL&#10;Gaming Channel - https://www.youtube.com/c/midasgaming2&#10;.&#10;Twitter - @MiDASDiGiTAL1&#10;Instagram (Digital Content Store) - @digitalbymidas&#10;Instagram (Gear + Merch) - @gearbymidas&#10;.&#10;DISCLAIMER: Links included in this description might be affiliate links. If you purchase a product or service with the links that I provide I may receive a small commission. There is no additional charge to you! Thanks for the support so I can continue to bring you good content."
