    title "HOW TO GET A SMALLER WAIST/K POP BODY SHAPE/ 6 Min AB Seated Workout At Home / No Equipment"
    description "&#9635; My Diet Meal Plan (Free)https://bit.ly/ShirlynKim&#10;&#9635; FREE WEEKLY WORKOUT PLAN &#10; https://www.youtube.com/c/ShirlynKim/community&#10;&#10;&#9654;You can complete this entire routine once or twice a day with my weekly workout plan on my channel. &#10;&#9654;For Better Results: Combine this workout with my workout program and a good nutritious meal (essential:) together. Also, consistency is the magic key to achieve your fitness goal. You can do it~! &#128522;&#10;&#9654;&#9655;How Long does it take to get results?  &#10;the time it takes for abs or small waist to show is that everyone is different.&#10;It depends  on a person&#8217;s body fat percentage, daily diet, gender ,and exercise habits, etc...&#10;At least it takes  approximately from 2 weeks to eight weeks to see the results.  &#10;&#10;&#9635; This  at home workout is to get a smaller waist and lose belly fat. &#10;Do this quick &#38; effective workout you can do at home, in only 6 minutes. &#10;No equipment needed and hope you enjoy it :)&#10;&#10;&#9734; WORKOUTS TO PAIR WITH THIS ONE&#10;&#9672;FULL BODY https://youtu.be/yZ_GeAfD0k4&#10;&#9672;Standing Arms &#38; Armpit Fat : https://youtu.be/MUkAJDviGQA&#10; &#9672;Abs &#38; Waist : https://youtu.be/D9biQBs27Do&#10;&#10;&#9655;&#9654;Side Plank for Beginner&#10;1) Lie on your side with your knees bent, and prop your upper body up on your elbow.&#10;2) Raise your hips off the floor, and hold for seconds&#10;3) Rest for 10 seconds.&#10;4) Repeat &#10;5) Switch to your other side and repeat steps 1 through 4.&#10;&#10;&#9672;For Beginners &#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL3H6kz_8S1nUF6keyek4U2CHdX2S-Mv0-&#10;&#10;Here are today's ab workout : &#10;1. SINGLE LEG LIFT &#10;2. RUSSIAN TWIST&#10;3. LEG SCISSORS&#10;    REST 15 sec &#10;4. CROSS CRUNCHES&#10;5. HEEL TOUCHES&#10;6. SIDE PLANK ( L )&#10;7. SIDE PLANK ( R)&#10;8. AB STRETCHES  20 sec&#10;9. MOUNTAIN CLIMBERS&#10;10. SPIDER PLANK &#10;11. PLANK WITH LEGS MOVEMENT&#10;12. ELBOW PLANK&#10;13. COOL - DOWN STRETCHES&#10;&#10;&#9829;WORKOUT PROGRAM &#38; DIET MEAL PLAN&#10;&#45796;&#51060;&#50612;&#53944; &#49885;&#45800; &#48143;  &#47588;&#51068; &#50868;&#46041;&#54540;&#47004;&#54364;&#10;https://www.instagram.com/fitn_youngsy/&#8203;&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCy9E...&#8203;&#10;&#9733;My Links &#10;https://www.instagram.com/fitn_youngsy/&#8203;&#8203; &#10;https://www.facebook.com/shirlyn.kim&#8203;&#8203; &#10;&#10;&#9734; Subscribe my channel&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCy9EJey-edwvVqv8FuKKIaQ?view_as=subscriber&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9831; Upload day: every Monday ( Korean Standard Time) &#10;&#10;&#9734;Music By&#10;https://www.epidemicsound.com/music/featured/&#10;&#10;Thanks for watching my video and hope you guys enjoy it. &#10;Love you &#9829;&#10;&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;This workout video on my YouTube channel is the one  that I personally do to help people stay fit and healthy at home. &#10;When joining me for this workout video, check your health and safety with experts first since they are the most important. &#10;I am not responsible for any injuries and risks arising from this workout video."
