    description "I hope you have done the exercises on time and got great results&#128170;&#128525;&#10;Many of you would like to vacuum your stomach or have a muscular stomach.&#10;But those who have a little fat around the abdomen cannot do a abdominal vacuum  because they have to reduce the belly fat first and then go for a abdominal vacuum.&#9989;&#10;You should rest for 30 seconds between each set during your workout.&#128076;&#10;Do not drink water between abdominal exercises and do not eat food&#10;You have to do abdominal exercises almost every day to get your desired result, and even have proper nutrition and sleep &#128564;&#129367;&#10;I hope that we will achieve the best body together &#128525;&#128170;&#10084;&#65039;&#10;&#10;&#128156;Instagram&#128156;&#10;https://instagram.com/officialmaedeh?igshid=YmMyMTA2M2Y=&#10;&#10;1: Full body workout&#10;https://youtu.be/45SGw3867lU&#10;&#10;2: Arm workout&#10;https://youtu.be/B_Kq2BIATPg&#10;&#10;3: Leg workout&#10;https://youtu.be/neVD7e84r7M&#10;&#10;4: Abdominal vacuu&#10;https://youtu.be/4ftgLFFDNrk&#10;&#10;5: Hip workout&#10;https://youtu.be/9YC90ogjQVc&#10;&#10;6: Leg workout&#10;https://youtu.be/_oWdE_PA33E&#10;&#10;7: Hip workout&#10;https://youtu.be/liJytbyPET0&#10;&#10;8: Hip workout&#10;https://youtu.be/YX5CHAJA4fg&#10;&#10;9: flat ab workout&#10;https://youtu.be/IHj08FLrOAc&#10;&#10;10:leg exercise&#10;https://youtu.be/6IpmLhh8oW8&#10;&#10;#workout  #sports #bodybuilding #workoutathome  #bestworkout #exercise #homeworkout&#10;#fitness #easyworkout #hiitworkout&#10;&#10;sporter girl&#10;workout&#10;exercise&#10;exercise morning&#10;home workout&#10;home exercise&#10;best workout&#10;easy workout&#10;hiit workout&#10;fitness&#10;bodybuilding&#10;sports&#10;workout at home&#10;bodybuilding at home&#10;abs workout&#10;abs workout at home&#10;abdominal vacuum&#10;stomach vacuum"
