    title "side abs workout in 15 day / side abs workout at home /side abs workout no equipment"
    description "A very brief and useful exercise for burning fat on your side &#128076;&#10;I wrote the set of exercises for you in the video. You should rest for 30 seconds between each set of exercises. Drink water between the side exercises, but little &#9989;&#10;You do not need any equipment in these exercises, but if you want to do your exercises in the club, you can also use dumbbells in some side exercises &#9745;&#65039;&#10;The side is one of the most important parts of the body because it shows itself a lot in clothing, if your side is small, you will have a slim waist &#128525;&#10;You should also eliminate a number of foods from your diet that will help you burn more fat on your sides and abdomen.&#10;You need to exercise your abdomen and  side almost every day to get to your small abdomen and side very quickly &#9989;&#10;And you can even see a variety of exercises in my playlist and use them to burn fat and build muscle in your abdomen and side &#128076;&#10;I'm very happy to be a friend of your online workouts&#10084;&#65039;&#128139;&#10;&#10;&#128156;Instagram&#128156;&#10;https://instagram.com/officialmaedeh?igshid=YmMyMTA2M2Y=&#10;&#10;1: Full body workout&#10;https://youtu.be/45SGw3867lU&#10;&#10;2: Arm workout&#10;https://youtu.be/B_Kq2BIATPg&#10;&#10;3: Leg workout&#10;https://youtu.be/neVD7e84r7M&#10;&#10;4: Abdominal vacuum&#10;https://youtu.be/4ftgLFFDNrk&#10;&#10;5: Hip workout&#10;https://youtu.be/9YC90ogjQVc&#10;&#10;6: Leg workout&#10;https://youtu.be/_oWdE_PA33E&#10;&#10;7: Hip workout&#10;https://youtu.be/liJytbyPET0&#10;&#10;8: Hip workout&#10;https://youtu.be/YX5CHAJA4fg&#10;&#10;9: flat ab workout&#10;https://youtu.be/IHj08FLrOAc&#10;&#10;10:leg exercise&#10;https://youtu.be/6IpmLhh8oW8&#10;&#10;#workout  #sports #bodybuilding #workoutathome  #bestworkout #exercise #homeworkout&#10;#fitness #easyworkout #hiitworkout&#10;&#10;sporter girl&#10;workout&#10;exercise&#10;exercise morning&#10;home workout&#10;home exercise&#10;best work