    description "Nina Dobrev has collaborated on a BODYJAM workout with Reebok and the Les Mills creative team, including BODYJAM Program Director Gandalf Archer-Mills and SH'BAM program director Rachael Newsham. The workout is chosen from Nina&#8217;s favorite dance moves and tracks, and developed and certified by our expert team. No equipment needed for this cardio workout!&#10; &#10;BODYJAM is the ultimate combination of music and dance. It&#8217;s a killer calorie-burning workout that mixes up House, Hip-hop, Drum &#8216;n&#8217; Bass, Trap, all styles of electronic dance music.&#10;&#10;Get the music:&#10;http://hyperurl.co/wnuxpe &#8211; You Can Feel The Force, Archer M_lls&#10;http://hyperurl.co/7zfazs &#8211;TwoZero, Archer M_lls&#10;https://monster.cat/LIKENINA&#10;&#10;Try LES MILLS On Demand FREE for 14 days here: https://lmod.co/onlineworkouts&#10;&#10;Try our dance workouts at home on LES MILLS On Demand: https://www.lesmills.com/ondemand/workouts/dance/&#10;Find BODYJAM at a gym near you: https://www.lesmills.com/workouts/fitness-classes/bodyjam/?findaclass=&#10;&#10;Find us on social:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/lesmills&#10;https://www.instagram.com/lesmillsondemand&#10;https://www.facebook.com/lesmills"
