    description "IdealFit 15% off Discount Code: &#34;NAOMI&#34;&#10;Shop here: https://bit.ly/3auCQ05&#10;&#10;Hey, there, guys!&#10;&#10;Today, we'll be doing an abs and core workout that you can do right from home--you don't even need any equipment! Just your body.&#10;This workout will be in a follow along style so that you can workout in real time with me!&#10;&#10;Please see down below for the full written workout &#38; music playlist.&#10;&#10;Of course, most importantly, never forget that your fitness goals are fueled also through your nutrition, so always remember to stay consistent with both your nutrition &#38; training.&#10;&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;*THIS GIVEAWAY IS CLOSED*&#10;&#10;Shoutout to all of you rock star babes who have been so kind and supportive of me and this channel! I wouldn't be here without you. THANK YOU.&#10;&#10;For this giveaway, ONE winner will receive IdealFit's Starter Bundle.&#10;The winner will be RANDOMLY chosen and contacted via Instagram DM and has 48 hours to respond before another winner is selected.&#10;This giveaway will CLOSE on Thursday, April 1st at 11:59PM CST.&#10;&#10;100K GIVEAWAY RULES:&#10;- Subscribe to my YouTube channel (@naomikong) &#38; turn the notification bell on&#10;- Drop a comment under this video including your Instagram username so I can easily contact you if you win&#10;- Follow me (@naomi.kong) on Instagram&#10;- Follow @idealfit on Instagram&#10;- Like/follow @beidealfit on Face Book https://www.facebook.com/BeIdealFit/&#10;&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;SUPPLEMENTS USED:&#10;(Discount Code: &#34;NAOMI&#34; for 15% off your purchase)&#10;IdealFit BCAAs (Peach Rings) | https://bit.ly/2NzgnpV&#10;IdealFit Pre-Workout (Watermelon Ice) | https://bit.ly/3qxfxZ5&#10;IdealFit Whey Protein (Fruity Cereal) | https://bit.ly/3jX8DtI&#10;&#10;BEGINNER ABS &#38; CORE WORKOUT:&#10;1) Reverse Crunches | 30 seconds&#10;Rest for 30 seconds.&#10;2) Heel Touches | 30 seconds&#10;Rest for 30 seconds.&#10;3) Dead Bugs | 30 seconds&#10;Rest for 30 seconds.&#10;4) Plank | 30 seconds&#10;Rest for 60 seconds.&#10;*Repeat 1-4 for a total of 2x.&#10;(Complete entire video twice for an extended version of this workout.)&#10;&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;My workout guides: https://naomikong.com/collections/all&#10;&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;6 WEEK BEGINNER FULL BODY WORKOUT GUIDE | https://youtu.be/t9p3mp1NIhU&#10;LEGS, BOOTY, &#38; ABS HIIT NO EQUIPMENT | https://youtu.be/8gl_qvq_E7Y&#10;6 WEEK BEGINNER ABS WORKOUT GUIDE | https://youtu.be/Yisj6bG3e5M&#10;&#10;For more workout videos and daily fitness motivation, follow me on:&#10;INSTAGRAM: http://www.instagram.com/naomi.kong&#10;FACEBOOK: http://www.facebook.com/naomikongfitness&#10;&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;*This video and description contains affiliate links. This helps support the channel and allows me to continue creating more content for you. Thank you for your support!&#10;&#10;&#10;OTHER:&#10;- Lashes: https://amzn.to/2ljP6cE&#10;&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Music Playlist:&#10;- Bedroom | Loving Caliber&#10;- Sweet Talk | Tyra Chantey&#10;- Do You Read Me (Ndy Remix) | Seroa ft. Emmalee&#10;- Red Lights | Lvly&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;#naomikong #naomikongfitness #absandcoreworkout"
