    description "15 MIN Lean Model Leg's Workout // Focused Toning For Defined Legs + No Equipment // Sami Clarke  @Sanne Vloet  &#10;&#10;Hi friends!&#10;&#10;I would love if you guys commented after your workout, or before, something that you overcame during quarantine. It can be anything doesn't need to be super personal, or it can be! It's up to you! I want to read your stories and since our community is all about growth and getting stronger we can all be here for each other! I can't wait to read all your comments and learn more about you guys! &#10;&#10;Today's workout is a lot of fun to do! Please share this video with a friend who hasn't worked out with me before. I love working out with a partner or friend, it helps me stay motivated and by doing it this way we are able push ourselves just a little bit harder while having a lot of fun! It's also fun to coordinate outfits! &#10;&#10;I hope all of you are subscribed and ready for a wellness/fitness challenge that I am thinking about doing here with all of you! Comment if you like the idea and what we should focus on!&#10;&#10;xoxo&#10;&#10;-sc&#10;&#10;Find me on Fit Plan: https://fitplan.app.link/Xak2l7VJ55"
