  node [
    id 2451
    label "H7iorqtyj-Q"
    step 1
    date "2020-05-04T01:21:47Z"
    title "20 Minute Challenging Upper Body Mini Band Workout | Delts"
    description "This super quick mini band workout will challenge the upper body.  The *main* focus is on the shoulders.  Make sure your band has a little give to it. If it is super heavy and has no give, it will not work! Im using a &#34;medium heavy&#34; band in this video. It came in a pack of three: medium heavy, heavy, and ultra heavy. I wouldn't be able to budge the ultra heavy around the arms. Every pack of bands is different and they wear pretty fast. We begin with a banded warm-up, if you would like more of a warm-up please perform some body weight internal and external shoulder rotations. This one is challenging and I wanted to cry like 5 times. Have fun.&#10;&#10;More Mini Band Workouts: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aXVif5f3VY063SEzLdnfWLQ&#10;&#10;Set of 5 Mini Bands: https://amzn.to/2UUc2NZ&#10;&#10;Set of 3 Mini Bands: https://amzn.to/2yoYIcR&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Similar Mat (Cheap): https://amzn.to/3aG7nFO&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;Music licensed through Soundstripe"
