  node [
    id 2454
    label "8_hZ5ywq7Nw"
    step 1
    date "2020-09-16T16:38:29Z"
    title "10 Minute Ab Workout | Dumbbell Only | Add on Abs | Month 3 Day 2 Strength Training At-Home Program"
    description "Grab one dumbbell and a mat for this super quick 10 minute add-on abdominal workout. As a modification (or if you don't have a dumbbell) you can also perform with bodyweight only. This quick ab burnout is designed to be added at the end of your workout (I will be adding this video as an add-on to some days in my month 3 strength and conditioning workout program). Since we are doing this at the end of your lower or upper body day, we are already warmed up. Soooo there is no warm-up included. There are 7 exercises. We will complete each exercise for 75 seconds and we will have 12 seconds to recover (that puts us just shy of ten minutes). These moves are basic and easy to follow; we don't need to re-invent the wheel in order to gain strength and achieve the results we want. Pay attention to how we are performing them (pause, eccentric, etc.), and maintain your mind-muscle connection throughout. Now lets do this! &#10;&#10;SKIP TO 1:35 TO BYPASS INTRO&#10;&#10;Month 3 Strength + Conditioning Workout Program: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aXvP7m0yYNR7f6NzJ6IKpyc *How to follow is in the description of the playlist*&#10;&#10;More advanced/Bootcamp workouts: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aUokOX1_8lO_9HI8ZXfPEi4&#10;&#10;Month 2 S+C Workout Program: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aUd7OnGD9n5w6KjcmELoW7w&#10;&#10;Dumbbell Set: https://amzn.to/2Ec8xOC&#10;Adjustable Dumbbells: https://amzn.to/2FDYO3T&#10;Dumbbell Set (light): https://amzn.to/2FOpdMj&#10;&#10;HydroJug: Use Code LARIE10 for discount&#10;https://www.thehydrojug.com/&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon tank: https://amzn.to/3g95fbP&#10;&#10;Cute CHEAP sports bra: https://amzn.to/37M7uh4&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon Align Pants CHEAP: https://amzn.to/2PaCRLK&#10;&#10;Lululemon Align Replica Grey: https://amzn.to/2Tfqhfh&#10;&#10;Yoga Mat (similar): https://amzn.to/39EvlS1&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;&#10;MUSIC:&#10;&#10;&#127925; Post Malone - Hollywood's Bleeding (BLKCUBE Remix) [No Copyright Music]&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JCwM7CcFik4&#10;&#10;&#127925; Travis Scott - Highest in the Room Remix &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jyeqSDlB95k&#10;&#10;&#127925;Ozzie x Post Malone- White Iverson (Airia Chill Trap Remix) [No Copyright Music]&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yqOf2...&#10;&#10;&#127925; All others songs are licensed from epidemic sounds and soundstripe"
