    title "Barre(less) Arms and Legs: 15 Minute Barre &#38; Pilates Inspired Workout - Light Weights, Heavy Burn"
    description "Support me &#38; give back:&#10;https://www.patreon.com/fitbylarie &#10;&#10;Lululemon Align Pant: https://goo.gl/dZP4Ho&#10;&#10;Lululemon tank (cheaper version): https://amzn.to/2J0bPEQ&#10;&#10;Yoga Mat: https://goo.gl/8CMsSS&#10;&#10;Set of light dumbbells: https://goo.gl/sH2tRW &#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;&#10;This 15 Minute Barre and Pilates Inspired video will sculpt and tone your arms. Not only will you get a great arm workout but you will also feel it in those legs while we do lunges, squats, and some static holds. Grab a 3-5 lb dumbell and let&#8217;s get to work!&#10;&#10;(Working out to 130 BPM)&#10;&#10;Music licensed through Soundstripe&#10;&#10;Follow me on IG: @lariemidkiff"
