  node [
    id 2456
    label "DaEmtU5VM7c"
    step 1
    date "2020-12-02T11:09:40Z"
    title "15 Minute Ankle Weight Workout | Booty + Thighs"
    description "Grab a mat and ankle weights for this 15 minute ankle weight workout. We will be focusing on the glutes and inner thighs. Every exercise is performed for 60 seconds. Following each exercise we will have 15 seconds to recover and transition into the next exercise. Since the exercises are timed, find a pace and tempo that works for you! We do not have to go at the same speed or hit the same amount of reps. Quality over quantity. Minimal cues are given so we can jam out. (Be sure to keep a neutral spine throughout and do not let the non-working hip sway. See intro of video for full explanation).&#10;&#10;SKIP TO 3:25 begin workout&#10;&#10;One song does have profanity. (Sorry, love Neffex!) For the SAME workout with no background music, click here : ) https://youtu.be/dn5Xb9Sejb8&#10;&#10;More ankle weight workouts: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aXogO2ohezFemGunjrP5fLH&#10;&#10;Ankle weights, adjustable heavy: https://amzn.to/2Js7Fbc&#10;Ankle weights, adjustable light: https://amzn.to/39Mo8Sv&#10;&#10;Cooldown/Stretching: https://youtu.be/dtT3temG5cs&#10;&#10;HydroJug: Use Code LARIE10 for discount&#10;https://www.thehydrojug.com/&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Beyond Yoga Tank: https://amzn.to/36uXJXe&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon tank: https://amzn.to/3g95fbP&#10;&#10;Cute CHEAP sports bra: https://amzn.to/37M7uh4&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon Align Pants CHEAP: https://amzn.to/2PaCRLK&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon Align Pants in Lilac: https://amzn.to/37HifDt&#10;&#10;Yoga Mat (similar): https://amzn.to/39EvlS1&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;&#10;MUSIC:&#10;&#10;&#127925; Post Malone - Hollywood's Bleeding (BLKCUBE Remix) [No Copyright Music]&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JCwM7CcFik4&#10;&#127925; Post Malone - Go Flex (ZiiPPCODE Remix) [No Copyright Music]&#10;https://youtu.be/_UZCnVG9wEw&#10;&#127925;NEFFEX - Watch Me &#127942; [Copyright Free]&#10;https://youtu.be/ib9HZzZhG7I&#10;&#127925;NEFFEX - Rumors &#128139; [Copyright Free]&#10;https://youtu.be/kXptPzKNMq4&#10;&#127925; All others songs are licensed from epidemic sounds and soundstripe"
