    description "Support me &#38; give back:&#10;https://www.patreon.com/fitbylarie &#10;&#10;Cheap Fabric Resistance Band: https://amzn.to/391iqsD&#10;&#10;Set of 3 Fabric Loop Bands: https://amzn.to/2HUKSAj&#10;&#10;Loop Band Im using but kinda can't believe I paid $35 for it: https://amzn.to/32qn1lD&#10;&#10;Lululemon Align Replica Purple: https://amzn.to/2SZLWti&#10;&#10;Lululemon Align Replica Grey: https://amzn.to/2Tfqhfh&#10;&#10;Anti-Slip Bands Set of 3 thicker: https://amzn.to/312qAhe&#10;&#10;Yoga Mat (similar): https://amzn.to/39EvlS1&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Skip to 1:30 to bypass intro. This quick barre (less) workout will be sure to get your glutes and core on fire (especially your glutes) You will need a sturdy chair, a resistance band (preferably fabric: linked a cheap one above, I really like this brand!), and a mat. Let's get burning barre babes!&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;Music licensed through Soundstripe"
