    label "F0oJOSh3DeQ"
    step 1
    date "2021-03-17T11:42:04Z"
    title "20 Minute Stretch + Flow Session | Full Body Stretch | Month 4 Day 7 Strength At-Home Program"
    description "All you need is a mat for this full body stretch session. We do flow from one stretch to the next so there is no timer, only verbal transition cues. I do talk you through this one; what to do, where you should feel this stretch, etc. This full body stretch should leave you feeling great. Try it out in the morning, mid-day, or evening. Let me know how you feel after in the comments below : )&#10;&#10;Total stretch time: 19 minutes&#10;&#10;Month 4 Strength Program: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aVuFlA5YLKfR-WWoigIfutE&#10;&#10;More Stretching/Yoga Videos: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aULHNQJUEsi_Xa8jXSIYUf_&#10;&#10;Leggings ryderwear, similar version here: https://amzn.to/2NuRo7s&#10;Top Alo, similar version here: https://amzn.to/2OEEdBe&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Yoga Mat (similar): https://amzn.to/39EvlS1&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff"
