    step 1
    date "2018-12-28T17:02:19Z"
    title "17 Minute Booty Burner Workout with Core, Shoulders, and Biceps. Burn calories, tone and sculpt!"
    description "Support me &#38; give back:&#10;https://www.patreon.com/fitbylarie&#10;&#10;*Skip past 2 minute intro to begin 17 minute workout.&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Saucony running shoes: https://amzn.to/2M8q6hs&#10;&#10;My favorite Lululemon 7/8 pants: https://goo.gl/c59MbX &#10;&#10;Yoga Design Lab Yoga Mat (great quality, mid-high price): https://goo.gl/8CMsSS&#10;&#10;Set of light dumbbells: https://goo.gl/sH2tRW &#10;&#10;&#10;What you will need: set of dumbbells. Preferably 3-5 lbs. May go heavier or lighter depending on fitness level. No weights? No problem! Grab a set of water bottles, soup cans, or something similar you have lying around the house.&#10;&#10;This video targets your glutes, hamstrings, quads, transverse abdominals, obliques, shoulders, biceps, and back. &#10;&#10;If you have time, hit replay and do TWO rounds!!!&#10;&#10;The option for the single leg deadlift is to leave the back foot onto the ground, but still keep the majority of weight in the front heel.&#10;&#10;Music licensed through Spundstripe&#10;&#10;Follow me on IG: @lariemidkiff"
