  node [
    id 2461
    label "mWV8-rnxNfI"
    step 1
    date "2021-02-25T19:33:38Z"
    title "15 Minute Cardio Workout | HIIT | No Equipment | Add-On Cardio | Month 4 Day 2 At-Home Program"
    description "All you need is yourself for this quick 15-minute non-stop cardio workout. You may want to grab some hydration and a mat. This workout is an 'add-on cardio workout&#34; It is meant to be done after your strength training. If you are doing this workout first or by itself, you may want to perform an additional warm-up.&#10;&#10;We have 10 exercises today. Every exercise is performed for 60 seconds. After 60 seconds, we will have a 30 second recovery exercise. The recovery exercise is the previous exercise taken down a notch. During the 60 seconds of work, make sure you are going at a level that feels challenging and uncomfortable to you. We do not have to go at the same speed. We should need that recovery before moving onto the next exercise.&#10;&#10;Look in the upper-left hand corner for the upcoming exercise. This one is short and sweet.&#10;&#10; Skip to 2:00 to bypass intro and begin workout. Let me know how it goes in the comments below : ) &#10;&#10;Skip to 2:00 to bypass intro&#10;Total Workout time: Approx 15 Minutes&#10;&#10;Month 4 Strength Program: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aVuFlA5YLKfR-WWoigIfutE&#10;&#10;More advanced/Bootcamp workouts: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aUokOX1_8lO_9HI8ZXfPEi4&#10;&#10;&#10;Dumbbell set: https://amzn.to/36ByjYu&#10;Dumbbell set lighter: https://amzn.to/3jtVSWB&#10;Adjustable DB: https://amzn.to/30DUv0e&#10;&#10;Adjustable bench: https://amzn.to/3laSQXy&#10;&#10;Fabric Band: https://amzn.to/3qmfAHa&#10;&#10;HydroJug: Use Code LARIE10 for discount&#10;https://www.thehydrojug.com/&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon tank:&#10;https://amzn.to/3a2A4Ou&#10;https://amzn.to/3petgU7&#10;&#10;Replica High Rise Lululemon Align Pants CHEAP:&#10;https://amzn.to/395JSrA&#10;https://amzn.to/3o5Kh1z&#10;&#10;Shoes: Nike Metcon 3s&#10;&#10;Yoga Mat (similar): https://amzn.to/39EvlS1&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;&#127925; NEFFEX - Watch Me, Soldier, Grateful, Failure, Crown  [Copyright Free]&#10;https://youtu.be/ib9HZzZhG7I&#10;https://youtu.be/Ccsh_-Cucl4&#10;https://youtu.be/83RUhxsfLWs&#10;https://youtu.be/_MTbjHKtobY&#10;https://youtu.be/YKqDiNJJPXk"
