  node [
    id 2463
    label "k9pwZxitbpg"
    step 1
    date "2021-06-19T11:08:02Z"
    title "15 Minute Bodyweight Only Ab Workout | Giant Sets | Add On Abs"
    description "Grab a mat for this bodyweight only 15 minute ab workout. We will perform four exercises at a time for 45 seconds each before taking a break (3 minutes of total work, minus the last set). Be sure to listen for the ding and watch the upper left hand corner for the upcoming exercise since there is no transition time between some of the exercises. After each giant set (or ever fourth exercise) we will take a 30 second break that we should need. The last block will be a giant giant set of six total exercises. Every block will progress in difficulty, starting with a short lever activation exercise. The set will become progressively more challenging as we go. Do not rush these moves! Quality over quantity. Don't just move, move with purpose, get your core to do most of the work! This workout could be done alone, or after your strength training workout. Minimal cues today. Let me know how it goes in the comments below : )&#10;&#10;Skip to 2:00 to begin workout&#10;Total Workout time: Approx 15 minutes&#10;Total Time with Stretching: Approx 17 Minutes &#10;&#10;The Workout&#10;45 seconds each&#10;Lower Abs&#10;1. Alternating reverse crunches short lever (warm-up, activation)&#10;2. Bilateral reverse crunches short lever&#10;3. Hip Lifts Long to short lever&#10;4. Hip Lifts Long lever&#10;30 second break &#10;Upper Abs&#10;1. Crunches &#10;2. Crunch with twist, right&#10;3. Crunch with twist, left&#10;4. Sit-Ups&#10;30 second break&#10;Abs, Obliques &#10;1. Deadbugs&#10;2.Bicycles, short lever&#10;3. Bicycles, long lever&#10;4. Sprinter Sit-Ups&#10;30 second break&#10;Core&#10;1.Plank reach unders, left&#10;2. Mountain climbers&#10;3. Plank Reach unders, right&#10;4. Forearm Plank Spidermans&#10;5. Rolling Plank&#10;6. Plank hold&#10;&#10;30 Minute Lower Body Giant Set Workout: https://youtu.be/4AVNUTlj6Ac&#10;30 Minute Upper Body Giant Set Workout: https://youtu.be/8wZw6VWLSTk&#10;20 Minute Cardio Workout: https://youtu.be/VI78DN4ukqM&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Tank: Free people&#10;Leggings: https://amzn.to/2SazZDg&#10;Shoes: Nike&#10;&#10;Dumbbell Set&#10;https://amzn.to/3brHMTv&#10;Adjustable DBs (Bowflex)&#10;https://amzn.to/3hsB3MT&#10;&#10;Body-Solid Adjustable Workout bench&#10;https://amzn.to/3oivphT&#10;Yoga Mat (similar): https://amzn.to/39EvlS1&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;MUSIC:&#10;&#10;&#127925; All songs are licensed from epidemic sounds and soundstripe"
