  node [
    id 2464
    label "8bGfJKhmeGE"
    step 1
    date "2022-07-01T23:10:40Z"
    title "25 Minute Upper Body Tri Set Workout | Dumbbells Only | At Home"
    description "Grab dumbbells and an optional mat for this 30 minute upper body at-home tri-set strength workout. This high rep, non-repeat workout will leave your upper body feeling strong! Exercises are grouped together in a tri-set during today's workout. We will perform each exercise for 60 seconds (3 minutes of total work time) before taking a 15 second break. This is non-repeat today, so after the 15 second break we will move into a new tri-set. This is a very very high volume metabolic workout, it should feel quite challenging by the end : ) &#10;&#10;Let me know how this workout goes in the comments below : )&#10;&#10;Skip to 1:05 to begin workout&#10;Total Workout time: Approx 23:00 minutes&#10;Total Time with Stretching: Approx 26 minutes&#10;&#10;&#10;The Workout&#10;DB Lu Raises&#10;DB Poliquin Lateral Raise&#10;DB Front Raise To Lateral Lower&#10;Rest&#10;DB Neutral Shoulder Press&#10;DB Neutral Row&#10;DB Hammer Curl To Neutral Press&#10;Rest&#10;DB Pronated Row&#10;BW Bushup&#10;DB Curl to Step back Plank&#10;Rest&#10;DB Tricep Extension&#10;BW Pike Pushup&#10;DB Plank Pull Through&#10;Rest&#10;DB Pronated Shoulder Press&#10;DB Supinated to Pronated Curl&#10;DB Curl To Arnold Press&#10;Rest&#10;DB Front Raise&#10;DB Y Raise&#10;DB Rear Delt Fly&#10;Rest&#10;DB 6 way raise&#10;DB 4 way raise&#10;DB lateral raise&#10;&#10;My Favorite Amazon Purchases: https://www.amazon.com/shop/fitbylarie?ref=cm_sw_em_r_inf_own_fitbylarie_dp_h66svXl4kkXOM&#10;&#10;30 Minute Lower Body Tri Set Workout: https://youtu.be/Jl85h1l4-0I&#10;30 Minute BW Only Cardio: https://youtu.be/LszeZPDKG98&#10;30 Minute Giant Set Total Body Strength and Cardio: https://youtu.be/yihr_JPlR0Q&#10;&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;Follow &#34;Fit By Larie&#34; on Facebook!&#10;Join the private FB group Fit by Larie (this is a great way to ask your questions when more context is needed!)&#10;&#10;&#10;&#127925; All songs are licensed from epidemic sounds and soundstripe"
