    step 1
    date "2022-03-19T11:52:47Z"
    title "30 Minute Full Upper Body Giant-Set Workout | Dumbbells Only"
    description "Grab dumbbells and a mat for this 30 minute upper body at-home giant-set workout. For resistance reference, I have a pair of 5,10,15 and 20lb DBs. Exercises are grouped together in a giant-set during today's workout. We will perform each exercise for 60 seconds (4 minutes of total work time) before taking a 30 second break. This is non-repeat today, so after the 30 second break we will move into a new giant-set. We have seven giant-sets today. This is a very very high volume metabolic workout, it should feel quite challenging by the end : )  Take additional rest time and/or drop the weight as needed!&#10;&#10;Let me know how this workout goes in the comments below : )&#10;&#10;Skip to 2:15 to begin workout&#10;Total Workout time: Approx 31:30 minutes&#10;Total Time with Stretching: Approx 35 minutes&#10;&#10;30 Minute Lower Body Giant Set Workout: https://youtu.be/yihr_JPlR0Q&#10;Add-on Cardio 20 minutes: https://youtu.be/bXwX2J3gjj8&#10;Add-on Abs 15 minutes: https://youtu.be/k9pwZxitbpg&#10;&#10;&#10;The Workout&#10;DB 6 way raise&#10;DB 4 way raise&#10;DB laterals&#10;DB lateral partials&#10;rest&#10;DB neutral grip row R&#10;DB neutral grip row L&#10;DB straight arm row&#10;DB plank pull through&#10;rest&#10;DB upright row to press L&#10;DB upright row to press R&#10;DB half neutral thrusters&#10;BW commandos&#10;rest&#10;DB tricep ext L&#10;DB tricep ext R&#10;BW tricep pushups&#10;DB supine tricep extensions&#10;rest&#10;DB bicep curls&#10;DB pronated row&#10;DB jump back plank to row/curl&#10;DB lat pullover&#10;rest&#10;DB Lu Raise&#10;DB front raise&#10;DB lateral raise 1 to 1/4 rep&#10;DB reverse fly&#10;Rest&#10;DB chest press&#10;DB chest fly&#10;BW slow pushups&#10;BW plank shoulder taps&#10;&#10;&#10;My Favorite Amazon Purchases: https://www.amazon.com/shop/fitbylarie?ref=cm_sw_em_r_inf_own_fitbylarie_dp_h66svXl4kkXOM&#10;&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;Follow &#34;Fit By Larie&#34; on Facebook!&#10;Join the private FB group Fit by Larie (this is a great way to ask your questions when more context is needed!)&#10;&#10;MUSIC:&#10;&#10;&#127925; All songs are licensed from epidemic sounds and soundstripe"
