  node [
    id 2472
    label "D9vG7lrEqfM"
    step 1
    date "2020-04-13T01:13:50Z"
    title "Dumbbell Only Arm Workout | PUSH | Shoulders, Triceps &#38; Chest | 35 Minutes | Month 2 Day 6 Program"
    description "Lets PUSH! Today's Upper Body workout will focus on the shoulders, triceps, and chest as we perform push exercises. Grab a light set of DB's (5-10 lbs) and a heavier set (15lbs and up). Everyone is different with their strength levels, so adjust your weights accordingly : ) Now, lets push!&#10;&#10;Month 2 Strength and Conditioning Program: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aUd7OnGD9n5w6KjcmELoW7w&#10;&#10;Dumbbell set (light weights): https://amzn.to/2QKi3vX&#10;&#10;Dumbbell set (heavier weights): https://amzn.to/37VEc00&#10;&#10;3lb only dumbbells: https://amzn.to/39ZJd9q&#10;&#10;5lb only weights: https://amzn.to/2s95DnA&#10;&#10;8lb only dumbbell: https://amzn.to/36TCAU4&#10;&#10;10lb only dumbbell: https://amzn.to/35GwdSL&#10;&#10;Resistance Bands Set: https://amzn.to/3alN14S&#10;&#10;Replica Align Leggings: https://amzn.to/2Ut3Ow1&#10;&#10;Strappy Tank (similar): https://amzn.to/3bhAPC6&#10;&#10;Yoga Mat (similar): https://amzn.to/39EvlS1&#10;&#10;Adjustable Bench: https://amzn.to/2WEowvD&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;Music licensed through Soundstripe&#10;&#10;Support me &#38; give back:&#10;https://www.patreon.com/fitbylarie"
