    label "LszeZPDKG98"
    step 1
    date "2022-03-27T22:36:28Z"
    title "30 Minute Giant Set Cardio Workout | No Equipment | Kickboxing Inspired | Low Impact Mods"
    description "Grab some hydration and an optional mat for this 30 minute cardio at-home giant-set workout.  Exercises are grouped together in a giant-set during today's workout. We will perform each exercise for 60 seconds (4 minutes of total work time) before taking a 30 second break. This is non-repeat today, so after the 30 second break we will move into a new giant-set. We have seven giant-sets today. This is a very very high volume, endurance-focused workout; it should feel quite challenging by the end : )  Everything is timed today so we do not have to go at the same speed! Take additional rest time and/or drop the weight as needed! There is some jumping during today's workout. I provide a verbal non-jumping modifications with those exercises, so just be sure to listen towards the beginning of the switch!&#10;&#10;Let me know how this cardio workout goes in the comments below : )&#10;&#10;Skip to 2:25 to begin workout&#10;Total Workout time: Approx 31:30 minutes&#10;Total Time with Stretching: Approx 35 minutes&#10;&#10;30 Minute Upper Body Workout: https://youtu.be/BS2aVV4BwQc&#10;30 Minute Lower Body Giant Set Workout: https://youtu.be/yihr_JPlR0Q&#10;Add-on Abs 15 minutes: https://youtu.be/k9pwZxitbpg&#10;&#10;&#10;The Workout&#10;2 count punches&#10;2 count punches (southpaw)&#10;Punch/hook combo&#10;Punch/hook combo (southpaw&#10;rest&#10;Tap jack to punch L&#10;Tap Jack to punch R&#10;Jumping Jack (slow/quick)&#10;Narrow squat pulse to jumping jack&#10;rest&#10;Tap to side kick L&#10;Tap to side kick R&#10;Sumo Squat pulse to alt side kick&#10;Squat to Ab Twist&#10;rest&#10;High Knees (Slow/Quick)&#10;2 front kicks/4 high knees&#10;2 back kicks/4 butt kicks&#10;2 front kicks/2 back kicks&#10;rest&#10;lunge/squat combo L&#10;lunge/squat combo R&#10;Heismans&#10;Lateral Shuffle with punch&#10;rest&#10;Punch with internal hip rotations&#10;Ab Twists&#10;Lateral lunge knee-in L&#10;Lateral lunge knee-in R&#10;Rest&#10;Inchworm/Commando&#10;4 Mt Climbers/4 Atomic Mt Climbers&#10;Iso Squat Jump Back Plank Pushup&#10;Squat Reach/ Squat Jump&#10;&#10;My Favorite Amazon Purchases: https://www.amazon.com/shop/fitbylarie?ref=cm_sw_em_r_inf_own_fitbylarie_dp_h66svXl4kkXOM&#10;&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;Follow &#34;Fit By Larie&#34; on Facebook!&#10;Join the private FB group Fit by Larie (this is a great way to ask your questions when more context is needed!)&#10;&#10;MUSIC:&#10;&#10;&#127925; All songs are licensed from epidemic sounds and soundstripe"
