    description "Support me &#38; give back:&#10;https://www.patreon.com/fitbylarie&#10;&#10;3lb pink dumbbells: https://amzn.to/2LrbgXl&#10;&#10;5lb pink dumbbells: https://amzn.to/2VgSNBk&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Converse shoes (FAVORITE lifting shoes): https://amzn.to/2JkU5nl&#10;&#10;Lululemon green yoga pants: https://amzn.to/2Vfz4lj&#10;&#10;Lululemon Black Tank: https://amzn.to/2VmyeU9&#10;&#10;Similar yoga mat: https://amzn.to/2JfGpdq&#10;&#10;&#8220;Want a hot body?! You better work!&#8221; - Britney Spears lol - this is an abdominal workout that is meant to provide a challenge and intense burn for everyone. Intended for intermediate and up! Options and modifications are provided throughout for beginners. Also beginners- take breaks and rest as needed!!! Grab a mat and 3-5lb dumbbell and let&#8217;s do the damn thang!&#10;&#10;Follow me on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;Music licensed through Soundstripe"
