  node [
    id 2477
    label "YBKTP6RaqWo"
    step 1
    date "2020-08-13T22:39:47Z"
    title "45 Minute Kettlebell Workout | Total Body Strength"
    description "You will need a kettlebell, a mat, and something for hydration for this total body workout. I am using a 20lb KB during this workout, but I encourage you to find a weight selection challenging for *you* during each exercise, it may be lighter, or it may be heavier.. everyone is different : ) If you have any wrist issues or discomfort, I suggest lightening the weight selection and/or replace the kettlebell with a dumbbell. The kettlebell lengthens your lever so a lot of these exercises will feel more challenging with a KB than a DB (if you were to use the same weight) After a quick bodyweight warm-up, we will complete five blocks at two rounds each. Each block will contain a unilateral exercise at a specified rep count followed by a bilateral exercise at a timed amount. Breaks are built-in after every timed exercise. Let me know how it goes in the comments below!&#10;&#10;30 Minute KB Total Body Workout: https://youtu.be/tb5JmymAkrw&#10;&#10;Kettlebell: https://amzn.to/2FdR20j&#10;Kettlebell Handle for DB's: https://amzn.to/3izmapm&#10;Kettlebell Set (light): https://amzn.to/2XYvcoa&#10;&#10;HydroJug: Use Code LARIE10 for discount&#10;https://www.thehydrojug.com/&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Adjustable Workout Bench: https://amzn.to/3cYdLtq&#10;&#10;Cute CHEAP sports bra: https://amzn.to/37M7uh4&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon Align Pants CHEAP: https://amzn.to/2PaCRLK&#10;&#10;Lululemon Align Replica Grey: https://amzn.to/2Tfqhfh&#10;&#10;Yoga Mat (similar): https://amzn.to/39EvlS1&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;&#10;MUSIC:&#10;&#10;&#127925; Post Malone - Hollywood's Bleeding (BLKCUBE Remix) [No Copyright Music]&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JCwM7CcFik4&#10;&#10;&#127925; Travis Scott - Highest in the Room Remix &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jyeqSDlB95k&#10;&#10;&#127925; Childish Gambino - 3005 (Felix Palmqvist Remix)&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xEe0Z...&#10;&#10;&#127925; Khalid - Talk (Olmos Remix) [No Copyright Music]&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LmAi9...&#10;&#10;&#127925; Post Malone - Psycho (ZiiPPCODE Remix) [No Copyright Music&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S9dwd...&#10;&#10;&#127925;Ozzie x Post Malone- White Iverson (Airia Chill Trap Remix) [No Copyright Music]&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yqOf2...&#10;&#10;&#127925; All others songs are licensed from epidemic sounds and soundstripe"
