  node [
    id 2478
    label "uJ2MdHCHcIw"
    step 1
    date "2022-02-26T13:10:42Z"
    title "20 Minute TRX Drop-set Lower Body Workout | Strength and Cardio Suspension Training"
    description "Grab your suspension trainer for this quick 20 minute lower body strength and cardio dropset suspension workout.This high rep workout will combine strength and a few cardio exercises targeting the lower body! Set your suspension trainer to mid-length. Exercises are grouped together in a superset during today's workout. We will perform one exercise for 60 seconds. After that exercise, we will immediately &#34;drop&#34; and continue with an exercise that targets the same or similar muscle group that should feel like a more do-able version of the first exercise. The second exercise will also be performed for 60 seconds. Once we make the drop into the second exercise our muscles will be pretty fatigued. When needed, rest, take a few deep breaths, and then continue the exercise. Repeat that method until time or walk further away from the anchor point. We have five supersets today. We will repeat each superset once to really fatigue the targeted muscle group. The recovery and transition time after each superset is only 15 seconds long, so if needed, take a longer break. This is a very very high volume metabolic workout, it should feel quite challenging by the end : ) &#10;&#10;Let me know how this leg workout goes in the comments below : )&#10;&#10;Skip to 2:40 to begin workout&#10;Total Workout time: Approx 23 minutes&#10;Total Time with Stretching: Approx 27 minutes&#10;&#10;The Workout&#10;Squat to calf raise&#10;Slow squat&#10;(repeat)&#10;Lunge shuffle, right&#10;Reverse lunge to knee-in, right&#10;(repeat)&#10;Lunge shuffle, left&#10;Reverse lunge to knee in, left&#10;(repeat)&#10;Speed Skaters&#10;Crossack Squat&#10;(repeat)&#10;Power Sumo Squats&#10;Iso Sumo squat calf raise&#10;(repeat and then finished)&#10;&#10;Add-ons to compliment this workout : )&#10;20 Minute TRX Upper Body and Core: https://youtu.be/dnnXqF3A1XE&#10;All TRX workouts: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aVAP1Pw6aidOsCKW2GAWBN1&#10;&#10;My Favorite Amazon Purchases: https://www.amazon.com/shop/fitbylarie?ref=cm_sw_em_r_inf_own_fitbylarie_dp_h66svXl4kkXOM&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;Follow &#34;Fit By Larie&#34; on Facebook!&#10;Join the private FB group Fit by Larie (this is a great way to ask your questions when more context is needed!)&#10;&#10;MUSIC:&#10;&#10;&#127925; All songs are licensed from epidemic sounds and soundstripe"
