  node [
    id 2479
    label "_bZK8aDMq00"
    step 1
    date "2020-04-24T19:11:37Z"
    title "One Hour Total Body Bootcamp | Dumbbells Only | Conditioning + Strength | Month 2 Day 3 S&#38;C Program"
    description "You will need a set of dumbbells and an optional mat. We will be switching from dumbbell strength exercises at a rep count from 10-15 to 3 minutes of body weight cardio that will progressively get more challenging for ONE HOUR! Low-impact options are visually provided throughout the cardio portions. Grab something to hydrate with - this one is challenging!  Let&#8217;s get moving &#128293;&#128512;&#10;&#10;Month 2 Strength and Conditioning Program: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aUd7OnGD9n5w6KjcmELoW7w&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Cute CHEAP sports bra: https://amzn.to/37M7uh4&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon Align Pants CHEAP: https://amzn.to/2PaCRLK&#10;&#10;Lululemon Align Replica Grey: https://amzn.to/2Tfqhfh&#10;&#10;Yoga Mat (similar): https://amzn.to/39EvlS1&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;Music licensed through Soundstripe"
