  node [
    id 2481
    label "CixwZmxkvD0"
    step 1
    date "2020-05-25T02:53:17Z"
    title "Shoulders Biceps + Triceps Strength Workout | 30 Minutes"
    description "Grab a bench, mat, mini band and dumbbells (preferably light, medium, and heavy, but use what you have!).  We start with a quick shoulder warm-up with the mini-band, so if you don't have one, use your light weights or body weight. Once we get into the first block, every exercise is timed. There is a demo and explanation before each block. During the actual exercises enjoy the music.  Try to get as many quality reps as you can in the time allotted. If your form or mind-muscle connection slip, lighten the weight an/or stop, take a few deep breaths, and then continue. This workout hits the entire head of the delt, and we also focus on the triceps and biceps with block one and two. Let me know how it goes in the comments below.&#10;&#10;Upper Body Stretch: https://youtu.be/oojhX6mpvEE&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Adjustable Workout Bench: https://amzn.to/3cYdLtq&#10;&#10;Cute CHEAP sports bra: https://amzn.to/37M7uh4&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon Align Pants CHEAP: https://amzn.to/2PaCRLK&#10;&#10;Lululemon Align Replica Grey: https://amzn.to/2Tfqhfh&#10;&#10;Yoga Mat (similar): https://amzn.to/39EvlS1&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;&#10;MUSIC:&#10;&#10;&#127925; Post Malone - Hollywood's Bleeding (BLKCUBE Remix) [No Copyright Music]&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JCwM7CcFik4&#10;&#10;&#127925; Travis Scott - Highest in the Room Remix &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jyeqSDlB95k&#10;&#10;&#127925; All others songs are licensed from epidemic sounds and soundstripe"
