  node [
    id 2482
    label "EAM7PGMIUMs"
    step 1
    date "2020-09-06T23:19:14Z"
    title "45 Minute Dumbbell Only Total Body Strength + Cardio Bootcamp Workout | Minimal Cues"
    description "Grab a mat, hydration, and a set of dumbbells for this 45 minute workout (exact workout time is 43:39 including warm-up, 47 minutes if you include warm-up and cooldown/stretching). Try to find a weight selection that challenges you by the end of each exercise while maintaining excellent form. We have 4 blocks during today's workout; 2 strength blocks and 2 cardio blocks. We will perform each block twice before moving onto a new set of exercises. Besides the warm-up, every exercise will be performed for 60 seconds, and we will have 15 seconds to recover. While you recover, I will demo the upcoming exercise. Since the exercises are timed, find a pace and tempo that works for you! We do not have to go at the same speed or hit the same amount of reps (we may be using different weight selections). Minimal cues are given so we can bump the music (and my mic is on the fritz). Let me know how it goes in the comments below : )&#10;&#10;SKIP TO 1:48 to begin warmup&#10;SKIP TO 3:45 to begin workout&#10;&#10;More advanced/Bootcamp workouts: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aUokOX1_8lO_9HI8ZXfPEi4&#10;&#10;Dumbbell set: https://amzn.to/36ByjYu&#10;Dumbbell set lighter: https://amzn.to/3jtVSWB&#10;Adjustable DB: https://amzn.to/30DUv0e&#10;&#10;HydroJug: Use Code LARIE10 for discount&#10;https://www.thehydrojug.com/&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon tank: https://amzn.to/3g95fbP&#10;&#10;Cute CHEAP sports bra: https://amzn.to/37M7uh4&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon Align Pants CHEAP: https://amzn.to/2PaCRLK&#10;&#10;Lululemon Align Replica Grey: https://amzn.to/2Tfqhfh&#10;&#10;Yoga Mat (similar): https://amzn.to/39EvlS1&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;&#10;MUSIC:&#10;&#10;&#127925; Post Malone - Hollywood's Bleeding (BLKCUBE Remix) [No Copyright Music]&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JCwM7CcFik4&#10;&#10;&#127925;Childish Gambino 3005 (Felix Palmqvist Remix) https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xEe0ZO4rkqs&#10;&#10;&#127925; Post Malone - Psycho (ZiiPPCODE Remix) https://youtu.be/S9dwdSFrCS8&#10;&#10;&#127925;Ozzie x Post Malone- White Iverson (Airia Chill Trap Remix) https://youtu.be/yqOf2fVkdK4&#10;&#10;&#127925; Travis Scott - Highest in the Room Remix &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jyeqSDlB95k&#10;&#10;&#127925; All others songs are licensed from epidemic sounds and soundstripe"
