  node [
    id 2483
    label "Vb3IieU2wZY"
    step 1
    date "2020-12-22T14:29:03Z"
    title "50 Minute Barre Inspired Upper Body + Core Bootcamp Workout | Barreless Arms + Abs"
    description "Month 2 Day 1 Tone&#38; Sculpt Program: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aXLkFcvnBq93hTjI__CPAsW&#10;&#10;ABOUT THE WORKOUT: dumbbells (light), a mat, and something for hydration for this upper body and core barre-inspired workout. This one is tough hence the name &#34;bootcamp&#34; with it. This 50 minute workout is all about strength and muscle endurance in the upper body. We begin with a quick bodyweight warm-up before moving on to our strength sections. Most of the exercises are timed, so look to the right hand corner for the countdown clock. When you hear the beep, we are done with that exercise and will transition to the next. There are minimal breaks today (the only real break is after the warm-up, then it's non-stop) so if needed, hit pause and take a break. Be sure to keep the core tight (to help stabilize the hips) on the unilateral exercises i.e. don't let the hip on the standing leg sway! &#10;&#10;SKIP to 1:45 to bypass intro.&#10;Total workout time is approx 50 minutes&#10;Total workout time including stretching at the end is approx 53 minutes&#10;&#10;Working out to: 130BPM (I dub music over top of what I am listening to, so it doesn't always match up perfectly... I try!!!)&#10;&#10;More Barre Workouts: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aVW3YZ2sgWo3cj2tqQeN3AD&#10;&#10;Barre Inspired Leg Day Bootcamp: https://youtu.be/Nk6wvhEYcPw&#10;&#10;Ab Add-On 10 Minutes: https://youtu.be/8_hZ5ywq7Nw&#10;Add-On 10 Minute Abs: https://youtu.be/RsTD-SSNLI4&#10;25 Minute Pilates Inspired Abs: https://youtu.be/Bb_WWHA5oLQ&#10;Cardio + Core Blast 20 Minutes: https://youtu.be/fseCPPrO3rA&#10;20 Minute Abs Non-Stop: https://youtu.be/7D5T9hgenT4&#10;Cardio Add-on: https://youtu.be/VI78DN4ukqM&#10;&#10;Bootcamp/Advanced Workouts: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aUokOX1_8lO_9HI8ZXfPEi4&#10;&#10;MiniBand Set: https://amzn.to/2Uy54yc&#10;&#10;Light Dumbbell Set: https://amzn.to/2UytrvH&#10;&#10;HydroJug: Use Code LARIE10 for discount&#10;https://www.thehydrojug.com/&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon Align Pants in Teal: https://amzn.to/3jR8iHA&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon tank: https://amzn.to/3g95fbP&#10;&#10;Cute CHEAP sports bra: https://amzn.to/37M7uh4&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon Align Pants CHEAP: https://amzn.to/2PaCRLK&#10;&#10;Yoga Mat (similar): https://amzn.to/39EvlS1&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;All music licensed through epidemic sound and sounstripe"
