  node [
    id 2484
    label "vgbEk2MzXCY"
    step 1
    date "2021-02-05T17:18:22Z"
    title "45 Minute Full Body At-Home Workout | Dumbbells + Band"
    description "Grab dumbbells, a long resistance band (the more the merrier), the door attachment handle (or something sturdy to wrap your band around like I do in the video with the workout bench) a book (something 1-2 inches to elevate your heels), and a mat.  This full body workout will challenge all of your muscles today : )&#10;&#10;Every exercise is performed for 60 seconds. After 60 seconds, we will have 15 seconds to recover and transition into the next exercise. Watch me during the recovery.&#10;&#10;After the warm-up, most exercises will go dumbbell exercise, banded exercise, bodyweight exercise (repeat)&#10;&#10;Since every exercise is timed, find a tempo that you can maintain while maintaining great form. You do not have to go at my speed, everyone is unique! There is one longer built-in recovery after our lower body tri-set, but if you need more break take it! Skip to 2:15 to bypass intro and begin workout. Let me know how it goes in the comments below : ) Minimial cues/minimal talking from me on this one (this is subjective lol) &#10;&#10;Skip to 2:15 to bypass intro&#10;Total Workout time: Approx 43 Minutes&#10;Total Workout time with stretching: Approx 45 Minutes&#10;&#10;More Resistance  Band Workouts: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aXVif5f3VY063SEzLdnfWLQ&#10;&#10;Month 3 Strength + Conditioning Workout Program: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aXvP7m0yYNR7f6NzJ6IKpyc *How to follow is in the description of the playlist*&#10;&#10;More advanced/Bootcamp workouts: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aUokOX1_8lO_9HI8ZXfPEi4&#10;&#10;Resistance Band Set (exact one I'm using): https://amzn.to/2LrnTC8&#10;&#10;Replica Align Leggings: https://amzn.to/3oStQGi&#10;Cropped Tank: https://amzn.to/36O68of&#10;Nike Metcon Shoes: https://amzn.to/39voAE7&#10;&#10;Dumbbell set: https://amzn.to/36ByjYu&#10;Dumbbell set lighter: https://amzn.to/3jtVSWB&#10;Adjustable DB: https://amzn.to/30DUv0e&#10;&#10;Adjustable bench: https://amzn.to/3laSQXy&#10;&#10;HydroJug: Use Code LARIE10 for discount&#10;https://www.thehydrojug.com/&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Yoga Mat (similar): https://amzn.to/39EvlS1&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;&#127925; NEFFEX - Watch Me, Soldier, Grateful, Failure, Crown  [Copyright Free]&#10;https://youtu.be/ib9HZzZhG7I&#10;https://youtu.be/Ccsh_-Cucl4&#10;https://youtu.be/83RUhxsfLWs&#10;https://youtu.be/_MTbjHKtobY&#10;https://youtu.be/YKqDiNJJPXk&#10;&#10;&#127925; All others songs are licensed from epidemic sounds and soundstripe"
