    step 1
    date "2020-10-09T15:49:46Z"
    title "45 Minute Chest, Triceps, and Quad Strength Workout | Month 3 Day 3 Strength At-Home Program"
    description "Grab a mat, bench or chair, something to elevate your heels 1-2 inches like a hardback book, and dumbbells for this 45 minute strength-focused chest, triceps, and quad workout. If you don't have a bench, use a sturdy chair instead, just be sure to place the back of the chair against a wall. You will always know what exercise is coming. Choose a challenging weight selection for *you* - Try to find a weight selection that challenges you by the end of each exercise while maintaining excellent form. We will be doing multiple sets, so if round one feels too light, go heavier during round 2 (and vice versa). Skip to 1:50 to bypass intro. Let me know how it goes in the comments below : )&#10;&#10;FOR ADDITIONAL WARM-UP, PERFORM&#10;jumping jacks x 60 sec&#10;bird/dogs x 60 sec&#10;seal jacks x 60 sec&#10;modified plank shoulder taps x 60sec&#10;&#10;Month 3 Strength + Conditioning Workout Program: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aXvP7m0yYNR7f6NzJ6IKpyc *How to follow is in the description of the playlist*&#10;&#10;Add on ab workout: https://youtu.be/8_hZ5ywq7Nw&#10;Add on cardio (low impact): https://youtu.be/7APgRMbzF2M&#10;Add on cardio (kickboxing style):&#10;https://youtu.be/ONe1DMjBaw8&#10;https://youtu.be/Dg1dzDof3XE&#10;&#10;SKIP TO 1:50 to begin workout&#10;&#10;More advanced/Bootcamp workouts: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLkdaCg6IG0aUokOX1_8lO_9HI8ZXfPEi4&#10;&#10;HydroJug: Use Code LARIE10 for discount&#10;https://www.thehydrojug.com/&#10;&#10;Dumbbell set: https://amzn.to/36ByjYu&#10;Dumbbell set lighter: https://amzn.to/3jtVSWB&#10;Adjustable DB: https://amzn.to/30DUv0e&#10;&#10;Adjustable bench: https://amzn.to/3laSQXy&#10;&#10;The GOAT of pre-workouts&#10;Amino Energy in Grape: https://amzn.to/2QVWtEg&#10;Amino Energy in Watermelon: https://amzn.to/2QTwFZy&#10;&#10;Post-Workout Protein Bars&#10;Fit Crunch Protein Bars LEGIT THE BEST TASTING PROTEIN BAR EVER: https://amzn.to/3byEMm7 (If you follow me on IG, you know I'm obsessed)&#10;&#10;Track your HR&#10;Apple Watch Series 3 White: https://amzn.to/2UujKiK&#10;Apple Watch Series 5 Rose Gold: https://amzn.to/3bAZe5H&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon tank: https://amzn.to/3g95fbP&#10;&#10;Cute CHEAP sports bra: https://amzn.to/37M7uh4&#10;&#10;Replica Lululemon Align Pants CHEAP: https://amzn.to/2PaCRLK&#10;&#10;Lululemon Align Replica Grey: https://amzn.to/2Tfqhfh&#10;&#10;Yoga Mat (similar): https://amzn.to/39EvlS1&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;&#10;&#10;&#127925; Post Malone - Hollywood's Bleeding (BLKCUBE Remix) [No Copyright Music]&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JCwM7CcFik4&#10;&#10;&#127925; Post Malone - Psycho (ZiiPPCODE Remix) https://youtu.be/S9dwdSFrCS8&#10;&#10;&#127925; All others songs are licensed from epidemic sounds and soundstripe"
