  node [
    id 2490
    label "QXxVUw9ccEg"
    step 1
    date "2022-04-01T19:37:47Z"
    title "30 Minute Glute Focused Giant Set At-Home Workout | Unilateral Training"
    description "Grab dumbbells, mini band (latex or fabric), a bench, and a mat for this 30 minute glute focused at-home giant-set strength workout.This high rep, non-repeat workout will leave that booty feeling strong! For resistance reference, 10lb DBs. Exercises are grouped together in a giant-set during today's workout. We will perform each exercise for 60 seconds (4 minutes of total work time) before taking a 30 second break. This is non-repeat today, so after the 30 second break we will move into a new giant-set. I'm keeping it conservatively light today with resistance because it is a very unilateral and demanding workout. Some blocks are solely on one side and then we repeat on the other side. If you feel your form start to slip, switch it to the other side and just mirror it on the next block!  We have seven giant-sets today. This is a very very high volume metabolic workout, it should feel quite challenging by the end : ) &#10;&#10;Let me know how this workout goes in the comments below : )&#10;&#10;Skip to 2:35 to begin workout&#10;Total Workout time: Approx 32:00 minutes&#10;Total Time with Stretching: Approx 36 minutes&#10;&#10;&#10;The Workout&#10;DB step ups L&#10;BW Toe Taps L&#10;DB Step Ups R&#10;BW Toe Taps R&#10;rest&#10;DB Single Leg Thrust L&#10;DB Bilateral to Single Leg Thrust L&#10;DB Bstance Thrust L&#10;DB Bilateral Top ROM Thrust&#10;rest&#10;DB Single Leg Thrust R&#10;DB Bilateral to Single Leg Thrust R&#10;DB Bstance Thrust R&#10;DB 1 to 1/4 rep Thrust Bilateral&#10;rest&#10;DB Single Leg RDL L&#10;DB Reverse Lunge 1 to 1/4 rep L&#10;DB Bstance RDL L&#10;DB Curtsey Lunge L&#10;rest&#10;DB Single Leg RDL R&#10;DB Reverse Lunge 1 to 1/4 rep R&#10;DB Bstance RDL R&#10;DB Curtsey Lunge R&#10;rest&#10;DB Banded Squat (slow)&#10;Banded Monster Walks&#10;Iso Banded Squat Calf Raises&#10;Iso Banded Lateral Walks&#10;Rest&#10;Banded Quadrupped Kickbacks L&#10;Banded Up and Overs L&#10;Banded Quadrupped Kickbacks R&#10;Banded Up and Overs R&#10;Banded Reverse Hypers &#10;&#10;&#10;My Favorite Amazon Purchases: https://www.amazon.com/shop/fitbylarie?ref=cm_sw_em_r_inf_own_fitbylarie_dp_h66svXl4kkXOM&#10;&#10;30 Minute Giant Set Upper Body Workout: https://youtu.be/BS2aVV4BwQc&#10;30 Minute BW Only Cardio: https://youtu.be/LszeZPDKG98&#10;30 Minute Giant Set Lower Body Strength and Cardio: https://youtu.be/yihr_JPlR0Q&#10;30 Minute Giant Set Total Body Strength and Cardio: https://youtu.be/yihr_JPlR0Q&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Tag me in your posts &#38; stories on IG: @lariemidkiff&#10;Follow &#34;Fit By Larie&#34; on Facebook!&#10;Join the private FB group Fit by Larie (this is a great way to ask your questions when more context is needed!)&#10;&#10;MUSIC:&#10;&#10;&#127925; All songs are licensed from epidemic sounds and soundstripe"
