    title "15 MIN STANDING ABS WORKOUT TO GET RIPPED ABS | abs workout with dumbbells standing"
    description "Hey everyone, thanks for joining in today&#8217;s 15 MIN STANDING ABS WORKOUT TO GET RIPPED ABS! &#10084;&#10;&#10;This standing abs workout is a great way to get ripped and toned abs! In 15 mins we are going to burn your ab muscles! This workout uses a dumbbell but you are more than welcome to go without the dumbbell. Do this workout 3-4 times a week and you will see your abs getting stronger and more toned! Consistency is key and will get you the success!&#10;&#10;The structure for this workout:&#10;-11 exercises (30s ON, 10s OFF)&#10;-2 SETS&#10;-30 sec RESET&#10;&#10;Do you want to lose body fat all over your body? HITT &#38; Cardio is the answer! If you are able to do a dedicated HIIT Cardio workout 3-4 times a week then you will get serious results! HIIT is so awesome because it spikes your heart rate for small intervals which burns a lot of calories. Try it! Here is a link, I have a playlist dedicated just to FAT BURNING HIIT &#128513; &#10;&#10;&#128142;LINK to HIIT workouts:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL7OE2rakuCi-Y0Z5Jc8729ff4Li2iC-Jy&#10;For more ABS workouts:&#10;&#128142;LINK to ABS workouts: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL7OE2rakuCi_J6jFXeKtpoXV25-erxfbS&#10;&#10;Remember this is your workout, we are all different and it&#8217;s important for you to have fun while working out. We want to make this a lifestyle and the only way to succeed is to enjoy what you are doing. If you need to stop and take a longer break, just pause the video. This is a no judgement zone ok!&#10;&#10;This is a workout channel for women. For us to have fun and join together in our hunt for good health and fit bodies. If you enjoy this workout, I would love for you to join the family. Please subscribe to my channel to see all my new videos posted!&#10;&#10;Enjoy your workout! Till next time&#8230;see ya!&#10084;&#10;&#10;MY LINKS:&#10;&#128073;FREE WORKOUT PLANS: http://themodernfitgirl.com/&#10;&#128073; INSTAGRAM MFG: https://www.instagram.com/themodernfitgirl/?hl=en&#10;&#128073;INSTAGRAM PERSONAL: https://www.instagram.com/gee.gee_pilot/?hl=en&#10;&#128073; PINTEREST: https://za.pinterest.com/themodernfitgirl0089/"
