    label "5-tH4gdpKiU"
    step 1
    date "2020-07-09T21:19:15Z"
    title "10 MIN BOOTY WORKOUT - Medium Intensity / No Equipment I Pamela Reif"
    description "a leg workout with a focus on booooty - which will not kill you :D I made it a bit easier than usual, I promise &#9829;&#65038; / Werbung &#10;&#10;Are my Beginner workouts a little too easy &#38; the other ones a little too hard? I got you - this one is right in the middle! I also encourage all Beginners to give this a try &#9829;&#65038; you can take breaks if you need to. &#10;The hardest part is the first part, so if you survived this one: the rest will be easier! &#10;&#10;But even on an &#8222;advanced&#8220; level, I enjoy this a lot to get all warmed up for my leg &#38; booty day. Oooor as a finisher in the end! &#10;We have standing SQUAT exercises in different varieties as a brilliant basic, some KICKBACKS with the main focus on booty, same for GLUTE BRIDGES, and some exercises down on the floor. Those ones are rather &#8222;easy&#8220; but if you focus on the muscle you want to train (mostly booty in those situations) you can really feel the muscles burning! &#10; &#10;Let me know how you like it :) &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;If you need breaks - TAKE THEM! Don't worry too much about that. You will improve over time :) The video is in full length which means you can just follow whatever I&#8217;m doing 30s for each exercise. &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#9656; you can find FREE WORKOUT PLANS on my Instagram Channel. 30min, 45min and Beginner Friendly combinations. Check out the Highlight Bubble &#34;Workout Plans&#34; for that.  &#10;&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10;__&#10; &#10;You can always find all songs in my workout playlist. I update it weekly &#38; it's available on Spotify, Apple Music, etc. &#9829;&#65038;&#10;http://wmg.click/GetActive&#10;&#10;1. Ofenbach &#38; Quarterhead - Head Shoulders Knees &#38; Toes feat. Norma Jean Martine 0:00 - 2:34&#10;2. KLAN &#8211; Sch&#246;n 2:35 - 5:12&#10;3. Lucas &#38; Steve &#8211; Letters 5:13 - 8:20 &#10;4. Pink Sweat$ - Not Alright 8:21 - 10:28 &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10142; Food Account http://www.instagram.com/pamgoesnuts/&#10;__&#10;&#10;Business Contact:&#10;pamela_reif@icloud.com&#10;&#10;__&#10;unterst&#252;tzt durch Warner Music Germany&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;When joining me for this workout video, you need to take some precautions as your health and safety is the most important.&#160;To avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health with your doctor before exercising.&#160;By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. Pamela Reif will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video."
