    description "Follow along with us for a quick 10 minute lightweight dumbbell workout that will work the entire body &#128293; This workout is designed for low resistance so you'll want to use a pair of dumbbells that are light---for reference we used a pair of 5lb and 10lb dumbbells. This workout is made up of 10 different compound exercises with NO REST in between movements. Don't let the lightweight fool you---this workout will improve your strength, muscle mass and endurance. Give this flow a try and drop a comment to let us know how you did.&#10;&#10;Note: The actual workout is 10 minutes but we included a warm up and cool down for those that need it.&#10;&#10;Check Out Our Other Lightweight Workout:&#10;https://youtu.be/PFGeohvbNq8&#10;&#10;The Home Equipment We Use:&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/juicetoya...&#10;&#10;Follow Us On Instagram For More Fitness Related Content:&#10;&#10;Juice: @JuicetonTx&#10;&#10;Toya: @ToyaCherrelle&#10;&#10;Personal Training Business Page: @OneBodyLA&#10;&#10;&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:53 The Warm Up&#10;3:49 The Workout&#10;14:17 The Cool Down&#10;17:13 The Recap"
