    description "Tap in  to this 20 Minute strength workout that requires NO equipment. This full body flow is has a mixture of active movements and isometric holds to help you maximize strength and stability. This workout is great for advanced through beginners and there are modifications mixed in to help you manage through the workout . This workout is great for building strength, stability, muscle mass, and it can even be used as a recovery day workout for heavy lifters. customize this workout to your needs and be sure to comment  how your workout went!&#10;&#10;DOWNLOAD THE JUICE &#38; TOYA APP:&#10; https://juiceandtoya.app/&#10;&#10;The Products We Use:&#10;https://a.co/6XQwGFA&#10;&#10;Support Our Channel With Some J&#38;T Merch:&#10;https://www.onebodyla.com/shop&#10;&#10;Follow Us On Social Media For More Fitness Related Content:&#10;Toya: @ToyaCherrelle&#10;Juice: @JuicetonTx&#10;TikTok: @JuiceandToya&#10;Personal Training Business Page: @OneBodyLA&#10;&#10;#StrengthWorkout  #JuiceandToya"
