    title "20 Minute &#34;Core-dio&#34; Workout [High Intensity Abs]"
    description "Tap in with us for a 20 minute high intensity core workout or what we like to call CORE-DIO! This is an intense workout that targets your abs and elevates the heart rate in an interval style format. This is a great workout to do solo or pair with any hiit/cardio workout of your own. Give this workout a go and be sure to drop a comment to let us know how your workout was.&#10;&#10;The Home Equipment We Use:&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/juicetoya &#10;&#10;DOWNLOAD THE JUICE &#38; TOYA APP: &#10;https://juiceandtoya.app/&#10;&#10;Support Our Channel With Some J&#38;T Merch:&#10;https://www.onebodyla.com/shop&#10;&#10;Follow Us On Instagram For More Fitness Related Content:&#10;&#10;Juice: @JuicetonTx&#10;&#10;Toya: @ToyaCherrelle&#10;&#10;Personal Training Business Page: @OneBodyLA&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;#Juice&#38;Toya #JuiceandToya"
