    title "10 Minute Dumbbell Tempo HIIT Workout (Full Body/Light Weight)"
    description "Tap in with us for a quick 10 Minute Full Body Dumbbell HIIT Workout that WILL burn calories and work up a good sweat! This workout is all about mixing the tempo of each exercise----we split each 1 minute interval into three 20 second sections where we will cycle between a normal pace and fast pace. You can follow our lead for pace but be sure to go at a pace that works well for your fitness level. We recommend starting with light weight to trial the workout before moving up to heavier weights. We designed this as a no repeat so you can do it for multiple rounds if you like (Repeat here 4:16 )  Give this workout a try below and don't forget to drop a comment and let us know how you did! &#128293;&#10;&#10;DOWNLOAD THE JUICE &#38; TOYA APP: &#10;https://juiceandtoya.app/&#10;&#10;Support Our Channel With Some J&#38;T Merch:&#10;https://www.onebodyla.com/shop&#10;&#10;The Home Equipment We Use:&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/juicetoya...&#10;&#10;Follow Us On Instagram For More Fitness Related Content:&#10;&#10;Juice: @JuicetonTx&#10;&#10;Toya: @ToyaCherrelle&#10;&#10;Personal Training Business Page: @OneBodyLA&#10;&#10;&#10;#JuiceandToya&#10;&#10;0:00 Intro &#10;1:20 The Warm-Up&#10;4:13 The Workout&#10;15:05 The Cool Down&#10;18:00 The Recap"
