    label "8ZsFTayAYBk"
    step 1
    date "2020-07-07T22:08:56Z"
    title "8 MIN SIXPACK WORKOUT - with Christopher &#38; a very special twist / No Equipment I Pamela Reif"
    description "you are NOT ready for what's happening after 2/3 of this workout :D / Werbung &#10;&#10;as promised, our special Danish guest Christopher is back for a second workout video. ABS are his weakest spot.. so there was no arguing: he had to suffer through a Pam Sixpack Routine. He asked me to create an &#34;easy one&#34; .. pfff not for him haha. &#10;&#10;But that's all secondary - because the last 1/3 of this video makes it EXTRA SPECIAL. We planned it, but Christopher was clearly confused at 6:36 :D :D Dennis and me couldn't stop laughing when we edited the video. &#10;&#10;Were you able to stick to the entire routine? Or did you let Christopher down? Be honest!! &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#9656; You can find Christopher's Songs in my workout playlist. I update it weekly &#38; it's available on Spotify, Apple Music, etc. &#9829;&#65038;&#10;http://wmg.click/GetActive&#10;&#10;1. Christopher - Bad 0:30 - 3:30&#10;2. Christopher - Ghost 3:31 - 6:41 &#10;3. Christopher - Irony 7:00 - 9:20&#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#9656; you can find FREE WORKOUT PLANS on my Instagram Channel. 30min, 45min and Beginner Friendly combinations. Check out the Highlight Bubble &#34;Workout Plans&#34; for that.  &#10;&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;Christopher's Social Media:&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/christophermusiccom/&#10;&#10;My Social Media:&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10142; Food Account http://www.instagram.com/pamgoesnuts/&#10;__&#10;&#10;Business Contact:&#10;pamela_reif@icloud.com&#10;&#10;__&#10;unterst&#252;tzt durch Warner Music Germany&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;When joining me for this workout video, you need to take some precautions as your health and safety is the most important.&#160;To avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health with your doctor before exercising.&#160;By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. Pamela Reif will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video."
