    step 1
    date "2022-04-12T21:43:01Z"
    title "10 MIN BUBBLE TROUBLE with Michael Bubl&#233; - super funny Beginner Full Body Workout"
    description "I have no words for this - this might be the most entertaining workout EVER? :D / Werbung  &#10;&#10;Let&#8217;s welcome the one and only: Michael Bubl&#233;. I have to admit, I was a bit (or very) nervous beforehand. I mean&#8230; we danced SO many hours of Christmas Workouts on Michael&#8217;s wonderful songs - and suddenly he&#8217;s standing next to me. He visited me in Germany during his promo tour for his new album &#8222;Higher&#8220; - definitely a pinch me moment!   &#10;&#10;&#9656; Beginner Friendly &#10;&#9656; Full Body: we start with legs, continue with cardio &#38; end with abs &#10;&#9656; Giveaway: Win my brand new Naturally Pam Fitness Mats (the mats we trained on &#38; signed in the video!) and a record of Michael&#8217;s new album here: https://www.instagram.com/p/CcR3up5MZ_T/&#10;&#10;&#10;PS: Cannot even decide what&#8217;s my favorite moment in here. Him singing? Dancing? Jumping on the butterfly? Climbing out of the water? :D :D :D &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#9656; You can find all songs in my workout playlist. I update it weekly &#38; it's available on Spotify, Apple Music, etc. &#9829;&#65038; http://wmg.click/GetActive&#10;&#10;1. Michael Bubl&#233; - Sway&#10;2. Michael Bubl&#233; - Higher&#10;3. Michael Bubl&#233; - I&#8217;ll Never Not Love You&#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#10142; my Pam App &#9829;&#65038; Free workout plans (11 versions, different fitness levels), lot of recipes &#38; tips: &#10;https://www.pam-app.de/app&#10;&#10;&#9656; 2 of those FREE WORKOUT PLANS are on my Instagram Channel. &#10;Lose Weight &#38; Focus on a Bubble Butt. Check out the Highlight &#34;Workout Plans&#34; for that.  &#10;&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10142; Food Account http://www.instagram.com/pamgoesnuts/&#10;&#10;&#9656; Use the hashtag #PamelaReif if you want to share your transformation or training on Instagram :) I always check the posts! &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;Business Contact:&#10;pamela_reif@icloud.com&#10;&#10;unterst&#252;tzt durch Warner Music Germany&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;When joining me for this workout video, you need to take some precautions as your health and safety is the most important. To avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health with your doctor before exercising. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. Pamela Reif will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video."
