    title "Best quick ab workout! Tone your abs in 7 min with Pilates using no equipment! No gym needed"
    description "If you like this workout head over to my new channel T &#8212; F Studio www.tashafranken.tv and sign up for a 7 day free trial!&#10;I have over 100 on demand videos and regular live classes!!&#10;&#10;Follow me on IG:  @Tasha Franken  &#10;Subscribe: www.tashafranken.tv/subscribe&#10;&#10;For outfit and equipment links:&#10;www.tashafranken.com/theshop&#10;&#10;Happy Monday!&#10;&#10;Makes me so happy to see so many of you working out today, so here is a quick new video for you!&#10;Do it on its own or add onto my other videos depending on how you feel :)&#10;&#10;A 7 minute workout for you focusing on strengthening your core...&#10;By strengthening your core you're building a strong foundation with so many additional benefits. &#10;By learning how to correctly active &#38; strengthen your core you'll have a better posture, increased performance and functionality, better balance and reduced injury &#38; back pain.&#10;Your core is more than just your abdominal muscles... It also includes the muscles in your back and the ones supporting your hips/pelvis which is why it's so important! &#10;In Pilates we call it THE POWERHOUSE as its the centre if the body.&#10;Hope you all have a great week!&#10;&#10;Tasha xx&#10;&#10;#Movewithtash &#10;#Pilates&#10;#TF"
