  node [
    id 2663
    label "k7nV8Gyn56o"
    step 1
    date "2021-02-24T19:58:43Z"
    title "10 MIN BEST OF HIIT - a compilation of the best parts of my HIIT workouts - INTENSE I Pamela Reif"
    description "SUCH A KILLER ROUTINE - but you won't notice while you're training (because it's also kind of happy). I was dripping sweat after only 1 round! &#9829;&#65038; Cardio is fun today! / Werbung&#10;&#10;omg I am so exciteeeeeed! &#10;A combination of your (and my :D) favorite parts of the 15min Happy Dance, 12min Happy Sweat, 12min Happy Cardio &#38; 10min R&#38;B Dance. Basically, it's mostly about the last, super high energy songs! The parts that we put all our energy into, that we sweat it all out &#38; feel so happy afterwards. &#10;&#10;This is my favorite HIIT workout ever now. It's SUPER DUPER intense, will kick your ass, but it will also kick the 12min Happy Cardio from it's throne haha. At least for my personal taste. Let me know what you think!!! &#10;&#10;&#9656; burn lots of calories &#10;&#9656; improve your endurance &#10;&#9656; main muscles worked: thighs, butt, abs (from all the high knees)&#10;&#9656; boost your mood &#38; just be happyyyyy&#10;&#10;PS: thanks for helping me decide about the workout parts on Insta Stories! Always love to do whatever you like best :))&#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;Apart form the good mood &#38; I can also guarantee a serious number of burned calories here. &#10;&#10;&#9656; I burned 90kcal in those 10min (which is a loooooot). &#10;Depending on your height, weight and fitness level this might vary between 80-160kcal. &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#9656; you can find FREE WORKOUT PLANS on my Instagram Channel. 30min, 45min and Beginner Friendly combinations. Check out the Highlight Bubble &#34;Workout Plans&#34; for that.  &#10;&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;use #PamelaReif if you want me to see your workout pics and videos! &#10;&#10;&#10142; my Pam App &#9829;&#65038; Free workout plans, recipes &#38; tips: &#10;Apple: https://apps.apple.com/app/pam/id1540604002&#10;Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.openreply.pam&#10;&#10;__&#10; &#10;I update my workout playlist weekly &#38; it's available on Spotify, Apple Music, etc. &#9829;&#65038;&#10;http://wmg.click/GetActive&#10;&#10;1. David Guetta feat. Nicki Minaj, Bebe Rexha &#38; Afrojack - Hey Mama  &#10;2. Sam And The Womp - Bom Bom   &#10;3. Parx feat. Non&#244; - Feel Right Now&#10;4. Ciara - Level Up &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;Business Contact:&#10;pamela_reif@icloud.com&#10;&#10;__&#10;unterst&#252;tzt durch Warner Music Germany&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;When joining me for this workout video, you need to take some precautions as your health and safety is the most important. To avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health with your doctor before exercising. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. Pamela Reif will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video."
