    title "I tried a Daisy Keech workout program for a month, before and after"
    description "This is the programme I created and followed for the results I got (I was happy :))&#10;Week 1:&#10;Day 1 ABS - https://youtu.be/5cWxgnJgHHs&#10;Day 2 BOOTY - 1) https://youtu.be/IgMD6ejBCZw  2) https://youtu.be/c6HyhbCxDW8 3) https://youtu.be/r3UrgY65dy4&#10;Day 3 -  HIIT https://youtu.be/f-r4E0LF50I&#10;Day 4 - SHOULDERS https://youtu.be/u6bkOPIv0h8&#10;&#10;Week 2:&#10;Day 1 ABS - https://youtu.be/_oXVabWGzEg&#10;Day 2 HIIT - https://youtu.be/-YnHKhTz0gc&#10;Day 3 BOOTY with weight 1) https://youtu.be/IgMD6ejBCZw  2)X2 https://youtu.be/xYw6dH0WqpM 3) https://youtu.be/r3UrgY65dy4&#10;Day 4 - SHOULDERS https://youtu.be/u6bkOPIv0h8&#10;&#10;Week 3:&#10;DAY 1 ABS - https://youtu.be/5cWxgnJgHHs&#10;DAY 2 BOOTY with weight 1) https://youtu.be/IgMD6ejBCZw  2)X2 https://youtu.be/xYw6dH0WqpM 3) https://youtu.be/r3UrgY65dy4&#10;DAY 3 HIIT - https://youtu.be/-YnHKhTz0gc&#10;DAY 4 SHOULDERS https://youtu.be/u6bkOPIv0h8&#10;&#10;Week 4:&#10;DAY 1 HIIT https://youtu.be/f-r4E0LF50I&#10;DAY 2 BOOTY with weight 1) https://youtu.be/IgMD6ejBCZw  2)X1 https://youtu.be/xYw6dH0WqpM 3) https://youtu.be/ZiDgJEt3x1U 4) https://youtu.be/r3UrgY65dy4&#10;DAY 3 SHOULDERS https://youtu.be/u6bkOPIv0h8&#10;&#10;&#10;Resistance Bands: https://tinyurl.com/2p9f5mzf&#10;&#10;Daisy Keech workout programme. Booty Growth, slimmer waist. All the good things! I did not use any photos of my body in this in this video or tell you my actual measurements because 1 (trigger warning) and 2 (I dont feel comfortable showing this). I was taking photos to track my progress and I told you my number increase and decrease to let you know how my body was changing. Working out to be easier on my neck. I also have sciatica in my right leg and trying to workout with that. I also fell down the stairs and injured my back so you'll see how I amended all the workouts to fit my issues lol and how I still got results.&#10;&#10;Have an amazing week ahead of you, lots of good things coming your way :)&#10;&#10;