  node [
    id 2707
    label "Jmf7ai8HerA"
    step 1
    date "2020-12-29T16:27:43Z"
    title "BUILD YOUR CURVES (weight gain workout) &#9203;"
    description "Alright ladies! Here is a workout you can do at home or gym (if you are lucky enough to have them open) that can help you build your curves! I love doing full body workouts because you get to work both your upper and lower body at the same time and you workout less throughout the week &#128518;&#10;&#10;Adding compound exercises to your workout routine is key since you get to work more than one muscle at a time for overall gains!&#10;&#10;Try out this routine and comment below to let me know if you liked it! &#128151;&#128170;&#127997;&#10;&#10;THE WORKOUT:&#10;1&#65039;&#8419; 12 reps RDLs x 3 sets&#10;2&#65039;&#8419; 12 reps Squats to Curtsy Squats x 3 sets&#10;3&#65039;&#8419; 12 reps Hamstring Curls x 3 sets&#10;4&#65039;&#8419; 12 reps Shoulder Press superset by 12 sets of Bent Over Rows x 3 sets&#10;5&#65039;&#8419; 12 reps Bicep Curls superset by 12 reps of Overhead Tricep Extensions x 3 sets&#10;&#10;My Programs:&#10;&#10;Join my Get Curvy App for 30 day monthly challenges!! http://www.Get-Curvy.com&#10;&#10;Join my 12 Week Full Body Muscle Building Program &#38; Nutrition Guide, Curvy In 30: https://bodibiday.com/products/curvy-in-30-program&#10;&#10;-&#10;&#9829; My Instagram: http://www.bit.ly/IG-BODiBiDAY&#10;&#9829; My Facebook: http://www.bit.ly/FB-BODiBiDAY&#10;&#9829; My Website: http://www.Bodibiday.com&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;Supplements That I Take &#9829;&#10;&#10;&#9829; Pre-workout in &#8220;Tropical Punch&#8221;:  http://www.womens.best/bodibiday&#10;&#9829; BCCAs in &#8220;Fruit Fusion&#8221;: http://www.womens.best/bodibiday&#10;&#9829; Protein Powder &#8220;Vegan Vanilla&#8221; : http://www.womens.best/bodibiday&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9825; SUBSCRIBE: New Videos Every Week.&#10;&#10;&#9825;LIKE This Video: It Really Supports My Channel!&#10;&#10;A LITTLE ABOUT ME:&#10;Whats up everyone!!! My name is Daysha aka. Bodibiday and I am a NASM Certified Personal Trainer. I used to be extremely skinny!! Not on purpose, but more of a genetic thing and a high metabolism... 87lbs was the most I ever weighed and I was able to put on over 20lbs of muscle, build curves and gain so much more confidence! So I dedicate my life and this channel to helping others, especially women, gain weight in a healthy way by working out and building muscle and educating about how the body works!"
    channel_title "Bodibiday Fitness"
    channel_id "UCuVcEb2SSjJtzo02lGoQfBg"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
