  node [
    id 2751
    label "UyABQFE6WBU"
    step 1
    date "2020-11-20T20:24:16Z"
    title "8-Minute BOOTY Workout At Home (No Equipment + NO Squats + NO Lunges)"
    description "No Squats, No Lunges, No Jumping and No Equipment -- just you, your mat, and 8-minutes of booty burning! &#128293; &#127825; &#10;&#10;A quick 8 minute booty workout you can do when you're short on time, OR make it a true booty burnout by adding it onto any leg day workout (like this LEG WORKOUT https://youtu.be/Nw14JlGEeBs)! &#10;&#10;IF...: &#10;&#10004;&#65039;squats + lunges hurt your knees&#10;&#10004;&#65039;you had a baby and you butt disappeared (this is a great post-baby workout, Diastasis Recti safe)&#10;&#10004;&#65039;you're pregnant and want strong glutes to support you and your baby (pregnancy-safe butt workout)&#10;&#10004;&#65039;you want a NO JUMPING glute workout (apartment-friendly) &#10;&#10004;&#65039;you don't have access to dumbbells but want to build a booty&#10;&#10004;&#65039;you want a LEG DAY BURNOUT &#128293;  to add-on to your strength workout&#10;&#10;DO THIS 8 Minute BOOTY WORKOUT! &#10;&#10;&#127775; BONUS: if you experience knee pain while doing squats or lunges, substitute these 4 exercises in other leg workouts!&#10;&#10;&#10024;THE WORKOUT: 8-Minute BOOTY WORKOUT At Home (No Equipment) &#10024;&#10;&#10;&#9658; EQUIPMENT: None! Just your bodyweight. &#10;&#10;&#127775; My oversized yoga mat is from Gorilla Mats (affiliate link): http://gorillamats.com?aff=5&#8203;&#8203;&#8203; &#10; *Discount Code: NourishMoveLove&#10;&#10;&#9658; WARM UP: There's no warm up included in this video, if you'd like one I suggest these 10 Glute Activation Exercise -- https://youtu.be/pHvp9LXf5i4&#10;&#10;&#9658; INSTRUCTIONS: Follow along with the video above. &#10;00:00 Workout Introduction&#10;00:45 Booty Workout Set 1 &#10;05:13 Booty Workout Set 2&#10;09:01 Cool Down&#10;&#10;&#9989; 4 booty building exercises&#10;&#9989; 45 seconds work/15 seconds rest&#10;&#9989; Repeat x2 sets for an 8 minute workout&#10;&#10;4 BUTT LIFTING EXERCISES WITHOUT WEIGHTS: &#10;1&#65039;&#8419; Table Top Leg Lifts (Curtsy)&#10;2&#65039;&#8419; Table Top Glute Stamps + Leg Extension (3 glute stamp pulses + 3 leg extension pulses)&#10;3&#65039;&#8419; Advanced Clamshell&#10;4&#65039;&#8419; Frog Glute Bridges or Frog Pumps &#10;X2 Sets&#10;&#10;*Perform exercise 1-3 on the right side of the body first set and the left side of the body second set. &#10;&#10;&#128156; Learn more about how to do each exercise in this full blog post: http://nourishmovelove.com/8-minute-booty-workout-at-home&#10;&#10;&#127926;  Cue up your favorite music, press 'play', and let's knock it out!&#10;Here's my workout playlist: https://spoti.fi/32fRMuK&#10;_________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;&#127775; More of my BEST BUTT Workouts: &#10;&#9658;10-Minute Legs with Weights + Booty Band -- https://youtu.be/9U0MoVXmPkA&#10;&#9658;35-Minute Legs + Butt Workout -- https://youtu.be/_zCFnZNa210&#10;&#9658;25-Minute Leg Supersets (Strength + Cardio) -- https://youtu.be/7kx94CVmPhY &#10;&#9658;30-Minute Lower Body Workout for Women -- https://youtu.be/Nw14JlGEeBs&#10;&#9658;15-Minute Low Impact Barre Legs - https://youtu.be/r55Y72xVTuM&#10;&#9658;30-Minute Leg Workout with Dumbbells (and Glute Band) -- https://youtu.be/AK8Cc3O1Emg&#10;&#9658;8 Best Leg Exercises with Booty Bands -- https://youtu.be/dbgP-jKARvk&#10;_________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;&#128680;SUBSCRIBE TO MY CHANNEL -- https://bit.ly/NMLYoutubeSubscribe&#10;&#10;&#9658;SUBSCRIBE TO MY EMAIL NEWSLETTER:&#10;Get all of my full length workout videos in your email inbox, and all my insider details (like my favorite athletic gear and more)!&#10;https://www.nourishmovelove.com/subscribe&#10;&#10;&#9658; Access ALL of my FREE 14-DAY + 30-DAY WORKOUT CHALLENGES: https://www.nourishmovelove.com/category/workouts/move-blog/workout-calendars/&#10;&#10;&#9658;FOLLOW On Instagram:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/nourishmovelove&#10;&#10;www.nourishmovelove.com"
