    date "2018-11-14T23:01:42Z"
    title "Exercises for Diastasis Recti!! | Postpartum Workout | Core Work"
    description "Please Watch in HD!! :) &#10;&#10;Hey guys!! Here is a video for all you mamas out there :) I've been working really hard to repair my abdominal muscles after birth and I still have a long way to go. So I wanted to share with you all some of the exercises that I have been doing to help. Hope you enjoy!! :) &#10;&#10;Full Workout: &#10;&#10;1. Anti-Rotations to the front: 2 sets, 15x&#10;2. Anti-Rotations to the side: 2 sets, 15x&#10;3. Steamboats on both sides: 2 sets, 10x&#10;4. Bird Dog Alternate Arm &#38; Leg: 2 sets, 10x&#10;5. Bird Dog Alternate w/ Crunch: 2 sets, 10x&#10;6. Fire Hydrants: 3 sets, 10x&#10;7. Beast: Hold for 10 sec., 5x&#10;8. Beast w/ Taps: 2 sets, 5x&#10;9. Single Leg Bridge: 3 sets, 10x&#10;&#10;SOCIAL MEDIA:&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM:  https://www.instagram.com/lovvesammay...&#10;&#10;NEW TO MY CHANNEL? SUBSCRIBE HERE!! : https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnIF...&#10;&#10;xoxo, &#10;&#10;Samantha (LOVVESAMMAY)"
