  node [
    id 2781
    label "aJhIsYrNCVc"
    step 1
    date "2020-12-22T14:21:26Z"
    title "15 Minute Stretch Postpartum DAILY Routine (DIASTASIS RECTI FRIENDLY)"
    description "15 minute stretch postpartum DAILY routine (DIASTASIS RECTI FRIENDLY). In this video I show you my best postpartum stretches that are diastasis recti safe and suitable for after c section to release tension in your shoulders, chest, neck, hips and back. It&#8217;s a 15-minute DAILY stretch typically targeted for new moms who are lifting, carrying and feeding their babies and want to stretch out their muscles and feel good! It&#8217;s a relaxing postnatal workout (that doesn&#8217;t feel like a workout) that&#8217;s short and easy to do in the morning or evening as part of your daily postnatal fitness routine. With elements of postnatal yoga (postpartum yoga) and dynamic stretches, I designed it so that those moms/mums who may have a diastasis recti/abdominal separation know that these exercises are safe for their body and if you do not have a diastasis recti, they are appropriate for you too. No equipment is required! &#10;https://youtu.be/aJhIsYrNCVc&#10;&#10;COMBINE THIS VIDEO WITH ONE OF THESE 2 OTHER VIDEOS: &#10;Diastasis Recti Safe Exercises for Toning (GET FLAT ABS POST BABY)&#10;https://youtu.be/dle4aenDbc8&#10; &#10;Postnatal Workout for Weight Loss and Tone (20 MINUTE SHAPE UP) &#10;https://youtu.be/xvWjkalaGFg&#10;&#10;&#8216;GET YOUR FREE COPY OF HOW TO GET A FLATTER TUMMY AFTER BABY GUIDE.&#10;Please comment &#8216;YES&#8217; in the comments below so we can notify you of it&#8217;s release! I&#8217;ve currently got my head down writing this for you and have lots of tips to share. I expect it to be ready February 2022 so thank you for your patience! &#10;&#10;MUSIC BY KIA ORA.&#10;WHAT SURROUNDS US&#10;SUMMER VIBE&#10;Check out Kia&#8217;s fabulous tunes here: &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jvKki4LRdIU&#38;feature=youtu.be&#10;&#10;TWEET THIS VIDEO: https://youtu.be/aJhIsYrNCVc&#10;&#10;LET&#8217;S CONNECT:&#10;&#9873; SUBSCRIBE TO MY CHANNEL &#9873;&#10;If you want to have more tone in your tummy and pelvic floor, to be strong to handle the demands of motherhood calmly and with more body confidence, to feel good about your body after pregnancy, you need to be doing the right kind of exercise after pregnancy. Consider subscribing to my channel for prenatal and postnatal exercise videos.&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8yjQGKCissWAu-L6R2TdOw &#10;&#10;&#12484;  CONNECT WITH ME  &#12484;&#10;Leave a comment on this video and you'll have a response; I read every one &#10084;&#65039;.  Or you can connect with me on different social platforms too:&#10;&#10;Instagram: www.instagram.com/bumpandbeyondclub&#10;Facebook: www.facebook.com/bumpandbeyondclub&#10;Join Bump and Beyond Community (Free): https://bump-and-beyond.mn.co/plans/48844?bundle_token=01841a80200c6895005042619b315c2c&#38;utm_source=manual&#10;Twitter: www.twitter.com/BumpandBeyondVW"
