et symmetrical jawline&#10;03:01 Access to facial symmetry package link&#10;04:08 jaw relaxing massage after exercise&#10;05:52 Group Face yoga sessions date announcement.&#10;&#10;Remember that you are aging everyday, you can Anti-age everyday too!&#10;Thank you for watching and enjoying Blush with me face yoga!&#10;#BlushWithMeFaceYoga #FaceYoga #Cheekbones #doublechin #vshapeface&#10;&#10;Subscribe to my channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCTz...&#10;&#10;Use promo code PARMITA20 to get 20% off on any &#34;Better Not Younger&#34; product https://better-notyounger.com/ &#10;&#10;My Jewelry: Satat Jewelry: www.satat-US.com&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE!!! SHARE!! LIKE!!... and COMMENT!!! &#10;&#10;&#128165; INSTAGRAM&#10;http://instagram.com/Blushwithme_parmita&#10;&#10;&#128165; FACEBOOK FANPAGE &#10;https://www.facebook.com/ParmitaKatka...&#10;&#128165; My Amazon store&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/blushwith.&#10;&#10;&#10;Recommended videos&#10;&#10;Face yoga playlist:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lbhYoSyH7GY&#38;list=PLrLHadod7vE821rcmUhM0LNrrn0DR9ZUb&#10;&#10;Skin care to get rid of three major aging concerns&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=puVdMd2kuE0&#38;t=377s&#10;&#10;Scalp massage techniques&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s7OEFOeu5Ws&#38;t=395s&#10;&#10;Face exercise and face massage technique for Jawline&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rt73quKws2o&#38;t=39s&#10;&#10;High cheekbones&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x7dYOHKXy4k&#38;t=113s"
