  node [
    id 2921
    label "YIRrZVl7-74"
    step 1
    date "2018-04-05T17:13:14Z"
    title "Shoulder Stretches For Upper Body Tightness | Pain Relief for Shoulder"
    description "HI MY LOVES!&#10;Okay, This last week i have been EXTREMELY sore in my upper body and I just needed to stretch AND a little bit of strengthening my shoulder blades. The idea is to keep moving and keep your body supple! SO i merged little bit of dance, yoga and other fitness forms to create this Shoulder Stretches For upper body sequence. Give this a try and let me know how you feel after.&#10;&#10;Leotard from PDAdancewear&#10;Mat from Yoga essentials!&#10;&#10;**************************************************************&#10;&#10;Be creepy and follow me on all my other social media handles:&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM: http://instagram.com/natashanoel001&#10;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/natashanoel001/&#10;TWITTER: http://twitter.com/natashanoel001&#10;BLOG:https://soulfulhappiness.wordpress.com/ ( I upload new blogs every Tuesday and Thursday!)&#10;&#10;BUSINESS INQUIRIES: dancing.yogini001@gmail.com&#10;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#10;Wanna make me smile even more than usual? SUBSCRIBE... Pretty please!!!! (:&#10;&#10;HERE! www.youtube.com/natashanoel&#10;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#10;If you're reading this. 1. You're freaking real for actually reading down here. 2. Comment what else you would like to see on this channel! I love hearing feedback. Thank you, loves.&#10;&#10;Till I see you next time,&