    description "&#10004;&#65039;Why Stretching WON'T Make You Flexible - FREE E-Book:&#10;&#10004;&#65039;http://www.criticalbench.com/stretching/&#10;&#10;===&#10;&#10;Sick &#38; tired of sore, stiff muscles? Here is a 10 minute hip and glute stretching routine that you can follow along with and start feeling relief in just a few minutes. Take care of your hip flexors and your glute muscles and feel better today!&#10;&#10;If you have a comment or question about something in this video, please post it now below! Thanks for watching.&#10;&#10;===&#10;&#10;Stretch Your Way LEAN in Just Minutes a Day!&#10;http://www.criticalbench.com/growth/metstretch&#10;&#10;#criticalbench #strongbydesign #stretching #lowerbody #legs #legtraining #legday #flexibility #mobility"
