  node [
    id 2977
    label "GNsJ7fgsl4I"
    step 1
    date "2020-07-30T22:47:06Z"
    title "Hip Labral Labrum Tear? Popping in Your Hip? Try This Exercise NOW! | Hip Scour"
    description "This exercise was inspired by a hip scour test which indicates arthritis! Often hip popping is a sign that the hip joint is shifting most likely from sitting for extended periods of time in poor positions. Prevent that cartilage breakdown with this simple hip scour exercise!&#10;&#10;You'll start with the scour test where you will try to drive your hip bone back into the socket and then attempt to pull your leg in a circle. If you find a spot that there seems to be a catch, do small circles in this area to lubricate the area and try the big circle again!&#10;&#10;For more information about how to keep your body healthy during COVID, check out our blogs below. &#10;&#10;https://www.rehabandrevive.com/post-1/ease-your-hip-pain-with-these-tips&#10;https://www.rehabandrevive.com/post-1/covid-care-part-2-alleviate-carpal-tunnel-now&#10;https://www.rehabandrevive.com/post-1/covid-care-part-3-neck-pain&#10;https://www.rehabandrevive.com/post-1/masks-causing-jaw-pain-and-headaches&#10;&#10;Subscribe: https://www.youtube.com/subscription_center?add_user=rehabandrevive&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Not all exercises, suggestions, and recommendations presented here are suitable for everyone and are in no way substitute for medical counseling. &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;These exercises can result in injury.  Any user of this program assumes the risk of injury and holds harmless and releases Dr. Justin Lin and Rehab and Revive Physical Therapy, Inc. from any and all liability in connection with the program and advice herein.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Visit Us! &#13;&#10;14661 Myford Rd. Suite C&#13;&#10;Tustin CA&#13;&#10;(714) 900-3880&#13;&#10;hello@rehabandrevive.com&#10;&#13;&#10;Visit Rehab and Revive's Website:&#13;&#10;http://www.rehabandrevive.com&#13;&#10;Find Us On &#13;&#10;Google Plus @ https://plus.google.com/+rehabandrevive&#13;&#10;Facebook @ https://www.facebook.com/RehabAndRevive&#13;&#10;Pinterest @ https://www.pinterest.com/rehabandrev...&#13;&#10;Instagram @ rehabandrevive&#13;&#10;Twitter @ rehabandrevive&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;For more videos subscribe to our Youtube channel!  &#13;&#10;Thanks for watching! &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Rehab and Revive Physical Therapy &#8211; We CAN and we WILL get better together!"
