    title "12-MIN Pelvic/Core Stability Routine for Hip Impingement (FOLLOW-ALONG!)"
    description "&#128204; TEST &#38; STRENGTHEN YOUR CORE (TO HELP YOUR HIPS) IN 12 MINUTES! &#10;&#128073; [READ FULL BLOG]: https://www.gotrom.com/blog/core-stability-hip-impingement&#10;Want to build a strong core to help your hip impingement (femoroacetabular impingement?)&#10;&#10;Look no further!&#10;&#10;In physical therapy, they say &#8211; &#34;proximal stability = distal mobility&#34;. &#10;In plain English, we would say &#8211; &#34;smart/strong core = healthy/happy hips.&#34; &#10;&#10;However you say it, these are some of my favorite core progressions to help you build core strength, endurance, and motor control (3 keys for healthy hips!)&#10;&#10;Minimal equipment is needed and you can do them anywhere, anytime! &#10;&#10;Gym...home...wherever!&#10;&#127909; IN THIS VIDEO YOU WILL LEARN: &#10;Why does &#34;neutral pelvis = happy hips?&#34;&#10;How to test your core intelligence/stability? &#10;How to &#34;master&#34; the position of your pelvis &#10;Which movements can a stable pelvic position enhance?&#10;What are the &#34;Hip Impingement and Pelvic Position&#34; tests? &#10;&#10;&#128073; SUBSCRIBE TO FIX INJURIES &#38; GET FLEXIBLE:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/GotROM?sub_confirmation1&#10;=====================&#10;&#10;&#129488; : Do you have FAI or Hip Impingement?&#10;http://www.TheFAIFix.com&#10;&#10;=====================&#10;&#10;&#128736; : The FAI Fix is a joint undertaking by Upright Health and Got ROM.&#10;http://UprightHealth.com&#10;http://GotROM.com&#10;&#10;=====================&#10;&#10;&#128218;: FREE EBOOKS + 6 BONUS GIFTS&#10;https://www.gotrom.com/p/free-resources&#10;&#10;(...and exclusive videos NOT found on YouTube)&#10;&#10;=====================&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9792;&#65039; : FLEXIBILITY &#38; MOBILITY PROGRAMS FOR THE MODERN ATHLETE&#10;&#10;30 &#38; 45-Day Programs&#10;http://GotROM.com/pages/products&#10;&#10;=====================&#10;&#10;&#128736; : RECOMMENDED MOBILITY TOOLS:&#10;https://www.gotrom.com/p/the-hip-stick&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/gotrom&#10;https://www.hyper-phoenix.com/discount/SHANE&#10;&#128073;(COUPON CODE &#34;SHANE&#34; for discount)&#10;Note: affiliate links included above &#10;&#10;=====================&#10;&#10;&#128293;: FACEBOOK / INSTAGRAM&#10;https://www.facebook.com/TheGotROM/&#10;https://www.instagram.com/thegotrom/&#10;&#10;=====================&#10;&#10;GotROM.com &#8212; Build an Injury Free, Athletic Body&#10;&#128235;: Questions? Email us!&#10;Support@GotROM.com&#10;&#10;Intro Music: Twist It by Shinogo (to http://shinogo.com/)"
