  node [
    id 2991
    label "COaQiHSBQQo"
    step 1
    date "2019-05-29T18:53:55Z"
    title "No More Clicking Hips | SmashweRx | Trevor Bachmeyer"
    description "If your hips click and pop then you need to stop reading and just do this!&#10;.&#10;The hip is a ball and socket joint and responds the best to anything that exploits global movement around its 360 degree set up.&#10;.&#10;Quick tip, if you&#8217;ve got some knee pain or actual knee issues then this needs to be modified because it does end up loading the knee slightly.&#10;.&#10;Now, that being said, get the hip into flexion and external rotation and then just start working the joint through as much movement as possible.&#10;.&#10;The clicks and pops (outside of the normal joint sounds) are usually because the joint is ratcheting and gapping throughout its range of motion due to a sticky capsule, uncooperative articular surface or just bad mechanics.&#10;.&#10;Here are three moves to end all of that.&#10;.&#10;1&#65039;&#8419; Narrow Ring Hold Squat Sweep&#10;2&#65039;&#8419; Wise Ring Hold Squat Sweep (Toes out)&#10;3&#65039;&#8419; Hip Scissor&#10;.&#10;Help someone with hip pain, give them a tag.&#10;.&#10;&#127825;TAG SOMEONE TO DO THIS&#127825;&#10;.&#10;Want to learn how to biohack yourself? The SmashweRx system has been used all over the planet from professional athletes to soccer moms.  Step into a pain free life at www.smashwerx.com, or just smash the link in our bio."
    channel_title "SmashweRx"
    channel_id "UC4BvkJe2U4CnenW61nm_HOQ"
