 by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/rdD-DMTWqU4&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/SayGoodbye&#10;&#10;&#127911; Track: Heuse &#38; Zeus x Crona - Pill (feat. Emma Sameth) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;https://youtu.be/CLiXUT3MS34&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/pill&#10;&#10;&#127911; Track: Tobu - Seven [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/h18gwLKQf_Q"
