  node [
    id 3057
    label "QljQfh9l5Gc"
    step 1
    date "2019-07-14T13:31:59Z"
    title "Learn Nauli Kriya step by step&#2404; &#2344;&#2380;&#2354;&#2368; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2360;&#2368;&#2326;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2310;&#2360;&#2366;&#2344; &#2340;&#2352;&#2368;&#2325;&#2366; #StayHome and do nauli #WithMe"
    description "Every Indian must read this book.&#10;https://amzn.to/3wUtxSB (in Hindi)&#10;https://amzn.to/3wTv0sn (in English)&#10;Nauli is one of the kriyas or shatkarma (cleaning exercises) from yoga. The exercise is claimed to serve the cleaning of the abdominal region - digestive organs, small intestine- and is based on a massage of the internal belly organs by a circular movement of the abdominal muscles.&#10;Nauli is an exercise of the classical hatha yoga but is not taught often in yoga schools. Nauli is considered difficult exercise, which can be learned only with perseverance and patience. There are four variations, which are gradually learned one after another:&#10;madhyana nauli: the isolated contraction of the central muscles of the abdomen&#10;vama nauli: the isolated contraction of the left part of the central muscles of the abdomen&#10;daksina nauli: the isolated contraction of the right part of the central muscles of the abdomen&#10;nauli kriya: the circular movement of the central muscles of the abdomen&#10;In yoga, nauli generally recommended for the recovery of constipation. The exercise may clean the small intestine and eliminate digesting problems.&#10;Nauli is generally done standing but it is possible to do it in other positions like lotus, whereby the trunk is bent forward and is supported by the hands at the thighs. After a complete breath out the entire belly is strongly brought in and then the middle belly muscle is contracted and moved in a circle.&#10;&#10;&#10;Sutra neti &#10;https://youtu.be/J5S_HOD-ET4&#10;&#10;Agnisaar kriya &#10;https://youtu.be/3JloLMpVu3E&#10;&#10;Jal neti for beginners&#10;https://youtu.be/LzD42Mbj878&#10;&#10;Siddhasana&#10;https://youtu.be/ZJ6SYJMhLzQ&#10;&#10;Paschimottanasan&#10;https://youtu.be/B8Qntu1vYO4&#10;&#10;Learn nauli kriya &#10;https://youtu.be/rLu9iWfTeWw&#10;&#10;Kapalbhati pranayama&#10;https://youtu.be/m57UVNlWfqI&#10;&#10;Abs workout at home &#10;https://youtu.be/BcHvehpL7vw&#10;&#10;How to do Ashwini mudra &#10;https://youtu.be/gVIksEUMRhY&#10;&#10;Ujjay pranayama &#10;https://youtu.be/sfafICEtces&#10;&#10;Advance bhramari pranayama&#10;https://youtu.be/4E4rjNwwnI8&#10;&#10;Bhramari  pranayama&#10;https://youtu.be/Y_02jYhoFK4&#10;&#10;Jal neti &#10;https://youtu.be/EM8Qr-J5U_I&#10;&#10;Sheet karma kapalbhati&#10; https://youtu.be/ioOvTA__Bh4&#10;&#10;Frozen shoulder &#10;https://youtu.be/GrU5InqIlNg&#10;&#10;Benefits of deep breathing &#10;https://youtu.be/Y7tF5GA6wLg&#10;&#10;How to do surya bhedana&#10;https://youtu.be/MULQvV9AjFM&#10;&#10;2 yoga for calf pain &#10;https://youtu.be/EWjztRjsfLI&#10;&#10;Vaman dhauti or kunjal kriya &#10;https://youtu.be/IdTpwMLxbcw&#10;&#10;How to get rid of double chin &#10;https://youtu.be/L1joRcbV_Vo&#10; &#10;Yoga for back pain&#10;https://youtu.be/TQzettf9Y08&#10; &#10;Facial yoga &#10;https://youtu.be/9mCQaG9sbPc&#10;&#10; Full split for beginners &#10;https://youtu.be/jM35ymukEhk&#10;&#10;2 step to do side split for beginners &#10;https://youtu.be/KV4QtdtFR4k&#10;&#10;Plank pose for belly fat &#10;https://youtu.be/HTGJ391SGTo&#10;&#10;Cervical spondylosis&#10;https://youtu.be/Z9iZFj0o_t8&#10; &#10;kapalbhati pranayama&#10;https://youtu.be/m57UVNlWfqI&#10;&#10;Learn nauli kriya for beginners&#10;https://youtu.be/QljQfh9l5Gc&#10; &#10;Surya namaskar for beginners&#10;https://youtu.be/mpZkRGg4M_k&#10;&#10;Shitali pranayam &#10;https://youtu.be/rZmMk_zTMKs&#10;&#10;Uddhiyana bandha &#10;https://youtu.be/5hMxSF_acrc&#10;&#10;Jalandhar bandha&#10;https://youtu.be/V3VUiD5RZeg&#10;&#10;Mula bandha &#10;https://youtu.be/YYy6FhxoSFI&#10;&#10;sirsasana for beginners&#10;https://youtu.be/Ck16ocgKTNI&#10;&#10;Padahastasana&#10;https://youtu.be/ZVkbhrFUKyc&#10;&#10;Rubber neti &#10;https://youtu.be/oP3QOe8_2FY&#10;&#10; Plankpose &#10;https://youtu.be/bwwfSe69zwo&#10;&#10;Mayurasana for beginners &#10;https://youtu.be/XGHZ4BFAAzs&#10;&#10;Yoga for knee pain &#10;https://youtu.be/8Q1jCdop3EU&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;#naulikriya&#10;#yoggurumohan&#10;#nauli&#10;#WithMe"
