    title "10 DAYS UPPER BODY CARDIO WORKOUT PLAN"
    description "Today' we'll be burning fat on the upper body -- arms, chest, shoulders!&#10;&#10;This is a cardio workout to burn upper body fat. Do this today to not only lose weight but also to tone and strengthen the muscles in your upper body. &#10;&#10;Let's do this - good luck!!&#10084;&#65039;&#128170;&#10;&#10;**If you want to be notified when I upload a new video, make sure to subscribe to our channel. I upload new videos everyday from Sunday to Friday!&#10;&#10;TIMECODES:&#10;&#10;00:00 Body Rotations&#10;00:47 Arm Crossovers&#10;01:31 Arm Circles&#10;02:09 Side Bends&#10;03:02 Rest&#10;03:34 Lateral Arm Circles&#10;04:09 Rest&#10;04:26 Step Back Jacks&#10;04:57 Rest&#10;05:14 Overhead Reach&#10;05:46 Rest&#10;06:03 Side Lunge Windmill&#10;06:39 Rest&#10;06:56 Punches&#10;07:30 Rest&#10;08:17 Lateral Arm Circles&#10;08:54 Rest&#10;09:16 Step Back Jacks&#10;09:50 Rest&#10;10:12 Overhead Reach&#10;10:46 Rest&#10;11:08 Side Lunge Windmill&#10;11:47 Rest&#10;12:09 Punches&#10;12:46 Rest&#10;13:33 Lateral Arm Circles&#10;14:12 Rest&#10;14:34 Step Back Jacks&#10;15:10 Rest&#10;15:32 Overhead Reach&#10;16:09 Rest&#10;16:31 Side Lunge Windmill&#10;17:12 Rest&#10;17:34 Punches&#10;18:14 Rest&#10;19:01 Lateral Arm Circles&#10;19:37 Rest&#10;19:54 Step Back Jacks&#10;20:25 Rest&#10;20:42 Overhead Reach&#10;21:14 Rest&#10;21:31 Side Lunge Windmill&#10;22:07 Rest&#10;22:24 Punches&#10;22:58 Rest&#10;23:45 Lateral Arm Circles&#10;24:22 Rest&#10;24:44 Step Back Jacks&#10;25:18 Rest&#10;25:40 Overhead Reach&#10;26:14 Rest&#10;26:36 Side Lunge Windmill&#10;27:15 Rest&#10;27:37 Punches&#10;28:14 Rest&#10;29:01 Lateral Arm Circles&#10;29:40 Rest&#10;30:02 Step Back Jacks&#10;30:38 Rest&#10;31:00 Overhead Reach&#10;31:37 Rest&#10;31:59 Side Lunge Windmill&#10;32:40 Rest&#10;33:02 Punches"
