  node [
    id 3088
    label "A5le3de-Yvs"
    step 1
    date "2022-06-15T16:34:08Z"
    title "How do you play as an adult? #shorts"
    description "Play first, work later&#10;&#10;How do you keep your child-like sense of play alive? There&#8217;s no right answer here, but as it&#8217;s the weekend I thought I&#8217;d post about the value of playing, especially as an adult. &#10;&#10;We have so many responsibilities in our day to day, and it&#8217;s easy to get bogged down and lose our sense of adventure, curiosity and levity. But I&#8217;m here to say no more friends! I challenge you this weekend to set aside a few hours to honor that little kid inside of you. Whether it&#8217;s climbing a tree, dancing in your underwear, playing dress up, or running like a crazy person, do something that you used to love to do but that got pushed to the side because of adult life.&#10;&#10;In fact, the research supports the importance of play. In an episode of the Huberman Lab podcast (linked below), Dr. Hubmeran talks about using play and/ or tinkering to learn a new skill. He says&#10; &#8220;the way to actually expand your practice is to engage in this low stakes thinking. &#8216;I&#8217;m going to explore in a way that it doesn&#8217;t really matter if the ball goes into the net, or into the hole.&#8217; And it&#8217;s counterintuitive. We think we need to drill and drill. But this state of play, with low levels of adrenaline and epinephrin, are only possible when the stakes are low enough that we aren&#8217;t stressed. And that combination allows the pre-frontal cortex to explore different possibilities in ways that can truly expand our capabilities over time.&#8221;&#10;&#10;One way I incorporate play time into my day to day is through movement. This could be exploring new kettlebell combinations, playing paintball as I did this weekend, or in my yoga practice. It doesn&#8217;t really matter what you do, just that you find something that you enjoy and don&#8217;t have to take seriously. Even if it happens to be your favorite sport, try this out for a bit and you may surprise yourself. Whether you learn something a new skill in the process or not, it&#8217;s never a bad thing to have fun along the way, right?&#10;&#10;Wishing you all a very playful weekend ahead&#9996;&#127996;&#10;&#10;Ally&#10;&#10;Full Huberman Lab Podcast:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BwyZIWeBpRw&#38;feature=youtu.be&#10;&#10;MY WEBSITE: https://www.alexandratempletonfit.com/&#10;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/allyt.fit/&#10;FACEBOOK: @alexandratempletonfit&#10;&#10;&#127916; POPULAR VIDEOS: https://www.youtube.com/user/AllyTCA/...&#10;&#10;&#128680;SUBSCRIBE to join the family! And if you enjoy these kinds of videos, it always means a lot when you like and share &#128591; &#10;&#10149; https://www.youtube.com/user/AllyTCA/...&#10;&#10;Music: Epidemic Sound &#10;&#10;Thank you for your support &#128515; It means so much and allows me to continue creating content on here for free."
    channel_title "Alexandra Templeton"
    channel_id "UCZu8wSlJpmQ22feBRKZozRA"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
    duration NAN
  ]
  node [
    id 3089
    label "ZBvH9qaDKlU"
    step 1
    date "2022-06-29T16:49:48Z"
    title "Yoga Burn REVIEW - Does It Work? Everything You Need To Know About Yoga Burn"
    description "Official Website + Discount = https://bit.ly/3a2mi2k&#10;Official Website + Discount = https://bit.ly/3a2mi2k&#10;Official Website + Discount = https://bit.ly/3a2mi2k&#10;&#10;Yoga Burn Review -  Everything You Need To Know About Yoga Burn, Does It Actually Work? Official Website, and Side Effects.&#10;&#10;Yoga Burn is an innovative 12-week program designed for women who want to reshape their body, boost their metabolism and get that classic yoga booty. But does it really get results? And is it worth the cash?&#10; &#10;Its primary goal is to help you get that tiny belly and yoga booty that often seem so elusive - but it's also great for relaxing and improving your flexibility.&#10;&#10;Zoe recommends completing three 45-minute yoga classes each week to get the fastest results. Unlike most programs, Yoga Burn is described as a &#34;strategic, progressive approach...that's proven to deliver results.&#34; That means each workout is tailored to YOU and YOUR current goals - you're not expected to go at the same pace as everyone else (like in a class yoga or cardio setting).&#10;&#10;Aside from the main yoga program, you also get a generous set of free bonuses to help you on your body transformation journey. Here's a breakdown of everything that's included:&#10;&#10;Yoga Burn 12-Week Body Shaping Course (Online Digital Download &#38; Physical DVDs) - this includes all three phases for participants, a quick-start class and 20 in-depth pose tutorials. There are 9 workout videos in total and you'll repeat each four times before moving onto the next phase.&#10;&#10;BONUS: Basic audio versions of each class to use while traveling.&#10;&#10;BONUS: Tranquility flow class - a unique set of sequences for stress relief. While tranquility flow isn't going to burn many calories, it's a great way to relax.&#10;&#10;BONUS: Immersion Community - a unique fitness community for women only. It provides access to coaching calls, a community for talking to other women and ongoing support throughout your journey.&#10;&#10;BONUS: Yoga Burn Monthly - an additional set of DVDs that serve as an introduction to a variety of different types of yoga. These include Ashtanga, Hatha, Jundalini, Vinyasa and restorative yoga.&#10;&#10;(Optional) There's also the option of purchasing a second copy of the course for a discount. This is great if you want to follow the program at the same time as a friend.&#10;&#10;Final verdict on Yoga Burn Customer Reviews are Positive.&#10;&#10;According to several Yoga Burn reviews and user experience, it seems to be the right choice for those who are in search of a healthier life. Hundreds of women have already used it and found it to be effective in supporting the life they desire. &#10;&#10;Besides, the Yoga Burn program is backed by a 100% money-back guarantee. So if you are not satisfied with the results of Yoga Burn, then you can claim a full refund. &#10;&#10;This makes the purchase 100% risk-free.&#10;&#10;Everything you need to know about yoga burn. Honest Review about yoga burn.&#10;Everything you need to know about yoga burn. Honest Review about yoga burn.&#10;Everything you need to know about yoga burn. Honest Review about yoga burn.&#10;Everything you need to know about yoga burn. Honest Review about yoga burn.&#10;Everything you need to know about yoga burn. Honest Review about yoga burn."
