    label "cyx0lb-a_bs"
    step 1
    date "2020-05-19T19:33:44Z"
    title "10 Minute Beautiful Thigh Sculpt Pilates Workout | 7 Day Thigh Challenge (Days 4-7)"
    description "Join me for the #7DayThighChallenge!!! https://www.blogilates.com/7-day-thigh-challenge-2020/&#10;&#10;These are your LAST five moves of the 7 Day Thigh Challenge and I want you to give them 110%!!!! Think about how strong and accomplished you're gonna feel at the end. So proud of you all for making it this far!!&#10;&#10;7 DAY THIGH CHALLENGE:&#10;&#10;Purpose: To slim and sculpt your thighs in 7 days!&#10;Begins: Monday May 25, 2020&#10;Ends: Sunday June 1, 2020&#10;Length: 7 days&#10;Daily commitment: 20-30 min&#10;&#10;How it works:&#10;Day 1-7: Take a before picture of your legs &#38; complete the workouts listed for the day. You can even film yourself doing these and have a cool progress video that you can upload to Instagram, TikTok, or YouTube at the end of the week!&#10;Day 1-7: Make sure to drink at least 64 oz of water a day for all 7 days.&#10;Day 1-7: Make sure to reduce your intake of refined/processed carbs (bread, crackers, cereal, pastries etc.) and replace with whole vegetables and fruits for 7 days.&#10;End of Day 7: Take an after picture or video of your legs and upload the results to Instagram, TikTok, or YouTube! Make sure to include the #7DayThighChallenge hashtag and tag @blogilates so other users can find the challenge!&#10;&#10;BEAUTIFUL THIGH SCULPT PILATES&#10;&#10;1. Inner thigh lift&#10;2. Inner thigh circles (fwd)&#10;3. Inner thigh circles (bwd)&#10;4. Froggers&#10;5. Sideways scissors&#10;&#10;We'll do each move for 45 seconds, with a 15 second break between. Let's do this!!!&#10;&#10;Day 1&#10;Leg Slimming Cardio Pilates (20 min): https://youtu.be/KpCPgNer_Oo&#10;&#10;Day 2&#10;Leg Slimming Cardio Pilates (20 min): https://youtu.be/KpCPgNer_Oo&#10;&#10;Day 3&#10;Leg Slimming Cardio Pilates (20 min): https://youtu.be/KpCPgNer_Oo&#10;&#10;Day 4&#10;Leg Slimming Cardio Pilates (20 min): https://youtu.be/KpCPgNer_Oo&#10;Beautiful Thigh Sculpt (10 min): https://youtu.be/cyx0lb-a_bs&#10;&#10;Day 5&#10;Leg Slimming Cardio 