y iamalex &#38; Hazy Year: https://soundcloud.com/headroomcollective/iamalex-x-hazy-year-hollywood-vinyl-ep-soon&#10;Music by Isaiah A- Mom: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YjgqjlD-bk8&#10;&#10;Thank you to Teami for sponsoring this video #TeamiPartner&#10;&#10;if you made it down here plz tell me u noticed a change in my belly button shape..now thats a fkn flex babes :-))"
