    label "qnJge-973vY"
    step 1
    date "2016-11-11T06:00:26Z"
    title "Pranayama - An Introduction | Breathing Basics | Yoga With Aj"
    description "In the first episode of Breathing Exercises, firstly learn the breathing basic with our instructor AJ only on Mind Body Soul.&#10;&#10;Pranayama is control of Breath. Prana is Breath or vital energy in the body. On subtle levels prana represents the pranic energy responsible for life or life force, and ayama means control. So Pranayama is Control of Breath. In this video learn to do breathing basics, and know what is Pranayama, why should we put Pranayama in to practice and much more about Yogic Breathing!&#10;&#10;Credits&#10;Yoga Instructor : Aparajita Jamwal AJ&#10;Director: Suchandra Basu&#10;Camera: Kawaldeep Singh Jangwal, Manjeet Katariya, Akshay Durgule&#10;Editing: Kishor Rai&#10;Creative Head: Kavya Krishnaswamy&#10;Producer: Rajjat A. Barjatya&#10;Copyrights: Rajshri Entertainment Private Limited&#10;&#10;For More Updates&#10;Like us on Facebook : https://www.facebook.com/mindbodysoulTV&#10;Follow Us on Twitter : https://twitter.com/MindBodySoulTV&#10;Follow Us on  Instagram : https://www.instagram.com/mindbodysoultv&#10;Follow Us on Pinterest : https://www.pinterest.com/mindbodysoultv&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE for more videos: http://bit.ly/SubscribeTo-Mindbodysoul&#10;&#10;Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/mindbodysoulTV&#10;&#10;Follow Us on Twitter: https://twitter.com/MindBodySoulTV&#10;&#10;Follow Us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/mindbodysoultv&#10;&#10;Follow Us on Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/mindbodysoultv"
    channel_title "Mind Body Soul"
