    step 1
    date "2019-09-17T18:44:33Z"
    title "How To Lose Flabby Legs | Thin Thighs in 13 | Do This Every Morning To Lose Fat &#128170;"
    description "GET SNATCHED FOR SUMMER with my &#34;big booty tight tummy&#34; plan!: http://bit.ly/2bbtt10&#10;&#10;New week, new workout!&#10;SUBSCRIBE TO MY CHANNEL &#128073;&#127996; http://bit.ly/2subtojo&#10;&#10;Today we are focusing in on the thighs and working on toning up the insides AND outside of our legs for a stronger, leaner set of legs!&#10;&#10;Make sure you are doing this workout every day- try it for 30 days and you will be seeing noticeable results (make sure you track your progress in the comment section!)&#10;&#10;Remember that working out is only one part of the equation. To achieve optimal results you also want to have a healthy, balanced diet. Rich in protein, complex carbohydrates, and healthy fats. This will ensure that your body is getting the nutrients it needs to stay strong and get that lean, toned look.&#10;&#10;A typical day of eating for me will look like this: *note, this will vary from person to person, so make sure that you are hitting your calorie and nutrient goal for your specific goals and needs*&#10;&#10;Breakfast: 2 scrambled eggs + half a thin bagel + multivitamins&#10;&#10;Snack 1: veggies + peanut butter (i especially love making &#34;ants on a log&#34; https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/23953/ants-on-a-log/&#10;&#10;Lunch: A large salad with multiple types of greens (arugula, spinach, lettuce, etc), avacado, beans or tofu, dried cranberries, apples, oil + balsamic vinegar&#10;&#10;snack 2: vegan yogurt or a larabar&#10;&#10;snack 3: 1/2 cup of blueberries + strawberries&#10;&#10;Dinner: beans/lentils, rice, mixed veggies, small spring salad&#10;&#10;Again, these are just suggestions, and you must tailor YOUR nutrition to YOUR needs! &#10;&#10;TODAYS WORKOUT is a series of 13 exercises done for 1 minute each. Here is the workout:&#10;&#10;Side lunge to cross over tap&#10;Curtsy lunges&#10;Pli&#233; slides (side to side)&#10;Side lunge to forward kick&#10;Squat hold + tap back&#10;Side lying kick ups&#10;Side lying under leg lifts&#10;Side lying leg circles&#10;Side lying inverted leg raises&#10;Hip extension and cross (on knees)&#10;Fire hydrant to kick&#10;Leg circles&#10;Lying criss cross legs to split&#10;&#10;I know you're gunna kill it, so let's get it!!&#10;&#10; Let us know in the comments below what other workouts you'd like to see!&#10;&#10;OTHER VIDEOS &#10;&#10145;&#65039;Lower Body Sculpting- https://youtu.be/xaKaqa6b8v0&#10;&#10145;&#65039;7 Min HIIT Workout- https://youtu.be/4VC3uzz8U4o&#10;&#10145;&#65039;HIIT Weight loss Challenge- https://youtu.be/Bun5cI_QEA4&#10;&#10145;&#65039;Challenging Upper Body Workout- https://youtu.be/ZVxyxZCSV5Y&#10;&#10;---------&#10;&#9825;  DOWNLOAD MY APP FREE FOR 7 DAYS - GET CUSTOMIZED DIET, NUTRITION &#38; MOTIVATION &#10;http://bit.ly/3ujelec&#10;--------&#10;Follow my IG: https://www.instagram.com/growwithjo/&#10;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.ca/growwithjo/p...&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/growwithjotalks&#10;TEXT ME for fitness help! 1-647-490-1160"
