    title "SLIM DOWN WAIST IN 2 WEEKS *10 min ab workout*"
    description "Slim down your waist in 2 weeks with this 10 minute ab workout. I recommend repeating this routine 3 times a day for the best results.&#10;&#10;EXERCISES MENTIONED:&#10;30 sec russian twist&#10;30 sec v crunch&#10;30 sec traveling crunch&#10;30 sec mountain climbers&#10;30 sec plank twists&#10;30 sec toe touches&#10;30 sec diamonds&#10;30 sec russian twists w/ crunch&#10;30 sec side plank dips&#10;30 sec side plank dips&#10;30 sec v hold with crunches&#10;&#10;Make sure to stretch before and after every single workout!&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME  &#129419;&#10;Instagram: @sanne_vander&#10;&#10;MERCH &#128156;&#160;&#10;VNDR Official Store: http://www.sannevander.com/&#10;&#10;CHECK &#10024; &#10;I tried BTS Jungkook&#8217;s WORKOUT for ONE WEEK *omg*&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f6CyrUXkXa0&#10;&#10;MORE OF MY LIFE &#128149;&#10;Instagram: @sanne_vander&#10;Tiktok: @sanne_vander&#10;Pommy&#8217;s Instagram: @pommy_vander&#10;VNDR official: @vndrofficial&#10;&#10;SECRET VANDERFIT GROUP &#128170;&#10;https://www.facebook.com/groups/931327580350725/&#10;&#10;DISCOUNT CODES &#128150;&#10;YesStyle: GLOWUPYEAR&#10;Stylevana: INF10SANNE&#10;Cokodive: GLOWUPYEAR&#10;&#10;BUSINESS INQUIRIES &#10;Team.sannevander@gmail.com&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER  &#10;This video is not sponsored. All opinions are my own.&#10;&#10;#2020glowupyear"
