    title "&#127797; 10 Best Lawn Mowers  (Flymo, Bosch and More)"
    description "&#127797; 10 Best Lawn Mowers  (Flymo, Bosch and More) | Lemongrass. Here are our editor picks:&#10;&#10;00:00 Introduction&#10;&#10;00:56 #1 - Manual Hand Push Lawn Mower Einhell GC-HM 30 (&#163;78.40)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Einhell-GC-HM-Manual-Lawnmower-Cutting/dp/B01AHEK39Q?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;01:34 #2 - Ride On Lawn Mower Honda HF2315HM (&#163;3,649.00)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Shop: https://toplistt.com/YKLo&#10;&#10;02:19 #3 - EasiMow Electric Lawn Mower Flymo 300 R (&#163;74.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Flymo-EasiMow-Electric-Rotary-Mower/dp/B082H58JXC?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:57 #4 - Petrol Rotary Lawn Mower Mountfield HP185 (&#163;189.00)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Mountfield-2L0481023-MC-Petrol-Lawnmower/dp/B089YX5TMM?tag=lemongrass00-21 &#10;&#10;03:36 #5 - Cordless Lawn Mower Worx WG779E.2 (&#163;168.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/WORX-WG779E-2-Cordless-battery-Batteries/dp/B075FYDHF8?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:14 #6 - Cordless Battery Lawn Mower K&#228;rcher LMO 18-36 (&#163;179.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/K%C3%A4rcher-Cordless-Battery-Machine-Yellow/dp/B084PR4ZV5?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:54 #7 - Self-Propelled Petrol Mower Challenge (&#163;170.00)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Shop: https://toplistt.com/Po7a&#10;&#10;05:33 #8 - Manual Garden Lawn Mower Bosch AHM 38 G (&#163;58.14)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Bosch-Manual-Garden-Lawn-Mower/dp/B004JMTY2K?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:10 #9 - Easi Glide 300 Flymo (&#163;94.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Flymo-Glide-Electric-Hover-Collect/dp/B004KPLRHQ?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:45 #10 - Rotak Hand-Propelled Electric Lawn Mower Bosch 34 R (&#163;112.19)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Bosch-Rotak-Electric-Rotary-Mower/dp/B00GZLFPRG?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;07:22 Ending&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;Thanks for watching!&#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE if you love the channel and follow our latest reviews https://studio.youtube.com/channel/UCqzOTu856n_BtYjiU9ZR0EQ?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;#LawnMowers(Flymo,BoschandMore) #LawnMowers(Flymo,BoschandMore)Review #Lemongrass&#10;------------------------------&#10;&#10;Whether your garden is big or small, it&#8217;s nice to have it looking spick and span for when the sun puts his hat on. Unruly patches of long grass can ruin the look of a lawn, so you'll want to have a decent lawnmower on hand to keep it looking neat and trim. However, when it comes to purchasing your new mower, there are some important decisions to be made.&#160;&#10;Do you want a cordless electric model, or a petrol motor you can ride on? A manual push mower is ideal if&#160;you don't mind a little workout, but perhaps you'd prefer a self-propelled option instead? In this guide, we compare clipping box capacity, rotary blades, cutting height and much more. We've even ranked the top 10 in the UK from trusted brands including Honda, K&#228;rcher and Bosch, on Amazon, eBay, and John Lewis.&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;&#10;Portions of footage found in this video are not original content produced by Lemongrass. Portions of stock footage of products were gathered from multiple sources including, manufactures, respected creators and various other sources.&#10;&#10;&#34;All claims, guarantees and product specifications are provided by the manufacturer or vendor. Lemongrass cannot be held responsible for these claims, guarantees or specifications&#34;&#10;&#10;Disclosure: Links are affiliate links to products. I may receive a small commission for purchases made through these links."
