    label "yaln9NbUaOw"
    step 1
    date "2022-07-09T22:35:25Z"
    title "&#127797; 10 Best Miso Pastes (Clearspring, Yutaka and More)"
    description "&#127797; 10 Best Miso Pastes (Clearspring, Yutaka and More) | Lemongrass. Here are our editor picks:&#10;&#10;00:00 Introduction&#10;&#10;00:47 #1 - Red Miso Paste Miso Tasty (&#163;3.15)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Miso-tasty-Organic-White-Paste/dp/B08NG5TG4B?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;01:23 #2 - Brown Rice Miso Clearspring (&#163;3.29)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Clearspring-Organic-Brown-Rice-Miso/dp/B06XDDYMF3?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:00 #3 - White Miso Yutaka (&#163;1.50)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Shop: https://toplistt.com/KhsF&#10;&#10;02:34 #4 - White Miso Japan Centre (&#163;2.39)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Shop: https://toplistt.com/WjRE&#10;&#10; 03:12 #5 - Additive Free Koji Miso Hikari (&#163;9.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/HIKARI-Mutenka-Enjuku-Koji-Genen/dp/B01CQE048K?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;03:49 #6 - Quick Serve Instant Miso Soup Marukome (&#163;2.20)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Marukome-Instant-Sachets-Wakame-12x18g/dp/B01HMBK054?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:29 #7 - Reduced Salt Miso With Dashi Marukome (&#163;6.20)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Shop: https://toplistt.com/K5N0&#10;&#10;05:08 #8 - Malted Rice Miso Paste Chaganju (&#163;9.59)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Malted-Handmade-10-58OZ-NON-GOM-NON-MSG/dp/B08BHMN9DC?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;05:40 #9 - Barley And Rice Awase Miso Masuyamiso (&#163;9.89)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Shop: https://toplistt.com/H4dz&#10;&#10;06:17 #10 - Hatcho Miso Paste Ichibiki (&#163;8.28)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Shop: https://toplistt.com/1ToL&#10;&#10;06:56 Ending&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;Thanks for watching!&#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE if you love the channel and follow our latest reviews https://studio.youtube.com/channel/UCqzOTu856n_BtYjiU9ZR0EQ?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;#MisoPastes #MisoPastesReview #Lemongrass&#10;------------------------------&#10;&#10;Miso paste has been used in Japan for thousands of years for its distinctive umami flavour. It's made from soybeans, salt, and sometimes other ingredients like barley or rice. Miso is fermented with a type of mould known as koji, which&#160;unlocks amazing flavour and nutritional benefits.&#10;If you're looking to add this high protein, low fat and low cholesterol ingredient to healthy home recipes, this video will help you find the best in the UK. Comparing the complexities of white, red and mixed miso for soups, marinades and more, keep reading for our 10 favourites on&#160;Amazon, Tesco, Waitrose and Japan Centre!&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;&#10;Portions of footage found in this video are not original content produced by Lemongrass. Portions of stock footage of products were gathered from multiple sources including, manufactures, respected creators and various other sources.&#10;&#10;&#34;All claims, guarantees and product specifications are provided by the manufacturer or vendor. Lemongrass cannot be held responsible for these claims, guarantees or specifications&#34;&#10;&#10;Disclosure: Links are affiliate links to products. I may receive a small commission for purchases made through these links."
    channel_title "Lemongrass UK"
    channel_id "UCqzOTu856n_BtYjiU9ZR0EQ"
