    title "&#127797; 10 Best Nintendo Switch Accessories (Switch Pro Controller, Power Banks and More)"
    description "&#127797; 10 Best Nintendo Switch Accessories (Switch Pro Controller, Power Banks and More) | Lemongrass. Here are our editor picks:&#10;&#10;00:00 Introduction&#10;&#10;00:56 #1 - Accessories Bundle Geek Pack Orzly (&#163;49.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Orzly-Accessories-Bundle-Compatible-Nintendo-Jet-Black/dp/B09GKTY56L?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;01:35 #2 - Nintendo Switch Screen Protector amFilm Pack of 2 (&#163;6.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B01N3ASPNV?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:16 #3 - Carry Case for Nintendo Switch and Switch OLED Orzly (&#163;13.91)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Orzly-Carry-Compatible-Nintendo-Switch-BLACK-Case/dp/B01NAUKS62/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:57 #4 - Switch Pro Controller Nintendo (&#163;49.95)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Nintendo-Switch-Pro-Controller- Black/dp/B01N4ND1T2?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;03:32 #5 - Grips for Nintendo Joy-Con FASTSNAIL (&#163;14.44)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/FastSnail-Nintendo-Switch-Wear-resistant-Controller/dp/B07WTBBZQL?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:12 #6 - Joy-Con Charging Grip Nintendo (&#163;27.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Nintendo-Switch-Joy-Con-Charging-Grip/dp/B01N3374BH/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:53 #7 - Battery Charger Case BigBlue (&#163;34.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/BigBlue-10000mAh-Nintendo-SwitchCharge-Kickstand-Black/dp/B07MYVL4TY?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;05:31 #8 - Everywhere Messenger Bag PowerA (&#163;24.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/PowerA-Everywhere-Messenger-Nintendo-Switch/dp/B08F451HF5?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:09 #9 - Joy-Con Wheel Pair Nintendo (&#163;14.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B01N7RIIR2?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:40 #10 - Power Bank VOOE (&#163;25.95)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/VOOE-%E3%80%9026800mAh-Version%E3%80%91-Portable-Capacity/dp/B07YHCTVSM/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;07:27 Ending&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;Thanks for watching!&#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE if you love the channel and follow our latest reviews https://studio.youtube.com/channel/UCqzOTu856n_BtYjiU9ZR0EQ?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;#NintendoSwitchAccessories #NintendoSwitchAccessoriesReview #Lemongrass&#10;------------------------------&#10;&#10;The Nintendo Switch is the most versatile console on the market at the moment, being both a home entertainment system and a portable handheld. It is also currently the most popular, having sold over 90 million units worldwide. This massive popularity combined with the adaptability of the console has resulted in a plethora of various accessories, some of which are even tailor-made for specific games.&#10;There&#8217;s no doubt that the Switch, the Switch Lite and the new OLED model are fantastic consoles in their own right, but picking up a few accessories can make playing favourites like Mario Kart, Super Smash Bros and Pok&#233;mon even more fun. From cases and covers to Joy-Cons holders and bundles, we're here to guide you through the best accessories and show you where to find them on Amazon, A...&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;&#10;Portions of footage found in this video are not original content produced by Lemongrass. Portions of stock footage of products were gathered from multiple sources including, manufactures, respected creators and various other sources.&#10;&#10;&#34;All claims, guarantees and product specifications are provided by the manufacturer or vendor. Lemongrass cannot be held responsible for these claims, guarantees or specifications&#34;&#10;&#10;Disclosure: Links are affiliate links to products. I may receive a small commission for purchases made through these links."
