    description "&#127797; 10 Best Extendable Dining Tables  (John Lewis, Selsey and More) | Lemongrass. Here are our editor picks:&#10;&#10;00:00 Introduction&#10;&#10;00:51 #1 - Banbury Extending Dining Table Argos Home Natural (&#163;130.00)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Shop: https://toplistt.com/vAE8&#10;&#10;01:23 #2 - Extendable Solid Wood Dining Table Furniture 247 Black (&#163;169.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Furniture-247-Extendable-Black-Oak/dp/B0754KV2GX?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:06 #3 - Miami Curve Extending Oak Effect Dining Table Argos Home (&#163;200.00)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Shop: https://toplistt.com/5u0w&#10;&#10;02:45 #4 - Ledbury Small Wooden Dining Table Hallowood (&#163;125.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B07XRVMNLS?tag=lemongrass00-21 &#10;&#10;03:20 #5 - Extendable Dining Table Furniture 247 (&#163;185.00)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Furniture-247-Dining-Table-Seater/dp/B0754KGQB2?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;03:57 #6 - Gateleg Extending Table Argos Home Walnut Effect (&#163;100.00)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Shop: https://toplistt.com/M452&#10;&#10;04:34 #7 - Extendable Dining Table Mobili Fiver Oak (&#163;196.58)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Mobili-Fiver-Extendable-Kitchen-Table/dp/B01L2F5T34/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;05:15 #8 - Foldable Drop Leaf Dining Table HOMCOM (&#163;93.73)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/HOMCOM-Foldable-Kitchen-Computer-Workstation/dp/B07GB5P93V?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;05:52 #9 - Roma &#8211; Italian Made Extending Dining Table Selsey (&#163;659.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/SELSEY-ROMA-Italian-Extending-Beautiful/dp/B075WY5L3H?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:29 #10 - Calia 8-12 Seater Extending Dining Table John Lewis (&#163;899.00)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Shop: https://toplistt.com/8jjd&#10;&#10;07:11 Ending&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;Thanks for watching!&#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE if you love the channel and follow our latest reviews https://studio.youtube.com/channel/UCqzOTu856n_BtYjiU9ZR0EQ?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;#ExtendableDiningTables(JohnLewis,SelseyandMore) #ExtendableDiningTables(JohnLewis,SelseyandMore)Review #Lemongrass&#10;------------------------------&#10;&#10;With 64 million of us packed onto a relatively small island, it's no wonder space is at a premium for most UK households. Having the ability to extend your dining table from everyday use into the centre stage of a memorable dinner party is a night and a life saver for any space-savvy Brit.&#10;From small 2-4 seaters to large 8-12 seaters and beyond, there's an extendable dining table out there for you. Brands like Mobili Fiver, Selsey and Homcom have created very stylish and modern tables that speak volumes about their quality and practicality. Amazon, John Lewis and Argos have many great deals practically begging to find a way into your home and life, and we're going to help you find them.&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;&#10;Portions of footage found in this video are not original content produced by Lemongrass. Portions of stock footage of products were gathered from multiple sources including, manufactures, respected creators and various other sources.&#10;&#10;&#34;All claims, guarantees and product specifications are provided by the manufacturer or vendor. Lemongrass cannot be held responsible for these claims, guarantees or specifications&#34;&#10;&#10;Disclosure: Links are affiliate links to products. I may receive a small commission for purchases made through these links."
