    title "&#127797; 10 Best Cooperative Board Games  Guide"
    description "&#127797; 10 Best Cooperative Board Games  Guide | Lemongrass. Here are our editor picks:&#10;&#10;00:00 Introduction&#10;&#10;00:50 #1 - Back to the Future: Dice Through Time Ravensburger (&#163;14.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B0861VM7YF?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;01:26 #2 - Betrayal at House on the Hill Avalon Hill (&#163;35.25)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B003HC9734?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:11 #3 - The Captain is Dead: Dangerous Planet Alderac Entertainment Group (&#163;36.78)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B07NNTWKQL?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:55 #4 - Gloomhaven Cephalofair Games (&#163;109.68) &#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Cephalofair-Games-CPH0201-Gloomhaven-Colour/dp/B01LZXVN4P?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;03:33 #5 - Sherlock Holmes Consulting Detective: Carlton House &#38; Queen's Park Space Cowboys (&#163;46.23)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Space-Cowboys-ASMSCSHCQ01EN-Carlton-Park-Sherlock/dp/2370990090?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:20 #6 - Dead of Winter: A Crossroads Game Plaid Hat Games (&#163;47.64)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Plaid-Hat-Games-PH1000-Crossroads/dp/B00HFKITJC?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:55 #7 - Marvel Champions: The Card Game Fantasy Flight Games (&#163;45.49)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B07W1BF6D5?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;05:35 #8 - Pandemic Legacy: Season 1 Z-Man Games (&#163;66.17)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Z-Man-Games-Pandemic-Legacy-Season/dp/B00TQ5SEAI?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:23 #9 - Gloomhaven: Jaws of the Lion Cephalofair Games (&#163;44.58)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Cephalofair-Games-CPH0501-Gloomhaven-Jaws-Colours/dp/B088QSDB7S?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;07:06 #10 - Arkham Horror: The Card Game Fantasy Flight Games (&#163;32.95)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Fantasy-Flight-Games-FFGAHC01-Arkham/dp/B01L3ZTXS0?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;07:49 Ending&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;Thanks for watching!&#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE if you love the channel and follow our latest reviews https://studio.youtube.com/channel/UCqzOTu856n_BtYjiU9ZR0EQ?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;#CooperativeBoardGamesGuide #CooperativeBoardGamesGuideReview #Lemongrass&#10;------------------------------&#10;&#10;Board games are more popular now than ever before, with experts predicting that the global industry will be worth more than &#163;9 billion by 2023. While many people think of board games as something that causes family arguments over the holidays, there are a number of great collaborative variations on the market that promote working and winning together.&#10;If you&#8217;re not a fan of board games because you seem to find yourself losing to a friend or sibling, take a look at our selection of the best cooperative games to buy on Amazon and John Lewis. We've included plenty of options for 2 players, families and beginners from some of the most well-known names in the industry like Fantasy Flight Games,&#160;Cephalofair Games and Z-man Games.&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;&#10;Portions of footage found in this video are not original content produced by Lemongrass. Portions of stock footage of products were gathered from multiple sources including, manufactures, respected creators and various other sources.&#10;&#10;&#34;All claims, guarantees and product specifications are provided by the manufacturer or vendor. Lemongrass cannot be held responsible for these claims, guarantees or specifications&#34;&#10;&#10;Disclosure: Links are affiliate links to products. I may receive a small commission for purchases made through these links."
