    description "&#127797; 10 Best Patch Cables (Ernie Ball, Mogami and More) | Lemongrass. Here are our editor picks:&#10;&#10;00:00 Introduction&#10;&#10;00:37 #1 - Right Angle Guitar Patch Cables Donner (&#163;17.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Donner-Guitar-Cables-Instrument-Effect/dp/B01MSF3E4B?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;01:23 #2 - Classic Series Right Angle Patch Cable Planet Waves (&#163;14.50)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Planet-Waves-Classic-Instrument-Cable/dp/B001PGXKC8?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:02 #3 - BCK-24 Solderless Patch Cable Kit Boss (&#163;82.00)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/BOSS-BCK-24-Solderless-Pedal-Board/dp/B076WN5GGS?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:47 #4 - IRG-600.5 Hosa (&#163;14.35)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Hosa-IRG-600-5-Low-Profile-Right- Angle-Guitar/dp/B0002IAJ56?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;03:29 #5 - Patch Cable Stagg SPC015L E (&#163;7.42)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Stagg-SPC060L-Angled-Patch-Cable/dp/B00754JWYE?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:06 #6 - Flat Ribbon Patch Cable Ernie Ball (&#163;13.95)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Ernie-Ball-Angle-Patch-3-Pack/dp/B079FQ2T2B?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:49 #7 - Tweed Deluxe Patch Cable Fender (&#163;11.50)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Fender-Cable-Deluxe-Tweed-Angled/dp/B07MVY8ZKQ?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;05:31 #8 - Patch Cable With Pancake Plugs Boss BPC-4-3 (&#163;28.00)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/BOSS-BPC-4-3-Space-saving-slimline-pedalboards/dp/B08NVSXB8Y?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:16 #9 - Patch Cord With Neutrik Jacks Mogami (&#163;25.00)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Mogami-Patch-Cable-Neutrik-6-3mm/dp/B079J98STM?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:52 #10 - Minijack Patch Cables Mono (&#163;5.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Shop: ht