    description "&#127797; 10 Best Sensory Toys for Kids With Autism  (Glowart, Chewigem and More) | Lemongrass. Here are our editor picks:&#10;&#10;00:00 Introduction&#10;&#10;00:50 #1 - Neon Effect Drawing Board Glow Art (&#163;18.92)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Glow-Art-R3-BLK-Drawing-Board/dp/B01ASIFRWE?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;01:26 #2 - LED Projector UOUNE (&#163;36.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/LED-Projector-Lights-360%C2%B0Rotating-Christmas/dp/B087Q35NT7/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:00 #3 - Black Out Tent/Den for Sensory Stimulation Busy Blanket (&#163;69.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Busy-Blanket-Sensory-Stimulation-Autism/dp/B08563K566?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:41 #4 - Puppy Weighted Lap Pad Huggaroo (&#163;39.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Huggaroo-Weighted-Lap-Pad- Alternative/dp/B079Y6JHN6/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;03:20 #5 - Sensory Swing Harkla (&#163;69.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Harkla-Hanging-Swing-Chair-Kids/dp/B0192I7E2C/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;03:56 #6 - Dimpl Duo Fat Brain Toys (&#163;34.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Fat-Brain-Toys-FA-208-1/dp/B07F2MRD19/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:33 #7 - No Worries Aromatherapy Dough Modoh (&#163;5.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Mohdoh-Kids-Worries-50g-Aromatherapy/dp/B07ZZG3ZFD/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;05:08 #8 - Chewable Necklace Chewigem (&#163;14.95)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Chewigem-Raindrop-Necklace-Sensory-ADHD-Grn/dp/B00TE2E46G/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;05:39 #9 - Rebounder Trampoline for Kids With Handle LBLA (&#163;71.95)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/LBLA-Trampoline-Kids%EF%BC%8CAdjustable-Rebounder-Trampolines/dp/B07XCTPVV9/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:27 #10 - 23pc Sensory Fidget Stress Relief Toys Abzel (&#163;26.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Azbel-Toys-Stress-Relief-Assortment/dp/B08P9SVPRB/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;07:09 Ending&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;Thanks for watching!&#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE if you love the channel and follow our latest reviews https://studio.youtube.com/channel/UCqzOTu856n_BtYjiU9ZR0EQ?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;#SensoryToysforKidsWithAutism(Glowart,ChewigemandMore) #SensoryToysforKidsWithAutism(Glowart,ChewigemandMore)Review #Lemongrass&#10;------------------------------&#10;&#10;Great care must be taken when selecting a toy for a child on the autistic spectrum. While the wrong type of toy can lead to disinterest or even distress, the right one can soothe, relax, and educate. It's crucial, therefore, that you find a toy that provides your child with the right kind of sensory information.&#160;&#10;Fortunately, there is now a wide range of toys to accommodate any sensory diet, but that doesn&#8217;t mean they're easy to find, and parents will often need to sift through a lot of unsuitable products before they find a good fit. Luckily, we&#8217;ve done the hard work for you, and drafted a handy buying guide as well as a list of the best autism-friendly toys to buy online from Amazon and eBay.&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;&#10;Portions of footage found in this video are not original content produced by Lemongrass. Portions of stock footage of products were gathered from multiple sources including, manufactures, respected creators and various other sources.&#10;&#10;&#34;All claims, guarantees and product specifications are provided by the manufacturer or vendor. Lemongrass cannot be held responsible for these claims, guarantees or specifications&#34;&#10;&#10;Disclosure: Links are affiliate links to products. I may receive a small commission for purchases made through these links."
