    description "&#127797; 10 Best Smart Locks (Yale, Samsung, August Home and More) | Lemongrass. Here are our editor picks:&#10;&#10;00:00 Introduction&#10;&#10;00:54 #1 - Rain Proof Smart Lock Wolf Guard (&#163;100.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/TT01-Fingerprint-Password-Assistant-Security/dp/B08Z3J8XHZ?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;01:40 #2 - Keyless Connected Smart Door Lock Yale (&#163;94.00)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B01DE4DFM8?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:19 #3 - Conexis L1 Smart Keyless Door Handle Yale (&#163;199.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Yale-SD-L1000-CH-Composite-Standard-Compatible/dp/B07GH295G2?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:57 #4 - Q106 Bluetooth Smart Door Lock Pineworld (&#163;79.00)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/PINEWORLD-Bluetooth-Deadbolt- Remotely-Reversible/dp/B08X3M5CQG?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;03:33 #5 - Fingerprint Door Lock BIWIBON (&#163;69.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Fingerprint-BIWIBON-Digital-Left-Right-Adjustable/dp/B09D74TMJD/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:08 #6 - Linus Smart Lock Yale (&#163;219.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Yale-05-101200-MB-Keyless/dp/B08FMXG3LW?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:48 #7 - Smart Lock Pro + Connect Wi-Fi Bridge Bundle August Home (&#163;416.95)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/August-AUG-SL03-C02-S03-Connect-Bundle-Silver/dp/B0752VPHVK/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;05:27 #8 - Keyless Entry Smart Lock hornbill (&#163;223.10)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Keyless-Deadbolt-Digital-Electronic-Bluetooth/dp/B081JPJ8FW?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:01 #9 - Digital Smart Fingerprint Door Lock ConBlom (&#163;119.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Fingerprint-Electronic-Bluetooth-Deadbolt-Anti-peep/dp/B097BMLFN2/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:38 #10 - Smart Digital Door Lock Haifuan (&#163;139.00)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/HAIFUAN-Stainless-Digital-Aluminium-HFA5300-45/dp/B078Q1FJJF?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;07:12 Ending&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;Thanks for watching!&#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE if you love the channel and follow our latest reviews https://studio.youtube.com/channel/UCqzOTu856n_BtYjiU9ZR0EQ?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;#SmartLocks #SmartLocksReview #Lemongrass&#10;------------------------------&#10;&#10;Whether you're looking to upgrade your front door or office, or you're worried about general security measures, there are plenty of reasons to install a smart lock. This handy invention allows you to greatly increase the accessibility of a building without having to pay for an extra set of keys, plus you can easily keep track of all the people entering your property. You can even link them up to your Google Home or Amazon Alexa device!&#10;Choosing the right smart lock for your needs can be difficult, so we've rounded up the best options available to buy online in the UK from top brands like Yale, Samsung and August Home. If you're tired of fumbling around to find your keys and you'd rather just use an app, fingerprint scanner or keypad to gain entry, then it's definitely time for an up...&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;&#10;Portions of footage found in this video are not original content produced by Lemongrass. Portions of stock footage of products were gathered from multiple sources including, manufactures, respected creators and various other sources.&#10;&#10;&#34;All claims, guarantees and product specifications are provided by the manufacturer or vendor. Lemongrass cannot be held responsible for these claims, guarantees or specifications&#34;&#10;&#10;Disclosure: Links are affiliate links to products. I may receive a small commission for purchases made through these links."
