    step 1
    date "2022-07-10T03:59:56Z"
    title "&#127797; 10 Best Sci-Fi Books (Frank Herbert, Orson Scott Card and More)"
    description "&#127797; 10 Best Sci-Fi Books (Frank Herbert, Orson Scott Card and More) | Lemongrass. Here are our editor picks:&#10;&#10;00:00 Introduction&#10;&#10;00:58 #1 - The City We Became N. K. Jemisin (&#163;13.22)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/City-We-Became-N-Jemisin/dp/0356512665?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;01:39 #2 - The War of the Worlds H. G. Wells (&#163;5.95)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/War-Worlds-Vintage-Classics/dp/1784872113?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:30 #3 - The Call of Cthulhu and Other Weird Stories H. P. Lovecraft (&#163;8.15)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Call-Cthulhu-Other-Weird-Stories/dp/0141187069?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;03:14 #4 - Data Runner Sam A. Patel (&#163;11.61) &#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Data-Runner-Sam-Patel/dp/1626810842?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;03:59 #5 - Ender's Game Orson Scott Card (&#163;7.37)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Enders-Game-Ender-Orson-Scott/dp/0356500845?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:46 #6 - The Worm and His Kings Hailey Piper (&#163;8.30)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Worm-His-Kings-Hailey-Piper/dp/057877979X?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;05:29 #7 - When Gravity Fails George Effinger (&#163;11.11)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/WHEN-GRAVITY-FAILS-George-Effinger/dp/0765313588?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:16 #8 - Shorefall Robert Jackson Bennett (&#163;7.91)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Shorefall-Founders-Robert-Jackson-Bennett/dp/178648790X?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:56 #9 - Dune Frank Herbert (&#163;8.19)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Dune-Frank-Herbert/dp/0340960191?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;07:48 #10 - Ring Shout P. Dj&#232;l&#237; Clark (&#163;11.79)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/Ring-Shout-P-Dj%C3%A8l%C3%AD-Clark/dp/1250767024?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;08:34 Ending&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;Thanks for watching!&#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE if you love the channel and follow our latest reviews https://studio.youtube.com/channel/UCqzOTu856n_BtYjiU9ZR0EQ?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;#Sci-FiBooks #Sci-FiBooksReview #Lemongrass&#10;------------------------------&#10;&#10;The term Sci-Fi was popularised during the 1920s and has since gone on to blossom into one of the most popular genres in all forms of media. Referred to as the literature of ideas, science fiction explores imaginative future concepts such as advanced science and technology, space exploration, parallel universes and extraterritorial life, as well as the potential consequences on humankind.&#10;While all that might sound exciting, it can be somewhat daunting to find a route into the science fiction canon. After all, the talk of wormholes, space warfare and shapeshifting creatures can be somewhat daunting. To help out, we&#8217;ve created a buying guide so help you find the best sci-fi novels, short stories and literary classics in the UK, including our ranking of the top 10 best on Amazon and eBay!&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;&#10;Portions of footage found in this video are not original content produced by Lemongrass. Portions of stock footage of products were gathered from multiple sources including, manufactures, respected creators and various other sources.&#10;&#10;&#34;All claims, guarantees and product specifications are provided by the manufacturer or vendor. Lemongrass cannot be held responsible for these claims, guarantees or specifications&#34;&#10;&#10;Disclosure: Links are affiliate links to products. I may receive a small commission for purchases made through these links."
