    title "&#127797; 10 Best Universal Remotes (Logitech, One for All, and More)"
    description "&#127797; 10 Best Universal Remotes (Logitech, One for All, and More) | Lemongrass. Here are our editor picks:&#10;&#10;00:00 Introduction&#10;&#10;00:50 #1 - Contour TV One for All (&#163;11.49)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B01K1DQ2D4?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;01:27 #2 - U1 Universal Remote SofaBaton (&#163;84.46)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk//dp/B07XG1HT7G/?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:04 #3 - 4-in-1 Universal IR Learning Remote Inteset (&#163;28.95)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B00M4I1BAY?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;02:42 #4 - Harmony Elite Logitech (&#163;359.67)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B014GXQOJ2? tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;03:18 #5 - Essence 4 Universal Remote Control One for All (&#163;17.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B003NSIE40?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:00 #6 - Universal 8 in 1 Remote Control Hama (&#163;9.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B01KACNV80?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;04:38 #7 - 4-Device Universal Remote Control GE 34457 (&#163;14.94)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B06XH52NNM?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;05:24 #8 - Big Button TV Universal Remote Memo24 (&#163;12.95)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk//dp/B08D3Y767B?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:05 #9 - HandleEasy 321rc Universal Infrared Remote Control Doro (&#163;14.99)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B0014F2CJC?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;06:46 #10 - Universal Remote Control for Samsung TV BCE (&#163;6.15)&#10;&#128717;&#65039; Amazon: https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/B018MFVXN2?tag=lemongrass00-21&#10;&#10;07:25 Ending&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;Thanks for watching!&#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE if you love the channel and follow our latest reviews https://studio.youtube.com/channel/UCqzOTu856n_BtYjiU9ZR0EQ?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;#UniversalRemotes #UniversalRemotesReview #Lemongrass&#10;------------------------------&#10;&#10;Fed up with switching between the different remotes for each of the various devices that make up your home entertainment system? Or perhaps you just need a replacement for an old remote with a volume button that gets stuck every time you press it. A universal remote is the answer to all of your problems!&#10;As with anything technological, finding the right option for your setup can be a difficult task. Luckily, we&#8217;re here to help you work out what to look for in a universal remote. Whether you'd prefer to go for something cheap and cheerful with infrared learning or a hi-tech Bluetooth gadget that you can operate by downloading an app, we'll take you through the best universal remotes that sites like Amazon and Argos have to offer.&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;&#10;Portions of footage found in this video are not original content produced by Lemongrass. Portions of stock footage of products were gathered from multiple sources including, manufactures, respected creators and various other sources.&#10;&#10;&#34;All claims, guarantees and product specifications are provided by the manufacturer or vendor. Lemongrass cannot be held responsible for these claims, guarantees or specifications&#34;&#10;&#10;Disclosure: Links are affiliate links to products. I may receive a small commission for purchases made through these links."
