    title "Follow Along Leg Workout Using ONLY Mini Bands"
    description "Why Stretching Won't Make You Flexible - FREE report&#10;http://www.criticalbench.com/stretching/&#10;&#10;Looking for a brand new leg workout to try?  Add this Mini Band Leg Workout to your routine for a break with heavy weights.  &#10;&#10;This is a great routine during de-load weeks or for people trying to improve joint mobility and restore a balance in strength. Training for strength is awesome but sometimes you need a break from the heavy loads and give your body some high rep workout.&#10;&#10;Mini bands are great for versatility and offer a total body resistance workout. Or use them in your workout finishers... they are terrific for a 5 minute workout finisher for any area of the body!&#10;&#10;Thank you for watching the Critical Bench YouTube channel. Please like and subscribe to our channel and be sure to drop a comment or question for us.... we'd love to hear from you!&#10;&#10;#minibands #minibandworkout #minibandlegworkout #minibandlegexercises #miniband #minibandlowerbody #minibandglutes #minibandsthighs #minibandlegtraining #minibandcriticalbench #firmandtight #minibandworkouts #brianklepacki #criticalbench #minibandroutines"
