    title "WORKOUT 1- BOOTY BAND CHALLENGE"
    description "WELCOME to day 1 of the BABY FIT GYM booty band challenge!!&#10;&#10;Go Here to get your booty bands!!&#10;https://www.amazon.com/Baby-Fit-Gym-Resistance-Instructional/dp/B071CKCCQG/ref=sr_1_10?s=sports-and-fitness&#38;ie=UTF8&#38;qid=1500969961&#38;sr=1-10&#38;keywords=workout+bands&#10;&#10;This is a quick 15 minute workout! There are 5 exercises. You will repeat each exercise for 45 seconds with a 15 seconds rest. You will repeat through for a total of 3 rounds. &#10;&#10;Exercises:&#10;1. Side Step&#10;2. Front Leg Raise&#10;3. Side Step Squat Jump&#10;4. Shoulder Pulls&#10;4. Bicycles&#10;&#10;For Low Impact: &#10;Avoid the Jump in Side Step Squat Jumps&#10;&#10;For Pregnancy:&#10;Avoid the jump in Side Step Squat Jumps&#10;Avoid Bicycles- Switch to Donkey Kicks&#10;&#10;For Diastasis Recti&#10;Avoid Bicycles- Switch to a Side Plank (20 seconds each side)"
