    description "Consider signing up for Ad-free Upside-Down Pilates at &#10;https://vimeo.com/ondemand/upsidedownpilates&#10;Code &#34;Founders5&#34; for discount&#10;&#10;Subscribe for weekly pilates videos.  Leave a comment below if you did the workout.  For other pilates videos, view the full description below.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Upside-Down Pilates (http://www.UpsideDownPilates.com) is Honolulu's premiere pilates studio.  &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;This is lesson 60 of our TV show which has been on the air in Hawaii since 2008.  In this lesson we cover the foam roller.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;For the full 30 minute pilates lesson:&#13;&#10;Upside-Down Pilates - Lesson 60 - Full 30 Minute Lesson&#13;&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FxZJGZyLFpU&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;If you prefer to do this pilates lesson in parts:&#13;&#10;Upside-Down Pilates - Lesson 60 - Part 1 of 4&#13;&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6n_4hV9Lmms&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Upside-Down Pilates - Lesson 60 - Part 2 of 4&#13;&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7gNUOqqZ3Es&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Upside-Down Pilates - Lesson 60 - Part 3 of 4&#13;&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7ezTCgvrJGw&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Upside-Down Pilates - Lesson 60 - Part 4 of 4&#13;&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=esGn0HANtMg&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;To view the Playlist with all of the episodes we have uploaded click here:&#13;&#10;http://www.youtube.com/user/jefforig#grid/user/39630980A33EB4DC&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;To learn more about pilates and our studio visit http://www.UpsideDownPilates.com&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Ensure you get the latest videos and Click &#34;Subscribe&#34; at the top of the page.&#13;&#10;Also, Click the &#34;Thumbs Up/Like&#34; button.&#13;&#10;And leave us a comment to let us know how we are doing.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Jeff Orig produces, directs, shoots, and edits this show.  To learn more about Jeff visit http://www.OrigMedia.com&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Copyright 2011 Upside-Down Pilates, LLC"
