    description "Stretching exercises! Gentle stretching exercises in this 15 Minute Full Body Stretching Routine for flexibility and increased mobility. This Daily stretching routine suitable for beginners is essential for women over 50 because as we age we can loose 50% of our flexibility, causing stiffness in the body and soreness in our joints. This workout can be done as a daily morning stretch or an evening or post workout stretch.&#10;&#10;Do this daily stretching routine so you can keep your body fit, healthy and limber for many years to come #stayhome #staysafe&#10;&#10;Welcome to fabulous50s! Here you will find content that relates to how to look younger, mature skincare, anti aging, wrinkles, how to dress over 50, style, fitness, health and beauty over 50. All the videos here have you, a mature Woman in mind and if you have any questions or video suggestions for mature Women, please feel free to leave your comment below.&#10;________________________________________________________________________________________________________&#10; &#10;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;CLICK BELOW TO DOWNLOAD MY FREE &#8220;STAY YOUNGER LONGER&#8221; EBOOK - (Learn to F E E L G O O D &#38; L O O K G O O D over 50!) &#10;&#10140; http://eepurl.com/dxHX01 &#10;&#10;&#128170;7 DAY WORKOUT CHALLENGE FOR WOMEN OVER 50&#128170;&#10; https://fabulous50s.co/challenges/&#10;&#10;&#128293;14 DAY WORKOUT CHALLENGE FOR WOMEN OVER 50&#128293;&#10;https://fabulous50s.co/14-day-challenge/&#10;&#10;If you enjoyed this video, I think you will enjoy watching these videos next xx&#10; &#10;10 Minute Tone Your Arm Workout For Women Over 50 | Beginner Friendly&#10;&#10140; https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8E7cjvOit64&#10; &#10;10 Minute Ab Workout For Women Over 50 | Reduce Belly Fat Fast | Fabulous50s&#10;&#10140; https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pdC3OfWI5cw&#38;t=212s&#10; &#10;5 Minute Full Body Stretching Routine!&#10;&#10140; https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ferw4VhbN54&#10; &#10;__________