    title "11 MIN INTENSE AB WORKOUT IN BED I Get flat abs I Free workout challenge I Beginner friendly"
    description "Welcome to #challengemily #emigos! This is a first training from my free bed workout challenge! &#10;&#10;A quick &#38; intense 11 min workout to target your abs. You don't need any equipment and all training you can do staying in your bed! &#10;&#10;This is a part of my 16 days bed workout challenge. This challenge contains trainings straight out of the bed - for all &#8220;couch potatos&#8221; ;-). We&#8217;ll take the first small step to start big changes together.&#10;&#10;A 16 days program with #soemily is easier to commit to, and you can always do it again after you finish it!&#10;&#10;Enjoy this intense ab workout #emigos! Work in your bed and get amazing results!&#10;&#10;Find schedule for this challenge and sign up for free materials: workout calendar, measurement card and some tips for better results: www.soemily.com&#10;&#10;You don't need any equipment or weights. You can do full training staying in bed. The video is in full length, which means you can just follow whatever I&#8217;m doing. There are 30s rests in between series. If you need to pause longer - feel free to do so. If you don't need a break - skip them!&#10;&#10;Remember to subscribe and turn on the notifications button to join #emiverse. Use #challengemily and don&#8217;t forget to share your photos or videos progress so that I can create a results video at the end of the challenge.&#10;_______________&#10;&#10142; WWW https://www.soemily.com&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/so.emily_&#10;&#10142; Tik Tok https://www.tiktok.com/@so_emily_&#10;&#10142; Facebook https://www.facebook.com/SoEmilyy/ &#10;&#10142; Facebook group for support https://www.facebook.com/groups/soemily.challenge/ &#10;_______________&#10;More about me: I am Emily and I`m helping all my #emigos to work out their dream bodies, change everyday habits and way of looking at themselves. I am a personal trainer, dietitian and girlboss. With all others #emigos you can now experience this amazing energy, inspiration and support of our group, and take part in the challenges that I have prepared. If this is not enough - you can train from any place in the world, on personal training online with my trainers. Over the past few years I have helped hundreds of people. Thanks for your trust #emigo! Together we can do it!&#10;_______________&#10;Music: https://www.bensound.com"
