    date "2020-05-05T18:18:47Z"
    title "30 MIN LEG DAY AT HOME | apartment friendly, real time"
    description "HI GUYS! LEG DAY ROUND 2. Upper body and the most intense HIIT ever are on the way too. Just wanted to mention that if you feel any lower back pain during this, it is most likely because your hips are super tight and/or your glutes/hamstrings are a little bit weak! I have this problem sometimes too. During the glute bridges I was feeling some low pack tightness because of my tight hips. Do a hip thrust with your back elevated on the chair to help with this.&#10;&#10;For more workouts, outfits, life: @gabbyschey https://www.instagram.com/gabbyschey/ &#10;Twitter: gabbyschey https://twitter.com/gabbyschey &#10;&#10;Shop my swimwear: Knight Swimwear: https://knightswim.com/&#10;Instagram: @knightswim https://www.instagram.com/knightswim/&#10;&#10;All my gym outfits: https://alphalete.shop/gabbyscheyen or code: GABBY to support moi&#10;The only supplements I take: https://alaninu.com/gabby code: GABBY for free shipping on orders over $50 &#10;&#10;WORKOUT GUIDES: https://gabbygains.com/ ($10 guides!!)&#10;&#10;Filming camera: https://go.magik.ly/ml/uzzq/&#10;&#10;This video is not sponsored. Alphalete, Alani Nu, and rstyle/magik are affiliate links in which I get a small commission. bit.ly links are just shortened links, (no affiliations or commissions).&#10;I am not liable for any injuries or damages that occur during my workouts. Consult a doctor before beginning my workouts/any workout programs! :)"
