  node [
    id 3488
    label "emZ5lpruedA"
    step 1
    date "2020-10-12T01:37:25Z"
    title "60 MIN LEAN LEGS &#38; GLUTES - Thigh Burning + Booty Building&#128293;Burn 507 Calories&#128293;"
    description "LEAN LEGS &#38; GLUTES WORKOUT - Tone and tighten with this 60 minute lower body workout designed to help you build a round booty and tighten your thighs at home.&#10;&#10;There are 3 circuits that make up this leg day workout. Complete each circuit 2 x through 40 seconds work/20 seconds rest.&#10;&#10;You'll need access to a wall + box/bench or chair +Booty Band +variety of weighted dumbbells to complete this thigh burning workout. I used  1 set of 5kg + 7kg but you may want to use something lighter or heavier depending on your strength and fitness level.&#10;&#10;For more videos like this dumbbell booty building leg workout  make sure to hit subscribe and tick the notification bell so you never miss another leg workout at home or booty workout at home.&#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/PennyBarnshaw&#10;New Videos every: Monday, Wednesday &#38; Friday&#10;Subscriber Count: &#10;&#10;#legworkoutathome #bootyworkout #garagefitnessgirl&#10;&#10;If you like this 60 minute legs and glutes workout  out try these ones next:&#10;https://youtu.be/4LHv1XQ7x5c (30 MIN LEG BURNER)&#10;https://youtu.be/6tMGYZ-IVYo (40 MIN NO REPEAT LEG &#38; BOOTY)&#10;https://youtu.be/P-ffXkBgMMo (GLUTE &#38; HAMSTRING WORKOUT)&#10;&#10;GET MY FREE MONTHLY WORKOUT CALENDAR:&#10;https://garagefitnessgirl.com&#10;&#10;**GEAR I USE**&#10;(When available, I use affiliate links and may earn a commission at no additional cost to you)&#10;&#10;WORKOUT MAT: www.square36.com/ref/4/ (Use code: garagefitnessgirl10 for $10 off at checkout)&#10;MUSIC: https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/ayddbl/&#10;CAMERA: https://geni.us/HJ7RM  (Amazon Link)&#10;TRIPOD: https://geni.us/Euk4      (Amazon Link)&#10;MICROPHONE: https://geni.us/pW6ksjU  (Amazon Link)&#10;&#10;CHECK OUT MORE OF MY FAVOURITE THINGS: https://garagefitnessgirl.com/favorites/&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME&#10;Website: https://www.garagefitnessgirl.com&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/garagefitnessgirl/&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/pennyfitnessfastpt/?ref=bookmarks&#10;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.com.au/pbarnshaw/&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER&#10;This is my own personal workout and may not be suited for you. It is strongly recommend that you consult with your doctor before beginning this or any exercise program. By engaging in this exercise program, you agree that you do so at your own risk&#10;&#10;Thank You For Following Along&#10;Penny xo"
