    title "14 MIN OF INTENSE BUTT WORKOUT | The Best Booty and Side Booty Exercises &#127825; | No Equipment At Home"
    description "Booty, Booty, Booty! This is a great combination of glute max and glute med exercises that will get your booty burning! It includes 5 pre-fatigue supersets!&#10;&#10;&#129361; Diet tips: I always recommend to eat as healthy as possible and drink enough water throughout the day. If you want to put on muscle, increased calorie intake is important. As a tip - Grab a healthy option in between your meals like nuts, bananas, avocado, protein yogurt etc.&#10;&#10;&#129419; SHARE AND POST YOU PROGRESS PICTURES ON INSTAGRAM AND USE #getfitbyivana&#10;&#10;&#127752;  BOOTY BOOST PROGRAMS:&#10;https://www.getfitbyivana.com/exercise-programs-1&#10;Program designed by me and exercise physiologist to achieve the best results!&#10;&#10;&#127752; SUBSCRIBE to my BOYFRIEND'S Exercise Channel:  @getfitbyjayden  &#10;&#10;&#128247; Instagram: getfitbyivana_&#10;https://www.instagram.com/getfitbyivana_/?hl=en&#10;&#128038; Twitter: getfitbyivana&#10;https://twitter.com/getfitbyivana&#10;&#128233; Business Enquires: &#10;getfitbyivana@gmail.com&#10;&#10;Music by:&#10;1)&#10;Song: Nadro ft. Timmy Commerford &#38; Jaytee - Paradise&#10;Link: https://youtu.be/07jV-LfmTAM&#10;Released by Outertone. Promoted by FMW.&#10;2)&#10;Song: Sad Puppy - Thinking Of You&#10;Link: https://youtu.be/NJQeHaz_0SU&#10;Music promoted by FreeMusicWave.&#10;3)&#10;Song: NEFFEX - Here to Stay&#10;Link: https://youtu.be/9QQz9BbHvBY&#10;Music promoted by FreeMusicWave.&#10;4)&#10;Track: T &#38; Sugah x NCT - Stardust (feat. Miyoki) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5pfDp6Wrf6Y&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/stardust"
