  node [
    id 3491
    label "b2ApK-D_RKc"
    step 1
    date "2020-05-09T00:34:43Z"
    title "Ultimate Abs and Glutes Workout | No Equipment | Follow Along"
    description "Subscribe to my YouTube Fitness Channel here: https://youtube.com/c/carolinegirvan/?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;Ultimate Intense Abs and Glutes Workout in under 30 minutes with no equipment. Follow along with me.&#10;&#10;Hello everyone!&#10;&#10;Take 30 minutes of time to follow along to this ab and glute workout and you will be glad you did! &#10;&#10;We are going to work through movements to work your entire core, glutes all angles and hamstrings. No weighted equipment, just a mat and a small space.&#10;&#10;Each exercise is 30 seconds each. Once complete it&#8217;s straight onto the next! &#10;&#10;The first 6 minutes are solely core and abs, followed by 14 minutes of glute focus and finishing with 7 minutes core and abs again. &#10;&#10;Please ensure you adapt this workout to your level as are all different! Simply bend at knee and don&#8217;t come down to floor as far to reduce difficulty. &#10;&#10;And remember &#8216;mind to muscle&#8217; connection &#10;throughout as you are trying to squeeze your core or glute muscles with every single rep! &#10;&#10;I hope you all enjoy this workout as much as I did!&#10;&#10;Cx"
