    label "kCvoZuneB5Q"
    step 1
    date "2021-09-09T09:32:30Z"
    title "60 MIN DUMBBELL BOOTY / LEG WORKOUT - Grow Your Glutes at Home - Summer Shred Day 18"
    description "This is an intense butt lift, pump, and round 60 min home workout. These grow your booty and glutes exercises will help you get a round, shaped, perky, and lifted bum from home. For the best butt workout results, do this with good nutrition and grab the heaviest dumbbells you have. This is Day 18 of Summer Shred Workout Challenge.&#10;&#10;(This workout has repeated exercises :) 4 CIRCUITS (15 MINS EACH CIRCUIT) they're fun and super effective so don't let that discourage you! It's all mental! YOU VS YOU)&#10;&#10;Workout Details&#10;&#10;&#9656; Strength Training&#10;&#9656; Level: Beginner, Intermediate, Advanced&#10;&#9656; Muscles Worked: Glutes, Quads, Hamstrings, Core&#10;&#9656; Time: Warm up + 60 Minutes + Cool Down&#10;&#9656; Equipment: Dumbbell, Chair / Bench&#10;&#10;&#9825;  CODE 'CELAMARR' to save 45% on your entire order.&#10;This is the link to the &#34;MYPROTEIN PRO SAMPLE BOX&#34; &#10;https://us.myprotein.com/sports-nutrition/myprotein-pro-sample-box/12683475.html&#10;&#10;&#9825; Summer Shred workout challenge https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLPYEagU956f8glNdsGW-L_0F8kztGD9Rg&#10;&#10;&#9825;  The Gear I Use: &#10;Camera: https://amzn.to/2WOsIeF&#10;Lens: https://amzn.to/3uOs4ui&#10;Tripod: https://amzn.to/2ZTIdDc&#10;Macbook Pro: https://amzn.to/2Yt13jK&#10;&#10;&#9825; SUBSCRIBE: https://bit.ly/2QV1PTw&#10;&#9825; Instagram: https://bit.ly/3oN6p2G&#10;&#9825; Tiktok: https://bit.ly/3wBvxfc&#10;&#10;&#9825; My Music: https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/oesy94/&#10;&#10;IMPORTANT DISCLAIMER: Celamarr strongly recommends that you consult with your physician before beginning any exercise program. You should be in good physical condition and be able to participate in the exercise. Celamarr is not a licensed medical care provider and represents that she has no expertise in diagnosing, examining, or treating medical conditions of any kind, or in determining the effect of any specific exercise on a medical condition. Some titles and descriptions may include certain SEO keywords that may be perceived as misleading or may be perceived as a guaranteed result. Results vary from person to person and a video title/description/thumbnail should not be taken as absolute truth.&#10;&#10;#WORKOUT #ABS #FITNESS #FLATSTOMACH #11LINEABS #HOURGLASS #HOURGLASSCHALLENGE #30DAYSWORKOUT #ABWORKOUT #ABWORKOUTS #CARDIO #EXERCISE #HIIT #WORKOUTS #HOMEWORKOUT #FATLOSS #LOWERABS #OBLIQUES #UPPERABS #SIDEABS #GLUTES #BOOTY #FLATBELLY"
