    step 1
    date "2022-06-01T16:19:22Z"
    title "15 MIN. No Jumping Cardio Workout for Weight Loss | Beginner Friendly Cardio"
    description "Are you looking for a full body training without jumping exercises? Great news then, here it is! &#128153;&#9889;&#65039;&#10024;&#10;&#10;A great possibility to train your whole body, to sweat really good while not creating too much pressure on your joints. A new 15 minute HIIT - which is a High-Intensity Interval Training, gives your entire body, especially your heart and core, a great workout. Moreover, this no jumping cardio routine is a good option to get you sweating and burning those calories without raising the noise level = neighbor friendly! &#10;&#10;This training consists of 17 exercises which are done for 45 seconds with 10 seconds of active rest in between. &#10;&#10;During this training we are targeting our core, upper and lower body muscles. While doing each exercise - make sure that you engage your muscles and do not feel any painful sensations in your body. &#10;&#10;No equipment is needed, so it is a perfect variant for your at home (or wherever you like) training. &#10;&#10;Be active. Be inspired. And now let&#8217;s start! &#128153;&#9889;&#65039;&#10;&#10;My Instagram: &#10;https://www.instagram.com/olyakrr/&#10;&#10;If you want to help me and share this training with your friends (Much appreciated&#128522;) :&#10;https://youtu.be/-z4ziN_F_mY&#10;&#10;0:00 Start&#10;0:13 Squat to Leg Circle&#10;1:09 Low Impact Burpees&#10;2:04 Overstep Lunge to Squat&#10;2:59 Plie with Oblique Crunches&#10;3:54 Plie Calf Raises&#10;4:49 Squat + Knee to Elbow Crunch&#10;5:45 Side Lunge + Toe Touch R&#10;6:39 Side Lunge + Toe Touch L&#10;7:33 2 Mountain Climbers + 2 Crossed MC&#10;8:28 Crab Toe Touches&#10;9:24 Spider Plank Crunch&#10;10:20 2 Hip Dips to Left Side Plank Lift&#10;11:14 2 Hip Dips to Right Side Plank Lift&#10;12:11 Cycling Crunches&#10;13:04 Floor Touch Squat + Toe Raises&#10;13:59 Rainbow Crunches&#10;14:54 Butt Kicks&#10;Mission Complete! &#10;&#10;Get Don't Be Shy by Ti&#235;sto, KAROL G here https://lickd.lnk.to/k0NeW1ID!Olya%20TV&#10;&#10;License ID: DbNYmKRe72O&#10;&#10;Get this and other songs for your next YouTube video at https://lickd.co&#10;&#10;Get Heartbreaker by Daniel Blume here https://lickd.lnk.to/uFmbMoID!Olya%20TV&#10;&#10;License ID: O4exJKvPXqb&#10;&#10;Get this and other songs for your next YouTube video at https://lickd.co&#10;&#10;Get Too Many Nights by 220 KID, JC Stewart here https://lickd.lnk.to/lAAmbXID!Olya%20TV&#10;&#10;License ID: 9AylQz23rK4&#10;&#10;Get this and other songs for your next YouTube video at https://lickd.co&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;In order to avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health before doing the exercises. Performing any fitness exercises without supervision, is at your own risk. Please take&#10;professional advices of a fitness professional. Olya TV will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video.&#10;&#10;#sport &#10;#homeworkout &#10;#nojumping"
