    title "Standing ABS Workout: Lose Belly Fat At Home"
    description "In losing belly fat, I know you guys are more inclined to do crunches or super mans, routines that make you lie down while you press and grind your belly fat to perfection. But did you know that there are routines that you can do while standing up that help burn belly fat and tone your belly to reveal your abs muscles? &#10;&#10;That's right! And in today's workout video you're going to be doing these exercises and they're really helpful too in strengthening your core and lower body muscles. These routines will help you reach your goal and spicing up your usual core game.&#10;&#10;Good luck and make sure to exercise on a daily basis to see results quicker!&#10084;&#65039;&#128170;&#10;&#10;**If you want to be notified when I upload a new video, make sure to subscribe to our channel. I upload new videos everyday from Sunday to Friday!"
