    title "FLAT TUMMY Workout &#9829; Melt Belly Fat in 10 Minutes! (Standing No Jump HIIT workout)"
    description "Let's melt those belly fats with this 10 minute Flat Tummy Workout! A standing no jumping HIIT workout that is sure to leave you drenched in sweat!&#10;&#10;SHOP MY BOOTY BANDS (resistance bands) here:&#10;https://www.docadamshop.com.ph/collections/simplyfit-bands&#10;and use my 10% discount code &#34;SIMPLYPINAY&#34;.&#10;Also available in Lazada&#10;Pink Purple Hot Pink set: https://bit.ly/3qvZWZV&#10;Black White Gray set: https://bit.ly/3dl1ja0&#10;&#10;MY WORKOUT CLOTHES&#10;leggings: https://bit.ly/3tZ24eO&#10;short leggings: https://bit.ly/37nMq37&#10;&#10;MY KITCHEN ESSENTIALS&#10;digital food scale: https://bit.ly/3dgIlS1&#10;microwavable food container: https://bit.ly/3bdiHLd&#10;measuring cups and spoons: https://bit.ly/3qrJJoJ&#10;portable blender: https://www.docadamshop.com.ph/simplypinay (discount code: SIMPLYPINAY)&#10;&#10;SHOP MY FIT &#38; HEALTHY DIET MEAL PLAN E-BOOK:&#10;https://www.facebook.com/1271764659529544/posts/pfbid0yN4z1i6KjE1useVmxXquzBjWar4LbV1SYpdy4rz2Uxh8taAAahEbJ7nAUVPthcV6l/&#10;&#10;Warm Up with Me: https://youtu.be/SMBr883RE3E&#10;&#10;Cool Down with Me: https://youtu.be/MweKG30rDnw&#10;&#10;FAQ: &#34;Ilang calories ang nabburn sa workout na 'to?&#34;&#10;Answer: Gagamit ka po ng fitness watch para malaman mo kung ilan ang calories na nabburn mo sa exercise kasi iba iba po kada individual. The heavier you are the more calories you burn, the lighter you are, the less. &#10;&#10;That's why I don't recommend you count the calories you burn. Hindi po sya practical eh. I suggest you focus on your calorie intake. Yun ang kontrolado natin at pwede natin ma track.&#10;&#10;If you want a specific number, on average around 200 calories per 10 minute session ang isang HIIT tulad nito. But again hindi yan exact. Depende parin sa weight, height, metabolism and other factors. &#128522;&#10;&#10;#flattummyworkout #abworkout #hiitworkout&#10;----------&#10;MUSIC&#10;&#10;Latin Industries by Kevin McLeod&#10;&#10;Papaya by tubebackr https://soundcloud.com/tubebackr&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution-NoDerivs 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY-ND 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://bit.ly/l-papaya&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/S5FbZACQhLM&#10;&#10;My Old East Coast (feat. Melanie) by Vendredi &#10;https://soundcloud.com/vendrediduo&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://bit.ly/my-old-east-cast&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library  https://youtu.be/XBkLTNGr6C8&#10;&#10;Here I Am (feat. Sphere) by Vendredi https://soundcloud.com/vendrediduo&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://bit.ly/l-here-i-am&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/mS45dLfqA7U&#10;&#10;&#10;Mamacita by Mike Leite https://soundcloud.com/mikeleite &#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY 3.0 &#10;Free Download / Stream: http://bit.ly/_mamacita&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/8YIJLkOYiBk&#10;&#10;&#10;----------&#10;&#10;Follow me on Socials!&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/kataglipay&#10;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/katrinaaglipay&#10;&#10;----------&#10;&#10;I'm Kat Aglipay, I create beauty and fitness videos that inspire and improve the lives of Pinays - including the topic of weight loss cause that's where I struggled a lot during my younger years. &#10;&#10;I love shopping yet I know how to save and currently considering going minimal! I love clothes and makeup. I love FOOD!&#10;&#10;----------&#10;&#10;COMMENT POLICY:&#10;Kahit sino welcome dito sa channel at malayang magcomment sa bawat video. Pero dahil ang Simply Pinay ay isang positive community, ang mga negative, rude, narrow minded and offensive comments ay idedelete kaagad. You may express your opinion in a respectful way. Constructive criticism done in a polite way is considered and encouraged. Let's spread only love and positivity!&#10;&#10;----------&#10;&#10;For brand partnerships and collaborations, flick me an e-mail at katrinaaglipay@gmail.com"
