  node [
    id 3540
    label "j7peK6LH4NY"
    step 1
    date "2022-04-19T08:23:25Z"
    title "Pilates Bar Upper Body Workout"
    description "I often get asked by clients for exercises that will strengthen their upper body, give tone and definition to their arms &#38; shoulders. So with that in mind, I have created this video. &#10;&#10;Be patient &#8230;. Listen to my cues &#8230;. Be sure to engage your core to stabilise your spine and hips and let&#8217;s isolate the work to achieve our goal. Your arms and shoulders will feel the burn. When you get tired, rest rather than starting to use your spine movements to assist . &#10;&#10;By the end of the workout, you will find the effort &#38; work that&#8217;s gone into completing the workout. &#10;&#10;Repeat&#8230;.repeat&#8230;.repeat and let&#8217;s keep getting stronger.&#10;&#10;Treat yourself to my favourite outfit to do Pilates in&#10;(affiliate link, I get a small payment if you buy something)&#10;&#128073; https://conturuk.com/?ref=DonnaFinnie (affiliate link)&#10;&#10;Anyone following this class does so at their own risk. It is your personal responsibility to work safely and within your own limits.&#10;&#10;Subscribe for regular Pilates workouts:&#10;&#128073; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmUxqJ_KuN6GQFc0Tg2o-XQ?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;Connect with me via:&#10;&#128073; http://instagram.com/pilatesmovesyou&#10;&#128073; http://www.facebook.com/pilatesmovesyou&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;#pilates"
    channel_title "Pilates with Donna Finnie"
    channel_id "UCmUxqJ_KuN6GQFc0Tg2o-XQ"
