    title "At home Pilates bar Love Handle Shredding Workout"
    description "Hello my CaliFitt Friends,&#10;&#10;       Today I have prepared an at home Pilates bar love handle exercise for you all to complete ! This workout will challenge you in terms of speed, core, and balance. Some of the exercises that will be performed in today&#8217;s video include, ab twist and crunch, side reaches, etc. Please pay close attention to my form and technique, because you do not want to acquire any unnecessary injuries to the body. If you need to modify any exercises please feel free to do so. Do not compromise form or safety for the amount of reps that you complete ! It is actually better to do a smaller amount of reps correctly, than to do more and they&#8217;re done improperly. Once again, I would like to thank you all for believing in me, and the CaliFitt vision, and dream. Don&#8217;t forget to please like, comment, share, and subscribe to the CaliFitt Family channel. Hit that post notification bell &#128276; if you would like to be notified whenever I post a new video ! Your bell will be ringing often lol ! CaliFitt CaliFitt CaliFitt Boom &#128165; Boom &#128165; Boom &#128165; Let&#8217;s GOoOoOoO &#8252;&#65039;&#8252;&#65039;#gymshark &#10;&#10;Workout clothes from @gymshark&#10;&#10;I do not have or own the rights to any of the music that is played within my workout video. Below is the requested and required information regarding both the artist and creators of the music played within my video. None of this music is owned by me ! &#10;1. NCS Dream by Di Young https://youtu.be/TiC7_167hQ0&#8203;&#10;Creative Commons Attribution license&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://bit.ly/-ncs-dream&#8203;&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/vE7GJnq0jHQ&#8203;&#10;2. Track: Different Story VIP &#8212; Another Kid [Audio Library Release]&#10;Music provided by Audio Library Plus&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/qLlB0N5UtGc&#8203;&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://alplus.io/different-story-vip&#8203;&#10;3. Neutrin05 - Missing You&#34; is under a Creative Commons (CC BY-SA 3.0) license&#10;Music promoted by BreakingCopyright: https://bit.ly/b-missing-you&#8203;"
