  node [
    id 3553
    label "yiLLewJ575o"
    step 1
    date "2021-01-29T17:36:31Z"
    title "At Home Pilates Bar Ab Workout"
    description "Hello my CaliFitt friends,&#10;&#10;     Today I am more than excited to bring to you all another Pilates Bar Ab Workout!! This workout will target your core muscles. It will require you to engage your core in order to complete each workout effectively. If I had to choose a favorite type of workout, then I would have to go for a good Ab workout ! Another great thing about this workout is that you do not have to worry about getting up and down to perform your exercises. Just stay right on the floor, until it&#8217;s time to stretch ! We are on the road to 600 subscribers!! Wohooo, and I couldn&#8217;t be even more grateful! Thank you all for your love and support. I humbly appreciate you all. Scroll to the bottom for information regarding each exercise that will be performed today ! #gymshark&#10;&#10;Workout clothes from @gymshark&#10;&#10;I do not have or own any rights to the music played within my video. Below are the listed songs and required information for both the artist and creators of the music. &#10;&#10;1. Tonight by Rexlambo https://soundcloud.com/rexlambo&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://bit.ly/-tonight&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/Lct7aahfiMM&#10;2. JPB - High [NCS Release] https://youtu.be/Tv6WImqSuxA&#10;https://soundcloud.com/jpb&#10;https://www.facebook.com/jpbmusic&#10;https://www.instagram.com/jpbofficial&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds &#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/R8ZRCXy5vhA&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;The following information concludes each exercise that will be performed in this video .....&#10;1. Flutter Kicks &#10;2. Heel Taps &#10;3. Leg Kick (L)&#10;4.Leg Kick (R)&#10;5. 2 Leg Ab Crunch &#10;Each exercise will be performed on the floor for 40 seconds each, and 20 seconds rest in between! We will then repeat each exercise &#38; then it will be time to stretch &#10;Stretches Include :&#10;1.  Forward Stretch and Hold (Halfway)&#10;2. Spine Stretch &#10;3. Shoulder outward stretch &#38; breath&#10;4. Spine Stretch / Lower back stretch &#10;5. Forward stretch with fingers interlocked &#10;6. Wide legs Hamstring Stretch &#10;7. Place hands on floor continue to stretch &#10;8. Butt Up forward stretch on tippie toes with slight rocking movement &#10;9. Bring body and arms up breath in&#10;10. Arms down breath out &#10;11. And Bow ! &#10;&#10;I hope this information is useful to you all !"
