  node [
    id 3554
    label "_z6jnH01-Is"
    step 1
    date "2021-03-25T12:47:50Z"
    title "At home Full Body Pilates Bar Workout : Good for beginners !"
    description "Hello my CaliFitt Friends,&#10;  &#10;          Today I have prepared yet another pilates bar workout video for you all to complete with me. There is not a lot of jumping, but if you feel any discomfort while jumping please do not complete the exercise ! There is one exercise where I squat &#38; jump up three times. If it is too uncomfortable for you to jump, just keep squatting. You could also decide to add alternating kicks to the front or back in replacement of the jump. Some of the exercises that will be performed in todays workout video include squats, lunges, leg pikes. You will be challenged to use proper form, and technique to balance your body while standing. Each exercise performed in todays workout video is only standing !! I know that you all love the only standing workout videos, so I am trying my best to be more creative with your exercises ! If you have any questions or concerns, please feel free to send me a message at any time ! CaliFitt Family Let&#8217;s GOOoOoOoOoOoO&#128165;&#10084;&#65039;&#8252;&#65039; I would like to take the time to thank you all for your love, and support ! CaliFitt CaliFitt CaliFitt Boom &#128165; Boom &#128165; Boom &#128165; Let&#8217;s GOoOOOooOOoOoOooOOoO&#128165;&#10084;&#65039;&#8252;&#65039;&#10;              Workout clothes from #gymshark &#10;I do not have or own the rights to any of the music that is played within my workout video. Below I have left the required, and requested information below for both the artist, and creators of the music. Once again, this music does not belong to me. Please feel free to click any of the links, in order to contact the artist or creators of the music.&#10;  1.  &#34;Neutrin05 - Missing You&#34; is under a Creative Commons (CC BY-SA 3.0) license&#10;Music promoted by BreakingCopyright: https://bit.ly/b-missing-you&#8203;&#10;2. Persuasion (Instrumental) by RYYZN https://soundcloud.com/ryyzn&#8203;&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported  &#8212; CC BY 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://bit.ly/-persuasion&#8203;&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/DWjFW7Yq1fA&#10;3. Track: Wanderlust &#8212; extenz [Audio Library Release]&#10;Music provided by Audio Library Plus&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/Tc41iHPxHGQ&#8203;&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://alplus.io/e-wanderlust&#8203;"
