    title "Pilates Bar Core / Glutes Workout | 25 minute Home Workout"
    description "Not got a Pilates bar? They're available from: https://geni.us/AmazonPilatesBar&#10;&#10;You will need a mat, Pilates Bar and possibly a cushion or Pilates ball for this workout. &#10;&#10;We will work through a series of exercises to challenge our core strength and fire up our glutes. I want you to carefully listen to my verbal cues and keep checking your position on the mat, ensuring you maintain good alignment. &#10;&#10;At the end of this workout, I can guarantee you will have felt challenged and had fun. &#10;&#10;Let&#8217;s get moving. Let&#8217;s work towards a stronger, more confident you. &#10;&#10;&#10;Treat yourself to my favourite outfit to do Pilates in&#10;(affiliate link, I get a small payment if you buy something)&#10;&#128073; https://conturuk.com/?ref=DonnaFinnie (affiliate link)&#10;&#10;Anyone following this class does so at their own risk. It is your personal responsibility to work safely and within your own limits.&#10;&#10;Subscribe for regular Pilates workouts:&#10;&#128073; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmUxqJ_KuN6GQFc0Tg2o-XQ?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;Connect with me via:&#10;&#128073; http://instagram.com/pilatesmovesyou&#10;&#128073; http://www.facebook.com/pilatesmovesyou&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;#pilates"
