    title "At home Pilates Bar Booty Toning Exercise"
    description "Hello my CaliFitt Friends,&#10;     &#10;     I am so excited !! Today I have prepared an at home Pilates Bar Booty exercise for you all to complete with me ! This exercise will target not only your glutes, but also your abs, and much of your lower body. I can honestly say that I am feeling the pain from this workout, and that&#8217;s what I love. If you&#8217;re looking to tone that booty, then this is the workout for you. Don&#8217;t forget to like, comment, share, and subscribe to my channel ! Please hit that post notification bell so you can be notified as soon as I drop a new video ! We are on the road to 500 subscribers, and I couldn&#8217;t be even more grateful for this opportunity. I&#8217;m so glad that we have come together on this journey to share our love for fitness  and a more healthy lifestyle. Sending you all love ! &#10;Yours Truly, CaliFitt!!!!!! #gymshark &#10;&#10;Workout clothes from @gymshark&#10;&#10;Below is the music played within my workout video. I do not have or own any of the rights to the music played within my workout video. Below I have placed the required and requested information to both the artist and creators of the music.&#10;1. JPB - High [NCS Release] https://youtu.be/Tv6WImqSuxA&#10;https://soundcloud.com/jpb&#10;https://www.facebook.com/jpbmusic&#10;https://www.instagram.com/jpbofficial&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds &#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/R8ZRCXy5vhA&#10;2. Waited (instrumental) by RYYZN https://soundcloud.com/ryyzn&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported  &#8212; CC BY 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://bit.ly/al-waited&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/jJg0_gG-nCc"
