    step 1
    date "2021-02-23T08:14:30Z"
    title "Let's WALK! Light Dumbbell Toning WEIGHT LOSS Workout &#127811; Pahla B Fitness"
    description "ALL standing, NO jumping | LIGHT dumbbells | MODERATE day | INCLUDES warm up and cool down&#10;&#10;Start LOSING WEIGHT TODAY with my FREE eBook - The 5-0 Method, Weight Loss for Women over 50:  https://pahlabfitness.com/weight-loss-over-50/&#10;&#10;It&#8217;s March&#127811;, and we&#8217;re taking on an efficient CARDIO TONING workout today to bring out our best&#128522;!   It&#8217;s one of my favorite workouts: WALKING WITH (very light) WEIGHTS. &#10;&#10;Find the 7-Day MARCH Workout Series in this playlist:  http://bit.ly/march7dayseries&#10;&#10;We&#8217;re using our lightest dumbbells (or no weights at all!) for this MODERATE routine, but of course there&#8217;s just a pinch&#129295; of challenge to keep us on our toes&#128099;.&#10;&#10;While we&#8217;re moving, we&#8217;re chatting about that word &#8220;MODERATE,&#8221; and I&#8217;m sharing tips for finding your sweet spot&#127855; and revealing the number one thing you can do to get the MOST out of each workout you do.&#10;&#10;Whether you&#8217;re on a quest to LOSE WEIGHT, GAIN FITNESS, or GET STRONGER, this workout will get you everywhere you want to go&#127758;!  Join me now!&#10;&#10;SHOPPING INFO:&#10;Get my exact 3-pair Dumbbell Set (affiliate link):  https://amzn.to/2vkvMkg&#10;Grab this comfy DISBEST tank top (affiliate link):  https://amzn.to/3fO3WiX&#10;Shop these COOLOMG leggings (affiliate link):  https://amzn.to/30xWwKv&#10;&#10;SET UP:&#10;Timer is set for intervals of 30 seconds; there are five mini circuits of four exercises each; complete each circuit twice before moving on; there is NO REST&#10;&#10;WARM UP&#10;&#10;EXERCISES:&#10;Mini Circuit 1&#10;Walking&#10;Airplane Arm Side Tappers&#10;Low Swinging Tappers&#10;Toy Soldiers&#10;&#10;Mini Circuit 2&#10;Walking&#10;Windmill Tap Backs&#10;Side Punch Step Backs&#10;Booty Kicker Jacks&#10;&#10;Mini Circuit 3&#10;Walking&#10;Forward Hinge Arm Flappers&#10;Tricep Curl Downs&#10;Dancing Xs&#10;&#10;Mini Circuit 4&#10;Walking&#10;Can Cans&#10;Daybreaks&#10;Butter Churns&#10;&#10;Mini Circuit 5&#10;Walking&#10;Drinky Bird Jacks&#10;Ding Dongs&#10;Cheerleader Kicks&#10;&#10;FINISHER:&#10;Super Slow Front Punch Front Kick (alternating sides)&#10;&#10;COOL DOWN&#10;&#10;&#128517; EXTENDED WALKING COOL DOWN:  https://youtu.be/tk6oIzlx1SE&#10;&#10;Everything You NEED TO KNOW about WEIGHT LOSS at 50 and Beyond:  https://youtu.be/tqcJM2kANQA&#10;&#10;Thanks so much for working out with me - be sure to LIKE, COMMENT and SHARE the video with your friends!  See you tomorrow.&#128155;&#10;&#10;Some sound effects provided by https://www.zapsplat.com/&#10;&#10;// FOLLOW&#10;&#10;&#128029; Killer B Hive Facebook Group:  https://goo.gl/fqtMXU&#10;&#127760; Website:  http://pahlabfitness.com/&#10;&#10;&#10;// RESOURCES&#10;&#10;&#128198; WORKOUT PROGRAMS &#10157; http://bit.ly/KBWorkoutPrograms&#10;&#128092; SHOP KILLER B MERCH &#10157; http://bit.ly/shopkb&#10;&#128722; MY FAVES FROM AMAZON &#10157; http://bit.ly/KBamazon&#10;&#10;// SUPPORT&#10;&#10;&#129309; PATREON &#10157; https://www.patreon.com/PahlaBFitness&#10;&#128519; PAYPAL (One Time Donation) &#10157;  http://paypal.me/PahlaBFitness&#10;&#10;&#10;// PODCAST&#10;&#10;&#127911; YouTube &#10157; https://www.youtube.com/c/TheFitnessMattersPodcast&#10;&#127911; iTunes &#10157; http://bit.ly/FitnessMatters&#10;&#127911; SoundCloud &#10157; http://bit.ly/SCFitnessMatters&#10;&#127911; Spotify &#10157; http://bit.ly/SPFitnessMatters&#10;&#127911; Stitcher &#10157; http://bit.ly/STFitnessMatters&#10;&#127911; Google Play &#10157; http://bit.ly/GPFitnessMatters&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10084;  Pahla B - your BEST fitness friend! &#10084;"
