    title "Pilates Bar Workout at Home"
    description "Today I have prepared a seventeen minute workout video. This workout can be completed right in the comfort of your home. This workout will target your arms, glutes, shoulders, and etc. I hope you all enjoy this video. Please don&#8217;t forget to like, comment, share, turn on that notification bell, as well as subscribe ! Thank you all for your support, CaliFitt.  #TABATA #GYMSHARK &#10;&#10;Workout Clothes are from : @https://www.gymshark.com/&#10;@gymshark&#10;&#10;The music used in this video is not mine. Below I have given credit to all of the music used in today&#8217;s video.&#10;&#10;1. Good For You by THBD https://soundcloud.com/thbdsultan&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported&#8212; CC BY 3.0 &#10;Free Download / Stream: http://bit.ly/2PgU6Mu&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/-K_YSjqKgvQ&#10;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#10;&#10;&#127925; Track Info:&#10;&#10;Title: Good For You by THBD&#10;Genre and Mood: Dance &#38; Electronic + Happy&#10;&#10;2. Trick or Treat (instrumental) by RYYZN https://soundcloud.com/ryyzn&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported  &#8212; CC BY 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://bit.ly/l_trick-or-treat&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/uNPXJ9CDzbc&#10;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#10;&#10;&#127925; Track Info:&#10;&#10;Title: Trick or Treat (instrumental) by RYYZN&#10;Genre and Mood: Hip Hop &#38; Rap + Dark&#10;&#10;3. Track: Wanderlust &#8212; extenz [Audio Library Release]&#10;Music provided by Audio Library Plus&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/Tc41iHPxHGQ&#10;Free Download / Stream: http