    title "Full Body 20 Minute Loop Band Workout | Resistance Band Workout, Mini Band Workout, At Home,  Bands"
    description "Full Body 20 Minute Loop Band Workout | Resistance Band Workout, Mini Band Workout, At Home,  Bands&#10;&#10;&#10006; FIND ME:&#10;&#9633; Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/abbeyyung/&#10;&#9633; Tik Tok: https://www.tiktok.com/@abbeyyung&#10;&#9633; Business Inquiries Only: abigailyung@gmail.com&#10;&#10;&#10006; MY MERCH &#38; LIGHTROOM PRESET FILTERS: https://abbey-yung.myshopify.com/&#10;&#10;&#10006; SHOP MY FAVES &#38; SAVE:&#10;&#9633; Shop My Beauty Favorites: https://shoplist.us/abbeyyung&#10;&#9633; Shop My Amazon Favorites: https://www.amazon.com/shop/abbeyyung&#10;&#9633; 20% off DRMTLGY: https://www.drmtlgy.com/?ref=3820008.5c97fc&#10;&#9633; 25% off Skin Store: https://tidd.ly/36mSiYP (&#8220;ABBEY&#8221;)&#10;&#9633; Yesstyle Discount: https://ys.style/75XrM5HxZcb (&#38; &#8220;ABBEYYUNG&#8221; for extra discounts)&#10;&#9633; Stylevana Discount: https://vana.ly/xl5e05 &#10;&#9633; 10% off 1st Lights Lacquer Order = ABBEY10: https://lightslacquer.com/&#10006; FIND ME:&#10;&#9633; Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/abbeyyung/&#10;&#9633; Tik Tok: https://www.tiktok.com/@abbeyyung&#10;&#9633; Business Inquiries Only: abigailyung@gmail.com&#10;&#10;RESISTANCE BANDS IN THIS VIDEO: https://amzn.to/2XAJJH7&#10;&#10;MORE REAL TIME WORKOUTS:&#10;REAL TIME CORE WORKOUT: https://youtu.be/GiXewyQQp1o&#10;REAL TIME FULL BODY WORKOUT: https://youtu.be/r5crez-_n9s&#10;REAL TIME PILATES INSPIRED WORKOUT: https://youtu.be/juxm-6-XjSg&#10;REAL TIME DUMBBELLS ONLY WORKOUT: https://youtu.be/neYV4EnEbcw&#10;&#10;#athomeloopbandworkout&#10;#loopresistancebands&#10;#loopbands&#10;#athomebootybandsworkout&#10;#loopbandworkout&#10;#20minutebandworkout&#10;#workout&#10;#workoutvideo&#10;#20minuteworkout&#10;#resistancebandworkout&#10;#fullbodyresistancebandoworkout&#10;#fullbodyworkout&#10;#fitness&#10;#femalefitnessmotivation&#10;#athomeworkout&#10;&#10;Video Overview: &#10;This workout video is a real time at home 20 minute full body workout. It was created and is guided by an NASM Certified Personal Trainer (me!). This is a muscle toning workout that requires only resistance band (also called booty bands &#38; loop bands), and no other equipment. This sweaty circuit will get your heart rate up with no jumping, but instead utilizing the resistance and muscle burning effect of loop resistance bands to build lean muscle mass. In this full body workout, we'll be targeting major muscle groups: Quads, Hamstrings, Glutes, Core / Abs, Shoulders, Chest, Back, and Biceps. This beginner friendly workout video is a timed with a circuit countdown timer and also has music included. This circuit can be done at home and is apartment friendly, because it's low impact. To make this resistance workout even more intense and effective, you can complete two times through for a 40 minute session. I love to incorporate workouts like this that utilize minimal equipment because they are effective, quick, fun, help to keep me lean &#38; toned, and target my major muscle groups in different ways than dumbbells do. Keywords: at home loop band workout loop bands resistance bands booty bands, loop resistance band at home booty band workout booty band workout loop band workout 20 minute workout 20 minute band workout band workout mini band workout mini band arm workout resistance band workout full body resistance band workout full body workout at home workout real time workout best band workout workout fitness workout video at home 20 minute loop band workout&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;FTC: This video is not in collaboration with any brands. If you decide to purchase any products from this video, it would mean SO much to me if you used my links. This gives me a small commission to continue to purchase new products to review for you all on this channel. Thank you so much for your love &#38; support &#128149;"
