  node [
    id 3679
    label "OJIWMlLa38Q"
    step 1
    date "2018-09-12T10:36:48Z"
    title "How to do ab wheel rollouts the right way"
    description "In this video I show you how to do ab wheel rollouts the right way in order to develop core strength in the abdomen. I show common mistakes and how to correct them, plus some easier and more difficult variations. Some of the exercises shown as being incorrect may correct if you are working on other parts of the body, for example, the shoulders. This video shows the correct method if the purpose is for an ab workout to develop a strong core.&#10;&#10;Many similar YT videos have conflicting advice about breathing during this exercise. I show you my prefered method which involves exhaling during exertion (extended stage) and inhaling at the initial stage.&#10;&#10;________________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: This video is for educational and entertainment purposes only. If you decide to perform these exercises, you do at your  own risk. &#10;You should consult your physician or other health care professional before participating in any type of exercises, in particular, if you suffer high blood pressure or heart disease, are obese, or have a bone or joint problem that could be made worse by a change in physical activity."
    channel_title "Donato Nardizzi"
    channel_id "UCMc95Uvuz52fG1hx4hAQ__g"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
    duration NAN
