    title "Abs 2.0 - 8 minute AT HOME Ab Workout (no equipment) | PRIDEFIT"
    description "&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;We're back with a new 8 minute ab workout to keep things fresh! Remember, varying our workouts is the best way to keep seeing results. This video can be done alone, but I'd suggest pairing it with another workout - i.e. running, legs, full body etc. &#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;If you enjoy the video remember to comment, like, subscribe - all the things! Check back Thursday for my next workout!&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;PRIDEFIT Abs 2.0&#10;3 Rounds:&#10;10 Pulse Bicycles (0:22)&#10;10 Levers (0:38)&#10;10 Deadbugs (1:02)&#10;10/side Star Crunch (2:07)&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;Follow me on:&#10;&#128495;I N S T A G R A M: https://www.instagram.com/leichtning/&#10;&#128495;T I K  T O K: https://www.tiktok.com/@leichtning?so...&#10;&#128495;F A C E B O O K: https://www.facebook.com/Leichtning/&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;Editor: Detachedmedia@gmail.com&#10;&#10;#abs #abworkout #sixpack&#10;&#10;Thanks again for watching Abs 2.0 - 8 minute AT HOME Ab Workout (no equipment)!"
