  node [
    id 3788
    label "0mzEUmli4v0"
    step 1
    date "2020-11-05T19:15:13Z"
    title "OBLIQUE WORKOUT (no equipment beginner 14 minute ab routine) | PRIDEFIT"
    description "&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; Super excited for y'all to try this 14 minute oblique workout! I made this video because I get asked all the time what people can do to fix their &#34;love handles&#34; and while working your obliques won't automatically fix this trouble spot, it is laying the ground work for strong obliques in the future!&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; Again, spot treatment doesn't work. We can't work our obliques and magically lose fat there, but that doesn't mean we shouldn't be laying a foundation with the obliques that leads to a strong core overall! &#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; If you're trying to lose those pesky love handles (you're absolutely not alone!), the honest to god best thing you should be doing is more cardio. We need to burn calories and eat clean in order to lose fat; so doing this oblique workout will help but you really should be pairing this workout with another HIIT or cardio session to achieve your goals.&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; 2 Rounds :40 per exercise&#10;1) Plank Hip Dips&#10;2) Side Crunch (R)&#10;3) Side Crunch (L)&#10;4) Plank Knee to Elbow&#10;5) Star Crunch (R)&#10;6) Star Crunch (L)&#10;7) Side Plank (R)&#10;8) Side Plank (L)&#10;9) Corkscrew&#10;10) Alternating Side Planks&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; Pridefit combines strength, cardio, HIIT, core, and mobility into one seamless program so you don't have to go searching through YouTube to decide what to do next or how to achieve your goals. Visit www.pridefit.com to get more information!&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; Don't forget to like/subscribe to my channel and leave me a comment below with what exercise was your favorite!&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; G E A R:&#10;S H O R T S: https://bty.tenthousand.cc/leicht&#10;Use code: LEICHTNING to get 15% off&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; Follow me on:&#10;&#128495;I N S T A G R A M: https://www.instagram.com/leichtning/&#10;&#128495;T I K  T O K: https://www.tiktok.com/@leichtning?so...&#10;&#128495;F A C E B O O K: https://www.facebook.com/Leichtning/&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; Editor: Detachedmedia@gmail.com&#10;&#10;#obliques #core #athomeworkout&#10;&#10;Thanks for watching OBLIQUE WORKOUT (no equipment beginner 14 minute ab routine)!"
