    title "12 min LEGS Workout AT HOME (no equipment) | PRIDEFIT"
    description "&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;This 12 minute at home workout absolutely destroyed my legs. No equipment necessary, but plenty of opportunities to add weight if you're brave! Let me know what you think in the comments! &#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;Be sure to SUBSCRIBE and check back next Thursday for a new full body video!&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;12 min EMOM (Every Minute On the Minute)&#10;Min 1) Squat Pulses&#10;Min 2) Alternating Reverse Lunges&#10;Min 3) Glute Bridges&#10;Min 4) Cossack Squats&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;Follow me on:&#10;&#128495;I N S T A G R A M: https://www.instagram.com/leichtning/&#10;&#128495;T I K  T O K: https://www.tiktok.com/@leichtning?so...&#10;&#128495;F A C E B O O K: https://www.facebook.com/Leichtning/&#10;&#10;#legday #legworkout #legburn&#10;&#10;Thanks again for watching 12 min LEGS Workout AT HOME (no equipment)!"
