    title "ULTIMATE CHEST DESTROYER (12 min dumbbell workout)  | PRIDEFIT"
    description "Y'all are going to absolutely LOVE this new chest workout. The best part? It's only 12 minutes and trust me, that is ENOUGH! You WILL need a set of medium weight dumbbells for this workout. I used 25's and it was pretty killer.&#10;&#10;Here's what we got:&#10;12 min EMOM of :40/:20&#10;1) DB Push Ups (R)&#10;2) Close Grip Floor Press&#10;3) Crush Grip Bicep Curls&#10;4) DB Push Ups (L)&#10;5) Glute Bridge Floor Press&#10;6) DB Floor Fly&#10;&#10;Don't forget to LIKE and SUBSCRIBE! This is the easiest way to support my channel! https://www.youtube.com/samleicht?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;This workout comes directly from my Pridefit Home &#38; Gym programs. Pridefit combines strength, cardio, HIIT, core, and mobility into one seamless program so you don't have to go searching through YouTube to decide what to do next or how to achieve your goals. Visit https://www.pridefit.com to start your 7 day free trial!&#10;&#10;Join the Pridefit collective for FREE on slack!! Here's the link: https://join.slack.com/t/pridefit/shared_invite/zt-t85sphma-R~NFoY6GivFgbD4PepnQIw&#10;&#10;Follow me on:&#10;&#128495;I N S T A G R A M: https://www.instagram.com/leichtning/&#8203;&#10;&#128495;T I K  T O K: https://www.tiktok.com/@leichtning?so&#8203;...&#10;&#128495;F A C E B O O K: https://www.facebook.com/Leichtning/&#8203;&#10;&#10;Editor: kyle@detachedmedia.com&#10;&#10;#chest #pecs #pridefit&#10;&#10;Thanks for watching ULTIMATE CHEST DESTROYER (12 min dumbbell workout)!"
