    title "16 minute SHOULDER CHEST &#38; AB BURN (beginner friendly no equipment workout)| PRIDEFIT"
    description "&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; I've done this workout a few times now and I'm always pleasantly surprised by the pump I get. In this workout you're going to be targeting your shoulders, chest, AND abs so I really think of it as a 3-in-1. Make sure to scale appropriately and really focus on quality over quantity.&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;  What workout do you want to see next? Leave me a comment below and subscribe to my channel so you don't miss it!&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; The FINAL week of the elimination diet vlog is coming at you on MONDAY with some new recipes! 5pm EST. &#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; 4on/2off/4on/2off/4on&#10;20 Shoulder Taps&#10;10 Ball Crunches&#10;5 Push Ups&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; Follow me on:&#10;&#128495;I N S T A G R A M: https://www.instagram.com/leichtning/&#10;&#128495;T I K  T O K: https://www.tiktok.com/@leichtning?so...&#10;&#128495;F A C E B O O K: https://www.facebook.com/Leichtning/&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; Editor: Detachedmedia@gmail.com&#10;&#10;#fitness #fit #exercise&#10;&#10;Thanks for watching 16 minute SHOULDER CHEST &#38; AB BURN (beginner friendly no equipment workout)"
