    description "&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; This ab workout is going to make your abs BURN in just 9 minutes. It's perfect for beginners who are new to working out and want to target your core. Make sure to listen for the scaling options throughout :)&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; Skip to Workout (2:15)&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;9 min AB BURN WORKOUT&#10;2 Rounds of :30 on/:15 off&#10;1) Boat Pose Crunches&#10;2) Sky Crunches&#10;3) Side Oblique Crunches (R)&#10;4) Side Oblique Crunches (L)&#10;5) Corkscrews&#10;6) Hollow Rocks&#10;&#10;*See Video or Direct Message for Scaling Options!&#10;&#10;&#128073; SUBSCRIBE &#38; STAY UPDATED: https://www.youtube.com/samleicht?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;Follow me on:&#10;&#128495;I N S T A G R A M: https://www.instagram.com/leichtning/&#10;&#128495;T I K  T O K: https://www.tiktok.com/@leichtning?so...&#10;&#128495;F A C E B O O K: https://www.facebook.com/Leichtning/&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;Editor: Detachedmedia@gmail.com&#10;&#10;#abs #workout #absworkout&#10;#PrideFit #leichtning #SamLeicht&#10;&#10;Thanks for watching 9 min AB BURN WORKOUT (no equipment beginner friendly abs/core)!&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;9 min AB BURN WORKOUT (no equipment beginner friendly abs/core) | PRIDEFIT&#10;sam leicht,sam light,leichtning,lightning,leichtning health,lightning health,lgbt,lgbtqia,gay,gay health,sustainable health,pridefit,6 pack,6 pack abs,9 min abs,9 min no equipment workout,9 min ab burn workout,9 min ab burn workout no equipment beginner friendly core,beginner friendly core,beginner abs,6 min beginner abs,how to get a 6 pack,beginner friendly abs 10 min,10 min abs,how to get a 6 pack fast,6 pack abs in 10 minutes,6 pack abs no equipment"
