    title "How to get a KILLER AB BURN in 7 MINUTES | PRIDEFIT"
    description "&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; This workout is the perfect way to get a killer ab burn FAST! I'd suggest tacking this onto a cardio session or full body workout of your choice! All it takes is 7 minutes to get a great workout &#128170;&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; Don't forget to follow/like/subscribe/comment! If you're able to donate, please consider giving to Vocal NY: &#10;&#10;https://vocal.ourpowerbase.net/civicrm/contribute/transact?id=6&#38;reset=1&#10;&#10;Voices Of Community Activists &#38; Leaders (VOCAL-NY) is a statewide grassroots membership organization that builds power among low-income people affected by HIV/AIDS, the drug war, mass incarceration, and homelessness in order to create healthy and just communities.&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;Be on the lookout for a special video coming on Monday! Hint: there may be a playground involved...&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; Skip to Workout (2:35)&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;KILLER AB BURN in 7 MINUTES:&#10;7 min AMRAP&#10;10 Sit Ups (1:08)&#10;20 Single Leg V-Ups (1:26)&#10;30 Flutter Kicks (1:55)&#10;*See Video or Direct Message for Scaling Options!&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;Follow me on:&#10;&#128495;I N S T A G R A M: https://www.instagram.com/leichtning/&#10;&#128495;T I K  T O K: https://www.tiktok.com/@leichtning?so...&#10;&#128495;F A C E B O O K: https://www.facebook.com/Leichtning/&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#65039;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;Editor: Detachedmedia@gmail.com&#10;&#10;#abs #workout #absworkout &#10;&#10;Thanks for watching How to get a KILLER AB BURN in 7 MINUTES!"
