    description "60 min sweat session! No equipment is necessary for this workout and you know what that means! This one will be extra tough ;)&#10;&#10;Today's workout:&#10;3 Rounds:&#10;:60 Forearm Plank&#10;10 Donkey Kicks&#10;10 Glute Bridges&#10;&#10;A1. 2x:30 Handstand/Wall Walk Hold&#10;A2. 2x6/side Front Levers&#10;&#10;B. 20 min EMOM&#10;1) Plank Up Downs&#10;2) Alternating Forward Lunges&#10;3) Tricep Toe Touches&#10;4) Sky Crunches&#10;5) Glute Bridge Shifts&#10;&#10;C. TABATA&#10;1) Full Body Crunch (Half Body Crunch)&#10;2) Push Ups&#10;&#10;Spotify Broadway playlist link:&#10;https://open.spotify.com/playlist/02nIkmLUrFKLn4PQdfauuz?si=6VUlVQdrQwiQI8yl9qK5XA&#10;&#10;Spotify pop playlist link:&#10;https://open.spotify.com/playlist/7MkZCProY21nUTHbVBEcIq?si=9J8whMPlSTWv3m1CIJhm8A&#10;&#10;I love sweating with y'all every weekend! I'm so unbelievably appreciative that you're here!&#10;&#10;If you enjoy these workouts, do me a favor and hit the like button, leave me a comment below, and subscribe to my channel. This is the absolute best way to support my channel and I can't tell you how much I appreciate it! Xoxo&#10;&#10;Looking for what videos to pair with this one? Pridefit does all of the planning for you! Every day you will get a full workout plan so you don't have to worry about what to do next. Head over to my website www.pridefit.com to sign up for your free 7 day trial!&#10;&#10; Follow me on:&#10;&#128495;I N S T A G R A M: https://www.instagram.com/leichtning/&#8203;&#10;&#128495;T I K  T O K: https://www.tiktok.com/@leichtning?so&#8203;...&#10;&#128495;F A C E B O O K: https://www.facebook.com/Leichtning/"
