    title "10mins ABS &#38; CORE WORKOUT | At Home | No Equipment"
    description "This is a Great abs workout that can be done at home, for ALL fitness levels men and Women (Beginners and advanced) .&#10;&#10;This is a great Bodyweight back workout you can do at home suitable for ALL fitness levels (beginners to advance) with next to no equipment needed. This is a great workout for both men and Women.&#10;&#10;TRAINING PLANS:&#10;-BODYWEIGHT HOME WORKOUT EBOOKS: https://obivincent.com/collections/frontpage/products/30-days-bodyweight-home-workout-ebook&#10;&#10;- DUMBBELL ONLY EBOOKS: https://obivincent.com&#10;&#10;- CROSSLIFTR Training (Conventional or Crossfit Box) Program: https://obivincent.com&#10;&#10;- Follow me on INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/obi_vincent/&#10;&#10;SUPPLEMENT SPONSOR PHD NUTRITION discount code &#8220;OBIV25&#8221;  https://www.phd.com&#10;&#10;Fitness tracker i use: WHOOP ..https://www.whoop.com .. disc code &#8220;OBI&#8221; For 15% off&#10;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10134;&#10;Bands https://www.rogueeurope.eu/rogue-monster-bands-eu&#10;&#10;EXERCISES &#10;Aim for atleast 2 -3 sets of Each &#10;1. Advanced Plank - Hold Till Failure &#10;2. Banded Wood Chop x 10 Both sides &#10;3. Superman x 10 &#10;3. Decline Plank x 12 &#10;4. Banded Decline Plank x 12 &#10;5. Plank Knees to Elbow x 12 &#10;6 Weighted Sit ups x 10 &#10;&#10;SPONSORS&#10;PHD NUTRITION DISCOUNT CODE: OBIV25 https://www.phd.com/&#10;Shop the Gymshark collection:  https://gym.sh/Shop-Obi-Vincent .. Thank you for your Support! &#10;WHOOP Fitness Track https://www.whoop.com/ Discount code: OBI &#10;&#10;SOCIAL&#10;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/obivincentfi.&#10;TWITTER: https://twitter.com/obi__vincent&#10;&#10;Business Enquiries Email: Obiuvincent@gmail.com&#10;&#10;#BREAKTHEMOULD #CROSSLIFTR #ABSWORKOUT"
