  node [
    id 3885
    label "-v0Pktus3DA"
    step 1
    date "2020-02-27T15:31:11Z"
    title "Total Body Workout (Back, Arms, Core, Legs, Shoulders, Chest)"
    description "Lifting weights is an important component of any exercise program because it's the one activity that allows you to build lean muscle tissue. That lean muscle is metabolically active, so your metabolism gets a boost, and that muscle also keeps you strong for all the activities in your life.&#10;There are plenty of ways to lift weights, but one of the simplest is total body training.&#10;Total body workouts are perfect for hitting all your major muscle groups in one workout, and they're very forgiving if you have a busy schedule.You only need to do total body workouts two or three times a week, so if you miss one you can always do it the next day.&#10;&#10;Music: Take/Five - Genesis&#10;Support The Producer&#10;https://www.soundcloud.com/takefivemusic&#10;https://www.facebook.com/iamtakefive&#10;https://www.twitter.com/iamtakefive&#10;https://www.instagram.com/iamtakefive/ &#10;Support Trap Nation&#10;&#9830;https://nations.io&#10;&#9830;http://twitter.com/alltrapnation&#10;&#9830;http://facebook.com/alltrapnation&#10;&#9830;http://soundcloud.com/alltrapnation&#10;&#9830;http://instagram.com/trapnation&#10;&#9830;http://trapnation.spreadshirt.com&#10;&#9830;http://bit.ly/TNATIONVINE&#10;&#10;&#10004;&#65039;Athlete model - @paulsklarxfit&#10;&#9679; www.paulsklarxfit.com&#10;#workout #training #fitness"
