    step 1
    date "2018-08-28T19:05:55Z"
    title "Easy Beginner Shadow Boxing Workout - 30 Minute Special Workout"
    description "Easy Beginner Shadow Boxing Workout - 30 Minute Special Workout&#10;&#10;What I decided to do since you guys have been asking is to run through a very basic Shadow Boxing session for true beginners. somebody who wants to throw their hands without gloves on and just goes through a session.  &#10;&#10;This video is about Easy Beginner Shadow Boxing Workout. This Shadow boxing workout is a smooth boxing workout that allows new users, subscribers, and curious peeps to try a boxing workout, learn boxing numbers, punches, and combinations and get a workout in while doing it.  This boxing session is 30 minutes of constant but controlled boxing combinations and movement.  You'll learn punches 1-6, ( jab, cross, left hook, right hook, left uppercut, right uppercut) basic footwork, and defense.  By the end of this session, you'll be throwing complete boxing combinations, moving well, and sweating.  Boxing is all about movement, fun, and learning something new to keep you interested in training or breaking up your usual fitness routine.  This Boxing workout is for all levels.&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------&#10;390 ELEVATED PREMIUM Workouts --- NATE BOWER ELEVATED&#10;https://watch.natebowerelevated.com/&#10;Join this channel to get access to perks:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCa9_TpiSkqYwcr35uh5N7Og/join&#10;--------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;A lot of times when you see my workouts they may seem advanced but that&#8217;s because your knowledge base of the punches or movements just isn&#8217;t there yet so the movements may seem&#10;complicated or you might be lost behind some of the combos. So what we&#8217;re going to do is run through something a little easier to get you started as a kick-starter to a shadow boxing workout to start your boxing journey on the Nate Bower fitness YouTube channel.&#10;&#10;Punches &#10;Jab is a 1&#10;Cross 2&#10;Lead hook  3&#10;Rear hook 4&#10;Lead uppercut 5&#10;Rear uppercut 6&#10;Lead up shoot 7&#10;Rear overhand right 8 &#10;&#10;Follow Nate Bower&#10;Official Website: http://natebowerfitness.com&#10;Instagram: https://instagram.com/natebowerfitness&#10;Facebook: https://facebook.com/natebowerfitness&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/nbfitness&#10;&#10;About Nate Bower: &#10;Nate Bower is a certified PTS, boxing instructor, personal trainer, and competitive athlete in Toronto, Ontario, Canada. This channel offers boxing workouts, heavy bag workouts, high-intensity interval training, motivation, timed session workout routines, and more.&#10;&#10;#boxingworkout #workout #shadowboxing&#10;.&#10;.&#10;.&#10;Keywords:&#10;shadow boxing workout&#10;shadow boxing for beginners&#10;shadow boxing&#10;learn boxing&#10;shadow boxing workout for beginners&#10;boxing workout for beginners&#10;boxing training for beginners&#10;boxing for beginners,&#10;air boxing workout&#10;boxing training at home&#10;learn boxing for beginners at home&#10;how to learn boxing&#10;boxing training at home for beginners&#10;boxing workout at home&#10;how to shadow box&#10;shadow boxing beginners&#10;shadow boxing drills&#10;how to shadow box for beginners&#10;boxing workout"
