    title "6 Pack ABS Workout For Beginners/Teens &#38; Athletes and Adults/10 min exercises at home"
    description "Best exercises at home for Beginners/Teens &#38; Athletes and Adults! Get ready for one of the best and challenging Workout of your LIFE! Let's do this!&#128293; trening for nybegynnere&#10;&#10;&#127918;    Follow my GAMING CHANNEL&#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/KliKKluKGaming?sub_confirmation=1&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;The best exercises for Beginners/Teens &#38; Athletes and Adults!&#10;&#10145;&#65039;  https://goo.gl/iMusVc&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#129309; Help support our Channel&#10;https://www.paypal.com/donate/?cmd=_donations&#38;business=6MYGTYTK5L29L&#38;item_name=Always+appreciate+your+support.+Thank+you%21&#38;currency_code=USD&#38;Z3JncnB0=&#10; https://paypal.me/KliKKluK&#10;Thank you &#128591;&#127996;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;&#127775; Our little store Unique gifts&#127775; &#10; https://www.etsy.com/shop/KristiKayBoutique&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Hi, welcome to my channel.&#10;My name is Danny,&#10;I am 14 years old and I love baseball.  &#10;We all need daily exercise to stay in shape.  &#10;&#128170;&#127995;We have created an easy and fun workout for beginners, teens and adults that can help burn extra calories and provide a healthy mindset. &#10;&#128073;&#127996; Do these exercises 4-5 days a week  &#10;&#11088;&#65039; I hope my workout videos will help you.  &#10;&#127758;Join me on my adventures by clicking&#10;                     &#128521;  SUBSCRIBE&#10;&#128313;&#128312;Comment below your results&#128312;&#128313;&#10;  &#128313;&#128312;Good Luck and lets begin! &#128312;&#128313;&#10;   &#128313;&#128312;See you in the next video&#128312;&#128313;&#10;&#10;&#10008; I N S T A G R A M &#10008;&#10;https://