    description "Get Your FREE Training &#38; Nutrition Plan:&#10;&#128221; https://www.SeanNal.com/custom&#10;&#10;Premium Quality, Science-Based Supplements:&#10;&#128138; https://www.RealScienceAthletics.com/&#10;(Save 15% with coupon code YOUTUBE15)&#10;&#10;Connect With Me:&#10;&#128073; https://www.Instagram.com/Sean_Nalewanyj&#10;&#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Masturbation And Bodybuilding: is there a connection? Does masturbation affect muscle growth? Does masturbation lower testosterone? This is a common fear among many lifters and is one reason why many go the &#34;No Fap&#34; route. They believe that this can help them increase testosterone naturally and thus build muscle faster as well. But is there any real truth to this? In today's video I go over the masturbation and testosterone studies that are available to determine if this is something you need to be worrying about. If you've been asking &#34;is masturbation bad for my gains&#34; or whether masturbating before a workout is harmful, make sure to watch this video through and also comment with your own experience as well."
