    step 1
    date "2022-06-07T18:56:13Z"
    title "8 MIN Fat Burn /Intense Upper Abs WORKOUT at Home (tone your abs) / No equipment Workout"
    description "8 MIN Fat Burn /Intense Upper Abs WORKOUT at Home (tone your abs) / No equipment Workout &#10;&#10;Hello everyone!&#10;&#10;This 8 minute at home workout challenge, will target your upper and lower belly fat. These abs exercises will help tone and lose belly fat and accompanied with a healthy balanced will help in preventing excess weight gain or in maintaining weight loss.&#10;&#10;The video is full length, so you can just follow whatever I'm doing for 45 seconds for each workout. There is no break included. &#10;8 Minutes, 10 exercises, no breaks.&#10;&#10;Please Note - that we cannot spot reduce fat, meaning we can&#8217;t choose the areas on our body where we lose fat. However, the only way to lose weight in a specific area is to lose weight in general - and the only way to do that is to follow the classic proven methods. Namely, regular exercise and a healthy, well-balanced diet.&#10;&#10;Please show your love and support by LIKING and SUBSCRIBING to the channel so we can grow a strong and powerful community &#128147; &#10;&#10;Activate the &#128276; beside the subscribe button to get the notification! &#10;&#10;If you have any questions or requests feel free to leave them in the comments below.&#10;&#10;Follow me on Instagram: IG - @hello.lori.fit &#10;Business enquiries: &#9993; hellolorifit@gmail.com &#10;&#10;LOVE PEACE AND BLESSINGS TO ALL &#128150;&#128150; &#10;&#10;Disclaimer: When joining me for all my workout videos, please understand that we can't pick which area we want to lose fat. Your health and safety are the most important things. Before you start this workout, it's best to consult your physician to reduce any risk of injury. Consult a fitness professional for advice on how to perform different exercises if you do not feel comfortable. HelloLoriFit channel will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video. &#10;&#10;&#10;#hellolorifit #workout #absworkout #abs #lowerabs #lowerabsworkout #burnout t #absexercises  #howtoloseweight  #bellyfatworkout #morningabsworkout #fatburning #howtogetabsfast"
    channel_title "HelloLoriFit"
    channel_id "UCf766IpDntbvV9c5JJHnLJA"
