  node [
    id 3974
    label "75iSx09xX_c"
    step 1
    date "2020-02-22T23:57:33Z"
    title "Workout To Get Abs Like A Boxer (Rocky Abs!)"
    description "Have you guys ever seen some of those ripped boxers and be like man&#8230; How do I get abs like those? Stick around and I am going to go through some boxer movement exercises to get those good looking abs. &#10;&#10;A lot of boxing movements use your core. Boxing is not just using your arms, you are twisting your core when throwing punches. I am going to show you some really basic exercises that you can do at home to workout like a boxer. &#10;&#10;You will need a resistance band, and just anchor it in the middle of your door. Pull the resistance band under your arms and we are going to do Air-Punches Door Bands. Just throw different kinds of punches, and different combinations of punches with this exercise. You are going to get out of breath pretty easily, so there is a free Boxing Timer app that you can download on the app store. &#10;&#10;Another way you can do that last exercise is Air-Punches Single Band. You don&#8217;t need a door and an anchor, all you need is one simple band. You are really going to feel this in your shoulder and your core after the 30 seconds  is up. &#10;&#10;The next thing you can do is some straight up sit-ups with throwing some punches. Hook your feet under something with resistance, and do basic sit-ups with punches. There are lots of different ways you can do this, and just go until you run out of breath. This is also a fantastic way to burn a lot of calories because we are really working our cardiovascular system as well.&#10;&#10;If you have a medicine ball or slam ball for this exercise that would be good. Experiment at first and make sure not to hit yourself in the face. This is really good at making your abs contract when you throw the ball down. &#10;&#10;Next exercise...Upper Air Punches. These overhead punches while moving your feet with the bouncing movement is going to kick your butt. The next exercise is Abs Slam. You are just going to hit your abs with the medicine ball, which is teaching your abs to contract before a hit or blow. That contracting your abs is what strengthens your core. &#10;&#10;Well guys that wraps up this video tutorial on how to get abs like a boxer. &#10;&#10;Make sure to subscribe to the channel for more videos on how to get abs after 40: https://youtube.com/liveanabolic?sub_confirmation=1"
    channel_title "Live Anabolic"
    channel_id "UCvoih36zyNmXAbIQ_MaBsHw"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
