    step 1
    date "2019-01-17T11:05:34Z"
    title "45 Min Full Body FAT BURN Workout | Get Flat Abs, Lean Legs &#38; Arms | No Jumping Ver Included"
    description "This is a 45 minute, full body burn workout that will help you get that flat belly and toned abs. This video is consist of warm ups, 8 sets and a cooldown. The 8 separate sets focused on full body, arms, legs, back and abs. This video is part of my FREE 30 days flat belly challenge program. If you want to get flat abs and a six pack, try out this video as well as the others in this series to get those abs you want in 30 days.&#10;&#10;FREE 30 day FLAT BELLY CHALLENGE PROGRAM: https://www.chloeting.com/program&#10;Ep 1 - 30 Min Full Body Workout: https://youtu.be/NQmnJtB1gzo&#10;Ep 2 - 10 Mins Abs Workout: https://youtu.be/UBnfm4s7CRA&#10;Ep 3 - 20 Mins Abs Hiit Cardio: https://youtu.be/owrBD7_8edA&#10;Ep 4 - 10 Mins Lower Abs: https://youtu.be/Th97oQ4eF9U&#10;Ep 5 - 45 Mins Full Body Burn: https://youtu.be/LDvAuqTZxMw&#10;Community RESULTS Video: https://youtu.be/VedbZeysJrk&#10;Meal Prep Video: https://youtu.be/CB0bqOCb1RE&#10;&#10;SPONSOR THIS CHANNEL: https://www.youtube.com/chloeting/join&#10;SUB TO MY 2ND CHANNEL: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBrcDabYtwbR1VIhwH5efZA?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;&#9734;Fitness Outfits&#9734;&#10;My Gymshark Affiliate Link - https://gym.sh/Shop-Chloe-Ting &#10;&#10;&#9734;My Instagram links&#9734;&#10;https://www.instagram.com/chloe_t/&#10;https://www.instagram.com/itschloeting/&#10;&#10;&#9734;Filmed With&#9734;&#10;Panasonic GH5&#10;Lumix G 8-18mm &#10;Lumix G 12-35mm &#10;Lumix G 42.5mm&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/chloeting&#10;&#10;&#9734;Music by&#9734;&#10;Track: Alex Skrindo &#38; Miza - Thinkin' [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/CkC5igeV_tM&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/ThinkinYO&#10;&#10;Track: Andromedik - With Me [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/pyj9yJO4rbA&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/WithMeYO&#10;&#10;Track: Jensation - Delicious [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/DeliciousYO&#10;&#10;Track: Kozah - Haha [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: &#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/HahaYO&#10;&#10;Track: Lost Sky - Dreams [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/SHFTHDncw0g&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/DreamsYO&#10;&#10;Track: Rival x Cadmium - Seasons (feat. Harley Bird) [Futuristik &#38; Whogaux Remix] [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/PwJVaJJ664g&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/SeasonsRemixYO&#10;&#10;Track: TULE - Lost [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/h-nHdqC3pPs&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/LostYO&#10;&#10;Track: Weero &#38; Mitte - Our Dive [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/qKqSBm07KZk&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/OurDiveYO&#10;&#10;Track: &#201;WN - Feels [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/ZevEW7zwslA&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/feels&#10;&#10;Track: &#201;WN - Feels [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/ZevEW7zwslA&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/feels&#10;&#10;Track: &#201;WN - The Light [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/q2D4-fuv67U&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/EWNTheLightYO&#10;&#10;Track: Halcyon - Runaway (feat. Valentina Franco) [TARI Remix] | NCS Release&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/k0Fz9FXos-U&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/RunawayTARIYO&#10;&#10;Track: JPB - All Stops Now (feat. Soundr) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/r2i74gg03GI&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/AllStopsNowYO&#10;&#10;#workouts #homeworkout 