    step 1
    date "2017-01-04T18:38:05Z"
    title "Bowflex&#174; Dumbbell Workout | Four-Minute Advanced Level Ab Workout"
    description "Check out more Bowflex workouts here: https://goo.gl/jkjFMm&#10;&#10;Four moves and four minutes is all you need to complete this advanced ab workout - no sit-ups required! These four ab exercises will challenge your balance to help engage your abs for an  awesome ab workout.&#10;&#10;The four exercises in this workout are:&#10;&#10;1) Rope Climb&#10;2) Corkscrew&#10;3) Russian Twists&#10;4) Plank Extensions&#10;&#10;Each exercise is done for 20 seconds with 10 seconds rest in between, and all four are done two times through.&#10;&#10;If you don't have dumbbells at home, you can use any object with weight that you can firmly hold on to while performing the exercise.&#10;&#10;If you'd like to get a pair of the Bowflex SelectTech dumbbells that you see in the video, head here: http://www.bowflex.com/selecttech&#10;&#10;Want an ab workout that doesn't require going to the floor?  Try this 6-Minute Standing Ab Workout: https://youtu.be/bkHuvrLxpUU&#10;&#10;If planks are more your thing, try this 3-Minute Perfect Plank Workout: https://youtu.be/ynUw0YsrmSg&#10;&#10;Subscribe for more workouts and tips: http://goo.gl/sxLYmP&#10;&#10;Additional fitness tips: http://goo.gl/vFWbTL&#10;&#10;Quick workouts: http://goo.gl/mj1b0C&#10;&#10;http://www.Bowflex.com - Find all the fitness solutions you'll ever need to be a healthier you.&#10;&#10;http://www.BowflexInsider.com - Head to the Bowflex Insider blog to read the latest in all things related to fitness and health and find simple ways to start losing weight.&#10;&#10;Connect with us and socialize with other Bowflex fans:&#10;http://www.facebook.com/Bowflex&#10;http://twitter.com/Bowflex&#10;http://plus.google.com/+Bowflex&#10;http://pinterest.com/Bowflex"
