    title "Bowflex&#174; Dumbbell Workout | Upper Body Blast Workout"
    description "Learn more about Bowflex SelectTech Dumbbells here: https://goo.gl/5pqUde&#10;&#10;Subscribe for more workouts and tips: http://goo.gl/sxLYmP&#10;&#10;Build up your upper body strength and tone your arms, chest, shoulders and back in under 10 minutes with this Upper Body Blast Workout. &#10;&#10;This video will take you through five simple upper body moves you can do with dumbbells that will really make a difference in your upper body strength.  While the exercises are being demonstrated, Bowflex Fitness Advisor, Tom Holland will also speak to the proper techniques for performing each move.&#10;&#10;This workout includes the following five strength building exercises:&#10;1) Chest Press&#10;2) Tricep Extension&#10;3) Bicep Curls&#10;4) Overhead Press&#10;5) One Arm Dumbbell Rows&#10;&#10;Each exercise is done with 10 reps and the circuit is done 2 times through.&#10;&#10;Want the dumbbells you see in the video? Get them here: http://www.bowflexselecttech.com&#10;&#10;More quick workouts: http://goo.gl/mj1b0C&#10;&#10;Additional fitness tips: http://goo.gl/vFWbTL&#10;&#10;http://www.Bowflex.com - Find all the fitness solutions you'll ever need to get on your way to being a healthier you.&#10;&#10;http://www.BowflexInsider.com - Head to the Bowflex Insider blog to read the latest in all things related to fitness and health and find simple ways to start losing weight."
