  node [
    id 4072
    label "QBC732YLX9c"
    step 1
    date "2015-08-26T15:46:26Z"
    title "Bowflex&#174; Bodyweight Workout | Three-Minute Push-Up Challenge"
    description "Are you up for the challenge?  The Three-Minute Push-up Challenge that is!  We aren't going to lie, this challenge will push your upper body hard, but when you complete the challenge you will be rewarded with the title of &#34;Push-up Master!&#34; (You'll have to create your own certificate of course)&#10;&#10;What does this challenge entail?  Four different types of push-ups for 30 seconds each, ten seconds of rest in between, ending with a 20-second chest stretch. Here's the breakdown:&#10;&#10;1) Push-ups (regular) - 30 seconds&#10;     Rest - 10 seconds&#10;2) Diamond Push-ups - 30 seconds&#10;     Rest - 10 seconds&#10;3) Leg Lift Push-ups - 30 seconds&#10;     Rest - 10 seconds&#10;4) Spider-man Push-ups - 30 seconds&#10;     Rest - 10 seconds&#10;End with a 20 second chest stretch by putting your hands behind your head and gently pulling your elbows back to stretch the chest.&#10;&#10;For most people, it will probably take some time to build up to being able to complete the full challenge.  Do what you can, even go to knee push-ups if needed, and continue to build up your upper body strength and endurance until you can complete the three minutes straight.  Oh, and let us know when you do!&#10;&#10;Here are some other fitness resources you may find helpful:&#10;&#10;https://www.bowflex.com/home?adID=DOXFBBSCL001 - Find all the fitness solutions you'll ever need to help you be healthy.&#10;&#10;https://www.bowflex.com/blog?adID=DOXFBBSCL001 - Head to the Bowflex Insider blog to read the latest in all things related to fitness and health."
    channel_title "Bowflex"
    channel_id "UCKik8uG08NYJStvTW7ZgUAQ"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
