    label "uZxiyReelTw"
    step 1
    date "2021-03-21T13:26:17Z"
    title "HOW I GOT 6 PACK ABS (TOP 6 Bruce Lee Ab Exercises Make Your Abs Pop Out) Bruce Lee Abs Training"
    description "I made this Bruce Lee Abs Training video so my son can grow up proud of his ethnicity, no matter what people say. &#10;&#10;I consider dip bars the single most important equipment for training abs with the highest return on investment to get abs like Bruce Lee. It's my fav fitness equipment, more versatile than dip station, literally maximizes ROI for ALL Push + Pull + Ab exercises: https://geni.us/bIEM (Canada) |  https://geni.us/De04Bgr (USA)&#10;&#10;About me: software product manager hacking fitness to help professionals reach their fitness goals while having a full-time job and busy schedule. Lose fat, build muscle, and have more energy for work and life. &#10;&#10;FREE guides I made for you that I also use myself:&#10;&#10;http://jonzhao.com/dietguide &#10;http://jonzhao.com/workoutguide&#10;&#10;If you&#8217;re interested in supporting the channel and you want to get the same home workout equipment I use myself, you can use my affiliate links for products you&#8217;re already going to buy anyways to make Amazon fund a real camera better than my iPhone so I can film crisper videos with (personal goal: this channel self-funds its own expenses). Thanks in advance.&#10;&#10;If you're wondering &#34;how to make abs like Bruce Lee&#34;, this video reveals the Top 6 Bruce Lee Ab Training Exercises I used as the fastest way to get 6 PACK ABS at home by studying Bruce Lee six pack abs workouts.&#10;&#10;&#9201; Timestamps&#10;0:00 - Intro&#10;3:18 - Ab training exercises that do not work&#10;6:25 - The best way to train to get a 6 pack fast&#10;7:20 - Best method to get 6 pack abs via Hypertrophy&#10;8:27 - The 6 Bruce Lee Ab Exercises (the best core exercises)&#10;10:12 - Most important principles to make abs like Bruce Lee Fast&#10;12:19 - Consistent practice with perfect form is the best method to get abs like Bruce Lee&#10;&#10;Ever wonder how to make your abs show without flexing? How do you get abs fast? Why do you only see abs when flexing? This video on Bruce Lee abs training shows how to reveal six pack abs under your stomach using the 6 most effective Bruce Lee ab exercises.&#10;&#10;To get shredded six pack abs fast and make abs show without flexing, you need dedicated ab training days. This is the best way to make your abs pop out, especially if you want to get your lower abs to pop out. Bruce Lee abs training even used multiple sessions on abs per day sometimes.&#10;&#10;How can you get abs fast? First knowing the difference between useful and not useful ab exercises is critical because using the most effective exercises for abs saves a lot of time and is the foundation to how people get abs fast (along with good eating to fuel the body).&#10;&#10;So, how do you build abs? How do you get abs fast? How to make your abs pop out? How to make abs show without flexing?&#10;&#10;Many popular ab exercises are a waste of time and won't help you get your abs to pop out without flexing. These 6 Bruce Lee ab exercises will. The lying leg raise is one of the easiest exercises for 6 pack abs. From here, we add the lying leg raise twists, reverse crunch, plank hold, knee raise, and knee raise twists to form the Bruce Lee six pack abs workout using the top 6 ab training exercises. Done with perfect form, this is the best way to get 6 pack abs at home and get abs like bruce lee.&#10;&#10;If you're still wondering &#34;How do I get abs fast&#34;, then focus on these 6 ab training exercises in the video. Progress from the easiest ab exercises to the hardest. You can do these in an ab training circuit or one by one as shown in this video to get that line down the middle and make your abs show without flexing.&#10;&#10;How to reveal six pack abs and get your abs to pop out and show more:&#10;&#10;1. Dedicate full workouts that train just abs using the best exercise to get abs at home&#10;2. Focus only on ab training exercises that are the most efficient&#10;&#10;If you're wondering how to get your lower abs to pop out, all of these 6 ab training exercises will help make your lower abs pop out. All of them except the plank hold targets the lower abs a lot, making this ab workout the fastest way to get 6 pack abs.&#10;&#10;Apply these ab training exercises today. Consistency is the fastest and easiest way to get six pack abs at home.&#10;&#10;Songs used:&#10;&#10;DBZ - Vegeta Super Saiyan Theme Remix&#10;Cover - Boriz Safi (Instagram: @ddrmr69)&#10;Guitar - Kevin Robb of Red House Productions&#10;Mixed - FWLR (Instagram: @fwlrmusic)&#10;&#10;Bliss by Dimatis - https://soundcloud.com/dimatis/&#10;Ending Track: Lost Sky - Fearless [NCS Release]&#10;By NoCopyrightSounds&#10;&#10;Tags: bruce lee ab workout, ab training exercises, how to get abs like bruce lee, bruce lee six pack abs workout, bruce lee abs training, bruce lee ab exercises, bruce lee six pack abs, how do you get abs, get your lower abs to pop out, why can I only see my abs when I flex, only see abs when flexing, how to make your abs show without flexing, ways to make your abs pop out, how to make abs show without flexing, how do I get abs fast, how can you get abs fast, how to make your abs pop out #6pack #sixpack #brucelee #6packabs #sixpackabs #bodyweight"
