    title "9 Minute Workout Melts Belly Flab and Builds Ab Muscles"
    description "Do you want to lose belly fat and build Ab muscles at home... in just 9 minutes per day?&#10;&#10;If so then this workout will help you achieve your goal, in the shortest time possible. It contains a few new Ab exercises (Flutter Kicks, Scissor Kicks, Toe Tap Leg Lifts) that will effectively work your abdominal area, burning belly fat and building Ab muscles.&#10;&#10;If you continue to do this workout everyday for 3-4 weeks then a six pack and a toned belly is not very far away! The beauty of it is you can exercise even at home with this training. 9 minutes is not that much time to invest your physical appearance, to look great and lose stomach fat!&#10;&#10;So press play, get down on the floor and let's begin the exercise!&#10;&#10;Good luck and be sure to subscribe to the channel to receive new video workouts everyday Monday to Friday!&#128170;&#10084;&#65039;&#10;&#10;Leave me a comment below and tell me how you feel and what is your progress!"
