    description "Stomach fat is the result of being out of shape, eating unhealthy food and doing little physical activity.&#10;&#10;The result is a hanging belly that seems to grow over time, and that seems so stubborn it doesn't want to go away!&#10;&#10;To fix the issue of abdominal fat I have compiled a list of 8 best exercises you can do at home to get rid of tummy fat. Here they are:&#10;&#10;1. Reverse Crunches&#10;2. Russian Twist&#10;3. Reach Through&#10;4. Leg Drops&#10;5. Cross Crunches&#10;6. Plank&#10;7. Single Leg Jacknife&#10;8. Russian Twist (Again!)&#10;&#10;All 8 of these exercises are included in today's video workout for you to do everyday! Yes, you must train regularly if you want to see good results in 3-4 weeks!&#10;&#10;Good luck and be sure to subscribe to the channel if you want to receive new video workouts everyday Monday to Friday!&#10;&#10;Leave me a comment below and tell me what results do you see and feel from doing this video workout!&#10;&#10;Let's begin!&#128170;&#10084;&#65039;"
