    description "Morning is one of the best times to exercise because you're giving your metabolism a boost and you're telling your body to start burning calories as soon as possible because you're having an active day!&#10;&#10;Today's video workout is a 25-minute workout to train your entire body in the morning. This will give your day a head-start and will help you stay fit, get in shape and look attractive!&#10;&#10;The exercises are designed to involve the major muscle groups of your body while also having a cardio effect - which will make your body burn calories throughout the day.&#10;&#10;Start the workout today and make sure to exercise every morning if you want to see amazing results in 3-4 weeks. Good luck and let's begin!&#10084;&#65039;&#128170;&#10;&#10;**If you want to be notified when I upload a new video, make sure to subscribe to our channel. I upload new videos everyday from Sunday to Friday!&#10;&#10;TIMECODES:&#10;&#10;00:00 Introduction&#10;00:10 Torso Rotation&#10;00:53 Rest&#10;01:10 Torso Twists&#10;01:35 Rest&#10;01:52 Side Leg Raise Left&#10;02:40 Rest&#10;02:57 Side Leg Raise Right&#10;03:45 Rest&#10;04:02 Side Lunge Left&#10;05:07 Rest&#10;05:24 Side Lunge Right&#10;06:28 Rest&#10;06:45 Walk Downs&#10;07:59 Rest&#10;08:16 Victory Squat&#10;08:53 Rest&#10;09:10 Sumo Hold&#10;10:25 Rest&#10;10:42 Step Back Jacks&#10;11:11 Rest&#10;11:28 Slow Mountain Climber&#10;12:00 Rest&#10;12:17 Single Leg Bridge Right&#10;13:16 Rest&#10;13:33 Single Leg Bridge Left&#10;14:32 Rest&#10;14:49 Leg Pulls&#10;15:33 Rest&#10;15:50 Knee Push Ups&#10;16:44 Rest&#10;17:01 Plank Slaps&#10;17:28 Rest&#10;17:45 Plank Reaches&#10;18:22 Rest&#10;18:39 Plank Press Back&#10;19:32 Rest&#10;19:49 Scissor Kicks&#10;20:14 Rest&#10;20:31 Reverse Crunches&#10;21:14 Rest&#10;21:31 Side Tap Crunch&#10;22:46 Rest&#10;23:03 Side Bends"
