    date "2020-09-23T03:48:35Z"
    title "2 WEEK BOOTY Challenge YOU HAVEN'T DONE BEFORE! Get RESULTS - At Home, No Equipment"
    description "&#128073; MY NEW (2022) BOOTY BOOST PROGRAM IS LIVE!&#10;https://getfitbyivana.com&#10;&#10;My Booty Boost program is designed to achieve progressive booty growth by doing the right volume of training and the right choice of exercises.&#10;&#10;The program includes:&#10;- A comprehensive 12 week booty workout plan&#10;- 6 follow-through workout videos&#10;- A 12 week (day-by-day) follow-through booty schedule&#10;- A progress tracking page (before &#38; after photos, booty measurement, strength assessment)&#10;- A private photo library&#10;- Plus more!&#10;&#10;&#128073; Clothing brand: www.phlurtofficial.com&#10;&#10;This is a challenge you have never tried before! We will be working out to a specific pace/beat.. Why is this good? Keeping the same pace doesn't give us time to rest and therefore our muscles are under tension the whole time. And that means GREATER RESULTS :) Are you ready to try this?&#10;&#10;&#129361; Diet tips: I always recommend to eat as healthy as possible and drink enough water throughout the day. If you want to put on muscle, increased calorie intake is important. As a tip - Grab a healthy option in between your meals like nuts, bananas, avocado, protein yogurt etc.&#10;&#10;&#129419; SHARE AND POST YOU PROGRESS PICTURES ON INSTAGRAM AND USE #getfitbyivana&#10;&#10;&#127752; SUBSCRIBE to my BOYFRIEND'S Exercise Channel:  @getfitbyjayden  &#10;&#10;&#128247; Instagram: getfitbyivana_&#10;https://www.instagram.com/getfitbyivana_/?hl=en&#10;&#128038; Twitter: getfitbyivana&#10;https://twitter.com/getfitbyivana&#10;&#128233; Business Enquires: &#10;getfitbyivana@gmail.com&#10;&#10;Music by:&#10;1)&#10;Track: Adam Vitali - CONSCIENCE&#10;Link: https://youtu.be/3ZnPIn9C034&#10;2)&#10;Waking Up At Noon by Carl Storm https://soundcloud.com/carlstorm&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6TE_vnwzNXvimAR7cLlVag&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://bit.ly/waking-up-at-noon&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/Jbhz73p86TM&#10;3)&#10;Track: L3V3LS - All Over (Outertone Free Release)&#10;Link: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OnDIuGSof5M&#10;Download here: https://soundcloud.com/outertone/l3v3&#10;Music provided by Outertone https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEu0cvEF7vfIbLYTVgdtHCQ&#10;Follow L3V3LS:&#10;https://soundcloud.com/l3v3ls&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCVNihbOdkOWw_-ajIYhAbQ&#10;https://l3v3ls.bandcamp.com/&#10;Follow Outertone: &#10;Website: http://outertone.com&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/outertonemusic&#10;Twitter: http://twitter.com/outertonemusic&#10;SoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/outertone"
