    title "How I Dropped 10% Body Fat In 3 Months (and more importantly, everything i learned)"
    description "Hi Guys!! I hope today's video helps you out! If you've been watching my channel, you know that 3 months ago I enlisted the help of a nutritionist to help me get my health on track. During these 3 months, I dropped 10% body fat, but even more importantly I learned so much about my health and fat loss in general. I wanted to make today's video to help share what I've learned for those who are interested, and also for those who can't afford to see a nutritionist themselves! Please remember this was all just a plan tailored specifically for me, so I'm not guaranteeing it will do anything for anyone else. But I do hope that you will be able to take away something that I learned and hopefully apply it to your own journey! love you sooo much!&#10;&#10;check out these sites to learn more!&#10;https://g-plans.com/&#10;https://www.doctoroz.com/quiz/quiz-what-your-metabolism-type&#10;https://gethealthyu.com/the-3-metabolic-body-types-explained/&#10;&#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/MissRemiAshten/join &#10;&#10;Listen to Pretty Basic here!&#10;Apple Podcasts:   https://apple.co/2Pgp7jV&#10;Stitcher:   https://bit.ly/2PTkJEw&#10;TuneIn:  https://bit.ly/2EK2Ruv&#10;Spotify:  https://spoti.fi/2PTBwHz          &#10;RSS: https://bit.ly/2O4nMYE&#10;&#10;Get Honeypop here!&#10;https://shophoneypop.com/&#10;&#10;WATCH MY VLOGS HERE!&#10;http://www.youtube.com/user/RemLife&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME HERE!!&#10;twitter: https://twitter.com/missremiashten&#10;instagram: @missremiashten&#10;https://www.instagram.com/missremiash...&#10;snapchat: @remiikinss&#10;facebook: https://www.facebook.com/missremiashten/&#10;&#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;postmates code: m1phk&#10;uber code: b4d5b&#10;main channel: http://www.youtube.com/user/MissRemiA...&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;business inquiries only:&#10;colette@expandentertainment.co"
