    title "FULL WEEK OF WORKOUTS | My Workout Routine + How I Stay Fit From Home!"
    description "HI FRIENDS!!! Welcome to my first ever full week of workouts! This new series is going to show you exactly what I do to stay active throughout the week. I hope this can give you some inspiration and motivation for your future workouts. Feel free to screenshot &#38; try some of them for yourself :)&#10;&#10;SHOP GYMSHARK (with my link eeeep): http://gym.sh/Shop-Kris&#10;I appreciate and love everyone who has shopped using my link! Be sure to follow me on IG (@sanfrankrisco) for updates on Gymshark's upcoming releases :)&#10;&#10;Friday's Workout: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rj8HC3qTsUg&#10;&#10;THANK YOU FOR WATCHING!&#10;I love you all so much!&#10;Subscribe for more videos! &#9825; &#10;&#10;____________________________&#10;&#10;&#10;FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS:&#10;&#10063; What camera do I use? &#8212; Canon G7X Mark II (mostly for vlogging), Canon T5i (for regular videos)&#10;&#10063; What do I use to edit? &#8212; iMovie for videos, PicMonkey for thumbnails&#10;&#10063; How old am I? &#8212; 22 (when this video was posted)&#10;&#10063; What school do I go to? &#8212; San Jose State University (just graduated, class of 2020 baby!)&#10;&#10063; What am I majoring in? &#8212; Business Marketing&#10;&#10;____________________________&#10;&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME:&#10;&#10155; Instagram: sanfrankrisco&#10;&#10155; Twitter: sanfrankrisco&#10;&#10155; Snapchat: krissswashere&#10;&#10155; Spotify: krissswashere&#10;&#10155; Soundcloud: sanfrankrisco&#10;&#10;&#10;____________________________&#10;&#10;&#10;FTC: This video is not sponsored. Some links are affiliate links, which helps support my channel :)&#10;&#10;FOR BUSINESS INQUIRIES:&#10;Email: sanfrankrisco@gmail.com"
