    date "2021-01-03T11:08:12Z"
    title "7min Abs Workout &#128293; V-cut Obliques"
    description "Get ready for one of the best Oblique Workouts of your LIFE! Let's get it! This is a full oblique workout that will focus on getting ripped v-cuts that you can do whenever and wherever you like... You won't need any equipment or weight.&#10;&#10;To develop a truly impressive Sixpack - you&#8217;ll want to train from abs a whole range of perspectives. You see, the core is generally made up of three key components. Namely the abdominals (6pack), obliques, and the serratus anterior. In order to develop a full midsection, you'll need to take care of all three areas.&#10;&#10;You can hit this home workout 1-2x per week - and if you wanted to keep active on your other days - be sure to check out my other workouts!&#10;&#10;1) Russian Twists&#10;2) Oblique Heel Taps&#10;3) Side Crunches&#10;4) Side Plank Twists&#10;5) Plank Rotations&#10;6) Mountain Climbers&#10;7) Lying Leg Raise Twist&#10;8) Lying Cross Leg Kicks&#10;9) V Sit Static Hold Twist&#10;10) L Sit Cross Punch&#10;11) Stomach Vacuums&#10;&#10;&#128073;Coaching Programs: https://www.fraserwilsonfitness.com&#10;&#128073;Subscribe: (https://goo.gl/84uFTA)&#10;&#128073;Clothes by Gymshark: https://gym.sh/Shop-Fraser2&#10;&#128073;Supplements: http://1upnutrition.com CODE: FRASERFIT&#10;&#10;ADD ME ON:&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/FraserWilso...&#10;Facebook: https://facebook.com/FraserWilsonFit/&#10;Snapchat: FraserWilsonFit&#10;&#10;Music:&#10;Cushy - Twist&#10;https://youtu.be/HiBk-fFlSp4&#10;&#10;Hallman - All In My Head&#10;https://youtu.be/tYnSzK627eU&#10;&#10;Cacti - Tropical Storm (Cospe Remix)&#10;https://youtu.be/_yt_nZgv7S8"
