    date "2020-05-27T15:01:04Z"
    title "10 MIN NECK FRIENDLY AB WORKOUT | no more neck and lower back pain"
    description "You want to train your abs but with the usual workouts you suffer from neck strain or lower back pain?&#10;&#128293;Then you should join me in my 10 min neck and back friendly ab workout!&#10;&#10;&#128170;The workout consists of 20 different ab exercises. The good thing is, you train your abs but you don't put a strain on your neck or back. This ab workout is beginner friendly but also appropriate for advanced people.&#10;&#10;You can perfectly do this neck and back friendly ab workout at home. &#10;Join me in this workout and say hello to trained abs and goodbye to neck and back pain!&#129321;&#10;&#10;Let's work on our sixpack! &#129421;&#10;&#10;&#128587;&#127996;&#8205;&#9792;&#65039;I am Nadja and I am a pole and aerial dancer, founder of AIRobics and an expert in fitness and dancing. &#10;&#10;Follow me on Instagram for more input about fitness, stretching, dancing and acrobatics:&#10;&#128293;https://www.instagram.com/nadjanero/?hl=de&#10;&#10;********************************&#10;&#10;What do you think about the video? &#10;&#9658;&#9658; tell me in the comments&#10;&#10;If you like the video, click &#34;&#128077;&#34; .&#10;You are more than welcome to share the video with your friends&#128107;&#10;&#10;&#11014;&#65039;Subscribe to my channel &#11014;&#65039;&#10;for more workouts and tutorials&#10;&#10;********************************&#10;&#10;&#8505;&#65039;Other effective fitness and stretching workouts:&#10;&#10;10 MIN DANCE STRETCH WORKOUT for fun and flexibility&#10;&#128073;https://youtu.be/yQG_mm3yWWg&#10;&#10;8 min full body warmup and stretch before workout&#10;&#128073;https://youtu.be/dFzfvPe6qcw&#10;&#10;7 min stretching at home office:&#10;&#128073;https://youtu.be/JbCPsBcYWok&#10;&#10;Middle Split Stretching:&#10;&#128073;https://youtu.be/NwH10lGx8bk&#10;&#10;Front Split Stretching:&#10;&#128073;https://youtu.be/Mfd3nXDzLlk&#10;&#10;********************************&#10;&#10;&#127925;Music:&#10;&#10;Track: Cartoon - Howling (ft. Asena) (Andromedik Remix) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/gUQDq9ezuJQ&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/HowlingRmx&#10;&#10;Track: Distrion - Alibi (ft. Heleen) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/_8Em605BQz4&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/Alibi&#10;&#10;Track: Marin Hoxha &#38; Caravn - Eternal [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/hECg1-wUyKg&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/Eternal&#10;&#10;Track: Tinoma - Find You [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/GW_TLXbZmz4&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/TFindYou"
