    title "6 Min Flat Belly Standing Abs Workout (GET AB LINES + RIPPED ABS)"
    description "6 Min Flat Belly Standing Abs Workout (GET AB LINES + RIPPED ABS)  // Caroline Jordan // For more info about abs workouts and other abs exercises, head over to: https://carolinejordanfitness.com&#10;&#10;&#9203;Video Chapters&#9203;&#10;00:00 Introduction&#10;01:20 Standing Bicycle Knee Twist&#10;02:20 Standing Oblique&#10;03:20 Standing Golfer&#10;04:20 Standing Punch&#10;05:20 Good Morning&#10;08:32 Standing Kick Cross&#10;&#10;Help me to maintain and grow this channel!!!&#10;become a Patreon here: https://www.patreon.com/carolinejordanfitness &#10;or donate Paypal: https://www.paypal.me/CarolineJordanUS &#10;or Venmo: https://venmo.com/carolinejordanfitness&#10;&#10;This standing abs workout leaves no core muscle untouched. The best part is you can do it literally anywhere because you don't need to lie down on an exercise mat!  If you are consistently doing this video 3-4 times a week for 4 weeks, you WILL see results. You'll feel stronger in your core and see a reduction in your waistline, not to mention improvements in your posture and performance. Take the flat belly abs challenge by committing to this routine. These are some of the best exercises to tighten your abs and lose belly fat from home. Do this video for 4 weeks consecutively paired with good nutrition for the best results. Leave me a comment and let me know how you feel after 4 weeks of consistent core training! &#10;&#10;&#9829; No matter how where you are in your health and fitness, you CAN start getting fit and improving your life! Start this workout with me &#9829; Snap &#38; Share pictures of your progress. Tag me @carolinejordanfitness I want you to be healthy &#38; happy. =) &#9829; LIKE, SHARE this video &#38; SUBSCRIBE. https://www.youtube.com/CarolineJordan?sub_confirmation=1 Support me in reaching more subscribers!!! xx&#10;&#10;Positive Feel Good Fitness,&#10;-Caroline Jordan&#10;&#10;Related Videos&#9654;&#65039;&#10;&#9654;&#65039;15 Min Seated Upper Body Workout with 