    title "NECK FRIENDLY ABS WORKOUT // Train your abs without hurting your neck | Twice as Fit"
    description "This is for everyone who struggles with neck pain while working out. This neck friendly abs workout will make you become stronger and strenghten your abs while giving your neck a little break &#129303;. The goal here is to train your abs without hurting your neck. We want you to get results while working out of course, but also to take it slow and always LISTEN TO YOUR BODY. That is so important!&#10;&#10;In this workout we are going to either keep our heads on the floor, support our heads with our hands, or do exercises on our elbows. Super easy, but believe us you will still feel the burn in your abs &#128293;. Aaand if that's not enough for you, feel free to go ahead and do a second round &#128556;&#10;&#10;Try it out and let us know what you think! Can&#8217;t wait to share more workouts with you all! &#10;We are so grateful to see this community growing together. Remember, we love to hear from you in the comments &#10084;&#65039; DON'T FORGET to Like and Subscribe to see what's coming next!&#10;&#10;Use #TwiceasFit if you want us to see and share your workout pics and videos on Instagram! &#10;&#10;If you liked this abs workout, then you're gonna LOVE these:&#10;INTENSE LOWER AB WORKOUT 8 min &#10137; https://youtu.be/zgc4PssmEh8&#10;20 MIN BEST AB ROUTINE for at Home &#10137; https://youtu.be/nlFD73RiSeg&#10;15 MIN BEACH BODY WORKOUT at Home &#10137;https://youtu.be/0-66SBQaggs&#10;&#10;&#9825; Subscribe to our YouTube Channel &#10145;&#65039; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgwdLbJnOJJMPJX5nIdxjyA?sub_confirmation=1 &#10;&#10;&#9825; Follow us on I N S T A G R A M for daily motivation: @twiceasfit_ &#10145;&#65039; https://www.instagram.com/twiceasfit_/?hl=en &#10;&#10;Our amazing abs workout music &#127925; &#10;&#11088; Things I Love - Lvly&#10;&#11088; Done - Lvly&#10;&#11088; Messed It Up (Chez Remix) - Lvly&#10;&#11088; Sleeping In My Head (Manta Circle Remix) - Siine&#10;&#10;#Abs #Fitness #HomeWorkouts"
