    date "2021-09-02T18:24:20Z"
    title "10 Min 11 Line ABS WORKOUT (neck friendly) - Abs Workout Easy On Neck"
    description "Happy Thanksgiving everyone!! I&#8217;m so thankful for having you all part of our community and thankful that you join me in my workouts!! It gives my heart a very fuzzy feeling&#129392; &#10;&#10;&#128071; To subscribe : &#10;https://tinyurl.com/yhkjfyqg&#10;&#10;Here is an 11 LINE ABS WORKOUT. 10 min, neck friendly!!! This workout includes exercises that are easy on the neck and focuses on targeting the obliques! Support the channel and get access to more exclusive home workout content!&#10;&#10;Workout Instructions:&#10;1. Keep your back to the ground&#10;2. Use your ab muscles with every movement&#10;3. Slower movement with control is better than faster without control.&#10;&#10;Exercises:&#10;&#9733;Slow reverse crunch&#10;&#9733;Leg raises variation&#10;&#9733;Leg extensions&#10;&#9733;Neck friendly jackknife&#10;&#9733;Scissors in crunch&#10;&#9733;Crunch - Extend on elbows&#10;&#9733;Knee bear hug&#10;&#9733;Flat bear hug&#10;&#9733;Slow side crunch &#10;&#9733;Side leg strikes &#10;&#9733;Arrow crunch &#10;&#9733;Side raises and crunches &#10;&#9733;Spiderman plank&#10;&#9733;Frog jump&#10;&#10;Music by Epidemic Sound: https://www.epidemicsound.com/music/f......&#10;   &#10;-Working out is essential for a healthy lifestyle and maintenance of general well-being. It is often difficult to find time to work out especially when our lives are already so full with so many commitments. As a mom and full-time nurse, I understand how challenging it can be to find time to work out. I create these follow-along workouts to help you stay in shape and feel great despite the lack of time to work out.&#10;&#10;&#9888;&#65039;DISCLAIMER&#9888;&#65039; &#10;When doing any of my workouts, please make sure to exercise caution. Please only exercise in a safe, clutter-free environment and I suggest consulting a family doctor prior to starting any activity and if you have experienced any injury in the past. Please exercise at your own risk while doing any Anastasia Vlassov workouts. Anastasia Vlassov will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video. Your health and safety are of the most importance so exercise at your comfort level and do only those exercises that you feel safe doing.&#10;&#10;&#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674;&#10;&#127916;CHECK OUT OTHER VIDEOS:&#128071;&#10;&#10149;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pUrGcB-Yxpc&#38;t=11s&#10;&#10149;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bMGk1gAuFJ0&#38;t=42s&#10;&#10149;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qDh6vnvInWQ&#38;t=119s&#10;&#10149;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eCkb2Kd1IzE&#38;t=22s&#10;&#10149;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b7kl0RVFsh4&#38;t=20s&#10;&#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674;&#10;Follow me on INSTAGRAM- https://www.instagram.com/anastasia.v/&#10;&#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674; &#8674;&#10;&#10;Hope you enjoy today's video!&#10;Please show your love and support by liking and subscribing to the channel so we can grow a strong and powerful community. &#10;&#10;Activate the &#128276; beside the subscribe button to get the notification!&#128233; If you have any questions or requests feel free to leave them in the comments below.&#10;&#10;Thank you for watching and see you in my next video!!  &#10;&#10;&#128150; Anastasia &#10;&#10;&#10;#absworkout #abworkout #neckfriendlyworkout #workout #neckfriendlyabs #11lineabs #11lineabsworkout  #abcrackworkout #homeworkout #AnastasiaVlassov"
