    title "10 MINUTE INTENSE AB WORKOUT Neck Friendly // Abs workout for neck pain | Twice as Fit"
    description "10 Minute Intense Ab Workout NECK FRIENDLY! This is the best abs workout for neck pain!&#10;&#10;This workout is super neck friendly &#10084;&#65039; we planned it so that you don&#8217;t have to worry about your neck hurting &#128129;&#127996;&#8205;&#9792;&#65039;&#128129;&#127996;&#8205;&#9792;&#65039; just those abs getting tighter &#128293;&#10;&#10;If you sometimes have neck pain while doing some of our ab exercises, for example the crunches that we put in allll of our abs videos, this workout might work better for you!&#10;&#10;The video is just 10 minutes but we still tried to keep it intense and effective for you so you can achieve your fitness goals.&#10;&#10;We would love to know if you like these neck friendly exercises and would like us to include more of them in our next workouts &#129392;&#10;&#10;Try it out and let us know what you think! Can&#8217;t wait to share more workouts with you all! &#10;We are so grateful to see this community growing together. Remember, we love to hear from you in the comments &#10084;&#65039; DON'T FORGET to Like and Subscribe to see what's coming next!&#10;&#10;Use #TwiceasFit if you want us to see and share your workout pics and videos on Instagram! &#10;&#10;If you liked this abs workout, then you're gonna LOVE these:&#10;10 MIN ABS WORKOUT TO GET FLAT BELLY &#10137; https://youtu.be/b8mZYIADI9E&#10;GET CRAZY ABS 10 MINUTE WORKOUT &#10137; https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y6bIc9eJY7k&#38;t=209s&#10;15 MIN BOOTY WORKOUT NO SQUATS NO JUMPS &#10137; https://youtu.be/XZtZUTW9Kuk&#10;&#10;&#9825; Subscribe to our YouTube Channel &#10145;&#65039; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgwdLbJnOJJMPJX5nIdxjyA?sub_confirmation=1 &#10;&#10;&#9825; Follow us on I N S T A G R A M for daily motivation: @twiceasfit_ &#10145;&#65039; https://www.instagram.com/twiceasfit_/?hl=en &#10;&#10;Our amazing abs workout music &#127925; &#10;&#11088; The Light - Loving Caliber&#10;&#11088; It's Deja Vu - ELWIN&#10;&#11088; The Right Thing to Do - Andy Delos Santos&#10;&#11088; Nobody Loves Me Better - Sture Zetterberg&#10;&#10;#absworkout #intenseworkout #fitness"
