    title "10 minute Calorie Burning Workout. Speed Up Your Metabolism (10 day challenge!)"
    description "10 minute Calorie Burning Workout. Speed Up Your Metabolism 10 day challenge // Caroline Jordan // Thanks to Lumen for sponsoring this video! Use code &#34;CAROLINE40&#8221; for $40 off and get your Lumen today (exclusive for the first 100 people who use the code!)!  Click here: http://www.lumen.me/shop?utm_source=influencer&#38;utm_medium=youtube&#38;utm_campaign=carolinejordan  &#10;&#10;Help me to maintain and grow this channel!!!&#10;become a Patreon here: https://www.patreon.com/carolinejordanfitness&#10;or donate Paypal: https://www.paypal.me/CarolineJordanUS&#10;or Venmo: https://venmo.com/carolinejordanfitness&#10;&#10;This home fitness video is 10 minutes to speed up your metabolism in just 10 days. With age, your metabolism naturally starts slowing down. But this 10-minute metabolism-boosting workout is full of exercises to boost metabolism and help you jump-start your metabolic rate again. Let me teach you HOW to master your metabolism and a 10-minute metabolism-boosting workout you can do to shift your body to fat burn.&#10;&#10;How this workout works &#8211; I suggest you do this workout every single day for 10 days. You can expect to see amazing results if you do the workout every day, if you eat well, sleep well, and if you drink water. You will see an increase in your energy and feel better in your body. You will feel lighter and see improvements in your posture, mood, and performance. 10 minutes a day is all it takes to kickstart your metabolism and move your life in a positive direction. Take the 10-day challenge with me. Comment and let me know you are IN and ready to get moving for a faster metabolism every day for 10 days!&#10;&#10;Today I use  Lumen to help me hack my metabolism and be smart about my workout and food choices.&#10;&#10;Lumen, is a first-of-its-kind handheld, portable device, and app that measures your metabolism in real-time with just a breath. Lumen measures the C02 levels in your breath to interpret if your body is using carbs or fats for fuel. With Lumen, you&#8217;ll know your current metabolic state and HOW to change it through your exercise and nutrition choices.&#10;&#10;Lumen has helped me to validate the effectiveness of my workouts on my body and allowed me to be metabolically flexible. Lumen is like having a coach and nutritionist in your pocket and the perfect health tool to reach your fitness and weight loss goals. Metabolic health is at the core of health and wellness from nutrition to fitness and weight loss, your metabolism and how efficient it is at processing energy makes all the difference.  Lumens metabolic health check can help you get an understanding of your current metabolic state and what you can do about it. Get a free metabolic health check: http://www.lumen.me/metabolic-assessment&#34;&#10;&#10;Thanks to Lumen, 100 people will be gifted $40 dollars off their first order. Use the code &#8220;CAROLINE40&#8221; for $40 off &#8211; act now so you can be one of the first 100 to get this special discount! Click here: http://www.lumen.me/shop?utm_source=influencer&#38;utm_medium=youtube&#38;utm_campaign=carolinejordan &#10;&#10;Positive Feel Good Fitness,&#10;-Caroline Jordan&#10;&#10;#CJFitness&#10;&#10;&#128071;SUBSCRIBE TO CAROLINE&#8217;S YOUTUBE CHANNEL NOW&#128071;&#10;https://www.youtube.com/CarolineJordan?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;&#9733;&#9734;&#9733; CONNECT WITH CAROLINE ON SOCIAL MEDIA &#9733;&#9734;&#9733;&#10;Caroline Jordan Blog: https://carolinejordanfitness.com/blog/&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/carolinejordanfitness&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/carolinejordanfitness/&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/carolinefitness&#10;Linkedin: https://www.linkedin.com/in/caroline-jordan-7531315b/&#10;&#10;&#128170;TRAINING AND PROGRAMS &#128187;&#10;HURT FOOT FITNESS EXCLUSIVE COACHING PROGRAM: https://www.hurtfootfitness.com&#10;WORKOUT VIDEO LIBRARY: https://www.hurtfootfitness.com/workout-video-library&#10;HURT FOOT DIET GUIDE: https://www.hurtfootfitness.com/healingdiet&#10;STRONG BODY PROGRAM: https://www.hurtfootfitness.com/strongbody&#10;DIABETES WEIGHT LOSS PROGRAM: https://hurtfootfitness.com/diabetes-exercises-for-weight-loss-workout-program&#10;SCIATIC NERVE PAIN RELIEF PROGRAM: https://get-pain-relief-now.teachable.com/p/sciatic-nerve-pain-relief&#10;&#10;#CarolineJordan &#10;DISCLAIMER: This content (the video, description, links, and comments) is not medical advice or a treatment plan and is intended for general education and demonstration purposes only. This content should not be used to self-diagnose or self-treat any health, medical, or physical condition. Don&#8217;t use this content to avoid going to your own healthcare professional or to replace the advice they give you. Consult with your healthcare professional before doing anything contained in this content. You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Caroline Jordan Fitness its officers, employees, and contractors for any and all losses, injuries, or damages resulting from any and all claims that arise from your use or misuse of this content. Caroline Jordan Fitness makes no representations about the accuracy or suitability of this content. Use of this content is at your sole risk."
