    description "HOW I LOST 15LBS IN 3 MONTHS &#38; KEPT IT OFF BY WALKING: Weight Loss Tip, Losing FAT, boost metabolism&#10;&#10;&#10;My in depth treadmill routine: https://youtu.be/fZpnJLRGZ74&#10;&#10;the most vulnerable video I have ever posted&#10;&#10;Here is my entire journey, my tips, growth and more. I grew a lot middle to end of 2021 physically, mentally, and more. I lost 15 lbs, I am happier and healthier. I uncovered disorderly eating and unhealthy habits and am working on repairing them still and always will. Body image will always be a struggle but I have learned to appreciate myself more than ever before. I have a different outlook on health, exercise, food and my body overall. Nobody needs to look a certain way but if you are struggling and want to make change like I did, if I can do it, you can do it.&#10;&#10;Big shout out to Lauren Giraldo for changing my life with her 12 3 30 workout&#10;&#10;Main Workout (Lauren Giraldo&#8217;s):&#10;12 3 30 Treadmill workout&#10;12 incline, 3 speed, 30 minutes. Increase the speed, incline, and time as it gets easier and do a long cool down walk.&#10;&#10;Treadmill used: AFG 3.3at treadmill&#10;https://www.searshometownstores.com/product/AFG-33AT-Treadmill-FREE-DELIVERY&#10;&#10;Loved Recipes:&#10;2 Ingredient Bagels: https://vm.tiktok.com/TTPdMBduBq/&#10;Mediterranean Quinoa Bowl: https://pin.it/uLMcQqy&#10;Butternut Squash Pasta: https://youtu.be/q48GrXmIztM&#10;&#10;loved foods: &#10;eggs, salads with LOTS of ingredients to keep it ACTUALLY tasty and not boring and only leaves, fruit smoothies, various soups, banza noodles, Emily Mariko salmon rice bowl, pretzel and hummus snack, whole grain swaps, healthy alternatives to traditional favorites&#10;&#10;&#10;Thank you for watching&#10;Please like, comment and subscribe if you like!&#10;&#10;follow me :)&#10;Instagram: morgreeen&#10;https://www.instagram.com/morgreeen/&#10;TikTok: morgreeen&#10;https://www.tiktok.com/t/ZTdGUkQRe/&#10;Pinterest: morgangreeeen&#10;https://pin.it/2tgUieR&#10;Twitter: mgreen_&#10;https://twitter.com/mgreen_&#10;&#10;Shop My Looks: http://Liketoknow.it/MorganGreen&#10;My Amazon Storefront Page!!! https://www.amazon.com/shop/morgangreen&#10;&#10;Codes &#38; Links~&#10;My Poshmark: https://posh.mk/DMKwXaZVJkb&#10;Ana Luisa: https://shop.analuisa.com/greeeen code: GREEEEN10 for 10%&#10;Andar: https://andar.com/?mct=MORGAN code: MORGAN for 15% off&#10;Afterbar: https://www.afterbar.us/ code: Morgan40 for 40% off&#10;Beis: https://beistravel.com/ code: MorganG15 for 15% off&#10;Dossier: code: https://dossier.co/ code: MorganGreen10 for 10% off&#10;Fanola: https://fanola.net/?rfsn=6135223.be35af&#38;utm_source=refersion&#38;utm_medium=affiliate&#38;utm_campaign=6135223.be35af code: MG10 for 10% off&#10;Highline Wellness: https://glnk.io/0yvn/morgan code: MORGAN for 10% off&#10;MERIT: https://muse.meritbeauty.com/morgan4&#10;Parade: https://secret.yourparade.com/morgangreeeen code: morgangreeeen for 20% off&#10;Static Nails: https://staticnails.com/collections/liquid-glass-lacquer?utm_source=youtube.com&#38;utm_medium=Influencers&#38;utm_campaign=MorganGreen&#38;utm_term=07162021 code: MORGAN10 for 10% off&#10;Teamiblends: https://www.teamiblends.com/discount/MGREEN20 code: MGREEN20 for 20% off&#10;Tribabe: https://shoptribabe.com/ code: Morgan20 for 20%&#10;Vanity Planet: https://deal.vanityplanet.com/morgangreeeen-50s code: MORGAN_50 for 50% off&#10;Zaful: https://zaful.app.link/JcnxFyvE1ib code: morgan for 18% off&#10;Support Me: https://venmo.com/code?user_id=2209942899523584185&#10;&#10;For business inquiries, please contact me at: morgreeen@gmail.com&#10;&#10;&#10;Music by Mark Generous - Warm Sands - https://thmatc.co/?l=737F36EF&#10;Music by Ryan Little - delirium. - https://thmatc.co/?l=46E42F3D&#10;&#10;&#10;#WeightLossJourney #Losing15lbs #HowILostWeight #12330 #MorganGreen&#10;weight loss, weight loss tips, weight loss journey, losing weight, how to lose weight, weight loss workout, exercise for losing weight, losing 15 pounds, keeping weight off, how I lost weight&#10;&#10;&#10;FTC Disclaimer: Some links included may be affiliate links that allow me to make a small commission. There is no extra charge or difference for you. Thank you for supporting me :)"
