    description "I TRIED THE CHLOE TING 2022 WEIGHT LOSS CHALLENGE (and it worked!!)&#10;&#10;&#10032;&#10032;&#10032;&#10032;&#10032;&#10;&#10;WE'RE BACK TO THE CHLOE TING CHALLENGES BABY! I made it my new year's resolution to do at least 4 of these challenges in 2022, and we're already a quarter of the way there! This challenge was 28 days long, so I did it throughout the entire month of February! Remember to LIKE and SUBSCRIBE, and COMMENT BELOW any other Chloe Ting challenges you want to see on my channel!   &#10;&#10;Try out the challenge for yourself: https://chloeting.com/program/2022/weight-loss-challenge&#10;&#10;O U T F I T   D E T A I L S:&#10;&#10032; Pink Top: https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B08CK4DC1Z/ref=ppx_yo_dt_b_asin_title_o09_s01?ie=UTF8&#38;th=1&#38;psc=1&#10;&#10032; Black Shorts: https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B08FXLN3QH/ref=ppx_yo_dt_b_asin_title_o09_s01?ie=UTF8&#38;th=1&#38;psc=1&#10;&#10;I N S T A  &#10;@charrlottepratt&#10;https://www.instagram.com/charrlottepratt/  &#10;&#10;M U S I C &#10;&#10032; Samba Isobel by Kevin MacLeod&#10;Link: https://incompetech.filmmusic.io/song/4316-samba-isobel &#10;License: https://filmmusic.io/standard-license&#10;&#10032; Music by DQ Quads&#10;&#10;A B O U T    M E&#10;hi I'm glad you're watching this video! I'm charlotte, I'm 20 years old, and I'm a junior year transfer student studying communications at the University of Michigan! I post weekly vlogs all about my lifestyle as a college student, including productivity, hauls, and fun with my roommates! If you like my videos, make sure to like and subscribe, and share my channel with your friends!!   &#10;&#10;sub count to look back on: 971   &#10;&#10;if you're reading this, comment &#8220;Chloe Ting&#8221; :)&#10;&#10;Chapters:&#10;00:00-00:52 Intro&#10;00:52-01:23 Before Measurements&#10;01:23-03:06 Week 1&#10;03:06-05:13 Week 2&#10;05:13-07:37 Week 3&#10;07:37-12:00 Week 4&#10;12:00-13:50 After Measurements&#10;13:50-14:38 Before &#38; After Com