    title "- 12 cm in 2 WEEKS ! FLAT STOMACH in just 10 minutes! without fat in the lower abdomen &#129327;&#128293;&#128170;&#127997;"
    description "#nowar &#10;&#10;Number of repetitions:&#10;&#128150;1 level (for beginners): 1-2&#10;&#128155;Level 2 (for those who have been doing sports for more than a month): 3&#10;&#128154;Level 3(PRO): 4&#10;&#10;&#10068; &#10067; Q&#38;A: &#10067; &#10068;&#10;&#128562; I can't jump! What to do?&#10;- Replace jumping with squats or any other exercise! &#10; &#1055;&#1086;&#1074;&#1090;&#1086;&#1088; Repeat this workout the next day?&#10;- No, we study all day, we rest all day! &#10;&#128170;&#127996; When to do exercises?&#10;- Preferably in the morning (on an empty stomach), BUT! if there is no opportunity, the main thing is to do it, and when it is not so important compared to how much time to train!&#10;&#128148; I have my period, is it possible to practice? &#10;- Do not strain your body during critical days. Because of this, big health problems may begin in the future. Therefore, if there is no pain and you feel good, do it, but not much.&#10;&#127828;How to eat to lose weight in the legs/ What is there to lose weight in the legs?&#10;(in the stomach, in the hands, in the knees..)&#10;- It is physiologically impossible to lose weight &#34;only in the legs&#34;. Fat is distributed evenly throughout the body. EXCLUDE FLOUR, SWEET AND FRIED! Everything useful remains.. apples, porridge, fish, chicken, cottage cheese... as they say, everything is useful, but in moderation. The most important thing is proteins (cottage cheese, eggs, chicken, turkey..) + fiber in the form of green vegetables. The rest is cereals like buckwheat, rice (brown preferably), lentils, mash, beans, etc. Be careful with fruits, because they contain a lot of fructose, which does not remove hunger, but only provokes it. &#10;I will also advise you to eat 2 times a day (3 can be made in the form of vegetables, fruit or berries, if you are really hungry). Interval fasting 16/8 is more or less gentle, I practice myself. &#10;Drink tea without sugar 1-4 times a day, coffee without milk 1-2 times a day, 1-2 liters of water is mandatory!&#10;BUT DO NOT FORGET ABOUT THE CALORIE CONTENT OF THE DAY! You can calculate it here: https://www.calc.ru/kalkulyator-kalor...&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;in the video, a thin waist and a flat stomach IN JUST 5 MINUTES, or how to reduce the belly and also a flat stomach, press + how to lose weight here is to lose weight quickly!!!waist exercises at home!exercises for the press at home), how to remove the stomach is interesting) how to lose weight in the stomach or flat stomach in 7 days! 2 weeks of challenge press, press for a week, press for 5 minutes and here's another press for 5 minutes a day! This is the coolest abs workout in 5 minutes! how to lose weight in a week!just like losing weight in the thighs and also how to lose weight in the thighs by 7 cm. it is possible how to lose weight in the thighs by 5 cm. how to lose weight in the legs at home?And also, how to lose weight at home? and how to lose weight at home!I lost weight in my thighs in a week)) skinny legs and leg exercises.slender legs in 5 minutes!&#9829;&#10;As well as skinny thighs and skinny thighs))) lost weight in the thighs and also lost weight in the thighs!I lost weight in lashes in a week)) beautiful ass, tight ass, how to lose weight in the ass. training for the buttocks, how to tighten the buttocks &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Improve with me&#128170; &#10;It is worth only 1 time not to give up.. &#129321;&#10;to get everything you wanted&#128293;&#10; You have a subscription - I have the coolest videos! &#128149;&#10;&#10;&#10;Social network: &#10;https://www.instagram.com/alyonext/&#10;&#10;&#10;Cooperation: &#10;unionalyonext@mail.ru"
