    date "2018-01-27T22:23:56Z"
    title "15 Minute BUTT Workout - Fitness Series With Romee Strijd"
    description "15 min BUTT workout - you can make more advanced by using ankle weights or tighter bands&#10;&#10;Warm up: &#10;A) Jump Squats X 20&#10;B) Reversed Lunges + Kick X 20 (each side)&#10;&#10;Booty Kicks on the matt: &#10;A) Donkey Kicks X 20 + 20 Pulse (each side)&#10;B) Fire Hydrants X 20 + 20 Pulse (each side) &#10;C) Corner Kicks X 20 + 20 Pulse (each side)&#10;D) Up and Over X 20 (each side)&#10;E) Spider Kicks X 20 + 20 Pulse (each side)&#10;&#10;On the matt with band 2 inches above knee: &#10;A) Bridge with Butterflies X 20 + 20 Pulse &#10;B) Clams X 20 + 20 Pulse (each side)&#10;&#10;Standing position with band 2 inches above knee: &#10;A) Step forward X 20 &#38; step backward X 20&#10;B) Side walk X 20 (each side)&#10;C) Step outs X 20 (each side)&#10;&#10;Sportlegging + Top: @victoriasport&#10;Shoes: @adidas&#10;&#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Contact:&#10;info@bwlprojects.com&#10;&#10;Social media:&#10;Instagram: @RomeeStrijd&#10;Snapchat: @RomeeS&#10;&#10;Music credits:&#10;Giraffe Squad - Wait For Me [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds&#10;&#10;Ship Wrek &#38; Zookeepers - Ark [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds&#10;&#10;Jo Cohen &#38; Sex Whales - We Are [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds&#10;&#10;Warriyo - Mortals (feat. Laura Brehm) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds&#10;&#10;Adventures - A Himitsu (No Copyright Music)&#10;Music provided by Audio Library"
