    title "25 Minute FULL BODY Workout - Fitness Series With Romee Strijd"
    description "25 Minute FULL BODY Workout - Fitness Series With Romee Strijd&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE for NEW VIDEOS: https://bit.ly/2ID4evA&#10;&#10;Here's where I get my music from:&#10;http://share.epidemicsound.com/njDwH&#10;&#10;Personal:&#10;http://instagram.com/romeestrijd&#10;&#10;Business:&#10;info@bwlprojects.com&#10;&#10;Special thanks to:&#10;Joe Holder(@Ochosystem)&#10;&#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;1) BANDED LATERAL GLUTE WALKS(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;2) BANDED DROPBACK GLUTE WALKS(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;3) BANDED GLUTE TOE TAPS(30 SECONDS)&#10;+ OTHER SIDE(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;4) BANDED GLUTE HOPS(IN AND OUT)(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;5) BANDED GLUTE HOPS(FRONT TO BACK)(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;6) LUNGE WITH CROSS REACH TO ROW(45 SECONDS)&#10;+ OTHER SIDE(45 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;7) PLANK ROW TO &#34;BIRD DOG&#34; SERIES(60 SECONDS)&#10;+ OTHER SIDE(60 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;8) PLYO JUMPING JACKS(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;9) SQUAT TO PRESS X ROTATION(60 SECONDS)&#10;+ OTHER SIDE(60 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;10) HALF KNEELING CORE CHOP(30 SECONDS)&#10;+ OTHER SIDE(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;11) HALF KNEELING ROW(30 SECONDS)&#10;+ OTHER SIDE(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;12) SINGLE LEG TOE TOUCH(30 SECONDS)&#10;+ OTHER SIDE(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;13) SINGLE LEG GLUTE BRIDGE(30 SECONDS)&#10;+ OTHER SIDE(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;14) PLANK TO ROTATIONAL REACH(30 SECONDS)&#10;+ OTHER SIDE(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;15) &#34;GOOD MORNING&#34; TO WITH PULSE(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;16) DUMBBELL DEADLIFT(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;17) RUNNERS DEADLIFT(30 SECONDS)&#10;OTHER SIDE(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;18) SUMO DEADLIFT(30 SECONDS)&#10;&#10;19) RUNNERS DEADLIFT OTHER SIDE(30 SECONDS)"
