    step 1
    date "2019-12-01T14:46:35Z"
    title "24 Hours Before a Victoria's Secret Photoshoot"
    description "Hey guys, here's a new video about how I prep and get ready for a Victoria&#8217;s Secret photoshoot. My morning supplements, how I make my smoothie, grabbing a matcha, workout at Justin Gelband, lunch &#38; cryo with Laurens, infrared sauna, lymphatic drainage, grabbing dinner at the Whole Foods &#38; finishing the day with a spraytan. Ofcourse I don&#8217;t always prep like this because sometimes I&#8217;m traveling a day before the shoot but if I can I love to take a day to do selfcare, because it also makes me feel good and relaxed! Hope you guys like this video. Question: Do you guys like fermented veggies? I have a hard time getting used to sauerkraut etc, but it&#8217;s soo good for you, so I&#8217;ll keep giving it a try! X&#10;p.s don&#8217;t forget, new video already this Wednesday!!! &#128139;&#10;&#10;Click here to SUBSCRIBE for NEW VIDEOS: https://bit.ly/2ID4evA&#10;&#10;Here's where I get my music from:&#10;http://share.epidemicsound.com/njDwH&#10;&#10;Personal:&#10;IG: www.instagram.com/romeestrijd&#10;&#10;Business:&#10;info@bwlprojects.com&#10;&#10;Edit by RV Webdiensten"
