    title "Model Morning Routine | Breakfast, Skincare, Hair | Romee Strijd"
    description "Hi guys, some of you requested we should do a 'Model Morning Routine' video. This time I stayed at a hotel and got ready for a before going to work. Please let me know in the comments what kind of video you would love to see next! X&#10;&#10;Products we used in this video:&#10;Dry Skin Body Brush: http://bit.ly/302KsCF&#10;Kiehl&#8217;s Body Wash: http://bit.ly/31y647H&#10;K&#233;rastase Bodidying Shampoo: http://bit.ly/31j9rix&#10;iS Clinical Cleansing Complex: http://bit.ly/31tSYs4&#10;K&#233;rastase Bodifying Conditioner: http://bit.ly/31j9BXb&#10;Girl Undiscovered Body Scrub: http://bit.ly/31mwvNf&#10;Trader Joe&#8217;s Toothpaste: http://bit.ly/31nTuHN&#10;Gisou Hair Oil: http://bit.ly/31oJhuT&#10;Augustinus Bader The Rich Cream: http://bit.ly/31qBLPW&#10;Clarins Paris Radiance Glow Booster: http://bit.ly/31m3P76&#10;CeraVe Daily Moisturizing Lotion: http://bit.ly/31tTSVu&#10;Cl&#233; de Peau Eye Contour Cream: http://bit.ly/31nFgH9&#10;iS Clinical Extreme Protect: http://bit.ly/2ZSwbZi&#10;ReFa Roller: http://bit.ly/2ZSyVpB&#10;Sisley Lip Balm: http://bit.ly/31qbL7A&#10;&#10;Click here to SUBSCRIBE for NEW VIDEOS: https://bit.ly/2ID4evA&#10;&#10;Here's where I get my music from:&#10;http://share.epidemicsound.com/njDwH&#10;&#10;Instagram: @Romeestrijd&#10;&#10;Business: info@bwlprojects.com"
