    title "How I Became a Model? | Weight Struggles, Victoria&#8217;s Secret &#38; more | Romee Strijd"
    description "Hi guys, so last week I decided to share my story in this 'How I Became A Model' video. I am sharing How I became a Vicoria's Secret Angel, but I also had my own struggles from the moment when I started modeling till now. This is my story. X Romee&#10;&#10;Click here to SUBSCRIBE for NEW VIDEOS: https://bit.ly/2ID4evA&#10;&#10;Here's where I get my music from:&#10;http://share.epidemicsound.com/njDwH&#10;&#10;Personal:&#10;IG: @Romeestrijd&#10;&#10;Business:&#10;info@bwlprojects.com"
