    label "0PHfRy8fkPU"
    step 1
    date "2018-05-19T03:46:57Z"
    title "10 Minute Model Ab Routine | Model Workouts | Sanne Vloet"
    description "Hi Guys,&#10;&#10;Welcome back! So today I am sharing my perfect &#34;10 Minute Ab Workout&#34;. Believe me this will fire up all your stomach muscles and you are going to FEEL it today... and tomorrow too. I try to do this workout every day in addition to my full body workout or just in the morning if I don&#8217;t have that much time. &#10;&#10;We will do each exercise for:&#10;&#10;-50 Seconds with a 10 second break in between (short breaks)&#10;&#10;-10 Sets in total&#10;&#10;-Every motion is quite slow this way you will feel the burn even more&#10;&#10;LET'S DO IT!&#10;&#10;&#10;XXX Sanne&#10;&#10;Also don&#8217;t forget to say Hi on my other Channels:&#10;Instagram: @sannevloet&#10;https://www.instagram.com/sannevloet/?hl=en&#10;&#10;Wearing:&#10;&#10;Victoria&#8217;s Secret Sport Bra: https://rstyle.me/~atjuy&#10;Adidas legging: https://rstyle.me/~atjdl&#10;Urban Outfitters hoodie: https://rstyle.me/~atjeU&#10;Nike Air Max Shoes:  https://rstyle.me/~atjuS&#10;&#10;Business inquires: management@sannevloet.co"
