    step 1
    date "2020-03-23T04:55:41Z"
    title "10 MIN Small Waist Workout- No Equipment  // Curves &#38; Flat Belly // Sanne Vloet - #WithMe"
    description "10 MIN Small Waist Model Workout // Curves, Flat Belly, &#38; Tight Abs // Sanne Vloet - #WithMe&#10;EP. 2 Fit At Home w/ Sami Clarke&#10;&#10;Hi guys,&#10;&#10;This is a really strange time and I wanted to make sure I asked you to do all you can to help put an end to what is currently going on. By practicing social distancing, washing our hands (&#38; not touching our face), &#38; staying in if you can are all in place to help flatten the curve. Please feel free to share any health tips and ideas with the group in the comments below. Also, Sami and I are going live today Monday March 23rd on Instagram at 10am Los Angeles time. So that means 1pm in New York City!&#10;&#10;So if you clicked on this video then you noticed from the thumbnail that this was going to be our second episode of Fit At Home. We started this series last month and I'm glad we filmed a few workouts so that we could have a few to share with you while we are all under self quarantine. Where are you guys watching from today? Are you in quarantine as well or are things still happening in your hometown. &#10;&#10;I hope you guys  are safe with your loved ones. I've been cooking every night and trying out new recipes to maybe share with you on the channel. I think I'm going to try to film a What I Eat In A Day right now. I've been planning out my meals differently because we have not been going to the grocery story much because of what is going on.&#10;&#10;I hope all of you are subscribed and trying out our at home workouts! We have a couple more ready for the next few weeks and I am going to be sharing some more food content with recipes that are easy to make with things you can usually find at the super market. Make sure to give this workout a thumbs up and let us know what you thought about this workout! &#10;&#10;xx&#10;&#10;Sanne &#10;&#10;Wearing Lol&#233;&#10;Tops - Half Moon Top -  https://bit.ly/2QDkSOB&#10;Bottoms - Half Moon Short - https://bit.ly/39ijzeM &#10;&#10;Follow me!&#10;Instagram: @sannevloet (https://bit.ly/2vlnHLy)&#10;Twitter: @sannevloet (https://bit.ly/2OKggYH)&#10;Subscribe!!! https://bit.ly/2KzihS5&#10;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          &#10;Sami Clarke&#10;Youtube: https://bit.ly/39ikewN&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/samiclarke/?hl=en&#10;&#10;I used music from Epidemic Sound -  http://share.epidemicsound.com/GVgBV"
