    description "Instagram @ninadapper and @ninadapperlifestylecoach &#10;Inner and Outer Thigh Model Workout for Slim Lean Legs / Nina Dapper&#10;&#10;Hi guys, welcome to my newest workout on the floor. This is the perfect workout for slim, lean and toned model legs. We focus on the inner and outer thighs and you need no equipment besides a mat. The duration of the workout is 17 minutes. Do not forget to subscribe! &#10;&#10;Nike Workout Legging: https://pzz.to/RjOl88&#10;Nike Workout Bra: https://pzz.to/m1dXXE&#10;I use affiliate links. I do earn a small commission from this depending on the product. All products either used or recommended to you are products I truly enjoy and believe in.&#10;--&#10;&#9658;Music: www.bensound.com&#10;&#9658;Music Credit: LAKEY INSPIRED&#10;Track Name: &#34;This Feeling&#34;&#10;Music By: LAKEY INSPIRED @ https://soundcloud.com/lakeyinspired&#10;Original upload HERE - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kqh0r8lEo5M&#10;Official &#34;LAKEY INSPIRED&#34; YouTube Channel HERE - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOmy8wuTpC95lefU5d1dt2Q&#10;License for commercial use: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported &#34;Share Alike&#34; (CC BY-SA 3.0) License.&#10;Full License HERE - https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/legalcode&#10;Music promoted by NCM https://goo.gl/fh3rEJ &#10;&#9658;Song: &#34;Ikson - Anywhere [Tropical House]&#34; is free to use in social media.&#10;Music promoted by BreakingCopyright: http://bit.ly/Ikson-Anywhere&#10;&#9658;'Happy Life' by Fredji: https://soundcloud.com/fredjimusic&#10;Music promoted by BreakingCopyright: https://youtu.be/XvQ-5RCt9xs"
