    label "21yjW0jbvko"
    step 1
    date "2021-03-09T16:26:15Z"
    title "12 Min Strong Tight Abs // Tone &#38; Strengthen // No Equipment // Sami Clarke"
    description "12 Min Strong Tight Abs // Tone &#38; Strengthen // No Equipment // Sami Clarke&#10;&#10;Hi babes,&#10;&#10;We are going to kick&#10;This week off with an amazing abs workout! It&#8217;s been a little bit since I gave you something to move your body to, so here it is. This is going to test your stability and the more you shake, the more your body is developing strength.&#10;&#10;This is a little preview of what&#8217;s to come for my new fitness platform with Sanne. We&#8217;re so excited to bring you that full stop shop for your health. Keep up the good work and sign up below for all the news that is coming out!&#10;&#10;Remember, it&#8217;s the days where you dint feel like you want to that are the most important days to follow through on. That&#8217;s how we train our body&#8217;s for resilience.&#10;&#10;Keep me up to date on anything you have thoughts on in the comments below. Don&#8217;t forget to like and subscribe if you haven&#8217;t yet!&#10;&#10;xoxo&#10;&#10;-sc&#10;&#10;Sign up now: SoulSync.co&#10;&#10;Bandier Bottoms: https://www.bandier.com/products/bonded-active-legging-black-2?variant=32907415388194&#38;utm_source=google&#38;utm_medium=cpc&#38;utm_campaign=Smart%20Shopping%20General&#38;utm_adgroup=All%20Products&#38;utm_keyword=&#38;gclid=Cj0KCQiA1pyCBhCtARIsAHaY_5fS00sze2q5yCrEy_jddYaZVUXmwtcYMykcVMlCDQHJLT-kuEe31zoaAkiSEALw_wcB&#10;&#10;Find me on Fit Plan: https://fitplan.app.link/NYKYoutube"
