    description "30 min TABATA HIIT: Special workout to celebrate TEAM GROW - all 1,5 Mil+ of us &#129395; There's no better way than a sweaty HIIT party on the mat. Burn calories, have fun and give it all your energy Team! Come on, let's do it!&#10;&#10;&#9656; Muscles Worked: Full Body Toning&#10;&#9656; Time: 30 Min + Cool Down Stretches&#10;&#9656; Equipment: No Equipment&#10;&#10;Workout:&#10;&#9656; Workout 20 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;Air Squats&#10;Warm Up Run&#10;Reach Up + Down&#10;Kick your Butt&#10;Pull Down + Squat&#10;Jumping Jacks&#10;Reverse Lunges&#10;Squat + Pulse&#10;Half Burpees&#10;Kneeling Up&#10;Squat + Crunch&#10;Lateral Lunge + Knee Tap Right&#10;Squat Jumps&#10;Lateral Lunge + Knee Tap Left&#10;Rope Jumps&#10;Pop Squats&#10;Climbers&#10;In Out Jumps + Pulse&#10;Plank Jacks&#10;Squat Jacks&#10;Hand Release Push Ups&#10;Plank Butt Kicks&#10;Reverse Lunge + Knee Drive Right&#10;Reverse Lunge + Knee Drive Left&#10;Squat + Punch&#10;Punches&#10;Twist Jumps&#10;Split Squat Hops Left&#10;Split Squat Hops Right&#10;Curtsy Lunges&#10;Lunge Jump + Hop&#10;Thrusters&#10;Full Burpees&#10;Squat + Side Step&#10;Slams&#10;Fast Feet&#10;Lunge Jumps&#10;Star Side Plank Right&#10;Jumping Jack + Tuck Jump&#10;Star Side Plank Left&#10;Jumping Jack + Punch&#10;Up Down Plank&#10;Push Up + Toe Tap&#10;Low Push Up Hold + Plank Jacks&#10;Low Plank Climbers&#10;Low Plank Dips&#10;Bicycle Crunches&#10;Full Leg Raises&#10;Reverse Crunches&#10;Flutter Kicks&#10;Low Skater Jumps&#10;Jumping Jack Variation&#10;Diamond Push Ups&#10;Jack + Tuck Jump&#10;Star Jumps&#10;Double Jump + Tuck Jump&#10;Knee Tap Run&#10;Burpee + Tuck Jump&#10;Plank Jack + Bunny Hop&#10;Bunny Hops&#10;&#10;&#9656; Cool Down 30 sec on, 10 sec off&#10;Child's Pose&#10;Deep Lunge Left Leg&#10;Deep Lunge Right Leg&#10;Inhale &#38; Exhale&#10;&#10;&#10;Please remember that we are all different and that you can make this your own workout &#9825; Take a longer break when you need to.&#10;&#10;&#9825; Sign up