    description "OPEN ME &#9825;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Hey Friends! &#10;&#10;Welcome back to my channel! This video is my Chloe Ting 2 week shred challenge video. I&#8217;ve been seeing this challenge all over YouTube and I wanted to try it.&#10;&#10;I did this challenge in June but I was scared and embarrassed to post it. I am not comfortable at the weight that I am and I am pretty sure you can tell in the video. (I couldn't even say how much I weigh). I was scared of what people would say but knowing this video might motivate someone gave me the courage to post it.&#160;&#10;&#10;In the video, you&#8217;ll see before and after pictures. I will also talk about how the challenge was for me. During this challenge, I lost 4 pounds and 4 inches!&#160;&#10;&#10;If you have any questions, please let me know! Let me know if you&#8217;ve tried the challenge and how it went for you. I hope you guys enjoyed the video!&#160;&#10;&#10;&#10;Music by Syphax - Rose Lips - https://thmatc.co/?l=17A2D69F&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME ON THESE:&#10;&#10;&#9825; Twitter: https://twitter.com/Millicent1096&#10;&#9825; Instagram: http://instagram.com/KumbiraiC&#10;&#9825; SnapChat: @Millicent1096&#10;&#10;BUSINESS INQUIRIES: &#10;Email me @ kumbiraichigwedere1@gmail.com"
