~~~&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/lauralynn_89 &#10;&#10;Come join us on Discord: https://discord.gg/TDZRr2K&#10;&#10;For any *serious* business inquiries you can email me at: lauralynnvlog@gmail.com &#10;&#10;Any mail can be sent to: &#10;420 S 72nd Ave &#10;Ste 180 PMB 188 &#10;Yakima, WA 98908&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: Links included in this description might be affiliate links. As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.&#10;&#10;~~~FOR THE YOUTUBERS~~~&#10;GoPro Hero8 Black: https://amzn.to/3bUqWf0 &#10;GoPro Media Mod: https://amzn.to/33p9PhJ&#10;GoPro Display Mod: https://amzn.to/35DEA5r &#10;GoPro Light Mod: https://amzn.to/35DEuuB &#10;Microphone: https://amzn.to/2Zzcd4y &#10;Tripod: https://amzn.to/3hpMiCo &#10;Camera Accessory Kit: https://amzn.to/3kdThzX &#10;SanDisk Extreme Memory Card: https://amzn.to/3keFeu5 &#10;&#10;&#10;~~~MUSIC~~~ &#10;Carefree by @kevinmacleod &#10;Life of Riley by @kevinmacleod &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;#chloetingchallenge #chloetingstandingabs #chloeting #standingabs #abworkout #weightlossjourney #weightloss #losing200lbs #loseweightwithmevlog #200lbweightlossjourney #loseweightwithme #weightlossmotivation #weightlossgoals #weightlossinspiration &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;abs, abs workout, abs exercises,10 mins abs, abs at home, standing abs, standing abs workout, standing abs no equipment, no equipment abs, easy standing abs exercise, fast standing abs, standing abs for women, standing lower abs workout, standing abs workout to lose belly fat,l ose belly fat, fat burn, fat burning workout, burn belly fat, fat belly, standing abs exercise, standing abs routine, standing abs 10 mins, standing abs home workout, ripped abs. fitness journey, before and after, determined to lose weight, weight loss motivation,100lb weight loss journey, natural weight loss journey, weight loss, weight loss journey, losing 200 lbs, mental health and weight loss, how to lose weight, how to lose weight the healthy way, weight loss motivation, get healthy, watch me shrink, lose weight with me, fat to fit, weigh in Wednesday, obese to fit, how to lose fat, how to lose fat when you are fat, strong mind strong body, better mental health, obese female, overweight female, mental strength, lose weight with me vlog, weight loss goals, plan for successful weight loss, body positivity, starting a weight loss journey, losing 100 lbs, how I am going to lose weight, how to get fit, dieting, belly fat, female, how to lose weight when you are obese, how to lose fat when you are obese, starting my weight loss journey, one month weight loss progress, how much weight can I lose in a month, slow and steady weight loss, healthy weight loss, realistic weight loss journey, weight loss inspiration, lose weight naturally, natural weight loss, slow and steady weight loss, omad weight loss, intermittent fasting, intermittent fasting for weight loss, meal prep, weight loss, fast weight loss, how to lose weight fast, how to lose fat, lose weight fast, fat loss, fasting, weight loss goals, losing weight, losing weight during quarantine, healthy weight loss, realistic weight loss journey, weight loss inspiration, lose weight naturally, natural weight loss, overweight female weight loss journey, the reason I am fat, why I&#8217;m fat, how to stay motivated to lose weight"
