    title "I TRIED CHLOE TING'S NEW 25 DAY HOURGLASS PROGRAM *INSANE RESULTS*"
    description "After seeing a ton of youtube videos on the Chloe ting two week ab shred.... I tried Chloe Ting's NEW 25 day hourglass workout program and it gave me AMAZING RESULTS... I never knew in one month I could change so much! This program was specifically targeted towards your abs and your glutes... a two in one combo! &#10;&#10;CHLOE TINGS HOURGLASS PROGRAM: https://www.chloeting.com/program/2020/hourglass-program.html&#10;&#10;CHLOE TINGS WEBSITE: https://www.chloeting.com&#10;&#10;CHLOE TINGS YOUTUBE CHANNEL: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCgLoMYIyP0U56dEhEL1wXQ&#10;&#10;In this video, I share with you the meals I ate in order to get the best results you could achieve, as well as my tips and tricks to getting a more efficient workout in. I have definitely came out of this challenge with more knowledge of how to properly exercise, and how to get the best results doing so without getting injured. &#10;&#10;If I could do this with a healing sprained ankle and a teared back muscle, then you can do! Definitely go at your own pace, and realize this is YOUR workout journey. We all have different bodies, so do not be discouraged if you didn't get the results you wanted. Little progress= BIG results in the future!&#10;&#10;Thank you to Chloe Ting for the amazing program and I hope you guys try this one or her other workout programs and let me know how you're doing with them in the comment section below! Or if there are other workout programs you want me to try and want me to document my results, let me know and I would love to make a video about it! &#10;&#10;For anyone wondering, I am 5'5! Or 5'4... LOL&#10;&#10;Stay motivated everyone! :) &#10;&#10;MY SOCIALS! &#10;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/glorianares...&#10;SNAPCHAT: gummybearglorii&#10;TIK TOK: https://www.tiktok.com/@glori.ana.r8? &#10;&#10;BUSINESS INQUIRIES:&#10;8pastelgalaxy8@gmail.com&#10;&#10;F A Q:&#10;age: 19(born in 2001)&#10;height: 5'4'&#10;what do you use to edit: final cut pro x&#