    title "30 MIN FULL BODY HIIT WORKOUT | Bodyweight workout, No Equipment"
    description "Push your limits with this killer 30 minute full body HIIT workout! No equipment needed and will leave you feeling exhausted but on cloud 9.&#10;&#10;You got this, squad!&#10;&#10;Workout Details&#10;&#10;&#9656; Cardio, HIIT Workout&#10;&#9656; Level: Intermediate, Advanced&#10;&#9656; Muscles Worked: Full Body&#10;&#9656; Time: 30 Minutes&#10;&#10;&#9656; Equipment: No Equipment&#10;&#10;&#9656; Instructions: Follow along and complete as many reps as possible in 45 seconds followed by a 15 second rest period. Repeat each move for 3 rounds, then 2 rounds, then 1 final round.&#10;&#10;The Moves:&#10;&#9656; Squat Jump to High Knee&#10;&#9656; Mountain Climber to Commando&#10;&#9656; 180 Squat Jack&#10;&#9656; Alternating Lying Crab Taps&#10;&#9656; Burpee Cross&#10;&#10;Please remember that we are all different and that you can make this your own workout!&#10;&#10;&#9825; Join the Instagram squad: instagram.com/spinsyddy&#10;&#10;&#9825; Workout Challenges &#38; Guides: spinsyddy.com&#10;&#10;&#9825; MY WORKOUT PLAYLIST: https://open.spotify.com/user/22gkmlxlnhkcesr3hswwhll5y?si=zP_vC5UOQDyf-PXEMlhBpw"
