    title "1 Year Weight Loss Transformation - Mind &#38; Body Transformation"
    description "I put together a video with clips from my 1 year weight loss transformation.  It was TRULY a MIND and BODY transformation!  And, believe it or not, my MIND transformation was FAR greater than my body transformation.  I'm hoping that by showing my transformation it will help provide weight loss motivation to others.&#10;&#10;Need to lose Covid-19 weight?  Yeah, me too!  Join me on Patreon for my new 2022 Weight Loss Challenge:&#10;https://www.patreon.com/WorkinThingsOut&#10;&#10;Workout recovery supplements that I am currently taking:&#10;Beta Alanine: https://amzn.to/3EPyuOa&#10;Citrulline Malate: https://amzn.to/3kBtqVV&#10;Glutamine: https://amzn.to/3CDgGnN&#10;&#10;My favorite stimulant free pre-workout supplement:&#10;https://5starnutritionusa.642pbb.net/gb64AB&#10;&#10;The scale I use:&#10;https://amzn.to/3HUMDeS&#10;&#10;My home gym (latest version):&#10;https://amzn.to/3HQMQ2x&#10;&#10;My vlogging camera:&#10;https://amzn.to/30ZrDSQ&#10;&#10;My action camera:&#10;https://amzn.to/3nOpAtV&#10;&#10;Some product links are affiliate links (I may earn a small commission if you purchase).&#10;&#10;Music Credit:&#10;Lost Within by A Himitsu https://soundcloud.com/a-himitsu&#10;Music by A Himitsu (https://youtube.com/channel/UCgFwu-j5...)&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://bit.ly/2RuWYmu&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/DHNZeIy4kjs"
