    date "2020-09-12T22:59:09Z"
    title "15 MIN ARM WORKOUT - standing only - NO REST | guided by angie"
    description "Hello friends!&#10;&#10;Since my other standing arm workout was a big success, I decided to create a new and longer one for you.&#10;&#10;I got my inspiration from various types of sport.&#10;&#10;Using boxing movements for warm-up, my &#8220;basketball&#8221; exercise that is always fun, some different swimming techniques to work the shoulders and also classic exercises to target biceps and triceps.&#10;&#10;For this workout you don&#8217;t need anything.&#10;&#10;No mat&#10;No equipment&#10;Not even sports clothes.&#10;&#10;All you need is yourself and speakers to turn the volume up! :D&#10;&#10;For my advanced peeps out there:If you want extra weight, ankle weights are always good or just grab two water bottles.&#10;You can also repeat this exercise 2-3 times, which will give you JELLY ARMS FOR SURE! lol&#10;&#10;Let me know if you enjoy this one!&#10;&#10;Have fun&#10;&#10;xx Angie&#10;&#10;Instagram:&#10;@guidedbyangie - www.instagram.com/guidedbyangie&#10;@angiemilano - www.instagram.com/angiemilano&#10;&#10;Music by Epidemic Sound&#10;www.epidemicsound.com&#10;&#10;Video Edit:&#10;Charles-Elie Lathion - www.charles-elie.com&#10;&#10;Contact:&#10;info@andjelamilanovic.com"
