    title "20 MIN FULL BODY WORKOUT - Beginner Friendly | Davina McCall"
    description "Let's do this !! &#128170;&#10;&#10;I thought I would share with you all a quick 20min full body workout. It's beginner friendly and can be done with no equipment.&#10;&#10;If you fancy a challenge, you can add some resistance with small weights or pick up anything you have laying around! &#10;&#10;Focus on keeping all the movements slow and the correct form. Never compromise form for speed &#128522; and always take a breather when you feel the need. &#10;&#10;Most of all... Have fun ! &#10;&#10;Don't forget to like and subscribe &#128250;&#10;&#10;Pls leave a comment on how you got on &#128071;"
