    title "10 BEST Exercises with a Gym Ball"
    description "I hope you try my 10 BEST Exercises with a Gym Ball!&#10;&#10;What&#8217;s your favourite?&#10;&#10;- Pushup crunch&#10;- V-sit pass the ball&#10;- Wall squat&#10;- Plank rollout&#10;- Glute bridge&#10;- Split squat&#10;- Hamstring curl&#10;- Leg rotation&#10;- Deadbug&#10;- Seated balance &#10;&#10;Don't forget to click LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE &#10;&#10;GET MY FREE #CROCKFITAPP HERE!&#8291;&#10;Free on Apple &#38; Google App stores&#10;https://www.crockfitapp.com&#10;&#8291;&#10;GET MY #CROCKFIT CLOTHING HERE&#10;https://www.crockfitclothing.com&#10;&#10;GET MY BULK SUPPLEMENTS: &#10;Use code CROCKFIT for discount (on non sale items) https://www.bulk.com/crockfit&#10;&#8291;&#10;GET A FREE MONTH ON WHOOP:&#10;https://join.whoop.com/crockfit&#10;And then join the #CrockFitCommunity in the Whoop app using code - COMM-CRCKFT&#10;&#10;THE BEST HAIR GROWTH SHAMPOO&#10;https://bit.ly/3whNPVY&#10;&#8291;&#10;---------------------------------------------------&#8291;&#10;&#8291;&#10;Follow my other pages too!&#8291;&#10;&#8291;&#10;For the #CrockFit plans - http://www.crockfitapp.com&#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/alexcrockford/?hl=en&#8291;&#10;Model Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/alexcrockfordmodel/?hl=en&#8291;&#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/alexcrockford&#8291;&#10;Facebook - https://en-gb.facebook.com/AlexCrockfordFitness/&#8291;&#10;TikTok - @alexcrockford&#8291;&#10;----------------------------------------------------&#8291;&#10;Intro titles by: mike@glynn.productions&#8291;&#10;&#10;Special thanks to Silveremere strength &#38; fitness gym&#10;www.silveremerefitness.co.uk&#10;&#10;Vibe With Me by Joakim Karud http://soundcloud.com/joakimkarud Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/-7YDBIGCXsY"
