    title "3 Exercises To Lose Belly Fat Fast On a Stability Ball For Beginners At Home"
    description "3 Exercises To Lose Belly Fat Fast On a Stability Ball For Beginners At Home + a Full Workout Outline.&#10;These are the best exercises for weight loss! Belly fat exercises for women at home that I (Add me on Instagram: LisaFox01) outlined in this video will work wonders for shrinking and toning your tummy. I recommend using a stability ball during your flat stomach workouts because it will work all your stomach muscle groups a lot more effectively as opposed to doing crunches on the floor. It's a power equipment that is a MUST for me and i recommend it to everybody!&#10;&#10;&#9733;Total Body Balance Ball Kit used in the video: https://amzn.to/3gAq29e&#10;&#10;&#9733;Updated version of this video:&#10;5 min Stability Ball Ab Workout For Beginners | Top 4 Flat Belly Moves: https://youtu.be/CLD_aUSB1s0 &#10;&#10;&#9733;Visit BetterSlimmerYou Store for more 'Get Fit at Home' resources: http://betterslimmeryou.com&#10;&#10;&#10;&#160;--------------------------------------------------------------&#10;CONNECT WITH LISA FOX :&#10;&#10084;Subscribe http://www.youtube.com/user/BetterSlimmerYou&#10;&#10;&#10084;Say Hi on My Facebook Fan Page http://on.fb.me/1wFAk9k&#10;&#10;&#10084; Instagram me https://www.instagram.com/lisafox01/&#10;&#10;&#10084;Email Me with any online coaching, personalized meal plan/fitness plans or for business inquiries: betterslimmeryou@gmail.com &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: Not a sponsored video.The kit was purchased with my own money. Some links may be affiliate.&#10;&#10;&#160;#LoseBellyFat #BellyFatExercises #BetterSlimmerYou"
