  node [
    id 4666
    label "ZSQ0OClkmMI"
    step 1
    date "2019-09-03T04:15:13Z"
    title "Stability Ball Core Workout | Flat Stomach in 11 minutes At Home"
    description "Stability Ball Core Workout | Flat Stomach in 11 minutes At Home. In this video you will tighten and firm-up your midsection in just 11 minutes a day with a stability ball. It&#8217;s not a beginners workout so get ready to be challenged ;-) (Level: Intermediate). Enjoy! Also my Instagram: LisaFox01&#10;&#10;&#10;&#128420;Total Body Balance Ball Kit used in the video: https://amzn.to/3gAq29e&#10;It's lasted me for 5 years now. Really good quality. I love it!&#10;-----------------&#10;Outline for today&#8217;s stability ball core workout with Lisa:&#10;1) Quick warm up (you can skip to 3:11 if you warmed up on your own)&#10;2) Main workout targeting the glutes:&#10;  -Jack-Knife Crunch  30 secs&#10;  - V-sit pass the ball 30 secs&#10;  - Plank rollout 30 sec &#10;  - Leg rotation 45 secs&#10;  - Deadbug 45 secs&#10;  - Regular crunch 30 secs&#10;  - Seated balance (as long as you can. I could only do 15secs! lol Everything takes practice.)&#10;3) Cooldown&#10;-------------------&#10;This is also a fantastic workout to strengthen and lose the belly fat on a stability ball at home as well.&#10;&#10;Here&#8217;s a couple more ways to flatten and firm your core:&#10; &#10004;&#65039; with a waist trainer: https://youtu.be/UeGqvcjsyWc&#10; &#10004;&#65039; with no equipment (tummy vacuum): https://youtu.be/drtVyMODn00&#10; &#10004;&#65039; on a chair (or a couch) by using these breathing techniques: https://youtu.be/iQ2jtGtzpXg  &#10;&#10;Stability Ball Booty Workout  | Firm Butt in 11 minutes At Home: https://youtu.be/ns58UTmFfAA&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#10;Subscribe to my channel here:&#10;http://www.youtube.com/betterslimmeryou&#10;---------------------------------------------&#10;CONNECT WITH LISA FOX :&#10;&#10;&#10084;Say Hi on My Facebook Fan Page http://on.fb.me/1wFAk9k&#10;&#10;&#10084;INSTAGRAM: http://instagram.com/lisafox01&#10;&#10;&#10084;EMAIL ME: betterslimmeryou@gmail.com &#10;&#10;#stabilityballworkout #flatabs #coreworkout"
