    title "20 Minute Pilates Workout with an Exercise Ball"
    description "This 20 Minute Pilates Workout with an Exercise Ball is an effective and fun Pilates workout that incorporates some unique Pilates exercises that are typically performed on a Pilates Reformer. &#10;&#10;Working out with a stability ball is a refreshing change of pace and really helps draw awareness to the balance (or imbalance in the body). &#10;&#10;Exercise Ball Workouts are effective for strengthening the muscles while working on the stability of the body as well. &#10;&#10;If you are like me, you have lots of exercise equipment that you forget to use. So dust off your exercise ball and let&#8217;s get moving!&#10;&#10;Beth&#10;&#10;P.S. I always recommend a good Pilates mat. &#10;This is the Pilates mat that I like: &#10;Basic Pilates Mat: http://amzn.to/2HPt9Jx&#10;&#10;Affiliate link used. I receive a small commission when you make a purchase via affiliate links but it's no extra cost for you. Thanks for supporting my channel! :)  &#10;&#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;You can also connect with me on: &#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/trifectapil...&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/TrifectaPila...&#10;Website: http://trifectapilates.com/ &#10;Sign Up for the Email List: https://tinyurl.com/yy2488aw&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Sunset Strip&#160;by&#160;Audionautix&#160;is licensed under a&#160;Creative Commons Attribution&#160;license (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)&#10;Artist:&#160;http://audionautix.com/"
