    title "Full Shoulder Workout for FASTER Shoulder Gains (5 EXERCISES!)"
    description "For 3 free tips on how to build muscle fast and exact macros customized for your body type and your goals, take my free body type fitness quiz - http://vshred.fit/fastershouldergains&#10;&#10;What&#8217;s going on guys! In today&#8217;s video, I&#8217;m gonna be showing you a full shoulder workout consisting of just 5 shoulder exercises that will help you develop bigger, wider, and fuller 3d delts FASTER!&#10;&#10;This workout contains the 5 total exercises below: &#128071;&#10;&#10;&#9989; Standing Strict Military Press &#10;&#128073;4 Total Sets - 12 Reps&#10;&#9200; Rest 90 Seconds - 4 Total Sets&#10;&#10;&#9989; Dumbbell Upright Rows - 12 Reps&#10;&#128640; Superset with Dumbbell Lateral Raises - 10 Reps&#10;&#9200; Rest 90 Seconds - 4 Total Sets&#10;&#10;&#9989; Double Handle Cable Face Pull&#10;&#128073;4 Total Sets - 12 Reps&#10;&#9200; Rest 90 Seconds - 4 Total Sets&#10;&#10;&#9989; Trap Cleans&#10;&#128073;4 Total Sets - 10-15 Reps&#10;&#9200; Rest 60-90 Seconds - 4 Total Sets&#10;&#10;&#128071; Trying this shoulder workout out? Drop a comment below and let me know which exercise was your favorite! Don't forget to subscribe for more videos as well!&#10;&#10;Full Shoulder Workout for FASTER Shoulder Gains (5 EXERCISES!)&#10;https://youtu.be/rTsKV86RCrg&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Check out My Supplement Stacks! &#10;&#10;For Fat Loss : http://vshred.fit/YTFatLossStack117&#10;&#10;For Muscle Building : http://vshred.fit/YTMuscleBuildingStack117&#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Intro Song: Always Have by Castor Troy"
