    label "OVbMPmcjJU8"
    step 1
    date "2021-11-18T18:21:35Z"
    title "15 Minute At-Home Strength Workout (DUMBBELLS ONLY!)"
    description "Here is a 15 minute at-home strength workout and you'll only two pairs of dumbbells! &#10;&#10;In this follow along style workout, get yourself two pairs of dumbbells (a light set and heavy set) I use 30 pounds and 50 pounds but you can go lighter or even heavier than what I use. This is a full body workout! &#10;&#10;15 Minute At-Home Strength Workout (Dumbbells Only) &#10;This at-home strength workout consists of 3 total rounds of 40 seconds on and 20 seconds off for each exercise. There are 5 exercises each round.&#10;&#10;Push Press (Light set of Dumbbells)&#10;Goblet Squat (One Heavy Dumbbell)&#10;Renegade Row (Light set of Dumbbells)&#10;Floor Press (Heavy set of Dumbbells &#10;Reverse Lunge (Light set of Dumbbells)&#10;&#10;00:00 - Intro&#10;01:26 - Workout Breakdown &#10;02:14 - Exercise Demonstration &#10;04:43 - Workout Starts&#10;19:29 - In Closing &#10;&#10;For 3 free tips on how to build muscle fast customized for your body type and your goals, take my free body type fitness quiz - http://vshred.fit/DumbbellsOnly&#10;&#10;#15MinuteStrengthWorkout #DumbbellsOnly #VShred&#10;&#10;&#128071; Trying this tip out? Drop a comment below and let me know how this helped you! Don't forget to subscribe for more videos as well!&#10;&#10;15 Minute At-Home Strength Workout (DUMBBELLS ONLY!)&#10;https://youtu.be/OVbMPmcjJU8&#10;-------------------------------------------------------&#10;Check out My Supplement Stacks! &#10;For Fat Loss: http://vshred.fit/YTFatLossStackJan25&#10;For Muscle Building: http://vshred.fit/YTMuscleBuildingStackJan25&#10;-----------------------------------&#10;V Shred Social Media! &#10;V Shred Instagram: http://vshred.fit/igvs&#10;V Shred For Women Instagram: http://vshred.fit/igvsw&#10;V Shred Apparel Instagram: http://vshred.fit/vthreadsig&#10;V Shred Facebook: http://vshred.fit/fbvs&#10;V Shred For Women Facebook: http://vshred.fit/vswFB&#10;---------------------------------------------&#10;Sculpt Nation Social Media! &#10;Sculpt Nation Instagram: http://vshred.fit/igsn&#10;Sculpt Nation Facebook: http://vshred.fit/snfb&#10;---------------------------------------------&#10;Intro Song: Lights Go Down by Bazanji"
