    description "Checkout our Sculpt Nation PRE WORKOUT! - http://vshred.fit/YTPREWORKOUT512&#10;&#13;&#10;What&#8217;s up, everyone! If bigger, stronger, more impressive shoulders are on your fitness bucket list, you will love what I&#8217;ve got for you today. I am giving you my exact shoulder workout that I use for strength and hypertrophy.&#10;&#10;Yes, this is my current shoulder workout, and instead of just filming an instructional video telling you what to do, I let the cameras roll during my lift and give you some technique pointers in between sets. This full shoulder workout is the perfect combination of compound low-rep strength exercises and some higher-rep pump movements.&#10;&#10;I promise, your delts will be on fire after this one!&#10;&#10;#FullShoulderWorkout #BiggerShoulders #VShred&#10;&#10;&#128071; Full Shoulder Workout for Bigger &#38; Stronger Shoulders &#128071;&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;00:00 - Intro&#10;00:45 - PRE WORKOUT&#10;01:43 - Warm Up&#10;02:21 - BB Seated Dead-Stop Shoulder Press (5x5, 2 minute rest)&#10;05:47 - DB Standing Single-Arm Shoulder Press (4x10, 1 minute sets, no rest)&#10;08:05 - DB Front Raises superset BB Bent-Over Rear Delt High Rows (4x12, 1 min rest)&#10;10:04 - DB Lateral Raises (Rack Runs, no rest)&#10;12:50 - End of Workout &#10;14:37 - Full Shoulder Workout Recap &#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#128071; Enjoying this Shoulder Workout? Drop a comment below and let me know how this helped you! Don't forget to subscribe for more videos as well!&#13;&#10;&#10;For 3 free tips on how to build muscle fast customized for your body type and your goals, take my free body type fitness quiz - &#13;&#13;http://vshred.fit/FullShoulderWorkout&#10;&#10;Full Shoulder Workout (GET BIGGER &#38; STRONGER SHOULDERS!) &#10;https://youtu.be/r6palmzQaPg&#13;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#13;-------------------------------&#10;Check out My Supplement Stacks! &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;For Fat Loss: http://vshred.fit/YTFatLossStack512&#10;&#13;&#10;For Muscle Building: http://vshred.fit/YTMuscleBuildingStack512&#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------&#13;--------------------------------&#10;Intro Song: Lights Go Down by Bazanji"
