    description "For 3 free tips on how to build muscle fast customized for your body type and your goals, take my free body type fitness quiz - https://vshred.fit/UpperBodyStrengthWorkout&#10;&#10;What&#8217;s going on guys! In today&#8217;s video, we're doing an upper-body strength workout using only dumbbells! It consist of three supersets and goes as follows:&#10;&#10;Upper-Body Strength Workout&#10;Flat Bench Press &#38; Standing Shoulder Press&#10;Bent-Over Row &#38; Incline Chest Press&#10;Supinated Curls &#38; Overhead Extension &#10;Workout Starts: 01:33&#10;&#10;#UpperBody #StrengthWorkout #VShred&#10;&#10;&#128071; Loving this video? Drop a comment below and let me know how this helped you! Don't forget to subscribe for more videos as well!&#10;&#10;Upper Body Strength Workout&#10;https://youtu.be/LyBhWhAGF9c&#10;---------------------------------------------&#10;&#9658; Check out My Supplement Stacks! &#10;For Fat Loss: https://vshred.fit/YTFatLossStackApril19&#10;For Muscle Building: https://vshred.fit/YTMuscleBuildingStackApril19&#10;---------------------------------------------&#10;&#9658; Shop V Shred Clothing!&#10;V Shred Threads: http://vshred.fit/shopvthreadsyt &#10;---------------------------------------------&#10;&#9658; Follow V Shred on Social Media! &#10;V Shred Instagram: http://vshred.fit/igvs&#10;V Shred For Women Instagram: http://vshred.fit/igvsw&#10;V Shred Apparel Instagram: http://vshred.fit/vthreadsig&#10;V Shred Facebook: http://vshred.fit/fbvs&#10;V Shred For Women Facebook: http://vshred.fit/vswFB&#10;V Shred Twitter: http://vshred.fit/vstwyt&#10;---------------------------------------------&#10;&#9658; Follow Sculpt Nation on Social Media! &#10;Sculpt Nation Instagram: http://vshred.fit/igsn&#10;Sculpt Nation Facebook: http://vshred.fit/snfb&#10;Sculpt Nation Twitter: http://vshred.fit/sntwyt&#10;---------------------------------------------&#10;V Shred&#174; is the fastest growing fitness, nutrition, and supplment brand in the world and much much more....&#10;---------------------------------------------&#10;Intro Song: Lights Go Down by Bazanji"
