  node [
    id 4740
    label "GVZZi-Gth_M"
    step 1
    date "2020-12-08T23:29:31Z"
    title "8 MIN STRETCH FOR SPLITS - how to get your front splits / No Equipment I Pamela Reif"
    description "who's joining a 30-day challenge? Let's slideeeee into the New Year with an elegant split haha. Let's do this routine every day (maybe even 2x) and fingers crossed we can get our splits fast! / Anzeige&#10;&#10;So: I USED to be able to do them. And then I stopped stretching and I totally lost it :D but I remember: it loved the feeling &#38; the simple fact that &#34;I can do the splits&#34; lol. &#10;&#10;Those stretches are fully targeted on hip mobility, hamstring &#38; thigh flexibility. This is necessary to slideeee into a front split. &#10;&#10;Who's joining my challenge? You can use #PamMakesMeSplit to share your progress with me! &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;You can do this after any kind of workout, as a wake-up stretch in the morning or before yu go to bed :) there is no &#34;wrong&#34; timing here. &#10;&#10;No Equipment needed. Just prepare a soft surface like a yoga mat or towel :) &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#9656;  my Pam App &#9829;&#65038; Free workout plans, recipes &#38; tips: &#10;Apple: https://apps.apple.com/app/pam/id1540604002&#10;Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.openreply.pam&#10;&#10;&#9656; You can find free WORKOUT SCHEDULES on my Instagram Channel. I saved them in my highlights. &#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10; &#9656; use #PamelaReif if you want me to see your workout pics and videos! &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#9656; You can always find ALL SONGS in my workout playlist. I update it weekly &#38; it's available on Spotify, Apple Music, etc. &#9829;&#65038;&#10;http://wmg.click/GetActive&#10;&#10;1. Sara Kays - Remember That Night? 0:00 - 3:45&#10;2. MAY-A - Apricots 3:46 - 6:56 &#10;3. Forest Blakk - If You Love Her 6:57 - 9:39 &#10;&#10;__&#10;Business Contact: pamela_reif@icloud.com &#10;&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;When joining me for this workout video, you need to take some precautions as your health and safety is the most important. To avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health with your doctor before exercising. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. Pamela Reif will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video."
    channel_title "Pamela Reif"
