    title "&#128293;15MIN No Repeats HIIT Cardio"
    description "Get ready to sweat with today's No Repeats HIIT Cardio Workout! This is a quick 15min workout that will get that heart rate up and have you feeling powerful in a short amount of time. It's great on it's own, as an add on to a strength session or as a killer workout finisher. No equipment needed today so all you need to do is clear some space, follow along and do YOUR best! *If you haven't already be sure to spend 5-10 minutes warming up before diving into this session! #HIIT #NoRepeatsWorkout #Cardio #HomeWorkout&#10;&#10;&#127822;Get the Nutrition Guide: https://heatherrobertson.com/shop/nutrition-guide&#10;&#128722;Shop Exclusive HR Merch: https://heatherrobertson.com/merch&#10;&#127758;Join the Facebook Community: https://www.facebook.com/groups/HeatherRobertsonForum&#10;&#128587;&#127996;Follow on Instagram for recipes, tips &#38; more:  https://www.instagram.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;&#10;Equipment Needed:&#10;Exercise mat or other soft surface. The Mat I use: https://lululemon.prf.hn/l/D958qbR&#10;&#10;Workout Breakdown:&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:36 HIIT Cardio Circuit (45s work + 15s rest x1 round) &#10; Spot Sprint&#10; Jumping Jacks&#10; Shuffle + Hop&#10; Mountain Climber&#10; Back + Forth Inchworm&#10; Pop Squat&#10; Cheer Squad&#10; Side Lunge Hops&#10; Cross + Hop&#10; Toe Taps&#10; High Knees&#10; Squat Jump + Jack&#10; Speed Skater&#10; Station Sprint&#10; Burpee Jacks&#10; &#10;15:36 Cool Down &#38; Stretch&#10;&#10;Where I download my Music *Try it FREE for 30 days*&#10;http://share.epidemicsound.com/zj9WV&#10;&#10;Shop My Amazon Picks: &#10;(US) https://www.amazon.com/shop/heatherrobertson&#10;(CA) https://www.amazon.ca/shop/heatherrobertson&#10;(UK) https://www.amazon.co.uk/shop/heatherrobertson&#10;&#10;L I N K S&#10;&#10;Website: http://www.heatherrobertson.com&#10;Instagram: http://www.instagram.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/heatherroberts