  node [
    id 4825
    label "oJ8x5ub2gyY"
    step 1
    date "2019-03-03T18:08:12Z"
    title "Fixing These 6 Abs Mistakes REALLY Changed My Training - Common Gym Errors"
    description "6 common abs workout mistakes &#38; how to fix them! &#10;&#10;Download my health &#38; fitness app 'OWNU' and start your 7-day free trial today!&#10;https://ownuapp.com/join/ &#10;&#10;When I got these abs exercises right it really helped and improved my training. &#10;&#10;The 6 abs exercises I'm teaching you about in this video are:&#10;&#10;1. The Plank&#10;Common mistake: Lower back bent over and glutes pointing up.&#10;How to fix it: lower back straight and glutes pressed down. &#10;&#10;2. Lying leg lifts&#10;Common mistake: Too much space between your lower back and the floor. &#10;How to fix it: Press down your lower back to the floor and you will have better contact in your abs. Work with slow reps and don't swing your legs up and down.&#10;&#10;3. Cable crunch&#10;Common mistake: Having no balance in the exercise. Not actually crunching, but just pulling the weights.&#10;How to fix: Make sure you do a real crunch movement (see video for an example). Have controlled breathing, blow out the air when going down.&#10;&#10;4. In and out crunch on a bench&#10;Common mistake: Chin and head pointed down. Just doing it for the reps.&#10;How to fix it: Raise up chin and head, look up and control the breathing. Slow and controlled reps.&#10;&#10;5. V-ups&#10;Common mistake: A lot of space between the lower back and floor. &#34;Swinging&#34; up the exercise, no tension in the abs.&#10;How to fix it: Push down the lower back to the floor, slow and controlled movements. &#10;&#10;6. Weighted abs side bent&#10;Common mistake: Focusing on doing as many reps as possible instead of the quality of each rep, which means you have no contact in the exercise. &#10;How to fix it: Lower the number of reps to about 15 and perform slow and controlled movements. Quality over quantity! &#10;&#10;Songs used in the video:&#10;Sappheiros - Fragments&#10;Tristam - Bone Dry [Monstercat Release]&#10;&#10;00:00 3 Golden rules for training Abs&#10;01:58 The Plank Wrong vs. Right&#10;02:52 Lying leg lifts Wrong vs. Right&#10;04:27 Cable crunch Wrong vs. Right&#10;06:15 In n out crunch Wrong vs. Right&#10;07:27 V-ups Wrong vs. Right&#10;09:01 Weighted side bent Wrong vs. Right&#10;10:22 Conclusion&#10;&#10;&#9825; My social media &#9825;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/hannaoeberg/&#10;Snapchat: @hannaoeberg"
    channel_title "Hanna &#214;berg"
    channel_id "UCBeKQoyinCzc6JdS_47nHKw"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
    duration NAN
  ]
