    description "Hi BodyRockers,&#10;&#10;In this workout,  @BodyRock TV trainer Sean L. leads you through this 12 Minute lower body &#8216;leg death&#8217; no repeat full body HIIT workout. While this workout will leave your legs shaking and baking, it will also absolutely destroy your core. There are a few new moves here for your abs that you have likely never tried before. &#10;&#10;Move through each 50 second interval pushing to your max effort. Listen for cues and tips throughout. There are several ways to gear down the intensity of each exercise - listen for these modifications if you need them. &#10;&#10;Keep track of your reps. These are your &#8216;scores&#8217;. The next time that you revisit this workout, you can see if you have improved, and you can strive to beat your personal best. &#10;&#10;To get the full workout breakdown, visit: &#10;https://www.bodyrock.tv/blogs/the-dailyhiit-blog/bodyrock-12-minute-hiit-workout-14-leg-death&#10;&#10;Get the full BodyRock training system (all gear) with free shipping for just $149 here: &#10;https://www.bodyrock.tv/products/bodyrock-hiit-workout-training-system?_pos=2&#38;_sid=ee90ffef6&#38;_ss=r&#10;&#10;To get the BodyRock Core Bands in the video: &#10;https://www.bodyrock.tv/collections/resistance-bands/products/copy-of-core-bands&#10;&#10;To get the BodyRock weighted vest:&#10;https://www.bodyrock.tv/products/bodyrock-weighted-vest&#10;&#10;To get the PINK Thing Dynamic Resistance Band:&#10;https://www.bodyrock.tv/collections/resistance-bands/products/bodyrock-pink-thing&#10;&#10;BodyRock Wrist &#38; Ankle weights: &#10;https://www.bodyrock.tv/products/new-ankle-weights?variant=32169362915403&#10;&#10;BodyRock Intermittent Fasting Plan: &#10;https://www.bodyrock.tv/collections/meal-plans/products/fast-and-furiously-fit-ebook&#10;&#10;To support this channel and get OTT access to our entire workout library on ROKU, AppleTV, Amazon etc, plus access to exclusive content, please subscribe to our fitness streaming 