    label "dwIjcmh-3i8"
    step 1
    date "2019-10-06T17:20:06Z"
    title "The ONLY 3 Triceps Exercises You Need for Mass"
    description "Building a set of horseshoe triceps doesn&#8217;t have to be this elaborate process where you hit them from all different angles; likewise, it&#8217;s usually not as simple as bench pressing every day.&#10; &#10;If you want to ensure maximal hypertrophy of the triceps, there are two things that have to happen: For starters, you&#8217;ve got to understand the anatomy and biomechanics of the triceps. Once you understand what muscles are involved and, more importantly, what function they&#8217;re responsible for, choosing the right exercises and how to perform them more effectively becomes obvious.&#10;&#10;Second, once you&#8217;ve got your 2-3 key movements, focus on progression. If you&#8217;re performing the right exercises using proper form and gradually increasing the load (i.e. increasing reps without sacrificing weight or increasing weight without sacrificing reps), your triceps will grow.&#10;&#10;In this video I go over the basic anatomy of the triceps and their functions, and then I share what are, in my opinion, the only 3 exercises you need for building horseshoes triceps. &#10;&#10; [FREE BOOK] CLAIM YOUR FREE COPY OF BULK UP FAST! &#10;&#10140; http://www.musclemonsters.com/book &#10;&#10;[SUPPLEMENTS] SCIENCE-BASED SUPPLEMENTS THAT WORK!&#10;&#10140; http://www.musclemonsters.com/supplements&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ALAIN ON INSTAGRAM:   &#10;&#10140; http://www.instagram.com/musclemonsters   &#10;&#10;FOLLOW ALAIN ON FACEBOOK:   &#10;&#10140; http://www.facebook.com/musclemonsters&#10;&#10;CHECK OUT MY BROTHER&#34;S FITNESS CHANNEL: &#10;&#10140; https://www.youtube.com/user/Albygonzalezfitness &#10;&#10;References: &#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/20934352&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/16095407&#10;https://suppversity.blogspot.com/2011/08/suppversity-emg-series-m-triceps.html"
