    description "For 10% off your first purchase: http://squarespace.com/nippard My Back Hypertrophy Program: https://shop.jeffnippard.com/product/back-hypertrophy-program/&#10;&#10;-------------------------------&#10;&#10;&#9657; CHANNEL MERCH!&#10;http://bit.ly/jeffnippardmerch&#10;&#10;&#9657; CHECK OUT MY TRAINING PROGRAMS &#8594; https://www.jeffnippard.com/programs&#10;&#10;&#9657; MY ARM TRAINING SCIENCE-BASED VIDEO &#8594; &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x4YNi4nRboU&#10;&#10;-------------------------------&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME &#9657;&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM &#8227; http://instagram.com/jeffnippard&#10;SNAPCHAT &#8227; http://snapchat.com/add/jeffnippard&#10;FACEBOOK &#8227; http://facebook.com/jeffnippard&#10;TWITTER &#8227; http://twitter.com/jeffnippard&#10;PODCAST &#8227; IceCream4PRs on iTunes &#10;&#10;-------------------------------&#10;&#10;IN THIS VIDEO &#9657;&#10;&#10;Scientific References:&#10;&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19826307&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/24245055&#10;http://etd.fcla.edu/UF/UFE0000772/pugh_g.pdf&#10;https://www.researchgate.net/publication/273714919_Comparative_electromyographical_investigation_of_the_biceps_brachii_latissimus_dorsi_and_trapezius_muscles_during_five_pull_exercises&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19855327&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/12423182&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/24662157&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/20543740&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC449729/&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19197209&#10;http://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/0268003394900574&#10;https://www.strengthandconditioningresearch.com/muscles/latissimus-dorsi/#4&#10;https://renaissanceperiodization.com/back-training-tips-hypertrophy/&#10;&#10;My First Science Explained Video (Back):&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NDmJNX9JrLs&#10;&#10;-------------------------------&#10;&#10;GET MASS (Research Review):&#10;&#8227; http://bit.ly/jeffMASS&#10;&#10;-------------------------------&#10;&#10;MY SUPPLEMENTS&#10;&#8227; https://www.PEScience.com&#10;&#8227; Use discount code JEFF to save 30%&#10;&#10;RISE Clothing&#10;&#8227; https://www.rise.ca&#10;&#8227; Use discount code JEFF10 to save 10%&#10;&#10;MUSIC&#10;Ryan Little - Day 3&#10;&#8227; https://www.youtube.com/user/TheR4C2010&#10;&#10;Blue Wednesday - Player 2&#10;&#8227; https://soundcloud.com/bluewednesday&#10;&#10;Anatomy Sketch Work:&#10;&#8227; https://www.instagram.com/capitanperu/&#10;&#10;Research Assistant:&#10;&#8227; Max Edsey&#10;&#10;Thumbnail Design: &#10;&#8227; https://www.instagram.com/lewfitness/&#10;&#10;&#10;-------------------------------&#10;&#10;This video was edited by Jeff Nippard and Rashaun R using Final Cut Pro X&#10;&#10;-------------------------------&#10;&#10;I'm 5'5, 173 lbs. My form was sloppy in this video. I was sick while recording this workout and didn't want to drop my weights back too much, but re-watching some of this footage, I think I should have. Anyway, enjoy!"
