  node [
    id 4892
    label "tVDX2WcBdpY"
    step 1
    date "2021-06-03T20:54:47Z"
    title "5 Minute Plank AB Workout (No Equipment Needed!)"
    description "For 3 free tips on how to build muscle fast customized for your body type and your goals, take my free body type fitness quiz - &#13;http://vshred.fit/5MinutePlank&#10;&#13;&#10;What&#8217;s going on guys! In today&#8217;s video, &#13;I'm revisiting why you may need to stop doing basic plank holds. &#10;&#10;Don&#8217;t get too excited because I&#8217;m not telling you to stop planking. In fact, the workout I have for you today involves five minutes of non-stop planking! What I&#8217;m saying is that plank holds are probably not the best option and something you should stop doing as your primary ab workout... if you can easily hold a plank longer than 1-minute!&#10;&#10;If that&#8217;s the case, you are way too advanced and should do this 5-Minute Ab Plank Workout I filmed for you. No equipment is needed. Just find a small place on the ground, hit play, and let&#8217;s get through these next 5-minutes of planking together!&#10;&#10;5 MINUTE PLANK AB WORKOUT&#10;----------------------------------------------------&#10;There is NO REST in this workout. Your active rest is a basic plank hold. You will move from each plank variation list below without stopping! One round is all you need! &#10;&#9201;30 sec - Spiderman Planks&#10;&#9201;30 sec - Plank Hold&#10;-&#10;&#9201;30 sec - Dolphin Plank&#10;&#9201;30 sec - Plank Hold&#10;-&#10;&#9201;30 sec - Plank Hip Dips&#10;&#9201;30 sec - Plank Hold&#10;-&#10;&#9201;30 sec - Plank Jacks &#10;&#9201;30 sec - Plank Hold&#10;-&#10;&#9201;30 sec - Plank Shoulder Taps &#10;&#9201;30 sec - Plank Hold&#10;--------------------------------------------------&#10;#5MinutePlankWorkout #AbExercises #VShred #VinceSant&#13;&#10;&#10;&#128071; Trying out this ab workout? Drop a comment below and let me know how this helped you! Don't forget to subscribe for more videos as well!&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;5 Minute Plank AB Workout (No Equipment Needed!)&#10;https://youtu.be/tVDX2WcBdpY&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#13;&#10;Check out My Supplement Stacks! &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;For Fat Loss: http://vshred.fit/YTFatLossStack606&#10;&#13;&#10;For Muscle Building: http://vshred.fit/YTMuscleBuildingStack606&#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------&#13;&#10;&#10;Intro Song: Lights Go Down by Bazanji"
    channel_title "V Shred"
    channel_id "UCOFCwvhDoUvYcfpD7RJKQwA"
