    step 1
    date "2021-02-12T20:14:21Z"
    title "Skinny Fat to Fit | 4 Best Ways to Burn Fat &#38; Build Muscle (DO THIS!)"
    description "For 3 free tips on how to build muscle fast customized for your body type and your goals, take my free body type fitness quiz - &#13;http://vshred.fit/SkinnyFat2Fit&#10;&#10;Sculpt Nation PROTEIN - &#128170;&#127995; http://vshred.fit/YTProtein214 &#128170;&#127995;&#10;Sculpt Nation CREATINE -  &#128074;&#127996; http://vshred.fit/YTCreatine214  &#128074;&#127996;&#10;Sculpt Nation BURN &#128293; http://vshred.fit/YTBurn214 &#128293; &#10;&#10;#SkinnyFatFix #BurnFat #SculptNation&#13;&#10;&#10;What&#8217;s going on guys! Do you consider yourself to be of &#8220;average&#8221; or &#8220;normal&#8221; weight (maybe even underweight)? When you look in the mirror do you see a smaller frame, but still feel soft and tend to have excess fat, especially around your midsection?&#10;&#10;You need to keep reading this article&#8230; because you may have a particular body type that could be a hazard to your health! Society kind of jokes about this body type. There is even a &#8220;slang&#8221; name for it. You have probably heard of it before. It&#8217;s called being ... SKINNY FAT!&#10;&#10;This is when someone appears SKINNY (of average weight or sometimes even underweight), but has little to no muscle mass. These people may appear thin (especially when clothed),  but actually have unhealthy levels of body fat.&#10;&#10;The good news is that with the right training and diet, this &#8220;body type&#8221; can be fixed. Unlike your bone structure or other aspects of your genetics, if you are SKINNY FAT&#8230;you are not doomed to have this body type forever. &#10;&#10;&#128071;&#127995;Here is your SKINNY FAT FIX&#128071;&#127995;&#10;04:16 - STOP making cardio your primary focus &#10062; &#10;06:03 - START a solid strength training regime &#9989; &#10;08:17 - DO FOCUS on feeding your muscles based on your body type &#9989; &#10;&#10;&#128071;&#127995;Drop a comment below!&#128071;&#127995; &#10;Let me know how this helped you! Don't forget to subscribe for more videos as well!&#13;&#10;&#13;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Skinny Fat to Fit | 4 Best Ways to Burn Fat &#38; Build Muscle (DO THIS!)&#10;https://youtu.be/ne1rbGAAczc&#13;&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Sculpt Nation PROTEIN - &#128170;&#127995; http://vshred.fit/YTProtein214 &#128170;&#127995;&#10;&#10;Sculpt Nation CREATINE -  &#128074;&#127996; http://vshred.fit/YTCreatine214  &#128074;&#127996;&#10;&#10;Sculpt Nation BURN &#128293; http://vshred.fit/YTBurn214 &#128293; &#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#13;---------------------&#13;---------------------&#13;&#10;Intro Song: Lights Go Down by Bazanji"
