    description "My Before vs. After results: 00:16&#10;Exercise starts: 01:11&#10;This is a lower body workout that not only can slim your legs but also can slim your butt as it burns fat and helps your muscles become more firm and thus looks slimmer! Moreover, it can correct bad body posture. If you want lean legs and a firm butt with a tall and straight body, this is the workout for you! Do this for 14 days, you should see progress! It is a little intense at first, but it gets easier if you keep doing it every day!&#10;&#10;*Please remember to stretch after, the stretching video can be found here:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zF7LFDfKEGY&#10;&#10;*More FREE workout programs&#10;https://aprilhanfit.com/daily_workout/&#10;&#10;*JOIN THIS CHANNEL TO GET ACCESS TO PERKS:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCce7Uuc8LILSkgzavNyDL9g/join&#10;SUBSCRIBE TO MY 2nd CHANNEL- April Han's Life&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKNO...&#10;FOLLOW ME ON INSTAGRAM @Piecesofapril37  &#10;https://www.instagram.com/piecesofapr... &#10;Email: lxhan77@gmail.com&#10;&#10;&#127925;&#127925;&#127925;&#127925;&#127925;&#10;Song: OmgLoSteve - Wrong For Me (ft. Addie Nicole)&#10;Link: https://youtu.be/5NdN3m10BZE&#10;Music promoted by FreeMusicWave.&#10;Song: King CAAN ft. ELYSA - Go Again (Vlog No Copyright Music)&#10;Music promoted by Vlog No Copyright Music.&#10;Video Link: https://youtu.be/XPs9eOstaGA&#10;Nadro - Waiting For You (feat. Veronica Bravo &#38; Timmy Commerford)&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GPUzr0J0eLg&#10;Stream / Free download: https://frequency.lnk.to/waitingforyouID&#10;Live It Up With You - Plehboy Pete &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HuH6eP9C88Q&#10;&#10;&#10;#Fitness #Workouts #Slimlegs&#10;*This video is not sponsored."
