    description "It's time to get your heart rate up with this Cardio Abs &#38; Legs workout aimed to get you slim legs and a flat belly. This workout is great if you are trying to lose weight around the belly area whilst also get leaner legs, slimmer thighs, and lift up your booty. It&#8217;s an intense 50 minute killer routine, so get a bottle of water, a towel, and your workout mat, and let's get going. &#10;&#10;Share your progress, comment workout ideas, or simply share some love in the comments below! &#128172;  &#10;&#10;Let's get after it babes!&#10;xoxo&#10;No Bad Addiction&#10;&#10;SIGN UP FOR OUR FREE WORKOUT PROGRAMS &#128071;&#10;&#10;Butt Lift Challenge | 10 Days &#128071; &#127825;&#10;https://nobadaddiction.com/10-day-butt-lift-challenge&#10;&#10;Summer Shred Program | 14 Days &#128071; &#128293;&#10;https://nobadaddiction.com/14-day-summer-shred-program&#10;&#10;Get Fit Program | 7 Days &#128071; &#10;https://nobadaddiction.com/pages/7-day-get-fit-program&#10;&#10;Or check out all our programs and challenges&#128071; &#10084;&#65039; https://nobadaddiction.com/workout-programs&#10;&#10;&#128170; The Workout:&#10;Warm Up: 0:00 - 3:38&#10;Round 1: 3:38 - 14:07&#10;Round 2: 14:07 - 24:40&#10;Round 3: 24:40 - 35:08&#10;Round 4: 35:08 - 45:34&#10;Cool Down: 45:34 - 49:29&#10;&#10;&#128717;SHOP OUR SWIMWEAR &#38; ACTIVEWEAR:&#10;https://nobadaddiction.com/&#10;&#10;DON'T FORGET TO FOLLOW US:&#10;&#10;Instagram&#10;@nobadaddiction&#10;https://www.instagram.com/nobadaddiction/ &#10;&#10;Today's Trainer | Julia &#10;https://www.instagram.com/julia__kareush/&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: &#10;All information provided by Nobadaddiction is for educational/entertainment purposes only. No information is to be taken as medical or other health advice pertaining to any individual-specific health or medical condition. You agree that the use of this information is at your own risk and Nobaddadiction is not liable for any injuries or damages or other claims."
