    description "Happy Monday!!&#10;&#10;Today we are CRUNCHING it! This quick Crunch 10 min ab workout is all about working those upper abs.  &#10;&#10;The entire workout is on the floor and equipment free, and you can do if from anywhere, anytime! And as always the video is full length, which means that you can just follow along with us. There are no breaks between exercises, but if you need some rest time just pause the video for a moment to catch your breath. But make sure to give it your all! &#128170;&#10;&#10;Try it out and let us know what you think! Can&#8217;t wait to share more workouts with you all! &#10;We are so grateful to see this community growing together. Remember, we love to hear from you in the comments &#10084;&#65039; DON'T FORGET to Like and Subscribe to see what's coming next! &#128580;&#10;&#10;Use #TwiceasFit if you want us to see and share your workout pics and videos! &#10;&#10;If you liked this ab workout, then you're gonna LOVE these:&#10;7 MIN KILLER ABS &#10137; https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=udf35MCj9Qw&#10;10 MIN ABS with MINI BAND &#10137; https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d80nm2G3Dvw &#10;15 MINUTE TOTAL CORE &#10137; https://youtu.be/bNgpGVmYJQ8&#10;&#10;&#9825; Subscribe to our YouTube Channel &#10145;&#65039; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgwdLbJnOJJMPJX5nIdxjyA?sub_confirmation=1 &#10;&#10;&#9825; Follow us on I N S T A G R A M for daily motivation: @twiceasfit_ &#10145;&#65039; https://www.instagram.com/twiceasfit_/?hl=en &#10;&#10;Our AB CRUNCH workout music &#127925; &#10;&#11088; Battle Scars (All U Gonna Get) - Lil' Loca&#10;&#11088; No Good For Each Other - Mindme &#10;&#11088; If I Change (Gribbe Remix) - Mindme &#10;&#11088; Stick Together (SLCT Remix) - Elijah N&#10;&#10;#absworkout #sixpack #workoutvideo"
