    title "Burn Belly Fat - 15 mins - Day 1 Summer Shape Up Challenge"
    description "Welcome to Day 1 of Summer Shape Up Challenge! &#10;&#10;This workout is designed to help you burn fat and focus on the lower belly. We have a timed workout routine, where I am be doing this full 15 minute workout with you. &#10;&#10;Make sure to do a little warm up beforehand and a stretch afterwards. &#10;&#10;Enjoy and take those 1st day photos for your progress pics at the end of the month! &#10;&#10;And don't forget to come into the Free Holly Dolke Community and share how it went. &#10;&#10;Love Holly xx&#10;&#10;CHAPTERS&#10;00:00: Intro &#10;00:30: Star Jumps &#10;01:00: Rest&#10;01:19: Reverse Burpee&#10;02:00: Rest&#10;02:20: Slow Mountain Climbers&#10;03:00: Rest&#10;03:20: Reverse Crunch Taps&#10;04:00: Rest&#10;04:20: High Knees&#10;05:00: Rest&#10;05:20: Star Jumps&#10;06:00: Rest&#10;06:20: Reverse Burpee&#10;07:00: Rest&#10;07:20: Slow Mountain Climbers&#10;08:00: Rest&#10;08:20: Reverse Crunch Taps&#10;09:00: Rest&#10;09:20: High Knees &#10;10:00: Rest&#10;10:20: Star Jumps &#10;11:00: Rest&#10;11:20: Reverse Burpee&#10;12:00: Rest&#10;12:20: Slow Mountain Climbers&#10;13:00: Rest&#10;13:20: Reverse Crunch Taps&#10;14:00: Rest&#10;14:20: High Knees&#10;15:00: Ending &#10;&#10;Disclaimer: Please always consult with your physician before practicing or participating in any workout challenges - if you do so, you workout at your own accord. This is my own personal workout and may not be suited for you&#10;&#10;&#128159; Join The Free Community: https://holly-dolke.mn.co/share/3kBGNlmv9kg1pCgo?utm_source=manual &#10;&#10;&#128159; 7 Day Free Trial! Download To My Fitness App: https://hooked.health/download-hooked-health/?sl=youtube&#10;&#10;&#128159;  https://www.instagram.com/hollydolke/&#10;&#10;------------ &#10;&#128159;  Music I Use: https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/gciteo&#10;&#10;&#128159; MY TIKTOK: https://vm.tiktok.com/uWJLyQ/&#10;&#10;&#128159; FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/Holly-Dolke-455973181401357/"
