    title "10 MIN BOOTY ON FIRE WORKOUT // No Equipment, on the floor | Twice as Fit"
    description "We are back with a booty workout! In this 10 min booty on fire workout we will show you exercises that you can do to train your booty with no equipment, on the floor, and while having fun!&#10;&#10;We start on our knees with leg lifts, pulses, and donckey kicks (on each side), and then move on our backs with some glute bridge exercises. We end the workout off with some glute bridge pulses. Let's see for how long you can pulse it out &#128556;&#10;&#10;Try it out and let us know what you think! Can&#8217;t wait to share more workouts with you all! &#10;We are so grateful to see this community growing together. Remember, we love to hear from you in the comments &#10084;&#65039; DON'T FORGET to Like and Subscribe to see what's coming next!&#10;&#10;Use #TwiceasFit if you want us to see and share your workout pics and videos on Instagram! &#10;&#10;If you liked this booty workout, then you're gonna LOVE these:&#10;INTENSE LOWER AB WORKOUT 8 min &#10137; https://youtu.be/zgc4PssmEh8&#10;20 MIN BEST AB ROUTINE for at Home &#10137; https://youtu.be/nlFD73RiSeg&#10;15 MIN BEACH BODY WORKOUT at Home &#10137;https://youtu.be/0-66SBQaggs&#10;&#10;&#9825; Subscribe to our YouTube Channel &#10145;&#65039; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgwdLbJnOJJMPJX5nIdxjyA?sub_confirmation=1 &#10;&#10;&#9825; Follow us on I N S T A G R A M for daily motivation: @twiceasfit_ &#10145;&#65039; https://www.instagram.com/twiceasfit_/?hl=en &#10;&#10;Our amazing booty workout music &#127925; &#10;&#11088; Intertwined - Ray&#10;&#11088; My Bare Bones - Lvly &#10;&#11088; Perfectly Opposite - Carla The Great&#10;&#11088; Long Time - Alexis Moore&#10;&#10;#bootyworkout#Fitness #HomeWorkouts"
