    date "2020-06-08T18:47:28Z"
    title "I TRIED THE CHLOE TING 4 WEEK SUMMER SHRED CHALLENGE PLUS-SIZED *Realistic Results* BEFORE &#38; AFTER"
    description "For the past 28 days I have taken on the 2020 Chloe Ting 4 Weeks Summer Shred Challenge, as a plus-sized woman, I had my fair share of struggles doing the exercises but I kept going, I modified when I had to, I found helpful tools along the way and I got it done! In this video I take you along on the entire fitness challenge for all the ups and downs&#8230;literally, because we did a lot of planks. I share my realistic weight loss results, before and after pictures, concerns I have and progress I made. If you were wondering, can a fat girl can complete a Chloe Ting Challenge? The answer is, yes!&#10;&#10;Starting Weight: 252.4 lbs (114.5 kg) &#10;Current Weight: 232.6 lbs (105.5 kg) &#10;Total lost: 19.8 lbs (9 kg) &#10;Goal Weight: 150 lbs. (68 kg)&#10;&#10;Chloe's channel: https://www.youtube.com/user/ChloesAddiction&#10;Chloe's website: https://www.chloeting.com/program&#10; &#10;THANK YOU FOR WATCHING! Please, stick around for a while! My weight loss journey to lose 100lbs is just getting started. Subscribe and turn on the notification bell if you would like to see more. &#10;&#10;*STALK THE STRUGGLE* &#10;INSTAGRAM: @bb_caruso https://www.instagram.com/bb_caruso/?hl=en&#10;&#10;LINKS:&#10;Wrist supportive brace- https://amzn.to/2AeFZlu&#10;64oz water bottle- https://amzn.to/2WcN9ha&#10;Thick yoga mat- https://amzn.to/2TBZR8K&#10;Eye Liner I Wear- https://amzn.to/2YliEYL&#10;Scale I Use- https://amzn.to/2CkkrED&#10;&#10;WATCH NEXT: &#10;* Starting my Weight Loss Journey - https://youtu.be/OElXGvMF_VQ &#10;*3 Day Water Fast- https://youtu.be/9ued-w9hkBI &#10;*Gallon of Water a Day- https://youtu.be/kdvaYyglZB4 &#10;*No More Yo-Yo Dieting- https://youtu.be/TI6KncIys3g &#10;*Walk/Jog 1 Mile a Day- https://youtu.be/lEhMvdeKLCg&#10;*What I Eat in a Day- https://youtu.be/xH11FjLksUo&#10;*Why I&#8217;m Overweight- https://youtu.be/ytihLwGs85c&#10;&#10;For business inquiries only: beatrice@sixsevenmedia.com&#10;&#10;All opinions are my own. All credit and rights reserved to the original creators featured. &#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: Links included in this description might be affiliate links. If you purchase a product or service with the links that I provide I may receive a small commission. There is no additional charge to you! Thank you for supporting my channel so I can continue to provide you with free content each week!&#10;&#10;#ChloeTingChallenge #ChloeTingSummerShred #ChloeTingChallenge2020 #ChloeTingResults #weightlossjourney #fitnessjourney&#10;Chloe Ting 4 weeks summer shred challenge Chloe Ting hour-glass challenge Chloe Ting 2-week shred Chloe Ting Abs in two weeks Chloe Ting workout results Chloe Ting before and after realistic results fitness challenge weight loss journey healthy weight loss fat to fit summer shred challenge does chloe ting&#8217;s program work how to lose weight how to lose fat summer shred program before and after weight loss results realistic before and after plus-sized chloe ting program review overweight girl tries cloe ting work out thick girl tries chloe ting workout 2020 weight loss journey I tried the Chloe ting 2020 4 week summer shred program I tried the Chloe ting summer shred challenge"
