    title "Common Gym Mistakes - Training Abs (Episode 6)"
    description "Training Programmes - https://mikethurston.co.uk/&#10;&#10;From my own experience of training, observations made with other gym goers, along with the thousands of of hours spent training my clients on a 1 on 1 basis, I've noticed a number of common mistakes made when it comes to training abs. &#10;&#10;Key Points:&#10;&#10;- Learn to effectively contract the abdominal muscles&#10;- Master your breathing (exhale on the concentric phase)&#10;- Maximise tension placed on your core (don't let other muscle groups do the work)&#10;- Minimise momentum&#10;- Keep your neck in line with your spine&#10;- Quality reps over quantity&#10;&#10;&#187; Website: www.mikethurston.co.uk&#10;&#187; Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/mikethurston&#10;&#187; Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/mikethurston...&#10;&#187; Twitter: https://twitter.com/thethurstonator &#10;&#187; 25% OFF BULK POWDERS&#174; Supplements (USE CODE THURSTON) - http://bit.ly/2F2UHwP&#10;&#10;&#187; MyProtein Supplements - Use Code THURSTON for a discount on your order&#10;https://bit.ly/2ZDgnsu - Best Sellers &#10;https://bit.ly/3jkdRyX - Bars &#38; Snacks"
