    title "THE PERFECT LEG WORKOUT TO BUILD BIG STRONG LEGS | My Top Tips"
    description "This workout is perfect for both MEN &#38; WOMEN of all fitness levels looking to build strong legs.  Full workout and a lot of top tips explained to help you throughout the workout. &#10;&#10;just made an updated video for 2021 check it out here: https://youtu.be/WWo1tCf08_U&#10;&#10; - GET MY NEW CROSSLIFTR TRAINING APP FOR JUST $1 ON THE FIRST MONTH: https://obivincentapp.com&#10;&#10;- Follow me on INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/obi_vincent/&#10;&#10;SPONSORS (Thank you for your Support) &#10;-PHD NUTRITION discount code &#8220;OBIV35&#8221;  https://www.phd.com&#10;-WHOOP Fitness tracker: https://join.whoop.com/en-uk/breakthemould  &#10;-Shop the Gymshark collection:  https://gym.sh/Shop-Obi-Vincent Training Plans&#10;&#10;Spotify Playlist: https://open.spotify.com/playlist/1fqhb83bDW69rrDIyWEAwd?si=FBroso55TIW1LBI1txyREg&#10;&#10;&#10;FULL WORKOUT:&#10;WARM UP (use video as reference)&#10;&#10;PRE WORKOUT PREP&#10;A: Kang Squats 2 x 10 &#10;B: Cossack Squats 2 x 10&#10;&#10;MAIN WORKOUT;&#10;1: Calf raises 2 x dropset of 2 (10x10) 4sec eccentric tempo and 1sec pause at the top and bottom of the movement. &#10;-&#10;2a: Anderson Squat 3 x 10/6/6&#10;2b: Banded KB Swing 3 x 15 &#10;-&#10;3a: Heel Elevated Goblet Squat 3 x 10 (2-3sec eccentric tempo)&#10;3b: Smith Machine Split Squats 3 x 10 Each Leg (2-3sec eccentric tempo)&#10;-&#10;4: Leg Extensions 1 x Dropset of 4 (10/6/6/6) at a 3-4sec eccentric tempo and 1 sec hold at the top &#10;&#10;BYE BYE LEGS FINISHER;&#10;3 ROUNDS &#10;20cal Leg Only BIKE Or 60sec Spin Bike &#10;12 x (2 x 22.5kg) DB Hang Squat Clean&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/obivincentfi.&#10;TWITTER: https://twitter.com/obi__vincent&#10;Business Enquiries Email: Obiuvincent@gmail.com&#10;&#10;&#10;MUSIC&#10;BEARTOOTH STRANGLE HEART &#8211; BIROCRATIC&#10;CHASE &#8211; THE BROTHERS RECORDS&#10;MISSION START &#8211; THE BROTHERS RECORDS&#10;&#10;#LEGDAY #CROSSLIFTR"
