    description "For more 6 pack abs workouts just like these, along with the exact diet for your body type check out my free quiz - http://vshred.fit/10AbExercises&#10;&#10;In this video I take you through a complete ab workout you can do from anywhere, no equipment needed! So grab a spot and let's kill this workout together!&#10;&#10;Perform 3 Sets of 10 for Each Exercise Below with 15 Seconds of Rest Between Each Set:&#10;&#10;- Straight Leg Toe Touches&#10;- Reverse Crunch Twists (5 Each Side)&#10;- Half Get-Ups&#10;- Advanced Planks&#10;- Straight Arm Russian Twists (5 Each Side)&#10;&#10;Where will you try this workout? At home? In the park? Let me know down below along with what you thought!&#10;&#10;See you next vid!&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Check out My Supplement Stacks! &#10;&#10;For Fat Loss : http://vshred.fit/257fatLossStackYT&#10;For Muscle Building : http://vshred.fit/257MuscleStackYT&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Intro Song: Always Have by Castor Troy"
