    date "2020-05-22T17:40:59Z"
    title "15 MIN AB WORKOUT | No Equipment Required"
    description "A NEW ab workout that you can wherever you want with absolutely ZERO equipment.&#10;&#10;In this video, I have a 15 minute ab workout for you to do along with me.&#10;&#10;The point of this video is to give you a follow along ab workout that you can do anywhere.&#10;&#10;There are no special pieces of equipment needed to do this.&#10;&#10;All you need is your body and some space on the floor.&#10;&#10;You might actually need a bit more than that, and that would be a heavy dose of determination to try and resist the burn of these exercises as you do them.&#10;&#10;Remember, the pain from ab training is usually only temporary.&#10;&#10;As soon as finish the exercise and the lactic acid starts to clear the abdominal muscles, you feel normal again.&#10;&#10;See if you can follow the entire ab workout along with me, resting when I do.&#10;&#10;If you need extra rest for some reason, don&#8217;t be bashful - take it.&#10;&#10;No excuses guys, grab a towel or yoga mat and join me for this quick &#38; intense session. &#10;&#10;Can&#8217;t wait to make those abs burn! &#10;&#10;Let's do this! &#10;&#10;5 Minute Warm Up Routine: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCG8hMXfJwM&#38;t&#10;&#10;15 MIN AB WORKOUT&#10;- 30 Seconds Alternating Leg Raises&#10;- 15 Seconds&#10;- 30 Seconds Scissors&#10;- 15 Seconds&#10;- 30 Seconds Lying Leg Raises&#10;- 15 Seconds&#10;- 30 Seconds Leg Lift Toe Touches&#10;- 15 Seconds&#10;- 30 Seconds Reverse Crunches&#10;- 15 Seconds&#10;- 30 Seconds Plank Knee To Elbow&#10;- 60 Minutes Stretch &#38; Relax&#10;Repeat 2 More Times&#10;&#10;15 Minutes in Total&#10;&#10;Please don't forget to give this videos a thumbs up. &#10;&#10;And if you like this workout, then I'm sure you'll also enjoy the rest of my videos. &#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE TO MY CHANNEL to make sure you don't miss any workouts!&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;&#10142;Coaching: https://www.gymperformance.ch&#10;&#10142;Project Fit Dad: https://www.facebook.com/groups/projectfitdad&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;#HomeWorkout #SixpackWorkout #AbWorkout"
