    description "For 3 free tips for getting your abs to show customized for your body type, take my free body type quiz - &#128073;  http://vshred.fit/BeginnerAbsHome  &#128072;&#10;&#10;What's going on guys! In today's video I'm going to be going over an ab workout that is aimed toward beginners, but any fitness level can try out! The best part? No equipment is needed. So grab a grab, and let's crush this!&#10;&#10;Exercise 1 - Deadbugs [12 Reps Each Side - Rest 10 Seconds]&#10;Exercise 2 - Bodyweight Plank [20 Second Hold - Rest 10 Seconds]&#10;Exercise 3 - Beginner Russian Twists [12 Reps Each Side - Rest 10 Seconds]&#10;Exercise 4 - Bodyweight Plank [20 Second Hold - Rest 10 Seconds]&#10;Exercise 5 - Reach Throughs [12 Reps - Rest 10 Seconds]&#10;Exercise 6 - Bodyweight Plank [20 Second Hold - Rest 10 Seconds]&#10;&#10;Repeat for 3 Total Rounds&#10;&#10;Thanks for watching guys, try out this ab workout next time you're hitting abs and let me know how it worked for you!&#10;&#10;Ab Workout for Beginners That You Can Do From Home&#10;https://youtu.be/la1pjshZ6lI&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Check out My Supplement Stacks! &#10;&#10;For Fat Loss : http://vshred.fit/YTFatLossStack42&#10;&#10;For Muscle Building : http://vshred.fit/YTMuscleBuildingStack42&#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Intro Song: Always Have by Castor Troy"
