    title "5 Rear Delt Exercises for BIGGER Shoulders | Episode 2"
    description "For more workouts to get you bigger shoulders along with a nutrition plan designed for your goals, take my free body type quiz and get the right plan for you - http://vshred.fit/ShoulderTrainingEpisode2&#10;&#10;Shoulder Training 101 Playlist - https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLIZtutUcGbA0Beg1XSckx_Di5OLZHaCjf&#10;&#10;In this video I show you 5 of my favorite exercises that target the rear (posterior) deltoid. Often times when we try to build muscle we grow the front of our body doing chest press, shoulder press, etc but forget about the rear. This can lead to tight pecs and by training this area of your delts, it will help improve posture and really help to fill out your upper body.&#10;&#10;5 Exercises:&#10;&#10;1) Face Pulls&#10;2) Bent Over Reverse Dumbbell Fly&#10;3) Lying Single Arm Reverse Dumbbell Fly&#10;4) Incline Bench Reverse Dumbbell Fly&#10;5) Single Arm Reverse Cable Fly&#10;&#10;Be sure to click the thumbs up &#38; let me know in the comments what exercises you'll be trying out below!&#10;&#10;See ya next video!&#10;&#10;5 Rear Delt Exercises for BIGGER Shoulders! Episode 2&#10;https://youtu.be/pluo3aOMMn0&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Check out My Supplement Stacks! &#10;&#10;For Fat Loss : http://vshred.fit/YTFatLossStack&#10;&#10;For Muscle Building : http://vshred.fit/YtMuscleBuildingStack&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Intro Song: Always Have by Castor Troy"
