  node [
    id 5013
    label "ca3IunU3908"
    step 1
    date "2022-06-26T13:30:50Z"
    title "How To Get 6 Pack Abs With No Equipment (AT HOME)"
    description "How To Get 6 Pack Abs With No Equipment (AT HOME)&#10;First you need to understand the basic anatomy of the core muscles.&#10;The rectus abdominis, which can be further divided into two regions; the upper and lower abs. Next there&#8217;s the obliques which run down the sides of the abs. Lastly, there&#8217;s the serratus anterior situated right on top of the ribs.&#10;So to sum the video up, here's what your abs workout could look like:&#10;legs down hold: 3 sets of 30 secons&#10;laying leg flutters: 3 sets of 30 seconds&#10;side plank reach through: 3 sets of 20 seconds on each side&#10;leg raises: 3 sets of 30 seconds&#10;crucifix: 3 sets of 30 seconds&#10;high to low palnk: 3 sets of 30 seconds (as you can see i'm starting with my right hand first afer 15 seconds we're gonna switch and start with our left hand first)&#10;Hopefully you can see that by applying the right science and the proper steps into your weekly routine, you'll be able to experience significantly faster results when it comes to how to get 6 pack abs.&#10;@SajjadZhaleh&#10;https://www.instagram.com/invites/contact/?i=jz1tuk1sxwb7&#38;utm_content=1d1dzla&#10;MUSIC&#10;by NCS Channel = http://bit.ly/1rrCLwu&#10; http://bit.ly/1THLERa // Ship Wrek &#38; Zookeepers - Ark&#10; http://bit.ly/1KkRhg3 // JPB - High&#10;&#10;0:00 Introduction&#10;1:47 LEGS DOWN HOLD&#10;2:09 LAYING LEG FLUTTERS&#10;2:41 SIDE PLANK REACH THROUGH&#10;3:04 PLANK KNEES TO ELBOW&#10;3:37 LEG RAISES&#10;4:26 HIGH TO LOW PLANK"
    channel_title "Sajjad Zhaleh"
    channel_id "UCU0uVUiX2PAb-NuwbUVwIog"
