    title "Perfect ABS Workout To Get 6 PACK  | FOLLOW ALONG"
    description "Let's burn some ABS today! This 5-minute intense ABS workout can be done right at home, at the gym, or literally anywhere. Absolutely no equipment is needed. Your ABS will be super sore after this intense session. Get after it, chase that core, and make those AB gains. Give this intense 5-minute at-home/anywhere ABS workout a try! You get a full ABS workout without going to the gym. No weights are needed, yet you'll be sore before you even finish 1 set of this. 9 exercises, 25 sec long each. Follow along with the video if you'd like, a timer is run throughout on the screen! You Can Do From Home. Learn How to Effectively build your ABS with No Equipment and without weights.&#10;Thank You so much for your support and for completing the workout, next stop we have the CARDIO WORKOUT. &#10;&#10;&#10;M I S S I O N &#10;My name is SALMAN KHAN and my mission is to give out an understanding of What Fitness Holds. We will be going into this amazing journey together and discovering if it's possible or not. I want to do all I can to help, motivate, educate, entertain, and inspire. I promise to always keep it 100% honest and real. I appreciate everyone who supports me and will always give it my all in putting out the best possible content as well as doing my best to always answer everyone who reaches out to me. HAVE NO LIMITS AND NEVER SETTLE!!!&#10;&#10;FITNESS IS THE DESTINATION &#10;&#10;Music:&#10;&#10146; NEFFEX&#10;&#10146; NCS&#10;&#10;CONTACT ME:&#10;&#10146; Email Address - lonewolfwalker11@gmail.com&#10;&#10;&#10;WATCH MORE WHATFITNESSHOLDS:&#10;&#10146; Recent Uploads - https://youtu.be/AFPcFP0G0u0&#10;&#10146; Popular Videos -  https://youtu.be/IaAv7SHhOJE&#10;&#10146; 5 MIN CHEST WORKOUT ANYWHERE - https://youtu.be/f9axq7pBR7w&#10;&#10146; 5 MIN LEG WORKOUT ANYWHERE - https://youtu.be/mD47Lov0Qtg&#10;&#10;ADD ME ON:&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/whatfitnessholds/&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/What-Fitness-Holds-109853145096205"
