    label "2iyoWRoO5ck"
    step 1
    date "2020-05-20T22:21:45Z"
    title "20 MIN BODYWEIGHT LEG WORKOUT AT HOME (No Equipment, Follow Along)"
    description "Workout alongside Conor Sloan with this 20 min at home leg workout. This is a bodyweight only workout that you can perform with no weights &#38; no equipment needed to build lean &#38; toned legs. This is a 20 min follow along bodyweight only leg workout that you can perform at home. This at home workout consists of the best leg &#38; glute exercises to build muscle with no equipment needed. &#10;&#10;&#9876;&#65039;20Min Workout | 10 Exercises | 40sec On | 20sec Off | 2 Rounds &#10;&#10;1. In &#38; Out Jump Squat &#10;2. Reversed Lunges&#10;3. 1 Leg Glute Bridge (right)&#10;4. 1 Leg Glute Bridge (left)&#10;5. Side Lunges&#10;6. Pulse Jump Squats &#10;7. Hip Thrusts&#10;8. Curtsy Lunge&#10;9. Forward Lunge&#10;10. Prisoner Squats &#10;&#10;My Top Bodyweight Workouts &#128071;&#127995;&#10;Home Leg Workout For Mass - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9ovuRgcuVm0&#10;Bodyweight Arm Workout At Home - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LNqgfg9osnY&#10;Upper Body Workout For Mass - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g4gnH3Ctb4U&#10;Bodyweight Back Workout For Mass - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0_tTiB_5pUY&#10;&#10;&#9989; For business inquiries contact me at conorsloanfitness@gmail.com&#10;&#10;------------------------------&#10;&#10;Help SUPPORT the channel by:&#128071;&#127995;&#10;&#10;Signing Up For Transformation Coaching - https://trainlikeawarrior.co.uk/&#10;&#10;Buying My Warrior Merch - https://teespring.com/stores/train-like-a-warrior&#10;&#10;-------------------------------&#10;&#10;Follow me on social media:&#10;Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/conorsloanfi...&#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/conorsloan_&#10;TickTok - @conorsloanfitness&#10;&#10;&#128226;Conor Sloan is a transformation coach who specialises in helping you lose unwanted body fat, gain lean muscle &#38; get into the best shape &#38; health of their lives. His goal is to not only help you with your physical transformation but most importantly show you how fitness will become apart of your lifestyle.&#10;&#10;&#127925; Music By NCS &#127925;&#10;Inukshuk - A World Away - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=icpSOBey7tk&#10;Alex Skrindo - Get Up Again (feat. Axol) - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2UeMLPCL1Cs&#10;Elektronomia - Limitless - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cNcy3J4x62M&#10;Laszlo - Fall To Light - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lq2UrnDsI_s&#10;Cartoon - Why We Lose (feat. Coleman Trapp) - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zyXmsVwZqX4&#10;Killercats - What I Said (feat. Alex Skrindo) - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z0yCMiYmL7w"
