    step 1
    date "2020-04-29T03:11:12Z"
    title "20 MINUTE LEG DESTROYER|Home Leg Workout (No Equipment + No Repeats)"
    description "The ULTIMATE Leg workout. Get ready for this 20-minute medium level bodyweight leg workout. This home leg workout is designed to build your glutes. hamstrings, quads, and calves, and even the adductors &#38; abductors which oftentimes get overlooked. This leg workout can help you gain mass in your legs if performed 2-4 times a week.  Let's get to work! For more home leg workouts or more home workouts, in general, please comment below so I can know what to upload next. This is one of many home workouts from my quarantine collection. If you enjoy this 20-minute total leg workout, make sure to click my workout playlist and check out my other workouts.  *This home leg workout does not require any equipment*&#10;&#10;#BodyWeightWorkout #NoEquipment #AtHome #AtHomeLegs&#10;Shop my Health &#38; Wellness programs!&#10; Meal Plans &#128073;: https://dudleydudzz.com/collections/meal-plan&#10; Workout Programs &#128073;:  https://dudleydudzz.com/collections/workouts&#10;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#10; &#9733;&#9733;Order Dudleydudzz Merch &#9733;&#9733;&#10; DudleyDudzz Merchandise: https://dudleydudzz.com/&#10;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#10;Become my friend :):&#10;Instagram: Dudley_e https://www.instagram.com/dudley_e/&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Dudleydudzz718/&#10;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/Dudleydudzz/&#10;&#10;&#128170;For personalized meal/workout plans, business or general questions&#10;Contact me via email: DudleyDudzz@hotmail.com&#10;&#10; To support me and the channel?&#10;Donate to $Dudleydudzz (Cash App)&#10;or become a Patron member&#10;Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/Dudleydudzz&#10;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#10;&#127793;HERBS &#38; SUPPLEMENTS I USE&#127793;:&#10;CBD OIL:&#128073;: https://www.calmbywellness.com/?rfsn=4887360.996cb1&#10;SuperFood Supplements&#128073;:http://bit.ly/2IbFRUd&#10;MRM Protein Powder: &#128073;:https://amzn.to/2Na7I9n&#10;Pineal Gland Decalcifyer/ Metal Detox &#128073;: https://amzn.to/2PKOE49&#10;Natural Anti-Stress &#38; Anxiety Herb&#128073;: https://amzn.to/2PeQkTt&#10;100% Natural Creatine &#128073;: https://amzn.to/32M16o7&#10;Mucous Eliminator&#128073;:https://amzn.to/31KIiVd&#10;Organic Turmeric (Fights Brain Fog) &#128073;: https://amzn.to/2W9fkgz&#10;Cancer-Fighting Soursop Tea: &#128073;https://amzn.to/2Gi8duW&#10;100% Wild Sea Moss &#128073;: https://amzn.to/3bgvwDI&#10;Manuka Honey (POWERFUL Antibiotic): https://amzn.to/38BMf2l&#10;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#10;&#127770;Skin, Hair Care, &#38; Hygiene Products I use:&#10;African Shea Butter&#128073;: https://amzn.to/2Jm0ZrN   (Skin &#38; Hair)&#10;African Black Soap &#128073;: https://amzn.to/2Ji04c4 (Skin)&#10;REAL Raw Coconut oil &#128073;: https://amzn.to/31ujZwl (Skin.Hair &#38; Cooking)&#10;Castor Oil &#128073;: https://amzn.to/2PgC4K3  (Hair)&#10;Jojoba Oil &#128073;: https://amzn.to/2BDRsrS  (Hair)&#10;Pure Castle Soap (Body Wash)&#128073;: https://amzn.to/2MIjzfK (Skin)&#10;Natural Alcohol-Free Mouth Wash&#128073;: https://amzn.to/2Ndt5qb&#10;Fluoride Free Toothpaste &#1