    title "20 Minute Dumbbell Legs and Core Workout w/ Warm Up   - 25 Minute At Home workout for Men and Women"
    description "Legs and Core Workout With Dumbbell comin' at ya! We get down with alternating legs and abs exercises each superset. It includes a warm up too. This workout was a ton of fun and can easily be modified to suit your needs!&#10;&#10;BUY DUMBBELLS OR RESISTANCE BANDS HERE AT OUR AMAZON.COM STORE : https://www.amazon.com/shop/achvpeak&#10;&#10;FOLLOW US ON OUR SOCIALS:&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/ACHVPEAK/&#10;Instagram: @AchvPeak&#10;&#10;WORKOUT OVERVIEW:&#10;Hit that like button and subscribe to see more! Don't be shy now.&#10;&#10;WARM UP:&#10;1. X Hops&#10;2. Run in Place&#10;3. Burpees&#10;4. Jumping Jacks&#10;&#10;LEGS AND CORE DUMBBELL WORKOUT&#10;1. Hex Squats&#10;2. Weighted Crunches&#10;3. RDL's&#10;4. Side Bends&#10;5. Single Leg Squat with Heel Touch&#10;6. Leg Lift over Weight&#10;7. Reverse Lunges&#10;8. Russian Twists&#10;&#10;&#10;If you enjoy our videos please subscribe and join the family!&#10;&#10;We always appreciate feedback so please leave a comment and let us know what you would like to see in future videos! &#10;&#10;PLEASE NOTE: All information provided by ACHV PEAK is of a general nature and is furnished only for entertainment purposes only. None of the information in our videos is to be taken as medical or other health advice pertaining to any individual specific health or medical condition. You agree that use of this information is at your own risk and hold ACHV PEAK harmless from any and all losses, liabilities, injuries or damages resulting from any and all claims."
    channel_title "ACHV PEAK"
