  node [
    id 5099
    label "CZy8chh3qUU"
    step 1
    date "2022-07-03T07:40:48Z"
    title "18 MIN BOOTY TABATA WORKOUT | with Dumbbells, no jumping | Medium Intensity | Vikki Power"
    description "Hey girls! Who is ready to work that booty? This tabata workout is so much fun and the time just flies in as we are doing 6 exercises, 6 times for 20 sec on and 10 sec off! This workout is definitely going to make your booty burn he he &#10;&#10;Tip: mind-muscle connection.  Make sure you really concentrate on feeling the tension in your booty during each exercise. slow down your tempo, take it nice and slow to make sure your muscle is under tension under a longer period. &#10;&#10;1. Goblet Squat (slow down, take a second before you slowly move back up)&#10;2. Alternating Lunge (to keep your balance make sure you don't step too far, knee should lightly touch the mat)&#10;3. Sumo Squat &#10;4. Romanian Dead Lift (back is straight, DB close to your legs, think about hips hinging back as far as you can then bring them back to the starting position)&#10;5. Glute Bridge (squeeze your glutes as much as you can when you bring your hips up)&#10;6. Squat Hold (this one is hard he he just remeber to keep your core braced and don't forget to breathe).&#10;&#10;The video is in full length which means you can just follow whatever I&#8217;m doing. :) I hope you enjoy this workout!&#10;&#10;Don&#8217;t forget to subscribe and turn on notifications so that you don&#8217;t miss any Workouts, Community Updates or Surprises: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkx74w-Gayqe7CHfbZnzdDg&#10;&#10;Follow me:&#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/vikkipower.fit/&#10;&#10;TikTok - https://www.tiktok.com/@vikkipower.fit&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;When joining me for this workout video, you need to take some precautions as your health and safety is the most important. To avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health with your doctor before exercising. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. Vikki Power will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video.&#10;&#10;#fitness #homeworkout #health"
    channel_title "Vikki Power"
    channel_id "UCkx74w-Gayqe7CHfbZnzdDg"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
