    description "Celebrity kids who aren't as sweet as they seem.&#10;Subscribe: https://goo.gl/Hnoaw3&#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;These famous celebrity kids are putting a whole new meaning to the term &#8220;spoiled brats&#8221;. Everybody knows that celebrity children don&#8217;t have a typical upbringing. They&#8217;re born into fame, fortune, and power. But being spoiled rotten isn&#8217;t all that is cracked up to be. The more money they&#8217;ve got, the less boundaries they have. But kids need limits to stay grounded. Otherwise, they go wild. And if you think dealing with a bratty kid or a diva is bad, wait until they get older. If they&#8217;re not kept in check, they&#8217;re only going to get worse. By the time they&#8217;re teenagers, these celebrity kids will be in serious trouble. They&#8217;ll start partying excessively and get into all kinds of trouble. Do you think that fame and fortune play a role in corrupting these children? Let us know in the comments and then click subscribe to TheTalko to get more videos.&#10;&#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Our Social Media:&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/TheTalko&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/thetalko&#10;Instagram: https://instagram.com/the_talko&#10;&#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;For more videos and articles visit:&#10;http://www.thetalko.com/"
