    title "7 Hit Exercises To Lose Belly Fat FASTER (NO EQUIPMENT)"
    description "7 Hit Exercises To Lose Belly Fat FASTER (NO EQUIPMENT)&#10;Even though your diet will always be the main determining factor for how many calories you take in, there are certain exercises that burn far more calories than others, and these exercises can be used to boost the number of calories you burn on a weekly basis, which will help you burn more fat from your whole body including the fat on your midsection.&#10;So to sum the video up, here's what your workout could look like:&#10;Half burpees: 1-3 sets of 45 seconds&#10;Side palnk: 1-3 sets of 45 seconds&#10;Plank alternating toe taps: 1-3 sets of 45 seconds&#10;High knee taps: 1-3 sets of 45 seconds&#10;High to low plank: 1-3 sets of 45 seconds&#10;Butt kicks: 1-3 sets of 45 seconds&#10;Jumping squats: 1-3 sets of 45 seconds&#10;Hopefully you can see that by applying the right science and the proper steps into your weekly routine, you'll be able to experience significantly faster results when it comes to lose belly fat.&#10;@SajjadZhaleh&#10;https://www.instagram.com/invites/contact/?i=jz1tuk1sxwb7&#38;utm_content=1d1dzla&#10;MUSIC&#10;by NCS Channel = http://bit.ly/1rrCLwu&#10; http://bit.ly/1THLERa // Ship Wrek &#38; Zookeepers - Ark&#10; http://bit.ly/1KkRhg3 // JPB - High"
