    description "Join this channel to get access to perks:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCs5Dd88OlcuILBzYtcYD9IQ/join&#10;&#10;My Best WEIGHT LOSS RECOMMENDATIONS FOR YOU &#10084;&#10084;&#10084;&#10;(Click this link)&#10;https://0f5f5bpqbs8u8vb1klsfp06n2n.hop.clickbank.net/&#10;&#10;I NEED YOUR HELP.&#10;Can you please don't skip the ADS advertisements, it helps my channel so i can continously make workout videos for you &#10084;&#10;&#10;&#10549;INSTAGRAM :&#10;https://www.instagram.com/johnnikzworkout/&#10;&#10;&#11088;FACEBOOK PAGE :&#10;https://bit.ly/2YYVzdK&#10;&#10;In this video I did 100 push ups a day for 30 days challenge. The results will blow your mind.&#10;&#10;&#160;I hope you like this video and if you do, please hit the &#128077; THUMBS UP button,&#160; click the SUBSCRIBE and don't forget to tap/click the &#128276; BELL ICON for more video like this.&#10;&#10;Related Videos:&#10;&#10;200 PUSH UPS A DAY FOR 30 DAYS CHALLENGE- epic body transformation &#10;https://youtu.be/UJHapDy_zzA&#10;&#10;100 PUSH UPS EVERYDAY for your 30 Days&#10;https://youtu.be/TlQ8txalLYg&#10;&#10;100 Push ups a day for 30 Days&#10;TRANSFORMATION&#10;https://youtu.be/4hn3XzCEHyE&#10;&#10;100 PUSH UPS A DAY FOR A MONTH&#10;https://youtu.be/rvRfHTRRFkM&#10;&#10;#30DayShred #100PushupsadayResults&#10;#PushupChallenge&#10;&#10;Mortals&#10;https://youtu.be/zFXl1sjTdms&#10;----------&#10;Jim Yosef - Link&#10;https://youtu.be/L0tfnhacciE.&#10;----------&#10;Invincible&#10;https://youtu.be/jRdgsDx0IP0 &#10;----------&#10;Elektronomia - Sky High&#10;https://youtu.be/92f3RRkakO8 &#10;&#10;Topic:&#10;Home Workout&#10;At Home&#10;Quarantine Workout&#10;&#10;Donate/Support my channel | PAYPAL&#10;https://www.paypal.me/JohnNikzSupport&#10;It would help my channel a lot&#10084;&#10;&#10;&#10;This 2020 is yours. SUBSCRIBE!! workout with me, so we can achieve the FITTEST YOU!"
