    title "10 000 Steps at Home | Fat Burning Indoor Walk | Stephanie S"
    description "Here's a 37-Min Indoor Step Workout to help you achieve your daily step goal. This fast walking workout is designed to keep you in the fat-burning zone while helping you achieve your daily step goal. I would highly recommend walking because it is a low impact and safe workout, especially for those who are extremely overweight or might have knee injuries. &#10;&#10;N.B: If you wish to complete 10 000 steps just by doing this workout, you should do it twice. &#10;________________&#10;Workout Details &#10;&#10;&#128073;&#127996; Duration: 37 Min&#10;&#128073;&#127996; No Equipment&#10;&#128073;&#127996; Get moving &#10;&#128073;&#127996; Level: All Levels &#10;&#10;If you wish to add more intensity to the workout: &#10;&#8226; Try running on the spot instead of marching&#10;&#8226; You can add jumps for some moves &#10;&#8226; During the 10 seconds break, keep running &#127939;&#127997;&#8205;&#9792;&#65039; &#10;&#10;_______________________&#10;More Videos You&#8217;ll Love&#10;&#10;&#11088;&#65039; Inner and Outer Thighs Workout: https://youtu.be/fMkCTj_HqZ4&#10;&#11088;&#65039; Flat Stomach: https://youtu.be/1vebazzcpEs&#10;&#11088;&#65039; Summer ABS: https://youtu.be/DO6_4WI4yGY&#10;&#11088;&#65039; 7 Exercises to Help Reduce Cellulite: https://youtu.be/1-cqiUS6Tc0&#10;&#11088;&#65039; Intense HIIT Workout: https://youtu.be/We8LOhK2KVY&#10;&#11088;&#65039; Burn Fat and Build Muscles: https://youtu.be/y2WMrdr9_sU&#10;&#11088;&#65039; Upper Body and Core: https://youtu.be/H6ZTvqswthg&#10;&#11088;&#65039; Stretch and Core: https://youtu.be/BQsyGHn5oMQ&#10;&#10;___________&#10;Disclaimer&#10;&#10;If you are new to exercise or planning on embarking on a new fitness program, you should consult your physician. &#10;This video may offer health, fitness, or nutritional information and is meant for educational purposes only. This information is not meant as an alternative to seeking professional medical advice or suggested treatment. Please know that performing any exercise or program is solely at your own risk.&#10;&#10;________________&#10;Connect with me&#10;&#10;&#10008; Instagram: @steph.saad&#10;&#10008; Twitter: @stephsaad&#10;&#10008; Facebook: facebook.com/stephanie.saad.1694/&#10;&#10008; Email : fitencore.ss@gmail.com"
