    title "Fitness Ballet Barre - Total Body Workout"
    description "A ballet barre fitness workout is the best way to create an elegant posture, a toned body and keeping fit.&#10;Sometimes we find ballet intimidating especially if we haven&#8217;t done it before, but what if I told you that this is a fun way to learn the basic steps and start your journey towards your healthy, toned, long and lean body?&#10;&#10;Are you with me, are you ready to play this fitness ballet barre?&#10;Let's start pointing our toes and float around the room, you&#8217;ll soon feel beautiful and more confident than ever.&#10;&#10;One last thing: be proud of yourself, every time you take a challenge and you get at the end of it, you are one step closer to your goal! Never give up!&#10;&#10;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10;Beemat ADJUSTABLE BALLET BARRE&#10;&#10036;The Barre I've used in the video!&#10;https://www.beemat.co.uk/products/beemat-adjustable-ballet-barre&#10;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10;&#10;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036; BECOME A MEMBER &#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10;&#10036;  https://www.lazydancerstudio.com/trial-offer &#10036;&#10;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10;&#10;Stuck with your training? TRY MY WORKOUT PLANS&#10;http://lazydancertips.com/ballet-fitness-programs/&#10;&#10;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10;&#10036;CoFounder/Performer/Writer:                                        &#10036;&#10;&#10036;Alessia Lugoboni                                                              &#10036;&#10;&#10036;CoFounder/Cinematographer/Cameraman/Editor:    &#10036;&#10;&#10036;Iacopo Di Luigi                                                                   &#10036;&#10;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10;&#10;Social links:&#10;&#10036; Facebook  &#10036; https://www.facebook.com/LazyDancerTips&#10;&#10036;Twitter       &#10036; https://twitter.com/LazyDancerTips&#10;&#10036; Instagram &#10036; https://www.instagram.com/lazydancertips/&#10;&#10036; Pinterest   &#10036; https://www.pinterest.com/lazydancertips/&#10;&#10036; Website     &#10036; http://www.lazydancertips.com&#10;&#10;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10036;&#10;&#10;Music:&#10;Intro: &#34;Life of Riley&#34; Kevin MacLeod and &#34;Your Call&#34; (http://www.incompetech.com)&#10;soundtrack: &#10;&#34;Dance, Don't Delay&#34; by Twin Musicom is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)&#10;Source: http://www.twinmusicom.org/song/303/dance-dont-delay&#10;Artist: http://www.twinmusicom.org"
