  node [
    id 5170
    label "3O3suCaXYFU"
    step 1
    date "2020-04-24T05:14:08Z"
    title "50 MIN/ Home HIIT &#38; AMRAP/ Full Body Workout | RVNFIT"
    description "No Excuse Workouts!!!&#10;&#10;TODAYS WORKOUT:&#10;45 SEC MAX EFFORT&#10;15 SEC REST&#10;FOR 40 MIN FULL BODY&#10;+&#10;10 MIN CORE AMRAP&#10;&#10;CIRCUIT 1- 5 MIN CARDIO&#10;1. SQUAT WALK OUT TO CRAB REACH&#10;2. BEAR TO CRAB&#10;3. SKATER HOP TO HIGH KNEES (SWITCH 22 SEC)&#10;4. 10 QUICK FEET + DROP &#10;5. GRAPPLER PUSH UP&#10;&#10;CIRCUIT 2- STRENGTH UPPER BODY&#10;1. ALTERNATING CHEST PRESS&#10;2. OUTSIDE CURL TO PRESS&#10;3. AROUND THE WORLD SHOULDER&#10;4. RENEGADE ROW + KICK BACK ALT.&#10;5. SUPERMAN ROW &#10;X3 &#10;&#10;CIRCUIT 3- STRENGTH LOWER BODY&#10;1. SIDE LUNGE HOPS (R)&#10;2. SIDE LUNGE HOPS (L)&#10;3. SQUAT + LEG KICK OUT &#10;4. INNER THIGH KICK (R)&#10;5. INNER THIGH KICK (L)&#10;X3&#10;&#10;CIRCUIT 1- REPEAT CARDIO&#10;&#10;CIRCUIT 4- 1O MIN AMRAP ABS&#10;1. 10 STANDING SIDE REACHES (R)&#10;2. 10 STANDING SIDE REACHES (L)&#10;3. 15 BANANA SIT UPS&#10;4. 10 LEG DROP DOWNS&#10;&#10;What are you waiting for? Get the body you want in a healthy way.&#10;&#10;My workouts are anywhere from 5-50 minutes, this is the time to stop making excuses and do something good for yourself!&#10;&#10;&#9829; Need a little more motivation? My book &#34;5 Steps To Motivation&#34; is in paper back form, right on my website or through this link below. &#10;Don't wait for YOUR perfect body, start NOW! &#10;&#10;RVNFIT Merchandise!&#10;https://teespring.com/stores/rvnfit&#10;&#10;My Book on Amazon:&#10;Amazon- 5 Steps to Motivation&#10;&#10;&#9829; Support My Work @RVNFIT&#10;&#8595; Follow Me! Social Media Links Below &#8595;&#10;&#10;&#9829; Follow Rebekah for more Fitness Motivation!&#10;&#10;&#9829; 100s of FREE Workouts on YOUTUBE &#38; Instagram &#10;&#10;Follow my Social Media &#10;https://instagram.com/rvnfit/&#10;https://www.facebook.com/rvnfit&#10;https://www.youtube.com/rvnfit&#10;https://vm.tiktok.com/shkDKq/&#10;&#10;&#8595;To add a few workout items to your routine check them out here&#8595;&#10;WORKOUT PIECES: https://www.rvnfit.com/equipment&#10;MY FAVORITE SUPPLEMENTS: https://www.rvnfit.com/nutrition&#10;&#10;Related Videos:&#10;&#10;Where to Start? 10 Minute Workout for Complete Beginners with Rebekah, Total Body Fitness At Home https://www.youtube.com/beginnerfullbody&#10;&#10;Get Fit Quick with Rebekah! 5 Min Arm Burnout Sequence for Beginners Home Fitness https://www.youtube.com/armburnout&#10;&#10;Belly Fat Blast with Rebekah! 10 Min. Ab Workout for Beginners, Core, Abs, Fitness at Home https://www.youtube.com/beginnercore&#10;&#10;Crazy Insane 40 Min Floor- Low Impact Workout- Great for all Levels! https://youtu.be/hdl0khVsEc4"
