    title "FULL AB DEFINING &#38; STRENGTHENING WORKOUT / 12 minutes + bodyweight only!"
    description "a strong AND defined core?! um YES please! which is exactly what we have in today's QUICK 12 MINUTE AB BURNER! bodyweight, no equipment required - you can literally do this as soon as you wake up before you get started for the day to start your day off on a HIGH vibe with those endorphins running from your workout!&#10;&#10;the format is 40 seconds ON / 20 seconds REST between each exercise&#10;there are 6 ab exercises total that will be repeated for two rounds which are listed below:&#10;&#10;1. plank reach out&#10;2. lying single leg raise&#10;3. bicycle crunch&#10;4. reverse crunch&#10;5. opposite jack knife&#10;6. ab crunch&#10;&#10;&#9825; SPORTS BRA I'm wearing in this video: https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B09BCD4SF4/ref=ppx_yo_dt_b_asin_title_o03_s01?ie=UTF8&#38;psc=1 &#10;&#10;&#9825; SHORTS I'm wearing in this video: from marshalls no link is available!&#10;&#10;&#9825; CAMERA I'm using: &#10;https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B08965JV8D/ref=ppx_yo_dt_b_search_asin_image?ie=UTF8&#38;psc=1&#10;&#10;&#9825; EDITING SOFTWARE I'm using: &#10;https://apps.apple.com/us/app/final-cut-pro/id424389933?ign-itscg=20200&#38;ign-itsct=rv_FCP_google&#38;mt=12&#38;mttnagencyid=b2r&#38;mttncc=US&#38;mttnpid=Google%20AdWords&#38;mttnsiteid=141192&#38;mttnsubad=fcp&#38;mttnsubkw=ag-68842611536-ad-521724107264&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9825; PERSONALIZED fitness + nutrition coaching for fat loss + muscle building for women: &#10;&#10;https://vivsgym.com/services&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9825; FOLLOW my instagram for more health &#38; fitness tips: instagram.com/vivsgym&#10;&#10;&#9825; LISTEN to my podcast for more health + fit tips: &#10;&#10;https://open.spotify.com/show/2Dm055M1OGrvBdB8HxWTv1&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9825; SUBSCRIBE to my relationship + love youtube channel for more deets on my life: &#10;&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCn1J-AokdZwVIluubiXU1PA&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER / if you're new to working out, go at your own pace and take rests + make easier exercise modifications as needed to prevent injury!&#10;&#10;this youtube channel offers fitness, nutrition and general health information. do not rely on this information as a substitute for professional medical advice! it does not serve as any kind of replacement, diagnosis or treatment that should be provided by a physician or health care professional. please consult your physician before starting this or any other fitness program/workouts to determine if it is appropriate for your personal needs. these workouts do not provide supervision for your form, perform at your own risk and liability. VivsGym / Vivian Ngo will not be held responsible for any injury or harm you may sustain as a result of this video. thank you for your understanding!"
