  node [
    id 5183
    label "XUI43nXVCIw"
    step 1
    date "2020-07-15T15:20:48Z"
    title "Summer Shred Upper Body Workout"
    description "In today's workout, we'll focus on leaning down with weights. The techniques used in this video include:&#10;Supersets&#10;Order of exercises&#10;Compound movements&#10;Single-arm movements&#10;Timed recovery&#10;Finishers&#10;&#10;The exercises include:&#10;1a). landmine single-arm t-bar row&#10;1b). landmine single-arm chest/shoulder press&#10;2a). landmine upright row&#10;2b). landmine Y-press&#10;3a). wide-grip pulldown&#10;3b). decline push up&#10;4a). dumbbell row&#10;4b). dumbbell/plate chest press&#10;5). renegade row with push up (finisher)&#10;&#10;Sets and reps, as always, will depend on your goals and current physique. For re-comping, heavier weights and more volume can be helpful (4-5 sets of 8-10 reps). For just shredding, higher reps can be effective. You still want to choose weights that are challenging, yet doable for the last 2-3 reps. 3-4 sets of 12-15 reps may be a good range. &#10;&#10;Join FitU! Weekly home and gym workouts, meal guides, live support, live Q&#38;As:&#10;http://erinsternfitness.com&#10;&#10;Thanks for watching! Please subscribe :)&#10;#summershred #erinstern #getlean&#10;&#10;BUSINESS CONTACT | erin@erinstern.com&#10;WEBSITE | http://www.erinstern.com&#10;INSTAGRAM | http://instagram.com/2x_ms_olympia&#10;PINTEREST | https://www.pinterest.com/erinstern5/&#10;TWITTER | https://twitter.com/erinfast&#10;FACEBOOK | https://www.facebook.com/fiterin&#10;&#10;Train hard, y'all!"
