    title "15 Minute Upper Chest Workout For A Perfect Chest!"
    description "&#9658; Grab SuperHuman Protein for 10% off and speed up your muscle building! CODE: Troy10 &#9658; http://bit.ly/SuperHuman-protein&#10;&#10;&#9726;NOTE TO ALL MY YOUTUBE SUBSCRIBERS, PLZ READ: I'm the Co-Founder of ALPHA LION and create all of our innovative sports nutrition products with my team of research scientists. &#10;&#10;The reason our formulas are so unique and effective is the same reason my bodybuilding tips work - massive attention to detail. &#10;&#10;I personally take every single product at some point in the year, and believe in the benefits 100% or I WOULD NEVER share them with my SuperHuman Fam. &#10;&#10;Thanks to all the amazing support the last year, helping www.AlphaLion.com become one of the fastest growing fitness lifestyle companies in the world and reaching motivated guys in over 50 countries Become SuperHuman!&#10;&#10;&#9726;FOLLOW ME ON IG @TroyShred &#10;&#10;For aesthetic bodybuilding, lifestyle motivation, and my adventures around the world building ALPHA LION.&#10;&#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;UPPER CHEST WORKOUT - BALLOON METHOD&#10;&#10;STAGE 1: Pre Fatigue your upper chest (first 3 minutes)&#10;&#10;STAGE 2: Metabolic Stress on your upper chest. Pick the best upper chest exercises that will directly hit. &#10;&#10;These are 3 killer upper chest shapers:&#10;&#10;- db low to high&#10;-low to high cable flyes&#10;-db around the worlds&#10;&#10;STAGE 3: Anabolic Dropsets for UPPER CHEST&#10;&#10;-I prefer to use the barbell incline bench press or db pullover for this. These are 2 of the best mass builders for the upper chest and should be included in any upper pectoral workout for gains!&#10;&#10;OTHER TIPS TO SCULPT THE UPPER CHEST and get AESTHETIC PECTORALS!&#10;&#10;-Hit upper chest at least twice per week &#10;&#10;-add more volume to your training every few weeks&#10;&#10;-Focus on time under tension and progressive overload. NOT ego lifting!&#10;&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;&#9726;SHARE THIS VIDEO: Grow Your Stubborn Upper Chest in 15 Minutes (BALLOON METHOD)&#10;&#10;------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#9726;SUBSCRIBE : http://www.Youtube.com/SuperHumanTV&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ON IG: @TroyShred&#10;&#10;------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#9726;LINKS TO MY OTHER AESTHETIC BB VIDEOS AND BALLOON METHOD VIDEOS:&#10;&#10;GET HUGE SHOULDERS in 15 Minutes (BALLOON METHOD)&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jxuY338-_3A&#10;&#10;3 FORGOTTEN LEG DAY PILLARS&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iGkTJmVaUU0&#10;&#10;5 REASONS I GAINED 10 LBS. OF MUSCLE&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NRDSUtegh_8&#10;&#10;WHY DO SPRINTERS HAVE SUCH RIPPED ABS?https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tEvJr0TuPIM&#10;&#10;HOW TO GET WIDER SHOULDERS:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9IJWOxP8BeA&#10;&#10;WHY DO MEN'S GYMNASTS HAVE SUCH BIG BICEPS?https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G19RMNUADJA&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;LINKS TO SOME OF THE BEST UPPER CHEST WORKOUT VIDEOS ON YOUTUBE:&#10;&#10;UPPER CHEST SOLUTION :https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BY13DFmEF-s&#10;&#10;SCIENCE BASED CHEST WORKOUT: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HtV1FIPyTEw&#10;&#10;3 UPPER CHEST EXERCISES YOU'VE NEVER TRIED:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IQsaUPISXOs&#10;&#10;3 KILLER UPPER CHEST EXERCISES:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3q1Cs3ZYZ-Y&#10;&#10;MASS BUILDING BODYBUILDING WORKOUT:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o9zCgPtsups"
