    title "How To Do A Side Plank | The Right Way | Well+Good"
    description "To get notified about new video uploads, subscribe to Well+Good's channel: [https://www.youtube.com/c/Wellandgood]&#10;&#10;Side planks are a key part of just about every core workout, but do you know how to do them the right way? Trainer Charlee Atkins shows us how to correct common mistakes people make when they're doing the infamous side plank and modifications you can make to perfect it! Watch to up your side plank game and optimize your workouts! #sideplank #therightway #wellandgood&#10;&#10;Be sure to follow Charlee here: https://www.instagram.com/charleeatkins/?hl=en&#10;&#10;Subscribe to Well+Good&#8217;s channel for more fitness tips and tricks: https://www.youtube.com/c/Wellandgood&#10;&#10;Check out more The Right Way videos here: &#10;How to Plank: https://youtu.be/u6ZelKyUM6g&#10;How to do a Glute Bridge: https://youtu.be/wPM8icPu6H8 &#10;&#10;You can find Well+Good here:&#10;Site &#128421;&#65039;: https://www.wellandgood.com&#10;Instagram &#128248;: https://www.instagram.com/iamwellandg...&#10;Facebook &#128077;: https://www.facebook.com/iamwellandgood&#10;Twitter &#128036;: https://twitter.com/iamwellandgood&#10;Pinterest &#128204;: https://www.pinterest.com/iamwellandgood/"
