    title "How to do a Boat Hold | The Right Way | Well+Good"
    description "A Boat Hold is a great movement for stabilizing through your center and lower core, which is why you want to make sure you're doing it the right way! Bridget O'Carroll, founder of Studio Qila, shows us the common mistakes she sees when performing this move as well as the right way to get the most out of it every time!&#10;&#10;To get notified about new video uploads, subscribe to Well+Good's channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/Wellandgood&#10;&#10;Find Bridget here: https://www.instagram.com/bridget.ocarroll/&#10;And check out Studio Qila here: https://www.studioqila.com/&#10;&#10;Meet this month's featured trainer: Bridget O'Carroll, founder of Studio Qila, the first Native-owned digital fitness studio. Follow along for high-intensity Pilates workouts filled with slow and controlled movements that leave you stronger head to toe.&#10;&#10;Subscribe to Well+Good&#8217;s channel for more fitness tips &#38; tricks: https://www.youtube.com/c/Wellandgood&#10;&#10;Want more The Right Way? Try these:&#10;Frogger: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e5O850feKz8&#10;Plank to Pike: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G-2oFuWRgNI&#10;Pilates Push-Up: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KJ_UP2m1hmk&#10;&#10;About Well+Good: &#10;Well+Good believes that wellness and health should be attainable for all&#8212;and recognizes the many barriers that prevent that from becoming a reality. Sitting at the cross-section of trends, service, and evidence-based journalism, we work to inform, empower, and educate communities and individuals when it comes to fitness, mental health, beauty, food, relationships, finance, and all other ways your day-to-day impacts your ability to live well, while working to challenge the systems that could hold you (or others) back. Your well-being is a birthright. Wellness is how you get there.&#10;&#10;You can find Well+Good here: &#10;Site &#128421;&#65039;:  https://www.wellandgood.com&#8203;&#8203;&#10;Instagram &#128248;: https://www.instagram.com/iamwellandgood&#10;Facebook &#128077;: https://www.facebook.com/iamwellandgood&#10;Twitter &#128036;: https://twitter.com/iamwellandgood&#8203;&#8203;&#10;Pinterest &#128204;: https://www.pinterest.com/iamwellandgood"
