  node [
    id 5297
    label "5-8IFt6vauc"
    step 1
    date "2020-08-07T19:50:28Z"
    title "Boxing Core Workout Inspired by Manny Pacquiao (No equipment needed)"
    description "Want to strengthen your core like a boxing champion? Add this core routine of 10 movements, inspired by Manny Pacquiao, to the end of your boxing training sessions. FightCamp Trainer Coach PJ will walk you through the first set, but if you are up for an ab challenge do this routine 2, 3, 4x back to back. If you are up for the PacMan challenge, you can do this ab workout up to 10 to 15 sets. &#10;&#10;10 Core Exercises Inspired by Manny Pacquiao's Training:&#10;1. Flutter Kicks&#10;2. Criss Crosses&#10;3. Knee Tucks&#10;4. Boxer Twists Right&#10;5. Boxer Twists Left&#10;6. Side Crunch Right&#10;7. Side Crunch Left&#10;8. 360 Crunch Clockwise&#10;9. 360 Crunch Counter Clockwise&#10;10. Toe Touches&#10;&#10;Check out these FightCamp videos for strengthening your core and enhancing your boxing skills:&#10;&#9702; 8 Minute Ab Workout with Flo Master: https://youtu.be/OzZsa-6MeiE &#10;&#9702; Aaron's Pyramid Ab Workout with Aaron Swenson: https://youtu.be/tVsQ5eD8jxI &#10;&#9702; WHY CORE? | What You Need To Know About Ab Workouts: https://youtu.be/WO8VJ6yCDg4 &#10;&#9702; Stability Ball Exercises For Boxing with Flo Master: https://youtu.be/vBll38ldiQE &#10;&#10;Ready to unleash the fighter within? &#128074;&#10;&#10;DOWNLOAD THE FREE FIGHTCAMP APP:&#10;&#9656; https://fightcamp.app.link/MRQpBJF81kb&#10;&#10;&#10;GET MORE FIGHTCAMP&#10;&#12299;Explore &#38; Shop at FightCamp: Head on over to our website: https://joinfightcamp.com/?utm_source=organicYT&#38;utm_medium=workout&#38;utm_campaign=description&#38;utm_content=&#10;&#12299;Subscribe: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJ6J1r5u8CFsbyVZ03A6IaQ?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;FREE DOWNLOAD | FIGHTCAMP TRAINING JOURNAL &#10;&#9656; Track your workouts like a champion by downloading the FightCamp Training Journal for free: https://joinfightcamp.com/journal/ &#10;&#10;JOIN THE TRIBE&#10;&#9656; Instagram | @FightCamp https://www.instagram.com/fightcamp/ &#10;&#9656; Facebook | https://www.facebook.com/fightcamp/ &#10;&#9656; Facebook Community | https://www.facebook.com/groups/542530602799015/ &#10;&#10;#boxing #coreworkout #abworkout&#10;&#10;Chapters:&#10;0:00 - Introduction&#10;1:12 - Flutter Kicks&#10;1:32 - Rest&#10;1:42 - Criss Crosses&#10;2:02 - Rest&#10;2:12 - Knee Tucks&#10;2:32 - Rest&#10;2:42 - Boxer Twists Right&#10;3:02 - Rest&#10;3:12 - Boxer Twists Left&#10;3:32 - Rest&#10;3:42 - Side Crunch Right&#10;4:02 - Rest&#10;4:12 - Side Crunch Left&#10;4:32 - Rest&#10;4:42 - 360 Crunch Clockwise&#10;5:02 - Rest&#10;5:12 - 360 Crunch Counter Clockwise&#10;5:32 - Rest&#10;5:42 - Toe Touches&#10;6:45 - Join FightCamp"
    channel_title "FightCamp"
    channel_id "UCJ6J1r5u8CFsbyVZ03A6IaQ"
