  node [
    id 5335
    label "HPcTtKmBD7A"
    step 1
    date "2020-02-19T11:25:40Z"
    title "I did Kayla Itsines BBG | 6 week BODY TRANSFORMATION (vlog style!)"
    description "HELLO! Thank you so much for watching my very first YouTube video!!&#10;This is a fun vlog style video following my journey doing @Kaylaitsines Bikini Body Guide for the Sweat 6 Week Challenge!&#10;&#10;Here is my journey doing the Bikini Body Guide by Kayla Itsines! The BBG program includes tri-weekly resistance workouts that consist of 4x 7 minute circuits. The other days are cardio days where I chose to do mostly HIIT because this was my 4th Round and I wanted to push myself a bit harder! I also challenged myself to eat vegetarian the whole time!&#10;&#10;I didn't do this challenge for weight loss - it was purely for fun because I love this program and wanted to give an insight into what the program is like and continue to improve my strength and fitness level! :)&#10;&#10;If  you want to follow more of my journey or if you have any questions feel free to ask me on my instagram!&#10;@jorjas.journey&#10;&#10;Don&#8217;t forget to SUBSCRIBE and support my channel for more videos like this! &#10;&#10;&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Music in this video:&#10;https://www.bensound.com/royalty-free-music &#10;&#10;Music: &#34;MBB - Wake up&#34;&#10;Promoted by BreakingCopyright: http://bit.ly/MBB_WakeUp&#10;&#10;&#34;Dj Quads - It just makes me happy&#34; is under a Creative Commons license (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0) https://creativecommons.org/licenses/...&#10;Music promoted by BreakingCopyright: https://youtu.be/I-kuqYg3O7s&#10;&#10;Music: Paradise by Ikson&#10;https://soundcloud.com/ikson&#10;Free Download: https://www.toneden.io/ikson/post/iks...&#10;&#10;Luke Bergs - Endless Summer&#10;Youtube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCL7P3NSg2K5IcDJTJla7pxQ?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;Song: MBB - Takeoff (Vlog No Copyright Music)&#10;Music provided by Vlog No Copyright Music.&#10;Video Link: https://youtu.be/wJD9T-NkAUw"
