  node [
    id 5349
    label "-RXTVJwMlqA"
    step 1
    date "2019-04-17T04:45:42Z"
    title "Do This Workout Every Morning | 30 MIN Total Body No Equipment Workout &#10084; Better Than The Gym!"
    description "Start your day off right with the one of the BEST morning workouts you can do at home! There's no equipment involved so NO EXCUSES!&#10;&#128071;Click for More Info&#128071;&#10;&#10;&#128591; Please help subtitle/translate my video (THANK YOU!!!): https://bit.ly/2SKFW5V&#10;&#10;&#10;The benefits of working out in the morning are well known! &#10;1&#8419; Jumpstart your metabolism&#10;2&#8419; You're less likely to skip your workout for the day&#10;3&#8419; Improve your mood by releasing endorphins &#10;&#10;This workout features HIIT cardio elements to burn extra calories, body weight strength exercises to boost metabolism and yoga-infused calisthenics to improve your mobility and flexibility. It is the most comprehensive morning workout you'll find!&#10;&#10;We're working every muscle group in the body to keep you completely fit, balanced and agile &#128170;&#10;&#10;Why NO JUMPING? It's better to wake up sleepy muscles in a gentle, moderate manner than jamming something intense down your body's throat! &#128541; Being too aggressive with your body and pushing too hard, too fast and/or for too long is the most common reason why people get injured. &#10;&#10;The truth is, you reap the absolute most benefit from exercise by going to a degree that is between too much and not enough. You have to FEEL THIS ONE OUT yourself because no trainer or instructor can tell you how far to go. &#10;&#10;Try doing this workout daily for at least a month and see the difference!&#10;&#10;*Oops* &#128541; There is a typo. &#34;Reverse Crunch Twist&#34; should be &#34;Reverse Lunge Twist&#34;... WHY AM I SO CLUMSY?!?!?&#10;&#10;-&#10;&#10;&#128142;GET IN SHAPE WITH ME!!!&#128142;&#10;Subscribe to be my Workout Buddy! https://tinyurl.com/joinworkout10&#10;&#10;&#128077; = GOOD FITNESS KARMA (I send positive vibes to you to get in shape faster!)&#10;&#10;-&#10;&#10;&#127925;MUSIC &#127926;&#10;&#10;Song: LiME - Dive In&#10;Video's Link : https://youtu.be/YryNMX6yxbo&#10;Download https://myaudiograb.com/CGlqPb3wt&#10;&#10;[LiME]&#10;https://soundcloud.com/offcial_lime&#10;&#10;Track: Ascence - Rules [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/GxobnOtrW10&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/RulesYO&#10;&#10;Track: TULE - Fearless [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/9rujCfYXhQc&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/FearlessYO&#10;&#10;Dinnerdate - Time | Majestic Color: https://youtu.be/4LNv3nv7SLw&#10;&#10;Track: Clarx - Bones [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/8Tu0lcl75yg&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/Bones&#10;&#10;Track: HYLO - Paradise ft. Akacia [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/eAo-QR9BtmU&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/ParadiseYO&#10;&#10;Track: Tobu - Candyland [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/IIrCDAV3EgI&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/candyland&#10;&#10;-&#10;&#10;#morningworkout&#10;#nojumpingworkout&#10;#totalbody&#10;#loseweight&#10;#homeworkout&#10;#workout&#10;#bodyweightworkout&#10;#noequipment&#10;#fullbodyworkout&#10;#totalbodyworkout"
