    title "The Harmful Body Shaming on Dance Moms //Uncovered S2E20"
    description "You are not alone.&#10;Please check out these resources:&#10;[US] Lifeline (24 hour service): https://suicidepreventionlifeline.org/&#10;     Call: 1-800-273-TALK (8255)&#10;[US] Eating Disorder Foundation: https://eatingdisorderfoundation.org/&#10;     Call: (303) 322-3373&#10;[AUS] Lifeline Australia (24 hour service): https://www.lifeline.org.au/&#10;     Call: 13 11 14&#10;[AUS] The Butterfly Foundation for Eating Disorders: https://butterfly.org.au/&#10;     Call: 1800 33 4673&#10;[UK] Samaritans: http://www.samaritans.org/&#10;     Call: 116 123&#10;[UK] Beat- Beating Eating Disorders: https://www.beateatingdisorders.org.uk/&#10;     Call: 0808 801 0677&#10;[CAN] Crisis Services Canada: https://www.crisisservicescanada.ca/&#10;     Call: 1-833-456-4566&#10;[CAN] Eating Disorders Foundation of Canada: http://edfc.ca/&#10;     Call: (519) 858-5111&#10;[NZ] Lifeline New Zealand (24 hour service): http://www.lifeline.org.nz/&#10;     Call: 0800 543 354&#10;[NZ] EDANZ: https://www.ed.org.nz/&#10;     Call: (09) 5222679&#10;[ZA] Lifeline Southern Africa: http://lifelinesa.co.za/&#10;     Call: 10 177&#10;[ZA] Eating Disorders South Africa: http://www.edsa.co.za/&#10;     Call: 079 235 7415&#10;For more countries' services, visit this website: https://www.therapyroute.com/article/helplines-suicide-hotlines-and-crisis-lines-from-around-the-world&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;EVIDENCE LINKS:&#10;Flat Tummy Tea Dangers: &#10;     https://www.theguardian.com/media/2018/aug/29/flat-tummy-instagram-women-appetite-suppressant-lollipops &#10;&#10;Boom Bod Dangers: &#10;     https://www.thesun.co.uk/fabulous/8515674/weight-loss-shake-boombod-katie-price-choke-fears/ &#10;&#10;Christi's Nose Surgery:&#10;     https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=58rs1YmYOnU &#10;&#10;Melissa gets Botox:&#10;     https://www.instagram.com/tv/CDR1X-8h_yc/?hl=en (20:20)&#10;&#10;Christi's Tomato Week:&#10;     https://youtu.be/itn3GgW-OEI?t=159&#10;&#10;Christi Says She'd Hate Herself if she ate too many Carbs:&#10;     https://youtu.be/itn3GgW-OEI?t=600&#10;&#10;Christi's Goal to Fit into a pair of Chloe's Jeans:&#10;https://www.facebook.com/211185825601731/videos/749984372026871 (45:40)&#10;&#10;Sadie's Fasting:&#10;     https://youtu.be/DNy-gd-GliI?t=394&#10;&#10;Abby Admits to the Potato Leaps:&#10;     https://youtu.be/5q5Hs0LlRHc?t=396&#10;&#10;Kelly says the Kids had to leap with potatoes at 7 or 8 year's old:&#10;     https://youtu.be/Q__yUf5UhME?t=191 &#10;&#10;Abby had names for the girls' stomachs:&#10;     https://youtu.be/s7mDcrFjtdA?t=32&#10;&#10;Abby body shamed Pressley:&#10;     https://youtu.be/hqjlFfG-95A?t=445&#10;&#10;Abby called Lilliana's feet fat:&#10;     https://youtu.be/fxHGCaE4Uuc?t=557&#10;&#10;Abby says she likes Pretty Girls: &#10;    https://youtu.be/W4NXIUxVedQ?t=54&#10;&#10;Abby says she's an expert on hiding Kids' flaws:&#10;     https://youtu.be/r8nNzFIsTSc?t=918&#10;&#10;Ava talks about her experience with bodyshaming:&#10;     https://youtu.be/n-NX59wegqM?t=588&#10;&#10;Kalani's Instagram Reel:&#10;     https://www.instagram.com/reel/CFcohAhnJk8/?igshid=1hjzvaz9je5tn&#10;&#10;Kendall says &#8220;I&#8217;m fat, I know&#8221;: &#10;     https://youtu.be/jHi1Bvpyji4?t=1272&#10;&#10;Kendall says she&#8217;s fat again: &#10;     https://youtu.be/EWd5jEhqkNE?t=1228 &#10;&#10;Maddie says her ice cream &#8220;has brownies in it and I&#8217;m fat&#8221;:&#10;     https://youtu.be/DM4scXbtn3s?t=75&#10;&#10;JoJo doesn&#8217;t like how she looks most of the time: &#10;     https://youtu.be/0U8mTpBmqC8?t=3073&#10;&#10;JoJo said &#8220;guys, we&#8217;re so fat!&#8221;: &#10;     https://youtu.be/AQDtum7TZQI?t=197&#10;&#10;Chloe Lukasiak Writes Account:&#10;     https://www.instagram.com/chloelukasiakwrites/&#10;&#10;Sophia Lucia's experience:&#10;     https://imgur.com/a/vHQuvGg&#10;&#10;#DMUncovered"
