  node [
    id 5376
    label "a_5_svcFOTQ"
    step 1
    date "2022-05-17T13:48:32Z"
    title "TONED ARMS || BURN ARM FAT, UPPER BODY 5 MINUTE - NO EQUIPMENT"
    description "Feel the burn in your upper body with the 5-minute workout! No equipment is needed&#128293;&#128293;&#128293;&#10;&#10;Exercises:&#10;&#128688;ShoulderTaps&#10;Tip: Engage your core to stabilize your body as you lift your right hand off the ground and touch your left shoulder. Repeat with your left hand, making sure to keep your hips stable.&#10;&#10;&#128293; Plank Lifts&#10;Tip: Starting on forearms use one arm at a time to rise to hands, then one hand at a time lower back to forearms. Keep alternating arms.&#10;&#10;&#129717;Plank With Arm Reach&#10;Tip: Your Hands will be underneath your chest a little inside your shoulders, lifting one hand at a time reaching forward and slowly lowering. Alternating each hand&#10;&#10;&#128038;Flappy Arms&#10;Tip: Both hands straight, slightly flap arms up and down with a controlled motion (without lowering them)&#10;&#10;&#9195; Assisted Push up&#10;Tip: Start by lying completely flat on the floor with your hands on the outside of your chest. Now push up into a push-up position if you can't do it onto your toes you can use your knees.&#10;&#10;Subscribe to my channel: https://youtube.com/channel/UCspgttLbEbspsoNl5wFTn-A?sub_confirmation=1&#10;Instagram: instagram.com/trainsuz&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/groups/trainsuz&#10;TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@trainsuz&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/trainsuz&#10;&#10;&#128231; Enquiries: trainsuz@gmail.com&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;&#10;If you are a complete beginner start with a pace you are comfortable with and then progress. Performing exercises out of your capability might strain your muscles and you may get injured.&#10;&#10;This channel offers health, fitness and nutritional information. You should not rely on this information as a substitute for, nor does it replace professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional give you advice on your exercise form. TrainSuz will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video.&#10;&#10;0:00 Introduction&#10;0:09 SHOULDER TAPS&#10;1:09 PLANK LIFTS&#10;2:09 PLANK ARM REACH&#10;3:09 FLAPPY ARMS&#10;4:09 ASSISTED HALF PUSH UP"
