    description "Trying the Victoria Secret Model Diet for 7 days (I'm shook)&#10;in this video i ate like 5 different models (3 vs angels, and 2 other models) and copied their workouts as well. I hope you learn some healthy meal ideas and new workouts !! VS models are known for being toned, having ab definition, and a flat stomach, so why not try it !!&#10;&#10;flat tummy tea: https://go.magik.ly/ml/zzgu/&#10;margarita pizza recipe: https://www.abeautifulplate.com/the-best-homemade-margherita-pizza/&#10;pasta recipe: https://www.errenskitchen.com/spaghetti-with-spinach-sauce/&#10;&#10;the models diets and workouts:&#10;&#9734;kendall jenner: https://www.harpersbazaar.com.au/health-fitness/kendall-jenner-diet-exercise-20138&#10;&#9734;gigi hadid: https://www.harpersbazaar.com.au/health-fitness/gigi-hadid-diet-exercise-17691&#10;&#9734;emily ratajkowski: https://www.harpersbazaar.com.au/health-fitness/emily-ratajkowski-diet-exercise-17031&#10;&#9734;stella maxwell: https://www.rachaelattard.com/stella-maxwell-diet-exercise-routine-model/&#10;https://www.byrdie.com/victorias-secret-models-fitness-diet&#10;&#9734;cambrie schroder: https://fitwithcambrie.com/collections/meal-plans (her meal plans and exercises)&#10;&#10;&#9734; ALL SOCIALS &#9734; (instagram, vsco, pinterest, tiktok, etc): @fernandaraamirez&#10;&#10;business inquiries:&#10;&#9734;fernanda@select.co&#10;&#10;FAQ&#10;&#9734;age: 18&#10;&#9734;height: 5'6&#10;&#9734;location: Vancouver, Canada&#10;&#9734;camera: Canon g7x Mark llI&#10;&#9734;editing software: final cut pro x&#10;&#10;i do not own any of the music used in this video&#10;Music by Mark Generous - Meganne - https://thmatc.co/?l=F270A21D&#10;Music by Eric Reprid - June Blues - https://thmatc.co/?l=8D6EA69&#10;Music by Gil Wanders - Dreams - https://thmatc.co/?l=2B7AFDC7&#10;Music by HOAX - Beach House - https://thmatc.co/?l=6651A13F&#10;&#10;affiliates !!&#10;-use code &#34;FERN123&#34; for $$$ off on YESSTYLE&#10;&#10;FTC: some links are affiliate links (I make a commission off of a purchase but you don't pay extra :)&#10;sub count: 40,511&#129419;&#10;#whatieatinaweek #eatinglikeavictoriasecretmodel"
