    step 1
    date "2022-04-11T13:15:32Z"
    title "10 MINUTE AB BURNER || NO EQUIPMENT NO REPEAT || HOME WORKOUT"
    description "Hello! Here's a quick and effective ab workout, suitable for beginners.&#10;&#10;&#129485;&#8205;&#9792;&#65039;Standing Crunch &#10;Tip: Contract abs by pulling both elbows to each knee, alternating each time.&#10;&#10;&#129461; Alternating Knee Crunch &#10;Tip: Bring your right elbow towards your left knee. Keep feet shoulder-width apart.&#10;&#10;&#128690; Bicycle Crunch &#10;Tip: Exhale and rotate your trunk, moving your right elbow and left knee toward each other.&#10;&#10;&#8596;&#65039;Tuck to extension &#10;Tip: Extend both legs out, keeping your lower back flat on the ground.&#10;&#10;&#8597;&#65039; Alternating Leg Drops&#10;Tip: Keep lower back flat on the ground.&#10;&#10;&#128099; Toe Taps &#10;Tip: Keep core tight as each foot is lowered.&#10;&#10;&#128095; Heel Taps &#10;Tip: Alternate touching each ankle with your hands by moving from side to side keeping your head and shoulders raised off the floor.&#10;&#10;&#11088; Alternating Starfish Crunch&#10;Tip: Slowly move up one leg and the arm of the opposite side until they reach the middle while keeping these body parts stretched.&#10;&#10;&#129781; Crunch Variation &#10;Tip: Plant your feet on the floor, hip-width apart. Push arms through between legs.&#10;&#10;&#129717; Plank&#10;Tip: Keep a neutral neck and spine.&#10;&#10;&#10;Subscribe to my channel: https://youtube.com/channel/UCspgttLbEbspsoNl5wFTn-A?sub_confirmation=1&#10;Instagram: instagram.com/trainsuz&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/groups/trainsuz&#10;TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@trainsuz&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/trainsuz&#10;Enquiries: trainsuz@gmail.com&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;&#10;If you are a complete beginner start with a pace you are comfortable with and then progress. Performing exercises out of your capability might strain your muscles and you may get injured.&#10;&#10;This channel offers health, fitness and nutritional information. You should not rely on this information as a substitute for, nor does it replace, professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. TrainSuz will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video.&#10;&#10;0:00 Introduction&#10;0:10 STANDING CRUNCH&#10;2:09 BICYCLE CRUNCH&#10;3:09 TUCK TO EXTENSION&#10;4:09 ALTERNATING LEG DROPS&#10;7:09 ALTERNATING STARFISH CRUNCH&#10;8:09 CRUNCH VARIATION&#10;9:09 PLANK"
