  node [
    id 5386
    label "g4ilatQS0Hs"
    step 1
    date "2022-05-19T10:17:09Z"
    title "LOWER BODY WORKOUT - SUPERSETS || NO EQUIPMENT/NO REPEAT - TONED LEGS - 5 MINS"
    description "Try this superset burner! Tone your lower body&#10;&#128293;&#128293;&#10;&#10;Exercises:&#10;&#128293; Side Lunge to Squat&#10;Tip: Take a big step to the side and, ensuring you keep your torso as upright as possible, lower until the knee of your leading leg is bent at around 90&#176;&#10;&#10;Squat Tip: Keep feet shoulder-width apart, keep your lower back neutral.&#10;&#10;&#128293; Wide Stance Squat to Good Mornings&#10;Tip:Keeping weight in your back heels, start to lower your hips and bend your knees into a wide squat. Go down until your thighs are parallel to the floor.&#10;&#10;Good Morning Tip: Exhale as you hinge at the hips, sending the hips backwards and upper body forward. Stop once your upper body is nearly parallel with the floor.&#10;&#10;&#128293;Forward Lunge to Reverse Lunge&#10;Tip:Lower your body until your right thigh is parallel to the floor and your right shin is vertical.&#10;&#10;Reverse Lunge Tip:Lunge backward with your right leg as far as you can comfortably while dropping your hips downward&#10;.&#10;&#10;&#129461; Donkey Kick to Fire Hydrant&#10;Tip: Keeping the 90-degree bend in your right knee, slowly lift your leg straight back and up toward the ceiling.&#10;&#10;Fire Hydrant Tip: Do each repetition slowly and with reasonable control.&#10;&#10;&#128293;Glute Bridge to Glute Pulse&#10;Tip: Lie faceup on the floor, with your knees bent and feet flat on the ground. Keep your arms at your side with your palms down.&#10;&#10;Glute Pulse Tip: Hold your bridged position for a couple of seconds before easing back down&#10;&#10;Subscribe to my channel: https://youtube.com/channel/UCspgttLbEbspsoNl5wFTn-A?sub_confirmation=1&#10;Instagram: instagram.com/trainsuz&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/groups/trainsuz&#10;TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@trainsuz&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/trainsuz&#10;...&#10;&#10;&#128231; Enquiries: trainsuz@gmail.com&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;&#10;If you are a complete beginner start with a pace you are comfortable with and then progress. Performing exercises out of your capability might strain your muscles and you may get injured.&#10;&#10;This channel offers health, fitness and nutritional information. You should not rely on this information as a substitute for, nor does it replace, professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. TrainSuz will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video.&#10;&#10;0:00 Introduction&#10;0:08 SIDE LUNGE INTO SQUAT&#10;1:09 WIDE STANCE SQUAT INTO GOOD MORNINGS&#10;2:09 FORWARD LUNGE INTO REVERSE LUNGE&#10;3:09 DONKEY KICK INTO FIRE HYDRANT&#10;4:09 GLUTE BRIDGE INTO GLUTE BRIDGE PULSE"
