  node [
    id 5387
    label "Y-RCYiJDdpE"
    step 1
    date "2022-04-14T12:19:40Z"
    title "20 MINUTE GLUTE WORKOUT - RESISTANCE BAND - BOOTY BURNER, GROW YOUR BOOTY"
    description "Set your glutes on fire with this 20-minute booty pump! If you're a beginner, you can do this workout without the resistance band and then progress onto resistance bands when the time is right!&#10;&#127825;&#127825;&#127825;&#10;This workout is great for glute activation, so it can be used before a lower-body session.&#10;&#128293;&#128293;&#128293;&#10;&#10;Exercises:&#10;&#127825; Glute Bridge&#10;Tip: Lift your hips off the ground until your knees, hips and shoulders form a straight line.&#10;&#10;&#127825; Glute Bridge Abduction&#10;Tip: Drive knees outward, then return to centre, keeping tension on the resistance band the whole time&#10;&#10;&#127825; Glute Bridge Hold&#10;Tip: Hold your bridged position, squeezing your glutes.&#10;&#10;&#127825; Frog Bridge&#10;Tip: Press the soles of your feet together, squeeze the glutes, lift the hips off the mat, and pause for 1 second.&#10;&#10;&#127825; Frog Bridge Hold&#10;Tip: Squeeze your glutes ensuring your feet are firmly on the floor.&#10;&#10;&#127825; Donkey Kick&#10;Tip: Bracing your core, use your glute to kick your working leg directly back as high as it will go without compromising your hip position.&#10;&#10;&#127825; Kneeling Straight Leg Lift&#10;Tip: Bracing your core, straighten one leg and slowly raise until you feel resistance in your glute.&#10;&#10;&#127825; Booty Lift&#10;Tip: When legs are raised squeeze and hold glutes, slowly release and continue for rep range.&#10;&#10;&#127825; Straight Leg Lift&#10;Tip: Ensure tension is always held.&#10;&#10;&#127825; Abduction to Glute Bridge Abduction&#10;Tip: Using resistance band, force knees outwards always keep tension.&#10;&#10;&#10;Subscribe to my channel: https://youtube.com/channel/UCspgttLbEbspsoNl5wFTn-A?sub_confirmation=1&#10;Instagram: instagram.com/trainsuz&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/groups/trainsuz&#10;TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@trainsuz&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/trainsuz&#10;&#10;&#128231; Enquiries: trainsuz@gmail.com&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;&#10;If you are a complete beginner, start with a pace you are comfortable with and then progress. Performing exercises out of your capability might strain your muscles and you may get injured.&#10;&#10;This channel offers health, fitness and nutritional information. You should not rely on this information as a substitute for, nor does it replace professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. TrainSuz will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video.&#10;&#10;0:00 Introduction&#10;2:09 GLUTE BRIDGE HOLD&#10;4:09 FROG BRIDGE HOLD&#10;6:09 DONKEY KICK RIGHT LEG HOLD&#10;8:09 DONKEY KICK LEFT LEG HOLD&#10;9:09 KNEELING STRAIGHT LEG LIFT RIGHT LEG&#10;10:04 KNEELING STRAIGHT LEG LIFT LEFT LEG&#10;11:05 KNEELING STRAIGHT LEG LIFT PULSE RIGHT LEG&#10;12:05 KNEELING STRAIGHT LEG LIFT PULSE LEFT LEG&#10;13:04 BOOTY LIFT&#10;18:04 ABDUCTION TO GLUTE BRIDGE ABDUCTION&#10;19:04 ON HANDS ABDUCTION"
