  node [
    id 5393
    label "lt7NhvxiJcw"
    step 1
    date "2022-06-06T19:19:15Z"
    title "FULL BODY FAT LOSS  || 10 MIN SCULPT || NO EQUIPMENT"
    description "A quick and effective 10-minute full-body blast. Helps target fat loss and scuplts your body!.&#10;&#128293;&#128293;&#128293;&#10;&#10;Exercises:&#10;&#128293;Feet Taps&#10;Tip: Bring one foot forward and tap, switch legs and repeat the process at a fast pace.&#10;&#10;&#128293;High Knees&#10;Tip: Switch to lift your right knee to your chest. Continue the movement, alternating legs and moving at a sprinting or running pace.&#10;&#10;&#128293;Squat to Heel Raise&#10;Tip: Squat down keeping feet shoulder-width apart. As you come to a standing position go onto your tip-toes and reach up, repeat the process.&#10;&#10;&#128293;Squat to Alternating Lunge&#10;Tip: After each squat lunge forward placing one foot forward, come back into a squat position and then repeat the process on the other leg. Keep alternating.&#10;&#10;&#128293;Standing Crunch&#10;Tip: Curl your shoulders toward your waist squeezing your abs.&#10;&#10;&#128293;Mountain Climbers&#10;Tip: Drive one knee forward toward your chest while engaging your abs.&#10;&#10;&#128293;Plank Arm Reach&#10;Tip: Your Hands will be underneath your chest a little inside your shoulders, lifting one hand at a time reaching forward and slowly lowering. Alternating each hand&#10;&#10;&#128293;Shoulder Taps&#10;Tip: Engage your core to stabilize your body as you lift your right hand off the ground and touch your left shoulder. Repeat with your left hand, making sure to keep your hips stable.&#10;&#10;&#128293;Jumping Jacks&#10;Tip: As you jump, spread your legs to be about shoulder-width apart. Stretch your arms out and over your head.&#10;&#10;&#128293;Kneeling Squat to Standing&#10;Tip: Once you have entered the kneeling position, you can then move onto the Squat and repeat the process. Keeping feet shoulder-width apart.&#10;Subscribe to my channel: https://youtube.com/channel/UCspgttLbEbspsoNl5wFTn-A?sub_confirmation=1&#10;Instagram: instagram.com/trainsuz&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/groups/trainsuz&#10;TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@trainsuz&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/trainsuz&#10;Contact (business inquiries):  hello@trainsuz.com&#10;&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;&#10;If you are a complete beginner start with a pace you are comfortable with and then progress. Performing exercises out of your capability might strain your muscles and you may get injured.&#10;&#10;This channel offers health, fitness and nutritional information. You should not rely on this information as a substitute for, nor does it replace professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. TrainSuz will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video.&#10;&#10;0:00 Introduction&#10;0:09 FEET TAPS&#10;1:09 HIGH KNEES&#10;2:10 SQUAT TO HEEL RAISE&#10;3:10 SQUAT TO ALTERNATING LUNGE&#10;4:10 ELBOW TO SHOULDER CRUNCH&#10;5:17 MOUNTAIN CLIMBERS&#10;6:16 PLANK ARM REACH&#10;7:18 SHOULDER TAPS&#10;8:16 JUMPING JACKS&#10;9:16 KNEELING SQUAT TO STANDING"
