    description "Let's work on those abs and make them stronger!&#10;&#10;Like and subscribe for more! I would love to hear your feedback in the comments below. &#10;&#10;Thank you for watching and hope you this will motivate you as well to start having a healthier lifestyle :)&#10;&#10;Say hi on Instagram @justlaura.official&#10;https://www.instagram.com/justlaura.official/&#10;&#10;For (business) inquiries send me an email at:&#10;lauraciortan@icloud.com&#10;&#10;Music in this video:&#10;Track: Neoni - Haunted - House [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/y2ewoCflHhY&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://ncs.io/HauntedHouse&#10;&#10;Track: NIVIRO - The Edge (feat. Harley Bird) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/xr6iSSZs74Q&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://ncs.io/TheEdge&#10;&#10;Track: FROZT, Andrew A - Sleeping Till Noon (feat. Moav) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/oUlYLcL7oj0&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://ncs.io/SleepingTillNoon&#10;&#10;Track: Jay Eskar &#38; Doxed - Let's Run Away (feat. Rico 56) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/Z_QVKFKjpZo&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://ncs.io/LetsRunAway&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;Please keep in mind that I am not a professional and I am doing these to motivate myself to just move and exercise as regularly as possible. You can follow along with me, but you should always consult your physician or other healthcare provider before changing your diet or starting an exercise program. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. Just Laura will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video.&#10;&#10;#abs #justlaura"
