    date "2022-06-14T04:14:11Z"
    title "10 MINUTE CORE WORKOUT - No Equipment Needed, Core Blaster"
    description "Move, sweat and use your lungs in this 10 MINUTE INTENSE AB Workout! Stretch yourself, push hard, burn fat and get your heart racing and the sweat pouring. This is a no-equipment workout that you can do anywhere! &#10;&#10;Turn up, give it all you got. What&#8217;s stopping you! &#10;&#10;WARM-UP&#10;&#10;WORKOUT&#10;&#10;Tuck ups&#10;Sit-up and Punch&#10;Supported Knee In and Outs&#10;Mason Twist&#10;Low Plank Hold&#10;Low Plank Dips&#10;Hell Tap Sit Up&#10;High Plank Hold&#10;Bicycles&#10;Mountain Climbers&#10;&#10;COOLDOWN &#10;&#10;Take breaks if you need them, as we are all at different levels. Make this your workout, and enjoy the journey! &#10;&#10;D I S C L A I M E R&#10;&#10;We all start at different levels. If you are new to working out, take a break if you need it. If you cannot do an exercise, that&#8217;s ok; modify it to your liking. Doing an exercise beyond your level could lead to a strain or an injury. This channel is all about embracing fitness and health. You should not rely on this information as any substitute, nor does it replace any professional medical advice, diagnoses or treatments. By performing any fitness exercises on this channel without supervision, you perform them at your own risk. Seek a fitness professional for advice on your form. Meghan Westcoast will not be responsible or liable for any injuries or harm you sustain due to this video."
