    description "Hi guys! this week's video is legs and booty and I'm so excited to be uploading this routine! I love to combine this with leg day and it helps activate my glutes a little more. It also burns so bad! you can see my struggle all throughout. I did a full leg day right before this too &#128517;&#10;&#10;Tips:&#10;Squats- weight on your heels, sit back as far as you can, tighten your stomach muscles, squeeze your butt going up &#10;Glute bridges- Squeeeeze your booty, have a pelvic tilt so it will be easier on your lower back, don't have your feet too close or too far away&#10;&#10;Hope you guys like this routine and hopefully, you can do a better job than I did LOL :)&#10;&#10;- 20 exercises, no breaks&#10;&#10;- All music is from epidemic sound &#10;&#10;Follow my other socials:&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/ana.bbenitez/?hl=en &#10;Tik tok: https://vm.tiktok.com/ZTd9gysqP/ &#10;&#10;Subscribe and leave a comment. &#9825;&#10;Let me know what other routines you'd like to see!&#10;&#10;#legs #booty #legday #homeworkout #workouts"
