    title "Kendall Jenner's Guide to Sun-Kissed Makeup | Beauty Secrets | Vogue India"
    description "Kendall Jenner shares her step-by-step guide to an everyday sun-kissed make-up look in Vogue India's Beauty Secrets. Of all the Kardashian-Jenner sisters, Kendall is perhaps the one with the most effortless day-to-day beauty regime. Never one to steal the credit, she shouts-out her sister and frequent collaborator Kylie, for inspiration, &#34;When she recommends a new product, I always like to try it and see if I vibe with it&#8221;. The supermodel preps her skin with moisturiser and mists before applying a blend of foundation and concealer. Last but certainly not least, Kendall reaches for the hero product that makes the look: bronzer.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;#KendallJenner #BeautySecrets #VogueIndia&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Credits&#13;&#10;Starring: Kendall Jenner&#13;&#10;Director: Tom Sandford&#13;&#10;DOP: JA Moreno&#13;&#10;Producer: Alba Feliz&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE to Vogue India: https://www.youtube.com/c/vogueindia?sub_confirmation=1&#13;&#10;Get your Vogue India copy: http://bit.ly/1Vd3gGC&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;KEEP UP WITH VOGUE INDIA:&#13;&#10;Website: http://www.vogue.in&#13;&#10;Facebook: http://bit.do/FacebookVogueIndia&#13;&#10;Twitter: http://bit.do/TwitterVogueIndia&#13;&#10;Instagram: http://bit.do/InstagramVogueIndia&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ABOUT VOGUE INDIA:&#13;&#10;Vogue places fashion in the context of culture and the world we live in - how we dress, live and socialise; what we eat, listen to and watch; who leads and inspires us. Vogue India brings you the best of global and Indian fashion, beauty, people, parties and culture.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;CHECK OUT OUR OTHER CHANNELS:&#13;&#10;Architectural Digest India: https://www.youtube.com/ArchitecturalDigestIndia&#13;&#10;CondeNast Traveller India: https://www.youtube.com/IndiaCNTraveller&#13;&#10;GQ India: https://www.youtube.com/IndiaGQ&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/vogueindia"
