    date "2018-08-16T09:13:28Z"
    title "Ab Crunch Challenge (7 MINUTES!)"
    description "&#9825;  DO THE QUIZ TO KNOW WHAT DIET AND TRAINING IS BEST FOR YOU:  &#10;https://bit.ly/2YQUB3x&#10;&#10;________________________________________&#10;&#10;Crunch Challenge | Abs | Flat Stomach &#10;&#10;Hey, guys!&#10;&#10;Welcome back to my Thursday workouts. This week is challenge time and it is all about crunches. There are a lot of variations to crunches and so, I thought, it was a good idea to combine some together into a non-stop 7-minute video. Yes, non-stop! &#10;This is a challenge, of course, so let's work out the whole time. Please do what you can and do not worry if you need to pause. &#10;&#10;The Crunches: &#10;- Frog Crunches-&#10;- Altered Bicycles&#10;- Bicycles&#10;- Modified Crunch with Tap &#10;- Reverse Crunch &#10;- Star Crunch&#10;&#10;Let me know in the comments if you like! &#10;&#10;Love, Holly xx&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM: @hollydolke&#10;MUSIC: Epidemic Sounds"
