  node [
    id 5429
    label "SJqfwlvgoes"
    step 1
    date "2021-06-06T08:21:57Z"
    title "&#128293;Day 1&#128293;STANDING ABS CHALLENGE&#128293;12 MIN STANDING ABS WORKOUT&#128293;12 Min/12 Days STANDING ABS CHALLENGE&#128293;"
    description "IG: burpeegirl_liss Day 1 of the 12 MIN/12 DAYS STANDING ABS CHALLENGE is here! Every video in this standing ab challenge is completely ABS and CORE  focused but will also make for a good quick CARDIO WORKOUT.  Let`s spend some time on our abs and work on tightening our core! This standing abs challenge will tighten up your entire core, abs, lower abs, as well as your obliques. This is a medium intensity, entirely low impact, absolutely no jumping standing abs workout, no mat needed.&#10;&#10;In my opinion, Standing Abs will not be as effective as regular on the floor ab exercises, but can still be an amazing alternative, if you really contract your core while performing the exercises. I tried to do just that: tighten everything while performing the exercises, and boy, did I feel them. It's up to you to make the exercises work their best for you. Control every movement and really focus on squeezing the abs and core. You`ll find a lot of leg raises in this workout. Make sure you pull from your abs, every single time, otherwise you`ll mostly feel the moves in your hip flexors! &#10;&#10;This workout can work great as an add-on to your regular daily routine. It's not really meant as a stand alone workout (except when you have a lazy day).&#10;&#10;If you choose to start this challenge at a different time, you'll find all the 12 days in this playlist:&#10;Standing Abs Challenge 12 Min/12 Days&#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLoeVbeU5Lfqr77gtcGxjuiD816o-mWDvq&#10;&#10;I post daily easy at home workouts (low and moderate intensity) for Weight Loss! Get your steps in with these indoor low and moderate intensity steady state cardio workouts anyone can do! &#10;&#10;Here are a few playlists you might find useful if you are looking for more steady state cardio workouts:&#10;&#10;More Standing Abs Workouts:&#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLoeVbeU5Lfqq70NLVdj-UW43zgs5DxApJ&#10;&#10;Warm Ups &#38; Cool Downs&#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLoeVbeU5LfqpNHUPtTU2nlE3Txsa6z9rU&#10;&#10;More Steady State Cardio Workouts:&#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLoeVbeU5LfqrUcaZAcuUA0aKgzbohfTTn &#10;&#10;More MISS Cardio Workouts:&#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLoeVbeU5Lfqp5Cg3Ly0mfZQddP8zQRvDx&#10;&#10;More LISS Cardio Workouts&#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLoeVbeU5LfqprNFuFwxIKUhE9O7DDgcFH&#10;&#10;More Fast Walking for Weight Loss Workouts:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLoeVbeU5LfqpQ4ty_nB28lNzIPfstc20k&#10;&#10;BurpeeGirl KISS WORKOUTS (KEEP IT SIMPLE &#38; SWEATY):&#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLoeVbeU5LfqpV6XSjcjNWe741S5FK-_tu&#10;&#10;D I S C L A I M E R&#10;I am not a certified trainer. This is my personal workout and may not be suited for others. If you'd like to give this workout a try, make sure to check with your physician first.&#10;&#10;&#128293;Day 1&#128293;STANDING ABS CHALLENGE&#128293;12 MIN STANDING ABS WORKOUT&#128293;12 Min/12 Days STANDING ABS CHALLENGE&#128293;&#10;&#10;#standingabschallenge  #tighterwaistline #abchallenge&#10;&#10;standing abs challenge, standing abs workout no jumping, standing abs workout for women,waistline challenge,waistline workout,core,abdominales de pie,six pack workout,easy ab workouts at home,easy abs workout for beginners,easy ab workout,tighten your core,tighten your core exercises,BurpeeGirl,burpeegirl,burpee girl kiss,burpee girl,standing obliques workout,standing abs,standing abs challenge,standing abs challenge results,12 days standing abs challenge,abs"
    channel_title "BurpeeGirl"
    channel_id "UCBjkIxM3xOuq9H9eFgZASBw"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
