    step 1
    date "2022-02-15T02:54:10Z"
    title "GROWWITHJO WALKING WORKOUT RESULTS | AT HOME WORKOUT ROUTINE | MY WEIGHT LOSS JOURNEY"
    description "#growwithjoresults #growwithjowalkingworkoutresults #athomeworkouttoloseweight &#10;&#10;Hey Mob!&#10;&#10;So in today's video, I will be discussing how I lost weight without having to go to the gym or use extreme dieting. I was able to lose weight just by doing at home workouts and monitoring what I ate a lot more. Listening to your body is key! Below I will list the supplements and at home workout youtube channels that I use and follow on a daily basis. I hope this video helps a lot of you to start your workout journey. It's never too late! &#10;&#10;At Home Workout Channels&#10;&#10;Mr London:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/MrLondonTV&#10;&#10;Growwithjo:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/growwithjo&#10;&#10;And8 Fitness:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/and8Fitness&#10;&#10;Supplements/ At Home Workout Dumbbells &#10;&#10;AminoLean Pre Workout-&#10;https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NCRGT4I?ref=ppx_pop_mob_ap_share&#10;&#10;Sports Research- Sweet Sweat Workout Enhancer - 6.4 oz Sports Stick-https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003QWG0IA/ref=cm_sw_r_cp_api_glt_i_RFBG8ATCZ7Q4X05ESAB8?_encoding=UTF8&#38;psc=1&#10;&#10;Sweet Sweat Waist Trimmer - &#10;https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M8GFOST?ref=ppx_pop_mob_ap_share&#10;&#10;Portzon Set of 2 Neoprene Dumbbell Hand Weights, Anti-slip, Anti-roll , 2-Pound , Blue-https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0894M8L2F/ref=cm_sw_r_cp_apip_qB27ijTwD6Oge&#10;&#10;I also have 10 lbs dumbbells as well...&#10;&#10;STAY CONNECTED SIS!&#10;Instagram: Sejayda_&#10;Twitter: Iamjaydafierce&#10;Snapchat: iamjaydafierce&#10;&#10;***CONTACT ME***&#10;Business Inquiries Only!&#10;SejaydaF@gmail.com&#10;&#10;SEJAYDA FENNELL&#10;PO BOX 666&#10;GOSHEN, NY 10924&#10;&#10;Common Questions:&#10;&#10;Age: 28&#10;Where I'm from: New York ( Hudson Valley area )&#10;Ethnicity: Jamaican&#10;Race: Black&#10;Nationality: American&#10;&#10;What do I use to edit my Youtube videos? Filmora X&#10;&#10;Camera ? Sony A5000&#10;&#10;Lighting? Neewer Ring Light 18&#34; / 48 cm Kit &#