    date "2019-07-05T19:30:42Z"
    title "MY 10 MINUTE AB WORKOUT"
    description "Hey guys everyone has been asking for an updated workout routine so I wanted to get one out there! As for my whole body, my workout routine isn&#8217;t really set, but I plan on putting out a full body workout soon! For my abs however, I do this workout pretty much everyday. I made it somewhat challenging for MYSELF and it&#8217;s only ten minutes so not having time is never an excuse I can use... This is what I&#8217;ve been doing for the past 2 months to tone up my stomach for the summer. Once in a while I will change some of the workouts to make it harder, but this is basically it! I personally hate the gym and my favorite thing about this routine is that I can do it at home. I also wanted to make this video where you can do the workouts with me if you choose! If you find this too easy or too hard you can adjust it to your liking. Hope you enjoy, XOXO &#10;&#10;Subscribe and become part of the ROSEGANG&#127801;&#10;&#10;SOCIAL MEDIA:&#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/xkatherinerose&#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/crazyy_katiee?lan...&#10;Snapchat - Katiecandy101&#10;&#10;OTHERS...&#10;Poshmark - https://bnc.lt/focc/4ASi5Qg71R&#10;Cameo - https://www.cameo.com/xkatherinerose&#10;&#10;For business inquires:&#10;galera@studio71us.com"
