    description "For my best 6 pack abs workouts and instructions on how to get abs designed for your body type, take my free body type quiz - http://vshred.fit/Better6PackAbs&#10;&#10;For this workout all you'll need is a dumbbell so it can be done almost anywhere! Grab a dumbbell and try this out as shown below:&#10;&#10;-Dumbbell Straight Arm Crunches - 4 Sets of 10-15 Reps&#10;-Dumbbell Reverse Crunches - 4 Sets of 10-15 Reps&#10;-Rotating Mountain Climbers - 4 Sets of 10-15 Reps&#10;-Dumbbell Woodchops - 4 Sets of 10-15 Reps each way&#10;&#10;Give this a try and let me know what you guys think down in the comments below! If you like these videos, make sure you are smashing that LIKE button so I know to make more just like this!&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Check out My Supplement Stacks! &#10;&#10;For Fat Loss :  http://vshred.fit/58FatLossStackYT&#10;For Muscle Building : http://vshred.fit/58MuscleStackYT&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Intro Song: Always Have by Castor Troy"
