    title "I Woke Up at 5AM For 30 Days, this is what happened"
    description "I Woke Up At 5AM For 30 Days, this is what happened&#10;Give Tiege Hanley a try &#38; get a FREE gift with your first box at http://tiege.com/browny5am &#10;&#10;Today's challenge:&#10;Waking up early, Mark Wahlberg wakes up at 2:30am, michelle obama is at the gym at 4:30am,  Tim apple wakes up 3:45, Dwayne the rock johnson wakes up at 3:30am and Elon musk doesn't sleep&#10;&#10;But I never really believed in this, it always sounds like just changing the time when you sleep.&#10;Why do this? Do the pros outweigh the cons?&#10;&#10;There are lots of claims, (better sleep, peak state, love life more, more confidence), those I'm very skeptical about, but these are the most interesting:&#10;1. productivity&#10;2. no food, get shredded&#10;3. it will build a routine&#10;4. Social life, friends, family, and relationship, I have a girlfriend&#8230;&#10;&#10;We&#8217;re going to track these things for the next 30 days, let's go.&#10;&#10;Follow moi:&#10;Instagram: @StanBrowney&#10;https://instagram.com/stanbrowney &#10;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#10;Stuff in the video:&#10;&#9679; Gymshark: http://gym.sh/Shop-Browney&#10;&#9679; MyProtein: http://tidd.ly/a5f49f61 (Code: Browney)&#10;&#9679; The 90 Day Challenge Course - Transform yourself in 90 days: https://90dayworkoutchallenge.com/&#10;&#9679; My Podcast: http://www.youtube.com/channel/UCR0T8UH-8_htroK2v5gRMlQ?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#9679; Forged London: https://forgedlondon.com/ &#10;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#10;More videos:&#10;3 Guys Do 200 Push ups a Day For 30 days, These Are The Results&#10;https://youtu.be/y_9qeB-6M-I&#10;I Took Cold Showers For 10 Days, this is what happened&#10;- https://youtu.be/YaM3xSnQlQ8&#10;UNLOCKING SUPERHUMAN STRENGTH WITH THE ICE MAN (Wim Hof)&#10;- https://youtu.be/Z-p99zH3axY&#10;We Did a Push up For Every Like