    title "20 Minute Heart-Pumping Cardio Workout - No Equipment With Warm-Up &#38; Cool-Down | SELF"
    description "Rhys and Amy take us through a 20 minute cardio workout that's sure to get your heart-pumping. This 3-circuit workout consists of squat thrusts, reverse lunges with knee dives, jumping jacks, leg raises to toe touches, up-down planks, and forearm plank holds.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Wardrobe:&#13;&#10;On Amy: Lululemon bra; Manduka leggings; Nike shoes.&#13;&#10;On Rhys: Beautiful F&#252;l top; Nike shorts and leggings; Bombas socks; Puma shoes.&#13;&#10;#stayhome #withme&#10;&#10;&#13;&#10;Still haven&#8217;t subscribed to Self on YouTube? &#9658;&#9658;  http://bit.ly/selfyoutubesub&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ABOUT SELF&#13;&#10;Daily health, fitness, beauty, style advice, and videos for people who want to achieve their personal best in life. &#10;&#10;20 Minute Heart-Pumping Cardio Workout - No Equipment With Warm-Up &#38; Cool-Down | SELF"
