    title "Weighted Ab Workout #2 | Full Core Toning Session"
    description "Hello guys! Finally, another weighted ab workout is out! I have admit this one was quite challenging for me. It was so hot and stuffy, but it makes a workout 10x better and more effective. Also, please disregard my discomfort while I was doing the &#8220;V-Sit Leg In Outs&#8221;&#8212;my injured wrist has been flaring up again and it has been very painful to work out. I have to push back a few videos due to my current inability to put any pressure on it, but nevertheless, the workout videos will continue! Thank you guys in advance for your patience~ &#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE!!!&#10;See you soon loves &#9829;&#65038;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; S O C I A L M E D I A&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/elizvchu/&#10;(where I keep you posted about new vids, updates, and more)&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; L I N K S &#10;What I Eat In A Day: https://youtu.be/6ISYDcpq14c&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; F A Q&#10;Height? 5&#8217;7&#10;Age? 21&#10;Ethnicity? Chinese&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; M U S I C&#10;ActLikeKnow-long by DJ Grumble&#10;DJ Grumble Soundcloud: https://soundcloud.com/gbeats&#10;&#10;Nomra - Your Body [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/JR7iaMPnevU&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/YourBody&#10;&#10;Teyeq - Demons [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/RQ5IkSeMQbc&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/TDemons&#10;&#10;Diamond Eyes - Flutter [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/lEHM9HZf0IA&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/FlutterYO &#10;&#10;Culture Code - Fairytale (feat. Amanda Collis)  [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/qVAFNx1WRWE&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/Fairytale&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;For serious inquiries ONLY: theelizabethchu@gmail.com"
