    label "YfuOLczNJ-g"
    step 1
    date "2021-01-20T00:41:08Z"
    title "Weighted Lower Abs Workout &#34;BURN LOWER BELLY FAT&#34; | Ab Transformation Series"
    description "&#10023;BURN LOWER BELLY FAT WITH ME&#10023;&#10;&#10;Hello everyone! Today, we have a WEIGHTED LOWER ABS WORKOUT. I am SOOOO excited to share this one with you all, it is definitely a current favorite of mine. I promise you, you will feel the BURN (in the best way possible). I am using a 5lbs dumbbell (~2.27kg), but you can use anything that is weighted! And remember, if the workout ever gets too intense for you, just put the weights down and continue without them. I want you all to try your best, without staining and hurting yourself. I love you guys very much. Thank you so much for watching and&#8230;&#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE!!!&#10;See you soon loves &#9829;&#65038;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; S O C I A L M E D I A&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/elizvchu/&#10;TikTok: https://vm.tiktok.com/ZMJu9PXGh/&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; V I D E O S&#10;What I Eat In A Day | 22nd Birthday Edition: https://youtu.be/xMkZu28TepU&#10;Weighted Upper Abs: https://youtu.be/JTkhe-LOfD8&#10;Weighted Obliques | Waist Chiseler: https://youtu.be/I1aMEKYUidM&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; L I N K S &#10;https://acta.grsm.io/ELIZVCHU&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/elizvchu&#10;https://linktr.ee/elizvchu&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; f t. E X E R C I S E S&#10;1. Leg in, Up, Down&#10;2. Leg lifts &#10;3. Leg in out &#10;4. Ab hold circles &#10;5. Leg out, up, down&#10;6. Floor Taps &#10;7. V-sit bridges  &#10;8. V-sit flutter kicks  &#10;9. v-sit leg in out &#10;10. V-Sit M lifts &#10;11. Jack knives &#10;12. Roll ups &#10;13. Ab hold squiggles &#10;14. Fast bicycles &#10;15. Floor taps &#10;16. Reverse Roll ups &#10;17. Bicycles &#10;18. Dead bug taps&#10;19. Plank one leg lift &#10;20. Other side &#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; M U S I C&#10;Blue Window by Jeff Kaale&#10;https://youtu.be/xFXujpHWsc4&#10;&#10;Uplink - Still Need You (feat. AWR) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/gy9IbepHACk&#10;Free Download/Stream: http://ncs.io/stillneedyou&#10;&#10;Steve Hartz - Never Get Old [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/sjQqv354mtI&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/NeverGetOld&#10;&#10;Kozah - Heavens [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/OqsMdYqxcUw&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/HeavensYO&#10;&#10;Coopex - Over The Sun [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/Iz9OjD_BGdM&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/OverTheSun&#10;&#10;&#10;For serious inquiries ONLY: theelizabethchu@gmail.com&#10;&#10;&#10;Links included in this description might be affiliate links.&#10;&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;Before joining me in my workout videos, please take precautions for your health and safety. To avoid injuries and discomfort, I recommend consulting with your physician before moving forward with the workouts. If you do decide to join me in my workout videos, you are voluntarily participating in these activities and agreeing to do so at your own risk. In addition, you agree to release Elizabeth Chu from any claims and actions. I, Elizabeth Chu, am not responsible and liable for any harm you may sustain from engaging in my workout videos."
