    title "Get 11 Abs Workout | tighten and strengthen ENTIRE core"
    description "Do this every day to tone and tighten up those 11 abs! I struggled towards the end and my abs were in FIRE. But it felt so good and I had such a good time :D How was it for you guys? Did you enjoy it as much as I did? Remember it&#8217;s okay if you can&#8217;t do the entire workout or if you need to take small breaks. Just go at your pace. &#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE!!!&#10;See you soon loves &#9829;&#65038;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; S O C I A L M E D I A&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/elizvchu/&#10;(where I keep you posted about new vids, updates, and more)&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; L I N K S &#10;What I Eat In A Day: https://youtu.be/6ISYDcpq14c&#10;Ab Workout with Dumbbells: https://youtu.be/nGZPfhDaCz8&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; M U S I C&#10;Clouds - Joakim Karud&#10;&#10;Nanz(Give Me Love) - HAR5H X HASCH&#10;HAR5H:&#10;https://open.spotify.com/artist/0XTpx...&#10;https://www.youtube.com/har5hmusic&#10;https://www.instagram.com/har5hmusic&#10;https://www.facebook.com/har5hmusic&#10;https://soundcloud.com/har5hmusic&#10;https://twitter.com/har5hmusic&#10;HASCH:&#10;https://open.spotify.com/artist/56zwe...&#10;https://www.instagram.com/hasch_music&#10;https://soundcloud.com/hasch_music&#10;&#10;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/...&#10;Music provided by RFM: https://youtu.be/iV4SlzgKBhU&#10;&#10;Nightlife - Duplex Bassline &#38; Rina&#10;Duplex Bassline:&#10;https://soundcloud.com/duplexbassline&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGfU...&#10;https://www.instagram.com/duplexbassl...&#10;https://open.spotify.com/artist/2Wx86...&#10;Rina:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/rina_musicc/&#10;&#10;Music from Soundcloud&#10;Music provided by RFM: https://youtu.be/7W1bc-8JcPc&#10;&#10;We Are - Jo Cohen &#38; Sex Whales&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C6IaUMAg3Dc&#10;Free Download/Stream:  http://ncs.io/jcswweare&#10;&#10;About You - Absence&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/bXHfrdi_fsU&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/AboutYou&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;For business inquiries only: theelizabethchu@gmail.com"
