    step 1
    date "2020-11-07T21:09:06Z"
    title "BURN BACK FAT, WAIST CHISELER | Weighted Back &#38; Obliques Workout"
    description "BURN BACK AND SIDE FAT~&#10;Hello everyone, I am so excited to share today&#8217;s video with you guys. It has got to be one of my favorite workouts. It seems very easy and doable, but let me tell you, IT&#8217;S VERY EFFECTIVE ( and there is a good chance you will feel sore the next day :D ). Remember, we can&#8217;t spot-reduce fat, but we do exercises that will help tone the general area, and this workout is perfect for that. We will be targeting the back and obliques, both go hand in hand with each other throughout this workout session. And if you don't have dumbbells, don't worry! You can substitute it with a book, a water bottle, a can, a bag, a chair, a TV, a microwave, literally ANYTHING works! So pick it up and workout with me! &#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE!!!&#10;See you soon loves &#9829;&#65038;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; S O C I A L M E D I A&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/elizvchu/&#10;TikTok: https://vm.tiktok.com/ZMJu9PXGh/&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; L I N K S &#10;My Quarantine Transformation: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0VQlHesvSe0&#38;t=2s&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; f t. E X E R C I S E S&#10;1. Standing slow twist &#10;2. Standing fast twist &#10;3. Cross woodchopper &#10;4. Other side &#10;5. Standing compass side to side &#10;6. Standing double pulse twist &#10;7. Standing side deadlifts &#10;8. Other side &#10;9. Straight leg Russian twist &#10;10. Fast Russian twist &#10;11. Hip dip pulses &#10;12. Opposite toe reaches &#10;13. Other side &#10;14. Standing twist right pulses &#10;15. Other side &#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; M U S I C&#10;DigDug3 1 by DJ Grumble&#10;DJ Grumble Soundcloud: https://soundcloud.com/gbeats&#10;&#10;Syn Cole - Feel Good [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q1ULJ92aldE&#38;ab_channel=NoCopyrightSounds&#10;Free Download/Stream: http://ncs.io/feelgood&#10;&#10;Steve Hartz - Never Get Old [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/sjQqv354mtI&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/NeverGetOld&#10;&#10;Heather Sommer &#38; Uplink - Chance On Faith [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/lpsL8Yv6W_E&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/ChanceOnFaith&#10;&#10;Diviners - Stockholm Lights [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/_Bs2dUtjDSI&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/StockholmLights&#10;&#10;&#10;For serious inquiries ONLY: theelizabethchu@gmail.com"
