    title "10MIN Weighted Obliques &#34;Waist Chiseler&#34; | Ab Transformation Series"
    description "&#10023;TONE OBLIQUES WORKOUT&#10023;&#10;&#10;Hello everyone! Today, we have ANOTHER weighted ab workout and more is coming your way! How did you guys like this workout? It was intense but definitely doable. I want you all to ALWAYS focus on engaging that core (tighten your core as if someone is punching your stomach). Ab workouts are highly effective if you engage your core. And to make the workout easier and smoother, breathe with control. Seriously, don&#8217;t forget to breathe! Try it out and you&#8217;ll see a difference in how you feel as you do the exercises.&#10;&#10;Anyway, I just want to say thank you for your undying support. You truly mean so so so much to me. You guys make me the happiest girl alive. I love you all! Thank you so much for watching and&#8230;&#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE!!!&#10;See you soon loves &#9829;&#65038;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; S O C I A L M E D I A&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/elizvchu/&#10;TikTok: https://vm.tiktok.com/ZMJu9PXGh/&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; V I D E O S&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; L I N K S &#10;https://acta.grsm.io/ELIZVCHU&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/elizvchu&#10;https://linktr.ee/elizvchu&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; f t. E X E R C I S E S&#10;1. Russian twist &#10;2. Bicycle twist &#10;3. Lean back twist &#10;4. Cross up-crunches &#10;5. Other side &#10;6. Cross crunch twist &#10;7. V-Sit twist &#10;8. Side jack knives &#10;9. Other side &#10;10. Straight leg bridges&#10;11. Plank dips &#10;12. Other side &#10;13. Plank toe crunches &#10;14. Other side &#10;15. High plank dips&#10;16. Other side &#10;17. Side plank hold &#10;18. Russian twist bicycles  &#10;19. Crunch hold flutter kicks &#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; M U S I C&#10;Tropic by Jeff Kaale &#10;https://youtu.be/s8vIDdRx7m4&#10;&#10;Alex Skrindo &#38; Miza - Thinkin' [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/CkC5igeV_tM&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/ThinkinYO&#10;&#10;Unknown Brain - Last 