    title "10MIN LOWER ABS BURN | Intense 11-Abs Workout"
    description "&#9645; featuring a NEW exercise &#9645;&#10;&#10;Hello everyone, we have a new ab workout! This workout will challenge your core, and target your lower abs. Remember to make that mind to muscle connection and focus on using only your lower abs to perform the exercises. And always feel free to modify any exercises and go at your own pace. This means to pause the video and take a break if needed. The premise of working out is to do what makes YOU feel good. I hope you enjoyed the workout babes; thank you so much for watching! &#10;L I K E  &#38;  S U B S C R I B E&#10;See you soon loves &#9825;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9645; S O C I A L M E D I A &#9645;&#10;Vlog Channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkFxzSsjMG8geiYsSZDNjBw&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/elizvchu/&#10;TikTok: https://vm.tiktok.com/ZMJu9PXGh/&#10;Pinterest: https://pin.it/4sWmZrI&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9645; L I N K S &#9645;&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/elizvchu&#10;https://linktr.ee/elizvchu&#10;https://acta.grsm.io/ELIZVCHU&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9645; T E C H  G E A R &#9645;&#10;Main Camera | Camera EOS M50: https://amzn.to/2S1Ob1q&#10;Lens | Canon EF-M 11-22mm: https://amzn.to/3wymfkH&#10;Microphone: https://amzn.to/3gt0CNh&#10;Vlog Camera | Camera G7x: https://amzn.to/3gAklJy&#10;Vlog Tripod: https://amzn.to/3wv77oh&#10;SD Card: https://amzn.to/3zy9LLJ&#10;External Hard Drive: https://amzn.to/3gsZ6un&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9645; f t. E X E R C I S E S &#9645;&#10;1. flutter kick + leg crunch ins&#10;2. airwalks&#10;3. toe taps &#10;4. flutter kicks  &#10;5. clockwise leg raises&#10;6. counterclockwise leg raises&#10;7. bike crunches&#10;8. single leg raise &#10;9. straight leg toe reach crunch  &#10;10. single-leg raise &#10;11. straight leg toe reach crunch &#10;12. bent knee toe taps &#10;13. roll up&#10;14. leg raises &#10;15. ball ups  &#10;16. side plank inner leg crunch &#10;17. plank hold&#10;18. side plank inner leg crunch &#10;19. plank crunch ins &#10;20. tummy vacuums&#10;&#10;&#