    title "Sayian Killer | Push Pull Workout for Mass  | 10 Minute Workout"
    description "Sayian Killer | Push Pull Workout for Mass  | 10 Minute Workout&#10;&#10;Push up and Pull up Workout for Mass&#10;Max pull ups ( AMRAP ) for 1 minute&#10;Max Push ups ( AMRAP ) for 1 minute&#10;Max one arm pull ups ( AMRAP ) for 1 minute&#10;Max one arm Push ups ( AMRAP ) for 1 minute&#10;Repeat to you reach 10 mins&#10;&#10;Likisthenics YouTube &#10;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#10;https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=odMB45vPybo&#38;feature=youtu.be&#10;&#10; Likisthenics on Instagram &#10;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#10;https://instagram.com/likisthenics?utm_medium=copy_link&#10;&#10;Join Our Facebook Group &#10;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#10;https://www.facebook.com/groups/2142176969249126/?ref=share&#10;&#10;=============================================&#10;&#10;LET'S CONNECT&#8252;&#65039;&#160;&#10;INSTAGRAM: https://instagram.com/goku_pump?igshid=lh57574ilauh&#10;&#10;FACEBOOK: http://www.facebook.com/therealbambaam/&#10;TikTok: https://vm.tiktok.com/bsCAsS/&#10;&#10;=============================================&#10;My name is Bam BAAM, I am the CEO of SenzuGang&#8482;&#65039;. I believe in a holistic approach to health that includes calisthenics, a Plant based diet, and free mind. I was raised in both Nigeria and Brooklyn and learn you don't need a gym membership to be fit. You don't need short cuts to reach your fitness goals the world is your gym. Hard work, motivation, and dedication is all you need. I've been training for 5 years without taking any supplements &#38; steroids. I've have proved bodyweight training alone can help build a great physic. Representing the calisthenics community 100%.&#10;=============================================&#10;&#10;What is calisthenics?&#10;&#10;The gymnastic exercises to achieve bodily fitness and grace of movement."
