    title "BIGGER TRICEPS in 20 MINUTES (GUARANTEED!)"
    description "Time to blow up your triceps and get horseshoe triceps in 20 minutes with the Balloon Method. This unique bodybuilding strategy will help you get bigger triceps fast by maximizing the only 3 science backed ways you can build muscle in a short and intense workout! If you are looking for the best tricep workout for mass you've found it. If you want bigger arms do this tricep workout up to 3x per week but ideally 2x per week should help most of you grow. Share this video with someone trying to get superhuman arms! &#10;&#10;TIME-STAMPERS FOR TODAY'S VIDEO:&#10;00:00 - time to grow those triceps&#10;00:40 - how big my arms were before the tricep workout&#10;01:03 - exercise 1 - superset tricep move&#10;02:00 - exercise 2 - great tricep mass builder (do this every workout)&#10;02:34 - exercise 3 - db overhead triceps to work the long head&#10;03:35 - exercise 4 - shout out  @Mike O'Hearn  for this epic move!&#10;04:29 - exercise 5 - rope cable tricep superset&#10;05:40 - exercise 6 - tricep finisher to burn them out&#10;06:30 - time to see how much my arms grew&#10;07:50 - big announcement (pin a comment on video that the Superhuman Games are taking place today and follow your YT Story)&#10;&#10;&#9658;&#119827;&#119851;&#119858; &#119808;&#119845;&#119849;&#119841;&#119834; &#119819;&#119842;&#119848;&#119847; &#119852;&#119854;&#119849;&#119849;&#119845;&#119838;&#119846;&#119838;&#119847;&#119853;&#119852; &#119827;&#119848; &#119810;&#119848;&#119847;&#119850;&#119854;&#119838;&#119851; &#119858;&#119848;&#119854;&#119851; &#119839;&#119842;&#119853;&#119847;&#119838;&#119852;&#119852; &#119840;&#119848;&#119834;&#119845;&#119852; &#10;https://www.AlphaLion.com (Code:Troy)&#10;Supplements mentioned in the video: Superhuman Pre-workout, Gains Candy, SuperHuman Protein&#10;&#10;&#9658;&#120276;&#120303;&#120316;&#120322;&#120321; &#120295;&#120319;&#120316;&#120326; &#120276;&#120305;&#120302;&#120320;&#120309;&#120322;&#120315;:&#10;Troy Adashun is the Co-Founder of sports nutrition company Alpha Lion&#10;&#10;&#9658;&#119813;&#119848;&#119845;&#119845;&#119848;&#119856; &#120295;&#120319;&#120316;&#120326; &#120276;&#120305;&#120302;&#120320;&#120309;&#120322;&#120315;:&#10;Instagram @Troy.Adashun&#10;TikTok @TroyAdashun&#10;&#10;&#9658;&#120278;&#120316;&#120315;&#120321;&#120302;&#120304;&#120321; &#120314;&#120306; &#120307;&#120316;&#120319; &#120303;&#120322;&#120320;&#120310;&#120315;&#120306;&#120320;&#120320;:&#10;Troy@AlphaLion.com&#10;&#10;#bodybuilding #balloonmethod #superhuman"
