    description "Want to train like the old school greats? Golden Era Bookworm shares time proven wisdom on real natural bodybuilding.&#10;His Channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/GoldenEraBookworm&#10;IG: https://www.instagram.com/goldenerabookworm/&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/GoldenEraBookworm/&#10;Site: https://www.goldenerabookworm.com/&#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/alexleonidasofficial/&#10;----------------------------------------&#10;My Gym Equipment: https://www.bellsofsteel.com/#a_aid=Leonidas&#10;----------------------------------------&#10;Neck Flex: https://tinyurl.com/yy22fk7a&#10;----------------------------------------&#10;5% off Naturally Enhanced Using Code &#34;ADF&#34;&#10;http://outalpha.com/ne&#10;----------------------------------------&#10;My Free Novice Program! http://outalpha.com/the-out-alpha-novice-program/&#10;----------------------------------------&#10;Nutrition Guide: http://outalpha.com/tad&#10;----------------------------------------&#10;Want to consult me for email exchanges, consultations, online coaching, or for custom programs? http://outalpha.com/contact/&#10;&#10;0:00 Introduction&#10;0:15 Who is Golden Era Bookworm?&#10;3:07 The many injuries&#10;6:15 Old school training fixed him&#10;7:38 Injured again&#10;9:01 The light dumbbell system&#10;9:37 Going back in time&#10;10:04 Ancient Greek lifting&#10;11:31 Farnes Hercules &#38; statue muscle&#10;12:46 The Online Roider Community &#38; negative view of natural BB&#10;16:03 What about honest users?&#10;22:12 Natty muscle remains&#10;24:39 How to raise the natural standards once more?&#10;28:27 Choose your side &#38; it shows&#10;30:27 Getting stronger to get bigger&#10;34:25 It's BODY building&#10;34:52 Chest Expander talk&#10;38:53 Overloading the tendons &#38; process takes time&#10;39:55 Expander spring standards&#10;43:02 How far can you build with expanders?&#10;44:13 Why effective old school methods died off?&#10;49:14 Can we do BETTER than old school greats?&#10;51:49 The old school shredded secret&#10;57:31 The body is one unit&#10;58:46 Full body works!&#10;1:02:01 Everything works &#38; science talk&#10;1:03:55 Obsession with TRT &#38; older lifters&#10;1:08:31 Probably don't need TRT especially young lifters&#10;1:09:59 Does Carlos see himself using TRT?&#10;1:12:52 Training talk&#10;1:12:59 Chest training&#10;1:14:36 Building the neck/back&#10;1:17:46 Old school lifters looked/were strong&#10;1:18:26 Strong shoulders = strong everything!&#10;1:21:08 Wide grip chins truth&#10;1:23:05 Legs &#38; squats!&#10;1:24:46 All about preacher curls&#10;1:28:50 What about spider curls?&#10;1:30:36 Reducing injuries from preachers&#10;1:32:57 Long head of triceps &#38; moving elbows&#10;1:36:10 The methods of ribcage expansion&#10;1:41:29 Pullovers AFTER breathing squats?&#10;1:43:54 Would cardio help?&#10;1:45:16 What causes the vacuum effect?&#10;1:46:53 Does ab training affect the vacuum?&#10;1:48:01 Top 5 favorite old school bodybuilders&#10;1:52:35 The mission &#38; ultimate message of Carlos&#10;1:57:27 Where to find him (see links)&#10;1:58:22 Wrapping up&#10;&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: AlphaDestiny is not a doctor or a medical professional.  Always consult a physician before starting any exercise program. Use of this information is strictly at your own risk. AlphaDestiny will not assume any liability for direct or indirect losses or damages that may result from the use of information contained in this video including but not limited to economic loss, injury, illness or death.&#10;&#10;#oldschoolbodybuilding #naturalbodybuilding #musclegain"
