  node [
    id 5764
    label "7537-yAhASA"
    step 1
    date "2021-10-12T21:17:03Z"
    title "10 MIN MEDIUM HIIT / Medium Level - a HIIT workout that won't kill you I Pamela Reif"
    description "This workout makes you sweat, burns calories&#8230; but it won't kill YOU! &#9829;&#65038; / Anzeige&#10;&#10;&#9656; suitable for Medium Level&#10;&#9656; suitable for Advanced people, who don&#8217;t want to push themselves to their absolute limit. I love this as a warm up or in between hardcore videos!  &#10;&#9656; suitable for very motivated Beginners &#10;&#10;For this routine, I used classic exercises and made them a bit &#8222;easier&#8220;. &#10;= Squats + Tippie Toes instead of Jump Squats&#10;= Plank Jump + Walking Jack instead of Plank Jump + Jumping Jack, etc. :) &#10;&#10;Therefore, I douuuubt you will feel like calling me bad names during those 10min :D Plus, the view &#38; the music are great! &#10;We don&#8217;t have any Jump Squats or Burpees either :) &#10;&#10;PS: I filmed this video fully on my own! &#10;Camera, tripod, iPhone, timers, exercises, smiling, sunset, hair - that was multitasking at its finest :D &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#9656; calories burned are between 70-110kcal, depending on your weight, height &#38; fitness level!  I'm a short and tiny person &#38; I burned 70kcal :) &#10;&#10;The video is in full length which means you can just follow whatever I&#8217;m doing 30s for each exercise. If you need a break - TAKE IT! Don't worry too much about that. You will improve over time :) that's the best feeling! &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#10142; my Pam App &#9829;&#65038; Free workout plans (8 versions), lot of recipes &#38; tips: &#10;Https://www.pam-app.de/app&#10;&#10;&#9656; 3 of those FREE WORKOUT PLANS are on my Instagram Channel. &#10;30min, 45min and Beginner Friendly. Check out the Highlight Bubble &#34;Workout Plans&#34; for that.  &#10;&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10142; Food Account http://www.instagram.com/pamgoesnuts/&#10;&#10;&#9656; Use the hashtag #PamelaReif if you want to share your transformation or training on Instagram :) I always check the posts! &#10;&#10;__&#10; &#10;&#9656; You can always find ALL SONGS in my workout playlist. I update it weekly &#38; it's available on Spotify, Apple Music, etc. &#9829;&#65038;&#10;http://wmg.click/GetActive&#10;&#10;1. James Blunt &#8211; Love Under Pressure (VIZE Remix) &#10;2. Ellipso, Astelle, Couch&#233; &#8211; YNTBOM (feat. KITTY VALIUM)&#10;3. Why Don&#8217;t we &#8211; Love Back&#10;4. Afrojack, Lucas &#38; Steve, DubVision &#8211; Anywhere with you &#10;&#10;__&#10;unterst&#252;tzt durch Warner Music Germany&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;When joining me for this workout video, you need to take some precautions as your health and safety is the most important. To avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health with your doctor before exercising. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. Pamela Reif will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video."
    channel_title "Pamela Reif"
    channel_id "UChVRfsT_ASBZk10o0An7Ucg"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
    duration NAN
  ]
  node [
    id 5765
    label "4YpYxExBmuU"
    step 1
    date "2019-02-17T12:18:57Z"
    title "15 MIN CHAIR WORKOUT - Extreme Full Body Training / Nothing for Beginners | Pamela Reif"
    description "A full body workout - only using a chair or bench (which we all have at home .. so no excuses hehe).  // Werbung &#10;&#10;A very intense sequence of exercises working your: abs, core strength, arms &#38; back muscles, chest, glutes, inner and outer thighs and your CARDIO. So all in all a great way to fire up your entire body in 15min &#9829;&#65038;&#10;&#10;I know a lot of those movements are very challenging - if you need a break - take it! You will get better over time :) &#10;Another option is performing the exercise without the chair (and for example) placing your feet on the ground. You do you! &#9829;&#65038;&#10;&#10;The video is in full length which means you can just follow whatever I&#8217;m doing 30s for each exercise. There is one 1min rests in between. &#10;&#10;I recommend switching up your workouts to give your muscles enough time to recover and to hit them from different angles. You can do this workout 2-3x a week and if you want to do be active on the other days: check out my Sixpack, Muffin Top, Sexy Arms, Calorie Burn or Booty Workout!! &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10142; Food Account http://www.instagram.com/pamgoesnuts/&#10;&#10;&#10;MUSIC by Epidemic Sound &#10;http://www.epidemicsound.com&#10;&#10;&#10;CONTACT ME (business inquires):&#10;pamela_reif@icloud.com&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;When joining me for this workout video, you need to take some precautions as your health and safety is the most important.&#160;To avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health with your doctor before exercising.&#160;By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. Pamela Reif will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video."
    channel_title "Pamela Reif"
    channel_id "UChVRfsT_ASBZk10o0An7Ucg"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
    duration NAN
