    step 1
    date "2022-07-07T12:49:35Z"
    title "7 Most Effective Bicep Exercises (Long Head and Short Head)"
    description "7 Most Effective Bicep Exercises (Long Head and Short Head)&#10;&#10;     The bicep brachii is a single muscle on the anterior side of the upper arm that is divided into a short and a long head.&#10;     The short head of bicep is located on the inside of your upper arm. The short head is wide and meshes with the long head to give the biceps a defined and wide appearance from the front view.&#10;     The long head of the bicep is located on the top and outside of your upper arm. The long head is slimmer than the short head and has a higher peak. The long head is the part of the biceps you notice when your arm is flexed, almost shaping into a sphere.&#10;&#10;00:00 Start&#10;00:06 Single Arm Dumbbell Preachers Curls&#10;00:40 Seated Dumbbell Curl&#10;01:08 Dumbbell Alternating Hammer Curl&#10;01:44 EZ Barbell Curls&#10;02:12 Chest Supported Dumbbell Curls&#10;02:39 Machine Preacher Curls&#10;03:09 Single Arm Cable Curls&#10;&#10;Website: http://gymbodymotivation.com&#10;Fanpage: https://www.facebook.com/gymbodyworkoutchart&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/gymbody.motivation&#10;&#10;Subscribe and Press the Bell icon: https://goo.gl/hupaey&#10;Thank you for your help!&#10;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#10;&#169; Copyright by Gym Body Motivation &#9758; Do not Reup&#10;Contact: gymbodymotivation@gmail.com&#10;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#10;Model Insta: &#10;@stevekrisofficial&#10;@_joeandrews&#10;@clarkfit&#10;@diesel.josh&#10;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#9644;&#10;&#127911; Track: Lost Sky - Vision pt. II (feat. She Is Jules) [NCS10 Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/kHLQF8_NFrM&#10;Free Download 