    title "12 MINUTE DUMBBELL AB WORKOUT | LEVEL 2 ABS (INTERMEDIATE)"
    description "Try this 12 Minute Dumbbell AB Workout. Do this AB workout for 1 or 2 Rounds daily, alternate, or pair with any other workout you do! Take only 2-5 minutes between each round if done together. &#10;.&#10;00:00 Intro&#10;00:40 Dumbbell Pull-through&#10;01:40 Dumbbell Legovers&#10;02:40 Dumbbell to Knee A&#10;03:40 Dumbbell to Knee B&#10;04:40 Oblique Crunch A&#10;05:40 Oblique Crunch B&#10;06:40 DB to Knee Plank A&#10;07:30 DB to Knee Plank B&#10;08:30 Woodchopper A&#10;09:30 Woodchopper B&#10;10:30 Knee to DB Plank A&#10;11:30 Knee to DB Plank B&#10;.&#10;Gain access to lots of FULL workout programs for every goal including programs I use personally, Tips &#38; Tactics, Meal recipes, Challenges &#38; more! Try my training APP for $1 for the first month: www.themidasmvmt.app&#10;.&#10;Like the Beat in this video, Support my BEATS channel - https://bit.ly/2RnwzMG&#10;Say hello on Instagram - @tmm.midas&#10;.&#10;Download My FREE Workout Programs &#38; Meal Guides: https://sellfy.com/digitalbymidas/freeworkoutprograms/&#10;.&#10;Try Amazon Prime for 30 days FREE&#10;US - https://geni.us/rWyNSyz&#10;CA - https://geni.us/IxeN&#10;UK - https://geni.us/PIP5p&#10;.&#10;WORKOUT EQUIPMENT (DUMBBELLS, KETTLEBELL ETC.)&#10;KIT - https://kit.co/Midas/home-workout-gear&#10;.&#10;US - https://geni.us/Im9yM&#10;CA - https://geni.us/9ErW&#10;UK - https://geni.us/HAHeB&#10;.&#10;WORKOUT SUPPLEMENT RECOMMENDATIONS&#10;KIT - https://kit.co/Midas/workout-supplements&#10;.&#10;Whey Protein Isolate (Less Sugar/Fats/Carbs - Pure Protein Source)&#10;US - https://geni.us/nyGun&#10;CA - https://geni.us/vvdI&#10;UK - https://geni.us/V2JEg&#10;.&#10;Whey Protein Concentrate (More Sugar/Fats/Carbs)&#10;US - https://geni.us/BExt&#10;CA - https://geni.us/BrEgB&#10;UK - https://geni.us/hdak5nb&#10;.&#10;Creatine&#10;US - https://geni.us/fLUdOgs&#10;CA - https://geni.us/5iddAM&#10;UK - https://geni.us/XST8Yk&#10;.&#10;Pre-Workout&#10;US - https://geni.us/JgPPwB&#10;CA - https://geni