    label "6_XXA8HmkqQ"
    step 1
    date "2016-11-16T19:39:57Z"
    title "Bowflex&#174; Dumbbell Workout | Four-Minute Butt &#38; Thigh Sculpting Workout"
    description "Learn more about Bowflex SelectTech Dumbbells here: https://goo.gl/5pqUde&#10;&#10;Get your butt and thighs in the shape you've always wanted by mixing this quick butt and thigh sculpting workout into your workout routines.&#10;&#10;In this workout you&#8217;ll be performing four exercises that target the lower body: &#10;1) Squats&#10;2) Alternating front lunges&#10;3) Deadlifts&#10;4) Alternating back lunges&#10;&#10;You&#8217;ll be performing each exercise for 45 seconds with 15 seconds rest in between. &#10;&#10;You can do these exercises with or without weights. If you are doing them for the first time, start by learning the correct form and building a base of strength using just your body weight. You don&#8217;t need to use weights to get results from this workout, especially if you are just beginning a strength training program. &#10;&#10;You can do this routine once, twice or even three times through depending on your fitness level, goals, and time available. This workout will strengthen, tone and sculpt all the major muscle groups of your legs, helping you to look and feel your best!&#10;&#10;Want to get the Bowflex SelectTech Dumbbells you see in the video? Grab a pair here: http://www.Bowflex.com/selecttech&#10;&#10;For additional quick workouts, check out our workouts playlist: http://goo.gl/mj1b0C&#10;&#10;Subscribe for weekly workouts and tips: http://goo.gl/sxLYmP&#10;&#10;Additional fitness tips: http://goo.gl/vFWbTL&#10;&#10;http://www.Bowflex.com - Find all the fitness solutions you'll ever need to get on your way to being a healthier you.&#10;&#10;http://www.BowflexInsider.com - Head to the Bowflex Insider blog to read the latest in all things related to fitness and health and find simple ways to start losing weight.&#10;&#10;Connect with us and socialize with other Bowflex enthusiats:&#10;http://www.facebook.com/Bowflex&#10;http://twitter.com/Bowflex&#10;http://plus.google.com/+Bowflex&#10;http://pinterest.com/Bowflex"
