    description "Thank you so much for watching! Please don't forget to like, comment and subscribe to see more videos. Hope to see you in my next video.&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -&#10;SUBSCRIBE : youtube.com/c/AnnabelleHayes&#10;INSTAGRAM : https://www.instagram.com/bellsebobo/?hl=en&#10;TWITTER : https://twitter.com/bellsebobo?lang=en&#10;SNAPCHAT :  @Bellsebobo&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -&#10;MY FITNESS WEBSITE: https://www.annabellehayes.com/&#10;MY FITNESS PROGRAMS: https://www.annabellehayes.com/programs-1/&#10;MY BLOG: https://www.annabellehayes.com/fitness-2/&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -&#10;BUSINESS EMAIL: annabellefhayes@gmail.com&#10;ADVICE EMAIL: contactbellsebobo@gmail.com&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -&#10;EXERCISE LIST:&#10;Warm Up: Banded Sumo Deadlifts&#10;Warm Up: Banded Work&#10;Warm Up: Ab Variations &#10;Warm Up: Stretching &#10;Smith Machine Squats: 3-4 Sets X 10-15 Reps &#10;Smith Machine Squats: 3 Sets X 10 Reps &#10;Hip Thrusts: 1 Set (Higher)  X 10 Reps &#10;Seated Calf Raises: 3 Sets X 10-15 Reps &#10;Hip Abduction Machine: 3 Sets X 10-15-20 Reps &#10;Lunges: SuperSet X 10 Reps &#10;High Knees: SuperSet X 10 Reps &#10;Single Leg Press: 3 Sets X 10 Reps &#10;Leg Extensions: 3 Sets X 10 Reps &#10;Single Leg Extensions: 2 Sets X 10 Reps &#10;Hamstring Curls: 3 Sets X 10 Reps &#10;Banded Side Squats: 3 Sets X 10 Reps &#10;Calf Press: 3 Sets X 10-15 Reps &#10;Foam Roll To Finish&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -&#10;MUSIC:"
