  node [
    id 5969
    label "m4lRy2bVqbg"
    step 1
    date "2020-02-26T18:25:58Z"
    title "my weekly abs &#38; cardio routine"
    description "my weekly fat burning ABS + CARDIO routine! my cardio consists of 2 parts: my daily step goal (between 8k and 10k steps) and (usually) 1 high intensity interval training (HIIT) workout. for my HIIT workouts, I either do treadmill sprints or a weight circuit.&#10;&#10;treadmill sprints: &#10;5 min walk (warm-up)&#10;10 rounds of sprints: 30 sec on/30 sec off&#10;5 min incline walk (active recovery)&#10;3 rounds of: 1 min walk, 1 min jog, 1 min sprint&#10;&#10;weight circuit:&#10;5 exercises&#10;30 sec work / 30 sec rest&#10;1 min rest after performing all exercises&#10;3-4 rounds&#10;&#10;For abs, I do 1 exercise that I want to become better at, at the end of my upper body workouts (2 times per week). Usually 3 sets and I max reps, while maintaining proper form&#10;&#10;I also do 1 abs circuit next to it. 3/4 different exercises, a few sets each. You can find more ab workouts on my Instagram!&#10; &#10;shop my products: www.gainsbybrains.com&#10;&#10;be my friend on&#10;&#187; instagram gainsbybrains&#10;&#187; snapchat gainsbybrains&#10;&#187; twitter gainsbybrains&#10;&#187; tiktok gainsbybrains&#10;&#10;links to support me&#10;shop gymshark here: https://gym.sh/Shop-GainsbyBrains&#10;shop women's best here: https://womens.best/GainsByBrains &#10;&#10;music from epidemic sound&#10;www.epidemicsound.com&#10;&#10;this video is not sponsored! Gymshark is an affiliate link (thank so much for shopping through my link, appreciate it so so much). Women's Best is not an affiliate link, but shopping through it &#38; using my code does help me working with the brand! xx"
    channel_title "GAINSBYBRAINS"
