    description "Thank you for watching! Please don't forget to like and subscribe. This is very much appreciated and it will help me to continue to produce as much content as possible to help you on your fitness journey. &#10;______________________________________________________&#10;WEBSITE: https://www.crystalrayy.com&#10;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/crystalrayf...&#10;&#10;FREE Clean Eating for Beginners guide: https://drive.google.com/file/d/19Hy5...&#10;_______________________________________________________&#10;Exercises &#10;&#10;Back &#10;&#10142; Pullups &#10;&#10142; Lat Pulldown &#10;&#10142; Barbell Bent Over Rows&#10;&#10142; Seated Rows&#10;&#10142; Standing Lat Pushdown &#10;&#10142; Underhand Lat Pulldowns (optional since lat pulldowns are already included) &#10;&#10142; Face Pulls&#10;&#10; Biceps &#10;&#10142; Cable Bicep Curl &#10;&#10142; EZ Bar Bicep Curls &#10;&#10142; Hammer Curls &#10;&#10142; Alternating Bicep Curls &#10;________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;Music Provided by:&#10;&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pXppQviIKCc https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EP625xQIGzs&#38;t=1s&#10;&#10;#backtobasics #backandbicepsworkout #femalebackworkout #backday #fitnessmotivation #fatlossjourney #fatloss #weightlifting"
