    title "10 MIN LOVE HANDLE WORKOUT (NO EQUIPMENT BODYWEIGHT WORKOUT!)"
    description "Get ready for one of the best Oblique Love handle Workouts of your LIFE! Let's get it! This is a full oblique workout that will focus on getting ripped v-cuts to help your love handles that you can do whenever and wherever you like... You won't need any equipment or weight.&#10;&#10;This video is full length which means you can just follow along with whatever I'm doing. If you need extra rest, just pause the video. If you don't need a rest - watch it the whole way through.&#10;&#10;You can hit this home workout 1-2x per week - and if you wanted to keep active on your other days - be sure to check out my other workouts!&#10;&#10;1) Side Plank Ups&#10;2) V Sit Crunches&#10;3) V Sit Cross Punch&#10;4) Russian Twists&#10;5) Cross Crunches&#10;6) Oblique Heel Taps&#10;7) Plank Toe Touches&#10;8) Plank Knee Crosses&#10;9) Side Plank Twists&#10;10) Plank Rotations&#10;11) Oblique Crunch&#10;12) Lying Oblique Crunch&#10;13) Lying Leg Crosses&#10;14) Cross Mountainers&#10;&#10;&#128073;Coaching Programs: https://www.fraserwilsonfitness.com&#10;&#128073;Subscribe: (https://goo.gl/84uFTA)&#10;&#128073;Clothes by Gymshark: https://gym.sh/Shop-Fraser&#10;&#128073;Supplements: http://1upnutrition.com CODE: FRASERFIT&#10;&#10;ADD ME ON:&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/FraserWilsonFit/&#10;Facebook: https://facebook.com/FraserWilsonFit/&#10;Snapchat: FraserWilsonFit&#10;&#10;Music:&#10;Ship Wrek &#38; Zookeepers - Ark [NCS Release] &#10;https://youtu.be/8xlDwukxjnA&#10;&#10;Futuristik - Forgive Me [NCS Release]&#10;https://youtu.be/E8VwtjhMFJ8&#10;&#10;Cartoon - On &#38; On (feat. Daniel Levi) [NCS Release]&#10;https://youtu.be/K4DyBUG242c"
