    title "Ankle Dorsiflexion Routine (Fix Tight Ankles)"
    description "---Open for download links, information and more---&#10;&#10;LIKE, COMMENT, SHARE and SUBSCRIBE! &#10;&#10;In this video we talk about one of the most common mobility restrictions, ankle dorsiflexion!&#10;&#10;Follow me on Instagram @TheBodyweightWarrior to stay up to date with my training and other awesomeness.&#10;&#10;DOWNLOAD MY PROGRAM: https://goo.gl/Jg0R46&#10;&#10;ARDOUR: http://www.ardour.life&#10;Use discount code &#8220;ARDOURTOM&#8221; for 10% off.&#10;&#10;Shoes I'm Wearing: https://goo.gl/jiDvwH&#10;&#10;INTRO - 0:19&#10;&#10;More About Dorsiflexion:  http://boxlifemagazine.com/the-importance-of-and-how-to-improve-ankle-mobility/ &#10;&#10;HOW OFTEN - 1:08&#10;&#10;EXERCISE 1 - SOFT TISSUE WORK - 1:26&#10;&#10;1 set x 1-2 minutes per leg&#10;&#10;Lacrosse Ball: http://amzn.eu/54IuTjN&#10;&#10;EXERCISE 2 - EMMET'S CALVE STRETCHING ROUTINE - 2:06&#10;&#10;1 set x 30-90s per position, per leg&#10;&#10;Emmet's Head to Toe Tutorial: https://youtu.be/3HVsDRjOHqU&#10;&#10;EXERCISE 3 - DORSIFLEXION BOUNCES - 3:10&#10;&#10;1-3 sets x 50r per leg&#10;&#10;Jordan Garcia: https://www.instagram.com/jordangarcia1775/&#10;&#10;SUMMARY - 4:10&#10;&#10;Music by: &#10;&#10;Instrumental - Chuki&#10;https://youtu.be/k4-r7LIzJoo&#10;http://www.youtube.com/user/CHUKImusic&#10;https://soundcloud.com/yuki-asemota&#10;https://www.facebook.com/pages/CHUKI/534703253224860&#10;&#10;Intro: 2BAD - Space Cake [FSTU Release]&#10;https://youtu.be/c3ibZ3QWXaI&#10;https://soundcloud.com/2bad-official&#10;https://www.facebook.com/2BaDOfficial/&#10;&#10;See you in the next video!"
