    title "Sleep Hypnosis &#38; YOU ARE Affirmations - EXERCISE Motivation 8-hrs"
    description "Do you feel totally unmotivated to exercise or work out at all? Program yourself to be motivated to exercise while you sleep, using deep sleep hypnosis and powerful YOU ARE affirmations. &#10;&#128308; WHY do I use &#34;You Are&#34; affirmations? - https://youtu.be/PqJHycA0yps&#10;&#10;&#10083;&#65039;  Consider becoming a Channel Member to put some skin in the game and for access to perks:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaEi38Wiw63fW5us177OjXQ/join&#10;&#10;&#10083;&#65039;  Join my LIFE CHANGE ACADEMY to become the best you possible!&#10;https://antonyreed.com &#10;&#10;&#10083;&#65039;  Try SLEEPPHONES, the headphones made for sleeping!&#10;https://www.sleepphones.com/?aff=430&#10;* Each purchase supports the channel with a small commission.&#10;&#10;AFFIRMATIONS IN THIS SESSION INCLUDE:&#10;You love to workout and exercise&#10;You enjoy working your muscles and body&#10;You treat your body well every day&#10;Every day, you become stronger and more fit&#10;You are motivated to get healthy the more you exercise&#10;You enjoy getting ready to workout&#10;You wake up each day, looking forward to your workout&#10;Exercising each day makes you happier&#10;You always finish your workouts&#10;You are someone who is always motivated to exercise.&#10;You know that working out makes your body the best it can be&#10;You work out every day and love the way it makes you feel&#10;You always look forward to exercising&#10;You feel amazing when you exercise regularly and take care of yourself&#10;You know you are valuable and worthy of a healthy lifestyle&#10;Keeping yourself in shape is important to you&#10;You are naturally motivated to work out and be in shape&#10;You always have the energy you need to exercise&#10;You will exercise each day will look forward to it&#10;You are totally focused on getting in shape&#10;You enjoy using your body and pushing it to improve&#10;You always find ways to make exercise fun and exciting&#10;The more you work out, the more motivated you become&#10;Your workouts never feel like work to you&#10;Finishing your workouts makes you feel good about yourself&#10;You always stay positive about your fitness&#10;&#10;What to keep in mind about hypnosis:&#10;* No program can guarantee results. If you don't want to change your current life habits, hypnosis will not help.&#10;* Hypnosis cannot make you do anything you don't want to do. It isn't &#34;mind control&#34;. That's just a myth brought to us by the entertainment industry. &#10;* You cannot get &#34;stuck&#34; in a hypnotic trance. That's another myth from the Big Screen... Thanks a lot, Hollywood!&#10;&#10;#sleephypnosis&#10;-----------------------------------------&#10;[Antony Reed is a certified hypnotist. He is not a medical doctor or psychiatrist and this video is not to be taken as medical or psychological advice or therapy. If you have a medical issue, please consult a professional.]"
