    date "2016-03-08T12:34:54Z"
    title "How Do Atomic Clocks Work?"
    description "We take lots of things for granted in this world; GPS, the internet and of course particle accelerators (well, maybe not particle accelerators!). However, none of these things would be possible without atomic clocks.&#10;&#10;In this video Dom explains how they work with some fascinating factoids to boot!&#10;&#10;Special Thanks to Dr. Edward Laird and Dr. Kyriakos Porfyrakis at University of Oxford.&#10;&#10;*What is Every Think?*&#10;Every Think is about, well, everything! Everything scientific and generally interesting that is. The channel explores the world we live in and the universe that world is in - from outer space to inside your body, Every Think has it covered.&#10;&#10;**CHECK OUT MY PATREON PAGE!**&#10;Hey, so I have a Patreon page now. Patreon is an awesome place where you can support creators like me. Click the link and see what rewards you could get for supporting me.&#10;https://www.patreon.com/everythink&#10;&#10;*What is Patreon?*&#10;https://youtu.be/rwvUjAv6pxg&#10;&#10;*Website*&#10;https://www.domburgess.com&#10;&#10;*Social Media*&#10;Twitter - @DumbBurgess&#10;&#10;Instagram - @dumbburgess&#10;&#10;https://www.facebook.com/everythinksc...&#10;&#10;https://www.facebook.com/domburgesspr...&#10;&#10;*Other Videos To Check Out!*&#10;Why Going To Mars Would Be Bad For Your Body&#10;https://youtu.be/a6qMaA4G3zU&#10;&#10;What Is Stockholm Syndrome? Have We All Got It?&#10;https://youtu.be/v8JEsKTRzl8&#10;&#10;Should We Send Animals to Mars?&#10;https://youtu.be/gBvflAYsPwc&#10;&#10;What Happens When You Are Struck By Lightning?&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj9Cb...&#10;&#10;How Do Atomic Clocks Work?&#10;https://youtu.be/l8CI3bs9rvY&#10;&#10;What Is Dark Matter?&#10;https://youtu.be/iTbP5XCGmMg"
