    step 1
    date "2021-11-26T22:16:12Z"
    title "I DID CAROLINE GIRVAN'S EPIC 3 PROGRAM and it was lifechanging! | Review + Results"
    description "In the past ten weeks i followed the EPIC 3 program by Caroline Girvan! It was hard and challenging but also beautiful and life changing. I loved it!&#10;In this video I'm talking about my experience, giving you my review, tips and tricks to conquer.&#10;Let's talk in the comments!&#10;&#10;Caroline's channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpis3RcTw6t47XO0R_KY4WQ&#10;&#10;Music&#10;Warriyo - Mortals: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJg-Y5byMMw&#10;Lost Sky - Fearless: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S19UcWdOA-I&#10;&#10;STAY CONNECTED&#10;&#187; Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/evacelineyt/&#10;&#10;Thank you to my best friend for helping me film the last sequences!&#10;I appreciate you.&#10;&#10;&#10084; Eva"
