    description "Free up some time for yourself and enjoy this 1 Hour Full Length Intermediate Pilates class! This full body workout will not only work your entire body but will leave you feeling strong, energised and more centred! All you need is yourself and a mat, no equipment needed. Have fun! :)&#10;&#10;&#127800; Leggings from Dharma Bums Active &#10;10% Discount Code: DBN20&#10;&#10;&#9825; INSTAGRAM: @movewithnicole&#10;&#9825; EMAIL: movewithnicole.yt@gmail.com&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9835; Music:&#10;Warm Nights by LAKEY INSPIRED https://soundcloud.com/lakeyinspired&#10;&#10;Me 2 by LAKEY INSPIRED (Feat. Julian Avila)&#10;&#10;Way Home by Tokyo Music Walker https://soundcloud.com/user-356546060 Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY 3.0&#10;&#10;Where Are We Going by Tokyo Music Walker https://soundcloud.com/user-356546060 Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported  &#8212; CC BY 3.0 &#10;&#10;Atch &#8211; Journey https://soundcloud.com/atch-music&#10;&#10;Merry Bay by Ghostrifter Official https://soundcloud.com/ghostrifter-of... Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY-SA 3.0 &#10;&#10;Track: Sunflower &#8212; Soyb [Audio Library Release] Music provided by Audio Library Plus Watch: https://youtu.be/dG1U3NuR9Pk Free Download / Stream: https://alplus.io/sunflower&#10;&#10;New Day by Tokyo Music Walker https://soundcloud.com/user-356546060 Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY 3.0&#10;&#10;Song: Erik Lund - Tokyo Sunset (Vlog No Copyright Music) Music promoted by Vlog No Copyright Music. Video Link: https://youtu.be/-jpnNRB5eTU&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;--&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;Please consult your doctor or health care professional before starting this workout. If you experience pain or discomfort at any time during this workout, you should stop immediately. By performing these exercises, you do so at your own risk. By using this video, you understand and