    description "Learn the right way of training your lower chest and master the secret of developing PERFECT PHYSIC. Push Workout 2.0&#10;Lower Chest Solution + Delt &#38; Triceps Workout with DUMBBELL ONLY (in Hindi). Push, Pull, Legs Workout  at Home or Gym.&#10;Most people have under-developed LOWER chest muscle which compromises the force output and create imbalance in body. &#10;&#10;I have shown you TOP 3 Lower chest exercise which will help you gain significant amount of muscles mass and strength of chest muscles. Also, there is a shoulder and triceps workout. &#10;&#10;Best Chest, Shoulder, Triceps workout at gym/home with Dumbbells only. &#10;&#10;Push Workout 1.0 : https://youtu.be/YPOv6m3J8Vw&#10;&#10;&#9989;The Perfect CHEST Workout&#10;1. Declined Chest Press 3-4 sets 6-12 reps&#10;2. Declined Chest Fly 3-4 sets 6-12 reps&#10;3. Standing Dips 3 sets- Max rep[s&#10;5. DB Front Raise 3 Sets 10-12 reps&#10;Alternate set with DB Side raise&#10;7. Diamond Push up 3 sets - Max reps&#10;8. DB OH Triceps Extn 3 sets 10-12 reps&#10;&#10;9. Triceps Pushdown 3 sets 10-12 reps&#10;&#10;PUSH/PULLL/LEG #02&#128293;100% RESULTS. Chest, Shoulder, Triceps at Gym/Home. Muscle building best PUSH WORKOUT PLAN in Hindi (with DUMBBBELL only). Follow Along. Chest, Shoulder, Triceps. Bodybuilding at Home/Gym. The Perfect PUSH Workout to build lean muscles mass. Dumbbell only PUSH Exercise/Workout for Chest, Triceps, Shoulder.&#10;&#10;Upper chest, Lower chest, anterior delt, side deltoid, long head triceps, lateral and medial head of triceps. &#10;&#10;&#128073;Timestamps&#128072;&#10;0:00 Overview&#10;1:08 How to TARGET Lower chest&#10;2:34 Warm up&#10;4:50 Push up&#10;5:26 1st exercise&#10;6:42 How many SETs for muscle growth?&#10;8:39 PRO Tip&#10;11:30 3rd set&#10;14:01 When to increase weight?&#10;15:18 Final set&#10;17:19 Muscle PUMP&#10;18:02 1st Set Dec. Chest Fly&#10;19:04 Motivation + 2nd set&#10;21:00 3rd set&#10;22:55 3rd exercise&#10;23:13 Why Dips? + 1st set&#10;