    title "10 min CARDIO to BURN FAT at home//No Equipment (&#128293;~70-100 calories)"
    description "#nitang #cardioworkout #loseweight&#10;This video has subtitles in many languages.&#10;Subtitles can be selected in the setting.&#10;&#10;Hello everyone, this is a 10-minute fat burning cardio workout at home, I practice daily combined with abs workout and arms workout to achieve higher efficiency. This exercise is suitable for everyone, including beginners. I do this workout twice a day.&#10;&#10;My other exercises at home:&#10;Get flat belly in 3 weeks: https://youtu.be/eKgfEA4PTTI&#10;Get rid of flabby arms in one week: https://youtu.be/Lmf0SWSqEYw&#10;&#10;C o n n e c t w i t h m e&#10;IG: https://www.instagram.com/tthnhi__/&#10;Email: nguyenthaonhi1309@gmail.com&#10;&#10;C a m e r a &#10;Filmed with iPhone 11&#10;Edit Program VLLO&#10;&#10;B g m&#10;1.&#10;Luke Bergs - Bliss&#10;Music by Luke Bergs:&#10;&#9654;Video Link: https://youtu.be/I4xxdXITAME&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#9654;Spotify: https://spoti.fi/37O7TkS&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#9654;Soundcloud: https://bit.ly/37JG9hB&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#9654;Facebook: https://bit.ly/2JOvnhT&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#9654;Instragram: https://bit.ly/2JKGqsy&#8203;&#10;&#119924;&#119958;&#119956;&#119946;&#119940; &#119927;&#119949;&#119938;&#119962;&#119949;&#119946;&#119956;&#119957; : https://youtu.be/7gpe8H1dHWs&#8203;&#10;2.&#10;Song: Tobu - Let's Go&#10;Music provided by Vlog No Copyright Music.&#10;Video Link: https://youtu.be/fFDLnyr6s1U&#8203;&#10;&#119924;&#119958;&#119956;&#119946;&#119940; &#119927;&#119949;&#119938;&#119962;&#119949;&#119946;&#119956;&#119957; : https://youtu.be/7gpe8H1dHWs&#10;3.&#10;Song: Vlad Gluschenko - Keeping The Moment&#10;Music provided by Vlog No Copyright Music.&#10;Creative Commons - Attribution 3.0 Unported&#10;Video Link: https://youtu.be/u1zPmltelFA&#8203;&#10;&#119924;&#119958;&#119956;&#119946;&#119940; &#119927;&#119949;&#119938;&#119962;&#119949;&#119946;&#119956;&#119957; : https://youtu.be/7gpe8H1dHWs&#8203;&#10;4. &#10;LiQWYD - Dance&#10;Dance by LiQWYD https://soundcloud.com/liqwyd&#8203; &#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY 3.0 &#10;http://creativecommons.org/licenses/b...&#8203; &#10;Free Download: http://bit.ly/2uJ7H3z&#8203;&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/4KcQ90UbRsg&#8203;&#10;&#119924;&#119958;&#119956;&#119946;&#119940; &#119927;&#119949;&#119938;&#119962;&#119949;&#119946;&#119956;&#119957; : https://youtu.be/7gpe8H1dHWs&#10;&#10;&#169; B&#7843;n quy&#7873;n thu&#7897;c v&#7873; NITANG&#10;&#169; Copyright by NITANG &#9758; Do not Reup"
