    title "I did 1000 jump ropes every single day for a week &#128095;&#10024;"
    description "#jumprope1000everydayinaweek #jumprope1000 #nitang #workouchallenge&#10;&#10;Hi guys, I'm back with another challenge, jumping 1000 rope every day in a week. After the challenge of losing belly fat, I want to find another exercise that can burn body fat, making the body firmer.&#10;At first thinking about jumping rope, I just thought it would be best if I could dance 200-300, that's right, the first 2 days I was very exhausted and it took a long time to finish 1000 pieces. However, it must be recognized that this rope skipping improves endurance very well, and the body looks much firmer.&#10;Now I have found a way to burn fat instead of just doing Cardio, helping my exercises more diverse.&#10;I hope this video is of help to you. Have a nice week of work and rest!&#10;&#10;&#129485;&#127995;&#8205;&#9792;&#65039;height: 159cm&#10;&#10;C o n n e c t w i t h m e&#10;IG: nitang13 - https://www.instagram.com/tthnhi__/&#10;Email: nguyenthaonhi1309@gmail.com&#10;&#10;C a m e r a &#10;Filmed with iPhone 11&#10;Edit Program VLLO&#10;&#10;&#169; B&#7843;n quy&#7873;n thu&#7897;c v&#7873; NITANG&#10;&#169; Copyright by NITANG &#9758; Do not Reup"
