  node [
    id 6319
    label "PBOEwudYhvs"
    step 1
    date "2019-01-16T21:22:09Z"
    title "The Perfect Squat - The Titan"
    description "I&#8217;m about to tell you my Secrets to a perfect squat&#8230;&#128071;&#10;&#10;I got together with my buddies Bedros and Todd to shoot this value-packed Youtube video about how to squat properly and its straight gold. &#128170;&#10;&#10;Not bronze, not silver&#8230;&#10;&#10;Gold.&#10;&#10;The thing about Todd and Bedros is their pros. &#127942;&#10;&#10;Add it up and they have 50 years of experience between them.&#10;&#10;Yet&#8230;&#10;&#10;When they work out with me they always learn something new.&#10;&#10;Because they&#8217;re champions.&#10;&#10;&#128721; In my 4 decades of training, I&#8217;ve noticed something&#8230;&#10;&#10;&#9989; What separates the champions from the average in this world is champions are always learning.&#10;&#10;&#9989;Always improving...&#10;&#10;&#9989; They understand if you aren&#8217;t learning then you aren&#8217;t getting any better.&#10;&#10;If you think about it, that applies to life, not just fitness...&#129300;&#10;&#10;It&#8217;s a universal rule&#10;&#10;So the balls in your court&#8230;&#10;&#10;If you are looking to improve your knowledge of bodybuilding, annihilate personal records or shred any excess fat&#8230;&#10;&#10;Then you're in the right place, my friend.&#10;&#10;..But first off&#8230;&#10;&#10;You need to check out this video.&#10;&#10;It&#8217;ll easily improve your squat game by &#128287;X&#10;&#10;Don&#8217;t Lighten up, TITAN UP!&#10;&#128058;&#10;&#9876;&#127808; Mike O'Hearn The Titan.&#10;&#10;P.S. Bedros said he had reconstructive surgery on his knee.&#10;&#10;After I showed him this squatting technique he said it was a piece of cake. Pain Free.&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Mike O'Hearn IG: https://www.instagram.com/mikeohearn/&#10;&#10;My website to find all the shirts and workout plans and so much more: http://www.mikeohearn.com/"
    channel_title "Mike O'Hearn"
    channel_id "UC8YnxGgVT62DDZ6sX1pLKGQ"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
    duration NAN
  ]
  node [
    id 6320
    label "bgiPzZd0UsA"
    step 1
    date "2022-06-16T01:37:22Z"
    title "LEE PRIEST: On the Passing of Cedric McMillan"
    description "We've lost too many great athletes already, so seeing Cedric McMillan on that list was certainly unpleasant. Our condolences and best wishes to his family.&#10;&#10;We shot this video on 13th of May 2022, it took us a while to upload it.&#10;&#10;https://www.instagram.com/leepriestofficial72/&#10;&#10;https://www.amazon.com/Believe-Yourself-Lee-Priest-Story/dp/0473550369&#10;&#10;Sam's Fitness - Gym Equipment: https://samsfitness.com.au/&#10;Follow us Facebook - https://goo.gl/uKtsUx&#10;OR&#10;Instagram - https://goo.gl/nF3Kfq"
