    description "The April Bikini Body Challenge is back! Just in time to get you that summer body! This is the SECOND video (Abs &#38; Upper Body) of WEEK 3. Remember to do some cardio tomorrow, repeat this workout on Saturday + The leg workout from Monday, and stay tuned for MONDAY of next week when i'll be releasing the Week 4 workouts!&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME &#128151; &#10;TIKTOK: https://www.tiktok.com/@vickyjustiz&#10;IG: https://www.instagram.com/vickyjustiz/&#10; FITNESS IG: https://www.instagram.com/vickyjustizfitness/&#10;&#10;WOMEN'S BEST: https://womens.best/Vickyjustiz&#10;10% OFF code: Vicky10&#10;&#10;MY WORKOUT PROGRAM: https://www.vickyjustiz.co/workoutprogram/bodysculptbundle&#10;&#10;&#10;Here is the schedule for the Bikini Body Challenge, which will be the same each week&#10;Monday - Leg Workout &#10;Tuesday - Rest/Cardio&#10;Wednesday - repeat Leg Workout&#10;Thursday - Ab/Upper Body workout (THIS VIDEO)&#10;Friday - Rest/Cardio &#10;Saturday - Both Legs &#38; Upper Body&#10;Sunday - REST DAY&#10;&#10;&#10;Remember to do the Vacuums EVERYDAY. &#10;&#10;The link to the vacuum video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y_V9W13Dtlk&#10;&#10;&#10;Equipment:&#10;Ankle Weights: http://amzn.to/2o42bqK&#10;Resistance Bands: http://amzn.to/2nu6pq6&#10;&#10;Hashtag your progress #BikiniBodyJustiz and tag me on Instagram @VickyJustiz so I can see your progress! &#10;&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - &#10;&#10;My Travel Youtube Channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/bottleofwinefortwo&#10;&#10;Latest Travel Video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3_1dXDx6tgw&#38;t=5s&#10;&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - &#10;&#10;Vicky Justiz on Instagram: @vickyjustiz&#10;https://www.instagram.com/vickyjustiz/&#10;Business Contact: bookvickyjustiz@gmail.com"
