    title "Fast Toned Abs (9 MINUTES)"
    description "Happy New Years guys and welcome back to my channel. &#10;To kick-start 2019, I am bringing you a Tabata flat stomach workout which is going to tone your abs. &#10;&#10;There is one main circuit to do, that contains 8 exercises. Each is performed for 20 seconds with a 10 seconds rest, and then we repeat this circuit two times. &#10;&#10;The exercises are: &#10;&#10;- Reverse Crunches &#10;- Single Knee Crunch &#10;- Otherside &#10;- Heel Touchers &#10;- Single Arm Lift Plank &#10;- Knee In Kick &#10;- Otherside &#10;- Downward Toe Taps to Plank&#10;&#10;Hope you all enjoy this workout and let me know in the comments!&#10;&#10;Love, Holly xx&#10;&#10;&#9825; 7 Day Free Trial! Download To My Fitness App: https://bit.ly/3kJrYQw&#10;&#10;------------&#10;Disclaimer: Please always consult with your physician before practicing or participating in any workout challenges - if you do so, you workout at your own accord. This is my own personal workout and may not be suited for you&#10;&#10;You can connect with me below for more workouts, food, and motivation!&#10;&#10;&#9825; MY INSTAGRAM:  https://www.instagram.com/hollydolke &#10;&#10;&#9825; MY TIKTOK: https://vm.tiktok.com/uWJLyQ/&#10;&#10;&#9825; FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/hollydolkeofficial"
