    title "8 MIN AB WORKOUT // No Equipment | Scott Mathison"
    description "What&#8217;s up guys!  Here&#8217;s a new bodyweight ab workout that will get your abs shredded in 8 minutes!  This is a follow along workout, and we&#8217;ll be doing 40 seconds on, and then 20 seconds of rest before the next exercise.  I have a preview of the upcoming exercise in the 20 second rest window so you can get ready for the next movement.  If you need more of a challenge you can do this workout 2 or 3 times.  I have listed the exercises below.  Let&#8217;s get it!&#10;&#10;Twisting Mountain Climbers&#10;Full Body Crunch&#10;Knee to Elbow &#10;Lower Body Leg Raise&#10;Plank Drops&#10;Crunch to Arm Raise &#10;Bicycle&#10;Seated Leg Side to Side"
    channel_title "Scott Mathison"
