    title "20 MINUTE DUMBBELL CHEST &#38; TRICEPS WORKOUT | BURN FAT &#38; BUILD MUSCLE"
    description "Grab some Dumbbells and try this 20 Minute Dumbbell Chest &#38; Triceps Workout. Complete two or three times every week. This workout is great to do if you're looking to burn fat &#38; build muscle at the same time. I used 20lbs dumbbells for this. Use any weights between 5-30lbs.&#10;.&#10;00:00 Intro&#10;00:40 Hammer Press&#10;01:30 DB Lying Skull Crusher&#10;02:30 Floor Fly&#10;03:30 Alt Tricep Kickback&#10;04:30 SxD Side Floor Fly&#10;05:30 DB Diamond Pushup&#10;06:30 Floor Press (Fingers Up)&#10;07:30 Double Overhead Press&#10;08:30 Alt Chest Fly&#10;09:30 Outward Extension&#10;10:30 Decline Floor Press&#10;11:30 Double DB Overhead Press&#10;12:30 Floor Press&#10;13:30 Leaning SxD Kickback&#10;14:30 Pushup x Double Chest Fly&#10;15:30 Single Overhead Press A&#10;16:30 Single Overhead Press B&#10;17:30 Alt Chest Fly + Hold&#10;18:30 Alt Lying SC x Pullovers&#10;19:30 Twisting Floor Press&#10;.&#10;Say hello on Instagram - @tmm.midas&#10;.&#10;FREE Workout Programs &#38; Meal Guides: https://bit.ly/3heQDuF&#10;.&#10;Try Amazon Prime for 30 days FREE&#10;https://geni.us/TryPrime30&#10;.&#10;Whey Protein Isolate (Less Sugar/Fats/Carbs - Pure Protein Source) - https://geni.us/WheyProteinIsolate&#10;Whey Protein Concentrate (More Sugar/Fats/Carbs) - https://geni.us/WheyProteinConcentrate&#10;Creatine Monohydrate - https://geni.us/CreatineMonohydrate&#10;Pre-Workout - https://geni.us/PreWorkout&#10;.&#10;Adjustable Dumbbell Set - https://geni.us/AdjustableDumbbells&#10;Home Workout Equipment - https://kit.co/Midas/home-workout-gear&#10;.&#10;Feeling generous? Donate here  - https://bit.ly/M2WZ2YfW. &#128591;&#127998;&#10;.&#10;Shop My Merch - https://bit.ly/2Yu4JSs&#10;Shop My Digital Product - https://bit.ly/3BVG1sS&#10;Everything I use to SHOOT videos! - https://kit.co/Midas/youtube-video-kit&#10;.&#10;Main Channel (Fitness &#38; Lifestyle) - https://www.youtube.com/c/MiDASLiFE&#10;Tech Channel - https://www.youtube.com/c/MIDASTECH&#10;Check out all