    title "30 Min All Standing No Jumping Cardio HIIT DANCE Workout | Burn 400 Calories | Exercise to the Beat"
    description "Get ready for this 30 min Cardio HIIT Dance Workout to walk the weight off. It's a low impact one but definitely not low intense. Performing to the beat gives us even more motivation keeping up and having fun. Don't mind if you fall off the beat, just keep up the vibe. Let's move our entire body!&#10;&#10;*The number of calories you burn will vary from person to person depending on your body composition, workout intensity and also fitness level but this might serve as a guideline. &#10;&#10;&#10048;Full Body Workout&#10;&#10048;Time: 40 sec on/ 10 sec off&#10;&#10;Warm Up 00:00 - 03:12&#10;Workout 03:12 - 33:12&#10;Cool Down 33:12 - 36:35&#10;&#10;&#10048; Don&#8217;t forget to Subscribe and turn on notifications so that you don&#8217;t miss any Workouts, Community Updates or Surprises:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6TSBn2RAx036n04GaN6McA&#10;&#10;&#10048;Join the Community:&#10;Fitness Channel&#10;Instagram:  http://instagram.com/eleni.fit__&#10;&#10;Healthy Food Channel &#10;&#9825; EVERYONE LOVES GOOD FOOD!!! &#10;Are you craving for something sweet or savory? Visit my food channel to discover delicious and healthy treats. &#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/elenis_healthy_kitchen/?hl=de&#10;YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClbLW1-A462PQrPAZi43tcA&#10;&#10;&#10048; Music:  https://www.epidemicsound.com&#10;&#10;&#10048; Gear I Use: &#10;Camera: https://amzn.to/3mYGS7G&#10;Tripod: https://amzn.to/3n0gt9G&#10;MacBook: https://amzn.to/3BBvUJq&#10;Softbox: https://amzn.to/3gZQZ8l&#10;&#10;&#10048; Equipment&#10;Mat Black: https://amzn.to/3DJFzj6&#10;Mat Grey: https://amzn.to/2WLQvfs&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER&#10;If you are new to exercise, you should understand that there is the possibility of physical injury.Please notice that if you performing any exercise or program, you agree that you do so at your own risk. This channel offers health, fitness and nutritional information and is not intended to be a substitute for professional med