    title "12 MIN Hard Toned Abs // No Equipment + 4 Day Ab Challenge // Sami Clarke"
    description "12 MIN Hard Toned Abs // No Equipment + 4 Day Challenge // Sami Clarke&#10;&#10;Hi my loves!&#10;&#10;I want to thank all of you who have began following along on this incredible month long journey! This is the second to last workout for Wellness Month, but the last one for me. In honor of that, give it all that you have! &#10;&#10;This one is going to be hard, and it&#8217;s going to burn&#8230;.. just the way we like it. As always, let me know what you think about the exercises in the comments below. Tell me how this last month has been for you and what you are looking forward to next year! Your input really makes a difference and it motivates me each and every day! &#10;&#10;So hit the subscribe button, turn on your post notifications, and challenge someone close to you over the next 30 days! I&#8217;m really proud of you all.&#10;&#10;xoxo&#10;&#10;-sc"
