  node [
    id 6560
    label "U0PTxzo46G0"
    step 1
    date "2021-01-08T22:34:53Z"
    title "What I learned from BEING SOBER for TWO YEARS (motivation to quit drinking)"
    description "What I learned from being sober for two years. I never would have thought I would get here. It took me many tries until I was finally able to quit alcohol. It really helped me to quit drinking by focusing on the benefits of being sober. I hope this video motivates and inspires you to get control over you drinking problem. &#10;&#10;My first video on HOW I QUIT DRINKING https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QxBxkv49L54&#10;&#10;Where I buy tea from (affiliate link) https://shareasale.com/r.cfm?b=1764427&#38;u=2246514&#38;m=18774&#38;urllink=&#38;afftrack=&#10;I love their green and white teas. My favorites are Clouds and mist, Silver needle, boulder blues and gyokuro. &#10;&#10;&#10;Ready to go vegan but don't know where to start?  Get this beginner vegan bundle, on sale now! &#10;https://damntastyvegan.lpages.co/vegan-bundle-direct/&#10;Here's what's all included:&#10;How to order vegan fast food (exactly what I say when ordering)&#10;Vegan protein cheat sheet&#10;Healthy vegan plate&#10;What to eat everyday to be a healthy vegan (checklist)&#10;5 ingredient, one month dinner meal plan and shopping list. &#10;Vegan meal ideas on instagram https://www.instagram.com/damntastyvegan/&#10;&#10;&#10;What supplements do I take?&#10;I take Ritual supplements that are vegan, sustainably sourced, non-gmo and contain no fillers. &#10;Ritual vitamins for women has B12, D3, Long chain Omega DHA, K2, Folate, Boron, Vitamin E and Iron. https://ritual.com/products/essential-for-women-multivitamin&#10;&#10;I also eat Iodine salt or dulse, or nori daily for my Iodine.  &#10;&#10;Things I love:&#10;&#10;High quality tested CBD oil (affiliate link) https://greenroads.com/mint-breeze-cbd-oil-1500mg-50mg-ml-broad-spectrum/?uid=42&#38;oid=2&#38;affid=22&#38;utm_medium=performance&#38;utm_source=everflow&#38;source_id=damntastyvegan&#38;sub1=howifinallybecamesober&#10;&#10;Rasa - An adaptogenic herbal, caffeine free coffee alternative (affiliate link) https://shareasale.com/r.cfm?b=1635871&#38;u=2246514&#38;m=98082&#38;urllink=&#38;afftrack=&#10;&#10;Tofu press (affiliate link) https://amzn.to/2TRbGI5&#10;&#10;Non-stick baking mat (affiliate link) https://amzn.to/2Ak2tkG&#10;&#10;Vegan menstrual cup perfect for beginners  (affiliate link) https://amzn.to/2WkgPf4&#10;&#10;Eco-Friendly Non-Toxic, no slip yoga mat (affiliate link) https://amzn.to/2RJx0xb&#10;&#10;Pressure cooker (affiliate link) https://amzn.to/2ITMjRh&#10;&#10;What I film with:&#10;Canon Rebel Camera (affiliate link) https://amzn.to/2DtvA3C&#10;&#10;&#10;I'm Maria Rose, the founder of Damn Tasty Vegan - No meat. No dairy. No eggs. No problem!&#10;I&#8217;m a pole dancing, foul-mouthed, downward-dog-loving, imperfect human who believes in progress not perfection. I'm a food blogger by day, professional musician by night and cat mom for life (meow!)&#10;&#10;I hope to show you that being vegan is about reducing animal suffering as much as is practical, and is not about obsessing about purity, weight loss or perfection. &#10;&#10;My journey to veganism was not a straight line. I flip flopped between being vegetarian and vegan for years!  I fell off the wagon so many times, I have permanent bruises on my metaphorical ass.&#10;&#10;I finally got it to stick after spending more time educating myself, connecting with the ethics of veganism and finding a vegan online community so I didn&#8217;t feel like an outsider. I&#8217;ve now been a satisfied and healthy vegan since 2015.&#10;&#10;Follow vegan activists like&#10;Earthling Ed https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QMX_V_6bMEU&#10;James Aspey https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7BCIvrBZ1iQ&#38;t=1373s&#10;That Vegan Couple https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OhY_9Zu0gRs&#10;&#10;Learn the basics of vegan nutrition by following doctors that aren't in it for the money, but that are in it for understanding the science.  &#10;Dr. Michael Gregor https://www.youtube.com/user/NutritionFactsOrg&#10;Dr. Garth Davis https://www.instagram.com/drgarthdavis/&#10;&#10;Read the book The Joyful Vegan by Colleen Patrick Goudreau https://www.colleenpatrickgoudreau.com/book/the-joyful-vegan/&#10;&#10;Watch Earthlings https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8gqwpfEcBjI&#10;Watch Dominion https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LQRAfJyEsko&#38;t=3s&#10;Watch Cowspiracy On Netflix - Here is a snippet https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dSjE8xw_-Dg&#38;t=107s&#10;&#10;#howtoquitdrinking #sobriety #sober"
    channel_title "Damn Tasty Vegan"
    channel_id "UCDXdAZcTdPc9qtm2bJqk-pA"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
