    title "30 MIN RESISTANCE BAND WORKOUT - Full Body With Cardio"
    description "Are you ready to get your sweat on? This 30 minute full body circuit workout will challenge you with a resistance band.  You can also do the workout with dumbbells. &#10;&#10;Remember to SUBSCRIBE so you don&#8217;t miss any NEW workouts!! LIKE this workout to help support my channel. Thank you! :)  &#10;&#10;We&#8217;ll be moving from one exercise to the next for 60 seconds of work and 20 seconds of rest. I&#8217;ll be showing modifications for intensity and impact. This is a great workout for traveling. &#10;&#10;So grab your water bottle, a band and a mat (or towel) and let&#8217;s go! Try out this workout and let me know what you think in the comments below!&#10;&#10;Equipment needed: resistance band, mat (or towel)&#10;&#10;Music used: https://share.epidemicsound.com/huyz68&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;&#10;The information contained in the following exercise video is of a general nature and for educational and entertainment purposes only. Please check with your doctor before beginning this or any exercise program. The creators, producers, participants and distributers of this video will not be responsible or liable for any injury or loss relating to the techniques, exercises and information provided within.       &#10;Copyright Laura Wells Fitness 2022&#10;&#10;L I N K S&#10;&#10;Website: https://www.laurawellsfitness.com&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/laurawellsfitness/&#10;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/Laura_Wells_Fitness&#10;&#10;#bandworkout #resistancebandworkout #workoutathome #circuitworkout #fullbodyworkout"
