    step 1
    date "2022-06-24T05:26:57Z"
    title "14 MIN INTENSE AB + CHAIR WORKOUT | For Lower, Upper &#38; Side Abs | Vikki Power"
    description "Who is ready to train abs with me? This workout is so much fun! It is designed in a way to target all your core muscles, from lower abs to obliques. So grab a chair and let's go!&#10;&#10;This workout is recorded in full so you don't need to pause just follow me on the screen. We are going to perform 10 exercises , for 2 rounds. Each exercise for 30 sec on, and 10 seconds off.&#10;1. Leg Raises&#10;2. Tuck Ins&#10;3. Scissors&#10;4. Flutter Kicks&#10;5. Knee to Elbow&#10;6. Reverse Plank Knee-In&#10;7. Leg Lift Around Chair&#10;8. Tuck In around Chair&#10;9. Crunches&#10;10. Plank&#10;&#10;I hope you enjoy the burn! &#10;&#10;Don&#8217;t forget to subscribe and turn on notifications so that you don&#8217;t miss any Workouts, Community Updates or Surprises: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkx74w-Gayqe7CHfbZnzdDg&#10;&#10;Follow me:&#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/vikkipower.fit/&#10;&#10;TikTok - https://www.tiktok.com/@vikkipower.fit&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;When joining me for this workout video, you need to take some precautions as your health and safety is the most important. To avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health with your doctor before exercising. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. Vikki Power will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video.&#10;&#10;#fitness #homeworkout #health"
