    label "VJf9ezmHTxg"
    step 1
    date "2020-03-04T20:54:14Z"
    title "$20 HIGH PROTEIN MEAL PREP ON A BUDGET | WALMART EDITION"
    description "THIS WEEK we went shopping at Walmart to create a high protein meal prep on a 20$ budget that will help you Bulk up with muscle &#38; lose fat.&#10;&#10;Brians Channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2ycqdFV0EmY5LmfM9mWkQg&#10;&#10;&#9658; Recipe &#38; Fitness eBook: https://jonvenus.com/tasty-vegan-meals&#13;&#10;&#9658; Online Meal &#38; Workout Plans: http://www.jonvenus.com&#13;&#10;&#10;RECIPE BREAKDOWN:&#10;&#10;BREAKFAST:&#10;&#10;Cookies:&#10;3 bananas ($0.60)&#10;56g / 1/2 Cup Walnuts($1.56)&#10;3 Tbsp Peanut Butter ($0.71)&#10;3 tsp Cinnamon &#10;270g/3 cups Rolled oats ($0.74) Bake in oven for 25 minutes at 200C/400F&#10;&#10;Frosting: &#10;3 Tbsp Peanut butter  &#10;3 Tbsp Raw Sport Protein Powder ($1.20)&#10;3 Tbsp water &#10;&#10;Totals per day:&#10;&#10;959 Calories&#10;121g carb&#10;34g protein&#10;36g fat&#10;$5.11 ($1.70 per meal)&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;LUNCH:&#10;&#10;Stir fry:&#10;1 cup/190g Dry Long Grain Brown Rice ($0.33) &#10;3 Tbsp Teriyaki sauce ($0.18)&#10;2 lbs/907g firm tofu ($2.88)&#10;1 large onion ($0.70)&#10;24 oz/680g California style vegetable mix ($2.00)    &#10;5 cups/355g broccoli ($1.00)&#10;&#10;Totals per day: &#10;&#10;676 calories&#10;86g carbs&#10;40g protein&#10;14g fat&#10;$7.00 ($2.36 per meal)&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;DINNER:&#10;&#10;Protein Pasta:&#10;4 1/2 cups/450g Whole wheat rotini pasta ($1.00)&#10;5 cups/426g Traditional Pasta sauce ($2.55) &#10;30oz/850g organic lentils ($1.84)&#10;13.7oz/390 Gardein Beefless ground ($3.12)&#10;&#10;Totals per day: &#10; &#10;957 calories&#10;167g carbs &#10;60g protein&#10;10g fat&#10;$8.50 / $2.80 per meal&#10;&#10;&#10;DAILY TOTAL:&#10;&#10;2600 Calories&#10;375g carbs&#10;133g Protein&#10;61g Fat &#10;&#10;$6.8 per day / $20.50 Total for 3 days. &#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#9658;Youtube: http://bit.ly/1v5BMp6&#13;&#10;&#9658;Facebook: http://on.fb.me/1taH0Ku&#13;&#10;&#9658;Instagram: instagram.com/jonvenus&#13;&#10;&#9658;Twitter: https://twitter.com/sergifitness&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;----------------------------------------&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;------------------------------------&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-------------&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Thanks for watching the this Video!! Please share this with friends and tell them to SUBSCRIBE if you can to make the channel GROW! :D it means everything to me! Thank you very much!!! :D&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;This channel includes only PG clean content&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;- Jon Venus&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;The Quest For Fitness"
