    title "Can Men &#38; Women be JUST Friends? - with Logos | Bianca Taylor Podcast EP 18"
    description "Bianca is joined by her friend, Logos, to answer the question - can men &#38; women be JUST friends? They share their journey of friendship, and why they think it is essential to have platonic male/female friends. They talk about all things jealousy, boundaries, and how to take sex off the table.&#10;&#10;===&#10;TIMESTAMPS:&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;1:39 Our friendship &#10;6:30 Advice for women - creating platonic friendships&#10;8:41 Jealousy &#38; Boundaries &#10;36:45 Allowing your Truth to Evolve &#10;44:05 Perspective &#38; Gratitude&#10;1:07:09 Conclusion &#10;===&#10;LOGOS: &#10;https://www.instagram.com/logosthegod/&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fukwEdV03js&#38;ab_channel=LogosVEVO&#10;&#10;===&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME:&#10;&#10;Instagram&#10;Https://Instagram.com/Biancataylorm&#10;&#10;Twitter&#10;Https://Twitter.com/Biancataylorm&#10;&#10;Tiktok&#10;Https://Tiktok.com/@Biancataylorm&#10;&#10;Embodied Babe Coaching:&#10;https://www.theembodiedbabe.com&#10;&#10;My Custom Vegan Meal Plans &#38; Training programs (home + gym available!)&#10;HTTPS://Getstarted.Biancataylorfitness.com&#10;&#10;My Fave Vegan Organic Supplements: (use &#8220;Bianca&#8221; for a discount)&#10;https://www.vedgenutrition.com/?rfsn=3781391.8e27eb"
