    title "Our VEGAN Story + How I got Started in Bodybuilding &#128170;"
    description "In today's video, my husband George and I share our vegan story.  We dive deep into 7 years of living the vegan lifestyle, how I got started in bodybuilding, and my journey to becoming an IFBB pro.&#10;#vlogmas #veganstory #NatalieMatthews&#10;&#10;&#9829;FOLLOW ME: &#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/fitveganchef/&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/fitveganchef&#10;Website: https://fitveganchef.com&#10;&#10;&#9829;LINKS + DISCOUNT CODES:&#10;&#10;&#9659;My favorite vegan protein &#38; supps | Discount Code: FITVEGAN20&#10;http://bit.ly/2H0ghDZ&#10;&#10;&#9659;My favorite gym wear | Discount Code: NATALIE&#10;https://www.buffbunny.com&#10;&#10;&#9659;Longeve Protein Crumbles | Discount Code: NATALIE&#10;https://www.longevebrands.com/shop/&#10;&#10;&#9659;Healthy baking mixes | Discount Code: NATALIE&#10;https://coconutwhisk.com&#10;&#10;&#9659;My favorites items from AMAZON:&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/influencer-814085a4&#10;&#10;&#9659;My favorite coffee:&#10;http://www.coffeeovercardio.com/discount/15fitveganchef&#10;&#10;&#9659;Angel Competition Bikinis | Discount Code: NATALIE &#10;http://bit.ly/2L4YqNy&#10;&#10;&#9659;Protan | Discount Code: Natalie20&#10;https://protanusa.com&#10;&#10;&#9659;Gallon Gear | Discount code: NatalieM&#10;http://bit.ly/2sok3A&#10;&#10;&#9659;Strength Shop | Discount code: Natalie&#10; http://www.strengthshopusa.com?aff=91&#10;&#10;&#9829;FAQ&#9829;&#10;&#10;Q: How long have you been vegan? &#10;A: 7 years vegan, vegetarian before that.&#10;&#10;Q: How tall are you?&#10;A: 5'3&#10;&#10;Q: Do you do coaching?&#10;A: I&#8217;m extremely grateful that you want to work with me.  Unfortunately, at this time, I do not provide coaching services.  If I was going to be responsible for the success of others, I would want my full attention to be devoted to them.   Currently, I am extremely focused on my upcoming cookbook and my own goals and not in a position to dedicate that time to someone else&#8217;s journey. Maybe in the future."
