  node [
    id 6582
    label "ihG0E_4_tCM"
    step 1
    date "2014-03-20T05:04:12Z"
    title "How to Do Scissor Lifts | Abs Workout"
    description "Ab Workout for Women! Sexy Six-Pack Playlist https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZJQ-AV3HRBo&#38;list=PLLALQuK1NDrh-WzJhsFQ_j9o-cUdspF3E&#10;&#10;I'm going to demonstrate how to do scissor lifts now which  are  similar  to&#10;leg drops. But I'm going to demonstrate on my back. You want  to  make  sure&#10;your abs are engaged,  your back is flat against  the  floor  and  your  rib&#10;cage is down. Hands are going be be down by your side. Your legs  are  going&#10;to be bent at 90 degrees.  &#10;&#10;So if you want to  keep  them  bent  you're  more&#10;than welcome to. What you're going  to  do  is  you're  going  to  alternate&#10;bringing your right and your left, up and down. &#10;&#10;Up  and  down.  Now  if  you&#10;want to make this harder you have a couple options. You can straighten  your&#10;legs and then scissor from here which is a lot more difficult. But you  want&#10;to make sure your not getting so much hip flexor that it's interfering  with&#10;your abs. So if you're feeling this here rather than here  then  just  bring&#10;your legs up a little higher and scissor from there.  &#10;&#10;If  you're  still  not&#10;feeling like this is challenging enough go ahead  and  drop  your  legs  and&#10;scissor from here. But again if it's going into your hip flexors  then  just&#10;make sure your legs are a little higher. You want to make sure your back  is&#10;completely flat the whole time and  your  breathing  is  in  sync  with  the&#10;scissoring. And that's how you do scissor lifts."
    channel_title "Howcast"
    channel_id "UCSpVHeDGr9UbREhRca0qwsA"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
    duration NAN
  ]
  node [
    id 6583
    label "WTmnP0xIdq8"
    step 1
    date "2019-12-10T23:55:40Z"
    title "How To Do A Proper V Sit Up - FREE Flat Tummy Guide"
    description "Flat Tummy Guide - Free Guide Download&#10;https://www.mindpumpmedia.com/flat-tummy-guide?__hstc=36882303.dd386afc2cd883be1e350bc077e12caf.1579979367672.1582136950298.1582141687752.18&#38;__hssc=36882303.1.1582141687752&#38;__hsfp=224627223&#10;&#10;Welcome back to Mind Pump TV where we cover all things Health &#38; Fitness to help you on your journey to reach your goals! &#10;&#10;In today&#8217;s video, Serene demonstrates how to properly do a V sit up. With this exercise it is very easy to use your low back and hip flexors instead of your abs if you are unsure how to do the exercise. &#10;&#10;Controlling Lower Trunk 1:40&#10;- Lift legs up&#10;- Squeeze knees &#38; ankles together&#10;- Press low back against the floor&#10;- Inhale down&#10;- Exhale up&#10;- Focus on controlling leg lifts with your core&#10;&#10;Bending From Your Spine 2:33&#10;- Lift legs up&#10;- Squeeze knees &#38; ankles together&#10;- Raise arms overhead&#10;- Slowly lift up&#10;    - Bring your arms in front over your legs&#10;    - Keep your arms straight &#10;- Use core to find &#38; hold balance at the top&#10;&#10;V Sit Up 3:35&#10;- Legs and arms stretched out long&#10;    - Palms facing in&#10;    - Knees together&#10;    - Ankles together&#10;- Deep breath (Inhale)&#10;- (Exhale) Lift arms, chest , &#38; legs together&#10;- Hold in a V position with hands pointing towards feet&#10;- Slowly return back to the floor&#10;    - Keep legs hovering if you can&#10;&#10;Thank you to Serene for filming this video, be sure to check out her instagram here:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/mindful_axis/?hl=en&#10;&#10;Free Resources Including Fitness Guides &#38; MORE:&#10;https://www.mindpumpmedia.com/free-resources?__hstc=36882303.df9f798e6994b5fec11ecfc7ed697635.1570572452412.1570572452412.1570572452412.1&#38;__hssc=36882303.1.1570572452413&#38;__hsfp=3098218544&#10;&#10;If you liked this video, be sure to check these out!&#10;&#10;How To Progress Your Abdominal Workouts&#10;https://youtu.be/ncTdrToPoEw&#10;&#10;Core Stability Workout Series On A Foam Roller (TRY THIS)&#10;https://youtu.be/QvvOHJ_L9oI&#10;&#10;LIKE this video if you learned something new!&#10;COMMENT below what topic you want us to cover next!&#10;SUBSCRIBE for more valuable fitness content!&#10;&#10;#MindPumpTV #VSitUp&#10;Subscribe to Mind Pump TV - https://goo.gl/h44uXg&#10;&#10;CONNECT WITH US:&#10;INSTAGRAM: http://bit.ly/mindpumpmedia&#10;TWITTER: http://bit.ly/2vN1qpE&#10;FACEBOOK: http://bit.ly/2vq95cd&#10;&#10;SHOP MIND PUMP:&#10;http://bit.ly/2uvQY6b&#10;&#10;PRIVATE FACEBOOK GROUP:&#10;http://bit.ly/2vuntia&#10;&#10;PODCAST:&#10;iTUNES - http://apple.co/2vMEPcA&#10;STITCHER - http://bit.ly/2hQSIAS"
