    title "HOW TO GET A BIGGER BUTTOCKS WITH SQUATS!! | CHINACANDYCOUTURE FITNESS"
    description "FAQ: How long did it take? IT TOOK ABOUT 4 MONTHS.&#10;This is what I do, what works for ME, if you need a PROFESSIONAL you can find a trainer or doctor. THIS IS WHAT AND HOW I DO IT! I recently lost about 20lbs and in losing weight I lost some weight from my buttocks, but I was able to increase the size of my butt by doing these squat exercises using dumbbells to add extra resistance.  &#10;&#10;Thanks for watching my BIGGER BUTT WITH SQUATS video, it definitely looks better in HD! Please THUMBS UP if u like, comment, and SUBSCRIBE :)  I am not a fitness professional, these are my PERSONAL exercises. I normally workout at home and these are the exercises I do in the comfort of my own home. *Disclaimer - If you need a professional please find a trainer and/or doctor. Style is about expressing who you are through fashion, don't be afraid to express yourself!&#10;&#10;BUTT LIFTER GARMENT&#10;http://chinacandycouture.bigcartel.com/category/workout-gear-and-body-garments&#10;&#10;&#10;GET YOUR OWN &#34;WORKOUT AINT NOBODY GOT TIME 4 FAT&#34; T-SHIRT&#10;http://CHINACANDYCOUTURE.BIGCARTEL.CO...&#10;&#10;MORE ON MY HEALTH &#38; FITNESS&#10;http://www.chinacandycouture.com/p/china-renees-health-fitness.html&#10;&#10;http://www.chinacandycouture.bigcartel.com&#10;&#10;WEIGHT LOSS JOURNEY UPDATE&#10;http://youtu.be/hcLlifYWeWg&#10;&#10;HOW I LOST MY BELLY FAT&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mgufLF...&#10;&#10;WEIGHT LOSS MOTIVATION&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1HB3Nz...&#10;&#10;MY HAIR&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RrQwK9g2lUQ&#10;&#10;MY LAST OOTDs&#10;http://youtu.be/O3R-0iRKMKA&#10;http://youtu.be/Hq__Q-a-wo4&#10;http://youtu.be/voOBbJQwFGM&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mk4VeH...&#10;&#10;DRAW MY LIFE TAG&#10;http://youtu.be/RMZoLLC0LrQ&#10;&#10;http://www.chinacandycouture.com&#10;http://www.twitter.com/chinacandyco&#10;Instagram @IamChinaRenee&#10;&#10;&#10;Facebook - http://www.facebook.com/pages/ChinaCa... ChinaCandyCouture is a channel based on beauty, fashion, and health. This channel is not just about outer beauty but more about inner beauty,loving yourself regardless of any flaws. I love fashion that won't break the bank, so my look books and style videos are perfect for any fashionista on a budget. Living a healthy lifestyle was a choice I made and I am here to share my journey, and I'm enjoying life just being ME...China Renee!&#10;I'm a firm believer in positivity, keeping a positive attitude not only keeps you happy but healthy!&#10;businessinquiries@thecollective-la.com&#10;Please SUBSCRIBE to my channel, you'll love me lol! https://www.youtube.com/user/ChinaCandyCouture/videos?sort=dd&#38;view=0&#38;shelf_id=7"
