  node [
    id 6607
    label "JRtrshTvftQ"
    step 1
    date "2022-04-14T12:38:21Z"
    title "30 MINUTE LOWER BODY BARBELL WORKOUT | Follow Along"
    description "30 minute lower body barbell workout that you can do in your home gym only requires a barbell and plates. This is a leg workout not to miss!&#10;&#10;This follow along lower body workout has 2 sections. Section A includes heavier barbell leg exercises &#38; Section B involves light barbell exercises for legs and abs.&#10;&#10;5MIN WARM UP https://youtu.be/t3bQvVOXPiE&#10;SUBSCRIBE https://www.youtube.com/TomPetoTraining&#10;12 WEEK BARBELL E-BOOK https://www.tompetotraining.com/store/p/the-barbell-plan&#10;&#10;LEVEL UP YOUR HOME GYM (Recommended kit)&#10;UK Barbells - https://shrsl.com/373in&#10;UK Plates - https://shrsl.com/373is&#10;UK Squat Racks - http://shrsl.com/35qne&#10;&#10;USA Barbells https://shrsl.com/3fsh0&#10;USA Bumper Plates https://shrsl.com/3fshs&#10;USA Squat Racks https://shrsl.com/3fsfx&#10;&#10;E-BOOK WORKOUT PLANS - Coming soon (release date May 2022)&#10;INSTAGRAM - https://www.instagram.com/tompetotraining/&#10;&#10;THE WORKOUT&#10;Section A |  40:15 | 3 Rounds (I used 40kg/90lb)&#10;A1. Back Squat&#10;A2. Deadlift&#10;A3. Calf Raises&#10;A4. Glute Bridges&#10;A5. Sumo Deadlift&#10;30sec&#10;&#10;Section B | 40:15 | 3 Rounds (I used 25kg/55lb)&#10;B1. Front Squat&#10;B2. Good Morning&#10;B3. Reverse Lunges&#10;B4. Alternating Single Leg RDL&#10;B5. Barbell Leg Raises&#10;30sec&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;To join in these exercises, you must be in good physical health. If you&#8217;ve been told for any health or medical reason that you should not take part in physical activity/sport, then you should not take part in this workout. When participating in any physical exercise, there is a possibility of physical injury. If you engage in these exercises, you agree that you do so at your own risk and assume all risk of injury to yourself. &#10;&#10;Timestamps&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:31 Section A&#10;15:30 Section B&#10;29:46 Outro&#10;&#10;*Affiliate links are included within this video description."
    channel_title "Tom Peto Training"
    channel_id "UCdEKcVwsB2-cEyCv4EEXz4w"
