  node [
    id 6609
    label "0wxywq-Q3Ao"
    step 1
    date "2022-04-05T20:51:43Z"
    title "30 MINUTE UPPER BODY BARBELL WORKOUT | Follow Along"
    description "30 minute upper body barbell workout that can be done as a follow along at home or in the gym and only requires a barbell and plates. &#10;&#10;This upper body workout has 2 sections. Section A includes barbell exercises suitable for a heavier barbell. Section B involves barbell exercises for a lighter barbell.&#10;&#10;5MIN WARM UP - https://youtu.be/t3bQvVOXPiE&#10;SUBSCRIBE TO CHANNEL https://www.youtube.com/TomPetoTraining&#10;&#10;LEVEL UP YOUR HOME GYM (Recommended Items)&#10;UK Barbells - https://shrsl.com/373in&#10;UK Plates - https://shrsl.com/373is&#10;UK Wrist Strap/Support - https://amzn.to/3oVKGqL&#10;&#10;USA Barbells https://shrsl.com/3fsh0&#10;USA Bumper Plates https://shrsl.com/3fshs&#10;USA Wrist Wrap/Supports - https://shrsl.com/3fsel&#10;&#10;12 WEEK BARBELL E-BOOK https://www.tompetotraining.com/store/p/the-barbell-plan&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM - https://www.instagram.com/tompetotraining/&#10;&#10;THE WORKOUT&#10;Section A |  40:15 | 3 Rounds (I used 40kg/90lb)&#10;A1. Push Press&#10;A2. High Pull&#10;A3. Floor Press&#10;A4. Pendlay Row&#10;A5. Leg Raises&#10;30sec&#10;&#10;Section B | 40:15 | 3 Rounds (I used 25kg/55lb)&#10;B1. Bicep Curl&#10;B2. Strict Press&#10;B3. Underhand Bent Over Row&#10;B4. Barbell Ab Rollout&#10;B5. Barbell Reaching Crunch&#10;30sec&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;To join in these exercises, you must be in good physical health. If you&#8217;ve been told for any health or medical reason that you should not take part in physical activity/sport, then you should not take part in this workout. When participating in any physical exercise, there is a possibility of physical injury. If you engage in these exercises, you agree that you do so at your own risk and assume all risk of injury to yourself. &#10;&#10;Timestamps&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:31 Section A&#10;15:30 Section B&#10;29:46 Outro&#10;&#10;*Affiliate links are included within this video description."
