    title "45 MINUTE BARBELL WORKOUT with EMOM FINISHER"
    description "Join me for a 45 minute barbell workout at home. This is a barbell follow along workout gives you a 45min full body workout that you can you at your home gym.&#10;&#10;Starting with a 5min barbell warm up we move onto Section A (heavy barbell compound exercises), then Section B (Moderate weight barbell exercises), finally finishing with a 12min barbell EMOM workout.&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE TO CHANNEL https://www.youtube.com/TomPetoTraining&#10;12 WEEK BARBELL E-BOOK https://www.tompetotraining.com/store/p/the-barbell-plan&#10;&#10;LEVEL UP YOUR HOME GYM (Recommended Items)&#10;UK Barbells - https://shrsl.com/373in&#10;UK Plates - https://shrsl.com/373is&#10;UK Squat Rack/Stands - http://shrsl.com/35qne&#10;&#10;USA Barbells https://shrsl.com/3fsh0&#10;USA Bumper Plates https://shrsl.com/3fshs&#10;USA Squat Rack/Stands https://shrsl.com/3fsfx&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM - https://www.instagram.com/tompetotraining/&#10;&#10;THE WORKOUT&#10;Warm Up | 30sec Each | 2 Rounds&#10;- Good Mornings&#10;- Strict Press&#10;- Pause Squats&#10;- Alt R Lunge&#10;- Spiderman Lunge&#10;&#10;Section A |  40:20 | 3 Rounds (I used 50kg/110lb)&#10;A1. Barbell Reverse Lunges&#10;A2. Back Squat&#10;A3. Deadlift&#10;A4. Calf Raises&#10;30sec&#10;&#10;Section B | 40:20 | 3 Rounds (I used 40kg/90lb)&#10;B1. Floor Press&#10;B2. RDL to Underhand Bent Over Row&#10;B3. Barbell Leg Raises&#10;B4. Barbell Pendlay Row&#10;30sec&#10;&#10;Section C | 12min EMOM (I used 40kg/90lb)&#10;MIN 1. 10r Front Squat&#10;MIN 2. 8r Power Clean&#10;MIN 3. 6r Push Press&#10;REPEAT&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;To join in these exercises, you must be in good physical health. If you&#8217;ve been told for any health or medical reason that you should not take part in physical activity/sport, then you should not take part in this workout. When participating in any physical exercise, there is a possibility of physical injury. If you engage in these exercises, you agree that you do so at your own risk and assume all risk of injury to yourself. &#10;&#10;*Affiliate links are included within this video description."
