    title "10 BEST CABLE PULLEY SYSTEM EXERCISES"
    description "Give my 10 best cable pulley system exercises a try in your home gym and let me know how you find them in comments (also known as lat and lift pulley system).&#10;&#10;This cheap cable machine alternative can be used is many ways. Included in this video are some ideas for cable pulley system bicep exercises as well as exercises for many other muscle groups. using various cable attachments linked below.&#10;&#10;IMPROVE YOUR HOME GYM (My Recommended)&#10;UK Cable Pulley System (as seen in video 1.8m cable + attachments) https://amzn.to/3rVwEEi&#10;UK Lat Pull Down Attachments https://shrsl.com/3fsja&#10;&#10;USA Cable Pulley System (1.8-2.2m cables + Attachments) https://amzn.to/3a6SmP5&#10;USA Cable Attachments (Tricep Rope / Lat Pulldown Bar) https://shrsl.com/3fsj5&#10;&#10;(AMAZON UK) Extras:&#10;CABLE PULLEY SYSTEM (2.0M CABLE + PIN LOADED + ATTACHMENT) https://amzn.to/2M2LkSW&#10;ROPE ATTACHMENT + CARABINER https://amzn.to/3dj3ECs&#10;STRAIGHT BAR WITH SWIVEL https://amzn.to/3jVmPDA&#10;OLYMPIC PLATE LOADING PIN https://amzn.to/3au0fil&#10;1.5-3.0 METRE CABLE ONLY https://amzn.to/2ZoGqCH&#10;&#10;Timestamps&#10;0:00 Single Arm Lat Pulldown&#10;0:36 Cable Tricep Pushdown&#10;0:59 Cable Crucifix Curl&#10;1:35 High Low Crossover Cable Fly&#10;2:29 Cable Crunch&#10;3:11 Face Pull&#10;3:40 Straight Arm Lat Pulldown&#10;4:11 Cable Woodchop&#10;4:56 Lat Pulldown&#10;5: 24 Lying Cable Spider Curl&#10;5:59 Outro&#10;&#10; &#10;Disclaimer&#10;Before starting any  exercises make sure you are in good physical health. If you&#8217;ve been told for any health or medical reason that you should not take part in physical activity/sport, then you should not take part in this workout. When participating in any physical exercise, there is a possibility of physical injury. If you engage in these exercises, you agree that you do so at your own risk and assume all risk of injury to yourself. &#10;&#10;*Affiliate links are included within this video description."
