    title "30MIN SHOULDER AND ARMS DUMBBELL WORKOUT | Follow Along"
    description "Follow along with this 30min shoulder and arms dumbbell workout at home or in the gym. &#10;&#10;This home dumbbell workout gives an awesome shoulder, bicep and tricep pump using only dumbbells. This upper body workout is great for developing muscle strength and definition in the shoulder and arms.&#10;&#10;5MIN WARM UP - https://youtu.be/t3bQvVOXPiE&#10;SUBSCRIBE https://www.youtube.com/TomPetoTraining&#10;&#10;EQUIPMENT FOR THIS WORKOUT (I used 12.5kg/27lb &#38; 7kg/15lb DB's)&#10;- Heavy + light pair dumbbells or adjustable&#10;&#10;GET KITTED OUT&#10;UK Hex Dumbbells - https://shrsl.com/37iey&#10;UK Adjustable Dumbbells - https://shrsl.com/3c22w&#10;&#10;USA Hex Dumbbells - https://shrsl.com/3fse5&#10;USA Adjustable Dumbbells - https://amzn.to/3zCGHDt&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM - https://www.instagram.com/tompetotraining/&#10;&#10;THE WORKOUT&#10;Section A | 40:15 | 3 Rounds&#10;A1. Alternating Strict Press&#10;A2. Alternating Hammer Curl&#10;A3. Upright Row&#10;A4. Single Dumbbell Overhead Tricep Extension&#10;A5. Neutral Grip Push Press&#10;&#10;Section B | 40:15 | 3 Rounds&#10;B1. Bent Over W Raise&#10;B2. In Out Bicep Curl&#10;B3. Lateral Raise&#10;B4. Skull Crusher&#10;B5. Drag Curl&#10;&#10;Timecodes&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:31 Section A Heavier Dumbbells&#10;15:32 Section B Lighter Dumbbells&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;To join in these exercises, you must be in good physical health. If you&#8217;ve been told for any health or medical reason that you should not take part in physical activity/sport, then you should not take part in this workout. When participating in any physical exercise, there is a possibility of physical injury. If you engage in these exercises, you agree that you do so at your own risk and assume all risk of injury to yourself. &#10;&#10;*Affiliate links are included within this video description."
