    title "45MIN FULL BODY DUMBBELL WORKOUT | FOLLOW ALONG"
    description "Try this 45minute follow along full body dumbbell workout you can do at home. This home workout is best done with a few pairs different weight pairs of dumbbells or one adjustable pair. This 45min workout includes a warm up, a heavy &#38; light dumbbell section and finished with a dumbbell AMRAP.&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE https://www.youtube.com/TomPetoTraining&#10;&#10;EQUIPMENT FOR THIS WORKOUT(I used 17.5kg/39lb &#38; 10kg/22lb DB's)&#10;- Dumbbells (heavy + light pair or adjustable)&#10;&#10;GET KITTED OUT&#10;UK Hex Dumbbells - https://shrsl.com/37iey&#10;UK Adjustable Dumbbells - https://shrsl.com/3c22w&#10;&#10;USA Hex Dumbbells - https://shrsl.com/3fse5&#10;USA Adjustable Dumbbells - https://amzn.to/3zCGHDt&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM - https://www.instagram.com/tompetotraining/&#10;&#10;THE WORKOUT&#10;Warm Up | 2 Rounds | 30sec Each&#10;- Kang Squat&#10;- Inch Worm&#10;- Spiderman Lunge&#10;- Prone Overheads&#10;- Downward Dog Toe Taps&#10;&#10;Section A | 40:20 | 3 Rounds&#10;A1. Alternating Single Db Snatch&#10;A2. Goblet Pause Squat&#10;A3. Single Dumbbell Sprinter Lunge&#10;A4. RDL to Bent Over Row&#10;&#10;Section B | 40:20 | 3 Rounds&#10;B1. Hammer Curl to Classic Curl Negative&#10;B2. Z Press&#10;B3. Skull Crusher&#10;B4. Leg Raise&#10;&#10;12min AMRAP (I used 15kg / 33lb DB's)&#10;C1. 12 Hang Clean&#10;C2. 10 2x DB Front Squat&#10;C3. 8/leg Alternating Reverse Lunges&#10;C4. 6 Push Press&#10;Repeat&#10;&#10;Timecodes&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:15 Warm Up&#10;5:32 Section A Heavier Dumbbells&#10;18:33 Section B Lighter Dumbbells&#10;31:33 Section C AMRAP&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;To join in these exercises, you must be in good physical health. If you&#8217;ve been told for any health or medical reason that you should not take part in physical activity/sport, then you should not take part in this workout. When participating in any physical exercise, there is a possibility of physical injury. If you engage in these exercises, you agree that you do so at your