    date "2022-06-30T18:41:57Z"
    title "30MIN BARBELL STRENGTH WORKOUT | FOLLOW ALONG"
    description "Join me for this follow along 30min barbell strength workout. This is a barbell workout for reps focuses on building strength with a barbell.&#10;&#10;This 30 minute full body barbell workout includes a wide variety of barbell strength exercises to help you develop a strong, athletic physique.&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE https://www.youtube.com/TomPetoTraining&#10;12 WEEK BARBELL E-BOOK https://www.tompetotraining.com/store/p/the-barbell-plan&#10;&#10;THIS WORKOUT (I used Section A. 60kg/132lb | Section B. 45kg/99lb | Section C. 25kg/55lb) &#10;Equipment needed; Barbell + Plates + Squat Rack or Stands&#10;&#10;LEVEL UP YOUR HOME GYM (Recommended Items)&#10;UK Barbells - https://shrsl.com/373in&#10;UK Plates - https://shrsl.com/373is&#10;UK Squat Rack/Stands - http://shrsl.com/35qne&#10;&#10;USA Barbells https://shrsl.com/3fsh0&#10;USA Bumper Plates https://shrsl.com/3fshs&#10;USA Squat Rack/Stands https://shrsl.com/3fsfx&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM - https://www.instagram.com/tompetotraining/&#10;&#10;THE WORKOUT&#10;Warm Up | 30sec Each | 2 Rounds&#10;- Strict Press&#10;- RDL&#10;- Overhead March&#10;- Alt Reverse Lunges&#10;- Pause Back Squats&#10;&#10;Section A | 3 Rounds&#10;A1. Back Squat 10r&#10;A2. RDL 8r&#10;A3. Floor Press 6r&#10;60sec&#10;&#10;Section B | 3 Rounds&#10;B1. Front Squat 10r&#10;B2. Barbell Bent Over Row 8r&#10;B3. Strict Press 6r (or Push Press)&#10;60sec&#10;&#10;Section C | 3 Rounds&#10;C1. Barbell Split Squat 10r/side&#10;C2. Barbell Bicep Curl 8r&#10;C3. Barbell Wipers 6/side&#10;60sec&#10;&#10;Timecodes&#10;0.00 Intro&#10;0:34 Warm Up&#10;5:49 Section A&#10;15:40 Section B&#10;24:04 Section C&#10;33:58 Outro&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;To join in these exercises, you must be in good physical health. If you&#8217;ve been told for any health or medical reason that you should not take part in physical activity/sport, then you should not take part in this workout. When participating in any physical exercise, there is a possibility of physical injury. If you engage in these exercises, you agree that you do so at your own risk and assume all risk of injury to yourself. &#10;&#10;*Affiliate links are included within this video description."
