    title "30 MINUTE CHEST AND BICEP DUMBBELL WORKOUT"
    description "Try this dumbbell Chest and Bicep workout you can do at home or in the gym. This 30 minute follow along dumbbell and bench workout supersets the best dumbbell chest exercises with dumbbell bicep exercises for an awesome home workout.&#10;&#10;5MIN WARM UP - https://youtu.be/t3bQvVOXPiE&#10;SUBSCRIBE https://www.youtube.com/TomPetoTraining&#10;&#10;EQUIPMENT NEEDED FOR THIS WORKOUT&#10;- Dumbbells (heavy + light pair or adjustable)&#10;- Adjustable Bench&#10;&#10;GET KITTED OUT&#10;UK Hex Dumbbells - https://shrsl.com/37iey&#10;UK Adjustable Bench - https://shrsl.com/3e1eb&#10;UK Adjustable Dumbbells - https://shrsl.com/3c22w&#10;&#10;USA Hex Dumbbells - https://shrsl.com/3fse5&#10;USA Adjustable Bench - https://shrsl.com/3fsee&#10;USA Adjustable Dumbbells - https://amzn.to/3zCGHDt&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM - https://www.instagram.com/tompetotraining/&#10;&#10;THE WORKOUT&#10;Section A | 40:15 | 3 Rounds (I used 17.5kg / 39lb DB's)&#10;A1. Incline Dumbbell Bench Press&#10;A2. Waiter Curl&#10;A3. Flat Dumbbell Bench Press&#10;A4. Hammer Curl&#10;A5. Jammer Press&#10;&#10;Section A | 40:15 | 3 Rounds (I used 9kg / 20lb DB's)&#10;B1. Incline Dumbbell Chest Fly&#10;A2. Prone Spider Curl&#10;A3. Alternating Cross Body Standing Fly&#10;A4. Seated Incline Bicep Curl&#10;A5. Dumbbell Pullover&#10;&#10;Timecodes&#10;0:00 Welcome&#10;0:31 30 minute Chest and Bicep Dumbbell Workout&#10;29:42 Outro&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;To join in these exercises, you must be in good physical health. If you&#8217;ve been told for any health or medical reason that you should not take part in physical activity/sport, then you should not take part in this workout. When participating in any physical exercise, there is a possibility of physical injury. If you engage in these exercises, you agree that you do so at your own risk and assume all risk of injury to yourself. &#10;&#10;*Affiliate links are included within this video description."
