    description "Join me for a 10min bodyweight glute workout at home with no gym equipment, just an exercise mat and a couch or bench. These Glute exercises are great for glute development and easy to follow along to at home and gives an effective workout in just 10 minutes.&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE https://www.youtube.com/TomPetoTraining&#10;&#10;GET KITTED OUT&#10;UK Thick Yoga/Ab Mat - https://shrsl.com/3f7uj&#10;UK Adjustable Bench - https://shrsl.com/3e1eb&#10;USA Thick Yoga/Ab Mat - https://amzn.to/3CDBvkk&#10;USA Adjustable Bench - https://amzn.to/353x0CS&#10;&#10;THE WORKOUT&#10;2 Rounds | 30sec/Exercise&#10;1. Single Leg Glute Bridge&#10;2. Other Side&#10;3. Double Drop Squats&#10;4. Bulgarian Split Squat&#10;5. Other Side&#10;6. Half Side Plank Abduction&#10;7. Other Side&#10;Rest 30sec&#10;&#10;JOIN ME ON INSTAGRAM - https://www.instagram.com/tompetotraining/&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;To join in these exercises, you must be in good physical health. If you&#8217;ve been told for any health or medical reason that you should not take part in physical activity/sport, then you should not take part in this workout. When participating in any physical exercise, there is a possibility of physical injury. If you engage in these exercises, you agree that you do so at your own risk and assume all risk of injury to yourself. &#10;&#10;*Affiliate links are included within this video description."
