    title "THE PERFECT LEGS &#38; GLUTES WORKOUT FOR WOMEN AND BEGINNERS (AT HOME OR GYM)"
    description "Grow you glutes! Join my challenge starting May 9: https://www.masvida.io/challenge/&#10;I want to be your coach for 45 days.&#10;Let's get it! &#128074;&#10;************************************************&#10;&#10;Welcome to the &#8220;Legs For Days&#8221; series. &#10;&#10;This routine focuses on simple, yet effective supersets to help you build and sculpt your lower half. &#10;&#10;Perform this routine twice a week.&#10;&#10;if you liked this workout become a MAwarrior and sign up for my #MA45DAY on my website . &#10;&#10;This program focuses on building muscle, strength, and decreasing body fat (I.e growing glutes, shaping, and helping you tone by changing your body composition).&#10;&#10;Website: www.MassyArias.com &#10;&#10;For My Supplements: www.gettrusupps.com&#10;&#10;Follow Me Here:&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/massy.arias&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/manko.fit/&#10;TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@massy.arias&#10;&#10;#massyarias #mawarriors #masvida&#10;&#10;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#10;&#10;Esta rutina se enfoca en superconjuntos simples pero super efectivos para fortalecer tus piernas. Como resultado  crecer tus gl&#250;teos, tonificar los m&#250;sculos de tus piernas. Realiza esta rutina dos veces por semana.&#10;&#10;Superconjunto: un ejercicio hecho despu&#233;s de otro con poco o sin ning&#250;n descanso entre ejercicios. Realizaras cada super conjunto 3 veces por 12 repeticiones por pierna o por movimiento."
