  node [
    id 6652
    label "iNNsLYog7RQ"
    step 1
    date "2021-01-24T07:27:13Z"
    title "7 Best Glute Exercises for Men (science-based)"
    description "With so many different glute videos out there on Instagram, it&#8217;s very hard to know what exercises are the best for growing your glute muscles.&#10;&#10;The truth is, most of the exercises you see on social media are not going to effectively train your glutes.&#10;&#10;In this video, I&#8217;m going to show you the 7 best exercises for men to build strong, athletic glute muscles.&#10;&#10;But before we get into these exercises, let&#8217;s first discuss why you should be prioritizing your glute training&#8230;&#10;&#10;To put it simply, the glutes are involved in every athletic movement you can think of.. from jumping to climbing and even sprinting.&#10;&#10;In fact, one study published in the Strength and Conditioning Journal found that the glutes are even more important than the quads when it comes to sprinting. That also explains why you&#8217;ll hardly ever see an Olympic sprinter with a flat butt.&#10;&#10;Not only that, but according to spine health expert, Dr. Stuart McGill, our modern lifestyle has led us to develop a motor pattern known as &#8220;gluteal amnesia&#8221;. If you&#8217;re not careful, this can and will lead to severe knee and back pain.&#10;&#10;Bottom line, if you really care about maximizing your performance in the gym, while living a pain free life, you need to implement these exercises. &#10; &#10;[THUMBNAIL IMAGE CREDIT] THE GLUTE GOD&#10;https://www.instagram.com/theglutegod/&#10;&#10;[MASS-5 FULL BODY] HIGH FREQUENCY FULL BODY WORKOUT &#10;&#10140; https://tinyurl.com/y6te9ppo&#10;&#10;[SUPPLEMENTS] SCIENCE-BASED SUPPLEMENTS THAT WORK! &#10;&#10140; https://tinyurl.com/yyxtqrls&#10;&#10;[FREE BOOK] CLAIM YOUR FREE COPY OF BULK UP FAST! &#10;&#10140; https://tinyurl.com/yypotjjf&#10;&#10;[SHREDDED-12] SCIENCE-BASED FAT LOSS PROGRAM &#10;&#10140; https://tinyurl.com/y493x3uj&#10;&#10;FOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM: &#10;&#10140; http://www.instagram.com/musclemonsters &#10;&#10;References &#10;1. https://journals.lww.com/nsca-scj/fulltext/2011/04000/a_comparison_of_the_various_methods_used_to.10.aspx&#10;2. https://www.backfitpro.com/pdf/selecting_back_exercises.pdf&#10;3. https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26214739/&#10;4. https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31191088/&#10;5. https://www.thieme-connect.de/products/ejournals/abstract/10.1055/a-1082-1126&#10;6. https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/24149748&#10;7. https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/10912892/&#10;8. https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/11932579/&#10;9. https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/1758295/&#10;10. https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26252837/&#10;11. https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/11767248/&#10;12. https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/12173958/&#10;13. https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26252837/&#10;14. https://journals.lww.com/nsca-jscr/Fulltext/2016/02000/Unilateral_vs__Bilateral_Squat_Training_for.12.aspx&#10;15. https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/24560168/"
