    date "2021-07-07T22:50:44Z"
    title "how i grew my booty *GLUTE &#38; HAMMY ROUTINE* | gym series"
    description "this is my first type of video like this so be nice pls ! reminder: I AM NOT A PROFESSIONAL! i hope u guys enjoy, more gym vids to come!&#10;&#10;*SOMETHING I FORGOT TO MENTION: FOOD IS FUEL!! YOU CANNOT GROW MUSCLE W/O EATING*&#10;to help: eat foods HIGH in protein! and do not skip meals!!&#10;&#10;THE WORKOUT IN THIS VIDEO:&#10;warm up: &#10;- 5 min incline walk&#10;- dynamic stretching &#10;- glute band activation &#10;* 10 side abductions each leg&#10;* 10 kick backs each leg&#10;* 20 crab walks &#10;* 10 glute bridge + abductions&#10;&#10;1. BB(bar w plates) RDL 4 x 8-10&#10;    1b. plate wide rdl 4x15&#10;2. BB hip thrusts 3 x 20&#10;     2b. DB sumo squat 3 x 12-15&#10;3. 4x 12 sumo deadlifts to sumo squat w/ dumbbell &#10;4. SL BB RDL 4 x 10&#10;     4b. DB bulgarian 4 x 10&#10;5. leg curl 2 x 8   2 x 20&#10;6. suitcase jumps 4 x 10&#10;      6b. suitcase pulses 4 x 10&#10;&#10;waist trainer: https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083FQMGTZ/ref=cm_sw_r_cp_apip_42RN2IZE2kvgA&#10;&#10;lifting gloves: https://www.walmart.com/ip/Lumintrail-Half-Finger-Sports-Exercise-Gloves-Anti-Slip-Gel-Padding-Wrist-Wrap-Mens-Womens-Breathable-Lycra-Washable-Weight-Lifting-Fitness-Cycling/706207281&#10;&#10;booty bands: https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LB4Y5KR/ref=cm_sw_r_cp_apip_g8lv49XrmYXkf&#10;&#10;FOR BUSINESS INQURIES: susie@mehrmgmt.com&#10;MY NEW INSTAGRAM IS @susiebarroeta.2 !!!!!&#10;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#10;Please consider signing some petitions linked down below &#38; educating yourselves:&#10;&#10;&#11015;&#65039;&#8252;&#65039;PROTECT ASIAN LIVES INFO&#8252;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#10;https://linktr.ee/stopaapihate&#10;https://stopasianhate.carrd.co/&#8203;&#10;https://asianawarenessproject.carrd.co/&#10;&#10;Justice for Daunte Wright:https://www.change.org/p/j