    title "Virgin Voyages Cruise - Costa Maya Mexico - Bimini Bahamas"
    description "my favorite playlist to this beautiful trip. &#10;sometimes I cant believe what I see in My eyes so I capture It so I can appreciate those moments again and share it with you  &#10;I got to Celebrate my birthday with someone special on a cruise with Virgin  Voyages. &#10;I was so impressed how everything was so good. &#10;There is so much to do on the ship. &#10;The food was amazing even for us plants based living :).&#10;The Spa is one of the most beautiful one and one of the coolest experiences I got to do. I got to see a lot of hotels spa around the world. this one is one of my favorites  for sure.&#10; and to watch the sea while u are relaxing in the sauna was absolutory amazing  experience. &#10;I will have a Blog on my website with more information about the trip. &#10;If you have any questions please write bellow I will answer them on the BLOG.&#10;Thank you Juanito!"
