    date "2019-03-01T03:56:54Z"
    title "Dead Sea Israel"
    description "#drone #dji #crocs&#10;this is the first time that i am running since March2018&#10;On November 8th i ran for the first time in the Deas sea Israel&#10;&#10;Last March i started to have gout,  my joints swelled up and i wasnt able to walk for almost 8 months thank you Crocs for making the most comfortable shoes ever. this Crocs were the only shoes i was able to wear for almost a year. i could not have any shoes on from the pain but Crocs.&#10;https://www.shoes.com/&#10;This video clip is very is a reminder that no matter how hard it is we cant give up. i was suffering i was miserable i was crying at night from the pain, &#10;Feeling so happy and greatful today that i can walk and run again &#10;&#10;video by my amazing brother   Shlomi znati &#10;&#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/shlomiel06"
