    step 1
    date "2020-11-15T17:24:30Z"
    title "Extreme FAT BURNING Home CARDIO Workout | 20 min | High&#38;Low intensity"
    description "If you need to burn some extra calories and get your heart beat an extra boost than this workout is just right for you :)&#10;&#10;Not even swap we high impact exercises with low ones to be more gentle on the joints, we also change up the intensity to get maximum results of those 20 minutes :)&#10;&#10;Do not forget to warm up before you work out and stretch afterwards :)&#10;&#10;Make sure to subscribe to my channel, like this video and leave me a comment :)&#10;--------------------------------------------------&#10;Special thanks to www.pulsefitnessbenesov.cz for this beautiful place.&#10;--------------------------------------------------&#10;&#9829; My Social Media&#9829; &#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/eliskalaci/&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Ela-Laci-201...&#10;--------------------------------------------------&#10;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#10;Track: Future Disco &#8212; Vendredi [Audio Library Release]&#10;Music provided by Audio Library Plus&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/zW2bU3ZnL9Q&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://alplus.io/future-disco&#10;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#10;Skladba What True Self, Feels Bogus, Let's Watch Jason X interpreta Chris Zabriskie podl&#233;h&#225; licenci Creative Commons 4.0 (uveden&#237; zdroje). https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/&#10;Zdroj: http://chriszabriskie.com/reappear/&#10;Interpret: http://chriszabriskie.com/&#10;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8211;&#8