    title "CAN YOU GET STRONGER WHEN CUTTING? | Back Workout"
    description "In this video, I discuss the idea of getting stronger / gaining strength while in a fat loss phase / cutting, while going through a back workout.&#10;&#10;Think it's time for a Fitness Coach?&#10;Join me on the best Training &#38; Nutrition Coaching Platform &#128279; https://www.ShreddedForLife.com&#10;&#10;My free Ab Program &#128279; https://www.ShreddedForLife.com/vcut&#10;&#10;__________&#10;&#9201; TIMESTAMPS&#10;00:00 INTRO&#10;00:07 EXERCISE 1&#10;01:45 EXERCISE 2&#10;03:17 EXERCISE 3&#10;05:10 EXERCISE 4&#10;07:18 EXERCISE 5&#10;09:12 EXERCISE 6&#10;12:06 EXERCISE 7&#10;&#10;__________&#10;&#127947;&#127995;&#8205;&#9792;&#65039; WORKOUT&#10;&#10240;&#10;1&#65039;&#8419; DEADLIFT | 4 Sets, 5 Reps&#10;&#10004;&#65039; Last set is a back-off set&#10;&#10240;&#10;2&#65039;&#8419; LAT PULLDOWN | 3 Sets, 15 Reps&#10;&#10240;&#10;3&#65039;&#8419; STRAIGHT-ARM PUSHDOWN | 3 Sets, 20 Reps&#10;&#10240;&#10;4&#65039;&#8419; ALT. DUAL CABLE PULLDOWN | 3 Sets, 15 Reps&#10;&#10004;&#65039; Take last set to failure&#10;&#10240;&#10;5&#65039;&#8419; CABLE CURL | 3 Sets, 20 Reps&#10;&#10004;&#65039; Take last set to failure&#10;&#128071; Super-set with 6&#10;&#10240;&#10;6&#65039;&#8419; CABLE ROW | 3 Sets, 20 Reps&#10;&#10004;&#65039; Take last set to failure&#10;&#128070; Super-set with 5&#10;&#10240;&#10;7&#65039;&#8419; HAMMER CURL | 3 Sets, AMRAP&#10;&#10004;&#65039; Take last set to failure&#10;&#10240;&#10;&#10004;&#65039; Monitor rest in between sets. Take as much as needed, but not more.&#10;&#10004;&#65039; AMRAP = As many reps as possible&#10;&#10004;&#65039; Super-setting is switching between two exercises, resting after 1 set of each exercise.&#10;&#10;__________&#10;&#128104;&#8205;&#128105;&#8205;&#128103;&#8205;&#128102; MY TEAMS&#10;&#10;Core Nutritionals Supplements &#128279; https://www.corenutritionals.com&#10;&#128176; Code BRIAN to save 15%&#10;&#10;YoungLA Clothing &#128279; https://www.youngla.com&#10;&#128176; Code BRIAN to save 15%&#10;&#10;Done-For-You Meals &#128279; https://refer.prestigelabs.com/meals?...&#10;Free US Shipping&#10;&#10;__________&#10;&#128241; SOCIAL&#10;&#10;  INSTAGRAM | https://www.instagram.com/briandecosta&#10;  TWITCH | https://www.twitch.tv/briandecosta_&#10;  TIKTOK | https://www.tiktok.com/@briandecosta&#8203;&#8203;&#10;  TWITTER | https://twitter.com/briandecosta&#8203;&#10;  FACEBOOK | https://www.facebook.com/BrianDeCostaFit&#10;  SOUNDCLOUD | https://soundcloud.com/briandecosta&#10;  SPOTIFY | https://bit.ly/briandecostaplaylist&#10;&#10;#ShreddedForLife #NaturalBodyBuilding"
