    title "Cardio and Abs (to Get a Six Pack) | What You Need to Know | Zac Perna"
    description "Hey Guys, On today's video I run you through my cardio and abs routine, and talk about abs and cardio in relation to fat loss and revealing the six pack! &#10;&#10;AB ROUTINE: PERFORMED AS A Giant Set/Circuit. 4-5 ROUNDS (Doesn&#8217;t matter though, if you want to rest then do that). TWICE PER WEEK&#10;1A: Weighted Ab Crunch: 8 Reps&#10;1B: Regular Situps: 8 Reps&#10;1C: Partial Ab Crunch: Max Reps&#10;D: Hanging Leg Raise Variation (eg straight vs twisting at the top) : 12 Slow Reps&#10;E: Vacuum: 3 Minutes Total &#10;&#10;Ab Crunch Pad (Any Brand): https://www.amazon.com.au/s?k=ab+crunch+mat&#38;i=sporting&#38;ref=nb_sb_noss_2&#10;&#10;CARDIO ROUTINE: EitherOutdoors (45 Min Walk) or Indoor: 30 Mins of walking Intervals &#10;Low: 5kmh 12% Incline - 1 Minute&#10;High: 6kmh, 15% Incline- 1 minute or 1 Minute Farmers Walk&#10;&#10;Subscribe: (http://bit.ly/2x9fzgN), HIT THE NOTIFICATION BELL&#10;Check out my TopVideos! http://bit.ly/ZacPernaTopVideos&#10;&#10;Let Me Coach You and get your diet and training plan:&#160;https://www.jointhemassivefam.zacperna.com.au&#160;&#10;Shop EHPLabs Supplements:USE ZAC10 at&#160;https://www.ehplabs.com/Zac-Perna&#160;&#10;Shop Gymshark:&#160;https://gym.sh/Shop-Zac-Perna2&#10;-&#10;Follow Me&#10;Twitter: @zacperna&#10;Instagram: @zacperna (https://instagram.com/zacperna)&#10;Tik Tok: @zacperna&#10;Snapchat Me: zacperna&#160;&#10;Facebook:&#160;https://facebook.com/zacpernafitness&#10;-&#10; Cardio and Abs to Get a Six Pack | What You Need to Know | Zac Perna&#10;https://youtu.be/HYOx9-0mzlI&#10;#abs #ZacPerna&#10;&#10;About Zac Perna:&#10;&#10;I Love Food, Fitness and having a laugh!  Welcome To My Life!&#10;&#8226;24. Melbourne, Australia &#10;&#10;https://youtu.be/HYOx9-0mzlI&#10;&#10;Zac Perna&#10;https://www.youtube.com/zeepee4"
