    step 1
    date "2022-02-06T21:19:56Z"
    title "MY SUPPS TO INCREASE TESTOSTERONE | Delt Workout"
    description "In this video, I answer training, nutrition, supplementation, and personal questions asked on my Instagram a few days ago.&#10;&#10;To enter to win:&#10;1&#65039;&#8419; Comment on latest IG post @briandecosta&#10;2&#65039;&#8419; Follow @corenutritionals&#10;&#10240;&#10;This giveaway includes:&#10;1&#65039;&#8419; Core ALPHA&#10;2&#65039;&#8419; Core TEST&#10;3&#65039;&#8419; Core HARD&#10;4&#65039;&#8419; Core 5-AT&#10;&#10;__________&#10;&#9201; TIMESTAMPS&#10;00:00 INTRO&#10;00:58 EXERCISE 1&#10;05:46 EXERCISE 2&#10;08:01 EXERCISE 3&#10;12:36 EXERCISE 4&#10;14:43 EXERCISE 5&#10;16:29 EXERCISE 6&#10;18:14 EXERCISE 7&#10;&#10;__________&#10;&#127947;&#127995;&#8205;&#9792;&#65039; WORKOUT&#10;&#10240;&#10;1&#65039;&#8419; OVERHEAD PRESS | 4 Sets, 10 Reps&#10;&#10004;&#65039; Last set is a back-off set&#10;&#10240;&#10;2&#65039;&#8419; DB OVERHEAD PRESS | 3 Sets, 10 Reps&#10;&#10004;&#65039; Last set includes a drop set&#10;&#10240;&#10;3&#65039;&#8419; LATERAL RAISE | 3 Sets, 20 Reps&#10;&#10004;&#65039; Each set includes a drop set&#10;&#10240;&#10;4&#65039;&#8419; SHRUG MACHINE | 3 Sets, AMRAP&#10;&#10240;&#10;5&#65039;&#8419; REAR DELT FLY | 3 Sets, 20 Reps&#10;&#10004;&#65039; Take last set to failure&#10;&#10240;&#10;6&#65039;&#8419; NEUTRAL MACHINE OHP | 3 Sets, AMRAP&#10;&#10004;&#65039; Last set includes a drop set&#10;&#10240;&#10;7&#65039;&#8419; LATERAL RAISE MACHINE | 3 Sets, AMRAP&#10;&#10240;&#10;&#10004;&#65039; Monitor rest in between sets. Take as much as needed, but not more.&#10;&#10004;&#65039; A Drop Set is a set performed immediately after a regular working set with 20-50% less weight.&#10;&#10004;&#65039; AMRAP = As many reps as possible&#10;&#10004;&#65039; Super-setting is switching between two exercises, resting after 1 set of each exercise.&#10;&#10;__________&#10;&#128104;&#8205;&#128105;&#8205;&#128103;&#8205;&#128102; MY TEAMS&#10;&#10;Core Nutritionals Supplements &#128279; https://www.corenutritionals.com&#10;&#128176; Code BRIAN to save 15%&#10;&#10;YoungLA Clothing &#128279; https://www.youngla.com&#10;&#128176; Code BRIAN to save 15%&#10;&#10;Done-For-You Meals &#128279; https://refer.prestigelabs.com/meals?af=chdbiacz&#10;Free US Shipping&#10;&#10;__________&#10;&#128241; SOCIAL&#10;&#10;  INSTAGRAM | https://www.instagram.com/briandecosta&#10;  TWITCH | https://www.twitch.tv/briandecosta_&#10;  TIKTOK | https://www.tiktok.com/@briandecosta&#8203;&#8203;&#10;  TWITTER | https://twitter.com/briandecosta&#8203;&#10;  FACEBOOK | https://www.facebook.com/BrianDeCostaFit&#10;  SOUNDCLOUD | https://soundcloud.com/briandecosta&#10;  SPOTIFY | https://bit.ly/briandecostaplaylist&#10;&#10;#ShreddedForLife #NaturalBodyBuilding"
