  node [
    id 6760
    label "dMfzbe7INNE"
    step 1
    date "2021-09-16T18:00:10Z"
    title "ARM TONING WORKOUT // Biceps, Triceps &#38; Shoulders"
    description "Today we are targeting the biceps, triceps and shoulders with this arm toning workout. Using dumbbells only for resistance we will work on building strength and creating lean, toned arms by performing a series of bicep, tricep and shoulder exercises. Choose a weight that challenges you but allows you to complete each rep with proper form. Let's gooooo!!!!&#10;#workout #armworkout #fitness&#10;&#10;&#127822;Nutrition Guide: https://heatherrobertson.com/shop/ &#10;&#11088;&#65039;Free Workout Programs: https://heatherrobertson.com/programs/&#10;&#128467; Free Monthly Workout Calendar: https://bit.ly/3bMZGjU&#10;&#128587;&#127996; My Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;&#128722;Outfit Details:&#10;      Shorts: https://bit.ly/3hEZExj&#10;      Top: https://bit.ly/3j8qU8T&#10;      Shoes: https://bit.ly/3EsGCEu&#10;&#10;Workout Breakdown:&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:23 Warm Up&#10;&#10;Circuit One (40s work + 20s rest x2 rounds) &#10;2:30 Front + Side Raise&#10;3:30 Squat + Curl&#10;4:30 Tricep Press&#10;5:30 Weighted Jacks&#10; &#10;Circuit Two (40s work + 20s rest x2 rounds)&#10;10:30 Skull Crusher&#10;11:30 In + Out Curls&#10;12:30 Push Press&#10;13:30 Inchworm&#10; &#10;18:30 REST&#10; &#10;Circuit Three (40s work + 20s rest x2 rounds)&#10;18:42 Hammer Curls&#10;19:42 Walking Plank&#10;20:42 Tricep Kickback&#10;21:42 Shadow Box&#10; &#10;Circuit Four (40s work + 20s rest x2 rounds)&#10;26:42 Press Combo&#10;27:42 Renegade Kickback&#10;28:42 Negative Curls&#10;29:42 Burpee + Clap&#10; &#10;34:42 Cool Down &#38; Stretch&#10;&#10;Equipment Needed: dumbbells (I used a set of 5lb. 10lb and 15lbs) exercise mat or other soft surface. The Mat I use: https://lululemon.prf.hn/l/Kj00Lb1&#10;&#10;Where I download my Music *Try it FREE for 30 days*&#10;http://share.epidemicsound.com/zj9WV&#10;&#10;My Amazon Picks: https://www.amazon.com/shop/heatherrobertson&#10;&#10;L I N K S&#10;&#10;Website: http://www.heatherrobertson.com&#10;Instagram: http://www.instagram.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;______________________________ &#10;&#10;D I S C L A I M E R&#10;&#10;This is my own personal workout and may not be suited for you. It is strongly recommended that you consult with your physician before beginning any exercise program. By engaging in this exercise or exercise program, you agree that you do so at your own risk.&#10;&#10;______________________________ &#10;&#10;Thanks for watching! &#10;&#10;&#10084; Heather"
