    step 1
    date "2021-08-24T22:51:43Z"
    title "&#128170;&#127996; Super Shred // Strength &#38; Cardio Workout (Dumbbells Only)"
    description "Sign up for your free 30 day Epidemic Sound trial here http://share.epidemicsound.com/zj9WV plus use code HEATHER3FREE for 75% off an additional 2 months! Woohoo!!&#10;&#10;Today's Super Shred Workout combines STRENGTH SUPERSETS and CARDIO BURSTS for one seriously sweaty TOTAL BODY workout. Using heavy dumbbells we will power through each strength superset and then follow up with a quick and intense burst of cardio using light weights or just our body weight. Get ready to build lean muscle, endurance and push out of that comfort zone!!! Follow along and do YOUR best!&#10;#strengthworkout #workout #fitness #cardio&#10;&#10;&#127822;Nutrition Guide: https://heatherrobertson.com/shop/ &#10;&#11088;&#65039;Free Workout Programs: https://heatherrobertson.com/programs/&#10;&#128587;&#127996; My Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;&#10;Workout Breakdown:&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:20 Special Offer!&#10;1:12 Warm Up&#10;&#10;Superset 1 (40s work + 20s rest x2 rounds)&#10;4:46 Row&#10;5:46 Push press&#10;REPEAT&#10; &#10;Cardio Burst 1 (60s)&#10;8:46 Weighted jacks &#10; &#10;Superset 2 (40s work + 20s rest x2 rounds)&#10;10:06 Full Body Crunch&#10;11:06 Russian Twist&#10;REPEAT&#10; &#10;Cardio Burst 2 (60s) &#10;14:06 Climbers&#10; &#10;Superset 3 (40s work + 20s rest x2 rounds)&#10;15:26 Deadlift&#10;16:26 Hip thruster&#10; &#10;Cardio Burst 3 (60s)&#10;19:26 Squat Jump &#38; Jack&#10; &#10;20:46 Rest &#10; &#10;Superset 4 (40s work + 20s rest x2 rounds)&#10;20:58 Curl &#38; Press&#10;21:58 Fly Combo&#10;&#10;Cardio Burst 4 (60s)&#10;24:58 Shadow Box&#10; &#10;Superset 5 (40s work + 20s rest x2 rounds)&#10;26:18 Toe Touch&#10;27:18 Reverse Crunch&#10;&#10;Cardio Burst 5 (60s) &#10;30:18 Burpee Jacks&#10; &#10;Superset 6 (40s work + 20s rest x2 rounds) &#10;31:38 Lunges&#10;32:38 Goblet Squat&#10;&#10;Cardio Burst (60s) &#10;35:38 Pop Squat&#10; &#10;36:58 Cool Down &#38; Stretch&#10;&#10;Equipment Needed: dumbbells (I used 5, 10, 15 and 25lb sets) exercise mat or other soft surface. The Mat I use: https://lululemon.prf.hn/l/Kj00Lb1&#10;&#10;My Amazon Picks: https://www.amazon.com/shop/heatherrobertson&#10;&#10;L I N K S&#10;&#10;Website: http://www.heatherrobertson.com&#10;Instagram: http://www.instagram.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;______________________________ &#10;&#10;D I S C L A I M E R&#10;&#10;This is my own personal workout and may not be suited for you. It is strongly recommended that you consult with your physician before beginning any exercise program. By engaging in this exercise or exercise program, you agree that you do so at your own risk.&#10;&#10;______________________________ &#10;&#10;Thanks for watching! &#10;&#10;&#10084; Heather"
