    label "MmBHqAZBhuI"
    step 1
    date "2021-05-30T02:26:24Z"
    title "TIGHT &#38; TONED ARMS &#38; ABS! 30 Minute Standing Dumbbell Workout ( No Crunches/No Planks)"
    description "TIGHT &#38; TONED ARMS &#38; ABS - This 2 in 1 workout combines upper body strength moves with core exercises in an awesome standing only routine that will tighten and tone arms and abs without you having to get up and down off the floor. &#10;&#10;You'll need a  variety of dumbbells to complete this workout. I used 1 set of 5kg + 7kg + 10kg dumbbells but you could use something lighter or heavier depending on your fitness and strength level.&#10;&#10;There are 2 circuits to work through. Complete each exercise for 2 sets 45 seconds work/ 15 secs rest before moving onto the next.&#10;__________________________________&#10;C1- Upper Body&#10;1&#65039;&#8419;DB Shoulder Press Combo (7kg)&#10;2&#65039;&#8419;Hammer Curl with Pause (7kg)&#10;3&#65039;&#8419;Alt Arm Cross Body Curl (7kg)&#10;4&#65039;&#8419;DB O&#8217;Head Tricep Extension (5kg)&#10;5&#65039;&#8419;DB Lateral to Front Raise Combo (5kg)&#10;6&#65039;&#8419;DB Tricep Kickback (5kg)&#10;.&#10;*30 second Drink Break&#10;.&#10;C2 - Abs&#10;1&#65039;&#8419;Standing DB Rotation (10kg)&#10;2&#65039;&#8419;DB Side Bend (L) Side (10kg)&#10;3&#65039;&#8419;DB Side Bend (R) Side (10kg)&#10;4&#65039;&#8419;Standing DB Twist (7kg)&#10;5&#65039;&#8419;Knee to Elbow Crunch (L to R) (7kg)&#10;6&#65039;&#8419;Knee to Elbow Crunch (R to L) (7kg)&#10;7&#65039;&#8419;Windmill (L) Side (5kg)&#10;8&#65039;&#8419;Windmill (R) Side (5kg)&#10;*Workout Complete &#128293;Burn 175 Calories &#10;&#10;~ Time Stamps ~&#10;00:00 30 Minute Standing Dumbbell Workout Introduction&#10;00:52 Strength Training Warm Up&#10;02:57 Upper Body Strength Workout &#10;14:54 Drink Break&#10;15:24 Standing Abs Dumbbell Workout&#10;31:08 Upper Body and Standing Abs Cool Down&#10;33:20 30 Minute Standing Dumbbell Workout Outro&#10;&#10;For more videos like this best standing arms and abs workout make sure to hit subscribe and tick the notification bell so you never miss another upper body workout standing or no crunch ab workout.&#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/PennyBarnshaw&#10;New Videos every: Tuesday &#38; Friday&#10;Subscriber Count: 91,385&#10;&#10;#standingabsworkout #upperbody #garagefitnessgirl&#10;&#10;If you like this standing dumbbell workout routines checkout these ones next:&#10;INTENSE STANDING ABS &#38; HIIT WORKOUT (https://youtu.be/bfufoRVgJAA)&#10;45 MIN STANDING CARDIO ARMS &#38; ABS WORKOUT WITH WEIGHTS (https://youtu.be/QBXJB_ShenE)&#10;&#10;**MY GO-TO GEAR &#38; FAVOURITE THINGS I USE**&#10;(When available, I use affiliate links and may earn a commission at no additional cost to you)&#10;&#10;WEARING: Ryderwear Base Sports Bra in Mushroom (M) and Rib Seamless Shorts in Charcoal (S) *Use code: PENNY for 10% off * http://www.ryderwear.com/penny&#10;&#10;FITCOVER SWEAT PROOF MAKEUP: *Use code: PENNYB for 10% off *&#10;https://ftcvr.com/PENNYB &#10;&#10;PROTEIN POWDER:  (Tropeka Vanilla Lean &#38; Chocolate Pump)&#10;https://t.cfjump.com/70577/t/67104&#10;&#10;WORKOUT MAT: *Use code: garagefitnessgirl10 for $10 off*&#10;www.square36.com/ref/4/&#10;&#10;MUSIC: **Try it FREE for 30 Days*&#10;https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/ayddbl/&#10;&#10;CAMERA: https://geni.us/HJ7RM  (Amazon Link)&#10;TRIPOD: https://geni.us/Euk4   (Amazon Link)&#10;MICROPHONE: https://geni.us/pW6ksjU  (Amazon Link)&#10;&#10;CHECK OUT MORE OF MY FAVOURITE THINGS: https://garagefitnessgirl.com/favorites/&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME&#10;Website: https://www.garagefitnessgirl.com&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/garagefitnessgirl/&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/pennyfitnessfastpt/?ref=bookmarks&#10;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.com.au/pbarnshaw/&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER&#10;This is my own personal workout and may not be suited for you. It is strongly recommend that you consult with your doctor before beginning this or any exercise program. By engaging in this exercise program, you agree that you do so at your own risk&#10;&#10;Thank You For Following Along&#10;Penny xo"
