    title "&#10024;Glow Up 2.0 // Day 2: Core &#38; Booty Bootcamp"
    description "It's day 2 of the Glow Up 2.0 Challenge and today we have a Core &#38; Booty Bootcamp ahead of us! Using just our body-weight, or an optional mini band we will power through 3 circuits designed to target the abs and the glutes. Get ready to feel the burn!! #GlowUpChallenge #Abs #Booty #HomeWorkout&#10;&#10;&#127822;Get the Nutrition Guide: https://heatherrobertson.com/shop/nutrition-guide&#10;&#128722;Shop Exclusive HR Merch: https://heatherrobertson.com/merch&#10;&#127758;Join the Facebook Community: https://www.facebook.com/groups/HeatherRobertsonForum&#10;&#128587;&#127996;Follow on Instagram for recipes, tips &#38; more:  https://www.instagram.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;&#10;Equipment Needed:&#10;Optional mini band/booty band&#10;Exercise mat or other soft surface. The Mat I use: https://lululemon.prf.hn/l/D958qbR&#10;&#10;Workout Breakdown:&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:09 Warm Up&#10;&#10;Circuit One (30s work + 10s rest x3 rounds)&#10; Bear Kickback&#10; Plank Leg Lifts&#10; Side Plank + Lift&#10; Side Plank + Lift&#10;  &#10;Circuit Two (30s work + 10s rest x3 rounds) &#10; V Lift + Pulse&#10; Butterfly Bridge&#10; Bridge Pulses&#10; Suitcase Crunch&#10;  &#10;Circuit Three (30s work + 10s rest x3 rounds)&#10; Rear Kick (L)&#10; Rear Kick (R)&#10; Plank Toe Taps&#10; Squat, Tap + Twist&#10; &#10;Cool Down &#38; Stretch&#10;&#10;Outfit Details:&#10;Leggings: https://bit.ly/3KTsbeA&#10;Bra:  https://bit.ly/3wc8j0W&#10;&#10;Where I download my Music *Try it FREE for 30 days*&#10;http://share.epidemicsound.com/zj9WV&#10;&#10;Shop My Amazon Picks: &#10;(US) https://www.amazon.com/shop/heatherrobertson&#10;(CA) https://www.amazon.ca/shop/heatherrobertson&#10;(UK) https://www.amazon.co.uk/shop/heatherrobertson&#10;&#10;L I N K S&#10;&#10;Website: http://www.heatherrobertson.com&#10;Instagram: http://www.instagram.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#1