    title "&#127798;Day 1: Arms &#38; Shoulders // Upper Body Strength Workout"
    description "We are Starting off Day 1 of my Fierce14 workout program with an upper body workout using just dumbbells. Focusing on arms and shoulder exercises, heavier weights and multiple sets to help us build strength and lean muscle. Let&#8217;s go team! #Fierce14 #Workout #armWorkout &#10;&#10;Find the Fierce14 playlist here: https://bit.ly/3cSW0xj&#10;&#10;&#127822;Nutrition Guide: https://heatherrobertson.com/shop/ &#10;&#11088;&#65039;More Free Workout Programs: https://heatherrobertson.com/programs/&#10;&#128467; Free Monthly Workout Calendar: https://bit.ly/3bMZGjU&#10;&#128587;&#127996;Follow on Instagram for recipes, tips &#38; more: https://www.instagram.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;&#10;Equipment Needed:&#10;Dumbbells: I used  5, 10 &#38; 15lbs sets&#10;Exercise mat or other soft surface. The Mat I use: https://lululemon.prf.hn/l/Kj00Lb1&#10;&#10;Workout Breakdown:&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;1:22 Warm Up&#10;&#10;Circuit One (40s work + 20s rest x3 rounds)&#10;4:18 Press Curls&#10;5:18 Negative Curls&#10;6:18 Hammer Curls&#10;7:18 Bicep Burn Out&#10; &#10;16:18 Shadow Box (60s x1 round)&#10; &#10;Circuit Two (40s work + 20s rest x3 rounds)&#10;17:51 Tricep Push Ups&#10;18:51 Skull Crushers&#10;19:51 Tricep Press&#10;20:51 Tricep Kickbacks&#10; &#10;29:51 Weighted Jacks (60s x1 round)&#10;&#10;Circuit Three (40s work + 20s rest x3 rounds)&#10;31:23 Lateral Raise&#10;32:23 Arnold Press (R)&#10;33:23 Arnold Press (L)&#10;34:23 Push Press&#10; &#10;43:23 Half Burpee (60s x1 round)&#10; &#10;44:43 Cool Down &#38; Stretch&#10;&#10;Where I download my Music *Try it FREE for 30 days*&#10;http://share.epidemicsound.com/zj9WV&#10;&#10;My Amazon Picks: https://www.amazon.com/shop/heatherrobertson&#10;&#10;L I N K S&#10;&#10;Website: http://www.heatherrobertson.com&#10;Instagram: http://www.instagram.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/heatherrobertsoncom&#10;_________________________