    date "2022-06-22T20:19:17Z"
    title "Quick toned thighs and butt pilates class // booty band optional"
    description "Welcome to the first class of a new season on this channel!! I'm super excited to share this leg and butt focussed class with you all!  In the class I am using a light booty band and ankle weights.  The booty band in particular helps to increase the resistance and targeting of the outer thighs and butt muscles.  However, if you are a beginner (or you don't have the equipment) I recommend starting by doing this class without any equipment and just use your own body weight.  This will help you improve your strength and perfect your form before making the workout more intense. You can always come back to the class again later once you are ready to step up.  Let me know how you find this class, if you like using the booty band or if you prefer no equipment workouts (plenty of these coming up soon!).  Love, Bails xx&#10;&#10;MY NEW PILATES APP: https://www.alignapp.com/&#10;&#10;MOBILE APP:&#10;iPhone: https://apps.apple.com/us/app/id1500794429&#10;Android:https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.bbfit&#38;hl=en_US&#38;gl=US&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM&#10;Me: https://www.instagram.com/baileybrwn/?hl=en&#10;ALIGN: https://www.instagram.com/bbfit.app/?hl=en&#10;&#10;TIKTOK: https://www.tiktok.com/@baileybrwn?lang=en"
