n G Minor, K. 550: IV. Allegro assai 25:40&#10;12 LITVINOVSKY - Le Grand Cahier: X. L'Incendie 32:17&#10;13 ROTA - Galop from Il Gattopardo 34:34&#10;14 BEETHOVEN - Symphony No. 7 in A Major, Op. 92: IV. Allegro con brio 36:06 &#10;15 MOZART - Symphony No. 36 in C Major, K. 425 &#34;Linz&#34;: IV. Presto 43:16&#10;16 TCHAIKOVSKY - The Nutcracker Suite, Op. 71a: No. 2a, March of the Toy Soldiers 50:45&#10;17 PIOVANI &#8211; Suite from La Vita &#232; Bella 53:11&#10;18 STRAUSS II - Annen Polka, Op. 117 58:03&#10;19 MOZART - Symphony No. 38 in D Major, K. 504 &#34;Prague&#34;: III. Presto 1:01:06&#10;20 BEETHOVEN - Symphony No. 8 in F Major, Op. 93: IV. Allegro vivace 1:07:02&#10;21 BRAHMS - Tragische Ouvert&#252;re (Tragic Overture), Op. 81 1:14:43&#10;22 MAHLER - Symphony No. 1 in D Major &#34;Titan&#34;: IV. St&#252;rmisch bewegt 1:28:46&#10;&#10;# 1, 2, 3, 6, 8, 12 &#38; 16 performed by Metamorphose String Orchestra cond. by Pavel Lyubomudrov&#10;Violin on The Four Seasons: Yuliya Lebedenko&#10;# 4, 7, 9, 10, 18: Stettino Philharmonic Orchestra cond. by Stefan Marzcik&#10;# 5: Donetsk Philharmonic Orchestra cond. by Silvano Frontalini&#10;# 11, 13-15, 17, 19: Orchestra da Camera Fiorentina cond. by Giuseppe Lanzetta&#10;# 20: Aachen Symphony Orchestra cond. by Giuseppe Lanzetta&#10;# 21: Olsztyn Philharmonic Orchestra cond. by Marek Tracz&#10;22: Volgograd Philharmonic Orchestra cond. by Silvano Frontalini&#10;&#10;Thank you so much for watching this video by Halidon Music channel, we hope you enjoyed it! Don't forget to share it and subscribe to our channel http://bit.ly/YouTubeHalidonMusic   &#10;&#10;All the best classical music ever on Halidon Music Youtube Channel. &#10;The very best of Mozart, Beethoven, Bach, Chopin, Tchaikovsky, Vivaldi, Schubert, Handel, Liszt, Haydn, Strauss, Verdi, Brahms, Wagner, Mahler, Rossini, Ravel, Grieg, Dvor&#225;k&#8230;&#10;&#10;#classicalmusic #workout #energetic"
