  node [
    id 6834
    label "cdi7S08Gvas"
    step 1
    date "2020-10-18T07:54:15Z"
    title "10 MIN HARDCORE SIXPACK WORKOUT | &#304;leri Seviye Kar&#305;n Kas&#305; Antrenman&#305; | Eylem Abaci"
    description "&#127468;&#127463;  This setting brings back beautiful memories of Bozcaada. BUT (!) if you think that this workout is as relaxing as the waves splashing behind, you are totally wrong. :D This routine will burn like hell in your abs: it is an ultimate fat burner and an intense workout for your abs. Hello sixpack! &#9829;&#65038;&#10;&#9642;&#65039; MY TIPS:&#10;&#8226; Try not to take any breaks in between.&#10;&#8226; Make sure to keep your lower back pressed straight against the mat while lifting and lowering your legs. You should lower your legs as far as your back is not lifting. You can achieve this with squeezing your abs.&#10;&#8226; For ultimate results, squeeze and &#34;crunch&#34; your abs during the whole workout. If your neck hurts, squeeze your abs even more. You can also lay your head down on the mat, if you feel more comfortable. But I feel like my abs are working even more when I lift my head though.&#10;&#8226; Repeating this workout 2-3x per week works perfectly. You can combine this one with my other ab workouts.&#10;&#10;&#127481;&#127479;  Bu video Bozcaada'daki g&#252;zel an&#305;lar&#305;m&#305; hat&#305;rlat&#305;yor. ANCAK (!) bu antrenman&#305;n arka planda g&#246;r&#252;nen sahil kadar relax olaca&#287;&#305;n&#305; zannediyorsan&#305;z yan&#305;l&#305;yorsunuz. :D Kar&#305;n kaslar&#305;n&#305;z cehennem gibi yanacak: Bu antrenman hem bel ve kar&#305;n b&#246;lgenizdeki ya&#287;lar&#305; yakar, hem de kar&#305;n kaslar&#305;n&#305;z&#305; belirginle&#351;tirmek i&#231;in yo&#287;un bir egzersizdir. Merhaba sixpack! &#9829;&#65038;&#10;&#9642;&#65039; &#214;NER&#304;LER&#304;M: &#10;&#8226; Workout boyunca mola vermemeye &#231;al&#305;&#351;&#305;n.&#10;&#8226; Bacaklar&#305;n&#305;z&#305; kald&#305;r&#305;p indirirken, belinizi, bel bo&#351;lu&#287;u olu&#351;mayacak &#351;ekilde, mata d&#252;md&#252;z bast&#305;rd&#305;&#287;&#305;n&#305;zdan emin olun. Bacaklar&#305;n&#305;z&#305; sadece bel bo&#351;lu&#287;u olu&#351;mayan noktaya kadar indirin. Bunu ba&#351;armak i&#231;in kar&#305;n kaslar&#305;n&#305;z&#305; hep s&#305;k&#305;n. &#10;&#8226; En iyi sonu&#231;lar i&#231;in t&#252;m egzersizlerde kar&#305;n kaslar&#305;n&#305;z&#305; s&#305;kman&#305;z gerekiyor. E&#287;er boynunuz a&#287;r&#305;yorsa, karn&#305;n&#305;z&#305; biraz daha s&#305;kmay&#305; deneyin. Egzersizleri ba&#351;&#305;n&#305;z&#305; mata koyarak da yapabilirsiniz, e&#287;er b&#246;yle daha rahat ediyorsan&#305;z. Ancak ben ba&#351;&#305;m&#305; kald&#305;rd&#305;&#287;&#305;mda kaslar&#305;m&#305;n daha &#231;ok &#231;al&#305;&#351;t&#305;&#287;&#305;n&#305; hissediyorum.&#10;&#8226; Bu workoutu haftada 2-3 kez yapman&#305;z sonu&#231;lar&#305; h&#305;zland&#305;r&#305;r. Di&#287;er kar&#305;n antrenmanlar&#305;mla kombinlerseniz harika olur.&#10;&#10;&#10142; INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/eylmbc/&#10;&#10142; BLOG: http://eylemabaci.com/&#10;&#10;&#9993;&#65039;  PR / BUSINESS INQUIRIES:&#10;info@eylemabaci.com&#10;&#10;&#128095;  &#220;ST&#220;MDEK&#304; SPOR KIYAFETLER&#304;:&#10;https://ty.gl/vilnd8ku&#10;&#10;&#127925;  M&#220;Z&#304;K | T&#252;m &#351;ark&#305;lar Spotify playlistimde!&#10;https://sptfy.com/50go&#10;&#10;&#127925;  Music provided by Epidemic Sound &#10;https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/u7y20x/&#10;&#10;&#127965;  Video, Ayazma Plaj&#305; / Bozcaada'da &#231;ekilmi&#351;tir.&#10;___________&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;In order to avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health before doing the exercises. Performing any fitness exercises without supervision, is at your own risk. Please take professional advices of a fitness professional. Eylem Abaci will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video.&#10;&#10;Sakatlanma veya v&#252;cudunuzda meydana gelebilecek herhangi bir olumsuzlu&#287;u engellemek ad&#305;na, videolardaki egzersizleri yapmadan &#246;nce sa&#287;l&#305;k kontrollerinizi yapt&#305;rd&#305;&#287;&#305;n&#305;zdan emin olun. Profesyonel bir spor antren&#246;r&#252; g&#246;zetiminde yapmad&#305;&#287;&#305;n&#305;z egzersizlerden sadece kendiniz sorumlu olacaks&#305;n&#305;z. L&#252;tfen profesyonellerden destek almay&#305; ihmal etmeyin. Eylem Abac&#305; bu videodan do&#287;abilecek sakatlanmalardan veya herhangi bir zarardan sorumlu tutulamaz."
