    description "Hourglass Workout No Equipment At Home&#10;-------------&#10;&#10;Welcome back loves! &#10;&#10;This week, we are doing an hourglass workout at home that focuses on toning your booty to make it round and perky, as well as the waist,  to bring it in and make it smaller. &#10;&#10;These exercises are great at targetting those specific areas and if you combine this with some of my cardio workouts and a balanced diet, you will achieve great results! &#10;&#10;So, grab some water and let's get into it.&#10;&#10;Make sure to leave me a comment and subscribe to my channel. &#10;&#10;Love, Holly xx&#10;------------&#10;&#10;&#9825; 7 Day Free Trial! Download To My Fitness App: https://bit.ly/3kJrYQw&#10;&#10;------------&#10;Disclaimer: Please always consult with your physician before practicing or participating in any workout challenges - if you do so, you workout at your own accord. This is my own personal workout and may not be suited for you&#10;&#10;You can connect with me below for more workouts, food, and motivation!&#10;&#10;&#9825; MY INSTAGRAM:  https://www.instagram.com/hollydolke &#10;&#10;&#9825; MY TIKTOK: https://vm.tiktok.com/uWJLyQ/&#10;&#10;&#9825; FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/hollydolkeofficial"
