    description "What is going on #sveltecrew !&#10;&#10;With all of the workouts we have been doing we thought a good daily stretch of several exercises would help relax your muscles and stretch out the body!&#10;&#10;The streches will hit your full body and is done sitting down for those who enjoy sitting while stretching! This will help increase your flexibility if done consistently as well as help maintain the health of your muscles as your stretch them out.&#10;&#10;Let us know if you enjoy these stretches and if you want more also tell us!&#10;&#10;Exercises::&#10;&#128170; Neck Rolls&#10;&#128170; Shoulder Rolls&#10;&#128170; Side Stretches&#10;&#128170; Cat Cow&#10;&#128170; Cobra&#10;&#128170; Runner's Lunge&#10;&#128170; Pigeon Pose&#10;&#128170; Straddle Stretch&#10;&#10;&#8206;&#9654; Free One-Minute Workout &#128073;  http://svelte.go2cloud.org/SHV&#10;&#10;&#8206;&#9654; Svelte Merch! &#128073; https://svelte-training.creator-spring.com/&#10;&#10;&#9654; Svelte's Website &#128073; http://www.sveltetraining.com/&#10;&#10;Say hi on social! &#128071;&#10;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/SvelteTraining/&#10;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/svelte_training/&#10;&#10;Tags:&#10;Daily Stretch, Full Body, Full Body Stretch, Daily Full Body Stretch, Flexibility, Maintain Muscles, Increase Flexibility, Increase Muscle Flexibility, Stretches, Best Stretches, Best Stretches For Flexibility, Back Stretch, Leg Stretch, Arm Stretch&#10;&#10;#Daily #Stretch"
