    title "Mobility Flow for Anxiety | 15 Minutes | Beginner + Self-Love Workout &#128150;"
    description "On the days you experience anxiety, press play on this mobility flow. It will help you quiet your mind, come back to your breath, and feel grounded in your own skin.&#10;&#10;Mobility flows can help us increase our range of motion and release pain &#38; tension throughout the body. I also love how it&#8217;s an opportunity to breathe deep, de-stress, and tune into our emotional and mental health. &#10;&#10;I hope this flow helps you feen seen, loved, and supported. You are enough &#128155;&#10;&#10;About Madison &#128150;&#10;Hi I&#8217;m Madison, a business owner, certified personal trainer, holistic nutrition coach, and your movement-obsessed BFF. In my business, The Fit Flamingo, I work 1 on 1 with women to help them love their body, discover food freedom, and feel good from the inside out. Welcome to our world of Feel-Good Fitness!&#10;&#10;Connect with The Fit Flamingo:&#10;&#10047; Inquire about 1 on 1 Fitness + Nutrition Coaching: https://bit.ly/3vw38sq&#10;&#10047; Follow on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/thefitflamingo/&#10;&#10047; Listen to The Fit Flamingo Podcast: https://thefitflamingo.com/podcast&#10;&#10047; Learn more on our Website: https://thefitflamingo.com"
