    date "2022-06-27T05:18:08Z"
    title "4 min Chair Tabata HIIT Whole body workout! Plus stretches! -  Under 10 Mins Beginner"
    description "Some of our favourite, simple chair workout moves, to strengthen triceps, biceps, chests, backs, shoulders, core, hamstrings, quadriceps, glutes, calves, and cardio! All combined in a quick, 4 minute Tabata or High Intensity Interval Training! &#10;&#10;4 minutes, 4 moves, twice each. 20 secs work, 10 seconds rest. &#10;&#10;Did you know that interval training is the most efficient and effective form of training or workout?! - Optimal exercise, all in just 4 minutes!! &#10;&#10;- Take a few minutes to do something great for your body! &#10;&#10;I'm Jocelyn Louise, a qualified fitness instructor, early childhood and primary educator, teacher, child carer, Austswim Swimming instructor, kids yoga teacher, lifestyle, parenting &#38; empowerment coach, and homeschooling, full-time travelling, mother of three!&#10;&#10;You can also find more of our videos with fun active games, stretches, yoga, meditation, mindfulness and more for kids and families on our channel Connected Kids! &#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8izU3kVQDqwpIqoS4C3q_A &#10;&#10;You can also check out our products (including fun kids and family yoga cards) and other services and offerings on my website:&#10;jocelynlouise.com &#10; &#10;And come and follow our family adventures of full time travel around Australia at We're Getting There! &#10;&#10;Have any questions or requests, or would like some support? &#10;Come find me on Facebook under Jocelyn Louise &#10;https://www.facebook.com/jocelynlouisecoach/&#10;&#10;Please like and subscribe to support our channel, and we'll see you in the next video! &#10;&#10;Thanks so much for watching!"
