    title "How to do a Russian Twist Properly and Safely"
    description "Join me as I demonstrate how to do a Russian Twist properly and safely to hopefully  avoid back pain that can sometimes happen with this exercise. This is an exercise that can go bad very quickly if done incorrectly. Please try to do this with me and let me know what you think! And as always, please remember to BREATHE!&#10;&#10;&#128279;JOIN MY 14 DAY KICK START CHALLENGE AT https://mailchi.mp/3bde7d00cea8/kickstart  Two weeks to give you the kick start you need to get working towards your goals again. Daily healthy tips, workout video and recipe!&#10;&#10;Equipment Needed: Any sort of weight - dumbbell or medicine ball&#10;&#10;&#128165;IMPORTANT &#128165; Please remember that you should have your doctor&#8217;s OK before starting any exercise program, especially if you have pre-existing injuries. I provide modifications but if anything doesn&#8217;t feel right, you experience joint or chest pain or feel lightheaded, stop that exercise immediately and consult your doctor. Listen to your body and go at a pace that works for YOU!&#10;&#10;Thank you so very much for watching! Please be sure to SUBSCRIBE to my channel for more videos. https://www.youtube.com/user/YourJourney2Wellness?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME ON SOCIAL MEDIA!&#10;WEBSITE: http://www.journey2wellness.ca/&#10;INSTAGRAM: http://www.instagram.com/journey2well... &#10;FACEBOOK: http://www.facebook.com/journey2wellness &#10;TWITTER: http://www.twitter.com/j2wellness &#10;&#10;~ Deborah Peddle - Hann, Fitness &#38; Wellness Specialist, Sepaker - Journey to Wellness&#10;&#10;#journey2wellness #russiantwist #workoutwithdeb"
