    date "2020-05-22T17:45:33Z"
    title "NEVER DO THE RUSSIAN TWIST LIKE THIS! | 3 Most Common Mistakes"
    description "Hey Everyone,&#10;&#10;I've been seeing a lot of mistakes and incorrect understanding for when it comes to performing the russian twist. This core/ab exercise is not meant to be done easy. Watch the video to see for yourself why you should never do the russian twist like this. These are the 3 most common mistakes I see all the time with most of my members and clients. I go into detail on how to perfect the in-corrections so that you all can be seeing some incredible benefits from this exercise let alone.&#10;&#10;I hope Ya'll enjoy the video and I hope you have learned something new! Best of luck to improving your core, I know you can do it!!&#10;&#10;Heres my 2nd Video on the Russian Twist - HOW TO STEP-BY-STEP Progressions FOR BEGINNERS!!&#10;Click Here - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YvVCoONm0Ls&#38;t=2s&#10;&#10;#dakotadurant #abs #russiantwist&#10;&#10;Comment below to talk to me.&#10;&#10;Go Follow me on Instagram and Facebook @DakotaDurant &#10;or click this - Instagram.com/dakota_durant&#10;&#10;Heres the link to Juice Plus+&#10;http://dakotadurant.juiceplus.com/&#10;&#10;Music in the Video:&#10;Track: TOKYO MACHINE &#38; Guy Arthur - GET UP [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/HV7mLcsUp5U&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/GetUp&#10;&#10;Play the Flappy Duck game: http://ncs.io/GetUp"
