    date "2015-12-10T18:48:55Z"
    title "How To Do Russian Twists For Fitness Beginners!!"
    description "Connect with me:&#10;Instagram:  johnpaul_built2win&#10;Tiktok: johnpaul_built2win&#10;&#10;Don't forget to comment, share,like and subscribe, thank you !&#10;&#10;Russian twist will help to get rid of the fat around the abdominal  area. It is a core exercise involving all the core muscles such as the obliques,abs, and more. A twisting motion helps to work the oblique muscles.&#10;Russian twist strengthens the oblique muscles on the sides of the abdomen.Strong abdominal muscle helps to prevent slouching and get a good posture.&#10;A trimmed abdomen also helps you in your everyday activities like bending to put your shoe, pick up something from the floor or sitting in a low chair.&#10;&#10;You can do 4 sets of 15 per side. To add more intensity, cut down on your break time or increase sets as well.&#10;&#10;You will have conditioned yourself to do more with your body with less effort, and that&#8217;s always a good thing"
