    description "&#2349;&#2366;&#2359;&#2339; &#2342;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2368;&#2326;&#2375;&#2306; Ace the Ability of Public Speaking, How to start a Speech? Communication &#38; Presentation. Deal With Stage Fear. Best Motivational Speaker and Business Trainer in India.&#10;&#10;The Art of Public Speaking, How to deliver speech&#10;&#10;Public speaking is the process or act of performing a speech to a live audience.&#10;Learn the Art of Public Speaking, Communication &#38; Presentation&#10;Most people fear public speaking more than death; severely limiting opportunities to communicate their thoughts and ideas, while stifling their personal growth. Only if forced to give a speech do they practice and then they will procrastinate until the last possible moment. Public speaking is like walking instead of crawling. It is a natural progression but requires practice and, when mastered, it greatly expands one&#8217;s view of the world.&#10;&#10;Dr. Amit Maheshwari is the Best Motivational Speaker and Corporate Trainer in Delhi NCR and India.&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Connect With Us Via Following Networks:&#10;&#10;On Facebook: - https://www.facebook.com/mettasclub/&#10;&#10;On YouTube:- https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6nCMhA2hqyw6Xa3RYkVoaA/videos&#10;&#10;On Twitter: - https://twitter.com/MettasClub , https://twitter.com/mettaskitchen&#10;&#10;On Linked in:- https://www.linkedin.com/in/amitmaheshwariji/&#10;&#10;On Pinterest: - https://in.pinterest.com/mettasclub&#10;&#10;On Google plus:- https://plus.google.com/+Mettasclub&#10;&#10;Check Out More Details: - http://www.mettaslifestyle.com , http://www.mettasclub.com&#10;&#10;For Training Program Registration Call Us at: 8882989694, 9911473894, 8882610799&#10;&#10;How to Advertise?&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xP6iwdbzlac&#10;&#10;How to Grow Sale?&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RfWsBqONywQ&#10;&#10;CASE STUDY Videos:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z_IcGr4-AKk&#10;&#10;