    step 1
    date "2022-01-12T05:47:04Z"
    title "&#2346;&#2375;&#2335; &#2325;&#2368; &#2330;&#2352;&#2381;&#2348;&#2368; &#2325;&#2350; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2409; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366;&#2350; | How To Reduce Belly Fat | Be Beautiful"
    description "As people get older, it&#8217;s common to see an increase of belly fat being collected along the waistline. This is usually because muscle mass decreases with age and fat increases. Now this of course, leads to you looking up for home workouts on how to burn belly fat or crash weight loss plans because let's be honest belly fat can make you feel self-conscious or can cause difficulty fitting into your favorite pair of pants and no one likes that! So here is Smriti from our Be Beautiful Beauty Squad showing you 3 exercises for reducing belly fat.&#10;&#10;&#2332;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375;-&#2332;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2350;&#2381;&#2352; &#2348;&#2397;&#2340;&#2368; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2361;&#2350;&#2366;&#2352;&#2375; &#2325;&#2350;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341;-&#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2346;&#2375;&#2335; &#2325;&#2368; &#2330;&#2352;&#2381;&#2348;&#2368; &#2332;&#2350;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2404;&#2311;&#2360; &#2330;&#2352;&#2381;&#2348;&#2368; &#2325;&#2379; &#2328;&#2335;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2361;&#2350; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2348;&#2375;&#2360;&#2381;&#2335; &#2361;&#2379;&#2350; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325;&#2310;&#2313;&#2335; &#2324;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2376;&#2358; &#2357;&#2375;&#2335; &#2354;&#2379;&#2360;&#2381;&#2360; &#2337;&#2366;&#2311;&#2335;&#2381;&#2360; &#2346;&#2375; &#2330;&#2354;&#2375; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367; &#2360;&#2330; &#2340;&#2379; &#2351;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376; &#2325;&#2368; &#2348;&#2375;&#2354;&#2381;&#2354;&#2368; &#2347;&#2376;&#2335; &#2361;&#2350;&#2366;&#2352;&#2375; &#2310;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2366; &#2357;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2360; &#2325;&#2379; &#2393;&#2366;&#2360; &#2361;&#2366;&#2344;&#2367; &#2346;&#2379;&#2361;&#2330;&#2366; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2404; &#2340;&#2379; &#2330;&#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2311;&#2360; &#2357;&#2368;&#2337;&#2367;&#2351;&#2379; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2361;&#2350;&#2366;&#2352;&#2375; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2335;&#2368; &#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2381;&#2357;&#2377;&#2337; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2381;&#2350;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367; &#2310;&#2346;&#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2375;&#2335; &#2325;&#2368; &#2330;&#2352;&#2381;&#2348;&#2368; &#2325;&#2350; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2409; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366;&#2350; &#2342;&#2367;&#2326;&#2366; &#2352;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;&#10;&#10;&#10157; Click on the link below to Subscribe:&#10;https://bit.ly/38vuNP6&#10;&#10;00:00 Things to keep in mind&#10;01:57 Exercise 1 : High Knees&#10;02:20 Exercise 2 : Mountain Climber&#10;03:09 Exercise 3 : Flutter Kicks&#10;Also Read:&#10;EFFECTIVE FOOD TO CUT BELLY FAT :&#10;https://www.bebeautiful.in/lifestyle/health-and-wellness/4-foods-to-cut-belly-fat&#10;&#10;Product Link:&#10;St. Ives Renewing Collagen &#38; Elastin Body Lotion :&#10;https://brands.shortlyst.com/stives/175206&#10;&#10;#howtoreducebellyfat #bellyfat #exercise #losebellyfat #weightloss #howtolosebellyfat #workout #fitness #BeBeautiful&#10;&#10;&#10157; For Skincare, Haircare &#38; Makeup tips, log on to our website:&#10;http://www.bebeautiful.in&#10;&#10;&#10157; Like us on Facebook:&#10;https://www.facebook.com/BeBeautifulIndia&#10;&#10;&#10157; Follow us on Twitter:&#10;https://twitter.com/BeBeautiful_In&#10;&#10;&#10157; Join us on Instagram:&#10;https://instagram.com/Bebeautiful_India&#10;&#10;Be Beautiful is your everyday beauty expert with a live radar for all things hair, skin, makeup, DIYs, self-care, fitness and more. Tune in every week for new videos on the latest viral beauty trends, skincare routines, hair care tips, DIY recipes, and everything the beauty junkie in you is craving! Trust us, the Be Beautiful Beauty Squad is constantly creating fun videos with easy step-by-step tutorials, how-tos and guides, honest reviews on beauty products, tips, tricks and hacks as well as home remedies. &#10;&#10;And that&#8217;s not all. You will also find leading dermatologists, makeup artists and beauty experts share their best advice on skin, hair and makeup on our channel. &#10;&#10;We also have weekly LIVE sessions with industry experts on our social media platforms where they answer all your pressing beauty queries. So what are you waiting for? Let&#8217;s Be Beautiful together! &#10;&#10;Drop us a comment, we would love to hear from you.&#10;&#10;For other makeup queries like how to choose foundation, types of foundation, foundation for skin types, and foundation tips for beginners, do visit our BeBeautiful website."
