    description "Subscribe Now &#9658; http://bit.ly/2tILwsY&#10;&#10;Welcome to the world of Yoga for Health and Fitness of the Mind, Body and Soul! &#10;Welcome to Shilpa's Yoga! &#10;&#10;Shilpa's Yoga' is a unique way of life which integrates the body, mind and soul, under the guidance of none other than the beautiful actress herself. Watch Shilpa Shetty as she demonstrates the various Yogic Postures, Breathing Techniques and Asanas. The video contains:- 35 Asanas (Postures) Back Asanas, Stomach Asanas, Standing Asanas, Sitting Asanas Neck &#38; Shoulder Asanas, Pranayam (Breathing).&#10;&#10;Check out Simple Soul App goal-based yoga &#38; fitness programs on https://www.theshilpashetty.com/. The app offers easy-to-do yoga asanas, exercises &#38; recipes to maintain a healthy balance in life.&#10;&#10;Like Shilpa Shetty explains, &#34;Everyone wants to feel and look good. I discovered something that did both, Yoga and I'm completely overwhelmed by the beauty and power of it. Yoga is a lifestyle choice. It's a management system for life and it is the most holistic approach to life that I have ever come across. It strengthens, tones and cures. It works on body, mind and soul. Yoga has had a spectacular impact on my life. I'm hoping it does the same for you.&#34; &#10;&#10;Find 5-Minute Morning Meditation practice by Shilpa Shetty: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4EWqeJhPuHw&#10;&#10;Subscribe to Shilpa yoga for more online yoga lessons: http://www.youtube.com/shilpayoga&#10;&#10;#ShilpaYoga #ShilpaShetty #HomeYoga #YogaLesson #YogaForBegginers"
