    description "Research has shown that vegetarian or plant based food is the best food for your body. It gives flexibility, ease and more power to your body. If you want to be sensitive to life and become perceptive then what you eat becomes very important. Plant-based diet helps reduce risk of various chronic degenerative disease like high blood pressure, diabetes, heart attack, cancer, obesity etc.&#10;&#10;In this video of The Indian Mystics, Sadhguru Jaggi Vasudev explains four major points 1. The benefits of vegetarian food over non vegetarian food 2. Why most of the Indians choose vegetarian diet over non vegetarian diet? 3. How plant based food helps you becoming sensitive to life and achieve higher dimensions of intelligence? 4. Why everyone should adopt a vegetarian food diet.&#10;&#10;#TheIndianMystics #Sadhguru #Food #Diet #Vegetarian #Non-Vegetarian #Health&#10;&#10;&#9658;Special Thanks To Sadhguru: https://www.youtube.com/user/sadhguru...&#10;&#9658; Video Footages and Music - Licensed&#10;&#9658; Edited By - https://www.instagram.com/_theeditmas...&#10;&#9658;* Copyright Disclaimer Under Section 107 of the Copyright Act 1976, allowance is made for &#34;fair use&#34; for purposes such as criticism, commenting, news reporting, teaching, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statute that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational, or personal use tips the balance in favour of fair use.&#10;1) This video has no negative impact on the original works (It would actually be positive for them). &#10;2) This video is also for educational purposes. &#10;3) It is not transformative in nature. &#10;4) I only used bits and pieces of videos to get the essence.&#10;&#10;&#128073; OUR OTHER VIDEOS:&#10;&#10;Most DANGREOUS NEGATIVE PRANIC FOOD - https://youtu.be/z2WAeAOeydw&#10;Solve 90% Of Your HEALTH PROBLEMS - https://youtu.be/jBWHXYQ2xmI&#8203;&#8203;&#10;EAT THIS High Power Protein-Rich SUPERFOOD - https://youtu.be/JC1MZ