    title "FilterCopy | People We See In Every Gym ft. Ayush, Barkha and Sudev"
    description "Gym aaja pardesi, tere weights bulaye re! &#10;Check out the latest KAPPA activewear collection at your nearest Lifestyle store or shop online here: https://goo.gl/18nVsT&#10;&#10;Here's our new video on the types of people we see in a gym. Watch it and let us know what you think about it in the comments below! :D&#10;&#10;Producer &#10;Aditya Pisharody&#10; &#10;Creative Prodcuer &#10;Nishaad Javeri&#10; &#10;Director &#10;Aniruddha Banerjee&#10; &#10;Assistant Directors &#10;Rajat Taneja&#10;Paritosh Bhatt&#10; &#10;Writers &#10;Bharat Misra&#10;Rajat Taneja&#10; &#10;DOP&#10;Ishani Roy&#10; &#10;Cast (in alphabetical order) &#10;Anand Bhardwaj&#10;Aniruddha Banerjee&#10;Ayush Mehra&#10;Barkha Singh&#10;Chandni Moolchandani&#10;Jivitesh Mazumdar&#10;Rajat Taneja&#10;Saahil Singh Yaduvanshi&#10;Sudev Nair&#10; &#10;Featured Cast &#10;Himanshu Joshi&#10;Sahil Harchandani&#10;Khyati Padaya&#10;Harveen Jamba&#10;Simran Jamba&#10;Himanshu Sharma&#10;Annukta Ganjoo&#10;Akshara Sawant&#10; &#10;Executive Producer &#10;Saahil Singh Yaduvanshi&#10; &#10;Editor &#10;Jaicy Mathew&#10; &#10;Color Grading &#10;Ishani Roy&#10; &#10;Camera Attendants &#10;Manish K. Mourya&#10;Tahir&#10; &#10;Sound Recordist &#10;Anatil Mahato&#10; &#10;Sound Design &#10;Sudhanshu Gaur&#10; &#10;Hair and Makeup &#10;Heena Sabhnani&#10; &#10;Subtitling &#10;Aniruddha Banerjee&#10; &#10;Graphics &#10;Sidhant Gandhi&#10;Manoj Omre&#10;Shreya Sethi&#10;Antara Pathak&#10; &#10;Spot &#10;Om Prakash Mishra&#10; &#10;Wardrobe &#10;Mahendra R. Prasad&#10; &#10;Stylist &#10;Prachiti Parakh&#10; &#10;Assistant Stylist &#10;Karma Thakrar&#10; &#10;Brand Solutions &#10;Aditi Shrivastava&#10;Shreya Agarwal&#10;Sonalika Mehra&#10; &#10;Location  &#10;The Cloud 9 Gym &#38; Fitness Club&#10; &#10;Copywriter &#10;Akanksha Dhyani"
