    description "Jennifer Aniston will perhaps forever be remembered for playing Rachel Green on the iconic sitcom and cultural phenomenon Friends. Her portrayal of Rachel wasn&#8217;t just praised for her performance but for the character's hairstyle and fashion sense.&#10;&#10;Aniston has, however, managed to have a massively successful career post-Friends and her appearance on the hit sitcom has made her into an international star. Though she will forever be Rachel in our hearts, she's now one of Hollywood's biggest stars.&#10;&#10;What else is there to know about Jennifer Aniston besides her successful career as an actor? Here&#8217;s the untold truth of Jennifer Aniston.&#10;&#10;#JenniferAniston #Truth #Celeb&#10;&#10;&#34;The Rachel&#34; | 0:00&#10;Jennifer on Stern | 1:11&#10;Dad's advice | 2:18&#10;Before acting | 3:09&#10;NBC's plan | 4:07&#10;Saturday Night Live | 5:13&#10;Fear of water | 6:21&#10;Dyslexia struggle | 7:13&#10;Leprechaun days | 8:07&#10;Mayer and Twitter | 9:04&#10;Return to TV | 9:55&#10;&#10;Read Full Article: https://www.thelist.com/193975/the-untold-truth-of-jennifer-aniston/"
