    description "Rachel from Friends wasn&#8217;t just a beloved character, she was also a fashion icon from her hairdo and the style of the character on the show. The sitcom brought Jennifer Aniston to A-list status and to be known as one of America&#8217;s sweethearts.&#10;&#10;However, Aniston is also notoriously known to be difficult to work with off-camera. This has caused some celebrities to not want to work with her again. According to a report by Radar Online, during the filming of Life Of Crime, Aniston was described as unfriendly. To find out more on why people don&#8217;t want to work with Jennifer Aniston, keep watching!&#10;&#10;#JenniferAniston #Celebs #Drama&#10;&#10;Snobby on set? | 0:00&#10;Getting violent? | 1:16&#10;Big stars only? | 1:52&#10;Disapproving peers | 2:46&#10;Oblivious to her privilege? | 3:27&#10;&#10;Read full article: https://www.nickiswift.com/210536/we-now-know-why-people-dont-want-to-work-with-jennifer-aniston/"
