  node [
    id 7492
    label "ciHqXV5-U3w"
    step 1
    date "2020-12-12T23:42:00Z"
    title "10 MIN INTENSE SIXPACK WORKOUT/ - Angela Kajo"
    description "Welcome back friends!&#10;&#10;Bringing you another 10 minute killer ab workout! &#10;&#10;You will see and feel, that an ab workout doesn't have to be long to be effective. I personally prefer to have the workout short and effective, especially when it&#8217;s an ab isolation workout. I feel like the longer the ab workout goes, the less effective it becomes. &#10;&#10;And remember- the key to getting a six pack is consistency. And the exercises I chose for this video are gonna work out your core broadly. And the few bottom up movements ( in-n-out variations, v-ups) are perfect to influence lower ab muscle fibres recruitment. You can easily do this workout every day and have great results!&#10;&#10;As always- the video is full length which means that you can just follow along with me. And if you need an extra rest- just pause the video for a moment to catch your breath. But try to give your best! &#128170;&#10;&#10;And if you love this workout- please give it a thumbs up! Im also happy to read&#10;all your comments and will try to answer you all as soon as possible. &#10084;&#65039;&#10;&#10;Make sure to try out also the other workouts on my channel @Angela Kajo &#10;&#10;And one last thing! Please make sure to warm up your core before the workout to prevent injury and stay safe during the exercise. &#10;&#10;HAVE FUN!!&#10;----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Music: &#10;&#10;1st: Kiba- You Got Me &#10;2nd: Monako- Fetish&#10;3rd: Random-memories by fassounds &#10;@Artlist &#10;&#10;My Social Media: &#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/angelakajo/&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/fitbyangela/... &#10;Email: kajoandco@gmail.com"
    channel_title "Angela Kajo"
    channel_id "UCuEA5i6be4kwFs7Guq0JCMw"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
