    step 1
    date "2022-01-11T16:33:03Z"
    title "10 MIN INTENSE AB LINES WORKOUT / Upper, lower abs &#38; obliques/ No Rest, No equipment/ Fit By Angela"
    description "Let&#8217;s call this the upgraded version of my 11 Line Ab Workout, that went viral last year, with almost 2,5 million views! &#129402;&#10084;&#65039;&#10;&#10;Here it is: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_ikzZyiwsGU&#10;&#10;Altho the new workout has completely different ab exercises, the target is the same: to have that flat belly and those ab lines appearing, you need to work on the entire core intensively, including upper abs, lower abs and obliques. &#10;&#10;Get ready! INTENSE AB LINES WORKOUT! &#10;10 minutes- no rest- no equipment!&#10;&#10;The video is Full Length which means that you can just follow along with me! &#10;if you do need a lil break to catch your breath, then just pause the video for a moment.&#10;&#10;for free workout plans check out my Instagram stories! &#10;My intention with those is help you reach your fitness and health goals and to have fun!&#10;&#10;&#129293; A&#10;&#10;_____________________________&#10;&#10;Music by Epidemic Sound&#10;https://www.epidemicsound&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#10;Follow me on Instagram:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/angelakajo/&#8203;&#10;&#10;Business enquiries:&#10;Email: kajoandco@gmail.com"
