    label "XpKLBOwD27k"
    step 1
    date "2021-12-07T13:29:44Z"
    title "LOWER AB WORKOUT/ Strong Lower Abs and Core/ No Equipment/ - Fit By Angela"
    description "On this Lower Ab Workout Routine you've got 10 Minutes to complete 10 challenging Ab Exercises! &#128293;&#10;&#10;before we start let's quickly talk about why are a set of good abs so important- especially when it comes to the stubborn lower abs, that are so difficult to train..? &#10;&#10;It's not only that it looks good, but strong core and abs will also do your body a world of good! Our core plays a huge role in supporting our back and affecting the tilt of the pelvis- meaning the stronger your abs, the stronger the support, and the better Your Posture!&#10;&#10;In this exercise routine you gonna come across some exercise variations that you might have not tried before, so it's very important that you read every label that comes on the screen. I wrote those little notes for you, so you can stay safe while each exercise and get the most out of them. &#10084;&#65039;&#10;&#10;The video is Full Length which means that you can just Follow Along with me! 10 minutes, 10 exercises, 10 sec rest in between each exercise!&#10;&#10;Let's go!!&#10;&#10;for Free Workout Plans check out my Instagram Stories and Youtube Posts.&#10;My intention with those is help you reach your Fitness And Health Goals and to have fun!&#10;&#10;&#129293; A&#10;&#10;_____________________________&#10;&#10;Music by Epidemic Sound&#10;https://www.epidemicsound&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#10;Follow me on Instagram:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/angelakajo/&#8203;&#10;&#10;Business enquiries:&#10;Email: kajoandco@gmail.com"
