    title "Do This Every Night to Burn Fat in Your Sleep | 2 MILE Strength | growwithjo"
    description "This workout is SWEATY, it gets your heart rate up, BOOSTS YOUR METABOLISM, and gets you strong.&#10;&#10;If you are currently doing an evening workout to burn fat in your sleep, this is the workout you need to replace it with. You will start to see results quite soon and the workout is only 35 minutes!&#10;&#10;This workout doesn't necessarily have to be done before bed; it can be done any time of the day, but if you want to get consistent, pick a time that you can consistently workout- for a lot of us that is before bedtime.&#10;&#10;What I love about evening workouts is that I have a MUCH deeper sleep and I wake up feeling lean and energized!&#10;&#10;Are you ready for this challenge?&#10;&#10;Here are my stats:&#10;Apple Watch Setting: Mixed Cardio&#10;Calories Burned: 380&#10;Intensity Level: 8/10&#10;&#10;DO THIS EVERY MORNING: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m1DBJhxKmiU&#38;t=926s&#10;&#10;MORE FUN WORKOUTS: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLG9XM5PzrT1eUy_R9xkiVfs9GNvwNS3Xz&#10;&#10;COOL DOWN: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x4MHzjnSayc&#38;t=193s&#10;________________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;RESULTS&#10;&#10;SHARE YOUR WORKOUT VIDEOS on Tik Tok, YouTube or Instagram for a chance to be featured in my next video or on our community Youtube: @growwithjo unified&#10;&#10;Record a video or take a picture of you doing the workout, tag me @growwithjo #growwithjo @growwithjo_unified&#10;&#10;To get the BEST (AND QUICKER) RESULTS, follow a nutrition plan that supports your goals. Get a customized nutrition plan in my app. &#10;&#10;Hit this link to try your customized plan FREE for 7 days: https://get.growwithjo.app/UVuo/myapp&#10;&#10;_______________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;SHOP&#10;&#10;Grow With Jo APP &#8594;https://get.growwithjo.app/UVuo/myapp&#10;Workbooks &#38; Video Programs &#8594; https://www.godaily.ca/&#10;Big Booty Tight Tummy Guided Video Program (BEST SELLER): https://