    title "Cardio Kickboxing Fat Burning, Low Impact Workout| growwithjo"
    description "This low impact cardio kickboxing workout was challenging but totally doable and totally worth it. &#10;&#10;I was able to burn over 380 calories in 30 minutes! Make sure to do a full body cool down after you complete this workout to increase the effectiveness of the workout and your recovery time. Also make sure to re-hydrate especially if you sweat a lot! This will help decrease cravings and again, help you recover from all your hard work!&#10;&#10;This workout is perfect for BEGINNERS as all the exercises are standing and low impact. Perfect for even those with knee pain or back pain.&#10;&#10;Grab a friend,  your mom, or even your baby and lets get our move and groove on with this intense (but fun) kickboxing workout!&#10;&#10;Fun Workout Easy Workout All Standing No Equipment Beginner Friendly Fitness Videos Indoor Cardio Workout&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;SHARE YOUR WORKOUT VIDEOS on Tik Tok, YouTube or Instagram for a chance to be featured in my next video!&#10;________________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;RESULTS&#10;&#10;Record a video or take a picture of you doing the workout, tag me @growwithjo #growwithjo @growwithjo_united&#10;&#10;To get the BEST (AND QUICKER) RESULTS, follow a nutrition plan that supports your goals. Get a customized nutrition plan in my app. &#10;&#10;Hit this link to try your customized plan FREE for 7 days: https://get.growwithjo.app/UVuo/myapp&#10;&#10;_______________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;SHOP&#10;&#10;Grow With Jo APP &#8594;https://get.growwithjo.app/UVuo/myapp&#10;Workbooks &#38; Video Programs &#8594; https://www.godaily.ca/&#10;&#10;_________________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;KEEP UP WITH ME&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM &#8594; https://www.instagram.com/growwithjo/?hl=en&#10;FACEBOOK &#8594; https://www.facebook.com/growwithjoofficial/&#10;PINTEREST &#8594; https://www.pinterest.ca/growwithjo/&#10;CONTACT EMAIL &#8594; support@groww