    title "11 LINE ABS WORKOUT - 8 MIN. for 2 Weeks / lose love handles - tone side abs | Mary Braun"
    description "My lovely active Community!!! How are we doing ?&#10;Another Challenge for YOU and YOUR ABS just right before summer is here.&#10;For the next 2 Weeks we will be working on our side abs and the muffin top / love handles area :) &#10;I hope you will stay with me and get into your best after quarantine shape.&#10;&#10;&#10;The 8 Min. Workout is made of exercises that :&#10;&#9656; focus on your side abs (obliques)&#10;&#9656; include side planks&#10;&#9656; will strengthen your whole core &#10;&#10;I like to do quick and effective short workouts for a longer period of time. Your muscles will grow after time when you do repetitive exercises and that's what we want, YES! &#10;BE STRONG AND FEEL STRONG.&#10;Never forget, you have to feel good in your own body and you are perfect the way you like and love yourself, no matter what others say. Focus on yourself.&#10;&#10;Let me know in the comments how you liked it and what you want to see more of, leave a like and we will see us as soon as you are ready for another workout with me.&#10;&#10;For weekly Workout Plans, keep an eye on my Instagram Stories and Posts here on Youtube.&#10;- &#9829;&#65039; MY GOAL is to offer you free access to build the body you want, stay healthy &#38; fit and have fun while working out &#9829;&#65039; - &#10;&#10;Lots of powerful love,&#10;Mary&#10;&#10;_____________________________&#10;&#10;Workout Equipment:&#10;https://www.picker.me/l/eb5cb2e5&#10;&#10;MUSIC by Epidemic Sound&#10;https://www.epidemicsound&#10;&#10;Follow me on Instagram for daily Motivation &#9829;&#65038;&#10;Instagram: @_marybraun&#10;https://www.instagram.com/_marybraun/?hl=en&#10;&#10; Business Contact:  marybraun.info@gmail.com"
