    title "BLACK GENETICS EXPLAINED"
    description "In this video I explain the truth about &#34;BLACK GENETICS&#34;. My intention is only to educate, not to discriminate.&#10;I learnt a lot of this information from watching Team 3D Alpha's video on Black Genetics. I followed up by researching for myself to see if what I had learnt was reliable. And I have come to find that this information is true and reliable.&#10;Check out Team 3D Alpha's video:&#10;https://youtu.be/miaqz2HMxKI&#10;&#10;&#10;&#128359;&#128359;&#128359; TIMESTAMPS &#128359;&#128359;&#128359;&#10;0:05 I'm Not Racist&#10;0:11 Is It True&#10;Factor to bear in mind:&#10;2:00 Genetic Diversity&#10;Reasons:&#10;3:20 No. 1 Natural Selection&#10;5:37 No. 2 The Power Gene&#10;7:56 No. 3 Myostatin&#10;8:16 No. 4 Androgen Receptors&#10;Rest Of The Video:&#10;8:45 Not Only Black People Have These Genes&#10;9:39 What You Need To Know&#10;10:14 Check Out Team 3D Alpha&#10;&#10;&#10;Like This Video?&#10;Check out some more down below.&#10;&#10;VIDEOS&#10;&#10;The Role Race Plays in Sport&#10;https://youtu.be/ioeeTmGJBis&#10;&#10;&#10;SOCIAL MEDIA&#10;&#10;Instagram:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/sonofbarfour/&#10;&#10;&#10;&#11093;&#11093;&#11093; SOURCES &#11093;&#11093;&#11093;&#10;&#10;ACTN3 Overall&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC1180686/#!po=27.4194&#10;https://www.frontiersin.org/articles/10.3389/fphys.2017.01080/full&#10;ACTN3 X TESTOSTERONE&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4042656/&#10;ACTN3 X Race&#10;https://core.ac.uk/download/pdf/153210997.pdf &#10;&#10;MYOSTATIN X Race&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC1698719/ &#10;Malaria X Muscle&#10;https://notpoliticallycorrect.me/2017/12/30/malaria-the-sickle-cell-trait-and-fast-twitch-muscle-fibers/amp/&#10;Haemoglobin X Race&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC2609411/&#10;Black Men X Testosterone&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4327897/&#10;&#10;&#10;&#128341;&#128341;&#128341; TIMESTAMPS &#128341;&#128341;&#128341;&#10;&#10;0:05 I'm Not Racist&#10;0:11 Is It True&#10;2:00 Genetic Diversity&#10;3:20 No. 1 Natural Selection&#10;5:37 No. 2 The Power Gene&#10;7:56 No. 3 Myostatin&#10;8:16 No. 4 Androgen Receptors&#10;8:45 Not Only Black People Have These Genes&#10;9:39 What You Need To Know&#10;10:14 Check Out Team 3D Alpha"
