    description "Stephanie Sanzo aka StephFitMum is back with another workout video.  This time Sanzo is giving us a complete inside look at her leg day.  In addition, she answers the question &#34;Should Guys Train Glutes Like Girls Do?&#34;. &#10;&#9658; Shop Primeval Labs: http://bit.ly/2RkASHD&#10;&#9658; Subcribe to the Primeval Labs YouTube Channel: http://bit.ly/2CjQNf7&#10;&#9658; More Videos from StephFitMum: http://bit.ly/2Ch97Wa&#10;&#10;| Stephanie Sanzo's Hypertrophy Leg Workout |&#10;1. Leg Extension: 2 sets, 10 reps&#10;2. Seated Glute Abduction Machine: 2 sets, 10 reps&#10;3. Lying Hamstring Curl: 2 sets, 10 reps&#10;4. Superset&#10;    a. Walking Lunges: 4 sets, 10-12 reps, Each Leg&#10;    b. Romanian Deadlift: 4 sets, 10-12 reps&#10;5. Superset&#10;    a. Seated Leg Press: 4 sets, 10-12 reps&#10;    b. Glute Hamstring Raise Machine: 4 sets, 10-12 reps&#10;6. Machine Weighted Glute kick Backs: 4 sets, 10-12 reps&#10;7. Superset&#10;    a. Cable Pull Through: 3 sets, 10-12 reps&#10;    b. Cable Squats: 3 sets, 10-12 reps &#10;&#10;| Follow StephFitMum |&#10;&#9658; YouTube: http://bit.ly/2CrBvoT&#10;&#9658; Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/stephaniesanzo/&#10;&#10;========================================&#173;=====&#10;&#10;| Primeval Labs Supplements |&#10;&#9658; Mega Pre: http://bit.ly/2CQBDz0&#10;&#9658; Mega Pre Black: http://bit.ly/2CUqBc3&#10;&#9658; Intracell 7 Black: http://bit.ly/2CQcaG8&#10;&#9658; Isolit: http://bit.ly/2CVcLpO&#10;&#9658; Ape Sh*t Untamed Pre-Workout: http://bit.ly/2CSymiR&#10;&#9658; EAA Max: http://bit.ly/2CQByvc&#10;&#9658; EAA Max Energy: http://bit.ly/2CQbqRm&#10;&#9658; EAA Sleep: http://bit.ly/2CRLch2&#10;&#9658; Glory MV: http://bit.ly/2CSEAz3&#10;&#9658; Gorilla Pumps: http://bit.ly/2D3X7sz&#10;&#9658; Mega Test: http://bit.ly/2CSrBNL&#10;&#9658; Neanderthal: http://bit.ly/2CR5NSU&#10;&#9658; Prim-ATP: http://bit.ly/2CUs9mn&#10;&#9658; Primalog: http://bit.ly/2CTpf1k&#10;&#9658; Primavar: http://bit.ly/2CQdc