    step 1
    date "2022-07-06T23:17:27Z"
    title "Beginner Butt-Thigh Workout."
    description "For this workout routine, you can warm up with  40 Jumping Jacks, 5 minutes treadmill run on a comfortable speed, as much as possible you should be in control. &#10;&#10;&#10;The workout routine : &#10;&#10;1. Goblet Squat : 10 reps x 3 sets. You rest for 60 secs after each set and then you do the next and the next. &#10;&#10;2.Single Dumbbell  Romanian Deadlift : 10 reps x 3 sets. You rest for 60 secs after each set and then you do the next and the next. &#10;&#10;3. Dumbbell Glute bridge: 10 reps x 3 sets. You rest for 60 secs after each set and then you do the next and the next. &#10;&#10;NB: The dumbbell used for these exercises is 30Lbs, that's about 15kg thereabout. &#10;&#10;4. Lying leg curls: 10 reps x 3 sets. You rest for 60 secs after each set and then you do the next and the next. &#10;&#10;The weight selected on the machine was 10kg. &#10;&#10;There you have it, let's know how you like it. &#10;&#10;Always keep it simple."
