    title "TOP ABS TINY WAIST Workout~Burn Belly Fat In 14 Days | Abs &#38; Core Strength At Home, No Equipment"
    description "My TOP ABS TINY WAIST Workout~Burn Belly Fat In 14 Days | 14 Best Abs Exercises I recommend&#10;&#10;Are you struggling to get rid of belly fat And keep it off? First you need to know what causes fat on your belly; Causes include poor diet, lack of exercise, and short or low-quality sleep, Stress and depression among others. Stress triggers the release of cortisol, a hormone that makes you crave high-fat, carb-heavy foods like pizza, fries, and cookies. Cortisol also deposits fat around your belly. Another way stress leads to weight gain is by keeping you up at night. People who sleep fewer hours tend to have more belly fat. Do these ab exercises along with a HIIT workout to burn extra body calories. Do this routine exclusively to tone and shape your core.&#10;&#10;I also recommend these core workout routines&#128071;100% &#10;&#9728;BRUTAL!! LOSE BELLY FAT In 14 Days | At Home Debloating V-Abs Workout That Works Faster&#10;https://youtu.be/lf33JD8m07g&#10;&#9728;Intense LOWER BELLY Fat Burn&#128293; Workout You Need Immediately (Waist And Abs), &#10;https://youtu.be/K5xdDDr7H4Y&#10;&#9728;Lose &#8220;MUFFIN TOP FAT + Lower Belly&#8221; At Home Intense Workout To Get Rid of Love Handles ~ https://youtu.be/fRjTL4-bGfY&#10;&#9728;10 EASY EXERCISES TO LOSE BELLY FAT And Slim Waist In 10 Mins~No Crunches ~ https://youtu.be/oDRsmjZcU0s&#10;&#10;The key to achieving your fitness and health goals is consistency and healthy lifestyle changes, without restriction.&#10;Feel free to ask me questions, I respond to all.&#10;&#10;DO THIS CHALLENGE: FLAT STOMACH IN 7 DAYS&#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLAHbQRajfllbZ5MIXSFjdLWb05oaiq4mh&#10;&#10;&#9728;6-WEEK-AB-GUIDE&#10;https://janekatefitness.com/products/6-week-ab-guide&#10;&#9728; `6 WEEK BOOTY GUIDE`&#10;https://janekatefitness.com/products/6-weeks-booty-guide&#10;&#10;Follow me on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/katendejane/?hl=en&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -