    title "Pilates Butt &#38; Thigh Workout  | 10 Day Challenge For LOWER BODY RESULTS"
    description "This pilates workout will define, tone, and sculpt your legs, butt, thighs, and hamstrings giving you beautiful lower body muscle definition. Our Boho Beautiful pilates 10 day challenge will take your strength and toning to the next level, leaving you with amazing leg definition and weight loss. &#10;&#10;BOHO BEAUTIFUL PILATES 10 DAY CHALLENGE DETAILS:&#10;&#10;For the next 10 days in a row complete this current video every single day and for anyone looking to challenge themselves further, follow it up with the second suggested Boho Beautiful Pilates workout.&#10;&#10;*Note: The second class is labeled optional and is your bonus workout for that day. You can add this secondary class into your workout or ignore it if you feel that your body has had enough that day. &#10;&#10;Day 1:&#10;Complete This Video Only&#10;&#10;Day 2:&#10;Complete This Video + (optional) Pilates For Toned Core&#10;https://youtu.be/rHq1Heh4z9o&#10;&#10;Day 3:&#10;Complete This Video + (optional) 10 Min Total Body Pilates&#10;https://youtu.be/hyZ60tjoud8&#10;&#10;Day 4:&#10;Complete This Video +(optional) 10 Min Leg Toning Workout&#10; https://youtu.be/YEETslOqmZs&#10;&#10;Day 5:&#10;Complete This Video + (optional) Pilates Total Core&#10;https://youtu.be/laxxGDWRteU&#10;&#10;Day 6:&#10;Complete This Video + (optional) Leg &#38; Inner Thigh Challenge&#10;https://youtu.be/oBEquqAe8Js&#10;&#10;&#10;Day 7:&#10;Complete This Video+ (optional) Pilates For Core &#38; Waistline&#10;https://youtu.be/23N21WheMRk&#10;&#10;Day 8:&#10;Complete This Video+ (optional) Pilates Yoga Workout&#10;https://youtu.be/d74QgltJUnQ&#10;&#10;&#10;Day 9:&#10;Complete This Video+ (optional) Pilates Body Burn&#10;https://youtu.be/7IyYtxdDqJw&#10;&#10;&#10;Day 10:&#10;Complete This Video+ (optional) Ultimate 10 Min Pilates Workout &#10;https://youtu.be/LhGmNiBfFrA&#10;&#10;Pilates Class Instructor: Juliana Spicoluk&#10;Video Production: Mark Spicoluk&#10;____________________________________________________