    description "This yoga stretch class for full front and middle splits will help you achieve your split goals and at the same time extremely improve your leg and hip flexibility. This Boho Beautiful yoga practice for all levels can be done on its own or as part of our 14 day challenge if you are looking for fast and incredible results. &#10;&#10;14 DAY SPLITS CHALLENGE &#10;&#10;Details: Complete the videos listed for each day which include this current video and another yoga class that will help you continue to expand your physical flexibility and help release muscular tension. &#10;&#10;Both classes will add up to be about 1 HR of yoga per day so please set aside an hour per day to complete this challenge and to gain the ultimate results. &#10;_______________________________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;WEEK 1&#10;&#10;Day 1:&#10;Complete This Video Only&#10;&#10;Day 2:&#10;Complete This Video + Easy Stretch &#38; Stress Release&#10;https://youtu.be/koUi-AgsowQ&#10;&#10;Day 3:&#10;Complete This Video + Full Body Yoga Workout&#10;https://youtu.be/Fd3Su5lWJsw&#10;&#10;Day 4:&#10;Complete This Video + Perfect Morning Yoga Flow&#10;https://youtu.be/oA6vjBPlmCE&#10;&#10;Day 5:&#10;Complete This Video + Yoga For Digestion&#10;https://youtu.be/JdcmIkFCzfI&#10;&#10;Day 6:&#10;Complete This Video + Yoga Class For Total Body Recharge&#10;https://youtu.be/FpgscxwZ_-s&#10;&#10;Day 7:&#10;Complete This Video+ Blissful Yin Yoga Experience&#10;https://youtu.be/IYiV4ztPVu0&#10;&#10;&#10;WEEK 2&#10;&#10;Day 8:&#10;Complete This Video + Yoga Flow For The Full Body&#10;https://youtu.be/g4wbPoWvsdo&#10;&#10;Day 9:&#10;Complete This Video + Gentle Yoga To Feel Your Best&#10;https://youtu.be/rUpkZZAGDzw&#10;&#10;Day 10:&#10;Complete This Video + Blissful Yoga Flow For Unsettling Times&#10;https://youtu.be/ENr27Q1hKsw&#10;&#10;Day 11:&#10;Complete This Video + Yin Yoga Deep Stretch&#10;https://youtu.be/BsKUBO_TPRk&#10;&#10;Day 12:&#10;Complete This Video + Yoga To Stretch &#38; Feel The Bliss&#10;https://youtu.be/6zzeSJxJS4s&#10;&#10;Day 13:&#10;Complete This Video + Breathtaking Yin Yoga Class&#10;https://youtu.be/7mi15YbS8wg&#10;&#10;Day 14:&#10;Complete This Video + Yoga For Flexibility &#10;https://youtu.be/IZCJiTqdPm8&#10;&#10;__________________________________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;Boho Beautiful Yoga Links:&#10;&#10;Boho Beautiful Official- Our NEW Streaming Platform &#38; App&#10;https://www.bohobeautiful.tv&#10;&#10;Download from your App Store Right Now!&#10;Apple Store- https://apps.apple.com/us/app/boho-beautiful-official/id1508335876 &#10;Android Store- https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.bohobeautiful.BohoBeautifulTV&#10;&#10;Get Two FREE Boho Beautiful Books here!&#10;https://www.bohobeautiful.life/returnhome&#10;&#10;Boho Beautiful Life- Our 2nd More Personal Youtube Channel:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBbs2c6JCjU_HZPOeY6jWVg/?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;Boho Beautiful RETREAT- Your 7 Day Home Yoga Retreat&#10;https://bohobeautiful.life/retreat&#10;&#10;Boho Instagram- http://instagram.com/bohobeautifullife&#10;&#10;#BohoBeautiful #Splits #BohoBeautifulYoga&#10;Boho Beautiful is Juliana Spicoluk and Mark Spicoluk&#10;&#10;----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Boho Beautiful is a yoga fitness lifestyle channel created by Juliana Spicoluk and Mark Spicoluk that is creating positive content for your body, mind, and the earth. Yoga, Wanderlust, Fitness, Vegan food, Conscious Living, and Meditation!&#10;&#10;Thank you so much for watching and subscribing to our channel! &#10;Connect With Us!&#10;&#10;Our Custom App &#38; Streaming Platform- https://www.bohobeauitful.tv&#10;Premium Programs- https://www.bohobeautiful.life/our-store&#10;Boho Beautiful Website- https://www.bohobeautiful.life&#10;Instagram- http://instagram.com/bohobeautifullife&#10;Facebook: http://facebook.com/b