    title "Weighted Ab Workout for More Defined Abs (DUMBBELL ONLY!)"
    description "For 3 free tips on how to drop body fat fast tailored for your body type and goals, take my free body type fitness quiz - &#128073; http://vshred.fit/weightedabworkout  &#128072;&#10;&#10;What&#8217;s going on guys! In today&#8217;s video, I&#8217;m gonna be showing you a weighted 6 pack ab workout you can try out to help you get stronger, more defined, visible abs! You'll only need one dumbbell for this workout so pick a weight that's appropriate for you (form is always more important so pick a weight you can control)&#10;&#10;&#9989;Perform 3 sets of 10 for each exercise below&#10;&#9200;Rest 45 Seconds between each set&#10;1&#65039;&#8419; Dumbbell Reverse Crunch&#10;2&#65039;&#8419; Dumbbell Side Plank Rotations&#10;3&#65039;&#8419; Behind-Head Dumbbell Crunch'&#10;4&#65039;&#8419; Dumbbell Straight-Arm Russian Twists&#10;&#10;&#128071; Trying this out? Drop a comment below and let me know!&#10;&#10;Weighted Ab Workout for More Defined Abs (DUMBBELL ONLY!)&#10;https://youtu.be/hW8wJq1RxzM&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Check out My Supplement Stacks! &#10;&#10;For Fat Loss : http://vshred.fit/YTFatLossStack97&#10;&#10;For Muscle Building : http://vshred.fit/YTMuscleBuildingStack97&#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Intro Song: Always Have by Castor Troy"
