  node [
    id 7838
    label "NF7XhCsITnU"
    step 1
    date "2021-03-07T23:08:37Z"
    title "30 MIN UPPER BODY WORKOUT WITH DUMBBELLS + HIIT | 6 WEEK SHRED &#8211; DAY 17"
    description "Welcome to day 17 our our 6 Week Shred Workout Program! Together we're going to tackle this 30 minute upper body dumbbell workout consisting of complex exercises followed by 60 seconds of bodyweight HIIT exercises that will replace your cardio and get that heart PUMPING! The goal is to build strength and endurance while burning as many calories as possible. This upper body HIIT workout has it all &#128517;&#10;&#10;As we already mentioned, in this dumbbell HIIT workout we'll be working through complex exercises, combining 2 exercises back-to-back for 30 seconds each. As we get deeper into the 6 Week Shred we'll be increasing the HIIT and cardio in these workouts so that you're in a constant state of fat burning. Work hard! The clock will expire (eventually) so leave it all out there and enjoy those rest periods when you can!&#10;&#10;If you've been following the 6 Week Shred then you know I love HIIT exercises. In fact, this winter I haven't done any other cardio &#8211; no running, hiking, cycling, etc... All of my cardio is coming from HIIT exercises and TBD... I feel like I have more cardiovascular health than ever before! So once again, we'll be adding HIIT exercises throughout this workout, but we're going to push the limits of your endurance and mental strength. Each HIIT exercise will last for 1 minute to get that heart rate up and to burn more calories. This of this workout like a strength + cardio session in one. Don't quit! Take breaks as needed, hit pause, get some water... but finish the workout. You got this!&#10;&#10;Equipment for this workout:&#10;- A pair of dumbbells at least (I&#8217;ll be using 2 pairs in this workout, 2 x 20 lbs and 2 x 30 lbs). Pick up the heavier set if you want this workout to be more challenging.&#10;- A mat&#10;&#10;As mentioned earlier, each complex set is 1 minute long and will consist of two exercises that you'll perform back-to-back for 30 seconds each. After the 1 minute set you'll have 30 seconds to rest before going into a 1 minute HIIT exercise that will raise your heart rate and act as cardio to burn calories. Then we'll rest another 30 seconds before moving on to the next complex set.&#10;&#10;We'll repeat this format throughout the entire workout. See below for the exercises:&#10;&#10;0:20 Tricep Extension&#10;0:50 Cobra Push Ups&#10;&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;1:50 Mountain Climbers&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;&#10;3:20 Bent Over Row&#10;3:50 Hammer Curls&#10;&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;4:50 High Knees&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;&#10;6:20 Shoulder Press&#10;6:50 Bent Arm Lateral Raises&#10;&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;7:50 Shoulder Taps&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;&#10;9:20 Wide Curls&#10;9:50 Bent Over Delt Rows&#10;&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;10:50 Swimmers&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;&#10;12:20 Chest Press&#10;12:50 Dead Stop Push Up&#10;&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;13:50 Spider Climbers&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;&#10;15:20 Snatch R&#10;15:50 Snatch L&#10;&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;16:50 Bicycles&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;&#10;18:20 Upright Row&#10;18:50 Front to Lateral Raise&#10;&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;19:50 Skaters&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;&#10;21:20 Supine Row&#10;21:50 Alternating Curls&#10;&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;22:50 Pop SquatS&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;&#10;24:20 Renegade Rows&#10;24:50 Wide Push Ups&#10;&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;25:50 Reverse Crunches&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;&#10;27:20 Dumbbell Swing&#10;27:50 Curl to Press&#10;&#10;Rest 30 Seconds&#10;28:50 Burpees&#10;&#10;LINKS:&#10;Dumbbells: https://amzn.to/3s8KS5V &#10;Mat: https://rstyle.me/+xlZqgv4HoIhJT03-htasHw &#10;Sneakers: @NOBULL  &#10;&#10;This is part of our 6 WEEK SHRED WORKOUT PLAN.&#10;Add this playlist to your favorites so you can come back every day &#128073;&#127996; https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL2NpXBzdtNam-M_8y6FFypSf7ae8Ph4_6 &#10;&#10;If you haven't already, be sure to check out our ABS VIDEO PLAYLIST for some of our favorite abs workouts &#128073;&#127996; https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL2NpXBzdtNakxT83kAFnxoKcNwYXFk9Cp &#10;&#10;LIKE if you crushed this at home upper body workout with dumbbells. &#10;COMMENT to let us know what other videos you want to see. &#10;SUBSCRIBE to never miss a workout!&#10;FOLLOW us on IG: https://www.instagram.com/tiffxdan/ &#10;&#10;As always, THANK YOU for watching!  We feel so grateful to have such an amazing YouTube family. &#10;&#10;TIFF x DAN &#10;&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: TIFF x DAN strongly recommend that you consult your physician before starting any exercise or workout program. You should be in good physical + mental condition + able to participate in the exercises. You should be aware + understand that when participating in any exercise or exercise program, there is the possibility of physical injury. If you engage in this workout, exercise or exercise program, you agree that you do so at your own risk, are voluntarily participating in these activities, assume all risk of injury to yourself, + agree to release and discharge TIFF x DAN from any and all claims or causes of action, known or unknown, arising out of TIFF x DAN negligence."
    channel_title "TIFF x DAN"
