    title "Standing DEEP CORE Workout (Simple &#38; Super Effective)"
    description "Visit us at our website http://pilatesforthepeople.com&#10;Follow us on facebook: http://facebook.com/pilatesforthepeople&#10;Instagram: http://instagram.com/pilates4thepeople&#10;&#10;In this video, your certified Pilates instructors Brittany Coughlan Murphy and Andrea Palen, show you a simple routine to get at the deep muscles of your core all while standing.&#10;&#10;These standing exercises also target the muscles of your glutes, legs, ankles and feet - all of which are important for stand taller and getting stronger.&#10;&#10;PILATES FOR THE PEOPLE is an online Pilates studio on a mission to help you feel better then you ever thought possible.&#10;&#10;Please leave us a comment and tell us what kind of workouts you want us to make."
