    title "My First Experience With Gravity Boots Resolved My Back Pain + My Review"
    description "Gravity Boot Supplier Recommendations:&#10;&#10;(USA) Teeter Gravity Boots Without Hang Up - https://amzn.to/2MJx2Vt&#10;Teeter Hang Ups With Gravity Boots - https://amzn.to/2P0EOYr&#10;&#10;(UK) Teeter Gravity Boots Without Hang Up - https://amzn.to/2P1qb7z&#10;Teeter Hang Ups With Gravity Boots- https://amzn.to/2P0EOYrhttps://amzn.to/2P13roe&#10;&#10;Janessa's Youtube Channel: https://bit.ly/2BEQ0IJ&#10;&#10;My First Experience With Gravity Boots Resolved My Back Pain + My Review&#10;&#10;So recently i bought some Gravity Boots after a friend reminding me about these amazing boots to vertical hang yourself up side down by your feet!&#10;&#10;I had heard of this recently and i want to buy some in Thailand but i could not find any but the other day i looked again and i found some which i am very happy about because as soon as i tried them out it resolved my lower back pain and cracked my whole back.&#10;&#10;This was a very profound experience i had the other day and now i am hooked to this things as they just give such great back and muscular relief especially after working at a desk for quite some time in the sitting position which is very well known for cause back muscle and back pain issues.&#10;&#10;In this video i share with you my whole experience with using the gravity boots for the first time, the health benefits from using them, why they are so effective for back related issues and my full review on gravity boots etc.&#10;&#10;My First Experience With Gravity Boots Resolved My Back Pain + My Review&#10;&#10;Please SUBSCRIBE &#38; Support Here https://bit.ly/2IBKwgE&#10;&#10;NOTE: When you subscribe to my channel, you don't automatically receive an email notification when I upload a new video. Please go to: http://www.youtube.com/subscription_manager?feature=feed and manually check the box that says 'send me updates' next to my name.&#10;&#10;WANT TO SEND ME SOMETHING?&#10;Mr Danny Glass&#10;The Odyssey Serviced Apartment&#10;41 Viangbua Road&#10;T. Changpuek&#10;A. Muang &#10;Chiang Mai &#10;50300&#10;Thailand &#10;&#10;MY SOCIAL MEDIA LINKS:&#10;D.Tube: https://d.tube/#!/c/conscalisthenics&#10;Steemit: https://steemit.com/@conscalisthenics&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/consciouscalisthenics/&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/consciouscalisthenics/&#10;&#10;How to Eat One Meal a Day (OMAD Diet) Video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aL6UC5ibP3s&#38;t=15s&#10;&#10;ONE MEAL A DAY WHAT I EAT IN A DAY VIDEOS PLAYLIST (PLANT BASED VEGAN DIET):&#10;What I Eat In A Day - One Meal A Day - https://bit.ly/2IpcLiG&#10;&#10;16/8 INTERMITTENT FASTING WHAT I EAT IN A DAY VIDEOS PLAYLIST (PLANT BASED VEGAN DIET):&#10;What I Eat In A Day - Intermittent Fasting - https://bit.ly/2ImuVBG&#10;&#10;THE SHOES I WEAR:&#10;Vibram V Running Shoe (Bikla Evo) - http://amzn.to/2ETi1MV&#10;Vibram Men's KSO EVO Five Finger Shoes - http://amzn.to/2GFlmMY&#10;&#10;My Filming Equipment:&#10;Canon EOS 70D Digital SLR Camera (Body Only) - https://amzn.to/2GaZq0r&#10;Canon EF-S 10-18mm f/4.5-5.6 IS STM Lens - https://amzn.to/2GhDIDG&#10;GoPro HERO6 Black - https://amzn.to/2IAJAct&#10;&#10;My Microphones: &#10;Shure VP83 LensHopper Mounted Microphone - https://amzn.to/2rWXRtQ&#10;&#10;My Microphone Wind Muffs:&#10;Shure A83-FUR Windjammer For VP83 Microphone- https://amzn.to/2Gywtqw&#10;&#10;My Camera SD Card:&#10;SanDisk Extreme Pro 64GB SDXC UHS-I Memory Card - https://amzn.to/2IC3RhU&#10;&#10;My Tripods:&#10;Innorel RT40 Carbon Fiber Light Weight Tripod - https://amzn.to/2ID3i7o&#10;JOBY GorillaPod Focus with Ballhead X Bundle -https://amzn.to/2GftCn1&#10;&#10;My Spare Batteries:&#10;Bonacell 2 Pack 2600mAh Spare Batteries For Canon 70D - https://amzn.to/2KIgCbt&#10;&#10;My Laptop:&#10;Apple MacBook Pro 13.3-Inch Laptop 2015 Model - https://amzn.to/2umGoyv&#10;&#10;My Laptop Case:&#10;Macbook Pro 13 Inch Heavy Duty Case - https://amzn.to/2ICDc4G&#10;&#10;My External High Speed Hard Drive:&#10;Samsung T5 Portable SSD 1TB External - https://amzn.to/2LffzRe&#10;&#10;The Protein Powders I Use:&#10;Garden of Life, RAW Organic Protein, Organic Plant Formula, Unflavoured - https://iherb.co/pd2s4zR&#10;Garden of Life, RAW Organic Protein, Organic Plant Formula, Vanilla - https://iherb.co/5p73CZS9&#10;Nature's Plus, Organic Pea Protein Powder - https://iherb.co/y6ponYc&#10;&#10;The Protein Bars I Use:&#10;Garden of Life, Organic Plant-Based Protein Bar, Peanut Butter Chocolate - https://iherb.co/DGV5LPX &#10;Garden of Life, Organic Plant-Based Protein Bar, Sea Salt Caramel - https://iherb.co/DGV5LPX&#10;&#10;The Supplements I Use:&#10;Allmax Creatine Monohydrate: http://amzn.to/2snm2nm&#10;Thorne Research, Basic Nutrients - https://iherb.co/cwMAKrU&#10;Lugols Iodine 5% (12.50mg of Iodine per drop): http://amzn.to/2sF6Wpz&#10;Magnesium Malate - https://iherb.co/33js15PG&#10;Ovega-3 Omega 3 Vegan EPA/DHA - http://amzn.to/2ine3SX&#10;DHEA (Dehydroepiandrosterone) 25 mg - https://amzn.to/2upVxz8&#10;RAW Hemp Oil 2000mg CBD + CBDa (Coupon code: consciouscalisthenics - 10% off) - https://bit.ly/2sJCeNd"
