    title "45 Minute Total Body Tabata &#38; Abs Workout | Summertime Fine 3.0 - Day 81"
    description "Be ready to sweat as we rock into this full body workout! Welcome to DAY 81 of Summertime Fine 3.0! Please subscribe to the channel at the link here! www.youtube.com/c/sydneycummings?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;Get your July Tier 3 STF3 calendar (with clickable stretch days) here!&#10;https://www.royalchange.fit/store/p172/Summertime_Fine_3.0_-_Tier_3_-_July_2021_Workout_%26_Stretch_Calendar.html&#10;&#10;Grab your Summertime Fine tank top, t-shirt, or water bottle here! www.royalchange.fit/merch.html&#10;&#10;Join the Sydney Squad Accountability Group! https://www.royalchange.fit/sydneysquad&#10;&#10;Today is a full body workout so grab your water and be ready to move with me! We will be working for 20 seconds and resting for 10 seconds and we will perform 3-4 rounds of each exercise. With only 20 seconds of work, keep the intensity up and crush this workout with me! I used my 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30 pound dumbbells today so grab your weights and let's crush it!&#10;&#10;Exercises: &#10;1. Right arm squat tap and curl&#10;2. Left arm Squat tap and curl&#10;3. squat slider circles&#10;4. Squat hold quick tap out&#10;5. Back Fly &#10;6. Tricep Kickback&#10;7. Superman Pull back and knee bend&#10;8. Superman Hold&#10;9. Leg raises&#10;10. Leg Flutters &#10;11.Mermaid Chops with both legs&#10;12. clam shell&#10;13. Walking Lunges with chest fly&#10;14. Reverse Lunges with bicep curl&#10;15. Seated Twists&#10;16. Side plank dips right&#10;17. Side Plank Dips left &#10;18. Weighted Plank&#10;&#10;Shop at my Amazon store and grab a jump rope, a cordless rope, a thin band, etc !&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/sydneycummings&#10;&#10;Interested in my outfits? Check out my LIKEtoKNOW.it profile here!&#10;https://www.liketoknow.it/Sydney%20Cummings&#10;&#10;Use code SYDNEY for 20% off GHOST Supplements! https://www.ghostlifestyle.com/&#10;I am obsessed with these products and since I get so many questions on my favorite pre-workout and protein, I figured you 