    title "Losing Weight After 60 is Possible! Just Get Rid Of These 8 Things"
    description "Losing Weight After 60 is Possible! Just Get Rid Of These 8 Things&#10;&#10;It&#8217;s no secret that losing weight gets harder the older that we get. When I worked at a Pizza restaurant as a young woman, I could eat as much cheesy goodness as I wanted and not gain an ounce. Now, I just look at a glass of water and feel myself expanding. The good news, it that there are small things that we can do to get healthy at any age.&#10;&#10;So, in this morning&#8217;s video, I want to share 8 small things that you should get rid of if you want to get to a healthy weight in your 50s, 60s or better.&#10;&#10;What do you do to stay in shape? Do you exercise? Eat healthy food? Dance? Something else?&#10;&#10;Read our article and join the conversation here: https://sixtyandme.com/losing-weight-after-60-is-possible-just-get-rid-of-these-8-things/ &#10;&#10;***** ORDER YOUR DECK OF INSPIRATIONAL CARDS HERE *****&#10;&#10;Here's where you can get your deck of our AGING BEAUTIFULLY affirmation cards: https://iu161.infusionsoft.app/app/orderForms/Aging-Beautifully-A-46-Card-Deck&#10;&#10;*****WANT TO RETIRE IN LUXURY OVERSEAS?*****&#10;&#10;How could a luxurious cruise save you money when retiring overseas? Check out this free guide from International Living to get more and spend less on your next cruise! https://internationalliving.com/sixtyandme&#10;&#10;*****MAKE MORE FRIENDS THIS YEAR!*****&#10;&#10;If you believe in our mission to improve the lives of women over 60, please consider supporting us on Patreon. Learn how here: https://www.patreon.com/sixtyandme&#10;&#10;*****GET MORE FROM SIXTY AND ME*****&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE to my YouTube channel: http://www.youtube.com/subscription_center?add_user=sixtyandme&#10;&#10;Watch all of our yoga for seniors videos for FREE: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0rn7wEvImNM&#38;list=PLnZnSS8X96ZVvR7myoLhLT4s4SkJGQg8n &#10;&#10;Also, remember to check out everything Sixty and Me has to offer here: http://sixtyandme.com/start&#10;