  node [
    id 7944
    label "fFVMe8MjJS0"
    step 1
    date "2019-01-07T09:05:51Z"
    title "Big Mistakes &#38; Right Way |Episode-9 Abdomen Series| About Sides Fat"
    description "Hello everyone in this video we are showing big mistakes &#38; right way of lower sides belly fat, we are giving you exercise &#34;Sides On Hyper, Dumbbell Side Bend &#38; Twisting With Rod&#34; we are highlighting the small mistakes people make during in the abdomen training, Thank you&#10;&#10;&#10;Bonjour tout le monde dans cette vid&#233;o, nous montrons de grosses erreurs et la bonne mani&#232;re de la partie inf&#233;rieure du ventre, nous vous donnons l'exercice &#34;Sides On Hyper, courbure et torsion lat&#233;rale avec halt&#232;re avec la tige&#34; nous soulignons les petites erreurs que les gens font lors de l'entra&#238;nement de l'abdomen , Je vous remercie&#10;&#10;&#10;Hola a todos en este video, estamos mostrando grandes errores y la forma correcta de la parte inferior de la grasa abdominal, le estamos dando ejercicio &#34;Lados en Hyper, Dumbbell Side Bend &#38; Twisting With Rod&#34;, Gracias&#10;&#10;&#10;#bhupender_dhawan #dronacharya_gym #mukesh_gahlot&#10;&#10;( Follow- Bhupender Dhawan )&#10;&#10;Facebook- https://www.facebook.com/ibhupenderdh...&#10;Page- https://www.facebook.com/ibhupenderdh...&#10;Instagram- https://www.instagram.com/ibhupender_...&#10;Twitter- https://twitter.com/Dronacharya_Ji&#10;Youtube- https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrq2...&#10;&#10;&#10;( Follow Mukesh Singh )&#10;&#10;Facebook- https://www.facebook.com/mukesh.singh...&#10;Page- https://www.facebook.com/MrMukeshGahlot/&#10;Instagram- https://www.instagram.com/mrmukeshgah...&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Dronacharya The Gym,&#10;2575 Hudson Lane, Behind Khalsa College, GTB Nagar, Delhi-110009, Ph:- 9560847923&#10;&#10;Timing To Meet &#10;Morning 08:00 AM to 10:00 AM &#10;Evening 03:30 PM to 7:30 PM&#10;&#10;#bhupender_dhawan #dronacharya_gym #mukesh_gahlot"
