  node [
    id 7983
    label "J7OpXC_1gUA"
    step 1
    date "2021-04-26T14:59:00Z"
    title "Lose Love Handles In 14 Days Challenge [How To Get Rid Of Side Fat In 2 Weeks]"
    description "Here is a lose love handles in 14 days challenge for you! None of us like stubborn love handles that we can't seem to shrink or get rid of. In this challenge, we are going to shed our love handles, also known as the side fat around our waist and try to slim down our side fat love handles. This home workout is perfect for men who are trying to get rid of love handles in 2 weeks and is a perfect workout routine to add on to a good diet that is aimed to lose your side fat love handles fast in 2 weeks at home.&#10;&#10;Suggested number of sets and frequency:&#10;&#10;Option 1&#65039;&#8419; : (More difficult)&#10;&#128073;  Daily workout of 2 sets a day. 5 minutes rest in between sets.  No rest days.  &#10;&#128308;  Remember to stretch after 2 sets completed with this cool down stretch routine to promote recovery: https://youtu.be/sefs_GhBWfI&#10;&#128994;  1 &#34;set&#34; means watching the video and following along with the exercises till you complete watching the video. Simply refresh page for 2nd set.&#10;&#10;Option 2&#65039;&#8419; : (Easier)&#10;&#128073;  Work out on Monday, Wednesday, Friday, Sunday. 2 sets each day. 5 minutes rest in between sets. Carry on for 3 - 4 weeks to complete 14 TRAINING DAYS.&#10;&#128308;  Remember to stretch after 2 sets completed with this cool down stretch routine: https://youtu.be/sefs_GhBWfI&#10;&#128994;  1 &#34;set&#34; means watching the video and following along with the exercises till you complete watching the video. Simply refresh page for 2nd set.&#10;&#10;Diet:&#10;Cut down to the minimum for consumption of junk/fried/sugary food and drinks. &#128683;  &#127828;  &#129473;  &#127853; &#128683;&#10;&#10;Receive 45% off all Myprotein products using discount code &#8220;GAINZMYP&#8221; at checkout!&#10;&#9654;  Shop Now At Your Respective Regions:&#10;&#127482;&#127480;  Myprotein (US): https://tidd.ly/3fyWJo9&#10;&#127470;&#127475;  Myprotein (India): https://tidd.ly/2T7p65n&#10;&#127468;&#127463;  Myprotein (UK): https://tidd.ly/3f3oplY&#10;&#127464;&#127462;  Myprotein (Canada): https://tidd.ly/3fDyhlF&#10;&#127463;&#127479;  Myprotein (Brazil): https://tidd.ly/3f8d9Fb&#10;&#10;&#10060;  Tired of ads in the middle of a video? &#10060;&#10;&#9989;  Join us as a member to gain access to exclusive videos without ads!&#10;Join here &#9654; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCr2zrs9Lm-tlgh0Zr-5KZqA/join&#10;&#10;&#9654; NO ADS VERSION OF THIS VIDEO - https://youtu.be/u0ERryZXCfM&#10;&#10;Special Thanks To Channel Members:&#10;&#128170;  Gainz Supporters &#128170;&#10;Krishna Katepally&#10;Zachary Miller&#10;Naidu M&#10;Pratik Adhikari&#10;Amol Borde&#10;Anup Lo gaule &#10;Frederick Grande&#10;Jeanette Alegre&#10;Caroline Watson&#10;Getti Kuush&#10;Rahman Fasha&#10;AR Ashik BD &#10;Prakash v&#10;Jason Bray &#10;Adenola Olagbegi &#10;Ravi Asthana &#10;Viswanatha Reddy &#10;Denis Jourdain Talla &#10;&#10;&#128170; &#128170; Gainz Elite &#128170; &#128170; &#10;Nestor Sanabria&#10;&#10;&#10;&#128170; &#128170; &#128170; Ultimate Gainz Hero &#128170; &#128170; &#128170;&#10;Bannu&#10;AB Kandari1990&#10;&#10;Click here to join as a channel member&#10;&#9654; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCr2zrs9Lm-tlgh0Zr-5KZqA/join&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9654; Join Our Discord Server For More Diet &#38; Training Tips &#38; Discussion: https://discord.gg/yMkhKFJ2rF&#10;&#9654; Free Home Workout Programs: http://www.thegainzcenter.com/programs&#10;&#9654; Subscribe to the channel for home workout videos! - https://bit.ly/2VMkmzQ&#10;&#10;&#10;Welcome to The Gainz Center,  where we bring you weekly home workout videos without equipment to BUILD MUSCLE and BURN FAT so that you can be in the BEST SHAPE of your life by working out and exercise at home&#10;&#10;Music Credits:&#10;&#10;Song: SVRRIC &#38; ruindkid - Fall To My Grave ft. Silent Child [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds&#10;Free Download/Stream: http://NCS.io/FallToMyGrave&#10;Watch: http://youtu.be/11R9Hmzxg-k&#10;&#10;Song: Unknown Brain - Let You Go (ft. NotEvenTanner) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds&#10;Free Download/Stream: http://ncs.io/UBLetYouGo&#10;Watch: http://youtu.be/gdnzYaTcypw&#10;&#10;Song: T-Mass &#38; Britt Lari - Like Me [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds&#10;Free Download/Stream: http://ncs.io/LikeMe&#10;Watch: http://youtu.be/iQrYoJ5tRV8&#10;&#10;Song: N3WPORT - Alive (feat. Neoni) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds&#10;Free Download/Stream: http://ncs.io/NAlive&#10;Watch: http://youtu.be/vJAcXd_UtWQ&#10;&#10;Song: Besomorph - Afterlife (ft. EMM) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds&#10;Free Download/Stream: http://ncs.io/Afterlife&#10;Watch: http://youtu.be/F3B6qKchtzo&#10;&#10;Song: James Mercy - Take You On (feat. PhiloSofie) [NCS Release] &#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds &#10;Free Download/Stream: http://ncs.io/TYO &#10;Watch: http://youtu.be/&#10;&#10;Song: Time To Talk Ft. Dave Marriner - Say The Words [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds&#10;Free Download/Stream: http://NCS.io/SayTheWords&#10;Watch: http://youtu.be/QlocqB3dgp0"
