    step 1
    date "2022-06-25T03:38:10Z"
    title "10 Minute Lower Body Dumbbell Workout For Women| Day 11- Ambition"
    description "10 Minute Lower Body Workout With Weights-  Get strong legs with this 10 minute lower body workout with weights. This 10 minute lower body workout with weights is for all fitness levels. The exercises will be demonstrated and the modifications of each exercise will be provided. This is day 11 of the Ambition training program.&#10;&#10;Each exercise in this 10 minute lower body workout with weights will be performed for 40 seconds. There will be 2 rounds of every exercise. A 15 second break of rest will be between each exercise.  A warm-up and a cooldown will be provided before and after this workout.&#10;&#10;10 Minute Lower Body Workout With Weights&#10;1.) Forward Lunge Deadlift right side&#10;2.) Forward Lunge Deadlift left side&#10;3.) Plie Squat&#10;4.) Rainbows right side&#10;5.) Rainbows left side&#10;&#10;Time Stamps:&#10;00:00 10 Minute Lower Body Workout With Weights Introduction&#10;00:30 10 Minute Lower Body Workout With Weights Warm Up&#10;01:26 10 Minute Lower Body Workout With Weights Workout&#10;10:14 10 Minute Lower Body Workout  With Weights Cool Down&#10;&#10;&#9989; Subscribe for more FREE tips and workouts on how to reach your fitness goals: &#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0igEEZrTMF3Tntl2G4138Q&#10;&#10;#legsworkout #lowerbodydumbbellworkout #lowerbodyworkout&#10;&#10;&#128064;WATCH NEXT: &#10;https://youtu.be/rCb01yjCGb8&#10;https://youtu.be/ezSlti4TnO0&#10;&#10;&#128077;FREE GUIDE:&#10;&#10;&#128073; Free Guide http://www.shannaafitness.com/6-week-ambition-program&#10;&#128073; Free Guide http://www.shannaafitness.com/free-guide&#10;&#128073;Free 5k plan http://www.shannaafitness.com/free-5k-training-plan&#10;&#10;&#10;//WORK WITH SHANNA&#10;&#128073;1-on-1 online fitness coaching&#10;http://www.shannaafitness.com/online-coaching&#10;&#10;//COME SAY HI!&#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/shannaafitness&#10;&#10;&#10;//ABOUT: My name is Shanna, a licensed physical education teacher, and NASM certified persona