    step 1
    date "2011-05-26T16:38:53Z"
    title "15-Minute Ultimate Abs Workout Exercise Routine for a Flat Stomach &#38; Strong Core"
    description "This challenging abs toning exercise and workout video will give you a firm toned flat stomach. It is 15 solid minutes of abs exercises.  I motivate you step by step through my entire routine.  You will develop a strong stable core for overall greater fitness and defined oblique (side abs) muscles for that thin waist, v-shape look. This video is a 15-minute excerpt from my Absolute Abs Ultimate Workout Video.  The full video is available  on my channel for free if you would like to further challenge your abs with many more exercises.  (See the link below.) The  full video also features helpful diet tips to achieve that flat stomach.  With summer right around the corner, it's time to get serious and work those abs.  Please remember to subscribe because I have so much more to come; something helpful and of interest to everyone.  Thanks so much for viewing!&#10;&#10;Click here to go to my full 50 minute Absolute Abs Workout Video:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NYdYu8gjfS0&#38;index=15&#38;list=PLFD0A271F52C872EE&#10;&#10;Click here for many more of my Abs Exercise Workout Videos:  https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLFD0A271F52C872EE&#10;&#10;Click here for my Fat and Calorie Burning Cardio Workout Videos: &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E63OUoRuCSU&#38;list=PL29927E2D983CD789&#10;&#10;Click here for my videos on Toning Your Legs, Butt, and Thighs:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dCnLTka2bVw&#38;list=PL36471C0C52C33E2F&#10;&#10;Please click here to go to my Facebook page and don't forget to &#34;like&#34; me!  https://www.facebook.com/YouTips4U&#10;&#10;Please follow me on Twitter at:  https://www.twitter.com/YouTips4U&#10;&#10;To visit my at my blog, please click here: http://www.youtips4u.blogspot.com/"
