    title "12 Minute Splits Stretch Flexibility Workout For Beginners How To Tutorial For The Splits"
    description "Ever wondered how to get your splits but wasn't sure on what split stretches to try?! &#10;&#9829; Our FREE Yoga App for Apple: https://apple.co/2MhqR8n&#10;&#9829; Our FREE Yoga App for Android: https://bit.ly/2MidhBO&#10;&#10;&#9829; Start Your Two Week Free Trail &#10;http://www.wellnessplus.tv&#10;&#9829; Help Support This Channel&#10;http://www.patreon.com/psychetruth&#10;&#9829; Subscribe To Our Podcast&#10;http://wellnessplus.tv/podcast-audio/&#10;&#10;#WellnessPlus&#10;#DanceWithDonnie&#10;#SplitsWorkout&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;12 Minute Splits Stretch #Flexibility #Workout For #Beginners How To Tutorial&#10;&#10;Ever wondered how to get your #splits but wasn't sure on what split stretches to try?! Then check out this splits tutorial video for beginners. Along with #stretches for splits, you'll get a great workout and all under 12 minutes! Follow along to Donnie and Corrina Rachel as they show you how to do the splits in this fitness flexibility stretch routine for #cheerleaders, dancers, yogis and gymnasts! Good luck and we hope this helps you improve your splits!&#10;&#10;&#9829; Follow our Social Media&#10;https://www.instagram.com/psychetruth&#10;http://www.facebook.com/psychetruthvideos&#10;http://www.twitter.com/psychetruth&#10;&#10;Related Videos &#10;&#10;Full Body Stretches, How to Stretch for Beginners, Part 1: Upper Body, Home Workout Follow Along&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h2aBPh_2eEo&#10;&#10;8 Minute Ab Buster Workout W/ Dena Maddie &#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PgIDo_ZnmJk&#10;&#10;Thai Massage for Hip Pain, How to Massage Hips, Relaxing Body Work Techniques&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0m6Zw8JhHEA&#10;&#10;Other Related Videos &#10;&#10;Stretch Workout: 10 Minute Cheerleading How to for Flexibility and Splits&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f2m9JccdIL4&#10;&#10;Cheerleader 5 Minute Stretch Routine, Perfect Splits Follow Along, Cheer with Inez&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ESLVbOTc1Qk&#10;&#10;Cheerleader Stretching Flexibility Routine before Stunts, Cheer with Jennifer&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ofRgyw9Ao3w&#10;&#10;Music by iChill Music Factory &#10;http://www.ichillmusic.com &#10;&#10;&#169; Copyright 2013 Target Public Media, LLC. All Rights Reserved."
