    title "10 Minute Upper Body Dumbbell Workout  | Day 10- Ambition"
    description "10 Minute Upper Body Workout With Weights-  Get toned arms with this 10 minute upper body workout with weights. This 10 minute upper body workout with weights is for all fitness levels. The exercises will be demonstrated and the modifications of each exercise will be provided. This is day 10 of the Ambition training program.&#10;&#10;Each exercise in this 10 minute upper body workout with weights will be performed for 40 seconds. There will be 2 rounds of every exercise. A 15 second break of rest will be between each exercise.  A warm-up and a cooldown will be provided before and after this workout.&#10;&#10;10 Minute Upper Body Workout With Weights&#10;1.) Bicep Curl/Shoulder Press&#10;2.) Back Rows&#10;3.) Push-Ups&#10;4.) Skull Crusher&#10;&#10;Time Stamps:&#10;00:00 10 Minute Upper Body Workout With Weights Introduction&#10;00:30 10 Minute Upper Body Workout  With Weights Warm Up&#10;01:36 10 Minute Upper Body Workout With Weights&#10;09:11 10 Minute Upper Body Workout  With Weights Cool Down&#10;&#10;&#9989; Subscribe for more FREE tips and workouts on how to reach your fitness goals: &#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0igEEZrTMF3Tntl2G4138Q&#10;&#10;#armsworkout #upperbodydumbbellworkout #upperbodyworkout&#10;&#10;&#128064;WATCH NEXT: &#10;https://youtu.be/rCb01yjCGb8&#10;https://youtu.be/ezSlti4TnO0&#10;&#10;&#128077;FREE GUIDE:&#10;&#10;&#128073; Free Guide http://www.shannaafitness.com/6-week-ambition-program&#10;&#128073; Free Guide http://www.shannaafitness.com/free-guide&#10;&#128073;Free 5k plan http://www.shannaafitness.com/free-5k-training-plan&#10;&#10;&#10;//WORK WITH SHANNA&#10;&#128073;1-on-1 online fitness coaching&#10;http://www.shannaafitness.com/online-coaching&#10;&#10;//COME SAY HI!&#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/shannaafitness&#10;&#10;&#10;//ABOUT: My name is Shanna, a licensed physical education teacher, and NASM certified personal trainer, a veteran marathon runner, and a mom of 3! I am here to help mo