    description "10 MINUTE AB WORKOUT Plank- Get flat abs with this 10 minute ab workout plank. This 10 minute ab workout plank is for all fitness levels and requires no equipment. The exercises will be demonstrated and the modifications of each exercise will be provided.&#10;&#10;Each exercise will be performed for 40 seconds and there will be a 15 second rest between each exercise. There is a short warm-up and cool down during this workout.&#10;&#10;10 Minute Ab Workout Plank&#10;1.) Shoulder Tap Plank&#10;2.) Hip to Hip Plank&#10;3.) Side Plank Knee to Elbow right side&#10;4.) Side Plank Knee to Elbow left side&#10;5.) Plank Alternating Leg Lift&#10;&#10;Time Stamps:&#10;00:00 10 Minute Ab Workout Plank Introduction&#10;00:27 10 Minute Ab Workout Plank Warm-Up&#10;00:43 10 Minute Ab Workout Plank Workout&#10;10:13 10 Minute Ab Workout Plank Cool Down&#10;&#10;&#9989; Subscribe for more FREE tips and workouts on how to reach your fitness goals: &#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0igEEZrTMF3Tntl2G4138Q&#10;&#10;#10minuteabworkoutplank #abworkout #10minuteabworkoutnoequipment&#10;&#10;&#128064;WATCH NEXT: &#10;https://youtu.be/rCb01yjCGb8&#10;&#10;&#128077;FREE GUIDE:&#10;&#10;&#128073; Free Guide http://www.shannaafitness.com/6-week-ambition-program&#10;&#128073; Free Guide http://www.shannaafitness.com/free-guide&#10;&#128073;Free 5k plan http://www.shannaafitness.com/free-5k-training-plan&#10;&#10;&#10;//WORK WITH SHANNA&#10;&#128073;1-on-1 online fitness coaching&#10;http://www.shannaafitness.com/online-coaching&#10;&#10;//COME SAY HI!&#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/shannaafitness&#10;&#10;&#10;//ABOUT: My name is Shanna, a licensed physical education teacher, and NASM certified personal trainer, a veteran marathon runner, and a mom of 3! I am here to help moms get in the best shape of their life by becoming a runner and losing the weight for good! I'll provide tips on how to reach fitness goals, getting to your ideal healthy weight without ex