    title "20 Minute Lean Legs Workout | Day 14- Ambition"
    description "20 Minute Lean Legs Workout-  Get lean legs with this 20 minute lean legs workout. This 20 minute lean legs workout is for all fitness levels. The exercises will be demonstrated and the modifications of each exercise will be provided. This is day 14 of the Ambition training program.&#10;&#10;Each exercise in this 20 minute lean legs workout will be performed for 40 seconds. There will be 3 rounds of every exercise. A 20 second break of rest will be between each exercise.  A warm-up and a cooldown will be provided before and after this workout.&#10;&#10;20 Minute Lean Legs Workout &#10;1.) Pendulum Lunge Right Leg&#10;2.) Backward Lunge Pulses Right Side&#10;3.) Pendulum Lunge Left Leg&#10;4.) Backward Lunge Pulses Left Side&#10;5.) Squats&#10;6.) Squat Pulses&#10;&#10;Time Stamps:&#10;00:00 20 Minute Lean Legs Workout Introduction&#10;00:32 20  Minute Lean Legs Workout Warm Up&#10;01:30 Pendulum Lunge Right Leg&#10;04:42 Backward Lunge Pulses Right Side&#10;07:54 Pendulum Lunge Left Leg&#10;11:07 Backward Lunge Pulses Left Side&#10;14:20 Squats&#10;17:30 Squat Pulses&#10;20:22 15 Minute Lean Legs Workout Cool Down&#10;&#10;&#9989; Subscribe for more FREE tips and workouts on how to reach your fitness goals: &#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0igEEZrTMF3Tntl2G4138Q&#10;&#10;#legsworkout  #lowerbodydumbbellworkout #lowerbodyworkout&#10;&#10;&#128064;WATCH NEXT: &#10;https://youtu.be/rCb01yjCGb8&#10;https://youtu.be/ezSlti4TnO0&#10;&#10;&#128077;FREE GUIDE:&#10;&#10;&#128073; Free Guide http://www.shannaafitness.com/free-guide&#10;&#128073;Free 5k plan http://www.shannaafitness.com/free-5k-training-plan&#10;&#10;&#10;//WORK WITH SHANNA&#10;&#128073;1-on-1 online fitness coaching&#10;http://www.shannaafitness.com/online-coaching&#10;&#10;//COME SAY HI!&#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/shannaafitness&#10;&#10;&#10;//ABOUT: My name is Shanna, a licensed physical education teacher, and NASM certified personal trainer, a veteran marathon ru