    title "25 Minute Legs and Glutes Dumbbell Workout"
    description "25 MINUTE LEGS AND GLUTES DUMBBELL WORKOUT-  Tone your legs and glutes with this 25 minute legs and glutes dumbbell workout. This 25 minute legs and glutes workout is for all fitness levels. The exercises will be demonstrated and the modifications of each exercise will be to use no weights.&#10;&#10;Each exercise in this 25 minute legs and glutes dumbbell workout will be performed for 15 reps. There will be 2 rounds of every exercise. A 15 second break of rest will be between each exercise.  A warm-up and a cooldown will be provided before and after this workout.&#10;&#10;25 Minute Legs and Glutes Dumbbell Workout&#10;1.) Single Leg Deadlift (right side)&#10;2.) Single Leg Deadlift (left side)&#10;3.) Forward lunge (right side)&#10;4.) Forward lunge (left side)&#10;5.) Elevated heel squat&#10;6.) Squat to lunges&#10;7.) Side lunge (right side)&#10;8.) Side lunge (left side)&#10;9.) Glute bridge&#10;10.) Fire hydrant (right side)&#10;11.) Fire hydrant (left side)&#10;12.) Jump squat&#10;&#10;Time Stamps:&#10;00:00 25 Minute Legs and Glutes Dumbbell Workout Introduction&#10;00:36 25 Minute Legs and Glutes Dumbbell Workout Warm Up&#10;02:14 25 Minute Legs and Glutes Dumbbell Workout&#10;24:36 25 Minute Legs and Glutes Dumbbell Workout Cool Down&#10;&#10;&#9989; Subscribe for more FREE tips and workouts on how to reach your fitness goals: &#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0igEEZrTMF3Tntl2G4138Q&#10;&#10;#cardioandabshiitworkout #hiitworkout #hiitworkoutnoequipment&#10;&#10;&#128064;WATCH NEXT: &#10;https://youtu.be/rCb01yjCGb8&#10;https://youtu.be/ezSlti4TnO0&#10;&#10;&#128077;FREE GUIDE:&#10;&#10;&#128073; Free Guide http://www.shannaafitness.com/free-guide&#10;&#128073;Free 5k plan http://www.shannaafitness.com/free-5k-training-plan&#10;&#10;&#10;//WORK WITH SHANNA&#10;&#128073;1-on-1 online fitness coaching&#10;http://www.shannaafitness.com/online-coaching&#10;&#10;//COME SAY HI!&#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/shannaafitness&#10;&