    title "HOW TO LOSE 10 POUNDS IN 3 DAYS | Military Diet , Does it work?"
    description "My Spanish channel ! https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J75ofJbetPc&#10;&#10;by no means are you obligated to donate! but if you do I am forever grateful to you! Your donation, small or big helps me to continue creating content. I will be giving shoutouts in my videos to the donors. So thank you for continuing to support me! &#128310;&#128310;&#128310;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Follow my Fitness Instagram! https://www.instagram.com/missyanyi_fit/&#10;Get cash back shopping through Ebates! (not sponsored) http://goo.gl/l1iJhz&#10;My workout routine&#10141; https://goo.gl/n93ZhE&#10;DRINK THIS TO BURN BELLY FAT! https://goo.gl/t1AyCC&#10;&#10;Travel with me to Paris and see what I ate !&#10141;https://youtu.be/fiZ_i9bCjPM&#10;Check out my blog for more details and a daily diary of my experience  http://goo.gl/ATRXx0&#10;&#10;Subscribe to my blog to get emails from me for updates,giveaways &#38; more&#10141;http://www.missyanyi.com/&#10;&#10;Here's how to lose weight fast ! Well anyone with a new years resolution to lose weight might want to try this military diet , which claims you can lose up to 10 pounds in 3 days , safely !&#10;&#10;Don't forget to subscribe and share this video with anyone who you think might want to lose some weight quickly and safely ! &#10;&#10;Those asking what lipstick I am wearing ,it's in my GRWM video link below :)&#10;https://goo.gl/VEedfA&#10;Please watch the whole video so you get all the answers to your questions! :)&#10;FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS:&#10;-Can I do this diet for more than 3 days?&#10;NO. You can only do it 3 days at a time and revert back to a regular low healthy low calorie diet after that you also have to go back to a regular diet to give your metabolism a chance to reset itself.&#10;-What do i drink during the diet?&#10;Water , water ,water :) &#10;-Hot dogs are unhealthy why are they in this diet?&#10;It a combination of the food and how the chemically break down each other that helps boost your metabolism and promote weight loss. AGAIN - this is not my diet i am just following it. :) &#10;- Can I substitute some of the foods?&#10;Ideally no , because the way the diet works most effectively is how the foods combine with each other. But there are a list of acceptable substitutes. Check out militarydiet.com&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Go check out my friends below, they did a similar diet , a little different than the military diet, so do check them out and see their results !&#10;DIVAMAKEUPQUEEN https://youtu.be/UrSow4lHbx0&#10;Rocio Laura - How to Lose 10lbs in 3 days &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gr37U...&#10;&#10;More info is also available on: &#10;http://themilitarydiet.com/military-d... &#10;&#10;STYLE HAUL!! &#10;http://www.youtube.com/user/stylehaul&#10;&#10;Follow me ! =)&#10;Instagram: @miss_YanYi&#10;http://instagram.com/miss_yanyi/&#10;&#10;Twitter: @miss_YanYi&#10;https://twitter.com/miss_YanYi"
