    label "1ZtDigKvT9U"
    step 1
    date "2017-09-16T03:48:47Z"
    title "30-Minute Dancehall Inspired Workout | #DanceFitness"
    description "Feel di riddim with this fun, easy to follow dancehall-inspired workout. Join Dance Fit in 30: https://www.dancefitin30.com/&#10;.&#10;.&#10;// S U B S C R I B E &#127909;&#10;https://youtube.com/fitbodybyashley&#10;&#128276; New Videos Every Week!&#10;&#10;// F O L L O W &#10133;&#10;&#10;Website | www.dancefitchicks.com &#10;Instagram | https://www.instagram.com/dancefitchicks/ &#10;Instagram | https://www.instagram.com/fitbodybyashley/ &#10;Facebook |  Fit Body by Ashley&#10;&#10;&#10145;&#65039; JOIN THE DANCE FIT CHICKS MEMBERSHIP CLUB! &#10;An exclusive online community for women who love to dance and want more support reaching their fit body goals.&#10;&#10;This is for you if:&#10;* You&#8217;re seeing some results with your cardio workouts but you&#8217;ve hit a plateau and want to take your body goals to the next level.&#10;* You struggle with putting food and fitness together&#10;* You are sick of boring workouts that drain the life out of you &#8212; you want your fitness journey to be more FUN. &#10;* You&#8217;re tired of wasting time trying to figure this out alone &#8212;  you need a clear plan to follow, accountability, and support.&#10;* You are READY to feel more fit, healthy, sexy, and confident!&#10;&#10;What is included?&#10;* Access to my FULL workout library without ads or commercials&#10;* A step by step guide on how to eat for FAT LOSS&#10;* Nutrition guides and easy to make recipes&#10;* Monthly transformation challenges &#38; fitness calendars&#10;* Livestream classes&#10;* Accountability and coaching inside our members-only group&#10;* Ongoing support from a coach who CARES!&#10;&#10;Want to join us? Click the link below!&#10;https://www.dancefitchicks.com/join&#10;.&#10;.&#10;//YOU&#8217;LL LOVE THESE VIDEOS TOO//&#10;&#10;1 HOUR CARDIO DANCE PARTY&#10;Burn between 500 - 900 calories in this super fun, hour cardio dance party! Need low impact modifications? Follow my sister, Trina! https://dancefitchicks.com/vod-library/&#10;&#10;HOT GIRL SUMMER WORKOUT&#10;An hour long Hot Girl Summer-themed workout. No equipment is needed and low modifications included, so it's great for all levels. https://dancefitchicks.com/vod-library/&#10;&#10;RIHANNA DANCE WORKOUT&#10;A 30 minute cardio dance workout with some of Rihanna's top hits. No equipment is needed but a towel is optional.&#10;https://dancefitchicks.com/vod-library/&#10;&#10;MISSY DANCE WORKOUT&#10;A 25 minute cardio dance workout to some of Missy Elliots top hits! https://dancefitchicks.com/vod-library/&#10;.&#10;.&#10;//FREE JUMPSTART CHALLENGE//&#10;Join me for 3 days of cardio-blasting&#128165;and body-shaping&#128089; workouts with music and moves that&#8217;ll help you jumpstart your fitness goals! &#10;&#10;Sign up here: https://www.dancefitchicks.com/challenge&#10;.&#10;.&#10;// WANT TO BE FEATURED IN MY VIDEOS? &#128247;&#10;&#10;Leave a COMMENT on your favorite videos sharing a testimonial or how you enjoyed it for a chance to be featured during our &#34;Dance Fit Shoutouts&#8221;.&#10;.&#10;.&#10;//Fit Body by Ashley//&#10;I&#8217;m Ashley &#128075;&#127998; I'm a fitness motivator and coach that helps women get fit and feel their best with dance workouts. I&#8217;m also the founder of Dance Fit Chicks, a community for women who want to make fitness &#38; a healthy lifestyle more fun &#38; enjoyable. We&#8217;re not just fit&#8212; we&#8217;re dance fit! Check out my free challenge, on-demand videos, and membership club to join the party. &#129395;&#10;.&#10;."
