    description "Oh V shred...your lies and misinformation are really just astounding, surpassed only by the lazyness of your filming and low production quality. Oh, and the supplements that are utterly devoid of effectiveness.&#10;&#10;&#10;In this video I assess an arm program by V shred aka Vincent Sant. There's some bad, and some good. &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;But mostly bad. &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;You probably know V shred from those annoying, scammy ads. Big surprise, their app, supplements and programs are all donkey dung.&#10;&#10;&#10;Kara's Instagram (she's awesome!)&#10;&#10;https://www.instagram.com/kara.wutzke/&#10;K2FIT&#10;https://www.k2fitchallenge.com/about-the-program/&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Sean Nalewanyj VShred supp assessment (hilarious!)&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OIwJgqdEukA&#10;Sean's Instagram&#10;https://www.instagram.com/sean_nalewanyj/&#10;&#10;&#10;Menno Articles Mentioned:&#10;https://mennohenselmans.com/natural-muscular-potential-women/&#10;https://mennohenselmans.com/cns-fatigue/&#10;&#10;&#10;TIMESTAMPS:&#10;0:00 Geoff Says Hello To the Good People of YouTube&#10;0:13 Table of Contents&#10;0:31 How to Build Muscle &#34;Bonus&#34;&#10;7:25 VShred APP reviews&#10;11:28 Kara Shout Out&#10;12:00 &#34;Big Arm&#34; Program Review&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Geoff's Training Plans/Coaching?&#10;Email geodude412 (at symbol thingy) yahoo (dot symbol thingy) com&#10;Geoff's Book? (Has 4.7 stars, rave reviews, enjoy!)&#10;https://www.verityfit.com/product-page/sweat&#10;Geoff's Instagram? &#10;https://www.instagram.com/geoffreyverityschofield/&#10;Geoff's Medium?&#10;https://medium.com/@geoffreyschofield&#10;Geoff's Quora? (you probably already know!)&#10;https://www.quora.com/profile/Geoffrey-Verity-Schofield"
