    label "qZkOgA0z0bg"
    step 1
    date "2022-07-05T03:15:27Z"
    title "30 MIN GIANT SETS UPPER BODY WORKOUT (Arms, Back, Shoulders, and Chest)"
    description "Today's upper body workout with dumbbells is no joke! Get ready for some  GIANT SUPERSETS &#8211; that's 4 exercises, back-to-back, for 30 seconds each before taking a 60-second break to recover.&#10;&#10;&#128170;&#127997; You CAN and WILL crush this workout! Don't let doubt creep into your mind. Tell those little voices to quiet down because you have some work to handle. &#10;&#10;You'll want to have two sets of dumbbells for this workout. For example, I'm using 20lb, but I use 15lbs for my rear delt flys. Make sure you keep good form while lifting. If it gets too heavy or you tire quickly, then drop weights. You don't want to sacrifice your form or you could risk injuring yourself.  Alternatively, if it's too easy and you need a little more, increase your weight. It's time to make yourself stronger.&#10;&#10;Let me know how you like the workout in the comments below &#128074;&#127996;&#10;&#10;...&#10;&#10;ALSO! I've struggled to get an accurate timer in my videos for you guys, so thank you for your patience with this! If anyone has any solutions or knows timers I can use I would greatly appreciate the help. &#10;&#10;...&#10;&#10; Follow on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/buildxburn/ &#10;&#10;...&#10;&#10; &#128077;&#127997; LIKE if you want more abs workouts! &#10;&#128172; COMMENT to let me know what other videos you want to see. &#10;&#128276; SUBSCRIBE + turn on notifications so you never miss a workout! &#10;&#10;...&#10;&#10;Thank you for working out with me! I'm grateful to have you here in this community. Let's continue to grow together! &#10;&#10;Dakota Montavon &#10;&#10;... &#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: Dakota Montavon strongly recommends that you consult your physician before starting any exercise or workout program. You should be in good physical + mental condition + able to participate in the exercises. You should be aware + understand that when participating in any exercise or exercise program, there is the possibility of physical injury. If you engage in this workout, exercise, or exercise program, you agree that you do so at your own risk, are voluntarily participating in these activities, assume all risk of injury to yourself, + agree to release and discharge Dakota Montavon from any and all claims or causes of action, known or unknown, arising out of Dakota Montavon's negligence."
