    description "There's so much buzz going around about how amazing the cast of &#34;Top Gun: Maverick&#34; looked on the big screen so I figured it would be fun to eat and train like a couple of the stars. Hope you enjoy!&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;My Low Cal Cookbook!!!!!! https://scottyscheller.com/?no-cache&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Grab my FAVORITE clothing &#10;15% OFF CUTS! https://cuts.team/scottyscheller&#10;Use code SCOTTYSCHELLER at checkout! &#10;&#10;&#10;Transparent Labs Supplements &#10;&#160;https://athlete.transparentlabs.com/scottyscheller2&#10;Code SCOTTY for 10% off&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;My camera set up!&#10;Sony A7111 https://amzn.to/3dZTxBr&#10;Rode VideoMicro Mic https://amzn.to/33qxBgR&#10;Tamron 24mm https://amzn.to/3m6BFJS&#10;&#10;&#10;Connect with me! &#10;Instagram- https://www.instagram.com/scottyscheller/?hl=en&#10;Facebook- https://www.facebook.com/thescottyscheller&#10;TikTok-https://www.tiktok.com/@scottyscheller?lang=en&#10;LinkTree- https://linktr.ee/ScottyScheller&#10;&#10;&#10;links to the articles I pulled from &#10;&#10;@menshealth&#10;https://www.menshealth.com/fitness/a34992346/miles-teller-top-gun-workout-plan/&#10;&#10;&#10;https://blog.ultimateperformance.com/nick-mitchell-trains-glen-powell/#:~:text=Glen%20did%20not%20have%20time,Chest%2Fback%2Ftraps%2Fabs&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;QHYPIL4FGKKPKSQ1&#10;ZKJNAPGY2QYRDM3K&#10;U8RFT4OCQPDSRDLG&#10;KUWDZWIVWY9WQ2RF"
