    label "dS0YgmhcuXQ"
    step 1
    date "2020-04-09T15:39:13Z"
    title "LOWER AB Workout &#9829; Burn Lower Belly Fat! &#9829; 12 minute HIIT (Philippines) &#9829; Pwedeng gawin sa kama!"
    description "Lower ab workout to burn lower belly fat! Do this workout with me to melt the extra fat on your puson or belly pooch and tone it for that 11 line abs. 12 minutes only!&#10;&#10;The lower belly is a common problem area for most people but the truth is, we all have abs. We just have to melt the belly fat surrounding it! And I made this video to help. &#10;&#10;This lower ab HIIT workout consists of 19 floor exercises including 4 moves for stretching.&#10;30 seconds work&#10;10 seconds rest&#10;Do this ANY TIME YOU WANT! Wag mo na itanong kung pwede sa umaga o sa gabi. &#10;&#10;Must have: a workout mat or a bed&#10;&#10;Get your yoga mat here: https://bit.ly/3uggFTs&#10;&#10;Do this with any full body HIIT workout or cardio from this channel to get faster results.&#10;You may feel body pain especially on your lower ab (sa puson mo) within 48 hours after doing this but that's how it works. &#10;&#10;Don't stop until you get the body that you've always wanted. &#10;This workout and any HIIT (high intensity interval training) also works best when you eat healthy and practice portion control. &#10;&#10;COOL DOWN/STRETCH:&#10;https://youtu.be/MweKG30rDnw&#10;&#10;Click here for Healthy Diet Food Guide:&#10;https://m.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=2670937746278888&#38;id=1271764659529544&#10;&#10;WORKOUT DOS AND DONT'S:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/post/UgxssV7pCXX2KZIzpI54AaABCQ?app=desktop&#10;WORKOUT Q&#38;A: https://youtu.be/DGlKiW4_uY4&#10;&#10;SHOP MY FIT &#38; HEALTHY DIET MEAL PLAN E-BOOK:&#10;https://www.facebook.com/1271764659529544/posts/pfbid0yN4z1i6KjE1useVmxXquzBjWar4LbV1SYpdy4rz2Uxh8taAAahEbJ7nAUVPthcV6l/&#10;&#10;#lowerabworkout #lowerab #workout&#10;&#10;----------&#10;&#10;MUSIC&#10;&#10;Soulful &#8212; Waimis [Audio Library Release]&#10;Music provided by Audio Library Plus&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/SZrFx8J1MFE&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://alplus.io/soulful&#10;&#10;Rewind by Jay Someday https://soundcloud.com/jaysomeday&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported  &#8212; CC BY 3.0 &#10;Free Download / Stream: http://bit.ly/Rewind-JaySomeday&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/PAGOAai4Hb8&#10;&#10;Waiting on You by RYYZN https://soundcloud.com/ryyzn&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported  &#8212; CC BY 3.0 &#10;Free Download / Stream: https://bit.ly/waiting-on-you&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/spOci-L3BNc&#10;&#10;YOURSWAG by tubebackr https://soundcloud.com/tubebackr&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution-NoDerivs 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY-ND 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://bit.ly/tubebackr-yourswag&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/XK5WipDlH5E&#10;&#10;Track: True Story &#8212; Vendredi [Audio Library Release]&#10;Music provided by Audio Library Plus&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/sgKMJQWKkk4&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://alplus.io/true-story&#10;&#10;Alone, Two Days Ago by Artificial.Music https://soundcloud.com/artificial-music&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported&#8212; CC BY 3.0 &#10;Free Download / Stream:  https://bit.ly/alone-two-days-ago&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/yuTPnUm7ro0&#10;&#10;----------&#10;&#10;Follow me on Socials!&#10;&#10;INSTAGRAM:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/kataglipay&#10;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/katrinaaglipay&#10;&#10;----------&#10;&#10;I'm Kat Aglipay, I create beauty and fitness videos that inspire and improve the lives of Pinays - including the topic of weight loss cause that's where I struggled a lot during my younger years. &#10;&#10;I love shopping yet I know how to save and currently considering going minimal! I love clothes and makeup. I love FOOD!&#10;&#10;----------&#10;&#10;COMMENT POLICY:&#10;Kahit sino welcome dito sa channel at malayang magcomment sa bawat video. Pero dahil ang Simply Pinay ay isang positive community, ang mga negative, rude, narrow minded and offensive comments ay idedelete kaagad. You may express your opinion in a respectful way. Constructive criticism done in a polite way is considered and encouraged. Let's spread only love and positivity!&#10;&#10;----------&#10;&#10;For brand partnerships and collaborations, flick me an e-mail at katrinaaglipay@gmail.com"
