    date "2016-04-07T20:26:42Z"
    title "Tabata and Strength #6"
    description "Plyo Box I use:&#10;Stamina X Plyo Box:  http://amzn.to/21GfRCN&#10;&#10;Tabata and Strength #6: &#10;&#10;To complete this workout do each Tabata round at 20:10 8x through, then do the strength moves after each 4 minute Tabata section&#10;&#10;Strength:&#10;Step-up + knee up+ lunge back (5 each leg)&#10;Triangle pushup burpee (10)&#10;Alternating curtsy lunges + kick (10)&#10;&#10;Tabata &#10;&#10;1. Goblet Squats + twists&#10;2. Single arm curls + double arm curls + 2 jump squats&#10;3. Plams in tricep presses + sit up on ball&#10;4. One leg bridge + chest press&#10;5. Elv pushup + kick outs&#10;6. Plank hops (2) to upright rows (2)&#10;7. SA Rows + glute raises&#10;8. Dips + bridge crabkicks&#10;9. Tricep yoga pushups (5) + tuck jump&#10;10. Chair squats + lateral raise into T bi curls"
