  node [
    id 8172
    label "ovSY6zneJxI"
    step 1
    date "2017-01-11T19:00:16Z"
    title "Plank Variation Workout"
    description "I call this one: walk the plank. It's a plank variation workout that I put together to get me back into getting strengthening my core. The movements target every bit of your abs and I promise you will be sore the next day. I'll be creating more of these plank variation workouts in future so stay tuned.&#10;&#10;How many rounds are you able to do?&#10;&#10;Full plank variation workout:&#10;&#10;Plank - 10 sec&#10;Side plank crunches - 10 reps each side (Variation - side plank - 20 sec)&#10;Plank Rows - 10 reps (Variation - No weights plank rows - 10 reps)&#10;Sphinx plank pushups - 10 reps (Variation - One arm at a time - 10 reps)&#10;Plate Pulls - 10 reps (Variation - No plate, use a towel - 10 reps)&#10;Stability ball plank - 10 seconds &#10;Stability ball pikes - 10 reps (Variation - Pike leans - 10 reps)&#10;Stability ball crunches - 10 reps&#10;Plank rollout - 10 reps&#10;Plank - till you drop!&#10;&#10;Repeat the plank variation workout as many times as possible with 30 seconds rest in between.&#10;&#10;&#10;Get me on:&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/seanroutledge/&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/SeanRoutledge&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/seanroutledge.tv&#10;&#10;Remember to like and subscribe, share with your friends, share with your mom, and.... BE NICE TO PEOPLE :D&#10;&#10;Thanks for watching!&#10;&#10;Track is Autolaser &#38; PLS&#38;TY - Used To This Ft. MOONZz&#10;Remixed by the great Gill Chang.&#10;https://soundcloud.com/gillchang/autolaser-plsty-used-to-this-ft-moonzz-gill-chang-remix"
    channel_title "Sean Routledge"
    channel_id "UCpR3YjClZDz6PVxl8PaHSdw"
