  node [
    id 8250
    label "xo4Q1GcI_Gg"
    step 1
    date "2022-06-24T13:28:10Z"
    title "Top 10 exercises for squats and legs workout - Natacha Oceane"
    description "-  Top 10 exercises for squats and legs workout - Natacha Oceane &#128165; workout video &#128165; Female Fitness Motivation video.&#10;&#9658; Thank you for watching videos!&#10;&#9658; You can also leave a like and share my videos if you want !&#10;&#9658;  -   Subscribe for more videos: https://goo.gl/ocm219 &#10;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#9620;&#10;&#10;&#9654;&#65039;Follow:  @natacha.oceane&#10;Instagram:  https://www.instagram.com/natacha.oceane/&#10;&#10;- Asymmetric OH pulsing squats (2 x 10 per side): keeping my centre of gravity central really brings the burn in the glute of my elevated leg&#10;- The band adds a lot of support so you can build up strength, and also means you won&#8217;t need full mobility just yet because you&#8217;ll be able to sit back and keep your torso a little more upright.&#10;- OH 1.5 rep squats (3 x 10): the overhead x 1.5 rep make this super compound and make sure you&#8217;re squeezing the most volume out of that gym time when you need it&#10;- Cable assisted pistols: you can set as little or as much assistance as you like until you&#8217;re down to zero &#129392; Take a step back from the cable, so your torso has a slight forward lean and we&#8217;re mimicking the motion of an unassisted pistol.&#10;-  Shuffle to hip rotation squat: stay low through the shuffle and then really pop up high + fast onto your toes in the hip rotation squat.&#10;- Pistol walk downs: walking your hands down on pretty much anything stable is gonna help you add the finishing touches once you&#8217;re close to the final move.&#10;- Heel elevated pistols: probably the final progression if you&#8217;re feeling strong enough but are just fine tuning that ankle mobility for the full ROM.&#10;- Box pistol step downs: however low you can get is the perfect start! &#10024; As you feel more comfortable, slowly bring your non-working foot forward as you lower to develop your mobility and balance alongside that strength.&#10;- Stand with both hands and feet, raise the dumbbells higher than your head and then slowly sit down&#10;- DB squat to heel tap (3 x 12): glutes and quads on fire, no more to say.&#10;&#10;@ Music:&#10;Track: NEFFEX - Losing My Mind &#129504; [Copyright-Free]&#10;https://ffm.to/neffexlosingmymind&#10;Watch: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yUVeuSDCg6w&#10;&#10;&#10;#gymworkouts #gymmotivation #weightloss #exercise #fitness #workout &#10;&#10; @ Our Goal, When Making a Compilation, Is Not To Steal Someone's Video. But, to share the Best Content and Quality Compilers. Use of Some Images, Short Videos On The Internet ... If Any Clip Owners, Used in Our Collective, Have a Copyright Problem, Feel Free to Contact Them I By Personal Message Or Add Title Issuance. We will remove clips."
