    date "2020-06-12T01:54:50Z"
    title "5 reasons why you are NOT getting results from doing Chloe Ting's challenge!! ((MUST WATCH))"
    description "Hey guys so in this video I am going to give you 5 reasons why you aren't seeing results from doing Chloe Tings challenge.&#10;I did Chloe Ting's 2 week challenge and really loved my results but I get a lot of questions on that video as to why other people are not getting the same results. So if you are one of those people and really want to see results make sure you watch this video all the way through, I promise it will help you. These 5 tips can be applied to any fitness journey that you are on even if you aren't doing Chloe Ting's workouts. Also if you are interested to see my results from her 2 week challenge then click the link below. &#10;&#10;My results from doing Chloe Ting 2 week challenge: https://youtu.be/CYni4lzcsiw&#10;&#10;What I ate while doing Chloe Ting's challenge:&#10;https://youtu.be/WBmUnUCYsn4&#10;&#10;https://www.teamiblends.com/discount/ASHLEYRAE25&#10;Discount Code: Ashleyrae25&#10;&#10;Thank you all for watching!! Don't forget to LIKE, SHARE and SUBSCRIBE!!&#10;&#10;*Social Media*&#10;Instagram: @ashleyraeuluvit  https://www.instagram.com/ashleyraeuluvit&#10;Snapchat:  @ashleyraeuluvit https://www.snapchat.com/add/ashleyraeuluvit&#10;&#10;Business Inquiries:&#10;ashleyraeuluvit@gmail.com&#10;&#10;Mailing address: &#10;PO Box 491&#10;Fremont, Ca 94536-9998&#10;&#10;#Chloetingworkouts #Chloetingchallenge #Notgettingresults"
