  node [
    id 8265
    label "h7bqFNfSEBs"
    step 1
    date "2020-09-16T13:55:24Z"
    title "My FAMILY Did Chloe Ting&#8217;s 2019 &#38; 2020 2 Week Summer Shred (which was better?)| OUR 4 WEEK RESULTS"
    description "** guys I'm sorry I am talking a bit faster in this video! I just didn't want the video to be too long! I'm sorry if it's too fast for some of you :( **&#10;&#10;&#10;I&#8217;m honestly scared to post this video because I can sense the hate comments already but I thought it would be fun to test out and compare Chloe's 2019 and 2020 summer shred challenge with my family. &#10;These are MY/ OUR OWN OPINIONS. I am not trying to offend anyone in any way. So please try not to be mean in the comments. Thanks guys!&#10;Love you :)&#10;&#10;*btw my brother was so obsessed he's now doing the 4 week summer shred.... that is how much he loves Chloe HAHAHAH&#10;&#10;2020 2 week summer shred:  https://www.chloeting.com/program/2020/two-weeks-shred-challenge.html&#10;&#10;2019 2 week summer shred: https://www.chloeting.com/program/2019/two-weeks-shred-challenge.html &#10;&#10;Up and down plank math: (hehe if I was wrong please feel free to fix my math!!)&#10;Do this to lose weight vid: 1 set of up and down planks x 12 vids in the challenge = 12 sets &#10;Abs in 2 weeks vid: 2 sets in each vid x 12 vids in the challenge = 24 sets &#10;Arms and core vid: 2 sets in each vid x 4 vids in the challenge = 8 sets &#10;12 + 24 + 8 = 44 sets in total &#10;&#10;favourite products: &#10;products mentioned: &#10;pb2: https://amzn.to/3qQRTXB&#10;My fav crunchy Kraft Peanut butter: https://amzn.to/39OEqZf&#10;yoga mat: https://amzn.to/3o01CJ3 &#10;my camera: https://amzn.to/3p2Ljwl&#10;popcorners: https://amzn.to/392cMJ1&#10;resistance bands: https://amzn.to/3iyxV0Q&#10;kashi granola bars: https://amzn.to/3bZcbtM&#10;&#10;&#10;Business Inquiries: lindasun@select.co&#10;&#10;&#10;Music: &#10;Music by HOAX - Grow - https://thmatc.co/?l=8FD72C05&#10;Music by Grant Schaffer - Pineapple - https://thmatc.co/?l=6A2836FB &#10;Music by Dylan Rockoff - Anymore (NDAF Chill Remix) - https://thmatc.co/?l=87F29144&#10;Music by Jonny Glenn - Don't Wanna Let You Down  - https://thmatc.co/?l=7C8CD3B5&#10;Music by Fiji Blue - Day by Day  - https://thmatc.co/?l=EDF7E57C&#10;Music by mark generous - orange and pomegranate - https://thmatc.co/?l=16FD1F70&#10;Music by Eric Reprid - Back to Business - https://thmatc.co/?l=FD583654&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: I am not a doctor, nutritionist, or dietician. The information I share should not be interpreted as nutritional advise. Everything I say is my own OPINION and it&#8217;s based off of MY OWN EXPERIENCES. I am not here to promote any type of diet or advise anyone to follow my diet. I am not a professional I am a student. If you have questions or concerns regarding diet, nutrition or fitness, speak to a professional. I am learning and growing and on my own journey of self-love and acceptance just like any other human being is. I am not perfect. These videos are meant only to showcase my own experiences. This channel is about me sharing my THOUGHTS and STORY and LIFE in a POSITIVE SPACE, and if you have anything NEGATIVE to say keep it to yourself or feel free to leave.  &#10;&#10;Please remember the only message I want to spread is a positive one. I want to encourage us all, myself included, that we should continually practice self-love and appreciate our bodies. We are on this journey together. I hope you can try to remember that. &#10;&#10;Love you guys. I'm so proud of you. We got this.  &#10;Linda"
