    title "STANDING PILATES RING:  LEGS &#38; CORE Workout"
    description "This pilates inspired workout will begin standing using a PILATES RING/MAGIC CIRCLE to target legs and core and transition down to the floor for more core work.  This workout fires deep muscles of the core and targets the lower body focusing on adductors, abductors, glutes, quads, and hamstrings! &#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE to get WEEKLY VIDEOS: https://www.youtube.com/user/Workouthotel/featured?view_as=public&#10;&#10;Connect with me!&#10;&#9829;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/workouthotel/&#10;&#9829;MORE FREE WORKOUTS &#38; TIPS: http://www.workouthotel.com/&#10;&#9829;INSTAGRAM: workout_hotel&#10;&#9829;PINTEREST: https://www.pinterest.com/workouthotel/&#10;My 7 Day Mind &#38; Body Makeover: https://youtu.be/_Nr1QfACbSA&#10;SUBSCRIBE: https://www.youtube.com/user/Workouthotel/featured?view_as=public"
