CATIONS TO STAY UP TO DATE&#10;&#10;MEDIA + BUSINESS ENQUIRIES : info@vanessabhealth.com &#10;WEBSITE : https://vanessabhealth.com/  &#10;&#10;About Vanessa Bartlett:&#10;&#9989;20 Years Experience as a Holistic Personal Trainer&#10;&#9989;Certificate 3 + 4 Fitness Certified&#10;&#9989;Level 2 APMA Pilates Certified&#10;&#9989;Award Recipient for Innovation In Healthcare&#10;&#9989;Nutrition + Rehab + Special Populations Certified&#10;&#9989;Pregnancy | Post Natal Fitness + Pilates&#10;&#9989;Burnout + Overtraining Recovery Specialist&#10;&#9989;Adrenal Fatigue Recovery Exercise Specialist + Self Healed from Adrenal Fatigue&#10;&#9989;Mum of Two &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Theraband Exercises  |  Theraband Shoulder Exercises |  Best shoulder theraband workout Theraband Exercise| Best 12 Minute Shoulder Theraband workout for beginners |  Theraband Arm Exercises    |Shoulder Band  | Pilates with Theraband  | Arm Strengthening with Theraband |  Upper Extremity Theraband Exercises|  Fitness Band Exercises |  Shoulder Rehab Exercises | 12 min theraband exercises shoulders | 12 min resistance band shoulder workout | 12 min shoulder rotator cuff band workout | 12 min resistance band upper body workout | 12 min band shoulder rehab workout |"
