    date "2013-10-15T18:18:47Z"
    title "How to Get Abs in 10 mins"
    description "Yes boo! I have brought us an abdominal workout video with none other than Madonna's Personal Trainer, Marlyn Ortiz! Finally!!! Not only is she Madonna's trainer but you may recognize her from workout videos: Insanity with Shaun T &#38; Brazilian Butt Lift. Marlyn is a professional dancer as well, toured with the likes of Taylor Swift, was part of the original &#34;Fuertza Bruta&#34; cast, and the list goes on! So, if you've ever wondered how you can get a flat stomach or how to get a six pack or simply how to stay fit; keep watching this video! This video is perfect for us women on the go! Only 10 minutes! You can do this first thing in the morning, at school, or at the office! GET IT!&#10;&#10;I SUCK so bad when it comes to working out my core so this was definitely an inspiration and blessing to have Marlyn give us a session on the house! Thanks girl!&#10;&#10;Make sure you&#8217;re SUBSCRIBED to my channel for the latest videos and turn your notifications on: http://goo.gl/AlZhsT&#10;&#10;-----------&#10;&#10;10 MIN ABDONMINAL WORKOUT: 2 reps of each&#10;- 10 sets of Leg raises&#10;- 10 sets of Horizontal V-ups&#10;- 10 sets of Side Planks on right side&#10;- 10 sets of Side Planks on left side&#10;- 10 sets of Plank Knee Crosses&#10;- 10 sets of Scissor Legs&#10;&#10;-----------&#10;&#10;Make sure you follow Marlyn Ortiz&#10;http://instagram.com/marlynortiz&#10;http://twitter.com/marlynortiz1&#10;&#10;----------&#10;&#10;GET TO KNOW ME&#10;http://instagram.com/mayasworld&#10;http://twitter.com/mayasworld&#10;https://www.facebook.com/shamelessmaya&#10;&#10;----------&#10;&#10;WATCH THESE VIDEOS&#10;How to get a perky bootay!&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=20kw-BP34TA&#10;&#10;How I stay fit without working out: DIET&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s7Kh7_72eX4&#10;&#10;----------&#10;&#10;GEEK INFO&#10;All my gear can be purchased on my Amazon store: http://bit.ly/Mayatechstore&#10;Camera: Canon 7D Mark lll http://amzn.to/2mNQV1L&#10;Audio: iPhone 4 Mic&#10;Lighting: Diva Ring Light http://amzn.to/1S1QLY7&#10;Editing: Final Cut Pro X&#10;&#10;Amazon store is an affiliate link which means I get a % if you drop coints.&#10;&#10;----------&#10;About Shameless Maya&#10;&#10;&#34;What would happen if I shamelessly promoted myself for 365 days?&#34; My channel started out as a social media experiment, and now it's a lifestyle. I hope my journey from shame to shameless inspires you and others not to be ashamed of who you are and to share and celebrate that shamelessly. Here on my channel, you'll find videos on lifestyle, inspiration, fun transformations, techie vids for aspiring geeks, beauty, fashion, and so much more.&#10;--"
