  node [
    id 8508
    label "tdtQk6byONk"
    step 1
    date "2013-06-08T16:57:42Z"
    title "Ab Workouts THAT WORK @ Home"
    description "PLEASE READ* This is an extremely fast and intense exercise grouping so make sure you can properly perform the movements before actually trying to do them! Those of you who try these movements are responsible for knowing your own bodies capabilities and limitations in regards to fitness. Please know that these movements are based on workouts I have previously used and performed; if you are trying these movements for the first time I suggest a spotter and proper pre-workout stretching and cardio warm-up to prepare! If you have any previous injuries to your knees, or lower-back, I suggest you use these movements with caution and consult with your physician! Be sure to keep good form and breathing throughout all of these movements! Also don't forget, to get the BEST results from these movements it is vital to sustain a healthy diet and workout routine with a steady meal plan! Enjoy guys!&#10;*******************************************************************&#10;&#10;&#10;*FOR ALL EXERCISES &#38; EXPLANATIONS CLICK HERE: http://brettcap.blogspot.com&#10;&#10;Hey everyone thank you so much for subscribing to my channel! I look forward to beginning this journey with all of you! Please leave comments below letting me know what you want to see next! Make sure you go to my blog to get all my information and inspiration on sets and reps to these workouts! Don't forget ABS ARE MADE IN THE KITCHEN- make sure you are cognizant of your abdominal muscles and how they work...everyone has a different body that works differently. No one person is the same...that is what makes fitness so amazing! &#10;&#10;Inform &#38; Inspire,&#10;&#10;-Brett&#10;&#10;SHARE my video on Facebook with the link below!&#10;http://youtu.be/tdtQk6byONk&#10;&#10;PLEASE FOLLOW ME ON INSTAGRAM/TWITTER! &#10;http://www.twitter.com/brettcap&#10;http://www.instagram.com/brettcap &#10;HASHTAG #BRETTCAP or #BRETTCAPFITNESS or #BRETTCAPFIT&#10;TO STAY UPDATED, COMMENT AND COMMUNICATE WITH ME! &#10;&#10;&#10;PLEASE LIKE MY PAGE ON FACEBOOK FOR UPDATES :) &#10;http://www.facebook.com/brettcapfit&#10;&#10;CHECK OUT MY MOTIVATIONAL TIPS VIDEO:&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TTYDpEd397s&#10;&#10;Check out my SIX PACK ABS IN 15 MINS VIDEO:&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AJdQsSsLUAw&#10;&#10;Check out THE BEST CHEST ROUTINE @ HOME:&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zkRNze65p5I&#10;&#10;Check out my NUTRITIOUS BREAKFAST IDEAS:&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ENarYbIuxkQ&#10;&#10;Check out my video on HOW TO PREP YOUR CHICKEN FOR MEAL PLANS:&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r-5WQdQL8NQ&#10;&#10;Check out my HEALTHY RECIPES || PEPPER BOWL VIDEO:&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iWYZTnT2GQ8&#10;&#10;Check out CELLULITE BLASTING THIGH WORKOUT:&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fkDdadIskH0&#10;&#10;Check out MY LOWER-BACK TONING CIRCUIT:&#10;http://www.youtube.com/edit?ns=1&#38;...&#10;&#10;Check out the most BENEFICIAL POST-WORKOUT PROTEIN SHAKE:&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B6R0-k...&#10;&#10;Check out MY EASY SIX PACK AB WORKOUTS @ HOME:&#10;http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tdtQk6...&#10;&#10;&#10;Carli's CHANNELS:&#10;http://www.youtube.com/carlibel55&#10;http://www.youtube.com/innerbeautybybel&#10;&#10;&#10;Music: All Beats Produced by Mike Cash&#10;YOUTUBE: http://www.youtube.com/user/ElectricBodega&#10;FACEBOOK: http://www.facebook.com/pages/Electric-bodega/149071315266156?fref=ts&#10;SOUNDCLOUD: http://soundcloud.com/electric-bodega&#10;&#10;&#10;*SPECIAL THANK YOU to my amazing girlfriend Carli. I LOVE YOU thanks for helping me with this video I can't wait to do the next one :)"
