    date "2020-03-23T13:41:01Z"
    title "I did 1000 AB EXERCISES in ONE DAY *omg insane*"
    description "I did 1000 abs exercises in one day! I challenge you to do the same, but in case it's too hard you can also do the following exercises over the course of one week.&#10;&#10;Monday&#10;100 Russian twists (50 on each side)&#10;100 Russian twists with crunch (100 in total)&#10;&#10;Tuesday&#10;100 sit-ups&#10;100 ab pushes&#10;&#10;Wednesday&#10;100 scissors&#10;100 toe touches&#10;&#10;Thursday&#10;100 mermaids&#10;100 plank twists&#10;&#10;Friday&#10;100 side crunches right&#10;100 side crunches left&#10;&#10;Saturday&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CYzZZhCG_1E&#10;&#10;Sunday&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5lByRCCkh1Y&#10;&#10;Good luck!&#10;&#10;Instagram: @sanne_vander&#10;&#10;GET &#9658; &#10;My monthly meal plan:&#10;https://gumroad.com/l/vanderfit&#10;&#10;BUY &#9658; &#10;VNDR official:&#10;http://www.sannevander.com/&#10;&#10;CHECK &#9658; &#10;How to slim down your legs in one week&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MYCkXBe53Pw&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME &#9658; &#10;Instagram: @sanne_vander&#10;Tiktok: @sanne_vander&#10;Pommy&#8217;s Instagram: @pommy_vander&#10;VNDR official: @vndrofficial&#10;&#10;SECRET VANDERFIT GROUP &#9658;&#10;https://www.facebook.com/groups/931327580350725/&#10;&#10;BUSINESS INQUIRIES &#9658; &#10;Team.sannevander@gmail.com&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER &#9658;  &#10;This video is not sponsored. All opinions are my own.&#10;&#10;#2020glowupyear"
