  node [
    id 8625
    label "dhaiv1trIlM"
    step 1
    date "2018-08-27T06:47:18Z"
    title "HOW I LOST 60 LBS for beginners | MY WEIGHT LOSS JOURNEY"
    description "Hey loves! I really hope you all enjoyed this video from me! I am beyond grateful for all the love and sweet messages I have received from everyone and I wish you all the best on those of you who are inspired by my journey to adventure on yours. Just a little background I started my weight loss journey the last two weeks of 2016 and it was my mission to stick to this change as my New Years Resolution. &#10;&#10;VIDEO STAMPS:&#10;What I did to lose weight: 1:51&#10;Benefits/Explanation of HIIT: 2:19&#10;Gym Membership?: 4:55&#10;Workout Partner?: 6:10&#10;Foods I Ate: 7:02&#10;&#10;HEALTHY AFRICAN FOODS VIDEO:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ddIrZUhi9Go&#10;&#10;MY HIIT ROUTINE ON THE TREADMILL:&#10;* Sprint for 1 minute (at speed of 6.5 or higher), walk for 2 minutes (at speed of 3.5 or higher)&#10;* You can leave the incline at speed 0.0 but I would recommend setting at 4.0 or higher (whatever your body is comfortable with, you can increase gradually)&#10;* I did the routine twice a day, 5-7 days out the week&#10;* Additional workouts that I would do after HIIT or in replacement of it is listed down below in description box (continue scrolling)&#10;&#10;WEIGHT, HEIGHT, &#38; BODY INFO:&#10;&#10;* I am 5'1 and I went from 231 - 171. I lost a total of 60 pounds! &#10;* I do not know my current measurements! &#10;&#10;PREVIOUS CARDIO WORKOUT ROUTINE:&#10;&#10;* 3-4 miles of HIIT workouts on the treadmill (twice a day, 5-7x out the week)&#10;&#10;CURRENT CARDIO WORKOUT ROUTINE:&#10;&#10;* 2 miles of HIIT on treadmill (30 sec sprint, 1 minute walk)&#10;* 2 miles on the elliptical &#10;* 2 miles on the bike&#10;&#10;LIST OF FOODS I ATE:&#10;&#10;brown rice &#8226; quinoa &#8226; wheat bread &#8226; wheat tortilla wraps &#8226; avocados &#8226; sweet potatoes &#8226; black beans &#8226; ripe/unripened plantain (boiled) &#8226; tilapia &#8226; salmon &#8226; tuna &#8226; sardines &#8226; salads &#8226; boiled eggs &#8226; scrambled eggs &#8226; any variation of vegetable soup &#8226; sushi &#8226; zucchini noodles &#8226; apple cinnamon oatmeal w/ banana slices + almonds/pistachios &#10;&#10;LIST OF FRUITS I ATE:&#10;&#10;mandarin oranges &#8226; melons &#8226; pineapples &#8226; mangoes &#8226; apples &#8226; water melon &#8226; grapes &#8226; cherries &#10;&#10;THE REAL REASON I LOST WEIGHT: &#10;https://youtu.be/6HnkWUDtl5w&#10;&#10;&#10;5 TIPS TO STAY MOTIVATED DURING WEIGHT LOSS:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qKQQIuXdo-Q&#38;t=10s&#10;&#10;WHAT I EAT IN A DAY TO LOSE WEIGHT:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j3AWSwnaF7o&#38;t=56s&#10;&#10;FULL BODY WORKOUT LIST:&#10;&#10;[Repeat 3x]&#10;50 jump ropes&#10;50 jumping jacks&#10;15 burpees&#10;50 crunches&#10;50 lunges &#10;2 30 sec. planks&#10;20 jump squats &#10;&#10;YOUTUBERS OR  TRAINERS TO REFER TO:&#10;&#10;1. VIVALANNEOMA: https://www.youtube.com/user/PrincesaNneoma&#10;&#10;2. BODYBYSAMMY2x (Dallas, TX Trainer): https://twitter.com/Sam_dos_equis2x&#10;&#10;3. KIAH CHISM: Instagram @KiahChism&#10;&#10;4. BRICK BUILT APPAREL: &#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=msoNz1bXU7s&#10;&#10;SOCIAL MEDIA:&#10;&#10;T W I T T E R: @NaijaaByNature&#10;I N S T A G R A M: @NaijaaByNature&#10;S N A P C H A T: tinatooshort&#10;&#10;#2020workouts, #2020weightloss #2020weightloss tips &#34;HIIT JUMP ROPE WORKOUT\&#34;,\&#34;jump rope workout\&#34;,\&#34;jump rope\&#34;,\&#34;cardio workout to lose belly fat\&#34;,\&#34;cardio workout\&#34;,\&#34;intense fat burning workout at home\&#34;,\&#34;cardio workout at home\&#34;,\&#34;jump rope workout for fat loss\&#34;,\&#34;hiit workouts\&#34;,\&#34;hiit routine\&#34;,\&#34;home workout\&#34;,\&#34;fat burning workout\&#34;,\&#34;fat burning hiit workout - bodyweight hiit cardio workout (with low impact modifications)\&#34;,\&#34;fat burning cardio\&#34;,\&#34;cardio workouts\&#34;,\&#34;cardio jump rope &#34;megan margot\&#34;,\&#34;weight\&#34;,\&#34;weight loss\&#34;,\&#34;how to\&#34;,\&#34;lose\&#34;,\&#34;transformation\&#34;,\&#34;motivation\&#34;,\&#34;tips\&#34;,\&#34;diet\&#34;,\&#34;60 pounds\&#34;,\&#34;60\&#34;,\&#34;pounds\&#34;,\&#34;before and after\&#34;,\&#34;journey\&#34;,\&#34;story\&#34;,\&#34;at home\&#34;,\&#34;advice\&#34;,\&#34;plan\&#34;,\&#34;woman\&#34;,\&#34;girl\&#34;,\&#34;pictures\&#34;,\&#34;fast\&#34;,\&#34;easy\&#34;,\&#34;simple\&#34;,\&#34;quick\&#34;,\&#34;hacks\&#34;,\&#34;how i did it\&#34;,\&#34;1 month\&#34;,\&#34;2 months\&#34;,\&#34;1 year\&#34;,\&#34;lazy\&#34;,\&#34;naturally\&#34;,\&#34;nutrition\&#34;,\&#34;losing\&#34;,\&#34;healthy\&#34;,\&#34;health\&#34;,\&#34;fitness\&#34;,\&#34;instagram\&#34;,\&#34;weight trainers\&#34;,\&#34;tea\&#34;,\&#34;water\&#34;,\&#34;drinking water\&#34;,\&#34;victoria's secret\&#34;,\&#34;models\&#34;,\&#34;kim kardashian\&#34;,\&#34;kylie jenner&#34;,&#34;beauty&#34;, &#34;blogger&#34;, &#34;goal&#34;,\&#34;secrets\&#34;,\&#34;whole foods\&#34;, &#34;exercise&#34;, &#34;without gym&#34;, &#34;workout&#34; 2019 workouts, 2019 weightloss"
