    title "Daily 10 Minute Mobility Routine - No Equipment | Follow Along | Stretch With Me!"
    description "Thanks for watching! Mobility &#38; Flexibility are just as important as fitness and what you put into your body. Stretching can limit some of the not so desirable effects of wear and tear, in crease flexibility and reduce overall stress. Especially during these times when most of us are spending more time at home, this video can be used during a quick break or as a pick-me-up. Stretch with me whenever you feel the need, and share with others that need a quick stretch as well!&#10;&#10;IG: crysfix&#10;&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;#Stretching #Mobility #HomeWorkout #Flexibility&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: By participating in the movements shown in this video, you are doing so at your own risk. Please consult at healthcare professional before adding anything shown to your exercise/wellness routine &#38; please be careful. I am not responsible for any harm/injury sustained while following along with this video.&#10;&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;&#10;Stretching&#10;For black women&#10;Workout with me&#10;Flexibility&#10;Mobility&#10;POC&#10;WOC&#10;Outdoor workouts&#10;Old navy active&#10;Nike&#10;Active wear&#10;Camo &#10;Yoga&#10;Yoga poses&#10;bodyweight&#10;functional training&#10;crossfit&#10;plyo&#10;WFPB&#10;plant based&#10;vegetarian&#10;vegan&#10;iifym&#10;bodybuilding&#10;&#10;&#10;___________________________________________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;functional training, bodyweight, crossfit, circuits, squats, lunges, tripod, vlogging camera, mobility, stretching, POC, WOC, for black women, workout with me, follow along, beginner friendly, smoothie recipe, berry smoothie, plant based smoothie, ninja, black hair, 4c hair, natural hair, hair tutorial, falafel, greek, tziki, chickpeas, garbanzo beans, the real, green juice, celery juice, clear skin, skin routine, skincare for black skin, oily skin routine, magnesium, muscle soreness, buld muscle, bodybuilding, goat, nike athlete, gymshark, nike training, plt, fashion nova fitness, outdoor workout, tennis, WOD, ootd, partner wod, lifestyle vlog, military, military wife, uniqlo, boyfriend tee, haul, tryon haul, workout clothes, athletic fashion"
