    description "10 min Inner Thigh Pilates Workout // Lengthen &#38; Tone // Lean Legs with Sanne Vloet&#10;&#10;Hey guys!&#10;&#10;I hope you had an amazing weekend! Whether you celebrate Valentine's day or not I hope you took some time this weekend for some self love and care. I've really been enjoying my epsom salt baths to help relax my muscles after a long day. Many of you requested a new Inner Thigh video so I wanted to share a quick 10 min Pilates inspired workout focused on strengthening and toning inner thighs. Sami and I are also super excited to finally share what we've been working on so stay tuned for a special announcement on my stories this week! &#10;I hope you enjoy this and let me know any feedback you have!&#10;&#10;Big warm hugs &#10;Sanne&#10;&#10;Follow me!&#10;Instagram: @sannevloet (https://bit.ly/2vlnHLy)&#10;Twitter: @sannevloet (https://bit.ly/2OKggYH)&#10;Subscribe!!! https://bit.ly/2KzihS5&#10;&#10;Follow the link to my gear page with everything I use to create content - B&#38;H Photo - https://bhpho.to/34XSsaj&#10;&#10;Music: &#10;I used music from Epidemic Sound -  http://share.epidemicsound.com/GVgBV&#10;I used music from Music Bed - http://share.mscbd.fm/sannevloet"
