    date "2020-12-01T22:25:31Z"
    title "ABS CHALLENGE // Burn Belly Fat // 14 Day Challenge"
    description "Hi Guys,&#10;&#10;Can you believe it! This is our last workout video for Wellness month! I hope you guys enjoyed the challenges as much I did! How did it go? I am curious to hear if you are feeling stronger, more motivated or if you just had fun in joining! &#10;&#10;Our health has played such a big role in the past year and with the right amount of exercise , healthy nutrition and relaxation we can increase our immune system! In the upcoming weeks I will be filming more Pilates workout so stay tuned for that. &#10;&#10;The holidays are around the corner and its honestly for most of us going to be a strange period of time! Many of us used to celebrate this with families and travels. I am very bumped that I can not go to the Netherlands to see my parents and brother but Max and I just made plans to visit friends in Colorado over Christmas.  Maybe if we are lucky we can go skiing for the day but we shall see! I am taking everything day by day because that's the only way how I not go crazy haha. &#10;&#10;Tomorrow I will be posting a What I eat in Week video so don't forget to subscribe and put your notifications on!&#10;&#10;X Sanne&#10;&#10;ps. My phone was broken for a time but I think I repaired it so I will be back trying to answer all you guys messages, so sorry for the delay! &#10;&#10;Follow me!&#10;Instagram: @sannevloet (https://bit.ly/2vlnHLy)&#10;Twitter: @sannevloet (https://bit.ly/2OKggYH)&#10;Subscribe!!! https://bit.ly/2KzihS5&#10;&#10;Follow the link to my gear page with everything I use to create content - B&#38;H Photo - https://bhpho.to/34XSsaj&#10;&#10;Music: &#10;I used music from Epidemic Sound -  http://share.epidemicsound.com/GVgBV&#10;I used music from Music Bed - http://share.mscbd.fm/sannevloet"
