    title "WHAT HAPPENS WHEN YOU DO PILATES EVERYDAY // I did Pilates everyday for 30 days, results???"
    description "What happens when you do Pilates everyday? Well I am going to show you! We are talking all about Pilates today, what Pilates is, who Pilates is for, why you should be doing Pilates, etc. Stick around to see what happened at the end of the 30 days!&#10;&#10;00:00 Intro&#10;00:36 What is Pilates?&#10;03:24 How I Got Into Pilates&#10;08:50 Numerical Results (Pictures &#38; Measurements) &#10;&#10;LIVE WORKOUT SCHEDULE HERE: https://margaretelizabeth.co/live-workouts&#10;&#10;Want to workout with me, check out my monthly Pilates membership: https://margaretelizabeth.co/pricing&#10;&#10;Links to frequent products:&#10;Ring Light: https://amzn.to/39oobmU&#10;Laptop Stand for Zoom classes: https://amzn.to/2YnrBzC&#10;My Yoga Mat:https://amzn.to/3nih6sU&#10;Yoga Blocks: https://amzn.to/34qWdTs&#10;Yoga Strap: https://amzn.to/3nwSoo8&#10;Yoga Bolster: https://amzn.to/3gUMBpY&#10;Foam Roller: https://amzn.to/34iwHAz&#10;Dumbbells: https://amzn.to/3cYmSuQ&#10;Mini Bands: https://amzn.to/34rS7uo&#10;&#10;If you are just stumbling upon this video and wondering who I am, my name is Margaret, and I am a 25 year old fitness professional and reformer pilates instructor. I have a Bachelor's Degree in Public Health, and I am also a ACSM certified personal trainer. I am very passionate about health and fitness and I hope to share my passion with you!&#10;&#10;COME SAY HI!&#10;Blog: http://margaretelizabeth.co&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/margaretelizabeth__&#10;Tik Tok: https://www.tiktok.com/@margaretelizabeth__?traffic_type=google&#10;&#10;Intro Music:&#10;Vocal: Stephanie Kay&#10;Coposer/Mix: Patryk Skowro&#324;ski&#10;&#10;(disclaimer- these links are affiliate links)"
