    description "Hi Guys!&#10;&#10;WOW we started wellness month in such an amazing way! Thank you so much for all the positive messages and all the re-posts of the workouts so far. It makes me so happy to know that you are enjoying this as much as I am!&#10;&#10;For our full body workout week I created another Pilates flow. This is great to do in combination with any HIIT workout.&#10;&#10;I have really noticed when I practice Pilates myself that my body feels more aligned, toned and lengthened. Let me know if you feel the same too!&#10;&#10;It really doesn&#8217;t matter what your goals are in the upcoming month because every little step towards a healthier and happier lifestyle is a step in a great direction! &#10;&#10;Don&#8217;t forget to tag Sami  and me in your workouts and don&#8217;t forget to subscribe and put your notifications on!&#10;&#10;Xxx&#10;&#10;Sanne&#10;&#10;Sport sets: &#10;&#10;Sanne white top: @aloyoga&#10;Sanne grey leggings @aloyoga: https://bit.ly/38XCC15&#10;Sami White Bra @aloyoga: https://bit.ly/3301mCl&#10;Sami leggings @aloyoga: https://bit.ly/38W57fV&#10;&#10;Special thanks to @aloyoga for using their space! &#10;&#10;Follow me!&#10;Instagram: @sannevloet (https://bit.ly/2vlnHLy)&#10;Twitter: @sannevloet (https://bit.ly/2OKggYH)&#10;Subscribe!!! https://bit.ly/2KzihS5&#10;&#10;Follow the link to my gear page with everything I use to create content - B&#38;H Photo - https://bhpho.to/34XSsaj&#10;&#10;Music: &#10;I used music from Epidemic Sound -  http://share.epidemicsound.com/GVgBV&#10;I used music from Music Bed - http://share.mscbd.fm/sannevloet"
