    date "2021-05-07T03:32:34Z"
    title "20 min Model Booty &#38; Flat Abs Pilates workout | Resistance band w/ Kelly Gale"
    description "Hi! &#10;&#10;How are you? Sorry I am late to post it's been a busy week for me! Our apartment is still under renovation so it has been almost two months since I have slept in my own bed! I was on set almost every day this week starting last weekend when Max and I had a summer campaign shoot for Express and then capturing content for Nekohama, my wellness platform, and a special cooking video which I will share in June. I can't wait to show you some of the images from this week! Even though I was working non-stop, I have never been more excited about the projects in my life right now and feel so lucky I get to do it with the people I love. &#10;&#10;Anyway, I want to share with you a great lower body and flat ab workout that I filmed with my friend Kelly Gale. You probably recognize her from some of my past fitness videos! We met when we walked for the Victoria's Secret fashion show when I first started modeling and have been friends ever since. From New York to LA who knows where the world will take us next. I hope you enjoy this workout and let me know in the comments below what type of workout you would like to see next. I hope you get some rest this weekend because that's what I'll be doing. Send me some new movie recommendations please! &#10;&#10;Big hugs xx&#10;Sanne&#10;&#10;Follow me!&#10;Instagram: @sannevloet (https://bit.ly/2vlnHLy)&#10;Twitter: @sannevloet (https://bit.ly/2OKggYH)&#10;Subscribe!!! https://bit.ly/2KzihS5&#10;&#10;Follow Kelly Gale!&#10;Instagram:  @kellybellyboom &#10;https://instagram.com/kellybellyboom?utm_medium=copy_link&#10;&#10;YouTube: Kelly Gale &#10;https://youtube.com/c/kellybellyboom&#10;&#10;Follow the link to my gear page with everything I use to create content - B&#38;H Photo - https://bhpho.to/34XSsaj&#10;&#10;Music: &#10;I used music from Epidemic Sound -  http://share.epidemicsound.com/GVgBV&#10;I used music from Music Bed - http://share.mscbd.fm/sannevloet"
