    title "ONE DIRECTION AB WORKOUT (10 min)"
    description "Today's workout is a One Direction Ab Workout! You guys requested a followup to my One Direction HIIT Workout, so here it is! This workout is only 10 minutes long, but will leave your abs burning... We'll be doing 10 ab exercises to the top songs of One Direction. You don't need any equipment - just a place to comfortably lie down :) I hope you enjoy and be sure to leave any workout requests in the comments! #OneDirectionWorkout #OneDirectionAbWorkout #10MinAbWorkout&#10;&#10;Songs:&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:37 Perfect&#10;3:17 Steal My Girl&#10;6:37 Story of My Life&#10;9:43 Best Song Ever&#10;&#10;Workout (45 sec on/15 sec rest) x1:&#10;1. Single leg drops&#10;2. Crunch toe tap combo&#10;3. Oblique crunch - left&#10;4. Oblique crunch - right&#10;5. Cross body crunch&#10;6. Leg lift with pulses&#10;7. Plank hip taps&#10;8. Cross crunch variation&#10;9. Butterfly crunches&#10;10. Knee in &#38; outs&#10;&#10;&#9734; MY HOME WORKOUT PROGRAM: https://dempseymarks.com/SHOP&#8203; &#9734;&#10;&#10;&#187; more workouts &#171;&#10;&#10032; LAST UPLOAD:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SXA-CxLxgYc&#38;t=6s&#10;&#10032; ONE DIRECTION HIIT:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ht1m3ovmC2k&#38;t=238s&#10;&#10032; TAYLOR SWIFT HIIT:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S7tbZB_yDo8&#38;t=293s&#10;&#10032; ARIANA GRANDE ABS:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Yiruq7ebcE&#38;t=12s&#10;&#10; instagram: @dempseymarks&#10;&#8627;https://www.instagram.com/dempseymarks/&#8203;&#10;my website:&#10;&#8627;https://dempseymarks.com&#8203;&#10; contact (business inquires): dempseymarks@gmail.com&#10;&#10;thanks for watching &#38; i hope you'll stick around and subscribe"
