    title "10 Minute BEE GEES WORKOUT | Exercises for Seniors &#38; Beginners | 70's Workout | No talking&#128151;"
    description "Workout to the Bee Gees! This is a short 10 minute workout created for Bee Gees fans! This is a low impact, beginner workout suitable for all ages but mostly with seniors in mind (since you are the ones who were around in the 70's when the great bands like the Bee Gees were getting all of you out on the dance floor!). I had fun creating this video and I hope you enjoy it, too. The total step count is 1177.  Please keep in mind there will be ads in the video.  When copyrighted music is used, I don't have any control over where ads can be placed in the video.  To see workouts without ads, please choose one of my other workouts without popular music:)&#10;&#10;I will have a seated version coming out in a few days for those of you who can't do the standing exercises. &#10;&#10;Please subscribe and write a comment! I'd love to hear from you! To see future videos, please be sure to turn your notifications on (hit the bell beside the subscribe button). &#10;&#10;Wishing you improved health!&#10;Jules &#10;&#10;#Beegees #Beegeesworkout #Workouttothebeegees &#10;&#10;Disclaimer: You should always consult your physician before starting any 'Improved Health' fitness program or any other fitness program. This content is not medical advice and is intended for general education and demonstration purposes only. The use of the information provided in this video is solely at your own risk. &#10;&#10;If you like the picture in the background, you can purchase it here: https://amzn.to/3iykrUs&#10;&#10;I often have people ask where I purchased specific clothing I am wearing so if you are interested, the t-shirt is from Under Armour and called 'Velocity Crew'.  I could not find it online even though I purchased it recently from the store but this link is of another one that is very similar to the one I am wearing:  https://amzn.to/3yF2XuW&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:  As an Amazon Associate I may earn from qualifying purchases.  I want you to know any purchase you make from links do not add any extra cost to you.  It'll cost the same regardless whether you click my link or go directly to the Amazon site.  Amazon pays a very small commission for links shared by YouTube creators.  Thank you in advance if you do decide to purchase through the link I share."
