    title "STRETCHES FOR TIGHT HIPS AND GLUTES (15 minutes)"
    description "STRETCHES FOR TIGHT HIPS AND GLUTES! Today's workout is a 15 minute Stretches for Tight Hips and Glutes Routine. In today's routine we will be doing 15 different hip and glute stretches and holding each stretch for 1 minute.  This 15 minute routine focuses on stretching your hips and glutes and increasing flexibility.  These stretches are great after a day of sitting at the computer, a tough leg workout, a run/hike/bike, or a long day of travel. Hope you enjoy and be sure to leave any workout requests in the comments! #StretchesForTightHipsAndGlutes #StretchingRoutine #TightHipsStretches&#10;&#10;&#9734; MY HOME WORKOUT PROGRAM: https://dempseymarks.com/SHOP&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203; &#9734;&#10;&#10;&#187; more workouts &#171;&#10;&#10032; 30 MIN DB HIIT:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hk01a...&#10;&#10032; STANDING ABS WORKOUT:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MdDqF...&#10;&#10032; 20 MIN NO EQUIPMENT HIIT WORKOUT:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=plN7N...&#10;&#10032; 10 MIN LOWER ABS:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uEWs2...&#10;&#10; instagram: @dempseymarks&#10;&#8627;https://www.instagram.com/dempseymark...&#10;my website:&#10;&#8627;https://dempseymarks.com&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#10; contact (business inquires): dempseymarks@gmail.com&#10;&#10;music: epidemic sound&#10;&#10;thanks for watching &#38; i hope you'll stick around and subscribe"
