    description "10 MINUTE BEGINNER AB WORKOUT! Today's workout is a 10 minute Beginner Ab Workout. I've gotten a few questions about how to keep your lower back flat against the mat during ab exercises and this is a great routine to build up strength towards accomplishing that.  Today we'll be doing 10 different beginner ab exercises to strengthen and tone your abs and core. This workout requires no equipment - just a place to comfortably lie down. Even if you aren't a beginner, it's always a good idea to take it back to basics once in a while! Hope you enjoy and be sure to leave any workout requests in the comments! #BeginnerAbWorkout #BeginnerAbs #AbWorkout&#10;&#10;&#9734; MY HOME WORKOUT PROGRAM: https://dempseymarks.com/SHOP&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203; &#9734;&#10;&#10;&#187; more workouts &#171;&#10;&#10032; 15 MIN HOURLGASS ABS WOROUT:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LLlUK...&#10;&#10032; INDOOR WALKING WORKOUT:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DRidp...&#10;&#10032; ONE DIRECTION AB WORKOUT:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=23kEq...&#10;&#10032; 7 MIN LOWER ABS:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cgscc...&#10;&#10; instagram: @dempseymarks&#10;&#8627;https://www.instagram.com/dempseymark...&#10;my website:&#10;&#8627;https://dempseymarks.com&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#10; contact (business inquires): dempseymarks@gmail.com&#10;&#10;music: epidemic sound&#10;&#10;thanks for watching &#38; i hope you'll stick around and subscribe"
