  node [
    id 8659
    label "2zr41FA3Lz4"
    step 1
    date "2021-12-01T21:46:48Z"
    title "ALL STANDING CARDIO WORKOUT to Taylor Swift - All Too Well (10 Minute Version) | No Repeat Cardio"
    description "As I say in this video, this may be the best cardio workout to exist! Of course,  I am incredibly biased, BUT being able to belt out &#34;All Too Well&#34; (10 Minute Version) while exercising is truly a perfect combination and I am thankful to Miss Taylor Swift for giving us this gem of a song.  &#10;&#10;While this isn't a Taylor Swift dance workout, this is also not a traditional cardio/hiit workout that has rest times and set intervals. There is more of a flow to this workout and the exercises all line up with the beat of the song! Some of the moves are a little funky (ex. sumo squat pulse + lip syncing) however, this workout is meant to be a fun time to get you moving! &#10;&#10;So, turn up the music, SING YOUR HEART OUT, and enjoy every minute of this Taylor Swift no repeat cardio workout! This is also an all standing cardio workout! &#10;&#10;MY RECOMMENDATION: while this is a quick 10 minute cardio workout, I recommend that you do this workout multiple times in a row :P This is my daily workout right now because it gets my heart rate racing &#38; flies by since I get lost in the music!&#10;&#10;If you want a more challenging HIIT workout but still want to exercise to Taylor Swift, check out this 13 MIN HIIT workout: https://youtu.be/X_8XxaRhCng&#10;&#10;NOTE: If there are any exercises that you need modifications for, please let me know! There aren't many jumping exercises, making this a fairly low impact cardio workout. I provide an alternate exercise for jumping exercises in my intro which is the standing alternating ab twist. This workout was meant to be as accessible as possible! &#10;&#10;SKIP TO WORKOUT DETAILS: 01:19&#10;SKIP TO THE WORKOUT: 02:39&#10;&#10;WORKOUT DETAILS: &#10;- 31 exercises&#10;- all standing exercises&#10;- duration will vary for each exercise&#10;- i will show a &#34;next up&#34; preview so you can anticipate the next move&#10;- there is no rest during the entire workout&#10;- the first few minutes act as a warm-up and the last minute acts as a cool down&#10;&#10;SHOP MY AMAZON STOREFRONT FOR ALL MY AMAZON FAVES (lulu dupes, gymshark dupes, &#38; my favorite bands): https://www.amazon.com/shop/audfit_&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME: &#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/audfit_/&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: I don't own any copyright to any music.&#10;&#10;#taylorswift #dailyworkout #cardioworkout"
    channel_title "Audrey Koomar - Home Workouts"
    channel_id "UCuP_ZoJBN3yZbu4nmJ5QolQ"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
    duration NAN
