    title "MAMMA MIA HIIT DANCE WORKOUT"
    description "Support my channel on Patreon and upgrade your &#34;Clown&#34; status!! &#10;www.patreon.com/emkfit&#10;&#10;Check out Elle on Demand if you want the gym experience with multiple classes and instructors, these gals are the bomb. Thanks ladies for letting me use your space!! &#10;@elleondemand&#10;@ellefitnessto&#10;&#10;Whasssup you clowns my name is Emily and I'm a certified PT, group fitness instructor, and creator of EMKHIIT&#10;&#10;Just over here trying to make working out a little less awful and a lot more FUN. We'll chat, get fit, build butts, etc, but we'll always keep it REAL. &#10;&#10;Check out my other platforms for more workouts and live classes!&#10;&#10;Instagram: @emkfit&#10;Twitch: emkfit&#10;Twitter: @emkfit&#10;&#10;PSA. I do not own any copyright to any music. I wanna make workouts fun and accessible. And that includes of course using popular music. I cannot make money off these videos therefore I cannot control any ads. I'll do my best!! Ads may come up, but we won't let that stop us. Every time an ad comes up. HOLD either a squat or a push up until the workouts resume. I DARE YOU. If you would like to support my channel and help keep it going check out my Patreon page! &#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: Please consult a physician before trying any new kind of physical activity. Not all workouts work for everyone. Always modify moves as you need to make them work for your body and the minute you start to feel any kind of pain (not the good kind) stop the workout and reassess. Take care of yourselves clowns! xx &#10;&#10;Here is your playlist:&#10;1. (Warm Up): &#34;Lay All Your Love on Me&#34;-ABBA/Mamma Mia Cast&#10;2. &#34;Gimme Gimme Gimme a Man after Midnight&#34;-ABBA/Mamma Mia Cast&#10;3. &#34;Mamma Mia&#34;-ABBA/Mamma Mia Cast&#10;4. &#34;Does Your Mother Know&#34;-ABBA/Mamma Mia Cast&#10;5. &#34;Take a Chance on Me&#34;-ABBA/Mamma Mia Cast&#10;6. &#34;Dancing Queen&#34;-ABBA/Mamma Mia Cast&#10;&#10;Equipment I use from Amazon Canada: