ia 2&#10;&#10;WATCH SPECS: &#10;Apple Watch Series 6&#10;Mode: High Intensity Interval Training&#10;Calories that I burnt: 224&#10;&#10;OUTFIT: &#10;Tank Top: EMKFIT CLOWN MERCH YEYEYEEE&#10;Sports Bra: Lululemon&#10;Shorts: Old ratty ones from Giant Tiger lol &#10;&#10;HEADS UP: please don't get in your head about how many calories I burnt compared to yours. I am also filming and doing things in between so that is why I burn a lot. This is to give people that don't have a watch a kind of idea!!"
