    date "2021-04-20T17:08:41Z"
    title "15 MIN BEGINNER LEG WORKOUT | Ba&#351;lang&#305;&#231; Seviye Bacak Antrenman&#305; | Eylem Abaci"
    description "Struggling with my leg workouts? Here is an alternative for beginners or those who need breaks in between the exercises. &#9829;&#65038; This workout targets our entire leg muscles - quads, hamstrings, calves &#38; booooty! Do this workout 2-3 times per week to get sexy and toned legs. And no, it won't grow your thighs (if you don't use any weights). If you want to grow your thighs, you can do this workout with weights (e.g. dumbbells, kettlebell, ankle weights).&#10;&#10;&#9642;&#65039; Intensity: Beginner&#10;&#10;&#9642;&#65039; Recommendations:&#10;&#8226; Make sure to keep your knees behind your toes when you squat or lunge down and squeeze your booty on the way up.&#10;&#8226; While performing glute bridges, your weight has to be on your heels, not on your toes. And don't let your booty fall down while lowering, always squeeze and hold the tension!&#10;&#8226; Repeating the workout 2-3x per week works perfectly.&#10;&#8226; For more burn, combine it with my other leg workouts.&#10;&#10;&#127481;&#127479; Bacak workoutlar&#305;mda &#231;ok zorlananlar&#305; &#351;&#246;yle alal&#305;m; bu video yeni ba&#351;layanlar ve egzersizler aras&#305; molaya ihtiya&#231; duyanlar i&#231;in harika olacak.&#9829;&#65038; Bu antrenman, t&#252;m bacak kaslar&#305;n&#305;z&#305; &#231;al&#305;&#351;t&#305;r&#305;r - quadlar, hamstringler, kalflar ve kal&#231;a! Sexy ve s&#305;k&#305; bacaklar i&#231;in haftada 2-3 kez tekrarlaman&#305;z&#305; &#246;neririm. Ve hay&#305;r, bacaklar&#305;n&#305;z&#305; kal&#305;nla&#351;t&#305;rmaz (extra a&#287;&#305;rl&#305;k kullanmazsan&#305;z). Sadece s&#305;k&#305;la&#351;t&#305;r&#305;r, &#351;ekillendirir ve sel&#252;lit g&#246;r&#252;n&#252;m&#252;n&#252; azalt&#305;r. E&#287;er bacaklar&#305;n&#305;z&#305; kal&#305;nla&#351;t&#305;rmak istiyorsan&#305;z, antrenman&#305; a&#287;&#305;rl&#305;klarla yapabilirsiniz (dumbbell, kettlebell, bilek a&#287;&#305;rl&#305;klar&#305; vs).&#10;&#10;&#9642;&#65039; Seviye: Ba&#351;lang&#305;&#231;&#10;&#10;&#9642;&#65039; &#214;nerilerim: &#10;&#8226; Squat ve lunge egzersizlerine inerken, dizlerinizin ayak parmaklar&#305;n&#305;z&#305; a&#351;mamas&#305;na dikkat edin ve tekrar aya&#287;a kalkarken kal&#231;a kaslar&#305;n&#305;z&#305; iyice s&#305;k&#305;n.&#10;&#8226; Glute bridge'lerde a&#287;&#305;rl&#305;k topuklar&#305;n&#305;zda olmal&#305;. Ayr&#305;ca kal&#231;an&#305;z&#305; hep s&#305;kmal&#305;s&#305;n&#305;z, a&#351;a&#287;&#305; inerken serbest b&#305;rakmay&#305;n!&#10;&#8226; Bu workoutu haftada 2-3 kez yapabilirsiniz.&#10;&#8226; Maksimum etki i&#231;in di&#287;er bacak workoutlar&#305;mla kombinleyebilirsiniz.&#10;&#10;&#10142; INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/eylmbc/ (Free Weekly Workout Plans!&#9829;&#65038;)&#10;&#10142; BLOG: http://eylemabaci.com/&#10;&#10;&#9993;&#65039;  PR / BUSINESS INQUIRIES:&#10;info@eylemabaci.com&#10;&#10;&#128095;  &#220;ST&#220;MDEK&#304; SPOR KIYAFETLER&#304;:&#10;https://ty.gl/vilnd8ku&#10;&#10;&#127925;  M&#220;Z&#304;K | T&#252;m &#351;ark&#305;lar Spotify playlistimde!&#10;https://sptfy.com/50go&#10;&#10;&#127925;  Music provided by Epidemic Sound &#10;https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/u7y20x/&#10;&#10;___________&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;In order to avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health before doing the exercises. Performing any fitness exercises without supervision, is at your own risk. Please take professional advices of a fitness professional. Eylem Abaci will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video.&#10;&#10;Sakatlanma veya v&#252;cudunuzda meydana gelebilecek herhangi bir olumsuzlu&#287;u engellemek ad&#305;na, videolardaki egzersizleri yapmadan &#246;nce sa&#287;l&#305;k kontrollerinizi yapt&#305;rd&#305;&#287;&#305;n&#305;zdan emin olun. Profesyonel bir spor antren&#246;r&#252; g&#246;zetiminde yapmad&#305;&#287;&#305;n&#305;z egzersizlerden sadece kendiniz sorumlu olacaks&#305;n&#305;z. L&#252;tfen profesyonellerden destek almay&#305; ihmal etmeyin. Eylem Abac&#305; bu videodan do&#287;abilecek sakatlanmalardan veya herhangi bir zarardan sorumlu tutulamaz."
