    label "RMmLTOv9jqs"
    step 1
    date "2022-07-04T21:11:00Z"
    title "6-MIN STRETCH | FOR STIFF MUSCLES | Training with Puart"
    description "Join me for this 6-Min Stretch for Stiff Muscles! You can do it in the morning/before and after workout or as a standalone short full body stretch routine. I hope you'll enjoy stretching together with me!&#10;&#10;Just grab your mat and get ready to STRETCH! &#10;&#10;Feel free to let me know if you have any questions or video suggestions in the comments below!&#10;&#10;SUPPORT CHANNEL&#10;https://bit.ly/puartpaypal&#10;&#10;MY DANCE TUTORIAL ON GUMROAD&#10;https://bit.ly/puartgumroad&#10;&#10;CHAPTERS&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:15 Hamstring Stretch&#10;0:46 Happy Baby Pose &#10;1:16 Frog Glutes Stretch &#10;1:47 Leg Shake&#10;2:17 Z-Stretch (L) &#10;2:48 Z-Stretch (R)&#10;3:18 Wide Legs&#10;3:48 Back Relax&#10;4:18 Almost Child Pose (L)&#10;4:49 Almost Child Pose (R) &#10;5:18 Lunge - Pyramid (L)&#10;5:49 Lunge - Pyramid (R)&#10;6:19 Outro&#10;&#10;SAFETY RULES&#10;1. This workout is NOT for you if you have any serious injuries.&#10;2. If you encounter pain at any point, please stop. Straining yourself beyond what your body allows is dangerous. &#10;3. Be careful - everyone's body is unique and while something can be easy for some people, it can hurt others.&#10;&#10;CONTACT&#10;- Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/trainingwithpuart&#10;- TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@trainingwithpuart&#10;- Vlog: https://youtube.com/marypuart&#10;For private classes and business inquiries, feel free to send me a DM on Instagram.&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER&#10;By deciding to join me in this workout video, you understand that you are performing these exercises at your own risk and without supervision, and you bear the sole responsibility for any consequences to your health or anything else and agree that Mary Puart cannot and will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you or anyone else sustains as a result of this video. Please always take all necessary precautions to protect your health and safety. If needed, consult with your doctor or a fitness professional first before exercising.&#10;&#10;MUSIC&#10;&#34;AER&#216;HEAD - Giving Way&#34; is under a Creative Commons (CC BY-SA 3.0) license&#10;Music promoted by BreakingCopyright: https://bit.ly/bkc-giving&#10;&#10;&#34;Sappheiros - Fading&#34; is under a Creative Commons license (CC BY 3.0) https://www.youtube.com/c/Sappheiros&#10;Music promoted by BreakingCopyright: https://youtu.be/uhqMKpppnpo &#10;&#10;&#34;Sappheiros - Memories&#34; is under a Creative Commons license (CC-BY).&#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/Sappheiros &#10;Music promoted by BreakingCopyright: https://bit.ly/memories-sappheiros-song&#10;&#10;Training with Puart - Stiff Muscles - 6-Min Stretch&#10;Copyright Mary Puart&#10;&#10;#stiffmuscles  #6minutestretch"
