    date "2020-03-19T15:59:14Z"
    title "Day 1 | Home Tabata Workout (Coronavirus/COVID-19 Quarantine Workout) w/ Inger Houghton"
    description "Home Tabata Workout with Inger Houghton &#38; Tabata Songs!&#10;DAILY HOME WORKOUTS: https://bit.ly/DailyTabata&#10;MUSIC: https://tabata-songs.lnk.to/DanceMonkeyID&#10;TABATA APP: https://tabatasongs.com/app/&#10;&#10;With the Coronavirus (COVID-19) keeping people around the world away from gyms, we thought we'd start bringing you some at-home workouts that can be done with minimal gear. NOBODY is better at creating these simple, yet effective, workouts than Inger Houghton. &#10;&#10;Inger demonstrates this At-Home Tabata Workout using only a kettlebell (a dumbbell could be used for this routine as well). &#10;&#10;The Workout:&#10;Tabata- &#34;20 seconds ON, 10 seconds OFF for 4 Minutes&#34;&#10;1. Single arm thruster left&#10;2. Lunge with rotation left&#10;3. Bent over row left&#10;4. 3-Step lateral lunge w/reach left&#10;5. Single arm thruster right&#10;6. Lunge with rotation right&#10;7. Bent over row right&#10;8. 3-Step lateral lunge w/reach right&#10;&#10;http://www.itunes.com/TabataSongs&#10;http://www.Spotify.com/TabataSongs&#10;http://www.tabatasongs.com&#10;&#10;Inger Houghton @IngerInDubai&#10;http://www.Instagram.com/IngerinDubai"
