    date "2021-06-06T13:44:00Z"
    title "14 G&#220;NDE KARIN VE SIRT YA&#286;LARINI YAKAN ETK&#304;L&#304; EGZERS&#304;Z PROGRAMI"
    description "Bu program kar&#305;n kaslar&#305;n&#305;z&#305; g&#252;&#231;lendirerek ya&#287;lar&#305; eritirken ayn&#305; zamanda s&#305;rt b&#246;lgesini de &#231;al&#305;&#351;t&#305;racak. S&#305;rt b&#246;lgesinde biriken ya&#287;lar&#305;n yak&#305;lmas&#305;na yard&#305;mc&#305; olurken duru&#351; bozuklu&#287;undan kaynaklanan kamburla&#351;may&#305; da d&#252;zelterek &#252;st bedeninizin &#231;ok g&#252;zel g&#246;r&#252;nmesini sa&#287;layacak. Program&#305;m&#305;z 10 dakika s&#252;r&#252;yor ve videoyu takip ederek tam zamanl&#305; yapabilirsiniz. 14 g&#252;n s&#252;recek olan bu program&#305; isterseniz devam ettirerek sahip oldu&#287;unuz sa&#287;l&#305;kl&#305; g&#246;r&#252;nt&#252;y&#252; kal&#305;c&#305; k&#305;labilirsiniz. Her hareketten &#246;nce a&#231;&#305;klamas&#305;n&#305; izleyeceksiniz ve ard&#305;ndan sayarak egzersizi yapaca&#287;&#305;z. Hareket bitiminde 15 saniye dinlenerek devam edece&#287;iz. Haz&#305;rsan&#305;z ba&#351;layal&#305;m.&#10;1- AYAKTA YANLARA E&#286;&#304;LME EGZERS&#304;Z&#304;&#10;2- AYAKTA MEK&#304;K EGZERS&#304;Z&#304;&#10;3- GER&#304; ADIM ATARAK KOL KALDIRMA EGZERS&#304;Z&#304;&#10;4- AYAKLARI &#199;IRPMA EGZERS&#304;Z&#304; &#10;5- SUPERMAN EGZERS&#304;Z&#304; &#10;6- RUS D&#214;N&#220;&#350;&#220; EGZERS&#304;Z&#304; &#10;7- KELEBEK MEK&#304;K EGZERS&#304;Z&#304; &#10;8- KU&#350; K&#214;PEK EGZERS&#304;Z&#304; &#10;9- SIRT&#220;ST&#220; OMURGA D&#214;ND&#220;RME EGZERS&#304;Z&#304;&#10;10- KOBRA HAREKET&#304;&#10;&#10;Kaynak&#231;a:&#10;1. https://www.spotebi.com/exercise-guide/standing-criss-cross-crunches/&#10;2. https://greatist.com/move/abs-workout-best-abs-exercises-you-can-do-standing-up#exercises&#10;3. https://www.self.com/story/4-standing-core-exercises-that-will-sculpt-your-abs-from-every-angle  &#10;4. https://brightside.me/inspiration-health/8-at-home-standing-exercises-that-will-sculpt-your-body-from-every-angle-798778/&#10;5. https://www.skimble.com/exercises/59964-step-back-jacks-how-to-do-exercise&#10;6. https://www.livestrong.com/article/84743-flutter-kicks-abs-exercise/&#10;7. https://sworkit.com/exercise/supermans&#10;https://www.sportsandmerits.com/makale/199-superman-hareketi-nedir&#10;8. https://www.womenshealthmag.com/fitness/a26011033/russian-twist/&#10;9. https://www.popsugar.com/fitness/photo-gallery/44902880/image/45068136/Butterfly-Crunch&#10;10. https://www.regularityfitness.com/butterfly-crunches/&#10;11. https://www.healthline.com/health/bird-dog-exercise&#10;12. https://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/325373#trunk-rotation&#10;13. https://myrehabconnection.com/simple-trunk-rotation-exercise-progression/&#10;14. https://yogahareketleri.com/supta-matsyendrasana/&#10;15. https://www.emedihealth.com/boost-immunity-through-yoga.html&#10;16. https://www.popsugar.com/fitness/photo-gallery/48083859/image/48083871/Cobra&#10;&#10;&#10;M&#252;zik:&#10;Credit : www. bensound.com&#10;&#10;SUMMER - ROYALTY FREE MUSIC&#10;Download this copyright free  music -&#10;https://www.bensound.com/royalty-free-music/track/summer-chill-relaxed-tropical&#10;&#10;&#350;&#304;FA BUL kanal&#305;m&#305;z&#305;n di&#287;er sayfalar&#305;:&#10;WEB S&#304;TES&#304;: www.sifabulun.com&#10;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/sifabul/&#10;TWITTER: https://twitter.com/SifaBul&#10;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/sifabulun&#10;TUMBLR: https://sifabul.tumblr.com/&#10;&#10;&#10;UYARI: Bu bilgiler internetteki sa&#287;l&#305;k siteleri ve sa&#287;l&#305;k kitaplar&#305;ndan derlenmi&#351;tir. Hi&#231;bir &#351;ekilde doktor tavsiyesinin yerine ge&#231;mez."
