    label "n7RFnJzFRxo"
    step 1
    date "2018-09-01T00:01:38Z"
    title "5 Minute Ab Workout for Beginners"
    description "For more ab workouts you can do from home to burn body fat fast along with a nutrition plan designed for your goals, take my free body type quiz and get the right plan for you - http://vshred.fit/5MinAbWorkout&#10;&#10;In this video I take you through a full core and abs workout you can do from the comfort of your home, at a gym, or anywhere really as you'll need zero equipment for this one!&#10;&#10;This workout consists of five exercises that we'll be performing once for 45 seconds, rest for 15 seconds, and then straight into the next exercise. Format for the workout is below:&#10;&#10;1) Beginner Sprint Crunches&#10;2) Plank Jacks&#10;3) Reach Thru Crunch&#10;4) Plank Up Downs&#10;5) Crunch Single Leg Extensions&#10;&#10;Perform each movement for 45 seconds, followed by a 15 second rest, move into the next and you'll be done with this full ab workout in 5 minutes!&#10;&#10;Like these workouts? Let me know down below in the comments and be sure you're smashing that like button!&#10;&#10;See ya next video!&#10;&#10;V Shred | 5 Minute Ab Workout&#10;https://youtu.be/3YtdkcJVVTg&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Check out My Supplement Stacks! &#10;&#10;For Fat Loss : http://vshred.fit/FatLossStackYT8&#10;&#10;For Muscle Building : http://vshred.fit/MuscleBuildingStackYT8&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;Intro Song: Always Have by Castor Troy"
