he |  &#127909; Video Playlist - https://rb.gy/7z584h &#10;WEEK 8: Workout Plans - https://rb.gy/obxep1  |  &#127909; Video Playlist - https://rb.gy/4zh1ly &#10;WEEK 9: Workout Plans - https://rb.gy/qa771k  |  &#127909; Video Playlist - https://rb.gy/2zilbj &#10;WEEK 10: Workout Plans -   |  &#127909; Video Playlist - https://rb.gy/ilo4nl&#10;&#10;Tag me in a post-workout selfie for a shoutout! &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9734; JOIN THE LEAN WITH TANVI ENCOURAGEMENT &#38; ACCOUNTABILITY COMMUNITY ON FACEBOOK&#9734; &#10;https://bit.ly/3lMGO8B &#10;&#10;&#10084;&#65039; WORKOUT SERIES:&#10;----------------------------------------------------&#10;&#9654; 30 DAY BEGINNER SERIES: https://rb.gy/sg1get &#10;&#9654; 30 DAY &#34;I WILL DO IT&#34; Advanced SERIES: https://bit.ly/3quSG05&#10;&#9654; 4 WEEK FAT LOSS CHALLENGE: https://rb.gy/5esa0m&#10;&#9654; 12 WEEK BEGINNER/ADVANCED FITNESS GUIDE: https://bit.ly/2XMKmfC&#10;&#9654; 1 HOUR INTERMEDIATE/ADVANCED Workouts: https://bit.ly/35IkLco&#10;&#10;&#10084;&#65039; WORKOUT ADD-ONS :&#10;----------------------------------------------------&#10;&#9654; No-Repeat Workouts: https://bit.ly/35IkLco&#10;&#9654; 15 min Lazy Workouts: https://rb.gy/ho7xzt&#10;&#9654; 10-15min Targeted Finishers: https://rb.gy/kfg8mi&#10;&#10;&#10084;&#65039; Equipment Links &#10;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#10;&#9654; Dumbbells: https://rb.gy/sj6uqv&#10;&#9654; Loop Resistance Bands: https://amzn.to/3d6vKy5&#10;&#9654; Yoga Mat: https://amzn.to/3qpwOmO&#10;&#10;&#10084;&#65039; FOLLOW ME&#10;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#10;&#9654; Instagram @iwillgetlean: https://www.instagram.com/iwillgetlean/  &#10;&#9654; Medium  https://medium.com/@iwillgetlean"
