    label "QABW99qPiNM"
    step 1
    date "2021-07-14T15:26:18Z"
    title "Bird Dog Exercise | Improve Your Core and Balance"
    description "The bird dog is a great stabilization exercise promoting back health.&#10;It has 3 important components: Satisfactory muscle challenge, doesn&#8217;t put a high load on the spine, and ensures sufficient stability.&#10;&#10;Due to these 3 components, this exercise is suitable for beginners and those who suffer from back pain.&#10;&#10;This video will go through the correct way to perform this exercise, its anatomical analysis, and common mistakes to avoid.&#10;&#10;For more videos, be sure to subscribe to our channel here on YouTube at the link below and don&#8217;t forget to turn on notifications so you never miss one.&#10;YouTube - https://www.youtube.com/user/Musclean...&#10;&#10;WANT EXCLUSIVE VIDEOS NOT FOUND ON YOUTUBE?&#10;Try the Strength Training app today on all devices!&#10;https://www.muscleandmotion.com/produ...&#10;------------------------------------------------------------------------------ &#10;FOLLOW US ON:&#10;YouTube - https://www.youtube.com/user/Musclean...&#10;Instagram (1M followers) - https://www.instagram.com/muscleandmo...&#10;Facebook (2M followers) - https://www.facebook.com/muscleandmotion&#10;&#10;The Muscle and Motion team&#10;https://www.muscleandmotion.com/"
