  node [
    id 8928
    label "GSuicJneDQU"
    step 1
    date "2021-11-29T15:57:50Z"
    title "How Bird Dogs Can Help Your Deadlift"
    description "Most dismiss bird dogs as simple boring exercises that have no place in the training program of strength athlete - when in reality they can be a great addition. &#10;&#10;Bird dogs (when done correctly) teach your body how to properly stabilize the spine &#38; create movement about the extremities. This is the same movement concept we want to see when doing most lifts - especially the deadlift. Using the bird dog as a warm up can help prime your body to perform well during your main lifts (a reason why they're also a part of the McGill Big 3: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2_e4I-brfqs&#38;t=251s&#10;&#10;Get my book on fixing injury here: &#10;https://www.amazon.com/Rebuilding-Milo-Foundation-Enhancing-Performance/dp/1628604220&#10;&#10;Get my book 'The Squat Bible' here: &#10;https://www.amazon.com/Squat-Bible-Ultimate-Mastering-Strength/dp/1540395421/&#10;&#10;Looking for olympic weightlifting programming? Try this 'Back to Basics' 13 week program: &#10;https://marketplace.trainheroic.com/workout-plan/program/vaughn-program-1626381817?attrib=547878-aff-squatu&#10;&#10;______________________&#10;&#10;Subscribe to the channel: https://tinyurl.com/y2eq7kpr&#10;&#10;Recommended products: https://squatuniversity.com/recommended-products/&#10;&#10;Support SquatU &#38; join monthly live Q&#38;A: https://www.patreon.com/SquatUniversity&#10;&#10;______________________&#10;&#10;Connect with SquatUniversity: &#10;Visit the website: http://www.squatuniversity.com&#10;Like the Facebook page: https://www.facebook.com/SquatUniversity&#10;Follow on Twitter: https://twitter.com/squatuniversity&#10;Follow on TikTok: @SquatUniversity&#10;Follow on Instagram: http://instagram.com/squat_university&#10;Listen to the Podcast on: apple iTunes, Overcast, Pocket Casts, Google Play and the Anchor App&#10;&#10;______________________&#10;&#10;Music credits &#10;Opening &#38; closing track by JookTheFirst: https://soundcloud.com/jookthefirst&#10;&#10;Shout out to @Chucky Wright for being my model athlete today."
    channel_title "Squat University"
