  node [
    id 8982
    label "N-qvQGHHyOg"
    step 1
    date "2021-02-04T09:05:51Z"
    title "One Week Training with Wim Hof | Short Documentary"
    description "Last year in January, this group of amazing people joined me in Poland for a full week of training with ice baths, breathing, and topped with a mountain climb in Wim Hof fashion, in just our shorts. I had a magical time together with this bunch, connecting with each other, just feeling, being, deepening our strength as well as our vulnerability. This is the result of that week! &#10;&#10;Thank you all for joining me &#10084;&#65039;&#10;&#10;Did you like the video? Check out the in-depth interviews with the guests that week:&#10;https://youtu.be/hHDiQhj7b1w&#10;&#10;Lewis Howes -  https://www.instagram.com/lewishowes/&#10;Jesse Itzler - https://www.instagram.com/jesseitzler/&#10;Mike Posner - https://www.instagram.com/mikeposner/ &#10;Aubrey Marcus - https://www.instagram.com/aubreymarcus/&#10;Matthew Hussey - https://www.instagram.com/thematthewhussey/&#10;Humble the Poet - https://www.instagram.com/humblethepoet/&#10;Mitch Mathews - https://www.instagram.com/mitchmathews10/&#10;Marq Brown - https://www.instagram.com/marqbrown/&#10;Nick Symmonds - https://www.instagram.com/nicksymmonds/&#10;Steve Weatherford - https://www.instagram.com/weatherford5/&#10;Chef Kamu - https://www.instagram.com/chefkamu/&#10;Robi Czech - https://www.instagram.com/robiczech/&#10;Taylor Jenson - https://www.instagram.com/taylorjenson/&#10;Matthew Cesaratto&#10;&#10;Soundtrack by Bansara.com&#10;&#10;!!All these exercises have been performed under expert supervision. Don't take the method and techniques too lightly, they go deep and the effects can have a huge impact. Don't do the breathing exercises in a swimming pool, before going underwater, beneath the shower or piloting any vehicle, without proper supervision. Always practice in a safe environment. Keep in mind to do the exercises without forcing them, gradually build up, and don't exceed your limits. Stay safe!!&#10;&#10;=====&#10;&#10;Want to discover &#38; learn more about the Wim Hof Method?&#10;&#10;JOIN THE FREE MINI CLASS:&#10;https://www.wimhofmethod.com/free-mini-class&#10;&#10;DOWNLOAD THE FREE MOBILE APP:&#10;https://www.wimhofmethod.com/wim-hof-method-mobile-app&#10;&#10;VISIT THE WEBSITE:&#10;https://www.wimhofmethod.com/&#10;&#10;CONNECT WITH WIM:&#10;YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/subscription_center?add_user=wimhof1&#10;Facebook: https://facebook.com/icemanwimhof/&#10;Instagram: https://instagram.com/iceman_hof&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/iceman_hof&#10;&#10;WIM HOF METHOD ONLINE COURSES:&#10;https://www.wimhofmethod.com/elearning&#10;&#10;FOR WORKSHOPS/SEMINARS/TRAVELS:&#10;https://www.wimhofmethod.com/activities&#10;&#10;QUESTION(S) ABOUT THE WIM HOF METHOD?&#10;https://wimhofmethod.com/faq&#10;&#10;=====&#10;ABOUT WIM HOF&#10;=====&#10;&#10;&#8220;The Iceman&#8221; Wim Hof is a Dutch athlete and multiple Guiness World Record holder known for his ability to withstand extreme cold and his extraordinary achievements.&#10;&#10;Wim believes that EVERYONE is capable of doing the same exceptional things his body allows him to do. That&#8217;s why he developed the Wim Hof Method - a combination of breathing exercises, cold therapy and commitment - to give YOU the tools to take control over your body.&#10;&#10;He&#8217;s on a mission to share the potential health benefits of his method, working with scientists around the world to prove that his techniques work.&#10;&#10;Discover more at wimhofmethod.com"
    channel_title "Wim Hof"
    channel_id "UCxHTM1FYxeC4F7xDsBVltGg"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
    duration NAN
  ]
  node [
    id 8983
    label "bPpV3Bk80uw"
    step 1
    date "2019-09-16T10:23:53Z"
    title "MARCO MIGNOT, vainqueur du Lacanau Pro 2019"
    description "Marco Mignot et Maud Le Car viennent de remporter le Cara&#239;bos Lacanau Pro 2019, dans une journ&#233;e finale historique, contre Gabriela Bryan (Haw) et Gatien Delahaye (FR), dans des vagues d&#8217;1,50m &#224; 2m.&#10;&#10;La 7eme &#233;tape du circuit qualificatif Europ&#233;en de la World Surf League (WQS) vient de se d&#233;rouler dans de tr&#232;s bonnes conditions toute la semaine avec comme point culminant  le sacre de Le Car et Mignot comme vainqueurs 2019.&#10;&#10;Mignot et Delahaye se sont mutuellement r&#233;pondu vague pour vague, score pour score, jusqu&#8217;&#224; ce que Mignot enchaine 3 rollers incroyables lui permettant de prendre 8,70 points et de s&#8217;imposer devant le Guadeloup&#233;en. &#171; C&#8217;est compl&#232;tement dingue de gagner aujourd&#8217;hui et surtout face &#224; Gatien avec qui je viens de passer la semaine &#224; Lacanau. &#187;&#10;&#10;Cette journ&#233;e historique des 40 ans du Lacanau Pro a &#233;galement permis &#224; la foule pr&#233;sente sur la plage centrale de Lacanau, d&#8217;assister &#224; la victoire de Flavio Padaratz (BRE) le Br&#233;silien vainqueur en 2002, face &#224; Tom Curren (USA), Tom Carroll (AUS) ou encore l&#8217;enfant du pays de retour apr&#232;s 17 ans d&#8217;absence, l&#8217;Australien Gary Elkerton (AUS).&#10;&#10;M&#234;me si la pluie s&#8217;est invit&#233; &#224; la f&#234;te, le public a v&#233;cu avec l&#8217;ensemble des comp&#233;titrices (eurs), ainsi que les organisateurs une journ&#233;e exceptionnelle pour ce mill&#233;sime 2019 de l&#8217;une des plus anciennes comp&#233;tition au monde.&#10;European Men&#8217;s QS Top 5:&#10;1 - Jorgann Couzinet (FRA) &#10;2 - Maxime Huscenot (FRA)&#10;3 - Leon Glatzer (DEU) &#10;4 - Vicente Romero (ESP)&#10;5 - Tristan Guilbaud (FRA)&#10;&#10;European Women&#8217;s QS Top 5: &#10;1 - Pauline Ado (FRA) &#10;2 - Yolanda Hopkins (PRT) &#10;3 - Ellie Turner (GBR) &#10;4 - Leticia Canales Bilbao (EUK) &#10;5 - Juliette Lacome (FRA)"
    channel_title "Ville de Lacanau"
    channel_id "UCFGfUQ3Rzz-OVzMGuE-CegQ"
    fav_count -1
    view_count -1
    like_count -1
    comment_count -1
