    step 1
    date "2017-03-16T01:41:00Z"
    title "How to Lose Belly Fat FAST &#8211; Quick Belly Fat Loss &#8211; Dr.Berg"
    description "Talk to a Dr. Berg Keto Consultant today and get the help you need on your journey. Call 1-540-299-1556 with your questions about Keto, Intermittent Fasting or the use of Dr. Berg products. Consultants are available Monday through Friday from 8 am to 10 pm EST. Saturday &#38; Sunday from 9 am to 6 pm EST. USA Only.&#10; &#10;. . Are you struggling to lose belly fat? Here&#8217;s a step-by-step guide on the fastest way to lose weight! &#10;&#10;0:00 How to lose belly fat fast&#10;0:49 The basics of burning belly fat fast&#10;3:41 What to add to burn belly fat&#10;6:19 Remove these things to burn belly fat&#10;9:43 Summary &#10;&#10;In this video, I&#8217;m going to show you how to burn belly fat fast. I&#8217;ve talked about specific parts of weight loss in many of my other videos. However, I&#8217;m going to give you a step-by-step guide on losing belly fat as a whole. &#10;&#10;There are three parts to this: the basics of what to do, what you should add, and what you should remove. Let&#8217;s start with the basics. &#10;&#10;Basics:&#10;&#8226; 3 meals with no snacks: https://youtu.be/ZKpiH7R8HS8 &#10;&#8226; 3-6 oz of Protein per Meal 7 to 10 cups of Veggies Per Meal: https://youtu.be/F1_I80tze60 &#10;&#8226; Cut out sugar&#10;&#8226; Consume healthy fats: https://youtu.be/VlB3K6o5BQo&#10;&#10;Add:&#10;&#8226; MCTs (medium-chain triglycerides): https://youtu.be/aHKaygC0PnQ &#10;&#8226; Get plenty of potassium: https://youtu.be/q2vPQYP0dpI &#10;&#8226; Take/use AVC (apple cider vinegar): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qTzxfoL82n8 &#10;&#8226; Take chromium: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RABThDFW000 &#10;&#8226; Get plenty of B-vitamins (nutritional yeast): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vAVSmmIdNpY &#10;&#8226; Do HIIT (high-intensity interval training): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fevi1lmDPEU &#10;&#8226; Get more sleep: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Eu1ldCIdLF0 *More &#10;&#8226; Don't forget recovery: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2m5uyamZblw &#10;&#10;Remove:&#10;&#8226; Rid Insomnia: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V3rGIIFdAVA &#10;&#8226; Rid Bloating: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A_PaHwx8p54 &#10;&#8226; Rid Female Cycle Issues: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wWGzfNaVHiE &#10;&#8226; Reduce Stress: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rZb-t2jr7FI &#10;&#8226; Rid MSG (monosodium glutamate/modified corn starch): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pFfkC-7xIPU &#10;&#8226; Avoid Restaurants due to unknowns &#10;&#8226; Avoid Overtraining &#10;&#8226; Rid Constipation: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fi0PLevPrbk &#10;&#10;&#10;Dr. Eric Berg DC Bio:&#10;Dr. Berg, age 56, is a chiropractor who specializes in Healthy Ketosis &#38; Intermittent Fasting. He is the author of the best-selling book The Healthy Keto Plan, and is the Director of Dr. Berg&#8217;s Nutritionals. He no longer practices, but focuses on health education through social media.&#10;&#10;DR. BERG'S SHOP: http://shop.drberg.com/&#10;&#10;Follow us on FACEBOOK: fb.me/DrEricBerg&#10;&#10;Send a Message to his team: m.me/DrEricBerg&#10;&#10;ABOUT DR. BERG: https://www.drberg.com/dr-eric-berg/bio&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;Dr. Eric Berg received his Doctor of Chiropractic degree from Palmer College of Chiropractic in 1988.&#160;&#160;His use of &#8220;doctor&#8221; or &#8220;Dr.&#8221; in relation to himself solely refers to that degree.&#160;&#160;Dr. Berg is a licensed chiropractor in Virginia, California, and Louisiana, but he no longer practices chiropractic in any state and does not see patients so he can focus on educating people as a full time activity, yet he maintains an active license. This video is for general informational purposes only.&#160;&#160;It should not be used to self-diagnose and it is not a substitute for a medical exam, cure, treatment, diagnosis, and prescription or recommendation.&#160;&#160;It does not create a doctor-patient relationship between Dr. Berg and you.&#160;&#160;You should not make any change in your health regimen or diet before first consulting a physician and obtaining a medical exam, diagnosis, and recommendation.&#160;&#160;Always seek the advice of a physician or other qualified health provider with any questions you may have regarding a medical condition. The Health &#38; Wellness, Dr. Berg Nutritionals and Dr. Eric Berg, D.C. are not liable or responsible for any advice, course of treatment, diagnosis or any other information, services or product you obtain through this video or site.&#10;&#10;Thanks for watching. I hope this video helps you lose belly fat fast and easy. Stay tuned for more helpful weight loss videos."
