    title "CHEST WORK OUT IN 20 MINUTE | COACHING UP ATHLEAN X"
    description "20 Minute Chest Workout...is it possible? can you make legitimate gains? or should you do something more optimal with your time? Watch and find out!&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#127998;  GET MUSCLE AND MOTION APP&#128073;&#127998; https://www.muscleandmotion.com/products/strength-training-app/?gclid=CjwKCAjw9-KTBhBcEiwAr19ig1G8-Z_Zme7wA1_e2akxXVbFSeF4NoczDILf-IOT3K5OxEdQ3wS9ghoC6ToQAvD_BwE&#10;&#10;&#128526;Free 2-Part Training Series &#128073;&#127998;&#10; https://training.jonnishreve.com/free&#10;&#128213;ULTIMATE PUSH PULL LEGS TRAINING EBOOK &#128073;&#127998;https://training.jonnishreve.com/ebook&#10;&#128421; BOOK YOUR 30 MIN VIDEO CONSULT HERE&#128073;&#127998;  https://calendly.com/jonnishreve/30min&#10;&#128421; BOOK YOUR 15  MIN VIDEO CONSULT HERE &#128073;&#127998;  &#10;https://calendly.com/jonnishreve/15-min-consult&#10;&#128104;&#127998;&#8205;&#128300; LET'S GET CHECKED USE JONNI30 30% OFF &#128073;&#127998;&#10;https://trylgc.com/jonnishreve&#10;&#127942;COACHING: https://jonnishreve.com&#10;&#128231;jonni.shreve@gmail.com&#10;&#129331;&#127999;INSTAGRAM: @_jonnishreve_ &#10;&#127929; LIKE THE MUSIC? HeyMcFly!&#10;&#127869;POWER 13 COOKBOOK: USE CODE OR LINK JONNI15 FOR 15% OFF http://bit.ly/p13jonni&#10;&#127947;&#127998;SHOP VERSA GRIPPS  link: http://www.versagripps.com/"
