    description "Walking Workout Music for Weight loss, Fitness &#38; Workout, Stress Release,  Relaxation&#10;&#10;Please feel free to comment, like (or dislike) and subscribe if you are enjoying this video for more content in the future. &#10;&#10;Ideas for future videos are also very welcome!&#10;&#10;&#10;Best Ways to Begin Exercising:&#10;&#10; I suggest try a slow walking speed video initially and gradually increase you speed, depending on your fitness, mood/state of mind and so on.&#10;&#10;&#10;iPhone - how to get YouTube music video playing in background without pausing:&#10;&#10;1. open Youtube video in Safari&#10;2. start playing in Safari (not in YouTube)&#10;3. go to your home screen (sound stops)&#10;4. swipe down for control panel&#10;5. press play in top right hand corner&#10;&#10;&#10;All Walking Speed Videos&#10;&#10;120 bpm - relaxed walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/XOt4EE5Hkfo&#10;&#10;122 bpm - relaxed walking speed 2&#10;https://youtu.be/DbnFaFt_q8M&#10;&#10;124 bpm - medium walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/JMEY_EMZvJo&#10;&#10;128 bpm - nearly good walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/qFLr4bS28_c&#10;&#10;130 bpm - good walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/OpcaK90CvPk&#10;&#10;132 bpm - slightly elated walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/3z7gDgbNwwU&#10;&#10;134 bpm - faster walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/-EJkj9FFAcU&#10;&#10;136 bpm - low power walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/nGdmlYKkvl8&#10;&#10;138 bpm - medium power walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/cm3y5Cd2VHc&#10;&#10;140 bpm - high power walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/6DR8VBJRG08&#10;&#10;142 bpm - very high power walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/Qzn87ZeOtog&#10;&#10;144 bpm - very high power walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/CMY02N_SPvo&#10;&#10;146 bpm - very high power walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/UZcDuBMp8AI&#10;&#10;148 bpm - very high power walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/cf2vpng5AJI&#10;&#10;150 bpm - very high power walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/1wvARsTSLEk&#10;&#10;152 bpm - very high power walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/SeuTThDUiCA&#10;&#10;154 bpm - very high power walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/tAL8qTcGwZY&#10;&#10;156 bpm - crazy power walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/KHke88sLKAM&#10;&#10;158 bpm - crazy power walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/bdL8CpNsQls&#10;&#10;160 bpm - crazy power walking speed&#10;https://youtu.be/im6lRDLgO20&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#8220;Beni&#8221; character designed by Rick Henry @ Mind and Technology&#10;https://mindtn.com/&#10;&#10;Music written by &#8220;Space Cadet&#8221;&#10;&#10;Finally:&#10;&#10;Big thanks to the guys and girls at&#10;https://www.pexels.com&#10;for the background visuals."
